[2026-04-27 10:28:06] Raw text/plain payload: b"What fossils, planets, and probability can actually tell us about life beyond Earth\r\nFOSSILS ET AL.\r\n\r\nEarth Is Our Only Data Point for Life in the Universe (For Now)\r\n\r\nWhat fossils, planets, and probability can actually tell us about life beyond Earth\r\n\r\nSilvia Pineda-Munoz, PhD - Climate Ages (https://medium.com/@silvia-pineda-munoz-phd?source=email-50207bf5a022-1767899147474-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-618665d86dc7------------------------aa8912da_71cb_470d_ae1a_c976326314b0--------67abc7b0bfbc)\r\n\xc2\xa0in\xc2\xa0Fossils et al. (https://medium.com/fossils-et-al?source=email-50207bf5a022-1767899147474-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-618665d86dc7------------------------aa8912da_71cb_470d_ae1a_c976326314b0--------67abc7b0bfbc)\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nJanuary 8, 2026\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\n5 min read\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nView on Medium (https://medium.com/fossils-et-al/cf1255bea1e1?source=email-50207bf5a022-1767899147474-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-618665d86dc7------------------------aa8912da_71cb_470d_ae1a_c976326314b0--------67abc7b0bfbc)\r\n\r\nImage from CANVA\r\n\r\nStudying fossils has made me increasingly curious about life elsewhere in the Universe.\r\n\r\nAs a paleontologist, I spend my time thinking about organisms that lived long before humans existed, long before forests, flowers, or even oxygen-rich air. I think about what it took for life to get started at all, and what it took for it to keep going through moments when the planet became hostile (http://redirect.medium.systems/r-qjBdWIicNC?source=email-50207bf5a022-1767899147474-newsletter.subscribeToProfile--cf1255bea1e1-----------------------aa8912da_71cb_470d_ae1a_c976326314b0--------67abc7b0bfbc)\r\n to almost everything alive.\r\n\r\nSomewhere along the way, a simple question kept resurfacing. If life could begin and persist here under such changing conditions, what does that tell us about life on other planets?\r\n\r\n\xe2\x80\xa6\r\n\r\nContinue reading (https://medium.com/fossils-et-al/cf1255bea1e1?source=email-50207bf5a022-1767899147474-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-618665d86dc7------------------------aa8912da_71cb_470d_ae1a_c976326314b0--------67abc7b0bfbc)\r\nThis is a member-only story and can only be read on Medium.\r\n\r\nSent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com by Silvia Pineda-Munoz, PhD - Climate Ages on Medium\r\nUnsubscribe (https://medium.com/me/email-settings/50207bf5a022/5a5d41a52e15?type=noSetting&newsletterV3Id=67abc7b0bfbc&collectionId=618665d86dc7&source=email-50207bf5a022-1767899147474-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-618665d86dc7------------------------aa8912da_71cb_470d_ae1a_c976326314b0--------67abc7b0bfbc)\r\n from this writer's email notifications\r\nManage your email settings (https://medium.com/me/settings/notifications?hash=5a5d41a52e15&userId=50207bf5a022&settingsRouteHash=%23manageSubscriptions&source=email-50207bf5a022-1767899147474-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-618665d86dc7------------------------aa8912da_71cb_470d_ae1a_c976326314b0--------67abc7b0bfbc)\r\n\r\n3500 South DuPont Highway, Suite IQ-101, Dover,\xc2\xa0DE\xc2\xa019901\r\nCareers (https://medium.com/jobs-at-medium/work-at-medium-959d1a85284e?source=email-50207bf5a022-1767899147474-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-618665d86dc7------------------------aa8912da_71cb_470d_ae1a_c976326314b0--------67abc7b0bfbc)\r\n\xc2\xb7Help Center (https://help.medium.com/hc/en-us?source=email-50207bf5a022-1767899147474-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-618665d86dc7------------------------aa8912da_71cb_470d_ae1a_c976326314b0--------67abc7b0bfbc)\r\n\xc2\xb7Privacy Policy (https://policy.medium.com/medium-privacy-policy-f03bf92035c9?source=email-50207bf5a022-1767899147474-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-618665d86dc7------------------------aa8912da_71cb_470d_ae1a_c976326314b0--------67abc7b0bfbc)\r\n\xc2\xb7Terms of service (https://policy.medium.com/medium-terms-of-service-9db0094a1e0f?source=email-50207bf5a022-1767899147474-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-618665d86dc7------------------------aa8912da_71cb_470d_ae1a_c976326314b0--------67abc7b0bfbc)"
