[2026-04-27 10:28:08] Raw text/plain payload: b"Joseph Razo\r\nZBCN the New Payroll Titan: Why Zebec's 2026 Playbook Feels Bigger Than a Token Update.\r\n\r\nJoseph Razo (https://medium.com/@j.razo7869?source=email-50207bf5a022-1767899835447-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------e87901cf_a4c4_4166_aa0a_e2fd750a26f8--------2d9d33acc198)\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nJanuary 8, 2026\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\n7 min read\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nView on Medium (https://medium.com/p/b0ef25e999e0?source=email-50207bf5a022-1767899835447-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------e87901cf_a4c4_4166_aa0a_e2fd750a26f8--------2d9d33acc198)\r\n\r\nJoseph Razo\r\n\r\nCrypto Researcher & Writer\r\n\r\nJan 8, 2026\r\n\r\n\xc2\xb7\xc2\xb7\xc2\xb7\r\nDisclaimer: This article is for informational and educational purposes only and does not constitute financial advice. Cryptocurrency and blockchain investments involve risk. DYOR (Do Your Own Research) and consult a qualified professional before making any financial decisions.\r\n\r\n\xc2\xb7\xc2\xb7\xc2\xb7\r\nMost crypto projects spend years trying to convince people why their token should matter.\r\n\r\nZebec, it turns out, has been doing something far less visible and far more dangerous to ignore.\r\n\r\nOn January 8th, 2026, two separate conversations happened almost back-to-back. One took place in a Zebec Network\xe2\x80\x93hosted X Space, led by CEO Simon\xe2\x80\xa6\r\n\r\nContinue reading (https://medium.com/p/b0ef25e999e0?source=email-50207bf5a022-1767899835447-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------e87901cf_a4c4_4166_aa0a_e2fd750a26f8--------2d9d33acc198)\r\nThis is a member-only story and can only be read on Medium.\r\n\r\nSent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com by Joseph Razo on Medium\r\nUnsubscribe (https://medium.com/me/email-settings/50207bf5a022/7e6b31899519?type=noSetting&amp;newsletterV3Id=2d9d33acc198&source=email-50207bf5a022-1767899835447-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------e87901cf_a4c4_4166_aa0a_e2fd750a26f8--------2d9d33acc198)\r\n from this writer's email notifications\r\nManage your email settings (https://medium.com/me/settings/notifications?hash=7e6b31899519&userId=50207bf5a022&settingsRouteHash=%23manageSubscriptions&source=email-50207bf5a022-1767899835447-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------e87901cf_a4c4_4166_aa0a_e2fd750a26f8--------2d9d33acc198)\r\n\r\n3500 South DuPont Highway, Suite IQ-101, Dover,\xc2\xa0DE\xc2\xa019901\r\nCareers (https://medium.com/jobs-at-medium/work-at-medium-959d1a85284e?source=email-50207bf5a022-1767899835447-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------e87901cf_a4c4_4166_aa0a_e2fd750a26f8--------2d9d33acc198)\r\n\xc2\xb7Help Center (https://help.medium.com/hc/en-us?source=email-50207bf5a022-1767899835447-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------e87901cf_a4c4_4166_aa0a_e2fd750a26f8--------2d9d33acc198)\r\n\xc2\xb7Privacy Policy (https://policy.medium.com/medium-privacy-policy-f03bf92035c9?source=email-50207bf5a022-1767899835447-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------e87901cf_a4c4_4166_aa0a_e2fd750a26f8--------2d9d33acc198)\r\n\xc2\xb7Terms of service (https://policy.medium.com/medium-terms-of-service-9db0094a1e0f?source=email-50207bf5a022-1767899835447-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------e87901cf_a4c4_4166_aa0a_e2fd750a26f8--------2d9d33acc198)"
