r\nSoFi at its discretion.\r\n\r\nPAYOUT TIMING: Bonus payments will be paid out within 2 weeks\r\nfollowing the conclusion of the promotion.\r\n\r\nADDITIONAL IMPORTANT TERMS:\r\n\xe2\x80\xa2 The SoFi Crypto $10 New Account Promo may be combined with\r\nother SoFi Crypto promos.\r\n\xe2\x80\xa2 Promotion is non-transferable and limited to one per account.\r\n\xe2\x80\xa2 SoFi reserves the right to exclude any members from\r\nparticipating in this Promotion for any reason, such as suspected\r\nfraud, misuse, or suspicious activity.\r\n\xe2\x80\xa2 SoFi also reserves the right to modify, suspend, or terminate\r\nthe Promotion at any time without notice.\r\n SoFi Bank values your privacy\r\nand the security of your personal information so please do not\r\ninclude sensitive personal information, such as your Social\r\nSecurity number, in any email or letter that you send to us.\r\n\r\nUnsubscribe ( https://ablink.r.sofi.com/ls/click?upn=u001.k-2FImUMyJvquSjfrastfytCaHf0CItlw9JVHjkSY1MAhwldbDIRGcvAOLK3WuemVn35mGi13Q4GtGLscWZPrfpPpxkonaDHit2nXUD1dvVeIlZ1a8kvVZcfqS4rZTNpIwFQ752FNohBGIG9-2BtCJ0eCf4vvif2N-2FrVTnF10eayuAwXf7dk-2Fqg2S7v6eGghPS-2Fjiv1E_Hvirw9jLOYnqUg7ucIAtvDa4JCWhfjePQT8cfdKWfeKaKK6WyzUu0MT5hcL83ezarLAJeFzEeRP-2BR0XWfLa6c0DZWp9w-2F3O1cMZT8eQiazsCYB5dw6VdtvNVdzfi1TZsTNSTNVSnNFlvPSl2TtEHPd0SDPvxsP-2F2rS5Pp49r5aFQTaBWwgGpY5byn8F8y10dvBvFv9j6FqKPOz9STKPwqLLJn1NANK0YdQuOxe2LvGt4BoUB744bPZvFo4QbCEdA8TK3kHYuw-2BQlGygPhWEaHw3DduMUSc9kawryBd9T8VuqQpEtAHYl8jsSLHaP33M90GNoS5oUH0H-2BwPqB0LpBQa1rY5ozmnO1lHeUwsrzICTRX3oEFZ-2FI0FoKGjhy6r05cHzq3TLLjaALQwC86GqQx-2BqDjitnN4Z810j9UE6D-2BiHgB2uNcXfMeibIEgvpcJy3nFfTEwls2mPFdPQKpNVqcqV-2FH5-2FcFzFiAfW4iosKKjh4S7Q2OSXYETja6J0OTRQZ7MDnilh15E-2B-2F35PYlwm2-2BleGcO8zMqlcC7mIAkCFp84aWhpdmBhtbHE61MzJ54yo9tcTV8bvIOReIvIr2bp6SnwFmjJUzk6-2Bh9PNIG4D5uM1xmA27QCeEaR-2BVFtSOq71AQJdJA0KPL4pf9uNG4Wd2mu6F0RDWvomPFrds-2BxXssMRdUDuBeqhRxToRwdVRgtDsShkIcAGh4Cn2u0wNAYm-2FkRpXhDPbUtsrKEmqfVgSJiIb-2FEh1i2LWzR35KOi-2FYxp ) | Privacy\r\nPolicy ( https://a