[2026-04-27 10:28:16] Raw text/plain payload: b'Final chance to register!  \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nNIST  \r\n \r\n\r\nView As Web Page [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USNIST/bulletins/4036570 ]\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\nHeader  \r\n \r\n\r\nNational Cybersecurity Center of Excellence\r\n \r\n \r\nLast Chance to Register! Cyber AI Workshop #2\r\nRegistration Closes Tomorrow! NIST Cyber AI Workshop #2\r\n\r\n*Date/Time: *January 14, 2026 | 9:00 a.m. \xe2\x80\x93 5:00 p.m. EST\r\n\r\n*Location:\xc2\xa0*The MITRE Corporation, 7525 Colshire Drive, McLean, VA, 22102\r\n\r\nJoin the National Cybersecurity Center of Excellence (NCCoE) on January 14, 2026 for a\xc2\xa0full-day workshop [ https://www.nccoe.nist.gov/get-involved/attend-events/cyber-ai-workshop-2 ]\xc2\xa0to discuss the preliminary draft\xc2\xa0NIST IR 8596, Cybersecurity Framework Profile for Artificial Intelligence (Cyber AI Profile) [ https://www.nccoe.nist.gov/projects/cyber-ai-profile#project-promo ]\xc2\xa0and hear updates regarding the\xc2\xa0SP 800-53 Control Overlays for Securing AI Systems (COSAiS) [ https://csrc.nist.gov/projects/cosais ].\r\n\r\n*Register now [ https://www.nccoe.nist.gov/get-involved/attend-events/cyber-ai-workshop-2 ]* to attend in-person or virtually and influence the development of the NIST Cyber AI Profile.\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*Background*\r\n\r\nWorking with the cybersecurity and AI communities, the NCCoE has published a preliminary\xc2\xa0Cyber AI Profile [ https://www.nccoe.nist.gov/projects/cyber-ai-profile#project-promo ]\xc2\xa0to help organizations strategically adopt AI while addressing and prioritizing cybersecurity risks stemming from its advancements.\r\n\r\n*Workshop Details*\r\n\r\nThis workshop will feature presentations in the morning, followed by breakout sessions in the afternoon. The breakout sessions will allow in-person attendees to engage with the NIST Cyber AI Profile team and discuss the preliminary draft of the Profile more in-depth.\r\n\r\nView the agenda [ https://www.nccoe.nist.gov/sites/default/files/2026-01/Cyber%20AI%20Workshop%20%232%20-%20Agenda.pdf ].\r\n\r\n*Note: The virtual portion of this workshop will conclude after the morning presentations.*\r\n\r\nWe encourage you to review the Profile in advance of this workshop \xe2\x80\x93 your feedback is crucial in shaping the next and final version of this publication. For more information regarding the workshop and breakout session discussion topics, please visit the\xc2\xa0NCCoE event page [ https://www.nccoe.nist.gov/get-involved/attend-events/cyber-ai-workshop-2 ]. The comment period for the Cyber AI Profile is open through\xc2\xa0*January 30, 2026*. Visit the NCCoE\xc2\xa0project page [ https://www.nccoe.nist.gov/projects/cyber-ai-profile#project-promo ]\xc2\xa0for more information on how to submit comments.\r\n\r\n*Now Available! Workshop Annotated Outline*\r\n\r\nTo help\xc2\xa0facilitate the\xc2\xa0control\xc2\xa0overlays\xc2\xa0for securing AI systems\xc2\xa0discussion\xc2\xa0during this event, NIST has issued an\xc2\xa0annotated outline [ https://csrc.nist.gov/csrc/media/Projects/cosais/documents/COSAiS-Predictive-AI-annotated-outline-Jan2026.pdf ]\xc2\xa0of proposed content for\xc2\xa0*NIST IR 8605, Control Overlays for Securing AI Systems: Overview and Methodology*, and*\xc2\xa0NISTIR 8605A, Control Overlays for Securing AI Systems: Using and Fine-Tuning Predictive AI*. The authors welcome feedback during the workshop, through ongoing engagement in the Control Overlays for Securing AI Systems (COSAiS) Slack Channel, and by email to _overlays-securing-ai@list.nist.gov_\xc2\xa0by February 13, 2026.\r\n\r\n**Registration closes tomorrow, January 9th.*\r\n\r\nRegister Now! [ https://www.nccoe.nist.gov/get-involved/attend-events/cyber-ai-workshop-2 ]\r\n\r\nNIST Cybersecurity and Privacy Program\r\nQuestions/Comments about this notice: cyberaiprofile@nist.gov\r\nNCCoE Website questions: nccoe@nist.gov\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nConnect with us\r\n facebook [ https://www.facebook.com/NIST ]twitter [ https://twitter.com/NIST ]youtube [ https://www.youtube.com/NIST ]linkedin [ https://www.linkedin.com/company/nist ]flickr [ https://www.instagram.com/nist/ ]  \r\n\r\nReceived this email from a friend? Subscribe here [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USNIST/subscriber/new?topic_id=USNIST_1 ].\r\n\r\n ITL NIST [ https://www.nist.gov/itl ] \r\n\r\nSubscriber services:\r\n\r\nManage Preferences [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USNIST/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 Unsubscribe [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USNIST/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 Help [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/ ]\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\nIf you have questions or problems with the subscription service, please contact subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/ ].\r\nTechnical questions? Contact inquiries@nist.gov. (301) 975-NIST (6478).\r\n\r\nThis service is provided to you at no charge by National Institute of Standards and Technology (NIST).\xc2\xa0100 Bureau Drive, Stop 1070\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7 Gaithersburg, MD 20899\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0301-975-6478\r\n\r\n GovDelivery logo [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/ ] \r\nbody .abe-column-block { min-height: 5px; } table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:10px; margin-right:10px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;} table.govd_hr {min-width: 100%;}\r\n'
