[2026-04-27 10:28:17] Raw text/plain payload: b'Also: Up to $3.3M in AI Development Funding Available  \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n*View as a webpage / Share [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/NJGOV/bulletins/403772e ]*\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nbusiness.nj.gov [ https://business.nj.gov/ ]  \r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nJanuary 8, 2026\r\n\r\n*Updates*\r\n\r\nFor more business updates and live support from business experts, visit *Business.NJ.gov [ http://business.nj.gov/ ].*\r\nAlready have an account? *Log in [ https://navigator.business.nj.gov/onboarding?page=1 ].*\r\n\r\n \r\n*Small Businesses Can Register for Free AI Tools Webinar [ https://www.eventbrite.com/e/how-ai-can-save-small-businesses-time-and-money-tickets-1976959090859?utm_source=govdelivery&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=20260108_nwsltr&utm_content=biz&utm_term=econ ]*\r\n\r\nLearn how artificial intelligence tools can help you save time and reduce costs at a free seminar hosted by the New Jersey Business Action Center. Small business owners can learn practical applications for AI, including improving efficiency, enhancing customer service, creating marketing content, analyzing sales data, and reducing administrative tasks. The webinar will also cover responsible AI use and developing company policies to protect your business.\r\n\r\nThe webinar takes place online on January 13 at 12:00 p.m. Registration is open now.\r\n\r\nRegister Now [ https://www.eventbrite.com/e/how-ai-can-save-small-businesses-time-and-money-tickets-1976959090859?utm_source=govdelivery&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=20260108_nwsltr&utm_content=biz&utm_term=econ ]\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n*Unemployment and Disability Insurance Rates Increased for 2026 [ https://nj.gov/labor/?utm_source=govdelivery&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=20260108_nwsltr&utm_content=biz&utm_term=ben ]*\r\n\r\nMaximum weekly benefit rates for Unemployment Insurance, Temporary Disability Insurance, Family Leave Insurance, and Workers\' Compensation increased on January 1, 2026.\r\n\r\nThe unemployment insurance taxable wage base rose to $44,800 (from $43,300). The Temporary Disability and Family Leave Insurance taxable wage base increased to $171,100 (from $165,400).\r\n\r\nMaximum weekly benefits are now: $905 for Unemployment Insurance, $1,119 for Temporary Disability and Family Leave Insurance, and $1,199 for Workers\' Compensation. Businesses should update payroll withholding and benefit calculations.\r\n\r\nLearn More [ https://nj.gov/labor/?utm_source=govdelivery&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=20260108_nwsltr&utm_content=biz&utm_term=ben ]\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n*AI Teams and Startups Can Compete for $3.34M in State Grants [ https://www.plugandplaytechcenter.com/innovation-services/challenge-offerings/ai-innovation-challenge?utm_source=govdelivery&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=20260108_nwsltr&utm_content=biz&utm_term=econ ]*\r\n\r\nNew Jersey is launching a strategic initiative to advance artificial intelligence solutions for public good and innovation. The AI Innovation Challenge recognizes AI\'s potential to enhance government services, address complex challenges, and drive technological advancement across sectors.\r\n\r\nTeams of students, researchers, entrepreneurs, and residents can apply alongside early-stage companies with fewer than 225 employees. Eligible applicants must have at least three members (including one AI expert) with 50%+ NJ residents and establish operations in New Jersey. New publicly-available datasets have been added to the *NJOIT Open Data Center [ https://data.nj.gov/?utm_source=govdelivery&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=20260108_nwsltr&utm_content=biz&utm_term=econ ]* (*data.nj.gov* [ https://data.nj.gov/?utm_source=govdelivery&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=20260108_nwsltr&utm_content=biz&utm_term=econ ]) to help applicants.\r\n\r\n*Applications close January 19*, 5:00 p.m. ET. Up to ten winners will receive a total of $1M for product development, with an additional $2.34M available based on progress and commercialization readiness demonstrated by March.\r\n\r\nApply Now [ https://www.plugandplaytechcenter.com/innovation-services/challenge-offerings/ai-innovation-challenge?utm_source=govdelivery&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=20260108_nwsltr&utm_content=biz&utm_term=econ ]\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n*New Jersey Minimum Wage Increased to $15.92 [ https://nj.gov/labor/?utm_source=govdelivery&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=20260108_nwsltr&utm_content=biz&utm_term=reg ]*\r\n\r\nThe minimum wage in New Jersey increased to $15.92 per hour on January 1, 2026, up from $15.49.\r\n\r\nThe increase applies to most employees, with some exceptions for specific worker categories. Businesses should update payroll systems and wage calculations immediately.\r\n\r\nLearn More [ https://nj.gov/labor/?utm_source=govdelivery&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=20260108_nwsltr&utm_content=biz&utm_term=reg ]\r\n \r\nIn Case You Missed It:\r\n\r\n*Moving Alcohol in New Jersey? Stay Compliant in Just a Few Clicks [ https://account.business.nj.gov/onboarding?page=1?utm_source=govdelivery&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=20260108_nwsltr&utm_content=biz&utm_term=reg ]*\r\n\r\n*Developers and Nonprofits Can Apply for Up to $100,000 in Planning Grants [ https://www.njeda.gov/asset-activation-planning-grant/?utm_source=govdelivery&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=20260108_nwsltr&utm_content=biz&utm_term=econ ]*\r\n\r\n*Employers Must Report All Worker Separations Through Online Portal [ https://www.nj.gov/labor/ea/employer-services/register-update/employeraccess.shtml?utm_source=govdelivery&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=20260108_nwsltr&utm_content=biz&utm_term=reg ]*\r\n\r\n*Hospitality Businesses Can Apply for Liquor License Reimbursement Grants [ https://www.njeda.gov/small-business-liquor-license-grant/?utm_source=govdelivery&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=20260108_nwsltr&utm_content=biz&utm_term=econ ]*\r\n\r\n*Small Businesses Can Get Reimbursed for Building Improvements [ https://www.njeda.gov/small-business-improvement-grant/?utm_source=govdelivery&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=20260108_nwsltr&utm_content=biz&utm_term=econ ]*\r\n\r\n*Small Businesses Can Receive Lease Payment Support [ https://www.njeda.gov/small-business-lease-grant-program/?utm_source=govdelivery&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=20260108_nwsltr&utm_content=biz&utm_term=econ ]*\r\n\r\n*View All Updates [ http://business.nj.gov/recent ]*\r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n*Business Question?*\r\n*Speak to a New Jersey Business Expert* \r\n \r\n\r\n*Chat with us online [ http://business.nj.gov/ ]\xc2\xa0 |\xc2\xa0 Call us at 1-800-Jersey-7 [ tel:1800Jersey7 ]\xc2\xa0 |\xc2\xa0 Mon-Fri, 8 a.m. - 5 p.m.*\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nThis newsletter is brought to you by:\r\n\r\nOffice of the Governor of the State of New Jersey [ https://nj.gov/governor/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]New Jersey Business Action Center [ https://www.nj.gov/state/bac/bac.shtml?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]New Jersey Economic Development Authority [ https://www.njeda.com/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]Department of the Treasury State of New Jersey [ https://www.state.nj.us/treasury/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]New Jersey Office of Innovation [ https://innovation.nj.gov/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n\r\n"Some newsletter content was created with the assistance of generative AI."\r\n"*Learn more [ https://innovation.nj.gov/skills/ai/ ].*"\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nStay Connected with The State of New Jersey: Facebook [ https://www.facebook.com/governorphilmurphy/ ]\xc2\xa0 X [ https://twitter.com/GovMurphy ]\xc2\xa0 Instagram [ https://www.instagram.com/govmurphy/ ]\xc2\xa0 SUBSCRIBER SERVICES:\r\nManage Subscriptions [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/NJGOV/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 Unsubscribe All [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/NJGOV/subscriber/one_click_unsubscribe?verification=5.7342faa5c6504bfcaf96eabf517c12fc&destination=jasonnorman66994%40gmail.com ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 Help [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/ ]  \r\nbody .abe-column-block {min-height: 0px;} \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n This email was sent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com using GovDelivery Communications Cloud on behalf of: The State of New Jersey \xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0\r\nPO Box 001\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7 Trenton, NJ 08625 GovDelivery logo [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/ ]\r\n'
