[2026-04-27 10:28:18] Raw text/plain payload: b"Bookmark and Share [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USIRS/bulletins/4008c67?reqfrom=share ]\r\n\r\nbody { font-family: arial; } p { font-size: 12px; } li { font-size: 12px; } h2 { font-size: 24px; font-style: italic;} --&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt; \r\nIRS.gov Banner \r\nQuickAlerts for Authorized\xc2\xa0IRS e-file Providers/EROs January 8, 2026 \r\n \r\ne-file Resources\r\n\r\nQuickAlerts Library [ https://www.irs.gov/e-file-providers/quickalerts-library ]\r\n\r\nQuickAlerts Article [ https://www.irs.gov/e-file-providers/quickalerts-more-e-file-benefits-for-tax-professionals ]\r\n\r\nQuickAlerts Brochure [ https://www.irs.gov/pub/irs-pdf/p4003.pdf ]\r\n\r\ne-file for Tax Pros [ https://www.irs.gov/e-file-providers/efile-for-tax-professionals ]\r\n\r\nSoftware Developers [ https://www.irs.gov/e-file-providers/modernized-e-file-overview ]\r\n\r\nIRS.gov [ https://www.irs.gov/ ]\r\n\r\nRefund Information [ https://www.irs.gov/pub/irs-pdf/p2043en.pdf ]\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\nOther Useful Links\r\n\r\nTax Professionals Home [ https://www.irs.gov/tax-professionals ]\r\n\r\nAll Forms and Instructions [ https://www.irs.gov/forms-instructions ]\r\n\r\nStakeholders Partners'  [ https://www.irs.gov/businesses/small-businesses-self-employed/irs-stakeholder-partners-headliners ]\r\nHeadliners [ https://www.irs.gov/businesses/small-businesses-self-employed/irs-stakeholder-partners-headliners ]\r\n\r\nTraining and [ https://www.irs.gov/tax-professionals/irs-training-and-communication-tools-for-tax-professionals ]\r\nCommunication Tools [ https://www.irs.gov/tax-professionals/irs-training-and-communication-tools-for-tax-professionals ]\r\n\r\ne-Services [ https://www.irs.gov/tax-professionals/e-services-online-tools-for-tax-professionals ]\r\n\r\nDisaster Relief [ https://www.irs.gov/newsroom/tax-relief-in-disaster-situations ]\r\n\r\nInternal Revenue Bulletins [ https://www.irs.gov/irb/index.html ]\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n*Subject: *Tax Year 2025 Publication 1345 is Available on IRS.gov\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n*Attention*: Software Developers, Return Transmitters and Authorized IRS e-file Providers/EROs \r\n\r\nPublication 1345 [ https://www.irs.gov/site-index-search?search=1345&field_pup_historical_1=1&field_pup_historical=1 ], Authorized IRS e-file Providers of Individual Income Tax Returns is now available on IRS.gov. \r\n\r\nThis revision replaces the previous edition revised October 2024.\r\n\r\n*Updates in Pub 1345:*\r\n\r\n\r\n  * Removed 1040-PR from Software Developers section paragraph (6) it was obsolete as of TY2022. \r\n  * Added section classifying resellers of software as Intermediate Service Providers and provided rules in Intermediate Service Providers. \r\n  * Replaced Form 1040SSPR with Form 1040SS. \r\n  * Updated Device ID to reflect it can be either a 40-digit alphanumeric value (SHA-1 algorithm) or a 64-digit alphanumeric value (SHA-256 algorithm). We recommend all software\xe2\x80\x99s transition to SHA-256 algorithm which provides more robust security measures. SHA-1 support will be discontinued in the future. \r\n\r\nThis publication is a great way applicants and participants can stay up to date on the latest IRS e-file requirements.\xc2\xa0Applicants and participants should read this publication to become familiar with the requirements for acceptance or continued participation.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nBack to Top [ #Fifteenth ]\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\nThank you for subscribing to QuickAlerts for Tax Professionals, an IRS e-mail service.\r\n\r\nIf you have an idea or a question related to QuickAlerts you can contact us by e-mail <QuickAlerts@irs.gov>. Submissions which are not related to QuickAlerts will not be processed. If you have tax related questions you should pursue normal customer service channels provided on\xc2\xa0IRS.gov [ https://www.irs.gov/ ].\r\n\r\nIf you know someone who might want to subscribe to this mailing list, please forward this message to them so they can subscribe [ https://www.irs.gov/e-file-providers/subscribe-to-quick-alerts ].\r\n\r\nThis message was distributed automatically. *Please Do Not Reply To This Message.*\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\nUpdate your subscriptions, modify your password or email address, or stop subscriptions at any time on your Subscriber Preferences Page [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USIRS/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ]. You will need your email address to log in. If you have questions or problems with the subscription service, visit subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/ ].\r\n\r\nThis service is provided to you at no charge by the Internal Revenue Service (IRS) [ https://www.irs.gov/ ].\r\n\r\n \r\nbody .abe-column-block {min-height: 5px;} ________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\nThis email was sent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com by: Internal Revenue Service (IRS) \xc2\xb7 Internal Revenue Service \xc2\xb7 1111 Constitution Ave. N.W. \xc2\xb7 Washington, D.C. 20535 GovDelivery logo [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/ ] \r\nbody .abe-column-block { min-height: 5px; } table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:10px; margin-right:10px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;}\r\n"
