[2026-04-27 10:28:30] Raw text/plain payload: b"Node 24 kill a popular dependency with native feature. Fewer deps, safer configs, let's see why this overdue change finally matters\xe2\x80\xa6\r\nNode.js Just Killed a Dependency We All Took for Granted\r\n\r\nAmit Kumar (https://medium.com/@amit08255?source=email-50207bf5a022-1767933180286-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------d8071cbe_08da_4fd5_819b_75726afdfbaf--------1e8d2271b316)\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nJanuary 9, 2026\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\n3 min read\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nView on Medium (https://medium.com/p/95726803236f?source=email-50207bf5a022-1767933180286-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------d8071cbe_08da_4fd5_819b_75726afdfbaf--------1e8d2271b316)\r\n\r\nNode.js Just Killed a Dependency We All Took for Granted\r\n\r\nEarlier this week, I finally removed dotenv from one of my projects.\r\n\r\nNot because it stopped working it's been rock solid since forever but because Node.js finally made it unnecessary.\r\n\r\nClick here to read for free\r\n\r\nThat's right. Node 24 added native support for loading\xc2\xa0.env files. Something we've all been patching in since, what, 2012?\r\n\r\nHonestly, it feels a bit overdue. But it's here, and it works beautifully.\r\n\r\nLet's walk through the small but neat changes.\r\n\r\nLoading\xc2\xa0.env Files Natively\r\n\r\nYou can now ask Node to load environment files when running your script.\r\n\r\nnode --env-file=.env app.js\r\nThat one flag replaces an entire dependency\xe2\x80\xa6\r\n\r\nContinue reading (https://medium.com/p/95726803236f?source=email-50207bf5a022-1767933180286-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------d8071cbe_08da_4fd5_819b_75726afdfbaf--------1e8d2271b316)\r\nThis is a member-only story and can only be read on Medium.\r\n\r\nSent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com by Amit Kumar on Medium\r\nUnsubscribe (https://medium.com/me/email-settings/50207bf5a022/308c70386a2b?type=noSetting&newsletterV3Id=1e8d2271b316&source=email-50207bf5a022-1767933180286-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------d8071cbe_08da_4fd5_819b_75726afdfbaf--------1e8d2271b316)\r\n from this writer's email notifications\r\nManage your email settings (https://medium.com/me/settings/notifications?hash=308c70386a2b&userId=50207bf5a022&settingsRouteHash=%23manageSubscriptions&source=email-50207bf5a022-1767933180286-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------d8071cbe_08da_4fd5_819b_75726afdfbaf--------1e8d2271b316)\r\n\r\n3500 South DuPont Highway, Suite IQ-101, Dover,\xc2\xa0DE\xc2\xa019901\r\nCareers (https://medium.com/jobs-at-medium/work-at-medium-959d1a85284e?source=email-50207bf5a022-1767933180286-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------d8071cbe_08da_4fd5_819b_75726afdfbaf--------1e8d2271b316)\r\n\xc2\xb7Help Center (https://help.medium.com/hc/en-us?source=email-50207bf5a022-1767933180286-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------d8071cbe_08da_4fd5_819b_75726afdfbaf--------1e8d2271b316)\r\n\xc2\xb7Privacy Policy (https://policy.medium.com/medium-privacy-policy-f03bf92035c9?source=email-50207bf5a022-1767933180286-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------d8071cbe_08da_4fd5_819b_75726afdfbaf--------1e8d2271b316)\r\n\xc2\xb7Terms of service (https://policy.medium.com/medium-terms-of-service-9db0094a1e0f?source=email-50207bf5a022-1767933180286-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------d8071cbe_08da_4fd5_819b_75726afdfbaf--------1e8d2271b316)"
