[2026-04-27 10:28:32] Raw text/plain payload: b'2026\xe2\x80\x8a-\xe2\x80\x8aThe Rule of Law is Good For All, Oreshnik in Lviv, Tanker Seized\r\nUkraine Update January 8\xe2\x80\x939\r\n\r\n2026\xe2\x80\x8a-\xe2\x80\x8aThe Rule of Law is Good For All, Oreshnik in Lviv, Tanker Seized\r\n\r\nDylan Combellick (https://medium.com/@dylan_combellick?source=email-50207bf5a022-1767939683335-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------654377b0_084e_4641_86a0_8a243f6af9a6--------354e45830cd6)\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nJanuary 9, 2026\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\n19 min read\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nView on Medium (https://medium.com/p/77c8601deba1?source=email-50207bf5a022-1767939683335-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------654377b0_084e_4641_86a0_8a243f6af9a6--------354e45830cd6)\r\n\r\nWell, Lviv was nice. We got to see some old friends and participated in a game of extremely difficult bar trivia in Ukrainian (which I barely speak but understand well enough), where we got two correct answers out of 32 questions. The quiz began with a minute of silence for frontline soldiers and the fallen. The trivia club is going to regionals next week and hopes to get a team to nationals. The top score was 19. It was less "fun bar trivia" and more, as the host put it, "mental BDSM".\r\n\r\nRapunzel was my one correct answer. The question\xe2\x80\xa6\r\n\r\nContinue reading (https://medium.com/p/77c8601deba1?source=email-50207bf5a022-1767939683335-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------654377b0_084e_4641_86a0_8a243f6af9a6--------354e45830cd6)\r\nThis is a member-only story and can only be read on Medium.\r\n\r\nSent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com by Dylan Combellick on Medium\r\nUnsubscribe (https://medium.com/me/email-settings/50207bf5a022/7195e96c3750?type=noSetting&newsletterV3Id=354e45830cd6&source=email-50207bf5a022-1767939683335-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------