[2026-04-27 10:28:36] Raw text/plain payload: b"The iPhone Features You'll Wish You Knew Years Ago\r\n7 Things 99% of Users Don't Know Their iPhone Could Do\r\n\r\nThe iPhone Features You'll Wish You Knew Years Ago\r\n\r\nThe Useful Tech (https://medium.com/@theusefultech?source=email-50207bf5a022-1767952584773-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-953b148ade73------------------------d6a9532b_8548_4e90_b236_9a620dd1eb04--------eeb618317985)\r\n\xc2\xa0in\xc2\xa0The Useful Tech (https://medium.com/the-useful-tech?source=email-50207bf5a022-1767952584773-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-953b148ade73------------------------d6a9532b_8548_4e90_b236_9a620dd1eb04--------eeb618317985)\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nJanuary 9, 2026\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\n9 min read\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nView on Medium (https://medium.com/the-useful-tech/93fc920005cb?source=email-50207bf5a022-1767952584773-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-953b148ade73------------------------d6a9532b_8548_4e90_b236_9a620dd1eb04--------eeb618317985)\r\n\r\nSource: Generated by GPT\xe2\x80\x8a-\xe2\x80\x8a5.2\r\n\r\nI have been testing and writing about Apple products for years, and I have reviewed hundreds of apps, dissected every iOS update, and spent embarrassing amounts of time in Settings menus most people don't know exist.\r\n\r\nAnd yet, every few months, I discover something my iPhone could do all along that I immediately wonder how I survived without it.\r\n\r\nThese aren't buried settings or obscure accessibility features. These are everyday shortcuts hiding in plain sight, waiting to save you time, taps, and frustration. Some of them genuinely changed how I use my phone.\r\n\r\nHere are seven of my favorites.\r\n\r\n\xc2\xb7\xc2\xb7\xc2\xb7\r\n#1 Siri Doesn't Need Your Full Sentence (And Never Did)\r\n\r\nWe\xe2\x80\xa6\r\n\r\nContinue reading (https://medium.com/the-useful-tech/93fc920005cb?source=email-50207bf5a022-1767952584773-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-953b148ade73------------------------d6a9532b_8548_4e90_b236_9a620dd1eb04--------eeb618317985)\r\nThis is a member-only story and can only be read on Medium.\r\n\r\nSent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com by The Useful Tech on Medium\r\nUnsubscribe (https://medium.com/me/email-settings/50207bf5a022/e25e92b8b3b5?type=noSetting&newsletterV3Id=eeb618317985&collectionId=953b148ade73&source=email-50207bf5a022-1767952584773-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-953b148ade73------------------------d6a9532b_8548_4e90_b236_9a620dd1eb04--------eeb618317985)\r\n from this writer's email notifications\r\nManage your email settings (https://medium.com/me/settings/notifications?hash=e25e92b8b3b5&userId=50207bf5a022&settingsRouteHash=%23manageSubscriptions&source=email-50207bf5a022-1767952584773-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-953b148ade73------------------------d6a9532b_8548_4e90_b236_9a620dd1eb04--------eeb618317985)\r\n\r\n3500 South DuPont Highway, Suite IQ-101, Dover,\xc2\xa0DE\xc2\xa019901\r\nCareers (https://medium.com/jobs-at-medium/work-at-medium-959d1a85284e?source=email-50207bf5a022-1767952584773-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-953b148ade73------------------------d6a9532b_8548_4e90_b236_9a620dd1eb04--------eeb618317985)\r\n\xc2\xb7Help Center (https://help.medium.com/hc/en-us?source=email-50207bf5a022-1767952584773-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-953b148ade73------------------------d6a9532b_8548_4e90_b236_9a620dd1eb04--------eeb618317985)\r\n\xc2\xb7Privacy Policy (https://policy.medium.com/medium-privacy-policy-f03bf92035c9?source=email-50207bf5a022-1767952584773-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-953b148ade73------------------------d6a9532b_8548_4e90_b236_9a620dd1eb04--------eeb618317985)\r\n\xc2\xb7Terms of service (https://policy.medium.com/medium-terms-of-service-9db0094a1e0f?source=email-50207bf5a022-1767952584773-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-953b148ade73------------------------d6a9532b_8548_4e90_b236_9a620dd1eb04--------eeb618317985)"
