[2026-04-27 10:28:40] Raw text/plain payload: b'Hi,\r\n\r\nAre you making efficient use of Filestack? Here are a few tips and tricks to get you started:\r\n*Filepicker setup <https://app.news.filestack.com/e/er?s=608&lid=63107&elqTrackId=73BED6CD6B7CB5577A12C74137E05208&elq=ae6673ecad914d1cb4189b04f60cafa4&elqaid=49921&elqat=1&elqak=8AF5822C31005E64903872E3A20F982DD2EE2FD66B67A209D9845BE82F3B48D5A536>\r\n*Drag & drop <https://app.news.filestack.com/e/er?s=608&lid=63106&elqTrackId=AC82FA955899B269D770632DA348C3C2&elq=ae6673ecad914d1cb4189b04f60cafa4&elqaid=49921&elqat=1&elqak=8AF5FB51C78A6985DAD635F9C8BADB0A5C4C2FD66B67A209D9845BE82F3B48D5A536>\r\n*Dropbox integration <https://app.news.filestack.com/e/er?s=608&lid=63105&elqTrackId=E09F19EC037CF0C730920F5D97605735&elq=ae6673ecad914d1cb4189b04f60cafa4&elqaid=49921&elqat=1&elqak=8AF5F7E8897B5D83FEF44F189D0AC489E4D52FD66B67A209D9845BE82F3B48D5A536>\r\n*Amazon S3 integration <https://app.news.filestack.com/e/er?s=608&lid=63104&elqTrackId=32A1F82C62D0E74DF08102EFA0DB479C&elq=ae6673ecad914d1cb4189b04f60cafa4&elqaid=49921&elqat=1&elqak=8AF5E6488F571E382813A6294A10FDE898CB2FD66B67A209D9845BE82F3B48D5A536>\r\n\r\nIs the free plan to your liking so far? You could take it up a notch and add features like a mobile-friendly image editor, virus detection, video conversions, and a lot more to your plan. You can try any of them for free; just let me know which one.\r\n\r\nNot familiar with the features? Check them out here:\r\n\r\nhttps://www.filestack.com/features/ <https://app.news.filestack.com/e/er?s=608&lid=63103&elqTrackId=251A40DDC4FAE9BC4BE8047C8BCD3258&elq=ae6673ecad914d1cb4189b04f60cafa4&elqaid=49921&elqat=1&elqak=8AF5E1D4672AAE1A2001A7D432B14A94A1722FD66B67A209D9845BE82F3B48D5A536>\r\n\r\nIf you have any suggestions on how we can assist you better, please don\xe2\x80\x99t hesitate to book a spot on my calendar using the link below in my signature.\r\n\r\nMany thanks,\r\n\r\nPaul Thomson\r\n\r\nCustomer Success Executive\r\n\r\nE: paul.thomson@filestack.com <mailto:paul.thomson@filestack.com>\r\n\r\nO: +441 628 684460\r\n\r\nSchedule a Meeting!\r\n\r\nhttps://zcal.co/i/DxPBCEhd <https://app.news.filestack.com/e/er?s=608&lid=63077&elqTrackId=ACAF542DC192C59B5C7D20A77390B6DE&elq=ae6673ecad914d1cb4189b04f60cafa4&elqaid=49921&elqat=1&elqak=8AF5CE95C824FB1332F8F1C304DA10B5B1622FD66B67A209D9845BE82F3B48D5A536>\r\n\r\nhttps://snap.filestack. <https://app.news.filestack.com/e/er?s=608&lid=60779&elqTrackId=EE223FB6C1F985743324A6C24BD0715A&elq=ae6673ecad914d1cb4189b04f60cafa4&elqaid=49921&elqat=1&elqak=8AF52F0F73A51E0BD9744874C46A30DF890E2FD66B67A209D9845BE82F3B48D5A536>com <https://app.news.filestack.com/e/er?s=608&lid=60779&elqTrackId=EE223FB6C1F985743324A6C24BD0715A&elq=ae6673ecad914d1cb4189b04f60cafa4&elqaid=49921&elqat=1&elqak=8AF52F0F73A51E0BD9744874C46A30DF890E2FD66B67A209D9845BE82F3B48D5A536>/#dashboard <https://app.news.filestack.com/e/er?s=608&lid=60779&elqTrackId=EE223FB6C1F985743324A6C24BD0715A&elq=ae6673ecad914d1cb4189b04f60cafa4&elqaid=49921&elqat=1&elqak=8AF52F0F73A51E0BD9744874C46A30DF890E2FD66B67A209D9845BE82F3B48D5A536>\r\n\r\nhttps://www.filestack.com/ <https://app.news.filestack.com/e/er?s=608&lid=52226&elqTrackId=49C6B9FD09A133355BB4F1F0B258857B&elq=ae6673ecad914d1cb4189b04f60cafa4&elqaid=49921&elqat=1&elqak=8AF5E3DFA1A211D9F7817C42CBC5D5BC74B02FD66B67A209D9845BE82F3B48D5A536>\r\n\r\nIf you would like me to stop sending you emails, please click here <https://app.news.filestack.com/e/cu?s=608&elqc=1905&elq=ae6673ecad914d1cb4189b04f60cafa4&elqak=8AF543DB6BFF339ECED65ADCE73FFC3BBD992FD66B67A209D9845BE82F3B48D5A536>'
