[2026-04-27 10:28:51] Raw text/plain payload: b'The approvals listed below may not be comprehensive. For the most current information, view the full listing of all approvals at Drugs@FDA [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=reportsSearch.process&rptName=1&reportSelectMonth=11&reportSelectYear=2025&nav ].\r\n\r\n*What\'s New Related to Drugs*\r\n\r\n*Updated Monday through Friday*\r\n\r\n\r\n  * Current and Resolved Drug Shortages and Discontinuations Reported to FDA [ https://dps.fda.gov/drugshortages#tab4 ] \r\n  * Drug Firm Annual Registration Status [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/drls/default.cfm?utm_medium=&utm_source= ] \r\n  * Drug Firm Annual Registration Status Download File [ https://www.fda.gov/drugs/drug-approvals-and-databases/drug-establishments-current-registration-site?utm_medium=&utm_source= ] \r\n  * National Drug Code Directory [ https://www.fda.gov/drugs/drug-approvals-and-databases/national-drug-code-directory?utm_medium=&utm_source= ] \r\n  * NDC Unfinished Drugs Excluded Database File [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/cder/NDC_unfinished_excluded.zip?utm_medium=&utm_source= ] \r\n  * NDC Database Excluded Packages and Products [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/cder/ndc_excluded.zip?utm_medium=&utm_source= ] \r\n  * Wholesale Distributor and Third-Party Logistics Providers Reporting [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/wdd3plreporting/ ] \r\n  * Drug Establishments Current Registration Site [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/drls/ ] \r\n  * Drugs@FDA Data Files [ https://www.fda.gov/drugs/drug-approvals-and-databases/drugsfda-data-files ]\xc2\xa0 \r\n\r\n*Updated Biweekly*\r\n\r\n  * Competitive Generic Therapy Approvals [ https://www.fda.gov/drugs/generic-drugs/competitive-generic-therapy-approvals ] \r\n\r\n*January 9, 2026*\r\n\r\n\r\n  * Draft Guidance:\xc2\xa0Use of Bayesian Methodology in Clinical Trials of Drug and Biological Products [ https://www.fda.gov/regulatory-information/search-fda-guidance-documents/use-bayesian-methodology-clinical-trials-drug-and-biological-products ] \r\n\r\n*January 5, 2026*\r\n\r\n\r\n  * FDA approves therapy for rare blood disorder in pediatric patients 12 years and older [ https://www.fda.gov/drugs/news-events-human-drugs/fda-approves-therapy-rare-blood-disorder-pediatric-patients-12-years-and-older ] \r\n  * FDA approves first oral treatment for anemia in thalassemia, an inherited blood disorder [ https://www.fda.gov/drugs/news-events-human-drugs/fda-approves-first-oral-treatment-anemia-thalassemia-inherited-blood-disorder ] \r\n  * FDA approves first drug to treat serious complication of stem cell transplant [ https://www.fda.gov/drugs/news-events-human-drugs/fda-approves-first-drug-treat-serious-complication-stem-cell-transplant ] \r\n\r\nThis report displays final approvals and tentative approvals of original and supplemental applications for the two days beginning on the earliest date listed below. Some approvals may be added to the Drugs@FDA database after this time span. For comprehensive approval reports, please use the monthly "All Approvals [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=reportsSearch.process&nav=&reportSelectMonth=9&reportSelectYear=2020&rptName=1&utm_medium=&utm_source=#navigation ]" report on Drugs@FDA.\r\n\r\nJanuary 8, 2026\r\n\r\nDrug Name and\r\nApplication Number Active Ingredient Dosage Form/ Route Submission Company Submission Classification Submission Status Acetazolamide\r\nANDA #209734 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=209734 ] Acetazolamide Tablet; Oral SUPPL-19 Strides Pharma Labeling Approved Acetazolamide\r\nANDA #212089 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=212089 ] Acetazolamide Tablet; Oral SUPPL-1 Aurobindo Pharma Ltd Labeling Approved Ensacove\r\nNDA #218171 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=218171 ] Ensartinib Hydrochloride Capsule; Oral SUPPL-2 Xcovery Labeling Approved \r\n\r\nJanuary 7, 2026\r\n\r\nDrug Name and\r\nApplication Number Active Ingredient Dosage Form/ Route Submission Company Submission Classification Submission Status Norgestimate and Ethinyl Estradiol\r\nANDA #201896 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=201896 ] Ethinyl Estradiol; Norgestimate Tablet; Oral-28 SUPPL-7 Mylan Labeling Approved Norgestimate and Ethinyl Estradiol\r\nANDA #201896 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=201896 ] Ethinyl Estradiol; Norgestimate Tablet; Oral-28 SUPPL-7 Mylan Labeling Approved Levocetirizine Dihydrochloride\r\nANDA #202046 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=202046 ] Levocetirizine Dihydrochloride Tablet; Oral SUPPL-18 Micro Labs Ltd India Labeling Approved Quetiapine Fumarate\r\nANDA #202152 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=202152 ] Quetiapine Fumarate Tablet; Oral SUPPL-23 Accord Hlthcare Labeling Approved Protriptyline Hydrochloride\r\nANDA #202220 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=202220 ] Protriptyline Hydrochloride Tablet; Oral SUPPL-4 Epic Pharma Llc Labeling Approved Protriptyline Hydrochloride\r\nANDA #202220 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=202220 ] Protriptyline Hydrochloride Tablet; Oral SUPPL-4 Epic Pharma Llc Labeling Approved Metolazone\r\nANDA #213827 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=213827 ] Metolazone Tablet; Oral SUPPL-3 Innogenix Manufacturing (CMC) Approved Metolazone\r\nANDA #213827 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=213827 ] Metolazone Tablet; Oral SUPPL-3 Innogenix Manufacturing (CMC) Approved Enoxaparin Sodium (Preservative Free)\r\nANDA #218775 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=218775 ] Enoxaparin Sodium Injectable; Subcutaneous ORIG-1 Hebei Changshan \xc2\xa0 Approved Yesintek\r\nBLA #761406 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=761406 ] Ustekinumab-Kfce Injectable; Injection SUPPL-1 Biocon Biologics Inc \xc2\xa0 Approved Yesintek\r\nBLA #761406 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=761406 ] Ustekinumab-Kfce Injectable; Injection SUPPL-1 Biocon Biologics Inc \xc2\xa0 Approved \r\n\r\nfeed [ https://www.fda.gov/about-fda/contact-fda/subscribe-podcasts-and-news-feeds?utm_medium=&utm_source= ]twitter [ https://www.twitter.com/US_FDA?utm_medium=&utm_source= ]facebook [ https://www.facebook.com/FDA?utm_medium=&utm_source= ]youtube [ https://www.youtube.com/user/USFoodandDrugAdmin?utm_medium=&utm_source= ]flickr [ https://www.flickr.com/photos/fdaphotos/albums/?utm_medium=&utm_source= ]  \r\n\r\n*Manage Subscriptions* [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 *Unsubscribe All* [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/subscriber/one_click_unsubscribe?verification=5.ee0243ee8741fe358146537aecf40e1e&destination=jasonnorman66994%40gmail.com ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 *Help* [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/ ]\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\nbody .abe-column-block {min-height: 5px;} td {line-height:1;} \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n This email was sent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com using GovDelivery Communications Cloud on behalf of: U.S. Food and Drug Administration \xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0\r\n10903 New Hampshire Ave\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0Silver Spring, MD \xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0 20993-0002\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa01-888-INFO-FDA GovDelivery logo [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/ ] \r\n \r\nbody .abe-column-block { min-height: 5px; } table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:10px; margin-right:10px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;}\r\n'
