[2026-04-27 10:28:55] Raw text/plain payload: b"The role of plants when Earth's climate changed faster than ecosystems could adapt\r\nTHE NEW CLIMATE\r\n\r\nWhat a 56-Million-Year-Old Warming Event Reveals About Climate Stability\r\n\r\nThe role of plants when Earth's climate changed faster than ecosystems could adapt\r\n\r\nSilvia Pineda-Munoz, PhD - Climate Ages (https://medium.com/@silvia-pineda-munoz-phd?source=email-50207bf5a022-1767977533523-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-58d375258204------------------------5dd2a3cc_52df_48d4_afb1_90609eedf7a1--------67abc7b0bfbc)\r\n\xc2\xa0in\xc2\xa0The New Climate. (https://medium.com/the-new-climate?source=email-50207bf5a022-1767977533523-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-58d375258204------------------------5dd2a3cc_52df_48d4_afb1_90609eedf7a1--------67abc7b0bfbc)\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nJanuary 9, 2026\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\n6 min read\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nView on Medium (https://medium.com/the-new-climate/faa1133af96a?source=email-50207bf5a022-1767977533523-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-58d375258204------------------------5dd2a3cc_52df_48d4_afb1_90609eedf7a1--------67abc7b0bfbc)\r\n\r\nPollen from a variety of common plants. The image is magnified some x500, so the bean shaped grain in the bottom left corner is about 50 \xce\xbcm long\xe2\x80\x8a-\xe2\x80\x8aDartmouth College Electron Microscope Facility, Public domain, via Wikimedia Commons\r\n\r\nSomething most people do not know about me is that, as a child, I was not only obsessed with biology. I was equally fascinated by history. I wanted to know what came before, how things changed, and why some moments mattered more than others.\r\n\r\nLooking back, there was a common thread running through those interests. It was time. My favorite books and movies were always about time travel. Not because of the fantasy, but because of the question underneath it. If you could move through time, what patterns would you see?\r\n\r\nThat same question is probably why paleontology felt like\xe2\x80\xa6\r\n\r\nContinue reading (https://medium.com/the-new-climate/faa1133af96a?source=email-50207bf5a022-1767977533523-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-58d375258204------------------------5dd2a3cc_52df_48d4_afb1_90609eedf7a1--------67abc7b0bfbc)\r\nThis is a member-only story and can only be read on Medium.\r\n\r\nSent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com by Silvia Pineda-Munoz, PhD - Climate Ages on Medium\r\nUnsubscribe (https://medium.com/me/email-settings/50207bf5a022/f87cc31ca051?type=noSetting&newsletterV3Id=67abc7b0bfbc&collectionId=58d375258204&source=email-50207bf5a022-1767977533523-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-58d375258204------------------------5dd2a3cc_52df_48d4_afb1_90609eedf7a1--------67abc7b0bfbc)\r\n from this writer's email notifications\r\nManage your email settings (https://medium.com/me/settings/notifications?hash=f87cc31ca051&userId=50207bf5a022&settingsRouteHash=%23manageSubscriptions&source=email-50207bf5a022-1767977533523-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-58d375258204------------------------5dd2a3cc_52df_48d4_afb1_90609eedf7a1--------67abc7b0bfbc)\r\n\r\n3500 South DuPont Highway, Suite IQ-101, Dover,\xc2\xa0DE\xc2\xa019901\r\nCareers (https://medium.com/jobs-at-medium/work-at-medium-959d1a85284e?source=email-50207bf5a022-1767977533523-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-58d375258204------------------------5dd2a3cc_52df_48d4_afb1_90609eedf7a1--------67abc7b0bfbc)\r\n\xc2\xb7Help Center (https://help.medium.com/hc/en-us?source=email-50207bf5a022-1767977533523-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-58d375258204------------------------5dd2a3cc_52df_48d4_afb1_90609eedf7a1--------67abc7b0bfbc)\r\n\xc2\xb7Privacy Policy (https://policy.medium.com/medium-privacy-policy-f03bf92035c9?source=email-50207bf5a022-1767977533523-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-58d375258204------------------------5dd2a3cc_52df_48d4_afb1_90609eedf7a1--------67abc7b0bfbc)\r\n\xc2\xb7Terms of service (https://policy.medium.com/medium-terms-of-service-9db0094a1e0f?source=email-50207bf5a022-1767977533523-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-58d375258204------------------------5dd2a3cc_52df_48d4_afb1_90609eedf7a1--------67abc7b0bfbc)"
