[2026-04-27 10:29:01] Raw text/plain payload: b'FDA Approves 1st Generic Drug for Equine Cushing\xe2\x80\x99s Disease  \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nIf your email program has trouble displaying this email, view as a webpage [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/bulletins/4038ff9 ].\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nUS Food and Drug Administration\r\n\r\nBookmark and Share [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/bulletins/4038ff9?reqfrom=share ]\r\n\r\n*FDA Approves First Generic Drug for Control of Clinical Signs of Equine Cushing\xe2\x80\x99s Disease*\r\n\r\nCVM Update [ https://www.fda.gov/animal-veterinary/cvm-updates/fda-approves-first-generic-drug-control-clinical-signs-equine-cushings-disease?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n\r\nJanuary 9, 2026\r\n\r\nThe FDA has approved Zygolide (pergolide tablets) for the control of with Pituitary Pars Intermedia Dysfunction (PPID) in horses. PPID is also known as Equine Cushing\xe2\x80\x99s Disease, an endocrine condition affecting the pituitary gland of horses.\r\n\r\nZygolide contains the same active ingredient (pergolide) as the approved brand name drug product, Prascend, which was first approved in 2011.\r\n\r\nZygolide is available only by prescription from a licensed veterinarian. when pergolide tablets are split or crushed. Zygolide tablets should not be crushed due to the potential for increased human exposure. People who have had adverse reactions to ergotamine or other ergot derivatives should not administer Zygolide. Like other ergot derivatives, human exposure to pergolide may cause vomiting, dizziness, lethargy or low blood pressure.\r\n\r\nZygolide is sponsored by Dechra Veterinary Products LLC, based in Overland Park, Kansas.\r\n\r\n*For more information:*\r\n\r\n\r\n  * Freedom of Information Summary \xe2\x80\x93 Zygolide (ANADA 200-823 [ https://animaldrugsatfda.fda.gov/adafda/app/search/public/document/downloadFoi/17829?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]) \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n  \r\n \r\n\r\nfeed [ https://www.fda.gov/about-fda/contact-fda/subscribe-podcasts-and-news-feeds?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]twitter [ https://www.twitter.com/US_FDA?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]facebook [ https://www.facebook.com/FDA?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]Instagram [ https://www.instagram.com/FDA?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]youtube [ https://www.youtube.com/user/USFoodandDrugAdmin?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]flickr [ https://www.flickr.com/photos/fdaphotos/albums/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]  \r\n\r\n*Manage Subscriptions* [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 *Unsubscribe All* [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/subscriber/one_click_unsubscribe?verification=5.ee0243ee8741fe358146537aecf40e1e&destination=jasonnorman66994%40gmail.com ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 *Help* [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/ ]\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\nbody .abe-column-block {min-height: 5px;} td {line-height:1;} \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n This email was sent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com using GovDelivery Communications Cloud on behalf of: U.S. Food and Drug Administration \xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0\r\n10903 New Hampshire Ave\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0Silver Spring, MD \xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0 20993-0002\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa01-888-INFO-FDA GovDelivery logo [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\nbody .abe-column-block { min-height: 5px; } table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:10px; margin-right:10px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;}\r\n'
