[2026-04-27 10:29:04] Raw text/plain payload: b'Campus Drug Prevention logo  [ https://www.campusdrugprevention.gov/ ]  \r\n\r\nPlease confirm your email address to receive future messages from CampusDrugPrevention.gov.\r\nUnconfirmed accounts will be deleted automatically. \r\n\r\nConfirm your email address [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USDOJDEACDP/destinations/17846848468/confirm?verify=4.c684a176e67d41a28a2a80f850a6de20 ] \r\n\r\nThank you for signing up for updates from Campus Drug Prevention. You\xe2\x80\x99ll now get information on DEA resources designed for you and other higher education professionals and community members committed to preventing drug misuse among college students.\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nYou can also visit the Campus Drug Prevention website at any time to see additional materials, including ways to get involved in your community with drug prevention awareness events like Red Ribbon Week and National Prescription Take Back Day.\r\n\r\nCampusDrugPrevention.gov [ https://www.campusdrugprevention.gov/ ]\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nSubscriber Help [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/ ]\r\n'
