[2026-04-27 10:29:05] Raw text/plain payload: b'table {border-collapse: collapse;} &lt;!-- /* Make columns expand to 100% on small screens */ @media only screen and (max-width: 480px) { .abe-column-block { min-width: 100%; } } /* Disables Apple clients adding blue color and underline to links and other text */ a[x-apple-data-detectors] { color: inherit !important; text-decoration: none !important; font-size: inherit !important; font-family: inherit !important; font-weight: inherit !important; line-height: inherit !important; } --&gt; \r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0 \r\n\r\nFTC Logo [ https://www.ftc.gov?utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nFTC Issues Annual Report on Ethanol Market Concentration 2025 [ https://www.ftc.gov/news-events/news/press-releases/2026/01/ftc-issues-annual-report-ethanol-market-concentration-2025?utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n\r\nThe Federal Trade Commission has issued its 2025 Report on Ethanol Market Concentration [ https://www.ftc.gov/reports/2025-report-ethanol-market-concentration?utm_source=govdelivery ]. The Clean Air Act, as amended by the Energy Policy Act of 2005, directs the Commission to perform an annual review of market concentration in the ethanol production industry \xe2\x80\x9cto determine whether there is sufficient competition among industry participants to avoid price-setting and other anticompetitive behavior.\xe2\x80\x9d\r\n\r\nView Press Release [ https://www.ftc.gov/news-events/news/press-releases/2026/01/ftc-issues-annual-report-ethanol-market-concentration-2025?utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n*More news from the FTC* [ https://www.ftc.gov/news-events/news/press-releases?utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n ________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\xc2\xa0 \r\nFacebook [ https://www.facebook.com/federaltradecommission?utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\nTwitter [ https://twitter.com/FTC?utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\nLinkedIn [ https://www.linkedin.com/company/163780?utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \xc2\xa0 \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \xc2\xa0 \r\n \r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\nTo\xc2\xa0update or delete your subscription at any time, visit your\xc2\xa0subscriber preferences page [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFTC/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ]. If you have questions or problems with the subscription service, please contact subscriber support [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/s/?utm_source=govdelivery ].\xc2\xa0This is a free service provided by the\xc2\xa0Federal Trade Commission [ https://www.ftc.gov/?utm_source=govdelivery ].\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\nThis email was sent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com using GovDelivery Communications Cloud on behalf of: Federal Trade Commission \xc2\xb7 600 Pennsylvania Ave., NW \xc2\xb7 Washington, DC 20580 \xc2\xb7 1-877-382-4357 \xc2\xa0 \r\nbody .abe-column-block { min-height: 5px; } table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:10px; margin-right:10px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;} table.govd_hr {min-width: 100%;}\r\n'
