[2026-04-27 10:29:14] Raw text/plain payload: b'Recall - Due to the Presence of Undeclared Meloxicam  \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nIf your email program has trouble displaying this email, view as a webpage [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/bulletins/403a59b ].\r\n\r\nMedWatch Header Pharmacy  \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\n*"MedWatch - The FDA Safety Information and Adverse Event Reporting Program"*\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nBookmark and Share [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/bulletins/403a59b?reqfrom=share ]\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\n*TOPIC: Silintan Capsules by Anthony Trinh, 123Herbals (123HERBALS.COM): Recall - Due to the Presence of Undeclared Meloxicam*\r\n\r\n*AUDIENCE:* Consumer, Health Care Professional, Pharmacy, Rheumatology, Cardiology, Gastroenterology\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*ISSUE: *ANTHONY TRINH, 123herbals is recalling all lots of *Silintan\xc2\xa0*capsules because FDA analysis has found the product to be tainted with meloxicam. Meloxicam, is an approved Nonsteroidal Anti-Inflammatory Drug, (NSAID) indicated for management of osteoarthritis pain. Products containing meloxicam cannot be marketed as dietary supplements. The presence of Meloxicam in *Silintan\xc2\xa0*capsules, renders it an unapproved new drug for which the safety and efficacy have not been established and, therefore, subject to recall.\r\n\r\n*Risk Statement:*\xc2\xa0Exposure to meloxicam at doses exceeding the recommended maximum daily dose of 15mg/day, may result in a reasonable probability of serious life-threatening events such as blood clots, heart attack, and stroke. Patients also face risks of hypersensitivity reactions, gastrointestinal bleeding, ulceration, and perforation, as well as acute kidney injury, particularly in elderly. Dangerous drug-drug interactions may occur in patients on blood thinners or other NSAIDs, significantly increasing bleeding risk.\r\n\r\nTo date, Anthony Trinh, 123Herbals has not received any reports of adverse events related to this recall.\r\n\r\nSilintan capsules were distributed nationwide online at 123herbals.com\r\n\r\nFor more information about this recall, click on the red button *"Read Recall"*\xc2\xa0below.\r\n\r\n*BACKGROUND: *The tainted Silintan is marketed as a dietary supplement for relief of joint and body aches.\r\n\r\n*RECOMMENDATIONS:*\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n\r\n  * \r\n\r\nConsumers should contact their physician or healthcare provider if they have experienced any problems that may be related to taking or using this drug product.\r\n\r\n\r\n  * \r\n\r\nConsumers and retailers that have\xc2\xa0*Silintan\xc2\xa0*capsules, which is being recalled, should stop using this product and/or return to the place of purchase, discard, or contact their doctor.\r\n\r\n\r\n  * \r\n\r\nConsumers with questions regarding this recall can contact Anthony Trinh, 123Herbals LLC by email at\xc2\xa0hello@123herbals.com or via phone at 1-626-656-3202.\r\n\r\n\r\n  * \r\n\r\nConsumers can return their product to the point of purchase for a refund. Customers that bought from the website 123Herbals.com can return to 300 West Valley Blvd. P.O. Box 1925, Alhambra CA 91803.\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nHealth care professionals, consumers and patients are encouraged to report adverse events or side effects related to the use of these products to the FDA\'s MedWatch Safety Information and Adverse Event Reporting Program:\r\n\r\n\r\n  * Complete and submit the report online [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/medwatch/index.cfm?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]. \r\n  * Download form [ https://www.fda.gov/safety/medical-product-safety-information/medwatch-forms-fda-safety-reporting?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] or call 1-800-332-1088 to request a reporting form, then complete and return to the address on form, or submit by fax to 1-800-FDA-0178. \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nRead Recall Button [ https://www.fda.gov/safety/recalls-market-withdrawals-safety-alerts/anthony-trinh-123herbals-llc-123herbalscom-issues-nationwide-recall-silintan-capsules-due-presence?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n*Follow us on X at @FDAMedWatch [ https://twitter.com/FDAMedWatch?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]*\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n  \r\n \r\n\r\nfeed [ https://www.fda.gov/about-fda/contact-fda/subscribe-podcasts-and-news-feeds?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]twitter [ https://www.twitter.com/US_FDA?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]facebook [ https://www.facebook.com/FDA?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]Instagram [ https://www.instagram.com/FDA?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]youtube [ https://www.youtube.com/user/USFoodandDrugAdmin?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]flickr [ https://www.flickr.com/photos/fdaphotos/albums/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]  \r\n\r\n*Manage Subscriptions* [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 *Unsubscribe All* [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/subscriber/one_click_unsubscribe?verification=5.ee0243ee8741fe358146537aecf40e1e&destination=jasonnorman66994%40gmail.com ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 *Help* [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/ ]\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\nbody .abe-column-block {min-height: 5px;} td {line-height:1;} \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n This email was sent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com using GovDelivery Communications Cloud on behalf of: U.S. Food and Drug Administration \xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0\r\n10903 New Hampshire Ave\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0Silver Spring, MD \xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0 20993-0002\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa01-888-INFO-FDA GovDelivery logo [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\nbody .abe-column-block { min-height: 5px; } table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:10px; margin-right:10px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;}\r\n'
