[2026-04-27 10:29:45] Raw text/plain payload: b'2026\xe2\x80\x8a-\xe2\x80\x8aWhat did he do today? Oh, god, not this again!\r\nUkraine Update January 10\r\n\r\n2026\xe2\x80\x8a-\xe2\x80\x8aWhat did he do today? Oh, god, not this again!\r\n\r\nDylan Combellick (https://medium.com/@dylan_combellick?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768027573858-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------ec49e36c_edbc_43f7_ae6c_53c50e490c4c--------354e45830cd6)\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nJanuary 10, 2026\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\n13 min read\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nView on Medium (https://medium.com/p/8b140866be60?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768027573858-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------ec49e36c_edbc_43f7_ae6c_53c50e490c4c--------354e45830cd6)\r\n\r\nSo Goes the War\r\n\r\nWe have reached a new level of depravity with the Russian military. "Volunteer" troops from Africa are having mines strapped to their chests as "kamikaze infantry," which is a tactical innovation I did not see coming.\r\n\r\nThe Russian holding the gun narrates, "Look at the trash they are fucking sending us now," asks him his callsign, to which he replies, "Francis." The Russian replies that it\'s a stupid name and then tells him to go out and run across the field.\r\n\r\nI will remind readers that the Russian who made this video posted it himself because he is proud of\xe2\x80\xa6\r\n\r\nContinue reading (https://medium.com/p/8b140866be60?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768027573858-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------ec49e36c_edbc_43f7_ae6c_53c50e490c4c--------354e45830cd6)\r\nThis is a member-only story and can only be read on Medium.\r\n\r\nSent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com by Dylan Combellick on Medium\r\nUnsubscribe (https://medium.com/me/email-settings/50207bf5a022/1744dcd8493d?type=noSetting&newsletterV3Id=354e45830cd6&source=email-50207bf5a022-1768027573858-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------ec49e36c_edbc_43f7_ae6c_53c50e490c4c--------354e45830cd6)\r\n from this writer\'s email notifications\r\nManage your email settings (https://medium.com/me/settings/notifications?hash=1744dcd8493d&userId=50207bf5a022&settingsRouteHash=%23manageSubscriptions&source=email-50207bf5a022-1768027573858-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------ec49e36c_edbc_43f7_ae6c_53c50e490c4c--------354e45830cd6)\r\n\r\n3500 South DuPont Highway, Suite IQ-101, Dover,\xc2\xa0DE\xc2\xa019901\r\nCareers (https://medium.com/jobs-at-medium/work-at-medium-959d1a85284e?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768027573858-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------ec49e36c_edbc_43f7_ae6c_53c50e490c4c--------354e45830cd6)\r\n\xc2\xb7Help Center (https://help.medium.com/hc/en-us?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768027573858-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------ec49e36c_edbc_43f7_ae6c_53c50e490c4c--------354e45830cd6)\r\n\xc2\xb7Privacy Policy (https://policy.medium.com/medium-privacy-policy-f03bf92035c9?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768027573858-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------ec49e36c_edbc_43f7_ae6c_53c50e490c4c--------354e45830cd6)\r\n\xc2\xb7Terms of service (https://policy.medium.com/medium-terms-of-service-9db0094a1e0f?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768027573858-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------ec49e36c_edbc_43f7_ae6c_53c50e490c4c--------354e45830cd6)'
