[2026-04-27 10:29:57] Raw text/plain payload: b'HeyJason, it\xe2\x80\x99s Gordana \xf0\x9f\x91\x8b\xf0\x9f\x8f\xbc \r\n Let me guess \xf0\x9f\x91\x80 You\xe2\x80\x99ve asked ChatGPT a question, weren\xe2\x80\x99t totally sure the answer was accurate, so you checked Gemini\xe2\x80\xa6 then Claude\xe2\x80\xa6 just to feel confident? \xf0\x9f\xa4\x94 \r\n If you do this every time you research, you\xe2\x80\x99re probably losing 3-6 hours EVERY week. \r\n That\xe2\x80\x99s why we built Collabwriting Chat + AI Canvas \xf0\x9f\x8e\x8a \r\n \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n \r\n - We merged everything into one subscription, so now you get all PRO AI models in one chat - ChatGPT, Grok, Gemini, Claude, and DeepSeek. \r\n - Your work stays in full context with verified sources, outputs are editable, and collaboration is easy with team features and integrations built-in. \r\n \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n \r\n [Image "gif+-+onboarding+-+chat.gif?expires=1782967788&amp;signature=c06047ab98e5074544db9e234442cadb9f8e4053af88c11e1ac026241c47a044&amp;req=dSggE8t%2Fn4lfXfMW2XS%2FiZnycMo%2FXcDgCn4S0s43lJ8JtivmaUU%3D%0A"] \r\n \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n \r\n Just ask a question, and Chat pulls answers from everything you\xe2\x80\x99ve already saved in Collabwriting, plus the web, giving the most accurate, relevant results. \r\n You can even choose the AI agent best for your task. \xf0\x9f\x98\x89 \r\n \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n \r\n [Image "image+3662.png?expires=1782967788&amp;signature=67f8dd2f2397b4072b7f811777c0c88c0a55f9c6838f42ac560b47e4ac006168&amp;req=dSggE8t%2Fm4ZfXfMW2XS%2FiexjJth%2Fg3NDQvjGLRZCiiVeqDdNqXU%3D%0A"] \r\n \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n \r\n With everything in one place, you can build your unique context and create outputs only you can deliver. \xf0\x9f\x8d\x80 \r\n Curious how Chat actually works? \r\n Take a Look Here \xf0\x9f\x91\x88\xf0\x9f\x8f\xbc \r\n \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n \r\n And hey, just reply to this email if you have any questions - happy to help anytime! \xf0\x9f\x98\x8a \r\n \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n \r\n Best, Gordana'
