[2026-04-27 10:30:30] Raw text/plain payload: b"Walking vs. Jumping Jacks vs. Yoga\xe2\x80\x8a-\xe2\x80\x8athe results shocked me\r\nI Tested 3 Workouts for 90 Days After Wasting 2 Years\xe2\x80\x8a-\xe2\x80\x8aHere's What Happened to My Body\r\n\r\nWalking vs. Jumping Jacks vs. Yoga\xe2\x80\x8a-\xe2\x80\x8athe results shocked me\r\n\r\nShikha | Author (https://medium.com/@SvaCopy?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768128869807-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-84ac01765c52------------------------3c8143c7_d965_4fae_9dfe_4ac6825b207f--------bd173739d135)\r\n\xc2\xa0in\xc2\xa0Write A Catalyst (https://medium.com/write-a-catalyst?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768128869807-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-84ac01765c52------------------------3c8143c7_d965_4fae_9dfe_4ac6825b207f--------bd173739d135)\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nJanuary 11, 2026\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\n6 min read\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nView on Medium (https://medium.com/write-a-catalyst/cf4a55c17eb4?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768128869807-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-84ac01765c52------------------------3c8143c7_d965_4fae_9dfe_4ac6825b207f--------bd173739d135)\r\n\r\nPhoto by Zac Ong (http://redirect.medium.systems/r-Lg2IjnevTN?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768128869807-newsletter.subscribeToProfile--cf4a55c17eb4-----------------------3c8143c7_d965_4fae_9dfe_4ac6825b207f--------bd173739d135)\r\n on Unsplash (http://redirect.medium.systems/r-Gu6Z_HViFN?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768128869807-newsletter.subscribeToProfile--cf4a55c17eb4-----------------------3c8143c7_d965_4fae_9dfe_4ac6825b207f--------bd173739d135)\r\n\r\nI wasted two years bouncing between workout trends. Pilates one month, CrossFit the next, then some Instagram influencer's 6-week shred program. Nothing stuck.\r\n\r\nMy body looked exactly the same, and I was more confused than ever.\r\n\r\nSo I decided to run an experiment on myself.\r\n\r\nFor three months, I rotated between three simple workouts:\r\n\r\na one-hour walk\r\n\r\n20 minutes of jumping jacks (including breaks)\r\n\r\nand 30 minutes of yoga.\r\n\r\nSame time commitment each week. Same dedication. No fancy equipment or expensive memberships.\r\n\r\nWhat I discovered completely changed how I think about exercise.\r\n\r\nThe Setup: Three Workouts, One Body\r\n\r\nMost fitness debates are pointless because everyone's arguing\xe2\x80\xa6\r\n\r\nContinue reading (https://medium.com/write-a-catalyst/cf4a55c17eb4?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768128869807-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-84ac01765c52------------------------3c8143c7_d965_4fae_9dfe_4ac6825b207f--------bd173739d135)\r\nThis is a member-only story and can only be read on Medium.\r\n\r\nSent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com by Shikha | Author on Medium\r\nUnsubscribe (https://medium.com/me/email-settings/50207bf5a022/deb601535bee?type=noSetting&newsletterV3Id=bd173739d135&collectionId=84ac01765c52&source=email-50207bf5a022-1768128869807-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-84ac01765c52------------------------3c8143c7_d965_4fae_9dfe_4ac6825b207f--------bd173739d135)\r\n from this writer's email notifications\r\nManage your email settings (https://medium.com/me/settings/notifications?hash=deb601535bee&userId=50207bf5a022&settingsRouteHash=%23manageSubscriptions&source=email-50207bf5a022-1768128869807-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-84ac01765c52------------------------3c8143c7_d965_4fae_9dfe_4ac6825b207f--------bd173739d135)\r\n\r\n3500 South DuPont Highway, Suite IQ-101, Dover,\xc2\xa0DE\xc2\xa019901\r\nCareers (https://medium.com/jobs-at-medium/work-at-medium-959d1a85284e?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768128869807-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-84ac01765c52------------------------3c8143c7_d965_4fae_9dfe_4ac6825b207f--------bd173739d135)\r\n\xc2\xb7Help Center (https://help.medium.com/hc/en-us?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768128869807-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-84ac01765c52------------------------3c8143c7_d965_4fae_9dfe_4ac6825b207f--------bd173739d135)\r\n\xc2\xb7Privacy Policy (https://policy.medium.com/medium-privacy-policy-f03bf92035c9?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768128869807-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-84ac01765c52------------------------3c8143c7_d965_4fae_9dfe_4ac6825b207f--------bd173739d135)\r\n\xc2\xb7Terms of service (https://policy.medium.com/medium-terms-of-service-9db0094a1e0f?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768128869807-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-84ac01765c52------------------------3c8143c7_d965_4fae_9dfe_4ac6825b207f--------bd173739d135)"
