[2026-04-27 10:30:33] Raw text/plain payload: b"LanguageTool Logo ( https://languagetool.org/?utm_campaign=email-funnel&utm_medium=email&utm_source=newsletter )\r\n\r\nLesson 2 *Advanced Features*\r\n\r\n*********************************************\r\nHey Jason,\r\n*********************************************\r\n\r\nWe hope you enjoyed your first week with LanguageTool. The more you write, the more important it is to stay focussed and keep track of all your writing. Here are some useful tricks to stay on top of your game.\r\n\r\nHappy writing,\r\n*The LanguageTool team*\r\n\r\n------------------------------------\r\nReach Your Potential With Statistics\r\n------------------------------------\r\n\r\nThis feature helps you stay consistent with your writing by tracking your productivity. It also provides an overview of languages used, errors made, and suggestions applied, so you can see for yourself how your writing skills have improved.\r\n\r\nTry now ( https://languagetool.org/editor/new?utm_campaign=email-funnel&utm_medium=email&utm_source=newsletter )\r\n\r\n---------------\r\nTemporary Texts\r\n---------------\r\n\r\nSome texts are just not meant to be stored forever. By default, all texts you write in the LanguageTool editor are temporary and disappear after two weeks. Don't worry, though. You can still access and recover them in the settings. If you know you want to keep a text for sure, just mark it as permanent.\r\n\r\nTry now ( https://languagetool.org/editor/new?utm_campaign=email-funnel&utm_medium=email&utm_source=newsletter )\r\n\r\n------------------------\r\nDistraction-Free Writing\r\n------------------------\r\n\r\nBlank out the world and let your creativity flow with distraction-free writing in the LanguageTool Editor. Suggestions are hidden until you decide to open the left and right sidebars again to access your other texts or take a closer look at LanguageTool's suggestions.\r\n\r\nTry now ( https://languagetool.org/editor/new?utm_campaign=email-funnel&utm_medium=email&utm_source=newsletter )\r\n\r\n-------------------\r\nBenefits of Premium\r\n-------------------\r\n\r\nGet the full experience of spell checking, grammar corrections, and style suggestions! Premium users enjoy access to a broader range of optimizations, even for longer texts.\r\n\r\n*Perfect Your Word Choice with Unlimited Paraphrases*\r\nDon\xe2\x80\x99t be bound to only three rounds of rephrased sentences. Instead, use AI to rewrite your sentences as many times as you\xe2\x80\x99d like to make them more formal, fluent, or concise.\r\n\r\n*More Personalized Inspiration for Word Choice and Tone*\r\nPick from one of five distinct writing goals and get custom corrections that perfectly suit your text type and target audience. Plus, turn on Picky Mode to achieve linguistic perfection.\r\n\r\n*Foster Collaboration with Various Team Features*\r\nIf you\xe2\x80\x99re looking for the ultimate solution for your team, LanguageTool can help you define the company\xe2\x80\x99s voice while making it easy to manage your account efficiently.\r\n\r\nUpgrade your writing now ( https://languagetool.org/premium?utm_campaign=email-funnel&utm_medium=email&utm_source=newsletter )\r\n\r\n-------------------------------------------\r\n*Use LanguageTool in Your Favorite Browser*\r\n-------------------------------------------\r\n\r\nMac AppStore Icon ( https://apps.apple.com/app/id1534275760?utm_campaign=email-funnel&utm_medium=email&utm_source=newsletter ) iOS AppStore Icon ( https://apps.apple.com/app/id1534275760 ) Windows AppStore Icon ( https://languagetool.org/windows?utm_campaign=email-funnel&utm_medium=email&utm_source=newsletter )\r\n\r\nGoogle Chrome Icon ( https://chrome.google.com/webstore/detail/grammar-and-spell-checker/oldceeleldhonbafppcapldpdifcinji ) Safari Icon ( https://apps.apple.com/app/id1534275760 ) Microsoft Edge Icon ( https://microsoftedge.microsoft.com/addons/detail/hfjadhjooeceemgojogkhlppanjkbobc ) Mozilla Firefox Icon ( https://addons.mozilla.org/firefox/addon/languagetool/ )\r\n\r\n*LanguageTool*\r\n\r\nCopyright \xc2\xa9 2022 LanguageTooler GmbH\r\n\r\nKarl-Liebknecht-Str. 21/22, 14482 Potsdam (Germany)\r\n\r\nFacebook Icon ( https://www.facebook.com/LanguageTool ) Twitter Icon ( https://twitter.com/languagetool ) TikTok Icon ( https://www.tiktok.com/@languagetool ) Instagram Icon ( https://www.instagram.com/languagetool/ ) LinkedIn Icon ( https://www.linkedin.com/company/languagetool ) YouTube Icon ( https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCJT2O6nVhaIi0iru2eyQomw )\r\n\r\nPrivacy ( https://languagetool.org/legal/privacy ) Terms & Conditions ( https://languagetool.org/legal/terms ) Imprint ( https://languagetool.org/legal/ )\r\n\r\nYou are being contacted because you recently\r\nregistered for a free LanguageTool account.\r\n\r\nUnsubscribe ( https://u19934751.ct.sendgrid.net/asm/unsubscribe/?user_id=19934751&data=AU2GdzvaCjeASnXbaqAoiTHize-0asVDHHLXjfzIdaRoMDAwdTAwMHBsQuYZRpmISqs6q9ib34_Z-auyA5pCOSC1_XKHXUMHA8Duo2Qq7qxgvKmnf5ra-y58tOpInv510uWKBW7OEcLidrOZNeZgzGpCTmUbdI0ko7Pw_QLjLIhPZwOUM7XE42T9abLBOLz-5Bj8GH6HWDmJqD2q9HGtnudy3j938BNSPT4GvjHcxZtaUm1HvWjcEJ-nsgZJzriXxDY1Ufkhtv8DYyuLwoniUufzEZh2b0vY0fRPtnQ-wvAhnB1rHh_5pTy3IPugByMGEzPyxmceFp3ZoGhzljPL_oOFjIPdePCPeHXiV5SeR9Fm2DYNFHk0W3XkmBeX7d0cZZoZTdK6aOqFu9achmjBz6DETE7ivKtcUx0qWSBaql2cdT2gvLa_q7QcmTQbF5JpCFT5Rj5TZgzIhMfP_D1ydEnN1f5lR_DuJqh9iAEG8RRx0FaiqchR3brFtnI02FapTeeKfywZk0wUyQXuibOmd2eJtpgyDciBrD7ul2eOnzjDBy-kBzdcHynbTXRhmuu_sY6Xr1O6x7moVJXgXWvj4H08lnawsQkUfivHB_skjoMtAnqvQRDk3UKKrRAMuuXLzMqbPtd3FxD2u852nMyMFfu9xG0VqfOmmSslNOw91QhBS5V2oq6glf80IxiWAbBYNEYOeauucWXrZ8T2kmqHZi_se24bMqM00VUs6Xq0pGWfxLeTGigYgmWXN2j_hBILjkQkT3jrQeY_YqjGc_fvxpE1Bj1yIQIvRDEA-gX6R7E9S1o0vLArbstW0JfcfpJrG5Cr3fQqYq-ctJdDq6_s6axzB6zivIjEMW30Zjgf0OuDVTDf1JfhjgKyRhcDJCE1zTnHsgwSly9v9oKJIw54Y9ggkfykC-t4SicEuNsKYb5CQH8IWJq8EQHYq2U03FkvG9Aat5ooeXWI0k54BhqZF4qHF36zsA8DOo1BV-n5AdufyGgxtVovuv3jv0ffkorW7NguchS99fpEHKWMBqHiJlKiQuMkADKSZIaqIRKjemXfMeCO5Tvfb2v1Zy_tVDKYKk3_uJDUPnHXN9tlmcso