[2026-04-27 10:30:58] Raw text/plain payload: b'2026\xe2\x80\x8a-\xe2\x80\x8aIcy Words.\r\nUkraine Update January 12\r\n\r\n2026\xe2\x80\x8a-\xe2\x80\x8aIcy Words.\r\n\r\nDylan Combellick (https://medium.com/@dylan_combellick?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768213657773-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------07abae76_ef85_4be2_9ccd_ce94dca4e81a--------354e45830cd6)\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nJanuary 12, 2026\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\n14 min read\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nView on Medium (https://medium.com/p/7e4345cfddca?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768213657773-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------07abae76_ef85_4be2_9ccd_ce94dca4e81a--------354e45830cd6)\r\n\r\nIf you aren\'t allowed to be disruptive, then you aren\'t allowed to protest. The justification I\'m hearing from the pro-ICE crowd is that all the people ICE shot "should have complied" or "should have followed orders." There are so many things wrong with that idea.\r\n\r\nThe very core of the right to protest contains the right to be disruptive. If the public can\'t disrupt business or government activities, then it isn\'t a protest; it\'s just a bunch of people watching as democracy falls apart. That doesn\'t mean that protests require violence, but they do require inconvenience. Unions have to be\xe2\x80\xa6\r\n\r\nContinue reading (https://medium.com/p/7e4345cfddca?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768213657773-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------07abae76_ef85_4be2_9ccd_ce94dca4e81a--------354e45830cd6)\r\nThis is a member-only story and can only be read on Medium.\r\n\r\nSent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com by Dylan Combellick on Medium\r\nUnsubscribe (https://medium.com/me/email-settings/50207bf5a022/a6bf53603666?type=noSetting&newsletterV3Id=354e45830cd6&source=email-50207bf5a022-1768213657773-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------07abae76_ef85_4be2_9ccd_ce94dca4e81a--------354e45830cd6)\r\n from this writer\'s email notifications\r\nManage your email settings (https://medium.com/me/settings/notifications?hash=a6bf53603666&userId=50207bf5a022&settingsRouteHash=%23manageSubscriptions&source=email-50207bf5a022-1768213657773-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------07abae76_ef85_4be2_9ccd_ce94dca4e81a--------354e45830cd6)\r\n\r\n3500 South DuPont Highway, Suite IQ-101, Dover,\xc2\xa0DE\xc2\xa019901\r\nCareers (https://medium.com/jobs-at-medium/work-at-medium-959d1a85284e?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768213657773-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------07abae76_ef85_4be2_9ccd_ce94dca4e81a--------354e45830cd6)\r\n\xc2\xb7Help Center (https://help.medium.com/hc/en-us?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768213657773-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------07abae76_ef85_4be2_9ccd_ce94dca4e81a--------354e45830cd6)\r\n\xc2\xb7Privacy Policy (https://policy.medium.com/medium-privacy-policy-f03bf92035c9?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768213657773-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------07abae76_ef85_4be2_9ccd_ce94dca4e81a--------354e45830cd6)\r\n\xc2\xb7Terms of service (https://policy.medium.com/medium-terms-of-service-9db0094a1e0f?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768213657773-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------07abae76_ef85_4be2_9ccd_ce94dca4e81a--------354e45830cd6)'
