[2026-04-27 10:31:01] Raw text/plain payload: b"One of the most counterintuitive parts of entrepreneurship is that, somehow, more experience makes it harder.\r\nWhy Does Having More Experience Building Startups Make Failing Easier?\r\n\r\nOne of the most counterintuitive parts of entrepreneurship is that, somehow, more experience makes it harder.\r\n\r\nAaron Dinin, PhD (https://medium.com/@aarondinin?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768215877608-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-7adf33e44ae3------------------------a48b277e_2695_4013_8d1b_a646d4b656f9--------7ae6917575f4)\r\n\xc2\xa0in\xc2\xa0Entrepreneurship Handbook (https://medium.com/entrepreneur-s-handbook?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768215877608-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-7adf33e44ae3------------------------a48b277e_2695_4013_8d1b_a646d4b656f9--------7ae6917575f4)\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nJanuary 12, 2026\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\n4 min read\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nView on Medium (https://medium.com/entrepreneur-s-handbook/69423dbc9720?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768215877608-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-7adf33e44ae3------------------------a48b277e_2695_4013_8d1b_a646d4b656f9--------7ae6917575f4)\r\n\r\nImage courtesy Pexels.com (http://redirect.medium.systems/r-e4idb6pcfu?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768215877608-newsletter.subscribeToProfile--69423dbc9720-----------------------a48b277e_2695_4013_8d1b_a646d4b656f9--------7ae6917575f4)\r\n\r\nOne of the strangest truths about entrepreneurship is that things don't get easier as you gain experience. They actually get harder. Even though you're more skilled, you're also more aware, and awareness creates its own set of problems.\r\n\r\nInexperienced founders\xe2\x80\x8a-\xe2\x80\x8athe kind of people who don't have much experience in the startup world\xe2\x80\x8a-\xe2\x80\x8amove fast because they don't fully understand what can go wrong. They try things, they ship imperfect products, and they ask naive questions because ignorance gives them momentum.\r\n\r\nIn contrast, experienced founders hesitate. They've seen enough failure to anticipate problems before they happen. They also\xe2\x80\xa6\r\n\r\nContinue reading (https://medium.com/entrepreneur-s-handbook/69423dbc9720?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768215877608-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-7adf33e44ae3------------------------a48b277e_2695_4013_8d1b_a646d4b656f9--------7ae6917575f4)\r\nThis is a member-only story and can only be read on Medium.\r\n\r\nSent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com by Aaron Dinin, PhD on Medium\r\nUnsubscribe (https://medium.com/me/email-settings/50207bf5a022/8fd702fcf77b?type=noSetting&newsletterV3Id=7ae6917575f4&collectionId=7adf33e44ae3&source=email-50207bf5a022-1768215877608-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-7adf33e44ae3------------------------a48b277e_2695_4013_8d1b_a646d4b656f9--------7ae6917575f4)\r\n from this writer's email notifications\r\nManage your email settings (https://medium.com/me/settings/notifications?hash=8fd702fcf77b&userId=50207bf5a022&settingsRouteHash=%23manageSubscriptions&source=email-50207bf5a022-1768215877608-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-7adf33e44ae3------------------------a48b277e_2695_4013_8d1b_a646d4b656f9--------7ae6917575f4)\r\n\r\n3500 South DuPont Highway, Suite IQ-101, Dover,\xc2\xa0DE\xc2\xa019901\r\nCareers (https://medium.com/jobs-at-medium/work-at-medium-959d1a85284e?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768215877608-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-7adf33e44ae3------------------------a48b277e_2695_4013_8d1b_a646d4b656f9--------7ae6917575f4)\r\n\xc2\xb7Help Center (https://help.medium.com/hc/en-us?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768215877608-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-7adf33e44ae3------------------------a48b277e_2695_4013_8d1b_a646d4b656f9--------7ae6917575f4)\r\n\xc2\xb7Privacy Policy (https://policy.medium.com/medium-privacy-policy-f03bf92035c9?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768215877608-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-7adf33e44ae3------------------------a48b277e_2695_4013_