[2026-04-27 10:31:10] Raw text/plain payload: b'The approvals listed below may not be comprehensive. For the most current information, view the full listing of all approvals at Drugs@FDA [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=reportsSearch.process&rptName=1&reportSelectMonth=11&reportSelectYear=2025&nav ].\r\n\r\n*What\'s New Related to Drugs*\r\n\r\n*Updated Monday through Friday*\r\n\r\n\r\n  * Current and Resolved Drug Shortages and Discontinuations Reported to FDA [ https://dps.fda.gov/drugshortages#tab4 ] \r\n  * Drug Firm Annual Registration Status [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/drls/default.cfm?utm_medium=&utm_source= ] \r\n  * Drug Firm Annual Registration Status Download File [ https://www.fda.gov/drugs/drug-approvals-and-databases/drug-establishments-current-registration-site?utm_medium=&utm_source= ] \r\n  * National Drug Code Directory [ https://www.fda.gov/drugs/drug-approvals-and-databases/national-drug-code-directory?utm_medium=&utm_source= ] \r\n  * NDC Unfinished Drugs Excluded Database File [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/cder/NDC_unfinished_excluded.zip?utm_medium=&utm_source= ] \r\n  * NDC Database Excluded Packages and Products [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/cder/ndc_excluded.zip?utm_medium=&utm_source= ] \r\n  * Wholesale Distributor and Third-Party Logistics Providers Reporting [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/wdd3plreporting/ ] \r\n  * Drug Establishments Current Registration Site [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/drls/ ] \r\n  * Drugs@FDA Data Files [ https://www.fda.gov/drugs/drug-approvals-and-databases/drugsfda-data-files ]\xc2\xa0 \r\n\r\n*Updated Biweekly*\r\n\r\n  * Competitive Generic Therapy Approvals [ https://www.fda.gov/drugs/generic-drugs/competitive-generic-therapy-approvals ] \r\n\r\n*January 9, 2026*\r\n\r\n\r\n  * Orange Book \r\n  * Approved Drug Products with Therapeutic Equivalence Evaluations [ https://www.fda.gov/drugs/drug-approvals-and-databases/approved-drug-products-therapeutic-equivalence-evaluations-orange-book ] \r\n  * Orange Book Current Cumulative Supplement [ https://www.fda.gov/media/72973/download?attachment ]\xc2\xa0(updated) \r\n  * Additions/Deletions for Prescription and OTC Drug Product Lists [ https://www.fda.gov/drugs/drug-approvals-and-databases/additionsdeletions-prescription-and-otc-drug-product-lists ]\xc2\xa0(updated) \r\n  * Orange Book Data Files (compressed) [ https://www.fda.gov/media/76860/download?attachment ]\xc2\xa0(updated) \r\n  * Appendix A: Product Name Index [ https://www.fda.gov/media/71494/download ]\xc2\xa0(updated) \r\n  * Appendix B: Product Name Sorted by Applicant [ https://www.fda.gov/media/71502/download ]\xc2\xa0(updated) \r\n  * Appendix C: Uniform Terms [ https://www.fda.gov/media/71523/download ]\xc2\xa0(updated) \r\n\r\n  * Reference Listed Drugs by ANDA Reference Standard List [ https://www.fda.gov/media/103879/download?attachment ]\xc2\xa0(updated) \r\n  * Orange Book Patent Listing Dispute List [ https://www.fda.gov/drugs/drug-approvals-and-databases/orange-book-patent-listing-dispute-list ]\xc2\xa0(updated) \r\n\r\n*January 5, 2026*\r\n\r\n\r\n  * FDA approves therapy for rare blood disorder in pediatric patients 12 years and older [ https://www.fda.gov/drugs/news-events-human-drugs/fda-approves-therapy-rare-blood-disorder-pediatric-patients-12-years-and-older ] \r\n  * FDA approves first oral treatment for anemia in thalassemia, an inherited blood disorder [ https://www.fda.gov/drugs/news-events-human-drugs/fda-approves-first-oral-treatment-anemia-thalassemia-inherited-blood-disorder ] \r\n  * FDA approves first drug to treat serious complication of stem cell transplant [ https://www.fda.gov/drugs/news-events-human-drugs/fda-approves-first-drug-treat-serious-complication-stem-cell-transplant ] \r\n\r\nThis report displays final approvals and tentative approvals of original and supplemental applications for the two days beginning on the earliest date listed below. Some approvals may be added to the Drugs@FDA database after this time span. For comprehensive approval reports, please use the monthly "All Approvals [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=reportsSearch.process&nav=&reportSelectMonth=9&reportSelectYear=2020&rptName=1&utm_medium=&utm_source=#navigation ]" report on Drugs@FDA.\r\n\r\nJanuary 9, 2026\r\n\r\nDrug Name and\r\nApplication Number Active Ingredient Dosage Form/ Route Submission Company Submission Classification Submission Status Narcan\r\nNDA #208411 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=208411 ] Naloxone Hydrochloride Spray, Metered; Nasal SUPPL-10 Emergent Labeling Approved \r\n\r\nJanuary 8, 2026\r\n\r\nDrug Name and\r\nApplication Number Active Ingredient Dosage Form/ Route Submission Company Submission Classification Submission Status Hydrocodone Bitartrate and Acetaminophen\r\nANDA #206245 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=206245 ] Acetaminophen; Hydrocodone Bitartrate Tablet; Oral SUPPL-18 Novel Labs Inc Labeling Approved Acetazolamide\r\nANDA #209734 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=209734 ] Acetazolamide Tablet; Oral SUPPL-19 Strides Pharma Labeling Approved Acetazolamide\r\nANDA #211069 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=211069 ] Acetazolamide Tablet; Oral SUPPL-1 Zydus Lifesciences Labeling Approved Magnesium Sulfate In Plastic Container\r\nANDA #211966 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=211966 ] Magnesium Sulfate Injectable; Injection SUPPL-11 Baxter Hlthcare Corp Manufacturing (CMC) Approved Acetazolamide\r\nANDA #212089 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=212089 ] Acetazolamide Tablet; Oral SUPPL-1 Aurobindo Pharma Ltd Labeling Approved Ensacove\r\nNDA #218171 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=218171 ] Ensartinib Hydrochloride Capsule; Oral SUPPL-2 Xcovery Labeling Approved Dapagliflozin\r\nANDA #219408 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=219408 ] Dapagliflozin Tablet ORIG-1 Sciegen Pharmaceuticals Inc \xc2\xa0 Tentative Approval \r\n\r\nfeed [ https://www.fda.gov/about-fda/contact-fda/subscribe-podcasts-and-news-feeds?utm_medium=&utm_source= ]twitter [ https://www.twitter.com/US_FDA?utm_medium=&utm_source= ]facebook [ https://www.facebook.com/FDA?utm_medium=&utm_source= ]youtube [ https://www.youtube.com/user/USFoodandDrugAdmin?utm_medium=&utm_source= ]flickr [ https://www.flickr.com/photos/fdaphotos/albums/?utm_medium=&utm_source= ]  \r\n\r\n*Manage Subscriptions* [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 *Unsubscribe All* [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/subscriber/one_click_unsubscribe?verification=5.ee0243ee8741fe358146537aecf40e1e&destination=jasonnorman66994%40gmail.com ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 *Help* [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/ ]\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\nbody .abe-column-block {min-height: 5px;} td {line-height:1;} \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n This email was sent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com using GovDelivery Communications Cloud on behalf of: U.S. Food and Drug Administration \xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0\r\n10903 New Hampshire Ave\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0Silver Spring, MD \xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0 20993-0002\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa01-888-INFO-FDA GovDelivery logo [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/ ] \r\n \r\nbody .abe-column-block { min-height: 5px; } table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:10px; margin-right:10px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;