[2026-04-27 10:31:11] Raw text/plain payload: b"Hi, everyone! How are you all?\r\n\r\nI started my writing project, The Silent Notes, back in January 2025 and have been sharing some of its\xe2\x80\xa6\r\nwriting-inspired publication materials now available on Pinterest! \xf0\x9f\x92\x8c\r\n\r\nletters from rosie (https://medium.com/@lynwrites_?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768226067198-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------f6acf24f_6cf1_445e_95c8_ec48c1ce0c3d--------8db497530be4)\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nJanuary 12, 2026\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\n2 min read\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nView on Medium (https://medium.com/p/1d41437ee90a?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768226067198-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------f6acf24f_6cf1_445e_95c8_ec48c1ce0c3d--------8db497530be4)\r\n\r\nImage from Pinterest\r\n\r\nHi, everyone! How are you all?\r\n\r\nI started my writing project, The Silent Notes, back in January 2025 and have been sharing some of its pieces on my website since then. Throughout the year, I also created various publication materials inspired by my writings. Toward the end of 2025, I made digital post stamps based on my works and shared them on Instagram.\r\n\r\nAfter posting those materials, I received a few requests from readers asking where they could view more of my publication pieces. As someone who genuinely enjoys creating creative designs and publication materials, I decided to share my\xe2\x80\xa6\r\n\r\nContinue reading (https://medium.com/p/1d41437ee90a?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768226067198-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------f6acf24f_6cf1_445e_95c8_ec48c1ce0c3d--------8db497530be4)\r\nContinue reading this story on Medium.\r\n\r\nSent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com by letters from rosie on Medium\r\nUnsubscribe (https://medium.com/me/email-settings/50207bf5a022/6bec80598369?type=noSetting&newsletterV3Id=8db497530be4&source=email-50207bf5a022-1768226067198-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------f6acf24f_6cf1_445e_95c8_ec48c1ce0c3d--------8db497530be4)\r\n from this writer's email notifications\r\nManage your email settings (https://medium.com/me/settings/notifications?hash=6bec80598369&userId=50207bf5a022&settingsRouteHash=%23manageSubscriptions&source=email-50207bf5a022-1768226067198-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------f6acf24f_6cf1_445e_95c8_ec48c1ce0c3d--------8db497530be4)\r\n\r\n3500 South DuPont Highway, Suite IQ-101, Dover,\xc2\xa0DE\xc2\xa019901\r\nCareers (https://medium.com/jobs-at-medium/work-at-medium-959d1a85284e?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768226067198-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------f6acf24f_6cf1_445e_95c8_ec48c1ce0c3d--------8db497530be4)\r\n\xc2\xb7Help Center (https://help.medium.com/hc/en-us?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768226067198-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------f6acf24f_6cf1_445e_95c8_ec48c1ce0c3d--------8db497530be4)\r\n\xc2\xb7Privacy Policy (https://policy.medium.com/medium-privacy-policy-f03bf92035c9?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768226067198-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------f6acf24f_6cf1_445e_95c8_ec48c1ce0c3d--------8db497530be4)\r\n\xc2\xb7Terms of service (https://policy.medium.com/medium-terms-of-service-9db0094a1e0f?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768226067198-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------f6acf24f_6cf1_445e_95c8_ec48c1ce0c3d--------8db497530be4)"
