[2026-04-27 10:31:16] Raw text/plain payload: b"Banner: U.S. Commercial Service Aerospace and Defense Global Team logo with photo of flag and map of Brazil. [ https://inevent.com/en/TradeGov/BrazilAeromedicalWebinar2026-9884-1765919186/purchase.php ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nWEBINAR OPPORTUNITY\r\n\r\n*Brazil Aeromedical Market Update*\r\n\r\nJoin us on *January 21 to learn more about Brazil\xe2\x80\x99s US$4 billion aeromedical market *and build the connections that can accelerate your entry and growth. This in-depth briefing will include expert insights from\xc2\xa0*the Brazilian Aeromedical Association* (*ABOA)*, Brazil\xe2\x80\x99s foremost aeromedical organization, and will highlight current market trends, regulatory considerations, and practical strategies for doing business in the country.\r\n\r\nYou\xe2\x80\x99ll gain access to valuable market intelligence, key industry contacts, and guidance to help position your products and services for success in Brazil.\r\n\r\nLooking ahead, CS Brazil will host *the second edition of the Brazil Aeromedical Trade Event on June 22\xe2\x80\x9323, 2026*. Attend the January 21 webinar to get key details, understand participation opportunities, and position your company for this high\xe2\x80\x91value event.\r\n\r\n*Speakers Invited to Discuss Opportunities for U.S. Companies:*\r\n\r\n\r\n  * ABOA \r\n  * S\xc3\xa3o Paulo Fire Department \r\n  * Brazilian Military Police - Aerial Patrol Unit \r\n  * Albert Einstein Israelite Hospital \r\n\r\n*Which U.S. Companies Should Join:*\r\n\r\n\r\n  * Aeromedical / Air ambulance manufacturers and distributors \r\n  * Aircraft conversion service providers \r\n  * Custom interior systems for air ambulances \r\n  * Flexible simulation equipment \r\n  * Flight simulator training \r\n  * Mobile medical equipment suppliers for fixed-wing and rotary-wing aircraft \r\n  * MRO companies \r\n  * Night vision equipment \r\n  * Service providers of doctors, nurses, emergency medical technicians, pilots, and crew training. \r\n  * Software focused on urgent rescue, medical care, data management, and rescue aviation \r\n  * Solutions for organ transport and preservation \r\n  * Specialists in disaster management, search and rescue, and emergency services. \r\n\r\n*Register Now,* Click here... [ https://inevent.com/en/TradeGov/BrazilAeromedicalWebinar2026-9884-1765919186/purchase.php ]\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n\r\n*Register Now* [ https://inevent.com/en/TradeGov/BrazilAeromedicalWebinar2026-9884-1765919186/purchase.php ] \r\n \r\n\r\n*Date:\xc2\xa0 January 21, 2026*\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0 9:00 AM, Los Angeles, CA\r\n\xc2\xa0 12:00 PM, Washington, DC\r\n\xc2\xa0 2:00 PM, Brasilia\r\n\r\n*Fee:* $25\r\n\r\n*Questions? Please contact:*\r\n\r\n*Renato Sabaine\r\n*U.S. Commercial Service\r\nU.S. Embassy - S\xc3\xa3o Paulo*\r\nEmail <Renato.Sabaine@trade.gov>*\r\n\r\n*Adam Shanks*\r\nU.S. Commercial Service\r\nAerospace & Defense Team\r\nEmail <Adam.Shanks@trade.gov>\r\n\r\n*Elmer (EJ) Richardson*\r\nU.S. Commercial Service\r\nAerospace & Defense Team\r\nEmail <Elmer.Richardson@trade.gov>\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n  \r\n \r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0International Trade Administration\xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0United States Commercial Service, International Trade Administration  \r\n\r\nThe U.S. Commercial Service is the trade promotion arm of the\r\n*U.S. Department of Commerce's International Trade Administration.*\r\nU.S. Commercial Service trade professionals in over 100 U.S. cities and in more than 75 markets \r\nhelp U.S. companies get started in exporting or increase sales to global markets.\r\n\r\n*STAY CONNECTED*\r\n\r\nVisit us on Twitter [ https://twitter.com/exportgov ]\xc2\xa0 Connect with us on LinkedIn [ https://www.linkedin.com/company/uscommercialservice/ ]\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nBookmark and Share [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USITATRADE/bulletins/4034462?reqfrom=share ]\r\n\r\nIf you are ready to begin exporting or expand to additional global markets, \r\nplease contact your nearest U.S. Commercial Service office [ https://www.trade.gov/commercial-services-offices-us ] or access exporting resources [ https://www.trade.gov/learn-how-export ].\r\n\r\n*SUBSCRIBER SERVICES*\r\nVisit our User Profile Page [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USITATRADE/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] to update your subscriptions or unsubscribe.\r\nIf you need assistance, please visit\xc2\xa0subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/hc/en-us ].\r\n\r\n \r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\nThis email was sent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com using GovDelivery Communications Cloud on behalf of the International Trade Administration\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7 1401 Constitution Avenue NW \xc2\xb7 Washington, DC 20230 GovDelivery logo [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/ ] \r\nbody .abe-column-block { min-height: 5px; } table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:10px; margin-right:10px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;} table.govd_hr {min-width: 100%;}\r\n"
