[2026-04-27 10:31:17] Raw text/plain payload: b'If your email program has trouble displaying this email, view as a webpage [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/bulletins/403f814 ].\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nUS Food and Drug Administration\r\n\r\nBookmark and Share [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/bulletins/403f814?reqfrom=share ]\r\n\r\nFDA Increases Flexibility on Requirements for Cell and Gene Therapies to Advance Innovation\r\n\r\nThe U.S. Food and Drug Administration announced it is sharing information [ https://www.fda.gov/vaccines-blood-biologics/cellular-gene-therapy-products/flexible-requirements-cell-and-gene-therapies-advance-innovation?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\xc2\xa0about the agency\xe2\x80\x99s flexible approach to overseeing chemistry, manufacturing and control (CMC) requirements for cell and gene therapies (CGT). The agency\xe2\x80\x99s more flexible approach has been, and is expected to continue to be, helpful in expediting product development and will help guide the FDA\xe2\x80\x99s evaluation of development strategies in preparation for a Biologics License Application (BLA) submission. \xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n\xe2\x80\x9cRegulatory flexibility must be tailored for cell and gene therapies,\xe2\x80\x9d\xc2\xa0*said FDA Commissioner Marty Makary, M.D., M.P.H.*\xc2\xa0\xe2\x80\x9cThese are common-sense reforms that will address the unique characteristics of cell and gene therapies and foster more innovation.\xe2\x80\x9d\r\n\r\nOver the last decade, the FDA\xe2\x80\x99s Center for Biologics Evaluation and Research (CBER) has approved close to 50 CGTs. The transformative potential of these therapies has captured the imagination of the patient community and ignited product development.\r\n\r\n\xe2\x80\x9cThere has been tremendous enthusiasm amongst product developers resulting in an explosive growth of cell and gene therapy submissions, many of which target serious or life-threatening conditions with an unmet medical need,\xe2\x80\x9d\xc2\xa0*Vinay Prasad, M.D., M.P.H., Chief Medical and Scientific Officer and Director of the FDA\xe2\x80\x99s Center for Biologics Evaluation and Research*. \xe2\x80\x9cCBER is eager for stakeholders to know that our effectiveness at exercising greater regulatory flexibility around chemistry, manufacturing and control requirements furthers innovative product development.\xe2\x80\x9d \xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*Read More* [ https://www.fda.gov/news-events/press-announcements/fda-increases-flexibility-requirements-cell-and-gene-therapies-advance-innovation?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nAbout Us\r\n\r\nThe Public Engagement Staff [ https://www.fda.gov/about-fda/office-external-affairs/stakeholder-engagement-staff?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] resides within the Office of External Affairs. We aim to build stronger relationships with health professional organizations, patients and patient advocacy organizations, consumer groups, trade associations, think tanks and academia, and other interested parties, in order to better inform our policy making process, identify policy hurdles or misconceptions, and create strategic collaborations. For more information, please contact us at\xc2\xa0PublicEngagement@fda.hhs.gov.\xc2\xa0For patient specific inquiries, please contact us at\xc2\xa0Patients Ask FDA [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/email/dsp_ESMR.cfm?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ].\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n  \r\n \r\n\r\nfeed [ https://www.fda.gov/about-fda/contact-fda/subscribe-podcasts-and-news-feeds?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]twitter [ https://www.twitter.com/US_FDA?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]facebook [ https://www.facebook.com/FDA?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]Instagram [ https://www.instagram.com/FDA?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]youtube [ https://www.youtube.com/user/USFoodandDrugAdmin?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]flickr [ https://www.flickr.com/photos/fdaphotos/albums/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]  \r\n\r\n*Manage Subscriptions* [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 *Unsubscribe All* [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/subscriber/one_click_unsubscribe?verification=5.ee0243ee8741fe358146537aecf40e1e&destination=jasonnorman66994%40gmail.com ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 *Help* [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/ ]\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\nbody .abe-column-block {min-height: 5px;} td {line-height:1;} \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n This email was sent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com using GovDelivery Communications Cloud on behalf of: U.S. Food and Drug Administration \xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0\r\n10903 New Hampshire Ave\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0Silver Spring, MD \xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0 20993-0002\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa01-888-INFO-FDA GovDelivery logo [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\nbody .abe-column-block { min-height: 5px; } table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:10px; margin-right:10px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;}\r\n'
