[2026-04-27 10:31:18] Raw text/plain payload: b'If your email program has trouble displaying this email, view as a webpage [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/bulletins/403f919 ].\r\n\r\nClick to share this newsletter with your friends!\xc2\xa0Bookmark and Share [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/bulletins/403f919?reqfrom=share ]\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nUS Food and Drug Administration \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\nRare Disease Day 2026\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*Program Information:*\r\n\r\nRegister Now [ https://www.fda.gov/news-events/fda-meetings-conferences-and-workshops/public-meeting-fda-rare-disease-day-2026-02232026?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]: Rare Disease Day 2026\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nFDA will host Rare Disease Day, a virtual public meeting, on Monday, February 23, 2026 in global observance of Rare Disease Week. The theme is:* \xe2\x80\x9cMoving Forward. Looking Ahead. An Event for Patients.\xe2\x80\x9d *The goal of this year\xe2\x80\x99s Rare Disease Day is to explore ways to engage and collaborate with patients and their communities to support and accelerate the development of medical products for rare diseases. We want patients to connect with FDA and stay involved with our outreach and engagement programs to ensure the patient voice informs medical product development and regulation throughout FDA. Panels will discuss:\xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n\r\n  * Patient Focused FDA Initiatives\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0 \r\n\r\n  * Patient Engagement Opportunities\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0 \r\n\r\n  * Addressing Challenges and Opportunities with AI Technology\xc2\xa0 \r\n\r\n  * Utilizing Real World Data and Real World Evidence at FDA\xe2\x80\xaf\xc2\xa0 \r\n\r\n*Th**is program is open to the public.*\r\n\r\n*View Meeting Information and\xc2\xa0 Agenda [ https://www.fda.gov/news-events/fda-meetings-conferences-and-workshops/public-meeting-fda-rare-disease-day-2026-02232026?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]*\r\n\r\n*Register [ https://touchpoints.app.cloud.gov/touchpoints/0cbe46ce/submit?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]*\r\n\r\nFor any inquiries regarding this initiative, please send an email to: FDARareDiseaseDay@fda.hhs.gov\r\n\r\nFollow the FDA Oncology Center of Excellence [ http://www.fda.gov/OCE?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] on X\xc2\xa0@FDAOncology [ http://www.twitter.com/@fdaoncology?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nNewsletter Twitter [ https://www.twitter.com/FDAOncology?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n\r\nSubscribe to OCE Engagement [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/subscriber/new?topic_id=USFDA_769 ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 Manage Subscriptions [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0Help [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/ ]\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n  \r\n \r\nbody .abe-section-table {max-width:601px !important;} body .abe-column-block {min-height: 5px;} \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n This email was sent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com using GovDelivery Communications Cloud on behalf of: U.S. Food and Drug Administration \xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0\r\n10903 New Hampshire Ave\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0Silver Spring, MD \xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0 20993-0002\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa01-888-INFO-FDA GovDelivery logo [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\nbody .abe-column-block { min-height: 5px; } table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:10px; margin-right:10px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;}\r\n'
