\xbf\xcd\x8f\xe2\x80\x8b\xef\xbb\xbf\xcd\x8f\xe2\x80\x8b\xef\xbb\xbf\xcd\x8f\xe2\x80\x8b\xef\xbb\xbf\xcd\x8f\r\n\xe2\x80\x8b\xef\xbb\xbf\xcd\x8f\xe2\x80\x8b\xef\xbb\xbf\xcd\x8f\xe2\x80\x8b\xef\xbb\xbf\xcd\x8f\xe2\x80\x8b\xef\xbb\xbf\xcd\x8f\xe2\x80\x8b\xef\xbb\xbf\xcd\x8f\r\n\xe2\x80\x8b\xef\xbb\xbf\xcd\x8f\xe2\x80\x8b\xef\xbb\xbf\xcd\x8f\xe2\x80\x8b\xef\xbb\xbf\xcd\x8f\xe2\x80\x8b\xef\xbb\xbf\xcd\x8f\xe2\x80\x8b\xef\xbb\xbf\xcd\x8f\r\n\xe2\x80\x8b\xef\xbb\xbf\xcd\x8f\xe2\x80\x8b\xef\xbb\xbf\xcd\x8f\xe2\x80\x8b\xef\xbb\xbf\xcd\x8f\xe2\x80\x8b\xef\xbb\xbf\xcd\x8f\xe2\x80\x8b\xef\xbb\xbf\xcd\x8f\r\n\r\nJasonnorman,\r\n\r\n\xf0\x9f\x92\xa1 Before we start, I have an important announcement: our Resolution Sale (https://learn.educative.io/e3t/Ctc/RG+113/cz5H404/VXc_dt3csBDPW8m2XH-3vcKWTW805GfB5Jclf8N5r_RRT3prCCW8wLKSR6lZ3ptW3Qt7794-xw90Vy8yh-8g5z3gW3R5-gG4tj0BGW41_FZr44XpNtW6rSFp56bQ6W1W2myW8-97qD0PW6lzHG93QMdvkW49-k0r3CcBf0V_fGRH1s8_PbW6_xwb05wgjtSW6CLQPG3fzL0HW8m0LV713bCgkW8sgjk61MJNlgW3ZjJtX8QF1T3W8shTQQ6ZNGHVVxVzM22KY3FcW63XZgV279K_wW4lLPBx1Bzf9TW9dP1dw21ScCyW5V1Nyb6pHVnqW7RmNC63Y89k3N26cNVnFTzrDW73fvpB5r-BvKW9dt3rB7mmPk_W7ZhND828f57nW8Pylph1s9JgGW6xy4zG57Fc61W8_rzYt65vwLgf3yhyLv04 ) ends Thursday. It\xe2\x80\x99s your last chance to lock in Year End pricing before everything resets.\r\n\r\nI've said this many times before: AI upskilling is a non-negotiable for any developer looking to keep up this year.\r\n\r\nBut what's the best way to actually get hands-on with AI skills?\r\n\r\nBuilding projects.\r\n\r\nHere's why:\r\n\r\n- Developers learn by building. Passive learning isn't fruitful, active learning is.\r\n- Employers see your portfolio as proof. A project on your portfolio beats a keyword on your resume any day. It shows you can build with a technology before you even interview.\r\n\r\nThat's why today I'll be sharing my top 9 Educative Projects for AI upskilling. These selections are based on the technologies my colleagues and I are prioritizing as we hire in 2026.\r\n\r\nIf you're unfamiliar with our Projects, they're our solution to help developers build production-grade projects while they learn.\r\n\r\nThey include:\r\n\r\n- Get a walkthrough for portfolio-ready projects\r\n- Code and build as you go, all inside your browser\r\n- No production set up or third party access needed\r\n\r\nLet's jump in.\r\n\r\n1. Build a Chatbot with OpenAI GPT-5 Using Flask\r\n\r\nTechnologies: Flask, Python, OpenAI\r\n\r\nBuild practical skills in backend development and AI integration using GPT-5 \xe2\x80\x94 one of the most advanced models available today.\r\n\r\nYou'll build a chatbot with Flask, connect it to the GPT-5 API, and generate intelligent, context-aware responses. You\xe2\x80\x99ll also implement chat history tracking so the conversation stays coherent across messages (just like real production apps do).\r\n\r\n\xf0\x9f\x91\xb7 Who it\xe2\x80\x99s for: Developers who want to build smarter AI-powered apps with real conversational memory.\r\n\r\n\xf0\x9f\x91\x89 Build a Chatbot with OpenAI GPT-5 Using Flask (https://learn.educative.io/e3t/Ctc/RG+113/cz5H404/VXc_dt3csBDPW8m2XH-3vcKWTW805GfB5Jclf8N5r_RQ45m_5PW50kH_H6lZ3kDW2jz8437grJqDVLWNs_8sxjyhVJxn4x31GCy6N814nYWQDm0cW1b_rjl2586XsW68h4zc58jLHxW8Jgd7s1sbVW7W68jFZL3cLqZbW8rpxn63WRHdbW11RlpT2KcVWKW3pN4FC3SV5nBW37t58Z37wQkfW8LC_ch6RFmKkN1gD2CRK6nRXW4nTgtw93Sg3wW6FDhvS6chzdlW6-jFQt36jZd3W7WDLVp61Fnc6W7xMfZ93DSYr-W18QLT9966XTpW6Hx5my7X1d0_W4g-jdz4RGXGNVRBZLt5bY-ytW40ND7r32ctzWW12cv4g3yN79RW1Vn6qF32tlCwW8kj3dR8Rj2TFW4BMNyd1kHDmNW5RHBgF3CMcPLW2l-gfc8rk8vdW3DRlNV50z7YQW62bd824rp5LGf1RsM4M04 )\r\n\r\nWant a Flask project that leverages DSPy too? Check out: Build an AI Financial Analyst Assistant with DSPy and Flask (https://learn.educative.io/e3t/Ctc/RG+113/cz5H404/VXc_dt3csBDPW8m2XH-3vcKWTW805GfB5Jclf8N5r_RQn5m_5PW5BWr2F6lZ3nZW6SXL4F44Kc7ZW3n29Cd471HPxW98M7sg5x-mFRW9gYkf318RsqsW7CYwFB8lfp02W8kH4Jy13bnzvW98HFz_1KSZCsW434QwD9bpsFRW7h245b4yRWzNW2wPcP81PDRH4N14TX3Sb9cQKN8wHVdp7gBM-W2s5-9K8T3-76W1rS-xR9bG5d8W8fW6BQ1g7pgTW8np6S94tPk33W3YMyyH4C45dxW1hkZ2z1-N-MPW7DDKck52h748W7gzZKh8hr2GRW6CDl4x96SWKrW9lV_4J6l59JMW3V-83R721CpyW3601WP8GWH4wW8-Pv5d1TqFRmW9hcG3b2R64lvW5mJKr88yjC7FW2LPRt-4VbfW1W94ZztD536vYFW9dzZSP1TqKFyW8CmhkM3wwnhMW2-jQgW8J9SK9W3ZN_s-6lNvSTW2-HltL19wWTDf5xVbDv04 ) .\r\n\r\nScreenshot from Build an AI Financial Analyst Assistant with DSPy and Flask\r\n\r\n2. FREE: Build a Multi-Agent Job Search System with CrewAI and Python\r\n\r\nTechnologies: CrewAI, LangChain, Python, Streamlit, Gemini\r\n\r\nIf you're on the job hunt, this project is a 2-for-1.\r\n\r\nYou'll come out with:\r\n\r\n- An AI project for your portfolio\r\n- And a job search system that saves you time (and sanity)\r\n\r\nYou'll define specialized agents to:\r\n\r\n- Search job postings\r\n- Generate tailored resumes and cover letters\r\n- Create outreach messages\r\n\r\n\xe2\x80\xa6And connect them into a working Crew to streamline your own job hunt.\r\n\r\nThis project is your hands-on introduction to agent orchestration and workflow design. Best of all: it's free.\r\n\r\n\xf0\x9f\x91\xb7 Who it\xe2\x80\x99s for: Developers who want to build AI chops + save time during the job hunt.\r\n\r\n\xf0\x9f\x91\x89  Build a Multi-Agent Job Search System with CrewAI and Python (https://learn.educative.io/e3t/Ctc/RG+113/cz5H404/VXc_dt3csBDPW8m2XH-3vcKWTW805GfB5Jclf8N5r_RQn5m_5PW5BWr2F6lZ3lgW4w3DHL5J5Lh9W6slfvN2m8F_dW2QjLll2bfCNfW4BMZZm17KfrnW3N4w342_-1yrW6LzjDm7Jk4FjW6pkKdx1X63y-W6hbf932PvDdJW67y9dN92_gZHN6fRF2xkHlB0W2rpZmq1-9jJ8W6kj8wj2Cd4pcN4RTG8ZQRlsGW60y1sV8Tyv05W6Qn3Dz8LdwdxW98Jlgp1rW4NkW91Rrhj5r3LctW76YhXP5phzM7W45Z-L94P_H-2W4x63Th2yL44LW3thLVp8qnHwCN8XYV5FK9wksV3TLmW1N12r6W4rhxDP7JZ8RQW6SDt847822_5W6qRf1z8hLdT9W879Ygc77TL6mW7MDwbY790Y1mW51Dh1n3dR3bBW3_fkPn4PC89cW5rZdDD301TtnW9bYhfS650lr2W3s6JHy8hDsFWW7jqgSX4306XCf3tZ8zn04 )\r\n\r\nInterested in another CrewAI + LangChain project?\r\n\r\nCheck out: Build an Agentic Workflow with CrewAI and GitHub MCP Server Tools (https://learn.educative.io/e3t/Ctc/RG+113/cz5H404/VXc_dt3csBDPW8m2XH-3vcKWTW805GfB5Jclf8N5r_RQn5m_5PW5BWr2F6lZ3lZW3dj6HG5cdmTBW3Y-g-Y2rhNT6W67xMh82hRYP6W3TJq5M6N6Vq9N3YlqLxhQC64M29NCQKl7-SW88pz6N3sk17yW6tqrfv2gJJbNW4NtY725WBGPFW8C_CJq1S7r3BW8cpMf72p58t4W2CxZM25GJRDMW7Dnv6D7K9knmN36zln3fbWVCW5n3Q3C1cd5MLW3nvX-R5mWPq-W55n2Jz15M5D_W2TnBTT2YRht-W7m7fTj5C26fGW4Dc1bk1gGCwYW5BS1sc3Hb1TyW5b2s0r4RgprkN563bjWXrn2kV99nNv6l5Jk9W3Cvgxm90mGH5N34lNPnKd9b8W9bQkQJ3ZsPcHW5-VVNq3XwlGpW1h28kZ62c3YXW7jXvFr1PlN1JW1FHRv44qvlm0N8Q9sZ_vJHX6W6NbhfS7gTcvXW8s8q6n88b0Yqd5lZVP04 ) .\r\n\r\n3. Explore DeepSeek Models via OpenRouter\r\n\r\nTechnologies: OpenRouter API, Jupyter Notebook, DeepSeek, Python\r\n\r\nThis project teaches you how to integrate multiple DeepSeek models into a Python workflow using the OpenRouter API, so you can build smarter tools that go beyond a single prompt.\r\n\r\nInside a Jupyter Notebook, you\xe2\x80\x99ll tackle tasks like summarizing research, writing support emails, generating social content, and solving code problems.\r\n\r\nAlong the way, you\xe2\x80\x99ll explore essential skills for any modern AI developer, including:\r\n\r\n- Prompt engineering\r\n- Token management\r\n- Model chaining\r\n\r\n\xf0\x9f\x91\xb7 Who it\xe2\x80\x99s for: Developers who want to move from prompting to building with large language models.\r\n\r\n\xf0\x9f\x91\x89 Explore DeepSeek Models via OpenRouter (https://learn.educative.io/e3t/Ctc/RG+113/cz5H404/VXc_dt3csBDPW8m2XH-3vcKWTW805GfB5Jclf8N5r_RQ45m_5PW50kH_H6lZ3l1W14VVcC1mfGr-W2-5QQQ2BDn5ZVpdhFp5p7HKpW90pD2g8h4sfrW6bnDdk46Tg8lW8CljxX6sc3DDW1cywTF5QKXkjW7R7fBV8TY9XFW7ZjWPy5cg1nSW2MX1y02NHSXCW4TD4tQ1PPGv_W1_MGlK8rR_yyVdd3T67K0zNfVGM3Dd86LRc8VRfWml5GBkVbW30rt6_8d9kS7W60nwpm94jfYRW39pdc78SwgNTW1b7FSG6WPH06W1stc8Z2KbT-cW6n_FY_5KxCR0W3YXxX73HbtJjW81KKGp5HVJ18W8rgkMn5TLyWDW5fvv7M1Sw2msW8zy_VK16yw-6Vk2WsN8D5lWlW5VdqHl6gLCvhW4jqyxr6tgvcRW6xgmZb4x9GrxW2-ylrl6tY8_mW4gcX7y2RBsMhf6VySXT04 )\r\n\r\n4. Develop a Multi-Agent Research Assistant Using AutoGen\r\n\r\nTechnologies: AutoGen, Python, OpenAI API\r\n\r\nMulti-agent systems like AutoGen are redefining what AI can do \xe2\x80\x94 not just answering questions, but coordinating complex tasks across specialized roles.\r\n\r\nIn this project, you\xe2\x80\x99ll use AutoGen to build a research assistant that automates the full pipeline of academic exploration: refining topics, finding papers, extracting insights, and compiling structured reports.\r\n\r\nYou\xe2\x80\x99ll get experience with skills like:\r\n\r\n- Agent collaboration\r\n- Sequential task execution\r\n- Custom workflow design\r\n\r\n\xe2\x80\xa6 All while building a portfolio-ready tool for research automation.\r\n\r\n\xf0\x9f\x91\xb7 Who it\xe2\x80\x99s for: Developers interested in automating complex workflows and building AI tools for knowledge work.\r\n\r\n\xf0\x9f\x91\x89  Develop a Multi-Agent Research Assistant Using AutoGen (https://learn.educative.io/e3t/Ctc/RG+113/cz5H404/VXc_dt3csBDPW8m2XH-3vcKWTW805GfB5Jclf8N5r_RQn5m_5PW5BWr2F6lZ3mHW4zpY3392P4zzN3rcK7j6B0TWW7jLKR26H1XKqW6prmB29cg4D-VKxmFp2HF2SZW8JWRpF7v7Z8SW3nShkB5rYg9WW2bk8yR1Y3GNPW5CPRs68h4hYpW95cDS16WH83hW4G2XLF6ZPH2hW3J_5t18xkcl9W620rZZ1HmV_ZW8659cT1vfBszW17zhz74d3b_WN4K46FBJvPjLW1hSv2c8v5WbLW29hyTT7rbX1vW5-L2Sf7tG0YCW8vhPQn7WjD01W3m0mmJ9bwhckW8x977L3yD8-pVg_dWG1fwK_rW6hVH7n5tsZ8YW3CP-X76mJMP-N2JFzKvp5FSQN8ZzRX2F5k93W61gTvr8YTWzxW4-nfPG2b1Q0hV7GSR-7qTVZgN77G3NkGblYHW3Sf4H64bYg70W4GtWrF6HcKRpN8JNRt5nh6lvf8jDSnx04 )\r\n\r\n5. Build a RAG Chatbot Using DeepSeek and LlamaIndex\r\n\r\nTechnologies: DeepSeek, LlamaIndex, ChainLit, React\r\n\r\nRAG is one of the most effective ways to reduce hallucinations in LLMs by grounding answers in real sources instead of just guessing. In this project, you\xe2\x80\x99ll build a chatbot that does exactly that: fetching up-to-date content from Wikipedia to generate accurate, context-aware responses.\r\n\r\nIn this project, you'll:\r\n\r\n- Create an interactive chat interface using ChainLit\r\n- Connect to Groq-hosted LLMs like DeepSeek or LLaMA 3 for ultra-fast inference\r\n- Rely on LlamaIndex for indexing and retrieval\r\n\r\nBy the end, you\xe2\x80\x99ll have a fully functional ReAct-based agent that can research, reason, and respond using live data.\r\n\r\n\xf0\x9f\x91\xb7 Who it\xe2\x80\x99s for: Developers who want to build faster, smarter AI systems that actually know what they\xe2\x80\x99re talking about.\r\n\r\n\xf0\x9f\x91\x89 Build a RAG Chatbot Using DeepSeek and LlamaIndex (https://learn.educative.io/e3t/Ctc/RG+113/cz5H404/VXc_dt3csBDPW8m2XH-3vcKWTW805GfB5Jclf8N5r_RQn5m_5PW5BWr2F6lZ3mXW2BJ7gV1qccFBW3XlCV27_Q2F-V2NQk95p128jW36SyXN8VsDy2VKb3P05p63hWW4WxTg838jh_RVMnzsN3WWkLyW36HPbF5M2gsKVvLsQC67HPbbW4k6ddH19Dh8mW2jL-zD3z0KQgW47gg7k2QpRCtW5mKcFY5d0sCCW5Svry01G7DXMN3Z_JbJ4zT13W7vPYv01csgXQW4FYPNl6cv2r4W1yWZjR1Z4Vy7W6y9D-J2jNMqjW81-7Cn7lX6z_W24zyBw1k5-SvW39BB0f8xqT63V9w5ch6l6SL1W9dZpfB5bRTjgVsSF7C59jM7NW8t-3bR8wlwx_W7VZz6t2LYgpFW6219Tj3bq4GSW74yKFK73FZz3W2YYJrQ5z3s6HW62mgGc4Kv3M9W11w8rz8mpDSwVLy7gS69H_txW83Yt7t1sTYPLf7jB9C-04 )\r\n\r\nWant a RAG project that gets you hands-on with FastAPI? Check out: Building a Retrieval-Augmented Generation System Using FastAPI (https://learn.educative.io/e3t/Ctc/RG+113/cz5H404/VXc_dt3csBDPW8m2XH-3vcKWTW805GfB5Jclf8N5r_RQn5m_5PW5BWr2F6lZ3lYW6k_tlN1TzFZRW5g8dRQ7BP0_1W5D3z4T1y34GcW2ZmB1C3nP8QLW4qjsQz7WTtdPV34cBL4xTHC5W2rgjHj6G_XbrW86mht731jd-4W1S4lCf40gLfYN7Y5rpMszJPxW80Ky_l6wVvsNW2Nw7tC47QqFSW9hQ8NP3xmy7rW79lbpn2x2hLlW3WC9gK85rgJMW8Cy_bS8kqMLTW5t9SNw3MyNbyW4cHLQj2PJQgpW5h13sF1vfxVBW8-JB0z84PY7-W5SrHF11nt7LNW8jb4x86k9l-MW1_JHhm5DTcqvW4T_R8Q6fGgGfW8n_rhR3CFvSlVt9gk53qCbH3W6GKD0L8HWDvwW7wRqSp31wYbLW85D84r4vNLrwW69L8tL3ffJswW2pWPyY371bWdW4Z9Cv11zFWSvW9b34fQ2M35HDW7wpQr45gx8f_f70Z1mY04 )\r\n\r\n6. Build an AI Travel Planner with Multi-Agent A2A Protocol\r\n\r\nTechnologies: Gemini, Python\r\n\r\nScreenshot from Build an AI Travel Planner with Multi-Agent A2A Protocol\r\n\r\nAgent-to-Agent (A2A) collaboration is quickly becoming one of the hottest trends in AI \xe2\x80\x94 powering more dynamic, modular, and scalable systems that go far beyond single-model solutions.\r\n\r\nIn this project, you\xe2\x80\x99ll explore that frontier by building an AI travel planner where specialized agents (flights, hotels, attractions, weather) coordinate through a central root agent to plan trips intelligently.\r\n\r\nYou'll learn how to:\r\n\r\n- Use Google\xe2\x80\x99s Agent Development Kit (ADK) to create role-based agents\r\n- Register and delegate tasks through root agents\r\n- Run asynchronous, CLI-based agent systems in Python\r\n\r\n\xf0\x9f\x91\xb7 Who it\xe2\x80\x99s for: Developers exploring the cutting edge of multi-agent AI \xe2\x80\x94 and looking to apply it to real, high-value use cases.\r\n\r\n\xf0\x9f\x91\x89 Build an AI Travel Planner with Multi-Agent A2A Protocol (https://learn.educative.io/e3t/Ctc/RG+113/cz5H404/VXc_dt3csBDPW8m2XH-3vcKWTW805GfB5Jclf8N5r_RQn5m_5PW5BWr2F6lZ3lBW5xfsy15f4TJDN7GWV8FfcFzyW6bSK2H81GcV_W8T0ZjR7_nw-vW57R2Xc4jWnZxW6sCNM-3Kg8zBW6MGPR_4qn7WLW6VsYr749Bkr3W8zllcT4srZmDW31nphB4jCrBFW6rQLkz5b3KpzW3PV1Mk6g_44ZVCwSM_1FphVQW4GWRch8J6WPSN183W36_0lsbW825RY-6WJxH9N8yspHg_8z3tN7v30t0SQNWwW37GDcR3_9PzxW8DSZdF5f2FdbMlsGF08jNCJW4dYK1z2tWW9JN3rGj8_xJBjNW2-m9gX3ygN6QW4sRY_c60_M6jN8Y-72M2fgy2W7ZsryY9hDt75W4vlGtF2XqN7QW321RFw7G2Sw6W8C_0R_2-Z24hW4LjnWd4rsw1NW5MSZ6c3KdtlMW3rMllW6DZ0p9W7KFGNf3qHNNvf7kNjsM04 )\r\n\r\nBuild your future one project at a time\r\n\r\nWith new models and tools emerging every week, there\xe2\x80\x99s a lot of noise in the AI space right now.\r\n\r\nBut what matters most is what you can build with it.\r\n\r\nThat\xe2\x80\x99s the throughline across every project I shared today: moving from knowing to doing. From \xe2\x80\x9cI\xe2\x80\x99ve read about that\xe2\x80\x9d to \xe2\x80\x9cI built this.\xe2\x80\x9d\r\n\r\nYou won\xe2\x80\x99t be the only one. Last year alone, developers spent over 5,000 hours building with Educative Projects \xe2\x80\x94 leveling up, shipping portfolio-ready work, and learning by doing.\r\n\r\nIf you\xe2\x80\x99re serious about futureproofing your skills in 2026, this is the way forward. Pick a project, get your hands dirty, and let the work teach you.\r\n\r\nWe built Projects for exactly this kind of learning \xe2\x80\x94 and I hope one of these gives you the spark to start. You can explore our entire catalog of Projects here (https://learn.educative.io/e3t/Ctc/RG+113/cz5H404/VXc_dt3csBDPW8m2XH-3vcKWTW805GfB5Jclf8N5r_RRT3prCCW8wLKSR6lZ3njW3jgNx487mh64W4fdKxh7pmBdLW22Cr0t6spxvJW1pNhV730lLhrW2M1cDK1zQ1GSW7R0ckL7FJkDqW1TnZdR4m1vhCW1Gswcj7dnjmnW1-X0Ry14n3JSW3P3NGW7X5Z68W1QPHdC2n_xZVW6M88pt8jnzxWW2s4B1r70vmsxW5kFnBW5BB0_yW2-_MHJ4LG2QmW4tttVj4FFG6JW1gsKn55wRQNpVvzSqK2KWbGrMxNGvqYX8yGW2K2zHX2NrVJ_W93s8Fr1L8c8WW2K3swK6Y6rM4W2Tj7Jg39X17lW6tvvck1KVcmpMKCyC46Gj0VW2x06pM5HKzQ3W2SFdqb7YGrlrN97-J_nqw0Flf5cS1l804 ) .\r\n\r\nLast call: Access any of these Projects with 50% off an Educative subscription during our Resolutions Sale. Get your discount before it expires in a few days.\r\n\r\nGet 50% off (or more)\r\n(https://learn.educative.io/e3t/Ctc/RG+113/cz5H404/VXc_dt3csBDPW8m2XH-3vcKWTW805GfB5Jclf8N5r_RRT3prCCW8wLKSR6lZ3ptW3Qt7794-xw90Vy8yh-8g5z3gW3R5-gG4tj0BGW41_FZr44XpNtW6rSFp56bQ6W1W2myW8-97qD0PW6lzHG93QMdvkW49-k0r3CcBf0V_fGRH1s8_PbW6_xwb05wgjtSW6CLQPG3fzL0HW8m0LV713bCgkW8sgjk61MJNlgW3ZjJtX8QF1T3W8shTQQ6ZNGHVVxVzM22KY3FcW63XZgV279K_wW4lLPBx1Bzf9TW9dP1dw21ScCyW5V1Nyb6pHVnqW7RmNC63Y89k3N26cNVnFTzrDW73fvpB5r-BvKW9dt3rB7mmPk_W7ZhND828f57nW8Pylph1s9JgGW6xy4zG57Fc61W8_rzYt65vwLgf3yhyLv04 )\r\n\r\nWhat's your resolution this year \xe2\x80\x94 and how can I help you get there? Hit reply and let me know.\r\n\r\nUntil then, happy learning!\r\n\r\n\xe2\x80\x94 Fahim\r\n\r\nEducative, 12280 NE District Way, Bellevue, WA 98005, United States\r\n\r\nManage preferences (https://learn.educative.io/hs/preferences-center/en/page?data=W2nXS-N30h-LHW250qd-2HVn5XW2TQS0h2zVDFYW30yP9P2sVR_WW1S9Mv73F00ycW2zW2zZ4cKfzGW3W1s3M4fNqvwW24VJ7