[2026-04-27 10:31:42] Raw text/plain payload: b'\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n Credible | Special loan offer for you or someone you know: Private student loan options \r\n  &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847;\r\n&#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847;\r\n&#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847;\r\n&#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847;\r\n&#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847;\r\n&#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847;\r\n&#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847;\r\n&#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847;\r\n&#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847;\r\n&#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847;\r\n&#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847;\r\n&#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847;\r\n&#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847;\r\n&#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847;\r\n&#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847;\r\n&#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847;\r\n                              \r\n                              \r\n                              \r\n                              \r\n                 \r\n \r\n Rates start at 2.69% FIXED APR*\r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nhttps://view.email.credible.com/?qs=e1a8fae4b11aa1c246632d1f5eb838eed3f82f31d63a1f28e024c644f5ab564c1ed68a4a3e3682cdb5ed141272c27de982638eec65e61ae30abdb308127c94b920c1188951aef8e23d8a61820e0ae4650059b6e97b4ce8ba \r\nView in browser \r\n\r\nhttps://click.email.credible.com/?qs=e3f4f865eb793c3b65b3c652e0ae1a8f8c3344685ea27d6a42ed456499a601069b14474ea3d271c62ea4400cadf68cd92261c61a1e8abf58c1aa625667513d1a \r\n\r\nWe helped you with prequalified personal loan rates\r\n \r\nLet us help you find your next student loan, too\r\n\r\nhttps://click.email.credible.com/?qs=e3f4f865eb793c3bfa842eea5db5ba16fb5c6ba846e80f7dcf338b74534a9fca3f47e00f379fd98f6c50bce5f82fc1b01e646e9e5ed3dacb8e0dd7220e66015e \r\n Check My Rates  \r\n\r\nWanda, whether you\'re managing debt, investing in education, or securing your dream home, Credible has diverse financial solutions to suit every stage of life. If you or someone you know is in the market for a private student loan, our #1 student loan marketplace gives students access to personalized loan options from up to 11 lenders.\r\n \r\n\r\nWhy use Credible to find a private student loan?\r\n\r\nYou can choose your ideal repayment option \xe2\x80\x94 payments can be made before or after graduation\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nYou\xe2\x80\x99ll be able to see your cost breakdown before selecting a lender\r\n \r\n\r\nWe help you complete your application with the lender and confirm your approval\r\n \r\n\r\nhttps://click.email.credible.com/?qs=e3f4f865eb793c3bfa842eea5db5ba16fb5c6ba846e80f7dcf338b74534a9fca3f47e00f379fd98f6c50bce5f82fc1b01e646e9e5ed3dacb8e0dd7220e66015e \r\n Check My Rates  \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n Sincerely,\r\nThe Credible Team\r\n \r\n\r\nQuestions? We\'re here to help.\r\nOur Credible Team would be happy to assist you!\r\n\r\ntel:+18552879106 \r\n  Call at 855-287-9106\r\n \r\n   |  \r\n \r\nmailto:support@credible.com \r\n  Send an email\r\n \r\n\r\ntel:+18552879106 \r\n  Call at 855-287-9106\r\n \r\n\r\nmailto:support@credible.com \r\n  Send an email\r\n \r\n\r\n\r\n https://click.email.credible.com/?qs=e3f4f865eb793c3bdc8c28182ada11f0bfce89eb216ca40da8d8c8d9811305130cb1bf9813e30a710db0f98e4d724d2515b14727d1c53bb57d6a7875de529fb0 \r\n\r\nCopyright \xc2\xa9 2026 Credible Operations, Inc.\r\n \r\n\r\nhttps://click.email.credible.com/?qs=e3f4f865eb793c3b10c0aec920f97e602477be63969452a4acb16864ebe8ff73290b1834d51709830f84123949854346b3b918fb95116d4af117ca1e7baf8293 \r\nLicenses and Disclosures \r\nOur mailing address is\r\n \r\n 6601 Northpark Boulevard, Ste. C #6037, Charlotte, NC 28216\r\n \r\n\r\nThis email is an advertisement. If you\'d like to unsubscribe, \r\n \r\nhttps://click.email.credible.com/subscription_center.aspx?qs=d20e97316b318d8f56a3391104bcc124597939318cc8b927311e3c95c2d24cba48554e4406424269ab89bc38e31261d27ceb745326bc09be7dc27ecef3d1cb08e13a23522db4adb1 \r\nclick here .\r\n \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\nThis email should not be considered advice. You are solely responsible for determining whether any product or service is appropriate for you. If you have any questions regarding your financial situation, please consult with your professional advisor.Do not reply to this email. The inbox is not monitored. If you require support, please email \r\nmailto:support@credible.com \r\nsupport@credible.com .\r\n\r\nPrivate student loans do not offer the same repayment protections as Federal student loans \xe2\x80\x94 like income-driven repayment and loan forgiveness. Always check to see if you qualify for subsidized funds first. \r\n\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n\r\n*Student Loan Rate and Terms Disclosure: Rates displayed include Automatic Payment and Loyalty Discounts, where applicable. Note that such discounts do not apply while loans are in deferment. The lenders on the <a href="https://www.credible.com" style="text-align:left; color:#7B7B7B; text-decoration:none;" target="_blank">Credible.com\r\n</a> platform offer fixed rates ranging from 2.69% - 17.99% APR and Variable interest rates from 3.07% - 17.99% APR. Variable rates will fluctuate over the term of the borrower\'s loan with changes in the Index rate. The Index will be either LIBOR or SOFR. Rates are subject to change at any time without notice. Your actual rate may be different from the rates advertised and/or shown above and will be based on factors such as the term of your loan, your financial history (including your cosigner\xe2\x80\x99s (if any) financial history) and the degree you are in the process of achieving or have achieved. While not always the case, lower rates typically require creditworthy applicants with creditworthy co-signers, graduate degrees, and shorter repayment terms (terms vary by lender and can range from 5-20 years) and include Automatic Payment and Loyalty discounts, where applicable. Loyalty and Automatic Payment discount requirements as well as Lender terms and conditions will vary\r\n by lender and therefore, reading each lender\xe2\x80\x99s disclosures is important. Additionally, lenders may have loan minimum and maximum requirements, degree requirements, educational institution requirements, citizenship and residency requirements as well as other lender-specific requirements. Lenders will conduct a hard credit pull when you submit your application. Hard credit pulls will have an impact on your credit score.\r\n\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n\r\n'
