[2026-04-27 10:32:06] Raw text/plain payload: b'2026\xe2\x80\x8a-\xe2\x80\x8a"One of ours, all of yours.", Russian Teletubbies\r\nUkraine Update January 13\r\n\r\n2026\xe2\x80\x8a-\xe2\x80\x8a"One of ours, all of yours.", Russian Teletubbies\r\n\r\nDylan Combellick (https://medium.com/@dylan_combellick?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768303331898-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------f2995e7b_e1b7_4482_b73a_9953bceb0def--------354e45830cd6)\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nJanuary 13, 2026\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\n12 min read\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nView on Medium (https://medium.com/p/eb4d1ecc8226?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768303331898-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------f2995e7b_e1b7_4482_b73a_9953bceb0def--------354e45830cd6)\r\n\r\nSo Goes the War\r\n\r\nUkrainian forces raised the flag over the remains of the City Hall of Kupiansk, a city which, according to what Russian generals have told Putin, is firmly under Russian occupation.\r\n\r\n-\xe2\x80\x8a-\xe2\x80\x8a-\r\n\r\nUkraine struck the Atlant Aero plant (http://redirect.medium.systems/r-PJQUoQYO6L?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768303331898-newsletter.subscribeToProfile--eb4d1ecc8226-----------------------f2995e7b_e1b7_4482_b73a_9953bceb0def--------354e45830cd6)\r\n in Taganrog, which is linked to the production of the Orion and Molniya drones. Russian sources suggest that the nearby Beriev Aircraft Repair Factory was also hit.\r\n\r\nContinue reading (https://medium.com/p/eb4d1ecc8226?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768303331898-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------f2995e7b_e1b7_4482_b73a_9953bceb0def--------354e45830cd6)\r\nThis is a member-only story and can only be read on Medium.\r\n\r\nSent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com by Dylan Combellick on Medium\r\nUnsubscribe (https://medium.com/me/email-settings/50207bf5a022/544a05cbbe74?type=noSetting&newsletterV3Id=354e45830cd6&source=email-50207bf5a022-1768303331898-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------f2995e7b_e1b7_4482_b73a_9953bceb0def--------354e45830cd6)\r\n from this writer\'s email notifications\r\nManage your email settings (https://medium.com/me/settings/notifications?hash=544a05cbbe74&userId=50207bf5a022&settingsRouteHash=%23manageSubscriptions&source=email-50207bf5a022-1768303331898-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------f2995e7b_e1b7_4482_b73a_9953bceb0def--------354e45830cd6)\r\n\r\n3500 South DuPont Highway, Suite IQ-101, Dover,\xc2\xa0DE\xc2\xa019901\r\nCareers (https://medium.com/jobs-at-medium/work-at-medium-959d1a85284e?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768303331898-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------f2995e7b_e1b7_4482_b73a_9953bceb0def--------354e45830cd6)\r\n\xc2\xb7Help Center (https://help.medium.com/hc/en-us?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768303331898-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------f2995e7b_e1b7_4482_b73a_9953bceb0def--------354e45830cd6)\r\n\xc2\xb7Privacy Policy (https://policy.medium.com/medium-privacy-policy-f03bf92035c9?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768303331898-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------f2995e7b_e1b7_4482_b73a_9953bceb0def--------354e45830cd6)\r\n\xc2\xb7Terms of service (https://policy.medium.com/medium-terms-of-service-9db0094a1e0f?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768303331898-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------f2995e7b_e1b7_4482_b73a_9953bceb0def--------354e45830cd6)'
