[2026-04-27 10:32:09] Raw text/plain payload: b"Export Opportunities for American Manufacturers  \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nl\r\n*Advanced Manufacturing in Australia: *\r\n\r\n*The AUKUS Opportunity for U.S. Exporters*\r\n\r\nRegister now [ https://inevent.com/en/TradeGov/AdvancedManufacturinginAustralia/hotsite.php ] \r\n\r\nJanuary 27 at 5pm EDT; Webinar fee: $25\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*DESCRIPTION:*\r\n\r\n\r\n  * \r\n\r\nAmerican manufacturers will discover the partnering and business opportunities emerging within the Australian maritime defense sector, with a particular focus on the AUKUS Alliance.\xc2\xa0 There are opportunities for U.S. firms to collaborate with Australian companies to enhance Australia's advanced manufacturing capabilities, directly supporting AUKUS Pillar I and II priorities and other important industry sectors.\r\n\r\n\r\n  * \r\n\r\nAustralia is actively seeking to boost its capabilities and integrate global best practices in its defense industrial base.\xc2\xa0 Through collaboration with key partners, U.S. advanced manufacturing companies can help drive innovation and security across maritime and defense supply chains.\r\n\r\n\r\n  * \r\n\r\nThis webinar has been designed for American suppliers of advanced manufactured finished products and advanced manufacturing solutions.\xc2\xa0 We will present practical steps for U.S. firms on doing business in Australia and partnering with Australian companies that are seeking to build innovation and resilience in critical industries.\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*AGENDA:*\r\n\r\n\r\n  * *Welcome and Introduction\r\n*Molly Hope, Advanced Manufacturing Team Lead \r\n  * *Introduction to Australia\r\n*Steve Knode, Senior Commercial Officer - Oceania \r\n  * *United States Military Group-Australia\r\n*COL Lewis Vaughn, Chief ODC. \r\nJoint Production and MRO Opportunities in-country. \r\n  * *U.S. Department of State: Policy Overview\r\n*Matt Steinhelfer, AUKUS Senior Advisor \r\n  * *AUKUS Joint Venture Opportunities\r\n*Mathew Cantagallo, Director Defence and Security, Austrade. Australian Capability and partnership opportunities.\xc2\xa0 \r\n  * *Why Look at International Markets\r\n*Rear Admiral David Goggins\xc2\xa0(retired), U.S. Navy.\xc2\xa0\r\nNew revenue opportunities through expanded markets and product offerings.\xc2\xa0Program support for companies looking to collaborate in the Australian Manufacturing space. \r\n  * *Advanced Manufacturing in Australia\r\n*Dr. Jens Goennemann, Managing Director, Advanced Manufacturing Growth Centre.\xc2\xa0The state of advanced manufacturing in Australia and opportunities for collaboration.\xc2\xa0 \r\n  * *Q&A* \r\n  * *Closing remarks:*\xc2\xa0Rana Nusheiwat, Commercial Specialist-Australia \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nhttps://www.trade.gov/ [ https://www.trade.gov/manufacturing-month ]Advanced Manufacturing Industry [ https://www.trade.gov/advanced-manufacturing-industry ] [ https://www.trade.gov/manufacturing-month ]\r\nContact: Molly.Hope@trade.gov\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n  \r\n \r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n* International Trade Administration*\xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0United States Commercial Service, International Trade Administration [ https://www.trade.gov/us-commercial-service ]*\r\n [ https://www.trade.gov/us-commercial-service ]*  \r\n\r\nThe U.S. Commercial Service is the trade promotion arm of the\r\n*U.S. Department of Commerce's International Trade Administration.*\r\nU.S. Commercial Service trade professionals in over 100 U.S. cities and in more than 75 markets \r\nhelp U.S. companies get started in exporting or increase sales to global markets.\r\n\r\n*STAY CONNECTED*\r\n\r\nVisit us on X [ https://twitter.com/exportgov ]\xc2\xa0 Connect with us on LinkedIn [ https://www.linkedin.com/company/uscommercialservice/ ]\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nBookmark and Share [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USITATRADE/bulletins/4040e07?reqfrom=share ]\r\n\r\nIf you are ready to begin exporting or expand to additional global markets, \r\nplease contact your nearest U.S. Commercial Service office [ https://www.trade.gov/commercial-services-offices-us ]\r\nor check out our online EXPORT SOLUTIONS [ https://www.trade.gov/export-solutions ].\r\n\r\n*SUBSCRIBER SERVICES*\r\nVisit our User Profile Page [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USITATRADE/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] to update your subscriptions or unsubscribe.\r\nIf you need assistance, please visit\xc2\xa0subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/hc/en-us ].\r\n\r\n \r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\nThis email was sent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com using GovDelivery Communications Cloud on behalf of the International Trade Administration\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7 1401 Constitution Avenue NW \xc2\xb7 Washington, DC 20230 GovDelivery logo [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/ ] \r\nbody .abe-column-block { min-height: 5px; } table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:10px; margin-right:10px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;} table.govd_hr {min-width: 100%;}\r\n"
