[2026-04-27 10:32:11] Raw text/plain payload: b"Banner: Advanced Manufacturing in Australia: The AUKUS Opportunity for U.S. Exporters. January 27 at 5 PM EST. Webinar. U.S. Commercial Service [ https://inevent.com/en/TradeGov/AdvancedManufacturinginAustralia/hotsite.php ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nAdvanced Manufacturing in Australia: The AUKUS Opportunity for U.S. Exporters\r\n\r\n**\r\n\r\nJoin us on January 27 for a webinar focused on practical guidance for firms looking to do business in Australia and partnering with Australian companies that are seeking to build innovation and resilience in critical industries.\r\n\r\nU.S. manufacturers across sectors will gain a clear view of the rapidly expanding partnership and business opportunities within Australia\xe2\x80\x99s maritime defense sector, driven in large part by the AUKUS (Australia\xe2\x80\x93U.K.\xe2\x80\x93U.S.) Alliance. As Australia accelerates its investment in advanced manufacturing and defense modernization, U.S. firms have an exceptional opening to export their world\xe2\x80\x91leading technologies and collaborate directly with Australian industry. These partnerships will play a pivotal role in strengthening Australia\xe2\x80\x99s capabilities while advancing AUKUS Pillar I and II priorities and supporting a broader range of critical sectors.\r\n\r\nAustralia is actively seeking to boost its capabilities and integrate global best practices in its defense industrial base. Through collaboration with key partners, U.S. advanced manufacturing companies can help drive innovation and security across maritime and defense supply chains.\r\n\r\n**\r\n\r\n*Agenda:*\r\n\r\n*Welcome and Introduction: *Molly Hope, Advanced Manufacturing Team Lead\r\n\r\n*Introduction to Australia: *Steve Knode, Senior Commercial Officer - Oceania\r\n\r\n*United States Military Group - Australia: *COL Lewis Vaughn, Chief ODC\r\n\r\n\r\n  * Joint Production and MRO Opportunities in-country \r\n\r\n*U.S. Department of State: Policy Overview: *Matt Steinhelfer, AUKUS Senior Advisor\r\n\r\n*AUKUS Joint Venture Opportunities: *Mathew Cantagallo, Director Defence and Security, Austrade\r\n\r\n\r\n  * Australian industry capability plans and partnership opportunities. \r\n\r\n*Why Look at International Markets: *Rear Admiral David Goggins (retired), U.S. Navy\r\n\r\n\r\n  * New revenue opportunities through expanded markets and product offerings. \r\n  * Program support for companies looking to collaborate in the Australian Manufacturing space. \r\n\r\n*Advanced Manufacturing in Australia: *Dr. Jens Goennemann, Managing Director, Advanced Manufacturing Growth Centre\r\n\r\n\r\n  * The state of advanced manufacturing in Australia and opportunities for collaboration. \r\n\r\n*Q&A*\r\n\r\n*Closing Remarks: *Rana Nusheiwat, Commercial Specialist - Australia\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n\r\n*Register Today* [ https://inevent.com/en/TradeGov/AdvancedManufacturinginAustralia/hotsite.php ] \r\n \r\n\r\n*Date:*\r\n\r\n*January 27, 2026*\r\n\r\n*Time:*\r\n\r\n\r\n  * 5 PM Eastern \r\n  * 2 PM Pacific \r\n\r\n*Fee:*\r\n\r\n\r\n  * $25 \r\n\r\n*Questions about the Webinar or International Business Opportunities? Please contact:*\r\n\r\n\r\n  * Molly Hope <Molly.Hope@trade.gov> - U.S. Commercial Service \r\n  * Doug Hartley <Doug.Hartley@trade.gov> - U.S. Commercial Service Australia \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n  \r\n \r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0International Trade Administration\xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0United States Commercial Service, International Trade Administration  \r\n\r\nThe U.S. Commercial Service is the trade promotion arm of the\r\n*U.S. Department of Commerce's International Trade Administration.*\r\nU.S. Commercial Service trade professionals in over 100 U.S. cities and in more than 75 markets \r\nhelp U.S. companies get started in exporting or increase sales to global markets.\r\n\r\n*STAY CONNECTED*\r\n\r\nVisit us on Twitter [ https://twitter.com/exportgov ]\xc2\xa0 Connect with us on LinkedIn [ https://www.linkedin.com/company/uscommercialservice/ ]\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nBookmark and Share [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USITATRADE/bulletins/4040a76?reqfrom=share ]\r\n\r\nIf you are ready to begin exporting or expand to additional global markets, \r\nplease contact your nearest U.S. Commercial Service office [ https://www.trade.gov/commercial-services-offices-us ] or access exporting resources [ https://www.trade.gov/learn-how-export ].\r\n\r\n*SUBSCRIBER SERVICES*\r\nVisit our User Profile Page [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USITATRADE/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] to update your subscriptions or unsubscribe.\r\nIf you need assistance, please visit\xc2\xa0subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/hc/en-us ].\r\n\r\n \r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\nThis email was sent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com using GovDelivery Communications Cloud on behalf of the International Trade Administration\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7 1401 Constitution Avenue NW \xc2\xb7 Washington, DC 20230 GovDelivery logo [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/ ] \r\nbody .abe-column-block { min-height: 5px; } table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:10px; margin-right:10px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;} table.govd_hr {min-width: 100%;}\r\n"
