[2026-04-27 10:32:23] Raw text/plain payload: b'US Food and Drug Administration \r\nConstituent Updates\r\n\r\nFDA Human Foods Program\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n*FDA Announces Update from the Canadian Food Inspection Agency (CFIA) on Certificate Requirements** for Certain Meat and Poultry Products* \r\n\r\nJanuary 13, 2026\r\n\r\nThe U.S. Food and Drug Administration (FDA) announces that the Canadian Food Inspection Agency (CFIA) has updated data requirements for official certificates for imports of FDA-regulated products that contain bovine-, porcine-, or poultry-derived ingredients. Effective immediately, CFIA is requiring the following information in addition to the already existing requirements to be included on FDA-issued "Certificate to a Foreign Government" (CFG) destined for Canada. Please refer to the FDA Food Export Library [ https://www.fda.gov/food/exporting-food-products-united-states/food-export-library?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery#Canada ] webpage for more information.\r\n\r\n\r\n  * *Manufacturer/Processor Name and Address:* Applicants must provide the complete name and address of the facility where the product was manufactured/processed. This information verifies the origin of the product. \r\n  * *Exporter Name and Address:* Applicants must provide the complete legal name and physical address of the exporting company. This information identifies the entity responsible for shipping the product from the United States. \r\n\r\nIndustry may request a CFG by submitting an online application in the HFP Export Certification Application and Tracking System (HFP eCATS). Please visit  [ https://www.fda.gov/food/food-export-certificates/online-applications-export-certificates-food?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] for a link to HFP eCATS and general instructions for submitting an application. Please see the links below for a list of certification data elements required by CFIA and instructions on how to provide this information in HFP eCATS.\r\n\r\nAdditional Information\r\n\r\n  * Food Export Library [ https://www.fda.gov/food/exporting-food-products-united-states/food-export-library?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n  * Online Applications for Export Lists [ https://www.fda.gov/food/food-export-lists/online-applications-export-lists?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nfeed [ https://www.fda.gov/about-fda/contact-fda/subscribe-podcasts-and-news-feeds?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]twitter [ https://www.twitter.com/US_FDA?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]facebook [ https://www.facebook.com/FDA?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]Instagram [ https://www.instagram.com/FDA?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]youtube [ https://www.youtube.com/user/USFoodandDrugAdmin?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]flickr [ https://www.flickr.com/photos/fdaphotos/albums/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]  \r\n\r\n*Manage Subscriptions* [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 *Unsubscribe All* [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/subscriber/one_click_unsubscribe?verification=5.ee0243ee8741fe358146537aecf40e1e&destination=jasonnorman66994%40gmail.com ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 *Help* [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/ ]\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\nbody .abe-column-block {min-height: 5px;} td {line-height:1;} \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n This email was sent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com using GovDelivery Communications Cloud on behalf of: U.S. Food and Drug Administration \xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0\r\n10903 New Hampshire Ave\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0Silver Spring, MD \xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0 20993-0002\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa01-888-INFO-FDA GovDelivery logo [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\nbody .abe-column-block { min-height: 5px; } table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:10px; margin-right:10px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;}\r\n'
