[2026-04-27 10:32:28] Raw text/plain payload: b"Easy techniques that can transform your experience from good to great. \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n <https://claude.ai/> \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nGetting better results with Claude \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n <https://claude.ai> \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nAs you get comfortable with Claude, here are 4 easy techniques that can \r\ntransform your experience from good to great. \r\n\r\nChat with Claude  <https://claude.ai> \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nAsk Claude to think out loud \r\nWhen you need help with something complex, try: \xe2\x80\x9cThink through this \r\nstep-by-step\xe2\x80\x9d or \xe2\x80\x9cBreak this down into smaller steps.\xe2\x80\x9d \r\n\r\n\r\n <https://claude.ai> \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n <https://claude.ai> \r\n\r\nAsk Claude to think out loud \r\nWhen you need help with something complex, try: \xe2\x80\x9cThink through this \r\nstep-by-step\xe2\x80\x9d or \xe2\x80\x9cBreak this down into smaller steps.\xe2\x80\x9d \r\n\r\n\r\nBe specific when results are too vague \r\nIf Claude's response isn't quite what you need, add more detail: \xe2\x80\x9cThat's \r\nhelpful, but I need ideas specifically for a family vacation with teenagers, \r\nnot young children.\xe2\x80\x9d \r\n\r\n\r\n <https://claude.ai> \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n <https://claude.ai> \r\n\r\nBe specific when results are too vague \r\nIf Claude's response isn't quite what you need, add more detail: \xe2\x80\x9cThat's \r\nhelpful, but I need ideas specifically for a family vacation with teenagers, \r\nnot young children.\xe2\x80\x9d \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nRefine through conversation \r\nTreat Claude as your creative partner and shape the output together: \xe2\x80\x9cI like \r\nwhere this email draft is going, could you make it more casual and half as \r\nlong?\xe2\x80\x9d \r\n\r\n\r\n <https://claude.ai> \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n <https://claude.ai> \r\n\r\nRefine through conversation \r\nTreat Claude as your creative partner and shape the output together: \xe2\x80\x9cI like \r\nwhere this email draft is going, could you make it more casual and half as \r\nlong?\xe2\x80\x9d \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nSpecify your audience and tone \r\n\xe2\x80\x9cExplain investing to a teenager\xe2\x80\x9d will get very different results than just \r\n\xe2\x80\x9cExplain investing.\xe2\x80\x9d \r\n\r\n\r\n <https://claude.ai> \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n <https://claude.ai> \r\n\r\nSpecify your audience and tone \r\n\xe2\x80\x9cExplain investing to a teenager\xe2\x80\x9d will get very different results than just \r\n\xe2\x80\x9cExplain investing.\xe2\x80\x9d \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThe more you talk to Claude like a thoughtful collaborator, the better your \r\nresults will be! \r\n\r\nChat with Claude  <https://claude.ai/> \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n <https://claude.ai/> \r\n\r\n <https://apps.apple.com/us/app/claude-by-anthropic/id6473753684>  \r\n<https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.anthropic.claude> \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n <https://www.instagram.com/anthropicai/> \r\n\r\n <https://www.linkedin.com/company/anthropicresearch/> \r\n\r\n <https://x.com/anthropicai> \r\n\r\n <https://www.youtube.com/@anthropic-ai> \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nAnthropic PBC, 548 Market St, PMB 90375, San Francisco, CA 94104 \r\nThis email was sent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com. To opt out of future \r\nemails, clickunsubscribe \r\n<http://links.anthropic.com/s/u/GjGRo4NesHfy6CKNAGGDp010cpTcopAel7Tav6G4Z0VHaLQaK2vIgXe1G6MSSt9UdoAbKqh54PfHgUjA3K9B7PsKsVGdnIVaq2HLg5o8hTs-jY64QeIwE2oAopk2Ye86XMQgpW77oWM-xtfhxwMswuJE2XidzoX_5NAw5gA7qsfrbcSwNAoNMe8henXo8Q4L47IAOmIVe9G2Gs5y/LQ72UoQQ6U3NB5fDPp33_Q5_Vx6zAmQq/16>\r\n. "
