[2026-04-27 10:33:01] Raw text/plain payload: b'If your email program has trouble displaying this email, view as a webpage [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/bulletins/40443a7 ].\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nUS Food and Drug Administration \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nFood Business Karison Foods & Snacks Inc Recalls \xe2\x80\x98PANJIRI\xe2\x80\x99, \xe2\x80\x98ALSI PINNI\xe2\x80\x99, \xe2\x80\x98PUNJABI PINNI\xe2\x80\x99, \xe2\x80\x98BESAN LADDOO\xe2\x80\x99, and \xe2\x80\x98NO SUGAR ADDED BESAN LADDOO\xe2\x80\x99 Due to Undeclared Milk Allergen [ https://www.fda.gov/safety/recalls-market-withdrawals-safety-alerts/food-business-karison-foods-snacks-inc-recalls-panjiri-alsi-pinni-punjabi-pinni-besan-laddoo-and-no?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n\r\nKarison Foods & Snacks Inc of Port Washington, NY 11050 is recalling 12 oz containers of \xe2\x80\x98PANJIRI\xe2\x80\x99, \xe2\x80\x98ALSI PINNI\xe2\x80\x99, \xe2\x80\x98PUNJABI PINNI\xe2\x80\x99, \xe2\x80\x98BESAN LADDOO\xe2\x80\x99, and \xe2\x80\x98NO SUGAR ADDED BESAN LADDOO\xe2\x80\x99 due to undeclared milk allergen.\r\n\r\nProduct was distributed in the states of New York, New Jersey, and Virginia through retail stores. The products are packaged in 12 oz clear plastic containers with the respective UPC codes (Panjiri- 897307002437, Alsi Pinni- 897307002512, Punjabi Pinni- 897307002154, Besan Laddoo- 897307002406, No Sugar Added Besan Laddoo- 897307002215) and expiration date Aug 29, 2026.\r\n\r\nNo illnesses have been reported to date. Persons who have an allergy or severe sensitivity to milk run the risk of a serious or life-threatening allergic reaction if they consume this product. During a routine inspection conducted at the firm, it was found that the milk allergen is undeclared on labels.\r\n\r\nView Full Recall [ https://www.fda.gov/safety/recalls-market-withdrawals-safety-alerts/food-business-karison-foods-snacks-inc-recalls-panjiri-alsi-pinni-punjabi-pinni-besan-laddoo-and-no?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n  \r\n \r\n\r\nfeed [ https://www.fda.gov/about-fda/contact-fda/subscribe-podcasts-and-news-feeds?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]twitter [ https://www.twitter.com/US_FDA?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]facebook [ https://www.facebook.com/FDA?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]Instagram [ https://www.instagram.com/FDA?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]youtube [ https://www.youtube.com/user/USFoodandDrugAdmin?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]flickr [ https://www.flickr.com/photos/fdaphotos/albums/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]  \r\n\r\n*Manage Subscriptions* [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 *Unsubscribe All* [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/subscriber/one_click_unsubscribe?verification=5.ee0243ee8741fe358146537aecf40e1e&destination=jasonnorman66994%40gmail.com ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 *Help* [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/ ]\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\nbody .abe-column-block {min-height: 5px;} td {line-height:1;} \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n This email was sent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com using GovDelivery Communications Cloud on behalf of: U.S. Food and Drug Administration \xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0\r\n10903 New Hampshire Ave\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0Silver Spring, MD \xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0 20993-0002\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa01-888-INFO-FDA GovDelivery logo [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\nbody .abe-column-block { min-height: 5px; } table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:10px; margin-right:10px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;}\r\n'
