[2026-04-27 10:33:10] Raw text/plain payload: b'Stories for Jason Norman\r\n@jasonnorman66994 (https://medium.com/@jasonnorman66994?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768362199210-digest.reader-------------------------4d5e2ccc_2947_4323_bfe8_a91024da2031)\r\n\xc2\xb7Become a member (https://medium.com/plans?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768362199210-digest.reader-------------------------4d5e2ccc_2947_4323_bfe8_a91024da2031)\r\n\r\nToday\'s highlights\r\n\r\nDylan Combellick (https://medium.com/@dylan_combellick?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768362199210-digest.reader--7e4345cfddca----0-2------------------4d5e2ccc_2947_4323_bfe8_a91024da2031-1)\r\n\r\nUkraine Update January 12\r\n2026\xe2\x80\x8a-\xe2\x80\x8aIcy Words.\r\n\r\n14 min read\r\n4.9K\r\n50\r\n\r\nMichal Malewicz (https://medium.com/@michalmalewicz?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768362199210-digest.reader--5d98ec9de627----1-102------------------4d5e2ccc_2947_4323_bfe8_a91024da2031-1)\r\n\r\nThe End of Dashboards and Design Systems\r\nDesign is becoming quietly human again.\r\n\r\n8 min read\r\n4.2K\r\n170\r\n\r\nStanley C. (https://medium.com/@stanleyc414?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768362199210-digest.reader--11d06d4a3443----2-108------------------4d5e2ccc_2947_4323_bfe8_a91024da2031-1)\r\n\r\nAs Music Journalists, When Should We Take Breaks?\r\nA guide to building self-care and strategy through\xe2\x80\xa6\r\n\r\n9 min read\r\n135\r\n1\r\n\r\nJahanzaib Ranjha (https://medium.com/@jahanzaib-ranjha?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768362199210-digest.reader-48e972f5c24e-6b8f165a587d----3-1------------------4d5e2ccc_2947_4323_bfe8_a91024da2031-1)\r\ninBootcamp (https://medium.com/design-bootcamp?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768362199210-digest.reader-48e972f5c24e-6b8f165a587d----3-1------------------4d5e2ccc_2947_4323_bfe8_a91024da2031-1)\r\n\r\nI Thought I Was Writing Content. I Was Actually Testing Ideas.\r\nHow daily posting quietly changed how I build products\r\n\r\n3 min read\r\n358\r\n3\r\n\r\nSam Liberty (https://medium.com/@