[2026-04-27 10:33:12] Raw text/plain payload: b'2026 -\r\nUkraine Update January 14\r\n\r\n2026 -\r\n\r\nDylan Combellick (https://medium.com/@dylan_combellick?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768380007311-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------d89718df_0012_40a9_866a_d9ee487842b6--------354e45830cd6)\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nJanuary 14, 2026\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\n12 min read\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nView on Medium (https://medium.com/p/216cbe26c23b?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768380007311-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------d89718df_0012_40a9_866a_d9ee487842b6--------354e45830cd6)\r\n\r\nUS State Department warns citizens to leave Iran. Which brings me to the question, WHY ARE THEY IN IRAN TO BEGIN WITH?! Don\'t go to Iran or Russia, ever. Or North Korea.\r\n\r\nOr Jacksonville. But not for the same reason.\r\n\r\n-\xe2\x80\x8a-\xe2\x80\x8a-\r\n\r\nDrill, Baby, Drill?\r\n\r\nCould the collapse of the Iranian government cause oil prices to fall? Dare I say prices might "collapse?"\r\n\r\nThere are many reasons this might happen.\r\n\r\nFirst, Iran is sanctioned, and has 170 million barrels in storage at sea (http://redirect.medium.systems/r-DsTmP9LDqp?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768380007311-newsletter.subscribeToProfile--216cbe26c23b-----------------------d89718df_0012_40a9_866a_d9ee487842b6--------354e45830cd6)\r\n. Should a new, legitimate government come to power, that oil can flood the market.\xc2\xa0\xe2\x80\xa6\r\n\r\nContinue reading (https://medium.com/p/216cbe26c23b?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768380007311-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------d89718df_0012_40a9_866a_d9ee487842b6--------354e45830cd6)\r\nThis is a member-only story and can only be read on Medium.\r\n\r\nSent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com by Dylan Combellick on Medium\r\nUnsubscribe (https://medium.com/me/email-settings/50207bf5a022/9f4696b0a58b?type=noSetting&newsletterV3Id=3