[2026-04-27 10:33:25] Raw text/plain payload: b'Jasonnorman, it all goes back to normal on Friday.\r\n\r\nJasonnorman, the end is finally here.\r\n\r\nThe last day of Educative\'s Resolution Sale is Thursday. On Friday, your Year End pricing will disappear... for another year.\r\n\r\nBut for the next 24 hours, you can use your link below to lock in the best offer you\'ll see this year:\r\n\r\nLock In Your Offer\r\n(https://learn.educative.io/e3t/Ctc/RG+113/cz5H404/VVp5hb8qyY2_W2wjqcs80Z1wJW2VV8NG5Jhgh6N7KkK2l3prCCW8wLKSR6lZ3k_VtrBsl997Fj4W1QHQYf3Yj0R3VQJ1zY80RPF5W2h9FB43wtKZRW3TyGwH2C3j-HW3NYqKH7XZ5Q4W3SRMTm35LyBxW5Czh0n93X-_XW4vYd-k8Z03PkN2s58ChWZyC6N1Kc7pmQ3nw_W8q46fk2tX6yXW8BH8mg9jxt-mW791TC418ff9yW7Mj1SZ4YWbv1W99vXl92y63LkW3bS5tX9lDzLyW19xd7X7X99W7N7Ybw5dFK80mW40WR382bs3mqW99qxbY6Mfx_FW41WQtx8qv3CWW6V1ynF8-wY7yVjf8HW5lN6bvN2cygPTGlX1KW7zr3P215fn_XN7s4Nk-fL4fJW1P7rGF8FzjT9f3SrWss04 )\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nRemember, with your Educative subscription, you\'ll get:\r\n\r\n- 1401+ Courses & Projects to get hands-on with hireable skills:\r\n\r\n- System Design (including Grokking the Modern System Design Interview)\r\n- Generative AI (MCP, LLMs, RAG, and more)\r\n- Coding Interview Prep\r\n- Machine Learning & Data Science\r\n- Web Development\r\n- ... and more\r\n\r\n- 201+ AWS Cloud Labs to master industry-standard cloud services\r\n\r\n- Project-based learning \xe2\x80\x94 with no downloads, setup, or hassle\r\n- Cloud Labs are included in our Premium Plus plan, which is available to you at a huge discount right now\r\n- \xe2\xad\x90 We recently added 50+ Cloud Labs Challenges and the Cloud Labs Assistant to get even more value out of your experience!\r\n\r\n- AI Mock Interviews for on-demand interview practice\r\n\r\n- My personal favorite way to put your technical skills to the test \xe2\x80\x94 you can try it with every technical loop: Coding Interviews, System Design, Object Oriented Design, and more\r\n\r\nLock in your Year End offer PLUS a bonus Holiday Gift with the link below:\xf0\x9f\x91\x87\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nLock In Your Offer\r\n(https://learn.educative.io/e3t/Ctc/RG+113/cz5H404/VVp5hb8qyY2_W2wjqcs80Z1wJW2VV8NG5Jhgh6N7KkK2l3prCCW8wLKSR6lZ3k_VtrBsl997Fj4W1QHQYf3Yj0R3VQJ1zY80RPF5W2h9FB43wtKZRW3TyGwH2C3j-HW3NYqKH7XZ5Q4W3SRMTm35LyBxW5Czh0n93X-_XW4vYd-k8Z03PkN2s58ChWZyC6N1Kc7pmQ3nw_W8q46fk2tX6yXW8BH8mg9jxt-mW791TC418ff9yW7Mj1SZ4YWbv1W99vXl92y63LkW3bS5tX9lDzLyW19xd7X7X99W7N7Ybw5dFK80mW40WR382bs3mqW99qxbY6Mfx_FW41WQtx8qv3CWW6V1ynF8-wY7yVjf8HW5lN6bvN2cygPTGlX1KW7zr3P215fn_XN7s4Nk-fL4fJW1P7rGF8FzjT9f3SrWss04 )\r\n\r\n\xf0\x9f\x9a\x80 2.9 million developers love learning with Educative\r\n\r\nAccess 1401+ AI-powered courses & projects \xe2\x80\x94 from Interview Prep & System Design to Data Science & GenAI.\r\n\r\nRashid Ali (https://learn.educative.io/e3t/Ctc/RG+113/cz5H404/VVp5hb8qyY2_W2wjqcs80Z1wJW2VV8NG5Jhgh6N7KkK223prCCW7Y8-PT6lZ3plW5FWPs18cY5vNW50r_D-47y_TXW45B_7F7XC9fYW8zHt661C5Lk8W4zxXhS41JW75VVy76J3XJM4nW20v0V52rQsV3W7ZDYwh3Xbc55W4RrFn55G8ZXWW1B27T-18gBt2V33Q5Z8vDbv7W4PWyZ58dlHbkW26yLl67NcBcXW5Xq4Wv3FHGKbN6RFPmYF08yrW3lS-6J2pp6KsW4bg9XC8zPd-sW7-STvx7qBql6N4bR8J_sVwMmW3GMzhX4gnMnKW4cDb4k6s4Gr8N8SPHQTrg1ccW8F-k8S4HGLt3W9249KQ2NcRk0N27F7lMs4N8_W3tfFQq8SWxj0dDY9kK04 )\r\n\r\nBusiness Intelligence Analyst @ Audi AG\r\n\r\n"The quality of learning material on Educative has impressed me the most. I found courses matching all skill levels (beginner to advanced) for almost all important skills and tools for me. I was initially skeptical about the courses having no videos, but eventually found it time saving and efficient."\r\n\r\n"The different skill paths are amazing and WAYYYYY better than any video course you can find anywhere else. The text format is amazing and means you can get through content much faster. The new mock interview function really helps me calm my nerves for the real ones."\r\n\r\nViljen Apalset Vassb\xc3\xb8 (https://learn.educative.io/e3t/Ctc/RG+113/cz5H404/VVp5hb8qyY2_W2wjqcs80Z1wJW2VV8NG5Jhgh6N7KkK2l3prCCW8wLKSR