[2026-04-27 10:33:28] Raw text/plain payload: b"Join the U.S. Commercial Service for a Free Webinar on Supplier Sourcing  \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nGlobal Advanced Manufacturing Team Banner [ https://www.trade.gov/advanced-manufacturing-industry ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nMade in America: Building Supply Chains with U.S. Manufacturing Partners\r\n\r\n*January 21, 2026 | 1pm ET | Virtual*\r\n\r\n*Register* [ https://events.gcc.teams.microsoft.com/event/3450f59a-a325-4cb1-ad33-9ca72efb7e6e@a1d183f2-6c7b-4d9a-b994-5f2f31b3f780 ] \r\n \r\n\r\nJoin the U.S. Commercial Service and *Sustainment* [ https://www.sustainment.com/ ] for a webinar that will transform how you source, connect, and grow your supply chain network!\r\n\r\nIn today's dynamic economic landscape, finding reliable and efficient U.S. manufacturers is more critical than ever. This exclusive session is your gateway to:\r\n\r\n\r\n  * Learn proven strategies for identifying and vetting top-tier U.S. manufacturers \r\n  * Navigate the challenges of local sourcing with expert insights \r\n  * Build mutually beneficial partnerships that drive growth and innovation \r\n  * Discuss real-world success stories from businesses that have mastered domestic supplier networks \r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nMade in America Webinar Cover \r\n\r\nWhether you're looking to find exceptional U.S. manufacturers or showcase your own products, this is your opportunity to expand your network and strengthen American industrial partnerships.\r\n\r\n*Agenda:*\r\n\r\n\r\n  * U.S. Commercial Service Introduction \r\n  * Sustainment Platform Overview \r\n  * MEP Supplier Scouting Services with *Manufacturer's Edge [ https://manufacturersedge.com/ ]* \r\n  * U.S. Company Success Story \r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*Register FREE* [ https://events.gcc.teams.microsoft.com/event/3450f59a-a325-4cb1-ad33-9ca72efb7e6e@a1d183f2-6c7b-4d9a-b994-5f2f31b3f780 ] \r\n \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nThank You to Our Co-Organizers\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nSustainment Logo \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n  \r\n \r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n* International Trade Administration*\xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0United States Commercial Service, International Trade Administration [ https://www.trade.gov/us-commercial-service ]*\r\n [ https://www.trade.gov/us-commercial-service ]*  \r\n\r\nThe U.S. Commercial Service is the trade promotion arm of the\r\n*U.S. Department of Commerce's International Trade Administration.*\r\nU.S. Commercial Service trade professionals in over 100 U.S. cities and in more than 75 markets \r\nhelp U.S. companies get started in exporting or increase sales to global markets.\r\n\r\n*STAY CONNECTED*\r\n\r\nVisit us on X [ https://twitter.com/exportgov ]\xc2\xa0 Connect with us on LinkedIn [ https://www.linkedin.com/company/uscommercialservice/ ]\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nBookmark and Share [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USITATRADE/bulletins/4043a3f?reqfrom=share ]\r\n\r\nIf you are ready to begin exporting or expand to additional global markets, \r\nplease contact your nearest U.S. Commercial Service office [ https://www.trade.gov/commercial-services-offices-us ]\r\nor check out our online EXPORT SOLUTIONS [ https://www.trade.gov/export-solutions ].\r\n\r\n*SUBSCRIBER SERVICES*\r\nVisit our User Profile Page [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USITATRADE/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] to update your subscriptions or unsubscribe.\r\nIf you need assistance, please visit\xc2\xa0subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/hc/en-us ].\r\n\r\n \r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\nThis email was sent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com using GovDelivery Communications Cloud on behalf of the International Trade Administration\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7 1401 Constitution Avenue NW \xc2\xb7 Washington, DC 20230 GovDelivery logo [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/ ] \r\nbody .abe-column-block { min-height: 5px; } table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:10px; margin-right:10px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;} table.govd_hr {min-width: 100%;}\r\n"
