[2026-04-27 10:33:30] Raw text/plain payload: b"Home repair information, birth certificate and marriage license records, LGBTQ+ resources, and more.  \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nView as a webpage / Share [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/NJGOV/bulletins/4045f18 ]\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nState of New Jersey Updates\r\n\r\n State of New Jersey [ https://nj.gov/governor/?utm_campaign=statewidewelcome&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]  \r\n\r\nIn previous emails, we've mentioned the key digital services and assistance with basic needs that are available in New Jersey. Additional services from the State are available online or via telephone. Here are a few of the more widely-used services.\r\n\r\nDrugs [ https://www.nj.gov/humanservices/reachnj/?utm_campaign=statewidewelcome&utm_content=m3&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery&utm_term=pubhealth ] \r\n\r\nHelp with Drug and Alcohol Abuse: Help with substance abuse is available 24/7 from*\xc2\xa0ReachNJ.gov [ https://www.nj.gov/humanservices/reachnj/?utm_campaign=statewidewelcome&utm_content=m3&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery&utm_term=pubhealth ].\r\n*\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nPhone [ https://www.nj211.org/?utm_campaign=statewidewelcome&utm_content=m3&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery&utm_term=ben ] \r\n\r\nGeneral Assistance:\xc2\xa0*NJ 211 [ https://www.nj211.org/?utm_campaign=statewidewelcome&utm_content=m3&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery&utm_term=ben ]*\xc2\xa0offers statewide information about health and human services, government programs, and local community resources. *Dial 2-1-1 [ tel:211 ]* for assistance.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nHouse energy [ https://njcleanenergy.com/residential/cp?utm_campaign=statewidewelcome&utm_content=m3&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery&utm_term=env ] \r\n\r\n*Comfort Partners [ https://njcleanenergy.com/residential/cp?utm_campaign=statewidewelcome&utm_content=m3&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery&utm_term=env ]*\xc2\xa0provides free and low-cost repairs to bring down energy costs in your home.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nPride flag [ https://www.info.nj.gov/transgender?utm_campaign=statewidewelcome&utm_content=m3&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery&utm_term=pubhealth ] \r\n\r\nHelp for the Transgender and Non-Binary Community: Members of the transgender community can find information about name changes, legal protections, and other resources at\xc2\xa0*Transgender.NJ.gov [ https://www.info.nj.gov/transgender?utm_campaign=statewidewelcome&utm_content=m3&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery&utm_term=pubhealth ].\r\n*\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nBirth certificate [ https://www.nj.gov/health/vital?utm_campaign=statewidewelcome&utm_content=m3&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery&utm_term=pubhealth ] \r\n\r\nBirth Certificate and Marriage License Records: Vital records such as birth certificates and marriage licenses\xc2\xa0*are obtainable online from the Department of Health [ https://www.nj.gov/health/vital?utm_campaign=statewidewelcome&utm_content=m3&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery&utm_term=pubhealth ].\r\n*\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nOnline guide [ https://nj.gov/humanservices/dds/documents/RD/2024/NJ_Resources_2024_First_Edition.pdf?utm_campaign=statewidewelcome&utm_content=m3&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery&utm_term=ben ] \r\n\r\nAdditional Services: the Department of Human Services publishes\xc2\xa0*a periodically updated guide to state services [ https://nj.gov/humanservices/dds/documents/RD/2024/NJ_Resources_2024_First_Edition.pdf?utm_campaign=statewidewelcome&utm_content=m3&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery&utm_term=ben ].*\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nYou're receiving this one-time message because you signed up recently for the State of New Jersey Updates newsletter from NJ.gov.\r\n\r\n   \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nStay Connected with The State of New Jersey: Facebook [ https://www.facebook.com/governorphilmurphy/?utm_campaign=statewidewelcome&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\xc2\xa0 X [ https://twitter.com/GovMurphy?utm_campaign=statewidewelcome&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\xc2\xa0 Instagram [ https://www.instagram.com/govmurphy/?utm_campaign=statewidewelcome&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\xc2\xa0 SUBSCRIBER SERVICES:\r\nManage Subscriptions [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/NJGOV/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ]\xc2\xa0 |\xc2\xa0 Help [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/ ]  \r\nbody .abe-column-block {min-height: 0px;} \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n This email was sent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com using GovDelivery Communications Cloud on behalf of: The State of New Jersey \xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0\r\nPO Box 001\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7 Trenton, NJ 08625 GovDelivery logo [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/?utm_campaign=statewidewelcome&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n"
