!important; text-align:left; } table#yahoo #main-header .govd_template_image { max-width: 480px !important; width: 100% !important; } table#yahoo .govd_content_container .govd_image_display { margin-left:0 !important; } table#yahoo .container-fill, table.gd_tbl_wrap, table.gd_tbl_wrap table { max-width: 480px !important; } .main-table, .mobile-footer, .mobile-tagline, table.gd_tbl_wrap, table.gd_tbl_wrap table { width:100% !important; min-width:100% !important; max-width:480px !important; } table#yahoo .tablecell, .tablecell { width:100% !important; display: block !important; } table#yahoo p, table#yahoo p span, table#yahoo .gd_p, table#yahoo li { font-size:13pt !important; } table#yahoo #view-in-browser p, table#yahoo #view-in-browser p span, table#yahoo #view-in-browser .gd_p, table#yahoo #view-in-browser li { font-size:8pt !important; } table#yahoo h1 { font-size:18pt !important; } table#yahoo h2 { font-size:16pt !important; } table#yahoo h3 { font-size:14pt !important; } table#yahoo #main-body .govd_hr {background:transparent none !important;} .mobile-hide {display:none !important;} .mobile-padding {padding:0 !important;} .mobile-columns {padding:10px 20px !important;} } --&amp;amp;gt; \r\nYou have signed up to receive updates from the Census Bureau when we publish new information on Business Formation Statistics. Here\'s the latest update. \r\n\r\nUnited States Census Bureau [ https://www.census.gov/economic-indicators/?utm_campaign=&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\nEconomic Indicator Updates\r\n\r\nYou have signed up to receive updates from the Census Bureau when\xc2\xa0we publish new information on Business Formation Statistics. See below or visit the\xc2\xa0Economic Indicators page [ https://www.census.gov/economic-indicators/?utm_campaign=&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] to learn more.\r\n\r\n*Business Formation Statistics [ https://www.census.gov/economic-indicators/?utm_campaign=&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]*\r\n\r\n01/14/2026 10:00 AM EST Total U.S. Business Applications were 497,046 in December 2025, down 7.3% from November 2025. \r\n\r\nDecember 2025: -7.3\xc2\xb0 % Change\r\nNovember 2025 (r): +7.7\xc2\xb0 % Change\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n"(\xc2\xb0) Statistical significance is not applicable or not measurable."\r\n\r\n"(r) Revised."\r\n\r\n"Estimates are adjusted for seasonal variation but not for price changes."  \r\n \r\n\r\n*Help us spread the word about Census Bureau data.*\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nShare this on social media or forward it to a friend.\r\n\r\nShare This [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USCENSUS/bulletins/4045ef0 ]\r\n\r\n \r\nAbout the Census Bureau\r\n\r\nWe serve as the nation\xe2\x80\x99s leading provider of quality data about its people and economy.\xc2\xa0The Census Bureau is the federal government\'s largest statistical agency. As the world\xe2\x80\x99s premier statistical agency, we are dedicated to making our nation a better place. Policy-makers, businesses, and the public use our data to make informed decisions.\r\n\r\n \xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0 \r\n \r\n\xc2\xa0 \r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*Stay connected with us!*\r\n\r\nJoin the conversation on social media.\r\n\r\n facebook [ https://www.facebook.com/uscensusbureau/?utm_campaign=&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]instagram [ https://www.instagram.com/uscensusbureau/?utm_campaign=&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]linkedin [ https://www.linkedin.com/company/us-census-bureau/?utm_campaign=&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]twitter [ https://twitter.com/uscensusbureau/?utm_campaign=&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] [ https://www.linkedin.com/company/us-census-bureau/?utm_campaign=&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]youtube [ https://www.youtube.com/user/uscensusbureau/?utm_campaign=&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]  \r\n\r\nSUBSCRIBER SERVICES:\r\n\r\nSubscriber Settings [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USCENSUS/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 Remove me from All Subscriptions  [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USCENSUS/subscriber/one_click_unsubscribe?verification=5.76359f46a06559a62e8e0404a80cc7e5&destination=jasonnorman66994%40gmail.com ]\xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0Help [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/ ]\r\n\r\n \r\n&amp;lt;!-- /* template top padding on mobile */ @media only screen and (max-width: 480px) { table#flexible-abe-main-table { padding:0 !important; } } --&amp;gt; ________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\nThis is an official email from the U.S. Census Bureau. If you have any questions or comments, please contact us (http://www.census.gov/about/contact-us.html [ http://www.census.gov/about/contact-us.html?utm_campaign=&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]).  \xc2\xa0 \r\nbody .abe-column-block {min-height: 5px;} table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:7px; margin-right:7px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;}\r\n'
