[2026-04-27 10:33:34] Raw text/plain payload: b"<https://app.news.filestack.com/e/er?s=608&lid=84989&elqTrackId=016340450E57CF7089177010EF599826&elq=fc053f4baecb4cd59b491f2b6b8222ad&elqaid=67028&elqat=1&elqak=8AF5F396F31DD3BC83140E541D7A08DAB35490E11D3EC008D1CA0CA5020DD775FA03>                                                               \r\n\r\n<https://app.news.filestack.com/e/er?s=608&lid=84988&elqTrackId=AE6152C4A4D3BAC297671C54CFA27E10&elq=fc053f4baecb4cd59b491f2b6b8222ad&elqaid=67028&elqat=1&elqak=8AF581713506A31D1D486FD6160FE6B45B2390E11D3EC008D1CA0CA5020DD775FA03>                                                               \r\n\r\nHi Jason,\r\n\r\nOur file automation webinar <https://app.news.filestack.com/e/er?s=608&lid=84988&elqTrackId=8B3209F1DB6893073C100A5AA83ED957&elq=fc053f4baecb4cd59b491f2b6b8222ad&elqaid=67028&elqat=1&elqak=8AF51DF965A29F6348C7FEEA0E9E607CF93990E11D3EC008D1CA0CA5020DD775FA03> is tomorrow. If you've been meaning to register, this is your last chance.\r\n\r\nQuick agenda rundown:\r\n\r\n0:00\r\n\r\nOverview: moving file processing out of your codebase\r\n\r\n0:10\r\n\r\nEdTech demo: content safety, virus scanning, compliance checks\r\n\r\n0:24\r\n\r\nStartup demo: user uploads with automatic optimization and routing\r\n\r\n0:33\r\n\r\nPrint service demo: document conversion and DPI validation\r\n\r\n0:42\r\n\r\nAutomation checklist: what you can chain together\r\n\r\n0:50\r\n\r\nQ&A\r\n\r\nAfter the session, you'll get:\r\n*Recording (if you can't make it live)\r\n*GitHub repo with all three demo applications\r\n*Pipeline templates you can import into your dashboard\r\n\r\n50 minutes. Three working applications. Code you can reference for your own refactoring.\r\n\r\nRegister for Tomorrow <https://app.news.filestack.com/e/er?s=608&lid=84988&elqTrackId=140D9686CC0094C11EB5FE9C7C8E4776&elq=fc053f4baecb4cd59b491f2b6b8222ad&elqaid=67028&elqat=1&elqak=8AF542E92545DA49495792AA366C74410E4590E11D3EC008D1CA0CA5020DD775FA03>                      \r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nAlready registered? Check your inbox for the calendar invite and join link. See you tomorrow.\r\n\r\nBest,\r\n\r\nThe Filestack Team\r\n\r\nVIEW ONLINE <https://app.news.filestack.com/e/es?s=608&e=11800444&elqTrackId=25CD2098256099B031823399FC64C7A2&elq=fc053f4baecb4cd59b491f2b6b8222ad&elqaid=67028&elqat=1&elqak=8AF524A1369E7FFC41C960A9EBF05A22DDC890E11D3EC008D1CA0CA5020DD775FA03>\r\n\r\n10801 N Mopac Expressway | Building 1, Suite 100 | Austin | TX | 78759  \r\n\r\nYou received this email because you are subscribed to Marketing Information from Filestack .\r\n\r\nUnsubscribe <https://app.news.filestack.com/e/cu?s=608&elqc=1905&elq=fc053f4baecb4cd59b491f2b6b8222ad&elqak=8AF543DB6BFF339ECED65ADCE73FFC3BBD9990E11D3EC008D1CA0CA5020DD775FA03> | Privacy Policy <https://app.news.filestack.com/e/er?s=608&lid=57680&elqTrackId=48F194D4DB630A3692A21E20B4DDFC48&elq=fc053f4baecb4cd59b491f2b6b8222ad&elqaid=67028&elqat=1&elqak=8AF51EF184D71BCFD6F687E248F4C011C45F90E11D3EC008D1CA0CA5020DD775FA03>"
