[2026-04-27 10:33:47] Raw text/plain payload: b'"Receive this email as a forward? Subscribe to CDER SBIA industry updates. [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/subscriber/new?topic_id=USFDA_352 ]"\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nBanner\r\nFDA | CDER | Small Business and Industry Assistance\r\n\r\nINDUSTRY NEWS\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\n.\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nBookmark and Share [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/bulletins/4045c1b?reqfrom=share ]\r\n\r\nConstituent Update:\r\n\r\nFDA and EMA Release Guiding Principles of\r\n\r\nGood AI Practice in Drug Development\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nJanuary 14, 2026\r\n\r\nToday, after several months of collaboration, the FDA and the European Medicines Agency (EMA) are releasing a common set of 10 guiding principles [ https://www.fda.gov/about-fda/artificial-intelligence-drug-development/guiding-principles-good-ai-practice-drug-development?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] to inform, enhance, and promote the use of artificial intelligence (AI) for generating evidence across all phases of the drug product life cycle.\r\n\r\nThe integration of AI in drug development has the potential to transform the way drugs are developed and evaluated, ultimately improving health care. AI technologies are anticipated to help promote innovation, reduce time-to-market, strengthen regulatory excellence and pharmacovigilance, and decrease reliance on animal testing by improving the prediction of toxicity and efficacy in humans.\r\n\r\nThese 10 guiding principles lay the foundation for developing good practice that addresses the unique nature of these technologies and identifies areas for potential collaboration by international regulators, international standards organizations, and other collaborative bodies.\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nThe Small Business and Industry Assistance (SBIA) program in the Center for Drug Evaluation and Research provides guidance, education [ https://lnks.gd/l/eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJidWxsZXRpbl9saW5rX2lkIjoxMTYsInVyaSI6ImJwMjpjbGljayIsInVybCI6Imh0dHBzOi8vd3d3LmZkYS5nb3YvY2RlcnNiaWFsZWFybj91dG1fbWVkaXVtPWVtYWlsJnV0bV9zb3VyY2U9Z292ZGVsaXZlcnkiLCJidWxsZXRpbl9pZCI6IjIwMjQwNDA0LjkyODcwNjExIn0.bvTTMrV69vNEv9jQ5ie7cvbfajxuiLzwmIntCGYThWs/s/2605691806/br/240159884453-l?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] and updates for regulated industry.\r\n\r\n\r\n  * Register for Upcoming Training [ https://lnks.gd/l/eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJidWxsZXRpbl9saW5rX2lkIjoxMTcsInVyaSI6ImJwMjpjbGljayIsInVybCI6Imh0dHBzOi8vd3d3LmZkYS5nb3YvY2RlcnNiaWE_dXRtX21lZGl1bT1lbWFpbCZ1dG1fc291cmNlPWdvdmRlbGl2ZXJ5IiwiYnVsbGV0aW5faWQiOiIyMDI0MDQwNC45Mjg3MDYxMSJ9.m3W4Q5TmF7U4ze9XjN70rDHKjEiEdJV6Fk6U2bPc2p4/s/2605691806/br/240159884453-l?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n  * View the SBIA 2024 YouTube Playlist [ https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLey4Qe-Uxcxaf1HvpvnKO8-n8u9QW412g&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n  * View the SBIA 2025 YouTube Playlist [ https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLey4Qe-Uxcxa5NzgN2UeQcHqklugEvBje&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n  * Subscribe to CDER SBIA Email Updates [ https://lnks.gd/l/eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJidWxsZXRpbl9saW5rX2lkIjoxMTksInVyaSI6ImJwMjpjbGljayIsInVybCI6Imh0dHBzOi8vcHVibGljLmdvdmRlbGl2ZXJ5LmNvbS9hY2NvdW50cy9VU0ZEQS9zdWJzY3JpYmVyL25ldz90b3BpY19pZD1VU0ZEQV8zNTIiLCJidWxsZXRpbl9pZCI6IjIwMjQwNDA0LjkyODcwNjExIn0.rkzrgB5T3o3MggEWrk43morjHQ6oyfX2_lm3997kshs/s/2605691806/br/240159884453-l?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n  * Connect on LinkedIn [ https://lnks.gd/l/eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJidWxsZXRpbl9saW5rX2lkIjoxMjAsInVyaSI6ImJwMjpjbGljayIsInVybCI6Imh0dHBzOi8vd3d3LmxpbmtlZGluLmNvbS9zaG93Y2FzZS9jZGVyLXNtYWxsLWJ1c2luZXNzLWFuZC1pbmR1c3RyeS1hc3Npc3RhbmNlP3V0bV9tZWRpdW09ZW1haWwmdXRtX3NvdXJjZT1nb3ZkZWxpdmVyeSIsImJ1bGxldGluX2lkIjoiMjAyND