[2026-04-27 10:34:00] Raw text/plain payload: b"What we did with freedom.\r\nFeminism Won, and We're All Still Miserable.\r\n\r\nWhat we did with freedom.\r\n\r\nJonatha Czajkiewicz (https://medium.com/@jonathacz99?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768412320397-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------39085da5_1c8b_4d08_9abc_f85bd0d6b7ba--------31025c3990ac)\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nJanuary 14, 2026\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\n6 min read\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nView on Medium (https://medium.com/p/5cf68110cfcf?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768412320397-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------39085da5_1c8b_4d08_9abc_f85bd0d6b7ba--------31025c3990ac)\r\n\r\nI saw a woman on LinkedIn announce that her word for 2026 is ease.\r\n\r\nShe wrote 400 words about it, formatted for engagement, with a call-to-action at the bottom. She's selling courses on how to stop hustling, with a post scheduled for optimal reach.\r\n\r\nShe's not a villain.\r\n\r\nShe's the symptom, doing exactly what the system trained her to do. Turn insight into content, turn struggle into her story arc, and turn peace into a product to be monetized. Even the escape from performance has become a performance. Breakdowns get optimized, and the rest gets branded. Ease as a product.\r\n\r\n\xe2\x80\xa6\r\n\r\nContinue reading (https://medium.com/p/5cf68110cfcf?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768412320397-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------39085da5_1c8b_4d08_9abc_f85bd0d6b7ba--------31025c3990ac)\r\nThis is a member-only story and can only be read on Medium.\r\n\r\nSent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com by Jonatha Czajkiewicz on Medium\r\nUnsubscribe (https://medium.com/me/email-settings/50207bf5a022/49cf3c7dc5c4?type=noSetting&newsletterV3Id=31025c3990ac&source=email-50207bf5a022-1768412320397-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------39085da5_1c8b_4d08_9abc_f85bd0d6b7ba--------31025c3990ac)\r\n from this writer's email notifications\r\nManage your email settings (https://medium.com/me/settings/notifications?hash=49cf3c7dc5c4&userId=50207bf5a022&settingsRouteHash=%23manageSubscriptions&source=email-50207bf5a022-1768412320397-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------39085da5_1c8b_4d08_9abc_f85bd0d6b7ba--------31025c3990ac)\r\n\r\n3500 South DuPont Highway, Suite IQ-101, Dover,\xc2\xa0DE\xc2\xa019901\r\nCareers (https://medium.com/jobs-at-medium/work-at-medium-959d1a85284e?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768412320397-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------39085da5_1c8b_4d08_9abc_f85bd0d6b7ba--------31025c3990ac)\r\n\xc2\xb7Help Center (https://help.medium.com/hc/en-us?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768412320397-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------39085da5_1c8b_4d08_9abc_f85bd0d6b7ba--------31025c3990ac)\r\n\xc2\xb7Privacy Policy (https://policy.medium.com/medium-privacy-policy-f03bf92035c9?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768412320397-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------39085da5_1c8b_4d08_9abc_f85bd0d6b7ba--------31025c3990ac)\r\n\xc2\xb7Terms of service (https://policy.medium.com/medium-terms-of-service-9db0094a1e0f?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768412320397-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------39085da5_1c8b_4d08_9abc_f85bd0d6b7ba--------31025c3990ac)"
