[2026-04-27 10:34:04] Raw text/plain payload: b'Also in this issue: fire safety research at NIST  \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nn i s t  \r\n \r\n\r\nView as a Web Page [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USNIST/bulletins/404325c ]\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\ntech beat  \r\nA biweekly news digest from the\r\nNational Institute of Standards and Technology\r\n \r\n\r\nJANUARY 14, 2026\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nA sliver of moon is visible in the sky during sunset over mountains. [ https://www.nist.gov/time-frequency/what-determines-length-day ] \r\n \r\n\r\nWhat Determines the Length of the Day? \r\n\r\nYou may be surprised to learn how many factors can affect what may seem like a fixed interval of time.\r\n\r\nREAD MORE [ https://www.nist.gov/time-frequency/what-determines-length-day ]\r\n \r\n \r\nRam Sriram poses smiling for a head shot outdoors on the NIST campus. [ https://www.nist.gov/blogs/taking-measure/ai-doctors-office-how-standards-can-support-trustworthiness ] \r\n \r\n\r\nAI in the Doctor\xe2\x80\x99s Office: How Standards Can Support Trustworthiness \r\n\r\nA NIST researcher explains why AI needs useful, thoughtful standards if it is to work reliably in health care \xe2\x80\x94 or any other field.\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nREAD MORE [ https://www.nist.gov/blogs/taking-measure/ai-doctors-office-how-standards-can-support-trustworthiness ]\r\n \r\n \r\nAndrew Iams wears safety glasses as his face is framed in an opening between two horizontal pieces of equipment in the lab.  [ https://www.nist.gov/blogs/taking-measure/taking-measure-celebrates-10-years-science-and-stories ] \r\n \r\n\r\nTaking Measure Celebrates 10 Years of Science and Stories \r\n\r\nFor the past decade, NIST\xe2\x80\x99s main blog has featured hundreds of voices telling the stories behind the groundbreaking research we do at our agency.\r\n\r\nREAD MORE [ https://www.nist.gov/blogs/taking-measure/taking-measure-celebrates-10-years-science-and-stories ]\r\n \r\n \r\n  \r\n\r\nPaper  \r\nMORE NEWS FROM NIST\r\n \r\n\r\nCAISI Issues Request for Information About Securing AI Agent Systems [ https://www.nist.gov/news-events/news/2026/01/caisi-issues-request-information-about-securing-ai-agent-systems ]\r\n\r\nThe Center for AI Standards and Innovation at NIST is seeking insights from industry, academia and the security community on the secure development and deployment of AI agent systems.\r\n\r\n  \r\n A NIST firefighter in safety gear watches a shed burn next to a structure representing a wall of a residence during an experiment. [ https://www.nist.gov/fire/history ]\r\n\r\nAnnual U.S. fire fatalities have decreased by more than 50% since the Federal Fire Prevention and Control Act was passed in 1974. NIST\xe2\x80\x99s fire research [ https://www.nist.gov/fire/history ] has played a crucial role in saving thousands of lives annually.\r\n\r\n \r\nFor Good Measure\r\n\r\nWhen we started Taking Measure [ https://www.nist.gov/blogs/taking-measure?utm_source=govdelivery&utm_medium=email&utm_id=techbeat_01132026&utm_content=editor_note ] in January 2016 to offer people in the NIST community the opportunity to describe their work in their own voices, some colleagues were concerned that we would run out of blog authors within the year. Others thought that blogs were an antiquated content form, as they were invented before modern social media and podcasts. Hundreds of blog posts later [ https://www.nist.gov/blogs/taking-measure/taking-measure-celebrates-10-years-science-and-stories?utm_source=govdelivery&utm_medium=email&utm_id=techbeat_01132026&utm_content=editor_note ], Taking Measure remains a vibrant platform for NISTers to communicate their discoveries and insights on everything from quantum mechanics [ https://www.nist.gov/blogs/taking-measure/5-concepts-can-help-you-understand-quantum-mechanics-and-technology-without?utm_source=govdelivery&utm_medium=email&utm_id=techbeat_01132026&utm_content=editor_note ] to living cells [ https://www.nist.gov/blogs/taking-measure/how-henrietta-lacks-changed-my-view-human-cells-physicist?utm_source=govdelivery&utm_medium=email&utm_id=techbeat_01132026&utm_content=editor_note ]. I invite you to sign up for the Taking Measure mailing list [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USNIST/subscriber/topics?topic_id=USNIST_309 ] if you are not already a subscriber and visit the blog [ https://www.nist.gov/blogs/taking-measure?utm_source=govdelivery&utm_medium=email&utm_id=techbeat_01132026&utm_content=editor_note ] to search for entries on your favorite topics. As always, we welcome your feedback at takingmeasure@nist.gov as we plan to continue the blog for years to come.\r\n\r\n\xe2\x80\x94Ben P. Stein, Managing Editor\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nConnect with us\r\n facebook [ https://www.facebook.com/NIST ]X [ https://twitter.com/NIST ]youtube [ https://www.youtube.com/NIST ]linkedin [ https://www.linkedin.com/company/nist ]flickr [ https://www.instagram.com/nist/ ]  \r\n\r\nReceived this email from a friend? Subscribe here [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USNIST/subscriber/new?topic_id=USNIST_1 ].\r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy [ https://www.nist.gov/privacy-policy#privpolicy ]\r\n\r\n NIST [ http://www.nist.gov/ ] \r\n\r\n*You are subscribed to receive updates from the National Institute of Standards and Technology (NIST).*\r\n\r\n*Subscriber services:*\r\n\r\n*Manage Preferences [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USNIST/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 Unsubscribe [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USNIST/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 Help [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/ ]*\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\nIf you have questions or problems with the subscription service, please contact subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/ ].\r\nTechnical questions? Contact inquiries@nist.gov. (301) 975-NIST (6478).\r\n\r\nThis service is provided to you at no charge by National Institute of Standards and Technology (NIST).\xc2\xa0100 Bureau Drive, Stop 1070\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7 Gaithersburg, MD 20899\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0301-975-6478\r\n\r\n GovDelivery logo [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/ ] \r\nbody .abe-column-block { min-height: 5px; } table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:10px; margin-right:10px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;} table.govd_hr {min-width: 100%;}\r\n'
