[2026-04-27 10:34:05] Raw text/plain payload: b"The Falcon-H1R doesn't make sense on paper. Until you understand what UAE's TII actually built.\r\nI Tested a 7B Model That Beat Models 7\xc3\x97 Its Size. Here's What I Found.\r\n\r\nThe Falcon-H1R doesn't make sense on paper. Until you understand what UAE's TII actually built.\r\n\r\nAdham Khaled (https://medium.com/@adhamhidawy?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768413822805-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-98111c9905da------------------------51b46188_4ded_44e3_b0cd_affb5593a7af--------dbf9f8a2e961)\r\n\xc2\xa0in\xc2\xa0Towards AI (https://medium.com/towards-artificial-intelligence?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768413822805-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-98111c9905da------------------------51b46188_4ded_44e3_b0cd_affb5593a7af--------dbf9f8a2e961)\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nJanuary 14, 2026\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\n6 min read\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nView on Medium (https://medium.com/towards-artificial-intelligence/6f240891f39a?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768413822805-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-98111c9905da------------------------51b46188_4ded_44e3_b0cd_affb5593a7af--------dbf9f8a2e961)\r\n\r\nLast Saturday, I downloaded a model that shouldn't exist.\r\n\r\n7 billion parameters. Open-source. From Abu Dhabi.\r\n\r\nOn paper, it's nothing special. The AI world runs on models 10\xc3\x97, 20\xc3\x97, even 100\xc3\x97 this size.\xe2\x80\x8b\r\n\r\nThen I ran the benchmarks.\r\n\r\nAIME-24 mathematics: 88.1%. That's better than ServiceNow's Apriel 1.5\xe2\x80\x8a-\xe2\x80\x8aa 15-billion parameter model that scored 86.2%.\xe2\x80\x8b\r\n\r\nLiveCodeBench coding challenges: 68.6%. Best in class for models under 8B parameters.\xe2\x80\x8b\r\n\r\nI ran the tests three times. Same results.\r\n\r\nA 7B model was beating models with 14B, 32B, even 47B parameters.\xe2\x80\x8b\r\n\r\nThis shouldn't be possible.\r\n\r\nBut it is. And once you understand how, everything\xe2\x80\xa6\r\n\r\nContinue reading (https://medium.com/towards-artificial-intelligence/6f240891f39a?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768413822805-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-98111c9905da------------------------51b46188_4ded_44e3_b0cd_affb5593a7af--------dbf9f8a2e961)\r\nContinue reading this story on Medium.\r\n\r\nSent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com by Adham Khaled on Medium\r\nUnsubscribe (https://medium.com/me/email-settings/50207bf5a022/b0332d7bcc3c?type=noSetting&newsletterV3Id=dbf9f8a2e961&collectionId=98111c9905da&source=email-50207bf5a022-1768413822805-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-98111c9905da------------------------51b46188_4ded_44e3_b0cd_affb5593a7af--------dbf9f8a2e961)\r\n from this writer's email notifications\r\nManage your email settings (https://medium.com/me/settings/notifications?hash=b0332d7bcc3c&userId=50207bf5a022&settingsRouteHash=%23manageSubscriptions&source=email-50207bf5a022-1768413822805-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-98111c9905da------------------------51b46188_4ded_44e3_b0cd_affb5593a7af--------dbf9f8a2e961)\r\n\r\n3500 South DuPont Highway, Suite IQ-101, Dover,\xc2\xa0DE\xc2\xa019901\r\nCareers (https://medium.com/jobs-at-medium/work-at-medium-959d1a85284e?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768413822805-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-98111c9905da------------------------51b46188_4ded_44e3_b0cd_affb5593a7af--------dbf9f8a2e961)\r\n\xc2\xb7Help Center (https://help.medium.com/hc/en-us?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768413822805-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-98111c9905da------------------------51b46188_4ded_44e3_b0cd_affb5593a7af--------dbf9f8a2e961)\r\n\xc2\xb7Privacy Policy (https://policy.medium.com/medium-privacy-policy-f03bf92035c9?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768413822805-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-98111c9905da------------------------51b46188_4ded_44e3_b0cd_affb5593a7af--------dbf9f8a2e961)\r\n\xc2\xb7Terms of service (https://policy.medium.com/medium-terms-of-service-9db0094a1e0f?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768413822805-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-98111c9905da------------------------51b46188_4ded_44e3_b0cd_affb5593a7af--------dbf9f8a2e961)"
