[2026-04-27 10:34:09] Raw text/plain payload: b"Explore timely and high frequency information on new business applications and formations.  \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nUnited States Census Bureau [ https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2026/business-formation-statistics-jan14.html?utm_campaign=20260114pios&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nBusiness Formation Statistics Monthly Data Release\r\n\r\nBFS [ https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2026/business-formation-statistics-jan14.html?utm_campaign=20260114pios&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n\r\n*JAN. 14, 2026* \xe2\x80\x94 The U.S. Census Bureau today released new Business Formation Statistics [ https://www.census.gov/econ/bfs/index.html?utm_campaign=20260114pios&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] (BFS) for December 2025. The BFS provide timely and high frequency information on new business applications and formations in the United States and Puerto Rico. The BFS are a standard data product of the Census Bureau, developed in research collaboration with economists affiliated with the Board of Governors of the Federal Reserve System, the Federal Reserve Bank of Atlanta, the University of Maryland, and the University of Notre Dame.\r\n\r\nThe full BFS dataset with all 12 series (four application and eight formation) is released monthly with statistics for the nation, region and states. Four monthly business applications series are released for Puerto Rico as part of the standard monthly BFS product.\xe2\x80\xaf\xc2\xa0BFS includes seasonally and not seasonally adjusted data.\r\n\r\n*Read More* [ https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2026/business-formation-statistics-jan14.html?utm_campaign=20260114pios&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nHelp us spread the word about Census Bureau data!\r\n\r\nShare this on social media or forward it to a friend.\r\n\r\n*Share This* [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USCENSUS/bulletins/403a699 ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nAbout the Census Bureau\r\n\r\nWe serve as the nation\xe2\x80\x99s leading provider of quality data about its people and economy.\xc2\xa0The Census Bureau is the federal government's largest statistical agency. As the world\xe2\x80\x99s premier statistical agency, we are dedicated to making our nation a better place. Policy-makers, businesses, and the public use our data to make informed decisions.\r\n\r\nResources for Media\r\n\r\nFor media interviews, please contact the\xc2\xa0Public Information Office [ https://lnks.gd/l/eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..p-5wpj2DTx0_qgyLiv6JuMTDOF_vZlHcwFpt971jIDs/s/866068797/br/124287751808-l?utm_campaign=20260114pios&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\xc2\xa0Toll Free at 877-861-2010, 301-763-3030, or\xc2\xa0pio@census.gov.\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n  \r\n \r\n\r\n*Stay connected with us!*\r\n\r\nJoin the conversation on social media.\r\n\r\n facebook [ https://www.facebook.com/uscensusbureau/?utm_campaign=20260114pios&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]instagram [ https://www.instagram.com/uscensusbureau/?utm_campaign=20260114pios&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]linkedin [ https://www.linkedin.com/company/us-census-bureau/?utm_campaign=20260114pios&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]twitter [ https://twitter.com/uscensusbureau/?utm_campaign=20260114pios&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] [ https://www.linkedin.com/company/us-census-bureau/?utm_campaign=20260114pios&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]youtube [ https://www.youtube.com/user/uscensusbureau/?utm_campaign=20260114pios&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]  \r\n\r\nSUBSCRIBER SERVICES:\r\n\r\nSubscriber Settings [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USCENSUS/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 Remove me from All Subscriptions  [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USCENSUS/subscriber/one_click_unsubscribe?verification=5.76359f46a06559a62e8e0404a80cc7e5&destination=jasonnorman66994%40gmail.com ]\xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0Help [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/ ]\r\n\r\n \r\n&lt;!-- /* template top padding on mobile */ @media only screen and (max-width: 480px) { table#flexible-abe-main-table { padding:0 !important; } } --&gt; ________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\nThis is an official email from the U.S. Census Bureau. If you have any questions or comments, please contact us (http://www.census.gov/about/contact-us.html [ http://www.census.gov/about/contact-us.html?utm_campaign=20260114pios&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]).  \xc2\xa0 \r\nbody .abe-column-block {min-height: 5px;} table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:7px; margin-right:7px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;}\r\n"
