[2026-04-27 10:34:15] Raw text/plain payload: b'table {border-collapse: collapse;} &lt;!-- /* Make columns expand to 100% on small screens */ @media only screen and (max-width: 480px) { .abe-column-block { min-width: 100%; } } /* Disables Apple clients adding blue color and underline to links and other text */ a[x-apple-data-detectors] { color: inherit !important; text-decoration: none !important; font-size: inherit !important; font-family: inherit !important; font-weight: inherit !important; line-height: inherit !important; } --&gt; \r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0 \r\n\r\nFTC Logo [ https://www.ftc.gov?utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nFTC Announces 2026 Update of Jurisdictional and Fee Thresholds for Premerger Notification Filings [ https://www.ftc.gov/news-events/news/press-releases/2026/01/ftc-announces-2026-update-jurisdictional-fee-thresholds-premerger-notification-filings?utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n\r\nThe Federal Trade Commission has approved revised jurisdictional thresholds and a revised filing fee schedule under the Hart\xe2\x80\x91Scott\xe2\x80\x91Rodino (HSR) Antitrust Improvements Act of 1976.\r\n\r\nView Press Release [ https://www.ftc.gov/news-events/news/press-releases/2026/01/ftc-announces-2026-update-jurisdictional-fee-thresholds-premerger-notification-filings?utm_source=govdelivery ]  \r\n\r\n*More news from the FTC* [ https://www.ftc.gov/news-events/news/press-releases?utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n ________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\xc2\xa0 \r\nFacebook [ https://www.facebook.com/federaltradecommission?utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\nTwitter [ https://twitter.com/FTC?utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\nLinkedIn [ https://www.linkedin.com/company/163780?utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \xc2\xa0 \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \xc2\xa0 \r\n \r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n