[2026-04-27 10:34:22] Raw text/plain payload: b'Hi Jasonnorman66994@gmail.com,\r\n\r\n\xf0\x9f\x91\x8b Welcome to DevCycle! I\xe2\x80\x99m Cobi, Head of Product and Co-Founder.\r\n\r\nSince you just signed up, you should be in the middle of, or just finished the guided onboarding experience which gave a brief overview of the platform. If you need a link back to the platform just go here ( https://app.devcycle.com?utm_campaign=DevCycle+Onboarding+Campaign&utm_content=Email+1+-+Get+Started+With+DevCycle&utm_medium=email_action&utm_source=customer.io ) .\r\n\r\nHere are a few extra resources to help you get started with DevCycle:\r\n* Quickstart\xc2\xa0documentation ( https://docs.devcycle.com/introduction/quickstart?utm_campaign=DevCycle+Onboarding+Campaign&utm_content=Email+1+-+Get+Started+With+DevCycle&utm_medium=email_action&utm_source=customer.io )\r\n* Where to find example app\xc2\xa0repos ( https://github.com/DevCycleHQ-Labs?utm_campaign=DevCycle+Onboarding+Campaign&utm_content=Email+1+-+Get+Started+With+DevCycle&utm_medium=email_action&utm_source=customer.io )\r\n* SDK\xc2\xa0documentation ( https://docs.devcycle.com/sdk/?utm_campaign=DevCycle+Onboarding+Campaign&utm_content=Email+1+-+Get+Started+With+DevCycle&utm_medium=email_action&utm_source=customer.io )\r\n* Introduction ( https://docs.devcycle.com/?utm_campaign=DevCycle+Onboarding+Campaign&utm_content=Email+1+-+Get+Started+With+DevCycle&utm_medium=email_action&utm_source=customer.io )\xc2\xa0to DevCycle\r\n\r\nIf you have any questions, just reply to this email, and I\xe2\x80\x99ll get right back to you (it may be automated, but I get all the replies personally). You can also find me in our\xc2\xa0Discord ( https://discord.com/invite/Tv8DFk54Zc?utm_campaign=DevCycle+Onboarding+Campaign&utm_content=Email+1+-+Get+Started+With+DevCycle&utm_medium=email_action&utm_source=customer.io ).\r\n\r\nUntil then - happy flagging,\r\nCobi\r\n\r\nUnsubscribe ( https://track.customer.io/unsubscribe/dgS79AYAAPCpA--pAwGbvrMPgn6KTcWKY85v_ZY= )'
