[2026-04-27 10:34:25] Raw text/plain payload: b'View as a webpage\xc2\xa0 /\xc2\xa0 Share [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USDAOC/bulletins/404780d ]\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nHeader-Hybrid \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nOffice of Communications\xc2\xa0 |\xc2\xa0 press@usda.gov\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\n*MEDIA ADVISORY: Secretary Rollins, Dr. Oz, and Dr. Carson in Pennsylvania TOMORROW\xc2\xa0*\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\n*(Washington, D.C., January 14, 2026) *\xe2\x80\x93 U.S. Secretary of Agriculture Brooke L. Rollins\xc2\xa0will travel to Pennsylvania, TOMORROW, January 15th. In Thomasville, Pennsylvania, Secretary Rollins will be accompanied by Centers for Medicare & Medicaid Services Administrator Dr. Mehmet Oz, and National Nutrition Advisor at the U.S. Department of Agriculture Dr. Ben Carson, where they will travel to Paradise Elementary School to tour the cafeteria and milk truck stop followed by media availability. Secretary Rollins, Dr. Oz, and Dr. Carson will then meet Pennsylvania Representatives Glenn "GT" Thompson, Dan Meuser, and Scott Perry, and Pennsylvania Agriculture Secretary Redding in Harrisburg, Pennsylvania, where Secretary Rollins will deliver remarks at the Pennsylvania Farm Show, followed by a media availability.\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*Secretary Rollins to Visit Paradise Elementary School*\r\n\r\n*WHAT:*\xc2\xa0Secretary Rollins,*\xc2\xa0*Dr. Oz, and Dr. Carson will meet with schoolchildren at Paradise Elementary School in Thomasville, Pennsylvania. Following the visit Secretary Rollins will hold media a availability.\xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*WHEN:\xc2\xa0*THURSDAY, January 15th,\xc2\xa011:30 am ET\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n"Media setup begins at 11:10 am ET"\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*WHERE:\xc2\xa0*Paradise Elementary School\xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa06923 Lincoln Highway West Thomasville, PA 17364\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n**please note, it will be outside so please dress accordingly\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*Secretary Rollins to Speak at Pennsylvania Farm Show*\r\n\r\n*WHAT:\xc2\xa0*Secretary Rollins, Dr. Oz, Dr. Carson, Pennsylvania Representatives Thompson, Meuser, and Perry, and Pennsylvania Agriculture Secretary Redding will attend the Pennsylvania Farm Show - Pennsylvania\xe2\x80\x99s State Fair - celebrating their 110th show\xc2\xa0in Harrisburg, Pennsylvania.\xc2\xa0Secretary Rollins will\xc2\xa0then\xc2\xa0deliver\xc2\xa0remarks\xc2\xa0and hold a media availability. \xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*WHEN:\xc2\xa0*THURSDAY, January 15th\r\n\r\n2:00 pm ET at Equine Arena for the delegation\'s remarks\r\n\r\n"Media setup begins at 1:45 pm ET"\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nMedia Availability begins at 2:35pm ET behind the\xc2\xa0PennAg\xc2\xa0Food Booth in the Farm Show Complex\xe2\x80\x99s Giant EXPO Hall\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n"Setup begins immediately following remarks"\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*WHERE:\xc2\xa0*Pennsylvania Farm Show\xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa02300\xc2\xa0N Cameron St. Harrisburg, PA 17110\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nDelegation Remarks: Equine Arena\r\n\r\nMedia Availability: Behind the PennAg Food Booth in the Farm Show Complex\xe2\x80\x99s Giant EXPO Hall\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n**Media interested in covering the event must RSVP to\xc2\xa0*press@usda.gov* by TOMORROW, Thursday, January 15**th**, at 8:00am ET\xe2\x80\xaf.*\r\n\r\n###\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n  \r\n \r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0 \r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*\r\nU.S. Department of Agriculture*\r\n\r\nwww.usda.gov [ https://www.usda.gov/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 Contact us [ https://ask.usda.gov/s/contactsupport?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n\r\ntwitter [ https://www.twitter.com/usda/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]facebook [ https://www.facebook.com/usda/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]instagram [ https://www.instagram.com/usdagov/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]flickr [ https://flickr.com/usdagov?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]youtube [ https://www.youtube.com/usda/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n\r\nBookmark and Share [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USDAOC/bulletins/0?reqfrom=share ]\r\n\r\nManage Subscriptions [ http://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USDAOC/subscribers/new?preferences=true ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 Unsubscribe All [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USDAOC/subscriber/one_click_unsubscribe?verification=5.b0b9ffc01626a62fade26e4ffc0836cd&destination=jasonnorman66994%40gmail.com ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 Help [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/ ]\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \xc2\xa0 \r\n \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n This email was sent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com using govDelivery on behalf of: USDA Office of Communications \xc2\xb7 1400 Independence Ave., S.W. \xc2\xb7 Washington, DC 20250  GovDelivery logo  [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\nbody .abe-column-block { min-height: 5px; } table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:10px; margin-right:10px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;} table.govd_hr {min-width: 100%;}\r\n'
