[2026-04-27 10:34:35] Raw text/plain payload: b'Stories for Jason Norman\r\n@jasonnorman66994 (https://medium.com/@jasonnorman66994?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768448192015-digest.reader-------------------------8fac1fbc_519d_4e2c_a183_8f07cecc5b40)\r\n\xc2\xb7Become a member (https://medium.com/plans?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768448192015-digest.reader-------------------------8fac1fbc_519d_4e2c_a183_8f07cecc5b40)\r\n\r\nToday\'s highlights\r\n\r\nMarina Wyss - Gratitude Driven (https://medium.com/@gratitudedriven?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768448192015-digest.reader-8993e01dcfd3-f226aa4550a1----0-109------------------8fac1fbc_519d_4e2c_a183_8f07cecc5b40-1)\r\ninData Science Collective (https://medium.com/data-science-collective?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768448192015-digest.reader-8993e01dcfd3-f226aa4550a1----0-109------------------8fac1fbc_519d_4e2c_a183_8f07cecc5b40-1)\r\n\r\nAI Agents: Complete Course\r\nFrom beginner to intermediate to production.\r\n\r\n30 min read\r\n2.4K\r\n96\r\n\r\nletters from rosie (https://medium.com/@lynwrites_?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768448192015-digest.reader--47154e3708c2----1-2------------------8fac1fbc_519d_4e2c_a183_8f07cecc5b40-1)\r\n\r\nif it makes you happy, it\'s not a waste of time.\r\nIn a world that constantly celebrates perfection and\xe2\x80\xa6\r\n\r\n3 min read\r\n1.94K\r\n22\r\n\r\nThe Useful Tech (https://medium.com/@theusefultech?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768448192015-digest.reader-953b148ade73-1a361eb81f1f----2-2------------------8fac1fbc_519d_4e2c_a183_8f07cecc5b40-1)\r\ninThe Useful Tech (https://medium.com/the-useful-tech?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768448192015-digest.reader-953b148ade73-1a361eb81f1f----2-2------------------8fac1fbc_519d_4e2c_a183_8f07cecc5b40-1)\r\n\r\nHow I Simplified My Entire Productivity System to One App (And Actually Stuck\xe2\x80\xa6\r\nNotes, tasks, research, and brainstorming, all in one\xe2\x80\xa6\r\n\r\n10 min read\r\n407\r\n8\r\n\r\nAaron Dinin, PhD (https://medium.com/@aarondinin?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768448192015-digest.reader-7adf33e44ae3-399989e697cb----3-2------------------8fac1fbc_519d_4e2c_a183_8f07cecc5b40-1)\r\ninEntrepreneurship Handbook (https://medium.com/entrepreneur-s-handbook?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768448192015-digest.reader-7adf33e44ae3-399989e697cb----3-2------------------8fac1fbc_519d_4e2c_a183_8f07cecc5b40-1)\r\n\r\nOne Question That Always Predicts Startup Success\r\nThe way a founder answers tells you everything you\xe2\x80\xa6\r\n\r\n4 min read\r\n367\r\n18\r\n\r\naneesh kumar (https://medium.com/@aneesh12online?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768448192015-digest.reader-5517fd7b58a6-08ee933bebaf----4-1------------------8fac1fbc_519d_4e2c_a183_8f07cecc5b40-1)\r\ninLevel Up Coding (https://medium.com/gitconnected?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768448192015-digest.reader-5517fd7b58a6-08ee933bebaf----4-1------------------8fac1fbc_519d_4e2c_a183_8f07cecc5b40-1)\r\n\r\nSpring Boot JDBC Connection Pooling: From 500 Errors to 5,000 Requests Per\xe2\x80\xa6\r\nThe Nightmare That Crashed My App\r\n\r\n6 min read\r\n81\r\n\r\nRebecca Bridger, PsyD (https://medium.com/@rcoop801?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768448192015-digest.reader-4b88e076eae2-7a3494d2553e----5-109------------------8fac1fbc_519d_4e2c_a183_8f07cecc5b40-1)\r\ninTiny House Big Mind (https://medium.com/tiny-house-big-mind?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768448192015-digest.reader-4b88e076eae2-7a3494d2553e----5-109------------------8fac1fbc_519d_4e2c_a183_8f07cecc5b40-1)\r\n\r\nThe Psychology of "Enough"\r\nWhy Chasing More Doesn\'t Make Us Happier\r\n\r\n9 min read\r\n5.5K\r\n188\r\n\r\nShikha | Author (https://medium.com/@SvaCopy?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768448192015-digest.reader-84ac01765c52-523ac60b9ffa----6-2------------------8fac1fbc_519d_4e2c_a183_8f07cecc5b40-1)\r\ninWrite A Catalyst (https://medium.com/write-a-catalyst?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768448192015-digest.reader-84ac01765c52-523ac60b9ffa----6-2------------------8fac1fbc_519d_4e2c_a183_8f07cecc5b40-1)\r\n\r\nThis One Book Will Make You Rich\xe2\x80\x8a-\xe2\x80\x8aIf You Read It Twice\r\nI read it once and learned about money. I read it\xe2\x80\xa6\r\n\r\n8 min read\r\n4K\r\n130\r\n\r\nSam Vaseghi (https://medium.com/@vaseghisam?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768448192015-digest.reader-cf522ff06849-26d40dd1dd3d----7-109------------------8fac1fbc_519d_4e2c_a183_8f07cecc5b40-1)\r\ninThe Quantastic Journal (https://medium.com/the-quantastic-journal?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768448192015-digest.reader-cf522ff06849-26d40dd1dd3d----7-109------------------8fac1fbc_519d_4e2c_a183_8f07cecc5b40-1)\r\n\r\nGod Plays Dice, But Mathematics Won\'t Prove It as Random\r\nPhysics can certify unpredictability in the lab, yet a\xe2\x80\xa6\r\n\r\n16 min read\r\n552\r\n12\r\n\r\nJan Kammerath (https://medium.com/@jankammerath?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768448192015-digest.reader--41a3af8fbcfe----8-109------------------8fac1fbc_519d_4e2c_a183_8f07cecc5b40-1)\r\n\r\nForget SEO. Everyone Does RAO.\r\nSearch Engine Optimization, or SEO in short, has been\xe2\x80\xa6\r\n\r\n8 min read\r\n3.4K\r\n213\r\n\r\nGreg Dessau (https://medium.com/@gregdessau?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768448192015-digest.reader-c83938b82bef-ddd2597b21aa----9-109------------------8fac1fbc_519d_4e2c_a183_8f07cecc5b40-1)\r\ninHuman Offset (https://medium.com/human-offset?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768448192015-digest.reader-c83938b82bef-ddd2597b21aa----9-109------------------8fac1fbc_519d_4e2c_a183_8f07cecc5b40-1)\r\n\r\nThe 800% Job Boom Nobody\'s Talking About\r\nThe bottleneck isn\'t building AI anymore. It\'s making\xe2\x80\xa6\r\n\r\n5 min read\r\n813\r\n39\r\n\r\nFrom your following\r\nEdit who you follow (https://medium.com/me/following/people?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768448192015-digest.reader-------------------------8fac1fbc_519d_4e2c_a183_8f07cecc5b40-31)\r\n\r\nJahanzaib Ranjha (https://medium.com/@jahanzaib-ranjha?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768448192015-digest.reader-48e972f5c24e-322497c699aa----0-1------------------8fac1fbc_519d_4e2c_a183_8f07cecc5b40-31)\r\ninBootcamp (https://medium.com/design-bootcamp?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768448192015-digest.reader-48e972f5c24e-322497c699aa----0-1------------------8fac1fbc_519d_4e2c_a183_8f07cecc5b40-31)\r\n\r\nWhy Transparency Accelerates Learning.\r\nHow Learning in Public Speeds Up Growth\r\n\r\n4 min read\r\n400\r\n3\r\n\r\nThe Useful Tech (https://medium.com/@theusefultech?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768448192015-digest.reader-953b148ade73-a115e0ab1fee----1-2------------------8fac1fbc_519d_4e2c_a183_8f07cecc5b40-31)\r\ninThe Useful Tech (https://medium.com/the-useful-tech?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768448192015-digest.reader-953b148ade73-a115e0ab1fee----1-2------------------8fac1fbc_519d_4e2c_a183_8f07cecc5b40-31)\r\n\r\nI spent $2,166 on 41 Apps in 2025\xe2\x80\x8a-\xe2\x80\x8aMy Brutally Honest Verdict of Them\r\nMy 2025 App Store Wrapped\r\n\r\n17 min read\r\n265\r\n7\r\n\r\nDylan Combellick (https://medium.com/@dylan_combellick?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768448192015-digest.reader--216cbe26c23b----2-2------------------8fac1fbc_519d_4e2c_a183_8f07cecc5b40-31)\r\n\r\nUkraine Update January 14\r\n2026 - French Sarcasm, Ukrainians armed with snow\xe2\x80\xa6\r\n\r\n12 min read\r\n3.6K\r\n36\r\n\r\nPiyush Shukla (https://medium.com/@piyushshukla150?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768448192015-digest.reader-eca1ba5ae1ca-393157f2e37e----3-1------------------8fac1fbc_519d_4e2c_a183_8f07cecc5b40-31)\r\ninILLUMINATION (https://medium.com/illumination?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768448192015-digest.reader-eca1ba5ae1ca-393157f2e37e----3-1------------------8fac1fbc_519d_4e2c_a183_8f07cecc5b40-31)\r\n\r\nWhat I learnt From Reading 12 Books in 2025\r\nI surprised myself by reading 12 books this year. At\xe2\x80\xa6\r\n\r\n3 min read\r\n128\r\n\r\nThe Useful Tech (https://medium.com/@theusefultech?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768448192015-digest.reader-953b148ade73-05bcfbbd0457----4-2------------------8fac1fbc_519d_4e2c_a183_8f07cecc5b40-3