entials\r\n\r\nKey FATCA Provisions [ https://www.irs.gov/businesses/corporations/summary-of-key-fatca-provisions ]\r\n\r\nNews Releases [ https://www.irs.gov/newsroom/news-releases-for-current-month ]\r\n\r\nIRS - The Basics [ https://www.irs.gov/about-irs/irs-the-basics ]\r\n\r\nIRS Guidance [ https://www.irs.gov/newsroom/irs-guidance ]\r\n\r\nMedia Contacts [ https://www.irs.gov/newsroom/irs-media-relations-office-contact-number ]\r\n\r\ne-News Subscriptions [ https://www.irs.gov/newsroom/e-news-subscriptions ]\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\nIRS Resources\r\n\r\nContact My Local Office [ https://www.irs.gov/help/contact-your-local-irs-office ]\r\n\r\nFiling Options [ https://www.irs.gov/filing ]\r\n\r\nForms & Instructions [ https://www.irs.gov/forms-instructions ]\r\n\r\nFrequently Asked Questions [ https://www.irs.gov/help/telephone-assistance ]\r\n\r\nNews [ https://www.irs.gov/newsroom ]\r\n\r\nTaxpayer Advocate [ https://www.irs.gov/taxpayer-advocate ]\r\n\r\nWhere to File [ https://www.irs.gov/filing/where-to-file-paper-tax-returns-with-or-without-a-payment ]\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\nIssue Number:\xc2\xa0 2026-01\xc2\xa0\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n*IRS clarifies recent update to FATCA XML Schema files*\r\n\r\nAs we communicated in a FATCA News and Information newsletter (Issue 2025-10), the IRS recently updated the FATCA XML Schema files to the fatcaxml_v2.0.1 version located on the FATCA IDES resources and support information webpage [ https://www.irs.gov/businesses/corporations/fatca-xml-schemas-and-business-rules-for-form-8966 ] to align FATCA Reporting with the International Organization for Standardization (ISO) country names updates.\r\n\r\nThis new version revises certain attributes within the FATCA XML Schema v2.0 as provided by the ISO update, specifically to the isofatcatypes_v1.2.xsd file. The fatcaxml_v2.0.1 was deployed to production on Monday, September 29, 2025.\xc2\xa0 Only FATCA reporting filers impacted by the following country name changes will need to download and apply the updated fatcaxml_v2.0.1 [ https://www.irs.gov/pub/fatca/fatcaxml-v2-0-1.zip ].\xc2\xa0 There are also a few additional currency code updates within the new version as noted below. \xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*Updated Country Names*\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n*Country Code***\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n*Previous*\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n*Current*\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nCV\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nCAPE VERDE\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nCABO VERDE\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nCZ\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nCZECH REPUBLIC\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nCZECHIA\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nSZ\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nSWAZILAND\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nESWATINI\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nMK\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nMACEDONIA, THE FORMER YUGOSLAV REPUBLIC OF\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nNORTH MACEDONIA\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nTR\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nTURKEY\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nT\xc3\x9cRK\xc4\xb0YE\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n*Additional Currency Codes**\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n*Currency Code*\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n*Description*\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nBYN\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nBelarussian Ruble: BELARUS\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nMRU\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nOuguiya: MAURITANIA\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nSTN\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nDobra: SAO TOME AND PRINCIPE\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nUYW\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nUnidad Previsional: URUGUAY\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nVED\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nBol\xc3\xadvar Soberano: VENEZUELA, BOLIVARIAN REPUBLIC OF\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nVES\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nBol\xc3\xadvar Soberano: VENEZUELA, BOLIVARIAN REPUBLIC OF\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n*Additional countries were included that use the currency code EUR\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n**Added the country code \xe2\x80\x9cXX\xe2\x80\x9d for Other\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nBack to top [ #top ]\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\nThank you for subscribing to FATCA News & Information, an IRS e-mail service. For more information on federal taxes please visit IRS.gov [ https://www.irs.gov/ ].\r\n\r\nThis message was distributed automatically from the FATCA News & Information mailing list. *Please Do Not Reply To This Message.*\r\n\r\n \r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\nUpdate your subscriptions, modify your password or email address, or stop subscriptions at any time on your Subscriber Preferences Page [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USIRS/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ]. You will need your email address to log in. If you have questions or problems with the subscription service, visit subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/ ].\r\n\r\nThis service is provided to you at no charge by the Internal Revenue Service (IRS) [ https://www.irs.gov/ ].\r\n\r\n \r\nbody .abe-column-block {min-height: 5px;} ________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\nThis email was sent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com by: Internal Revenue Service (IRS) \xc2\xb7 Internal Revenue Service \xc2\xb7 1111 Constitution Ave. N.W. \xc2\xb7 Washington, D.C. 20535 GovDelivery logo [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/ ] \r\nbody .abe-column-block { min-height: 5px; } table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:10px; margin-right:10px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;}\r\n'
