[2026-04-27 10:34:52] Raw text/plain payload: b'This is Why Its The Best Ecosystem Out There Without a Doubt\r\n10 Underrated Things That Make The Expensive Apple Ecosystem Worth It\r\n\r\nThis is Why Its The Best Ecosystem Out There Without a Doubt\r\n\r\nThe Useful Tech (https://medium.com/@theusefultech?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768499592706-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-953b148ade73------------------------4c1b814d_c627_4925_a40e_5b271b1e5eb2--------eeb618317985)\r\n\xc2\xa0in\xc2\xa0The Useful Tech (https://medium.com/the-useful-tech?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768499592706-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-953b148ade73------------------------4c1b814d_c627_4925_a40e_5b271b1e5eb2--------eeb618317985)\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nJanuary 15, 2026\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\n8 min read\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nView on Medium (https://medium.com/the-useful-tech/094461e4facb?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768499592706-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-953b148ade73------------------------4c1b814d_c627_4925_a40e_5b271b1e5eb2--------eeb618317985)\r\n\r\nSource: Author Screenshot\r\n\r\nEveryone knows the Apple ecosystem is expensive.\r\n\r\nWhat most people don\'t know is that Apple has quietly built dozens of small features that only work when you own multiple Apple devices, the kind of features they barely advertise, features that most users never discover.\r\n\r\nThese aren\'t the flashy specs you see in keynotes. These are the "wait, my devices can do that?" moments that make you feel like you\'re finally getting your money\'s worth.\r\n\r\nI\'ve been deep in the Apple ecosystem for years, and I still stumble upon features that surprise me.\xc2\xa0\xe2\x80\xa6\r\n\r\nContinue reading (https://medium.com/the-useful-tech/094461e4facb?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768499592706-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-953b148ade73------------------------4c1b814d_c627_4925_a40e_5b271b1e5eb2--------eeb618317985)\r\nThis is a member-only story and can only be read on Medium.\r\n\r\nSent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com by The Useful Tech on Medium\r\nUnsubscribe (https://medium.com/me/email-settings/50207bf5a022/68f370ef9d70?type=noSetting&newsletterV3Id=eeb618317985&collectionId=953b148ade73&source=email-50207bf5a022-1768499592706-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-953b148ade73------------------------4c1b814d_c627_4925_a40e_5b271b1e5eb2--------eeb618317985)\r\n from this writer\'s email notifications\r\nManage your email settings (https://medium.com/me/settings/notifications?hash=68f370ef9d70&userId=50207bf5a022&settingsRouteHash=%23manageSubscriptions&source=email-50207bf5a022-1768499592706-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-953b148ade73------------------------4c1b814d_c627_4925_a40e_5b271b1e5eb2--------eeb618317985)\r\n\r\n3500 South DuPont Highway, Suite IQ-101, Dover,\xc2\xa0DE\xc2\xa019901\r\nCareers (https://medium.com/jobs-at-medium/work-at-medium-959d1a85284e?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768499592706-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-953b148ade73------------------------4c1b814d_c627_4925_a40e_5b271b1e5eb2--------eeb618317985)\r\n\xc2\xb7Help Center (https://help.medium.com/hc/en-us?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768499592706-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-953b148ade73------------------------4c1b814d_c627_4925_a40e_5b271b1e5eb2--------eeb618317985)\r\n\xc2\xb7Privacy Policy (https://policy.medium.com/medium-privacy-policy-f03bf92035c9?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768499592706-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-953b148ade73------------------------4c1b814d_c627_4925_a40e_5b271b1e5eb2--------eeb618317985)\r\n\xc2\xb7Terms of service (https://policy.medium.com/medium-terms-of-service-9db0094a1e0f?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768499592706-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-953b148ade73------------------------4c1b814d_c627_4925_a40e_5b271b1e5eb2--------eeb618317985)'
