643&utm_source=iter&utm_medium=email&utm_term=us-en&utm_campaign=p1_bb_co_all_pcn_b202111&utm_content=h_l>\r\n \r\n<https://www.dropbox.com/?oref=e&_tk=email&_camp=12233700&_ad=30be3a22a7b84f29b4f239a2b5bf8643&utm_source=iter&utm_medium=email&utm_term=us-en&utm_campaign=p1_bb_co_all_pcn_b202111&utm_content=h_l>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nShow your team that there\xe2\x80\x99s a better way to collaborate\r\n\r\nWork goes more smoothly when the entire company has immediate access to \r\nnecessary files and folders, in a controlled environment. And getting them to \r\njoin you on Dropbox is a smooth process, as well. \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nInvite co-workers today <https://dropbox.com/home?invite_modal=deep_link> \r\n <https://dropbox.com/home?invite_modal=deep_link> \r\n <https://www.dropbox.com/team/admin/members> \r\n <https://www.dropbox.com/team/admin/members> \r\n\r\nOnce they\xe2\x80\x99re on Dropbox, your team will be more connected\xe2\x80\x94and more productive\xe2\x80\x94\r\nthanks to: \r\n\r\n * Instant access to resources: New members get immediate access to the files \r\nand tools they need. \r\n * Simplified sharing: They can share files with a link, without having to \r\nchangepermissions for each file. \r\n * Automatic syncing: Newly saved or updated files automatically sync across \r\ndevices, so you won\xe2\x80\x99t have to spend time emailing the latest versions to \r\ncollaborators. \r\n * Centralized control: Security is key\xe2\x80\x94admins can manage team permissions and \r\naccess, right within the admin console. \r\n * A shared workspace: Everyone will access the same set of files, making it \r\neasier to collaborate and share updates. \r\n\r\nInvite them to Dropbox <https://dropbox.com/home?invite_modal=deep_link> \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n <https://www.twitter.com/Dropbox>  <https://www.facebook.com/Dropbox/>  \r\n<https://www.youtube.com/user/dropbox> \r\n\r\nThis email was sent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com \r\nWant to stop getting emails from Dropbox? Unsubscribe \r\n<https://links.dropbox.com/e/eh?_t=60154b197d654466a40480a2b908d3b7&_m=30be3a22a7b84f29b4f239a2b5bf8643&_e=UajLgLBY0YK7snh_6TLhnMFl5Kg64CyQLabKFGb0Sbp6TO-NJnLYx4sHJ-5IHLZof2KMWWzQX_zgioL9MyNiJaEVIp-g-lmQ8FJEN579yC4lH8qmjFSCpHHG5VVO0p_etSssyxOf3vORXkHDArSa9uGOXGC5LOkQwme6IBf2DWg%3D&dbx_unsub=10419888971189/14572921/174/AAC3INFTgzYzEPgUOvzzOTBC9lFNjKb9s8Am3rAoy2eTDQ&dbx_campid=12233700&dbx_endpoint=send_email&dbx_env=prod>\r\nDropbox, Inc., PO Box 77767, San Francisco, CA 94107 '
