[2026-04-27 10:34:57] Raw text/plain payload: b'Energy Team Email Banner [ https://www.trade.gov/energy-industry ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nGoing Global\r\nEnergy Newsletter\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nWebinars\r\nPeru Critical Mineral and Mining Projects\r\nCritical Mineral and Mining Projects in Peru: Opportunities for U.S. Businesses\r\n\r\n*Wednesday, January 21 | 12:00pm EST*\r\n\r\nAre you a mining equipment manufacturer, service supplier, project finance professional interested to learn more about mining opportunities in Peru? Hear a market overview from the U.S. Commercial Service and U.S. Embassy officials in Lima on exciting mining projects in Peru\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*Mining in Peru Overview*\r\n\r\n\r\n  * Mining is vital to Peru\'s economy, contributing 15% of GDP (2017-2021) \r\n  * World\'s 2nd largest producer of Copper\xc2\xa0 \r\n  * Major producer of key minerals such as gold, silver,\xc2\xa0zinc,\xc2\xa0and lithium \r\n\r\n*Opportunities*\r\n\r\n\r\n  * $53.7 billion pending projects \r\n  * Significant business opportunities exist for international companies such as: benefit plant, mining\xc2\xa0equipment,\xc2\xa0exploration, infrastructure, and development and preparation \r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*Register Now* [ https://events.gcc.teams.microsoft.com/event/3ad836aa-c77f-40de-a00f-0cc6c9b3e4fe@a1d183f2-6c7b-4d9a-b994-5f2f31b3f780 ] \r\n \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\nEBRD\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nEBRD in Ukraine: Updates from the Ground on the Project Pipeline\r\n\r\n*January 22, 2026 | 11:00 AM - 12:15 PM EDT*\r\n\r\n*Cost: $35*\r\n\r\nThe U.S. Commercial Liaison Office to the EBRD will host a webinar for U.S. companies interested in Ukraine reconstruction efforts.\xc2\xa0 Join us to learn more about the bank\'s presence in Ukraine and its upcoming pipeline of projects.\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*Register:* https://app.inevent.com/en/TradeGov/EBRDinUkraine [ https://gcc02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Flinks-1.govdelivery.com%2FCL0%2Fhttps%3A%252F%252Fapp.inevent.com%252Fen%252FTradeGov%252FEBRDinUkraine%252F%2F2%2F0100019b086f632c-2a4773a0-9d49-4ae0-9a68-e79caa9ca1a6-000000%2F-jWqqO0_rRKb7Y5bTXIkwhVuvFS2gBFpasqw04-ga84%3D435&data=05%7C02%7CCathy.Gibbons%40trade.gov%7C90686aff5fc541e1c76d08de38090af4%7Ca1d183f26c7b4d9ab9945f2f31b3f780%7C0%7C0%7C639009808669053359%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&sdata=juQmbMBjuT8xcyV5EiXbt0zEEay0OayHGpUGaM6jDuU%3D&reserved=0 ]\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*About the Commerce Multilateral Development Bank Liaison Office at EBRD*\r\n\r\nThe U.S. Commercial Liaison office at the European Bank for Reconstruction and Development (EBRD) leverages the United States\' shareholding to engage U.S. businesses in EBRD-financed activities across 40+ emerging markets in Africa, Asia, and Europe.\xc2\xa0 For more information about EBRD, visit _www.ebrd.com [ https://gcc02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Flinks-1.govdelivery.com%2FCL0%2Fhttp%3A%252F%252Fwww.ebrd.com%252F%2F1%2F0100019b086f632c-2a4773a0-9d49-4ae0-9a68-e79caa9ca1a6-000000%2Fzr0fPg4JT2CX9go5aenUmcGsyXSAXtbAQ_r2-2DVrI4%3D435&data=05%7C02%7CCathy.Gibbons%40trade.gov%7C90686aff5fc541e1c76d08de38090af4%7Ca1d183f26c7b4d9ab9945f2f31b3f780%7C0%7C0%7C639009808669087577%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&sdata=dabwrWXuAatBQY7egP%2BabFZ%2FrisZWHxX54Zb%2BLP%2BxZE%3D&reserved=0 ]_.\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*Register Now* [ https://app.inevent.com/en/TradeGov/EBRDinUkraine ] \r\n \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\nGlobal Energy Show 2026 \r\n\r\nStrengthen Your Energy Business in Canada:\xc2\xa0 Market Access, Supply Chains & Cross-Border Opportunities\r\n\r\n*January 28, 2026 | 11:30 AM EST*\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nThe U.S. Commercial Service invites *American energy producers, service companies, equipment manufacturers, technology providers, logistics firms, and supply chain partners* to join a high-impact webinar on *commercial opportunities in Canada\xe2\x80\x99s energy sector* and how to engage effectively at the Global Energy Show.\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nThis session will focus on *market access, regulatory considerations, and **cross-border supply chain opportunities* relevant to U.S. companies operating in or entering the Canadian energy market. Canada remains the United States\xe2\x80\x99 largest energy trading partner. Recent *developments in infrastructure, permitting, and supply chain integration create new opportunities for U.S. firms* to expand their presence, strengthen North American energy security, and build commercial partnerships with Canadian operators.\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*Why Attend?*\r\n\r\n\xe2\x80\xa2 Get *clarity on 2026 commercial opportunities* for U.S. companies in Canada\xe2\x80\x99s energy sector.\r\n\r\n\xe2\x80\xa2 Learn how to *participate in the Global Energy Show* to expand your customer base.\r\n\r\n\xe2\x80\xa2 Understand* procurement, regulatory, and supply chain considerations* for cross border operations.\r\n\r\n\xe2\x80\xa2 *Connect with Embassy and Commercial Service experts* who can support your company\xe2\x80\x99s market entry and issue resolution.\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\n*Register Now* [ https://events.gcc.teams.microsoft.com/event/f8bd6f6a-2e34-43a9-82c6-f84a3ff6cc89@a1d183f2-6c7b-4d9a-b994-5f2f31b3f780 ] \r\n \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\nVietnam mining webinar\r\n*Vietnam Mining, Coal & Critical Minerals Webinar*\r\n\r\n*January 28, 2026 | 8:30 PM EST*\r\n\r\n*Cost: $25*\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n\r\n  * *Market Insights*: Understand how Vietnam\xe2\x80\x99s energy transition, mining reforms and industrial policies create near-term opportunities for U.S. firms. \r\n  * *Regulatory Guidance*: Get an overview of Vietnam\xe2\x80\x99s regulatory requirements, licensing, and compliance for market entry. \r\n  * *Export Strategy*: Find out where U.S. solutions fit into Vietnam\xe2\x80\x99s energy sector development and critical minerals strategies. \r\n  * *Coal and Critical Minerals Projects*: Explore how modernization and emerging regulations in Vietnam are leading to opportunities for suppliers of equipment and services for plant retrofits, efficiency upgrades and safety and environmental monitoring. \r\n  * *Expert Insights*: Learn how to align proposals with Vietnam\xe2\x80\x99s energy transition and industrial priorities, including actionable steps to enter the market. \r\n  * *Promotion Opportunities: *\xc2\xa0Learn about the new Coal and Mining Connect trade and promotion platform. \r\n  * \xc2\xa0 \r\n\r\n*Questions?* Please contact: Monica McFarlane | Monica.McFarlane@trade.gov <Luis.Arreola@trade.gov>\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*Register Now* [ https://events.trade.gov/en/TradeGov/US-VietnamPartnershiponModernMiningCoalEfficiencya/ ] \r\n \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nTrade Mission\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nIMPACT\r\nSouthern Cone Energy Technologies Trade Mission to Chile, Argentina, and Uruguay\r\n\r\nMarch 16\xe2\x80\x9319, 2026\r\n\r\n*"Registration Deadline: January 15, 2026"*\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nThe U.S. Department of Commerce\xe2\x80\x99s International Trade Administration (ITA) invites U.S. companies to take part in a high-impact Energy Technologies Trade Mission to Chile, Argentina, and Uruguay \xe2\x80\x94 three rapidly evolving markets at the forefront of Latin America\xe2\x80\x99s energy transformation.\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nOrganized under the *Initiative for Improving Advanced Competitiveness through Trade (IMPACT)*, this trade mission offers a unique opportunity for U.S. firms to connect with key decision-makers, explore growing market opportunities, and position their solutions in the Southern Cone\xe2\x80\x99s fast-expanding energy sectors.\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*Why Participate?*\r\n\r\n\r\n  * *Tap into government-driven investment* in energy infrastructure and sustainability across the region. \r\n  * *Meet pre-screened buyers, distributors, agents, and project developers* actively seeking U.S. technologies and expertise. \r\n  * *Gain on-the-ground insights* through market briefings, site visits, and face-to-face meetings. \r\n  * *Engage with high-level officials and industry leaders* during networking receptions and roundtables. \r\n\r\n*Explore. Connect. Expand.* Capitalize on this strategic opportunity to expand your business in South America\xe2\x80\x99s most dynamic energy markets.\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*Apply Now* [ https://links-1.govdelivery.com/CL0/https:%2F%2Fevents.trade.gov%2FTradeGov%2FSouthernConeEnergyTechTradeMission%2Fhotsite.php/2/01000196abc6fb4f-3efc8eef-ae71-4ef8-8b2c-86af8be3fa4f-000000/QzXqP77wOaXBMQCFl5S6-Nn1IYZlwo9mFCd_Y8-HfUQ=404 ] \r\n \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\nBusiness Mission to Baku\r\nU.S. Business Mission to Baku, Azerbaijan\r\n\r\n*February 9-10, 2026*\r\n\r\nThe U.S. Chamber of Commerce, in partnership with the U.S. Department of Commerce, will lead its first-ever bilateral Business Mission to Azerbaijan this February 9\xe2\x80\x9310, 2026. The delegation will spend two full days in Baku, meeting with Azerbaijani government and business leaders across various ministries and sectors.\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*Register Now* [ https://uschamberofcommerce.swoogo.com/baku-mission-2026 ] \r\n \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nUpcoming Trade Events\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\nSmart Energy Week 2026\r\n\r\n*March 17 - 19, 2026 | Tokyo, Japan*\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*Smart Energy Week* is an exhibition where the latest technologies, information, and people gather to accelerate business in the energy industry.\xc2\xa0 Smart Energy Week gathers a full range of energy technologies such as hydrogen and fuel cells, rechargeable batteries, smart grids, biomass, zero-emission thermal power generation, etc.\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nThis exhibition attracts a *significant number of visitors not only from Japan, but also from various Asian regions, including China and South Korea, making it an excellent opportunity for exhibitors seeking to expand their business in the Asian market.*\r\n\r\nThe exhibition provides an excellent platform for establishing strategic partnerships, exploring collaborative projects, and driving innovation through in-depth discussions and cutting-edge technologies.\r\n\r\nThe expected visitor profile includes: *Electric Power & Gas Companies, **Oil & Chemical Manufacturers, Power Generation & Transmission/Distribution Companies, Aggregators, General Contractors & Engineering Firms, Heavy Industry & Heavy Electric Machinery Manufacturers, Automotive & Transportation Equipment Manufacturers*\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nCompanies interested in attending or exhibiting at Smart Energy Week can contact Delaney Messina <delaney.messina@rxglobal.com> at RX Global for more information.\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*Learn More* [ https://www.wsew.jp/hub/en-gb.html ] \r\n \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\nWorld Hydrogen Summit 2026\r\n\r\n*May 19 - 21, 2026 | Rotterdam, the Netherlands*\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nThe industry\xe2\x80\x99s most influential event, *World Hydrogen Summit & Exhibition* returns to Europe\xe2\x80\x99s hydrogen hub in 2026!\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nBrought to you by the Sustainable Energy Council and RX Global, in partnership with the Dutch Government, the Province of South Holland, the City of Rotterdam and the Port of Rotterdam, *World Hydrogen 2026 is recognized as the official meeting place where hydrogen deals get done and key partnerships are forged*.\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nAcross the three bustling days, 10,000 global participants enter a world of hydrogen insights!\xc2\xa0 From strategic discussions at the C-Level Summit, leading products and services in the Exhibition, and in depth product showcases at the 3 Tech Stages, to the incredible site visits in the Port of Rotterdam and non-stop networking with over 4,800 companies at the world\xe2\x80\x99s most influential hydrogen event.\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nJoin the global hydrogen community for its yearly gathering and be part of the conversation as companies and governments discuss pragmatic approaches to navigate changing market conditions and enable successful deployment of projects.\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nCompanies interested in attending or exhibiting at World Hydrogen Summit & Exhibition can contact Delaney Messina <delaney.messina@rxglobal.com> at RX Global for more information.\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*Learn More* [ https://www.world-hydrogen-summit.com/world/en-gb.html ] \r\n \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\nExpo Electrica\r\n\r\nExpo El\xc3\xa9ctrica Internacional, since 1997, is the *most important business platform for the electrical sector at the national level, where the main manufacturers and distributors of the industry meet.*\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nIn addition to its extensive exhibition area, Expo El\xc3\xa9ctrica Internacional offers a program of highly specialized technical conferences and training sessions. It is a unique networking opportunity that *brings together more than 41,000 electrical industry professionals each year, covering areas such as lighting, automation, control, materials, electrical equipment, sustainable energy, electromobility, air conditioning, and refrigeration.*\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nTo learn more about the event, contact Claudia.Salgado@trade.gov\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*Learn More* [ https://expoelectrica.com.mx/Es/ ] \r\n \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\nROG.e\r\nROG.e\r\n\r\n*September 24 - 26, 2026 | Rio de Janeiro, Brazil*\r\n\r\nThe new ROG.e (previously called Rio Oil & Gas) \xe2\x80\x94 one of the world\xe2\x80\x99s largest energy events \xe2\x80\x94\xc2\xa0will take place from *September 21\xe2\x80\x9324, 2026* at Riocentro with the ambition of becoming the world\'s largest energy festival.\xc2\xa0 Hosted by the *Brazilian Petroleum and Gas Institute (IBP)*, ROG.e 2026 signals the beginning of a new era, combining strategic discussions with influential global keynote speakers, interactive spaces, and networking experiences, making it a truly unique global energy gathering.\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nSince 1982, ROG.e has brought together major leaders, experts, and companies in the energy sector. Throughout its history, the event has evolved to reflect global energy transformations, incorporating new content, expanding thematic areas, and promoting debates on emerging technologies, innovations, and energy transition strategies.\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nIn 2026, ROG.e is expected to receive an even larger audience, composed of professionals, academics, public sector professionals, and representatives of companies from different segments of the energy chain. The event will feature a robust schedule of technical sessions, debate panels, and networking spaces, creating unique opportunities for knowledge exchange.\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*Learn More* [ https://roge.energy/en/ ] \r\n \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nCoal and Mining Export Opportunities Initiative\r\n\r\nThe U.S. Commercial Service\'s Coal and Mining Export Opportunities Initiative aligns with the Administration\'s Executive Order on reinvigorating coal and related technology sectors.\xc2\xa0 *This initiative aims to boost international trade and facilitate exports of U.S. coal -- recognized globally for the exceptional quality and performance of its thermal and metallurgical grades -- as well as showcase the unmatched expertise and innovation of American mining equipment manufacturers*.\xc2\xa0 Sign up below to receive the latest news on our Coal and Mining Global Webinar Series, upcoming Trade Shows and Missions, inclusion in our Coal and Mining Connect Directory, customized market research and business matchmaking, and more.\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*Sign Up for Updates* [ https://forms.office.com/pages/responsepage.aspx?id=8oPRoXtsmk25lF8vMbP3gOqQa5SqcfdOhJUawlhCEZtUM0tGM0FFQzRJU0FPOUdHUjlaUDZCOEJZMi4u&origin=QRCode&route=shorturl ] \r\n \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nTrade Leads\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nSt. Kitts \r\n\r\nSolar and Battery Storage\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nSt. Kitts Tender [ https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/USITATRADE/2026/01/15/file_attachments/3524169/St%20Kitts%20solar%20and%20battery%20storage%20tender.pdf ]\r\n\r\n Oman \r\n\r\nCCUS Ecosystems\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nOman: CCUS [ https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/USITATRADE/2025/12/10/file_attachments/3488930/Oman%20CCUS.pdf ]\r\n\r\n Colombia \r\n\r\nOil and Gas products: pipelines, fittings, valves\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n*Colombia: fittings, valves [ https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/USITATRADE/2026/01/15/file_attachments/3524202/Energy%20Trade%20Lead%20Form_Codifer.pdf ]*\r\n\r\n Colombia \r\n\r\nRegasification project\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n*Colombia: regasification [ https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/USITATRADE/2026/01/15/file_attachments/3524218/Energy%20Trade%20Lead%20Form_Intelcost%20CENIT.pdf ]*\r\n\r\n Ecuador \r\n\r\nEcuadorian Electrical Corporation Government Tender\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n*Ecuador: CELEC Tender [ https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/USITATRADE/2025/12/10/file_attachments/3488947/Ecador%20Government%20Tender.pdf ]*\r\n\r\n Togo \r\n\r\nExtension of power plant at Port of Lome\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n*Togo: Power Plant [ https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/USITATRADE/2025/12/10/file_attachments/3488937/Togo%20Lome%20Container%20Terminal%20power%20plant.pdf ]*\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nEcuador\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nOil Pipeline\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n*Ecuador: Oil Pipeline [ https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/USITATRADE/2025/12/10/file_attachments/3488929/Ecuador%20oil%20pipeline.pdf ]*\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nSouth Africa\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nSeeking partners interested in the pursuit of gas pipeline development, construction and operation, gas to power plans and export/import terminal developments.\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n*South Africa: gas pipeline development [ https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/USITATRADE/2025/08/13/file_attachments/3355308/Energy%20Trade%20Lead%20Form%20-%20ENERGY%20%20GAS%20South%20Africa.pdf ]*\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nSouth Africa\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nSeeking partners in management and development of oil pipelines and refineries.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n*South Africa: pipelines and refineries [ https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/USITATRADE/2025/08/13/file_attachments/3355311/Energy%20Trade%20Lead%20Form%20-%20PETROCHEMICALS%20-%20South%20Africa.pdf ]*\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nBahrain\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nUtility scale photovoltaic facility\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n*Bahrain: PV facility [ https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/USITATRADE/2025/12/10/file_attachments/3488945/Bahrain%20utility%20scale%20pv.pdf ]*\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nBulgaria\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nConsultancy service for the State Enterprise for Radioactive Waste in Bulgaria.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n*Consultancy service [ https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/USITATRADE/2025/08/14/file_attachments/3356017/Energy%20Trade%20Lead%20-%20SERAW_08%202025%20-%20Bulgaria.pdf ]*\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nBarbados\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nGovernment tender: Battery Energy Storage Systems\r\n\r\n Barbados: BESS [ https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/USITATRADE/2025/12/10/file_attachments/3488928/Barbados%20BESS.pdf ] \r\n\r\nJordan\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nDevelopment of the Northern Risha Gas Field and East Safawi Area\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nJordan: *Development of the Northern Risha Gas Field and East Safawi Area* [ https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/USITATRADE/2025/12/10/file_attachments/3488948/Jordan%20Development%20of%20the%20Northern%20Risha%20Gas%20Field%20and%20East%20Safawi%20Area.pdf ]\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nMauritius\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nThe Central Electricity Board invites prospective bidders to rent to CEB, install, test and commission one or two MGT(s) in Jin-Fei, Mauritius.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n*Mobile Gas Turbines [ https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/USITATRADE/2025/08/14/file_attachments/3356024/Energy%20Trade%20Lead%20Form-%20Mauritius%20-%20Mobile%20Gas%20Turbine.pdf ]*\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nEuropean Bank for Reconstruction and Development\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nVarious opportunities.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n*New EBRD Leads [ https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/USITATRADE/2025/12/10/file_attachments/3489022/EBRD%20Energy%20Trade%20Leads%20and%20Open%20Tenders%20%28Published%20Since%20Sept%201%29.pdf ]*\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nDominican Republic\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n***** *DOMINICAN REPUBLIC:* PDG Modems [ https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/USITATRADE/2025/07/02/file_attachments/3313099/PDG%20Modems%20red%20mo%CC%81vil%20LTE%20230625%20-%20v12.pdf ]*****\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nSuriname\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n***** Suriname [ https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/USITATRADE/2025/07/02/file_attachments/3313100/Commercial%20Diplomacy%20Suriname-%20Expansion%20of%20Transmission%20and%20Distribution%20Systems%20Project.docx ]*****\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nGuatemala\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n*****GUATEMALA:* [ https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/USITATRADE/2025/06/11/file_attachments/3289929/Energy%20Trade%20Lead%20Form%20PEG5%20Guat