0Trade%20Lead%20Form%20-%20Project%20Kagesi%20%28002%29.pdf ]\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nSouth Africa\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n**SOUTH AFRICA: * [ https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/USITATRADE/2025/03/13/file_attachments/3195449/Energy%20Trade%20Lead%20Form%20Rivoni%20Matimba%20Pty%20Ltd.pdf ]*Rivoni Matimba Pty Ltd [ https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/USITATRADE/2025/03/13/file_attachments/3195449/Energy%20Trade%20Lead%20Form%20Rivoni%20Matimba%20Pty%20Ltd.pdf ]\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nEl Salvador\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n**SAN SALVADOR: * [ https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/USITATRADE/2025/03/13/file_attachments/3194954/Trade%20Lead%20Form_Gamma%20Enterprise.pdf ]*Gamma Enterprise [ https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/USITATRADE/2025/03/13/file_attachments/3194954/Trade%20Lead%20Form_Gamma%20Enterprise.pdf ]\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nMarket Research\r\n\r\nEnergy Market Intelligence\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*Did you know that the International Trade Administration publishes\xc2\xa0comprehensive and up-to-date information about the\xc2\xa0Energy market and the export potential for your products and services?\xc2\xa0 See below for some recent examples.*\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n\r\n  * *Croatia Energy \xe2\x82\xac335 Million Tender for Oil and Gas Well Services:*\xc2\xa0 Croatia\xe2\x80\x99s largest oil and gas company is seeking contractors for a \xe2\x82\xac335 million, five-year oil and gas well services contract Read the report! [ https://www.trade.gov/market-intelligence/croatia-energy-eu335-million-tender-oil-and-gas-well-services ] \r\n  * *C\xc3\xb4te d\xe2\x80\x99Ivoire Petroleum Infrastructure and Logistics Projects*:\xc2\xa0 U.S. companies have the opportunity to participate in developing C\xc3\xb4te d\xe2\x80\x99Ivoire\xe2\x80\x99s petroleum infrastructure.\xc2\xa0 Read the report! [ https://www.trade.gov/market-intelligence/cote-divoire-petroleum-infrastructure-and-logistics-projects ] \r\n  * *Brazil Oil and Gas Petrobras Business Plan*:\xc2\xa0 Brazil\xe2\x80\x99s largest company announces investment plan that expands opportunities for U.S. upstream, downstream, and clean-energy suppliers. Read the report! [ https://www.trade.gov/market-intelligence/brazil-oil-and-gas-petrobras-business-plan ] \r\n  * *South Korea Liquid Natural Gas Market:* Korea\xe2\x80\x99s LNG contracts make the U.S. its #2 supplier, creating new opportunities for U.S. exporters offering flexible deals, pricing and logistics support. \xc2\xa0Read the report! [ https://www.trade.gov/market-intelligence/south-korea-liquid-natural-gas-market ] \r\n\r\nAbove are just a few of our energy market intelligence reports recently released. Access the full library of reports below!\r\n\r\n*Energy Market Intelligence Reports* [ https://trade.gov/market-intelligence-search/776 ] \r\n \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nCountry Commercial Guides\r\n\r\nOur trade experts working at U.S. Embassies and Consulates have updated the\xc2\xa0*Country Commercial Guides!*\xc2\xa0Find current assessments of global opportunities, market conditions, and great tips on doing business abroad.\r\n\r\n*Choose Your Country Guide* [ https://www.trade.gov/ccg-landing-page ] \r\n \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n*We hope you enjoyed this edition of "Going Global Energy Newsletter."*\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n  \r\n \r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n* International Trade Administration*\xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0United States Commercial Service, International Trade Administration [ https://www.trade.gov/us-commercial-service ]*\r\n [ https://www.trade.gov/us-commercial-service ]*  \r\n\r\nThe U.S. Commercial Service is the trade promotion arm of the\r\n*U.S. Department of Commerce\'s International Trade Administration.*\r\nU.S. Commercial Service trade professionals in over 100 U.S. cities and in more than 75 markets \r\nhelp U.S. companies get started in exporting or increase sales to global markets.\r\n\r\n*STAY CONNECTED*\r\n\r\nVisit us on X [ https://twitter.com/exportgov ]\xc2\xa0 Connect with us on LinkedIn [ https://www.linkedin.com/company/uscommercialservice/ ]\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nBookmark and Share [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USITATRADE/bulletins/40301a0?reqfrom=share ]\r\n\r\nIf you are ready to begin exporting or expand to additional global markets, \r\nplease contact your nearest U.S. Commercial Service office [ https://www.trade.gov/commercial-services-offices-us ]\r\nor check out our online EXPORT SOLUTIONS [ https://www.trade.gov/export-solutions ].\r\n\r\n*SUBSCRIBER SERVICES*\r\nVisit our User Profile Page [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USITATRADE/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] to update your subscriptions or unsubscribe.\r\nIf you need assistance, please visit\xc2\xa0subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/hc/en-us ].\r\n\r\n \r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\nThis email was sent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com using GovDelivery Communications Cloud on behalf of the International Trade Administration\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7 1401 Constitution Avenue NW \xc2\xb7 Washington, DC 20230 GovDelivery logo [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/ ] \r\nbody .abe-column-block { min-height: 5px; } table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:10px; margin-right:10px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;} table.govd_hr {min-width: 100%;}\r\n'
