[2026-04-27 10:34:59] Raw text/plain payload: b'United States Census Bureau [ https://www.census.gov/en.html?utm_campaign=&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nHow to Resolve Common AES Response Messages\r\n\r\n*\r\nJanuary 15, 2026*\r\n\r\n"*Note: This message is sent to all AES Updates subscribers and is for educational purposes only.*"\r\n\r\nWhen submitting your Electronic Export Information (EEI) to the Automated Export System (AES), you can receive different response messages: Fatal, Compliance, Verify, Informational and Warning.\xc2\xa0 It is important that AES filers address and/or correct Response Messages as soon as they are received to comply with the Foreign Trade Regulations [ https://www.census.gov/foreign-trade/regulations/index.html?utm_campaign=&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ].\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nTo help you take the appropriate action, here is guidance on how to address one of the most frequent Response Messages that were generated in the AES for the previous month.\r\n\r\n_Response Code:\xc2\xa0 503_\r\n\r\nNarrative:\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0 License Code Missing\r\n\r\nSeverity:\xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0Fatal\r\n\r\nReason:\xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0The License Code/ License Exemption Code is missing.\r\n\r\n*Resolution: A License Code/ License Exemption Code must be reported on every shipment.\xc2\xa0 \r\n\r\n**Valid License Codes in AES are listed in _Appendix F - License and License Exemption Type Codes and Reporting Guidelines [ https://www.cbp.gov/document/guidance/aestir-appendix-f-license-and-license-exemption-type-codes?utm_campaign=&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]_.\xc2\xa0 \r\n\r\n**Verify the License Code/ License Exemption Code, correct the shipment and resubmit. \r\n\r\n*For a complete list of the AES Response Codes, their reasons and resolutions, see _Appendix A \xe2\x80\x93 Commodity Filing Response Messages [ https://www.cbp.gov/document/guidance/aestir-appendix-commodity-filing-response-messages?utm_campaign=&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]_.\r\n\r\nAs a reminder, filers have multiple resources that they can use when filing EEI to the AES.\xc2\xa0 You can access User Guides, Walk-through videos and other resources at our website [ http://www.census.gov/aes?utm_campaign=&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ].\r\n\r\nPlease contact the U.S. Census Bureau\xe2\x80\x99s Trade Data Collection Branch for further information or questions.\r\n\r\nTelephone: (800) 549-0595, select option 1 for AES\r\n\r\nEmail: askaes@census.gov\r\n\r\nOnline: www.census.gov/trade [ http://www.census.gov/trade?utm_campaign=&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] [ https://www.census.gov/newsroom/blogs/global-reach.html?utm_campaign=&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\n*Help us spread the word about Census Bureau data!*\r\n\r\nShare this on social media or forward it to a friend.\r\n\r\n*Share This* [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USCENSUS/bulletins/4049eb4 ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nAbout the Census Bureau\r\n\r\nWe serve as the nation\xe2\x80\x99s leading provider of quality data about its people and economy.\xc2\xa0The Census Bureau is the federal government\'s largest statistical agency. As the world\xe2\x80\x99s premier statistical agency, we are dedicated to making our nation a better place. Policy-makers, businesses, and the public use our data to make informed decisions.\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n  \r\n \r\n\r\n*Stay connected with us!*\r\n\r\nJoin the conversation on social media.\r\n\r\n facebook [ https://www.facebook.com/uscensusbureau/?utm_campaign=&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]instagram [ https://www.instagram.com/uscensusbureau/?utm_campaign=&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]linkedin [ https://www.linkedin.com/company/us-census-bureau/?utm_campaign=&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]twitter [ https://twitter.com/uscensusbureau/?utm_campaign=&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] [ https://www.linkedin.com/company/us-census-bureau/?utm_campaign=&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]youtube [ https://www.youtube.com/user/uscensusbureau/?utm_campaign=&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]  \r\n\r\nSUBSCRIBER SERVICES:\r\n\r\nSubscriber Settings [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USCENSUS/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 Remove me from All Subscriptions  [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USCENSUS/subscriber/one_click_unsubscribe?verification=5.76359f46a06559a62e8e0404a80cc7e5&destination=jasonnorman66994%40gmail.com ]\xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0Help [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/ ]\r\n\r\n \r\n&lt;!-- /* template top padding on mobile */ @media only screen and (max-width: 480px) { table#flexible-abe-main-table { padding:0 !important; } } --&gt; ________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\nThis is an official email from the U.S. Census Bureau. If you have any questions or comments, please contact us (http://www.census.gov/about/contact-us.html [ http://www.census.gov/about/contact-us.html?utm_campaign=&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]).  \xc2\xa0 \r\nbody .abe-column-block {min-height: 5px;} table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:7px; margin-right:7px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;}\r\n'
