jXv )\r\nWanda,\r\nNew year, same resolutions? You're not alone.             Nearly\r\n75% of Americans fell short of their saving and spending\r\nresolutions in 2025 according to a recent survey.\xc2\xb9 If your budget\r\nfell off sometime around Valentine\xe2\x80\x99s Day last year, maybe it\xe2\x80\x99s\r\ntime to try a budgeting style that actually fits this year.\r\nHere are three approaches to help you stay on track in 2026.\r\n50/30/20 budget\r\n\r\nBreak it down like this: 50% for needs, 30% for wants, and 20%\r\nfor savings. That last 20%? Put it to work. Earn\r\n4.00%\r\nAPY on your savings for up to six months when you open a SoFi\r\nChecking and Savings account with eligible direct deposit.\xc2\xb2 After\r\nthat, you\xe2\x80\x99ll still earn a strong\r\n3.30% savings\r\nAPY3\xe2\x80\x94 8x\r\nthe national average savings rate based on FDIC monthly savings\r\naccount rate \r\n( https://ablink.r.sofi.com/ls/click?upn=u001.k-2FImUMyJvquSjfrastfytL7Xeiq3hAuQvxdUup8Mg9Q7yx-2BkOLXwYpYj7FoYNDwJe3reFL65ltlyE8ulj6hNpauthz-2Fs-2FXKwXi9mACynLQw-3Dk-vV_Hvirw9jLOYnqUg7ucIAtvDa4JCWhfjePQT8cfdKWfeKaKK6WyzUu0MT5hcL83ezarLAJeFzEeRP-2BR0XWfLa6c3LafQstlKEWkiUuForPSSRcjVQwJ11iHEZ-2FwNI5P-2FF1vxwQ1YWbgB4fFHKfdAO-2FSxCfYrTnHaSG7LN8pl0rL48q9f5aE2LNIHE2MckK0LmiZGdNzNfozgMSz4fK4UeFuBGm3XOXtmFp9iQ2-2BxL9uze-2F-2FVFjllun5nJ-2BzF9x8qP7YP8VHmsH9sTtfxBUP3PsrtPgKhVtT2pzbNqnqUVbzDVdCP3vEvZbrkeL0pACKAHExRaZ8e9vboJwCOmxDjrInDem5JafWHne5HCz3jJU8CD-2BXrPPwoiNsXXE2l-2BO42tHt1RgJIy9aPvh3pdZcgxKPMfOWBjfntn2h3mC0lKmI0NUOEyGLq-2Bi-2BRW6PmDoBFFTJQoPgZmyOTPZX3YltSdj9aTAJXbnYy1OCYNcEcspjM8RYu6wqGsq2LbhIg2spZ9m6yty5w-2FY9ps73aZTHQL86v6xe22CJ0mH3-2BZ9L0X4SM4qXRywEQM-2BXGC7vT-2BJ7exE7J6lEqzPPE7eimtEp53c0kAFh2S4rN8W8ukLPKaY-2FfYn-2B0c9MlK-2F8nM-2FJGPN1eep24uoeA1FIJJ31pj-2BJabvZ36rY3EYOIKbwd2Gq3-2BA85ewqIAk3hUrOW0e1Pv4WKErlR9z8BjC8P1-2FJ-2FL4Yb74yB7h6SbFavPEDxpet-2FQ1LIXyv-2BIQSXZKhZbwEpJVZ3Zf )\r\n as of December 15, 2025. 4\r\nPlease note rates are variable and subject to change.\r\nEnvelope budget\r\n\r\nImagine having designated spots for all your spending\r\ncategories\xe2\x80\x94one for groceries, one for rent, another for that\r\ndream vacation. The envelope system helps you visually allocate\r\nyour money. When you bank with SoFi, you can use Vaults to\r\nearmark your goals and turn on Autopilot to automatically move\r\nmoney toward them\xe2\x80\x94making it easy to stay on track.\r\n\r\nZero-sum budget\r\n\r\nEvery single dollar gets a purpose. This attention to detail\r\nhelps you take complete control of your finances. Use Bill Pay\r\nwith SoFi Checking and Savings to automatically send money where\r\nit needs to go, covering bills, subscriptions, and other must-dos\r\nso every dollar does its job.                        Open a SoFi\r\nChecking and Savings account and get the tools you need to master\r\nyour money mindset. With Vaults and Autopilot, it\xe2\x80\x99s easy to\r\nautomate your finances, stay in control, and crush your 2026\r\ngoals.                 Open an account \r\n( https://ablink.r.sofi.com/ls/click?upn=u001.k-2FImUMyJvquSjfrastfytEja-2F8Xz9cKX8PbFN-2FwdoYYLZd2Rc6hQ2NtkLZ8rn25zMYMX_Hvirw9jLOYnqUg7ucIAtvDa4JCWhfjePQT8cfdKWfeKaKK6WyzUu0MT5hcL83ezarLAJeFzEeRP-2BR0XWfLa6c3LafQstlKEWkiUuForPSSRcjVQwJ11iHEZ-2FwNI5P-2FF1vxwQ1YWbgB4fFHKfdAO-2FSxCfYrTnHaSG7LN8pl0rL48q9f5aE2LNIHE2MckK0LmiZGdNzNfozgMSz4fK4UeFuBGm3XOXtmFp9iQ2-2BxL9uze-2F-2FVFjllun5nJ-2BzF9x8qP7YP8VHmsH9sTtfxBUP3PsrtPgKhVtT2pzbNqnqUVbzDVdCP3vEvZbrkeL0pACKAHExRaZ8e9vboJwCOmxDjrInDem5JafWHne5HCz3jJU8CD-2BXrPPwoiNsXXE2l-2BO42tHt1RgJIy9aPvh3pdZcgxKPMfOWBjfntn2h3mC0lKmI0NUOEyGLq-2Bi-2BRW6PmDoBFFTJQoPgZmyOTPZX3YltSdj9aTAJXbnYy1OCYNcEcspjM8RYu6wqGsq2LbhIg2spZ9m6yty5w-2FY9ps73aZTHQL86v6xe22CJ0mH3-2BZ9L0X4SM4qXRywEQM-2BXGC7vT-2BJ7exE7J6lEqzPPE7eimtEp53c0kAFh2S4rN8W8ukLPKaY-2FfbK9VKOErYtFdLRJHylkna4A6nyeHcJjDANeyhwAZJLRZVgf2TuQwphZNAH56uKo-2BoKuNJOtOzWI-2BcTZDKdRJTHcDWe-2FY9iewfEzTpIGnA1qQW5DeIHiAU-2Bmm7crRJF45fKNzf6Yp5rCGDaA8GsiZgD )           \xc2\xb9Insights based on\r\nthe 2025 Vanguard