[2026-04-27 10:35:05] Raw text/plain payload: b'\r\nAllAboutCookies        Spot where your personal info is exposed and remove it with confidence.         \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c \xe2\x80\x8c        \r\n\r\nHi Jason,                                                                    \r\n\r\nYour personal information can end up on the web without you knowing it. Data brokers and people-search sites might list your full name, current and past addresses, phone numbers \xe2\x80\x94 and the same of everyone you know!                                                                    \r\n\r\nThe good news is you can uncover what\xe2\x80\x99s out there and take steps to remove it. Here\xe2\x80\x99s a friendly, practical guide to finding and cleaning up your exposed data.                                                                    \r\n\r\n\xf0\x9f\x94\x8d 1. Start with a data exposure scan\r\n\r\nBefore you can clean up your data, you need to see what\xe2\x80\x99s out there. A free data exposure scan gives you a snapshot of what personal details are floating around publicly or in data broker lists.                                                                    \r\n\r\n\xf0\x9f\x91\x89 Run a free data exposure scan (https://trk2.cp20.com/click/gsi4-303uva-1iheyy-lt1c1wk8/pmrf65jchirgq5duobztulzpmfwgyylcn52xiy3pn5vwszltfzxxezzpmzzgkzjnmrqxiyjnmv4ha33tovzgklltmnqw4p3vorwv643povzggzk4ouydam3emfqwgxdvgaydentvorwv63lfmruxk3k4ouydam3emvwwc2lmfvrxaxdvgaydentvorwv65dfojwvy5jqgazwijdtn52xey3fej6q%3D%3D%3D%3D).\r\n\r\n\xf0\x9f\xa7\xb9 2. Remove exposed data yourself\r\n\r\nFinding exposed data is only half the battle. Removing it is when the real work begins.                                                                    \r\n\r\nHere\xe2\x80\x99s how to get started:                                                                    Contact site owners: Look for \xe2\x80\x9cContact,\xe2\x80\x9d \xe2\x80\x9cSupport,\xe2\x80\x9d or \xe2\x80\x9cPrivacy\xe2\x80\x9d pages and ask for your info to be removed.Use site opt-out forms: Some data brokers offer forms to request deletion.Update privacy settings: Tighten settings to limit public exposure.                                                                    \xe2\x8f\xb1 3. Want to save time? Consider a data removal service\r\n\r\nManually removing your data works, but it can take hours of searching, filling out forms, and following up. Data removal services automate this process by submitting opt-out requests on your behalf and monitoring for new listings over time.                                                                    \r\n\r\n\xf0\x9f\x91\x89 Review our guide on the best data removal services (https://trk2.cp20.com/click/gsi4-303uva-1ly982-lt1c1wk8/pmrf65jchirgq5duobztulzpmfwgyylcn52xiy3pn5vwszltfzxxezzpmjsxg5bnmrqxiyjnojsw233wmfwc243foj3gsy3fh52xi3k7onxxk4tdmvohkmbqgnsgcyldlr2tambsgz2xi3k7nvswi2lvnvohkmbqgnsgk3lbnfwc2y3qlr2tambsgz2xi3k7orsxe3k4ouydam3eerzw65lsmnsse7i%3D).\r\n\r\nStay safe, Jason.\r\n\r\n                                                                    https://trk2.cp20.com/click/gsi4-303uva-1ly984-%3D%3D%3D%3D%3D%3D (https://trk2.cp20.com/click/gsi4-303uva-1ly983-lt1c1wk9/pmrf65jchirgq5duobztulzpmfwgyylcn52xiy3pn5vwszltfzxxezzph52xi3k7onxxk4tdmvohkmbqgnsgcyldlr2tambsgz2xi3k7nvswi2lvnvohkmbqgnsgk3lbnfwc2y3qlr2tambsgz2xi3k7orsxe3k4ouydam3eerzw65lsmnsse7i%3D)Unsubscribe\r\n\xc2\xa9 January 15, 2026 All About Cookies                                                                    \r\n111 E. Atlantic Ave., Suite 200, Delray Beach, FL 33444                                    \r\nAll About Cookies is an informational website that provides tips, advice, and recommendations to help you with Online Privacy, Identity Theft Prevention, Antivirus Protection, and Digital Security. We strive to provide up-to-date information, but make no warranties regarding the accuracy of our information. Ultimately, you are responsible for your digital security. All About Cookies is not a digital security product and does not provide any digital security products.                                                        \r\n\r\n'
