rreversible. SoFi is not responsible\r\nfor any failure or delay in processing a transaction resulting\r\nfrom factors beyond its reasonable control, including blockchain\r\nnetwork congestion, protocol or network operations, or incorrect\r\naddress information. Availability of specific digital assets,\r\nfeatures, and services is subject to change and may be limited by\r\napplicable law and regulation.\r\n\r\nSoFi Crypto products and services are offered by SoFi Bank,\r\nN.A., a national bank regulated by the Office of the Comptroller\r\nof the Currency. SoFi Bank does not provide investment, tax, or\r\nlegal advice. Please refer to the SoFi Crypto account agreement \r\n( https://ablink.m.sofi.org/ls/click?upn=u001.k-2FImUMyJvquSjfrastfytMlP-2B8q6pOg1vXyfQ-2BewlRGj7XAvluRL0iS0dfvGrQsNV1Ka_Hvirw9jLOYnqUg7ucIAtvDa4JCWhfjePQT8cfdKWfeKaKK6WyzUu0MT5hcL83ezarLAJeFzEeRP-2BR0XWfLa6c1ISM06pZNjn0d4HK2ShGAd3K-2BgelayCl6WVO1NVPj0hkjGn9-2FdIMk-2BnBCtQiX4-2B6XCiytbjlSfSLAe4X-2F9zJJr8uqz-2FwmtXwWHvFQIohXdlZiIyhF9sxIIfC9oY6rGeXMjTnEt195WHXdsij2RVDxNOu63cxz0n3f1PEcGs2MSHnitqyTc8aUhW-2BwUd1EV2PPpEm-2FpCD40kl7LXNlcTi-2Fjv9tj4zrncpd8sQ5L2Nc8i345RNLyRlLkXzUAN8o0si1qy7rpRfL30qinRLexcVo2S4mmyyUEBQliCM-2B0CCfxr33JqHeQ3e-2BlSi3-2B5GEzgh9YePvI7jvRTTCsGA4gvThGdlIeckB5Mr8g8iOIGlBPF-2BqB17GKazqAbuxANlNnvCreYHvSlM5LL1M9YE66nFNaGzbN1tzI4AGXIrDvPO5RykotXY1v3ysL5inSkj7hspJyx-2FMOzcQ5VIv3luDjd6QDpVIX-2FOtZdaA9gOBnWKEBNqXqG-2FTe2DmlmLiYMz74DHv1t6-2FPDXDpK3fo6A7QPmopl3faU5cvyYdBm08dvyZZxMxTOFXgNbCePGT8DbPvkHmqQFZXuNxipa1fRoQZnZnYUzXRO4LDQp-2Fdd0Hv8ONFzbEwtFMSy1sOdAbBo2tKQec3-2Bcdw6D0Sd8TzGmaiyu0I-3D ) for additional terms and\r\nconditions.        1ELIGIBILITY\r\nThis Promotion is open and available to SoFi members who are\r\nlegal residents of the fifty (50) United States and the District\r\nof Columbia and are at least eighteen (18) years of age or older\r\nas of time of promotion period. Open to SoFi members who are\r\nlegal residents of the 50 U.S. states/DC, 18+, with active SoFi\r\nPlus, Checking/Savings, and Crypto accounts. SoFi Plus status\r\nmust be active at the time of an eligible crypto buy to qualify\r\nfor the 1% match.\r\n\r\nPROMOTION TIMING & PHASES\r\nThe Promotion runs from January 15, 2026 through December 31,\r\n2026 and is divided into two phases. To be eligible for this\r\nPromotion, you must participate in the Offer Phase and maintain\r\nthe digital assets through the Holding Phase. * Offer Phase\r\n(Buying Window): Jan 15, 2026 (9:00 a.m. ET) \xe2\x80\x93 March 30, 2026\r\n(11:59 p.m. ET).\r\n* Holding Phase (Holding Window): March 31, 2026 (12:00 a.m. ET)\r\n\xe2\x80\x93 December 31, 2026 (11:59 p.m. ET).\r\nHOW IT WORKS\r\nSoFi Plus members can earn a 1% Match on Net Funded Crypto Buys\r\nmade through SoFi Bank, N.A., capped at a total buy volume of\r\n$250,000. * Funding: Eligible crypto buys must be funded directly\r\nfrom your SoFi Checking & Savings.\r\nIncoming crypto transfers do not qualify. * Calculation: The 1%\r\nMatch is based on the total USD value of eligible crypto buys\r\nmade during the Offer Phase, MINUS the value of any cash or\r\ndigital asset withdrawals from your SoFi Crypto account at any\r\ntime before Dec 31, 2026.\r\nSelling digital assets does not reduce your match amount\r\nprovided the proceeds remain in your SoFi Crypto account or are\r\nused to buy other digital assets.    1% MATCH CALCULATION\r\nEXAMPLES * Standard Buy and Hold\r\nA SoFi Plus Member executes $1,000 worth of crypto buys during\r\nOffer Phase and holds the digital assets on platform through Dec\r\n31, 2026.\r\n1% Match: $10 in stablecoin.\r\n\r\n* Cash/Digital Asset Withdrawal\r\nA SoFi Plus Member executes $1,000 worth of crypto buys during\r\nOffer Phase and withdraws $500 (cash or digital asset withdrawal)\r\nbefore Dec 31, 2026.\r\n1% Match: $5 in stablecoin \xe2\x80\x93 1% of the remaining $500 net funded\r\namount.\r\n\r\n* Trading/Rebalancing Portfolio\r\nA SoFi Plus Member executes a $1,000 BTC crypto buy. Later,\r\nsells $500 of BTC to buy ETH. No withdrawals made and holds\r\ndigital assets on platform through Dec 31, 2026.\r\n1% Match: $10 in stablecoin \xe2\x80\x93 1% Match based on original net\r\nfunding for crypto buys.\r\n\r\n* Market Value Changes\r\nA SoFi Plus Member executes $1,000 worth of crypto buys. Market\r\ndrops portfolio value to $800. No withdrawals made and digital\r\nassets held on platform through Dec 31, 2026.\r\n1% Match: $10 in stablecoin \xe2\x80\x93 Market performance does not affect\r\n1% match payout.\r\nPAYOUT METHOD & TIMING\r\nThe 1% Match payout will be paid in a one-time bonus, in\r\nstablecoin, credited to the member\xe2\x80\x99s SoFi Crypto account. The\r\nstablecoin used for the match payout will be determined by SoFi\r\nat its discretion. The member must maintain an active SoFi Crypto\r\naccount to receive the payout. Payments will begin at the\r\nconclusion of the promotion period on or around January 2027.\r\n\r\nADDITIONAL IMPORTANT TERMS * The SoFi Plus 1% Crypto Match\r\nPromo may be combined with other SoFi Crypto promos.\r\n* Promotion is non-transferable and limited to one per account.\r\n* SoFi reserves the right to exclude any members from\r\nparticipating in this Promotion for any reason, such as suspected\r\nfraud, misuse, or suspicious activity.\r\n* If SoFi suspects that there may have been fraudulent activity\r\nand/or a violation of these Terms & Conditions in connection with\r\nthe Offer, or a violation of the customer agreement, SoFi\r\nreserves the right to either decline to grant the Match, or to\r\nrescind the Offer. SoFi reserves the right to liquidate any\r\ndigital assets to make up for any shortfall.\r\nSoFi also reserves the right to modify, suspend, or terminate\r\nthe Promotion at any time without notice.\r\n\r\n2$1,000 Value of SoFi Plus membership: The value of a SoFi\r\nPlus membership varies depending on benefits used, and there is\r\nno guarantee you will reach or receive any specific value.\r\n$1,000+ estimated value is based on (i) the average activity of\r\nexisting SoFi Plus members for the following benefits over a\r\n12-month period and (ii) publicly available Urban Institute\xe2\x80\x99s\r\nAmerican Affordability Tracker data regarding average annual\r\ngrocery spending used to estimate potential Smart Card cash back\r\nrewards: an estimated $600 in annual cash back rewards at grocery\r\nstores with SoFi Smart Card (estimated earnings based on 5% cash\r\nback rewards on grocery store purchases and the average monthly\r\ngrocery spend for a family of four, as reported in the Urban\r\nInstitute's American Affordability Tracker, released October\r\n2025. Actual rewards earned will vary based on household size,\r\ngrocery spending, and card usage), an average of $17,000\r\ndeposited in a SoFi savings account with a 3.60% APY at the start\r\nof the 12-month period, $21,500 average annual spend on the SoFi\r\nUnlimited 2% Credit Card (with a 10% boost on cash-back rewards),\r\nand one additional 30-minute session (beyond the basic member\r\nbenefit) with a certified financial planner, with an assumed\r\nvalue of $300. Other Plus benefits are available beyond those\r\nstated above. SoFi Credit Card cash back rewards are earned in\r\nthe form of rewards points, and rewards points redeem at a rate\r\nof 1 cent per point. SoFi Plus members must be approved for a\r\nSoFi Credit Card or SoFi Smart Card in order to receive the\r\ncorresponding benefits. Savings and spend assumptions are based\r\non average activity from existing SoFi Plus members between the\r\nperiod of 10/1/2024 - 9/30/2025. Terms apply.    3 Active SoFi\r\nPlus members are eligible for a 2% match offer on qualifying\r\nrecurring IRA contributions, up to their Internal Revenue Service\r\n(IRS) contribution limit, into their eligible new or existing\r\nSoFI IRA account. The match requires the funds and match to be\r\nmaintained in the account that received the match for five (5)\r\nyears from the settlement date. Match