[2026-04-27 10:35:11] Raw text/plain payload: b'Do not eat, sell or serve recalled Live it Up-brand Super Greens dietary supplement powder.  \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nUS Food and Drug Administration \r\nOutbreak Investigations & Safety Advisories\r\n\r\nFDA Human Foods Program\r\n\r\nThe following is an update from FDA of concern to our subscribers.\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nOutbreak Investigation of Salmonella: Dietary Supplement \r\n\r\nJanuary 15, 2026\r\n\r\nThe FDA and CDC, in collaboration with state and local partners,\xc2\xa0are investigating\xc2\xa0illnesses in a multistate outbreak of\xc2\xa0"Salmonella"\xc2\xa0Typhimurium\xc2\xa0infections\xc2\xa0linked to\xc2\xa0Live it Up-brand\xc2\xa0Super Greens\xc2\xa0dietary supplement powder\xc2\xa0produced\xc2\xa0by\xc2\xa0Superfoods,\xc2\xa0Inc.\xc2\xa0doing\xc2\xa0business\xc2\xa0as\xc2\xa0(dba)\xc2\xa0Live it Up of New York, NY.\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nOn January\xc2\xa015, 2026,\xc2\xa0Superfoods, Inc.\xc2\xa0recalled [ https://www.fda.gov/safety/recalls-market-withdrawals-safety-alerts/superfoods-inc-dba-live-it-recalls-live-it-super-greens-because-possible-health-risk?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\xc2\xa0all Live it Up-brand Super Greens dietary supplement powder with\xc2\xa0expiration\xc2\xa0dates from 08/2026 to 01/2028.\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nThe recall includes the following products:\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n\r\n  * Live it Up\xc2\xa0Super Greens, NET WT 8.5 oz (240g) with UPC 860013190804. \r\n  * Live it Up\xc2\xa0Super Greens, 30 \xe2\x80\x93 0.28oz (8g) sticks, NET WT. 8.47 oz (240g) with UPC 850077468063 \r\n  * Live it Up\xc2\xa0Super Greens, Wild Berry, NET WT 8.5OZ (240g), with UPC 860013190811 \r\n  * Live it Up\xc2\xa0Super Greens, Wild Berry, 30 \xe2\x80\x93 0.32oz (9g) Sticks, NET WT. 9.52oz (270g), with UPC 850077468070 \r\n\r\nConsumers and retailers who\xc2\xa0purchased\xc2\xa0recalled Live it Up-brand Super Greens\xc2\xa0products\xc2\xa0should not eat, sell, or serve this product and should throw it away. FDA is\xc2\xa0determining\xc2\xa0if\xc2\xa0additional\xc2\xa0recalls are necessary\xc2\xa0and will update\xc2\xa0this\xc2\xa0advisory as more information becomes available.\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nIn addition, FDA is conducting a traceback investigation of products ill people reported consuming before becoming ill and is working with state partners to sample products of concern.\xc2\xa0FDA\xe2\x80\x99s investigation is ongoing.\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nRead the full update. [ https://www.fda.gov/food/outbreaks-foodborne-illness/outbreak-investigation-salmonella-dietary-supplement-january-2026?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nRecalls, Outbreaks & Emergencies [ https://www.fda.gov/food/recalls-outbreaks-emergencies?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nfeed [ https://www.fda.gov/about-fda/contact-fda/subscribe-podcasts-and-news-feeds?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]twitter [ https://www.twitter.com/US_FDA?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]facebook [ https://www.facebook.com/FDA?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]Instagram [ https://www.instagram.com/FDA?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]youtube [ https://www.youtube.com/user/USFoodandDrugAdmin?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]flickr [ https://www.flickr.com/photos/fdaphotos/albums/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]  \r\n\r\n*Manage Subscriptions* [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 *Unsubscribe All* [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/subscriber/one_click_unsubscribe?verification=5.ee0243ee8741fe358146537aecf40e1e&destination=jasonnorman66994%40gmail.com ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 *Help* [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/ ]\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\nbody .abe-column-block {min-height: 5px;} td {line-height:1;} \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n This email was sent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com using GovDelivery Communications Cloud on behalf of: U.S. Food and Drug Administration \xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0\r\n10903 New Hampshire Ave\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0Silver Spring, MD \xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0 20993-0002\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa01-888-INFO-FDA GovDelivery logo [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\nbody .abe-column-block { min-height: 5px; } table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:10px; margin-right:10px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;}\r\n'
