nEver wonder how people are using what they\xe2\x80\x99ve learned through Codecademy? Get \r\ninspiration from real people who embarked on a learning journey with us and \r\nended up with a totally new career.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n \r\n<https://www.codecademy.com/resources/blog/from-freelance-web-designer-to-nasa-software-engineer/?utm_source=iterable&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=free_onboarding_v4i&utm_content=inactive_social_learner_story_img1>\r\n\r\n\r\nI got to work at NASA by learning what I love, and by applying it in the way \r\nthat I love to apply it. Now I\xe2\x80\x99m able to do what I love, professionally. \r\n\r\n\r\nDe\xe2\x80\x99Shaun Broadnax\r\n\r\nAssociate Software Engineer for Embedded Flight Systems at NASA \r\n\r\nWinter Park, Florida \r\n\r\n\r\nMeet De\'Shaun \r\n<https://www.codecademy.com/resources/blog/from-freelance-web-designer-to-nasa-software-engineer/?utm_source=iterable&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=free_onboarding_v4i&utm_content=inactive_social_learner_story_cta1>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n \r\n<https://www.codecademy.com/resources/blog/from-higher-ed-to-tech-in-one-year/?utm_source=iterable&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=free_onboarding_v4i&utm_content=inactive_social_learner_story_img2>\r\n\r\n\r\nWith not that much money, especially when compared to bootcamps, I was able to \r\nlearn so much. I am very grateful that I could learn from home at my own pace \r\nwith such fun and engaging material. \r\n\r\n\r\nStina Nieman \r\nSoftware Business Analyst at Wayside Publishing\r\nSouth Central Pennsylvania\r\n\r\n\r\nRead Stina\'s story \r\n<https://www.codecademy.com/resources/blog/from-higher-ed-to-tech-in-one-year/?utm_source=iterable&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=free_onboarding_v4i&utm_content=inactive_social_learner_story_cta2>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n \r\n<https://www.codecademy.com/resources/blog/from-coffee-entrepreneur-to-github-support-engineer/?utm_source=iterable&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=free_onboarding_v4i&utm_content=inactive_social_learner_story_img3>\r\n\r\n\r\nThere\xe2\x80\x99s no secret recipe, shortcut, or life hack. It was just the consistency \r\nthat really helps.\r\n\r\n\r\nDaniel Hardej \r\n\r\nSupport Engineer at GitHub \r\n\r\nPerth, Australia \r\n\r\n\r\nGet inspired with Daniel \r\n<https://www.codecademy.com/resources/blog/from-coffee-entrepreneur-to-github-support-engineer/?utm_source=iterable&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=free_onboarding_v4i&utm_content=inactive_social_learner_story_cta3>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nTry one of our top-rated\r\n\r\nbeginner courses\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n \r\n<https://www.codecademy.com/learn/learn-python-3?utm_source=iterable&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=free_onboarding_v4i&utm_content=inactive_social_python_course_img>\r\n\r\nPaid course\r\n\r\n\r\nLearn Python\r\nLearn the basics of Python 3, one of the most powerful, versatile, and \r\nin-demand programming languages today.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nStart course \r\n<https://www.codecademy.com/learn/learn-python-3?utm_source=iterable&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=free_onboarding_v4i&utm_content=inactive_social_python_course_cta>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nSee what others are saying\r\n\r\n\xe2\x80\x8c\r\n\r\n\r\n\xe2\x98\x85\xe2\x98\x85\xe2\x98\x85\xe2\x98\x85\xe2\x98\x85 4.6 stars | 7,070 ratings\r\n\r\n\xe2\x80\x8c\r\n\r\n\r\n"Interactive and fun, concepts separated into nice and manageable chunks, so \r\nthe the learning at no point feels like a chore and the next goal is always \r\nwithin reach."\r\n\r\n\r\nMatago L.\r\nVerified Learner\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n \r\n<https://www.codecademy.com/learn/learn-html?utm_source=iterable&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=free_onboarding_v4i&utm_content=inactive_social_html_course_img>\