[2026-04-27 10:35:34] Raw text/plain payload: b"Drug Safety-related Labeling Changes (SrLC)\r\n\r\n*The SrLC database has been updated with the following approved drug safety labeling changes.*\r\n\r\nDrug Name Active Ingredient Application Number Application Type Supplement Date Database Updated *CEREZYME* [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/safetylabelingchanges/index.cfm?event=searchdetail.page&DrugNameID=2573 ] IMIGLUCERASE 020367 BLA 01/12/2026 01/14/2026 *MEN'S ROGAINE* [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/safetylabelingchanges/index.cfm?event=searchdetail.page&DrugNameID=3237 ] MINOXIDIL 021812 NDA 01/14/2026 01/16/2026 *ROGAINE (FOR MEN)* [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/safetylabelingchanges/index.cfm?event=searchdetail.page&DrugNameID=3234 ] MINOXIDIL 019501 NDA 01/14/2026 01/16/2026 *ROGAINE (FOR WOMEN)* [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/safetylabelingchanges/index.cfm?event=searchdetail.page&DrugNameID=3235 ] MINOXIDIL 019501 NDA 01/14/2026 01/16/2026 *ROGAINE EXTRA STRENGTH (FOR MEN)* [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/safetylabelingchanges/index.cfm?event=searchdetail.page&DrugNameID=3236 ] MINOXIDIL 020834 NDA 01/14/2026 01/16/2026 *WOMEN'S ROGAINE* [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/safetylabelingchanges/index.cfm?event=searchdetail.page&DrugNameID=3238 ] MINOXIDIL 021812 NDA 01/14/2026 01/16/2026 \r\n\r\nfeed [ https://www.fda.gov/about-fda/contact-fda/subscribe-podcasts-and-news-feeds?utm_medium=utm_source&utm_source= ]twitter [ https://www.twitter.com/US_FDA?utm_medium=utm_source&utm_source= ]facebook [ https://www.facebook.com/FDA?utm_medium=utm_source&utm_source= ]youtube [ https://www.youtube.com/user/USFoodandDrugAdmin?utm_medium=utm_source&utm_source= ]flickr [ https://www.flickr.com/photos/fdaphotos/albums/?utm_medium=utm_source&utm_source= ]  \r\n\r\n*Manage Subscriptions* [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa