[2026-04-27 10:35:35] Raw text/plain payload: b'FDA \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nCENTER FOR DRUG EVALUATION AND RESEARCH\r\n\r\nDIVISION of\r\nDRUG INFORMATION\r\n\r\n"Your source for the latest drug information. Know the moment it happens."\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\n\xe2\x80\x8bBookmark and Share [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/bulletins/404b989 ]\r\n\r\nFDA Releases Version 4.0 of OND Custom Medical Queries\r\n\r\nThe U.S. Food and Drug Administration\xe2\x80\x99s (FDA) Office of New Drugs (OND) has released version 4.0 of the OND Custom Medical Queries (OCMQs), which includes terms released in MedDRA v27.0 and earlier. Updated OCMQ versions will be released periodically on the Office of New Drugs Custom Medical Queries (OCMQs) webpage [ https://www.fda.gov/drugs/development-resources/office-new-drugs-custom-medical-queries-ocmqs?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ], where the latest OCMQ version can be downloaded.\r\n\r\nOCMQs [ https://www.fda.gov/drugs/development-resources/office-new-drugs-custom-medical-queries-ocmqs?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] are intended to capture clinically meaningful groupings (i.e., safety signals) in premarketing safety data. OCMQs have become an important component of premarket drug safety evaluations, as they promote a consistent safety signal detection strategy across OND divisions.\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\n"This is an automated message delivery system. Replying to this message will not reach DDI staff. If you have comments or questions, please contact us at: 1-888-INFO- FDA (1-888-463-6332) or 301-796-3400 from 8:00 am - 4:30 pm ET Monday - Friday.\xc2\xa0""You can also email us at:\xc2\xa0"*druginfo@fda.hhs.gov* <%20druginfo@fda.hhs.gov>"."\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nStay Connected with U.S. Food and Drug Administration:\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\ntwitter [ https://twitter.com/Fda_Drug_Info?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]facebook [ https://www.facebook.com/FDA?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]instagram [ https://www.instagram.com/fda/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]threads [ https://www.threads.net/@fda?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]youtube [ https://www.youtube.com/user/USFoodandDrugAdmin?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]linkedin [ https://www.linkedin.com/company/fda/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]podcasts [ https://www.fda.gov/about-fda/contact-fda/subscribe-podcasts-and-news-feeds?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] [ https://www.fda.gov/about-fda/contact-fda/subscribe-podcasts-and-news-feeds?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nSUBSCRIBER SERVICES:\r\n\r\nManage Subscriptions [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 Help [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/ ]\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n  \r\n \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n This email was sent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com using GovDelivery Communications Cloud on behalf of: U.S. Food and Drug Administration \xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0\r\n10903 New Hampshire Ave\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0Silver Spring, MD \xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0 20993-0002\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa01-888-INFO-FDA GovDelivery logo [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\nbody .abe-column-block { min-height: 5px; } table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:10px; margin-right:10px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;}\r\n'
