[2026-04-27 10:35:36] Raw text/plain payload: b"Atlassian Jira\r\n[https://post-office-rml-frontend.prod-east.frontend.public.atl-paas.net/assets/atlassian-jira-header.ec25c35f.png]\r\n\r\n\r\nGET SETUP WITH JIRA IN A SNAP\r\n\r\nTake the first step by creating your first project, and we'll help your team get\r\nsetup for success.\r\n\r\nLet's go\r\n[https://jasonnorman66994.atlassian.net/jira/create-project?atlOrigin=eyJpIjoiNDYxYmE3Y2QyZWRlNGY5YWJhOWY3NDA0Mjk2YTViYjQiLCJwIjoicG9zdE9mZmljZUVtYWlsIn0&atl-tracking=true&tid=1b302eac-077b-4531-a7f1-65802f4b6eab&m=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..01xmIcY7bZIUnRTYOVBEXAMcY0Thmo__IF7-5gT6IT8&j=1]\r\n\r\nJira board showing with different status of each card\r\n[https://post-office-rml-frontend.prod-east.frontend.public.atl-paas.net/assets/project-status.71e6b44f.png]https://jasonnorman66994.atlassian.net/jira/create-project?atlOrigin=eyJpIjoiYzVjY2MwMDUxNjQwNGY5M2E1NmNiNjExMGM4ZmI0ODMiLCJwIjoicG9zdE9mZmljZUVtYWlsIn0&atl-tracking=true&tid=ffd24cfb-6dab-4a60-9335-f014a3449d66&m=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..01xmIcY7bZIUnRTYOVBEXAMcY0Thmo__IF7-5gT6IT8&j=1\r\n\r\n\r\nGETTING STARTED IN JIRA IS SIMPLE:\r\n\r\nIcon - Check circle\r\n[https://post-office-rml-frontend.prod-east.frontend.public.atl-paas.net/assets/icon-check-circle.cb3ecdd8.png]Create\r\nyour project - Choose a workflow and project setup that makes sense for how your\r\nteam worksIcon - Check circle\r\n[https://post-office-rml-frontend.prod-east.frontend.public.atl-paas.net/assets/icon-check-circle.cb3ecdd8.png]Add\r\nin work - Work items (just like to-dos) help your team easily keep track of\r\nwhat's getting doneIcon - Check circle\r\n[https://post-office-rml-frontend.prod-east.frontend.public.atl-paas.net/assets/icon-check-circle.cb3ecdd8.png]Move\r\nwork forward, together - Invite teammates to Jira, and collaborate by editing\r\nand visualizing your project work as it progresses\r\n\r\nLet's go\r\n[https://jasonnorman66994.atlassian.net/jira/create