[2026-04-27 10:35:44] Raw text/plain payload: b"Self-employment gave me freedom. Then it almost destroyed my growth.\r\nI Went From $0 to $10k Monthly While Studying 15 Hours a Week\r\n\r\nSelf-employment gave me freedom. Then it almost destroyed my growth.\r\n\r\nShikha | Author (https://medium.com/@SvaCopy?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768581376024-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-84ac01765c52------------------------7478e7d2_2f2d_428f_8065_863b641fc7e0--------bd173739d135)\r\n\xc2\xa0in\xc2\xa0Write A Catalyst (https://medium.com/write-a-catalyst?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768581376024-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-84ac01765c52------------------------7478e7d2_2f2d_428f_8065_863b641fc7e0--------bd173739d135)\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nJanuary 16, 2026\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\n6 min read\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nView on Medium (https://medium.com/write-a-catalyst/25f4dc679cab?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768581376024-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-84ac01765c52------------------------7478e7d2_2f2d_428f_8065_863b641fc7e0--------bd173739d135)\r\n\r\nPhoto by Kelly Sikkema (http://redirect.medium.systems/r-ltZY2wT5mS?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768581376024-newsletter.subscribeToProfile--25f4dc679cab-----------------------7478e7d2_2f2d_428f_8065_863b641fc7e0--------bd173739d135)\r\n on Unsplash (http://redirect.medium.systems/r-Gu6Z_HViFN?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768581376024-newsletter.subscribeToProfile--25f4dc679cab-----------------------7478e7d2_2f2d_428f_8065_863b641fc7e0--------bd173739d135)\r\n\r\nNobody warns you about the dark side of being your own boss.\r\n\r\nYou escape the corporate grind, ditch the commute, answer to nobody\xe2\x80\x8a-\xe2\x80\x8aand then realize you've built yourself the most demanding boss you've ever had: yourself.\r\n\r\nFor the first eight months of self-employment, I made money but learned nothing new. I was trapped in a cycle of client work, invoices, and survival mode. My skills stayed frozen while the industry moved forward without me.\r\n\r\nThen I watched a former colleague\xe2\x80\x8a-\xe2\x80\x8asomeone I used to mentor\xe2\x80\x8a-\xe2\x80\x8aget hired at a salary double what I was grossing.\xc2\xa0\xe2\x80\xa6\r\n\r\nContinue reading (https://medium.com/write-a-catalyst/25f4dc679cab?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768581376024-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-84ac01765c52------------------------7478e7d2_2f2d_428f_8065_863b641fc7e0--------bd173739d135)\r\nThis is a member-only story and can only be read on Medium.\r\n\r\nSent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com by Shikha | Author on Medium\r\nUnsubscribe (https://medium.com/me/email-settings/50207bf5a022/e85c1cbd14b3?type=noSetting&newsletterV3Id=bd173739d135&collectionId=84ac01765c52&source=email-50207bf5a022-1768581376024-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-84ac01765c52------------------------7478e7d2_2f2d_428f_8065_863b641fc7e0--------bd173739d135)\r\n from this writer's email notifications\r\nManage your email settings (https://medium.com/me/settings/notifications?hash=e85c1cbd14b3&userId=50207bf5a022&settingsRouteHash=%23manageSubscriptions&source=email-50207bf5a022-1768581376024-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-84ac01765c52------------------------7478e7d2_2f2d_428f_8065_863b641fc7e0--------bd173739d135)\r\n\r\n3500 South DuPont Highway, Suite IQ-101, Dover,\xc2\xa0DE\xc2\xa019901\r\nCareers (https://medium.com/jobs-at-medium/work-at-medium-959d1a85284e?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768581376024-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-84ac01765c52------------------------7478e7d2_2f2d_428f_8065_863b641fc7e0--------bd173739d135)\r\n\xc2\xb7Help Center (https://help.medium.com/hc/en-us?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768581376024-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-84ac01765c52------------------------7478e7d2_2f2d_428f_8065_863b641fc7e0--------bd173739d135)\r\n\xc2\xb7Privacy Policy (https://policy.medium.com/medium-privacy-policy-f03bf92035c9?source=email-50207bf5a022-1768581376024-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-84ac