[2026-04-27 10:35:49] Raw text/plain payload: b'This is a Class I recall, the most serious type of recall.  \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nIf your email program has trouble displaying this email, view as a webpage [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/bulletins/404be2a ].\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nCDRH Medical Device Recall\r\n\r\nBookmark and Share [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/bulletins/404be2a?reqfrom=share ]\r\n\r\nAnesthesia Kit Recall: Medline Removes Anesthesia Circuits and Anesthesia Circuit Kits \r\n\r\nThe FDA is aware that Medline has issued a letter to affected customers recommending certain Anesthesia Circuit Kits and other kits\xc2\xa0containing\xc2\xa0Anesthesia Circuits be removed from where they are used or sold.\xc2\xa0Medline has received multiple complaints of anesthesia circuit leaks during leak testing and patient use due to cracks in the 120\xe2\x80\x9d expandable tubing, resulting in potential compromised ventilation and anesthetic delivery.\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*Read More* [ https://www.fda.gov/medical-devices/medical-device-recalls-and-early-alerts/anesthesia-kit-recall-medline-removes-anesthesia-circuits-and-anesthesia-circuit-kits?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n\r\n*"This "**"recall"* [ https://www.fda.gov/medical-devices/medical-device-recalls/what-medical-device-recall?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]*"\xc2\xa0involves removing certain"*"\xc2\xa0"*"devices from where they are used or sold.\xc2\xa0"*"The FDA has\xc2\xa0identified\xc2\xa0this recall as the most serious type. This device may cause\xc2\xa0serious injury\xc2\xa0or death if you continue to use it.\xc2\xa0"\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nQuestions?\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nCustomers in the U.S. with adverse reactions, quality problems, or questions about this recall should contact Medline at\xc2\xa0866-359-1704 or\xc2\xa0recalls@medline.com.\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n  \r\n \r\n\r\nFollow us on X at @FDADeviceInfo [ https://x.com/FDADeviceInfo?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n\r\n \r\ntwitter [ https://x.com/FDADeviceInfo?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]facebook [ https://www.facebook.com/FDA?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]youtube [ https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC_giJ3xlEL9jUF1YfJdzzuQ?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]LinkedIn [ https://www.linkedin.com/company/fda?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]  \r\n\r\n*Manage Subscriptions* [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 *Unsubscribe All* [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/subscriber/one_click_unsubscribe?verification=5.ee0243ee8741fe358146537aecf40e1e&destination=jasonnorman66994%40gmail.com ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 *Help* [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/ ]\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\nbody .abe-column-block {min-height: 5px;} td {line-height:1;} \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n This email was sent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com using GovDelivery Communications Cloud on behalf of: U.S. Food and Drug Administration \xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0\r\n10903 New Hampshire Ave\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0Silver Spring, MD \xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0 20993-0002\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa01-888-INFO-FDA GovDelivery logo [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\nbody .abe-column-block { min-height: 5px; } table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:10px; margin-right:10px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;}\r\n'
