edium=email&utm_term=us-en&utm_campaign=p1_bb_co_all_pcn_b202111&utm_content=h_l>\r\n \r\n<https://www.dropbox.com/?oref=e&_tk=email&_camp=12234003&_ad=00c8d48bd8bb489eb5712188f9098ac8&utm_source=iter&utm_medium=email&utm_term=us-en&utm_campaign=p1_bb_co_all_pcn_b202111&utm_content=h_l>\r\n\r\n\r\n Share files with confidence \r\n We\xe2\x80\x99ve built features that allow you to easily share your work while \r\nmaintaining control over your data\xe2\x80\x99s security and accessibility. Discover what \r\nsharing method best suits your needs. \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nExplore sharing options \r\n<https://learn.dropbox.com/self-guided-learning/dropbox-fundamentals-course/how-to-use-dropbox#how-to-share-a-file-or-folder-from-your-dropbox-account>\r\n \r\n<https://learn.dropbox.com/self-guided-learning/dropbox-fundamentals-course/how-to-use-dropbox#how-to-share-a-file-or-folder-from-your-dropbox-account>\r\n \r\n<https://learn.dropbox.com/self-guided-learning/dropbox-fundamentals-course/how-to-use-dropbox#how-to-share-a-file-or-folder-from-your-dropbox-account>\r\n \r\n<https://learn.dropbox.com/self-guided-learning/dropbox-fundamentals-course/how-to-use-dropbox#how-to-share-a-file-or-folder-from-your-dropbox-account>\r\n\r\nSharing options for every situation: \r\n\r\n * Share with link: Simply create a link to your files or folders and share it \r\nvia email or chat, allowing recipients to access the content without needing a \r\nDropbox account. \r\n * Password-protected links: Ideal for sharing sensitive information securely. \r\nOnly recipients with the password can access the links, ensuring \r\nconfidentiality. \r\n * View-only sharing: Share documents in their final form. Recipients can view \r\nbut cannot modify, preserving the integrity of your documents. \r\n * Team folder sharing:  Facilitate collaboration by setting up accessible \r\nteam folders. Centralize essential resources for easy access. \r\n * Dropbox Transfer:  Best for sending large files effortlessly. Transfer \r\nlarge datasets quickly and securely without impacting your storage limits. \r\n\r\nStart sharing <https://www.dropbox.com/home?file_chooser_type=sharing> \r\n\r\n\r\nMake collaboration easy by inviting people to join your team on Dropbox. \r\n\r\nInvite people  <https://www.dropbox.com/team/admin/members> \r\n\r\n\r\n <https://www.twitter.com/Dropbox>  <https://www.facebook.com/Dropbox/>  \r\n<https://www.youtube.com/user/dropbox> \r\n\r\nThis email was sent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com \r\nWant to stop getting emails from Dropbox? Unsubscribe \r\n<https://links.dropbox.com/e/eh?_t=60154b197d654466a40480a2b908d3b7&_m=00c8d48bd8bb489eb5712188f9098ac8&_e=SmVyocqUM3yhZhSAn-UnTrI4VNrYuRs7A-BqKUiEN7-Si9OIYGy4ulFxqGq6pE9dW8Y9ylPEIWN0ifpInFtMNUC1Es0eqQxobNP90_a4aLkio6ivPBk71U7QGVid-uq8XymN9INjdxXkGEqcCw7CGJ1Y6suKz-BBrwNYeUZheuA%3D&dbx_unsub=10419888971189/14572921/174/AAC3INFTgzYzEPgUOvzzOTBC9lFNjKb9s8Am3rAoy2eTDQ&dbx_campid=12234003&dbx_endpoint=send_email&dbx_env=prod>\r\nDropbox, Inc., PO Box 77767, San Francisco, CA 94107 '
