gram Overview [ https://www.irs.gov/individuals/international-taxpayers/income-verification-express-service ]\r\n\r\nHow to Get Started Using IVES Electronic Signature [ https://www.irs.gov/individuals/international-taxpayers/how-to-get-started-using-ives-electronic-signature ]\r\n\r\nFrequently Asked Questions [ https://www.irs.gov/individuals/international-taxpayers/irs-income-verification-express-service-ives ]\r\n\r\ne-Services - Online Tools for Tax Professionals (Transcript Delivery System for IVES) [ https://www.irs.gov/tax-professionals/e-services-online-tools-for-tax-professionals ]\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n*System Issue Impacting the IVES Program\xc2\xa0*\r\n\r\nDear IVES Participants,\r\n\r\nOn Wednesday, January 14, 2026, a technical issue was identified with the Income Verification Express Services (IVES) Transcript Delivery System (TDS). Some of the Form 1120 family HTML5 transcripts are displaying an unexpected string of characters and numbers in the Income and Deductions sections of the transcript. Our IT staff is working diligently to resolve the issue. We will share any updates that we receive via these Gov Delivery messages.\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nIf you need a corrected transcript, please submit a dispute for each batch impacted. Our coordinators will hold the batches identified and process them as soon as the transcripts are corrected in the TDS system.\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nIf you have any questions, please email us at ts.ives.participant.assistance@irs.gov.\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nThank you,\r\nIRS IVES Team\r\n\r\nBack to Top [ #Fifteenth ]\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n*\xc2\xa0* \r\n\r\nFaceBook Logo [ https://www.facebook.com/IRS/ ]\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0Twitter Logo [ https://twitter.com/IRSnews ]\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0LinkedIn Logo [ https://www.linkedin.com/company/irs/ ]\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0YouTube Logo [ https://www.youtube.com/user/irsvideos ]\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0 IRS2go Logo [ https://www.irs.gov/newsroom/irs2goapp ]\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\nThank you for subscribing to IVES Program e-News and Updates, an IRS e-mail service. For more information on the IVES program please visit\xc2\xa0IRS.Gov. [ https://www.irs.gov/individuals/income-verification-express-service ]\r\n\r\nThis message was distributed automatically from the IVES Program e-News and Updates mailing list. *Please Do Not Reply To This Message.*\r\n\r\n \r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n \r\n\r\n*\xc2\xa0*\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\nUpdate your subscriptions, modify your password or email address, or stop subscriptions at any time on your Subscriber Preferences Page [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USIRS/subscriber/new?preferences=true ]. You will need to use your email address to log in. If you have questions or problems with the subscription service, please contact subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/ ].\r\n\r\nThis service is provided to you at no charge by the Internal Revenue Service (IRS) [ https://www.irs.gov/ ].\r\n\r\n \r\nbody .abe-column-block {min-height: 5px;} ________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\nThis email was sent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com by: Internal Revenue Service (IRS) \xc2\xb7 Internal Revenue Service \xc2\xb7 1111 Constitution Ave. N.W. \xc2\xb7 Washington, D.C. 20535 GovDelivery logo [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/ ] \r\nbody .abe-column-block { min-height: 5px; } table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:10px; margin-right:10px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;}\r\n'
