[2026-04-27 10:36:53] Raw text/plain payload: b"\r\n\r\nAtlassian\r\n\r\nFrom to\xe2\x80\x91do to  done \xe2\x9c\x85\r\n\r\nTeams choose Jira because of its out\xe2\x80\x91of\xe2\x80\x91the\xe2\x80\x91box features that enable them to set goals, organize tasks, and execute efficiently.\r\n\r\nTry\xc2\xa0out\xc2\xa0features\r\n>> https://jasonnorman66994.atlassian.net/jira/settings/projects/manage?atlOrigin=eyJpIjoiMGJkM2M5MWQtNDYwZC00NmRlLTg4ZDgtMDY0NDIyNTQxZjgzIiwicCI6InNmbWMifQ==\r\n \r\n\xe2\x9e\x95 Boards \r\n>> https://www.atlassian.com/software/jira/guides/boards/overview?utm_source=sfmc&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=email-2A_EML-20775&jobid=107651258&subid=135349949&send_date=1/19/2026#what-is-a-jira-board\r\n\r\nUse a Jira board to track how your team is progressing. Gain insight into who's doing what, understand how the team is tracking towards deadlines, and figure out what needs to be tackled next.\r\n\r\n\xe2\x9e\x95 Timelines\r\n>> https://www.atlassian.com/software/jira/guides/basic-roadmaps/overview?utm_source=sfmc&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=email-2A_EML-20775&jobid=107651258&subid=135349949&send_date=1/19/2026#timeline\r\n\r\nVisualize how all your team's work rolls up to the big picture. Understand timing, duration, and dependencies of large bodies of work within a single project.\r\n \r\n\xe2\x9e\x95 Workflows\r\n>> https://www.atlassian.com/software/jira/guides/workflows/overview?utm_source=sfmc&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=email-2A_EML-20775&jobid=107651258&subid=135349949&send_date=1/19/2026#what-is-a-jira-workflow\r\n\r\nIn Jira, a workflow refers to the path your work items take from creation to completion. Tailor Jira to match your team's real\xe2\x80\x91life processes and streamline delivery.\r\n   \r\nLearn Jira best practices\r\n \r\nJoin our weekly app demo and chat live with Atlassian app experts on how to plan, track, deliver, and report on work in Jira.\r\n \r\nJira\xc2\xa0101\xc2\xa0demo  \xe2\x86\x92\r\n>> https://www.atlassian.co