o we investigate? [ https://www.irs.gov/compliance/criminal-investigation/program-and-emphasis-areas-for-irs-criminal-investigation ]\r\n\r\nHow investigations are initiated [ https://www.irs.gov/compliance/criminal-investigation/how-criminal-investigations-are-initiated ]\r\n\r\nJ5 international partnership [ https://www.irs.gov/compliance/joint-chiefs-of-global-tax-enforcement ]\r\n\r\nIRS.gov/CI [ http://www.irs.gov/ci ]\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\nTax Schemes and Fraud\r\n\r\nTax Fraud Alerts [ https://www.irs.gov/compliance/criminal-investigation/tax-fraud-alerts ]\r\n\r\nReport Suspected Tax Fraud [ https://www.irs.gov/individuals/how-do-you-report-suspected-tax-fraud-activity ]\r\n\r\nVoluntary Disclosure [ https://www.irs.gov/compliance/criminal-investigation/irs-criminal-investigation-voluntary-disclosure-practice ]\r\n\r\n [ https://www.irs.gov/newsroom/e-news-subscriptions ]\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\nCI Newsroom\r\n\r\nCI News Releases [ https://www.irs.gov/compliance/criminal-investigation/criminal-investigation-press-releases ]\r\n\r\n [ https://www.irs.gov/newsroom/news-releases-for-current-month ]\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\nCI Resources\r\n\r\nCI Annual Reports [ https://www.irs.gov/compliance/criminal-investigation/irs-criminal-investigation-annual-reports ]\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\nDecember Tax Case of the Month\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\nColorado man sentenced to 12.5 years in prison for promoting an abusive tax shelter and operating a multi-million-dollar investment fraud scheme\r\n\r\n*Timothy McPhee* of Estes Park, Colorado, was sentenced to 151 months in prison and ordered to pay more than $59 million in restitution for promoting an abusive tax shelter and operating a fraudulent investment scheme. McPhee and several codefendants facilitated the layering of a business trust, family trust, and charitable trust, and a private family foundation, to conceal business income from the IRS. McPhee taught clients to use the trusts and the foundation to avoid paying income taxes and claim only about 2% of their income. In total, the tax shelter caused a loss to the United States of about $45 million in unpaid federal income taxes. McPhee also operated and promoted a fraudulent investment scheme called the ROI Cash Flow Fund as an opportunity for investors to earn 3% monthly returns. The ROI Cash Flow Fund was actually a Ponzi scheme and resulted in a loss to investors of about $6 million. Congratulations to the *Denver Field Office* on a great case!\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nBack to top [ #top ]\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n [ https://www.facebook.com/IRS/ ]Twitter Logo [ https://twitter.com/IRS_CI ]\xc2\xa0 [ https://www.facebook.com/IRS/ ]\xc2\xa0YouTube Logo [ https://www.youtube.com/@irsci8772 ] \xc2\xa0LinkedIn Logo [ https://www.linkedin.com/company/irs-criminal-investigation ]\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\nIRS-CI is the criminal investigative arm of the IRS, responsible for conducting financial crime investigations, including tax fraud, narcotics trafficking, money-laundering, public corruption, healthcare fraud, identity theft and more. IRS-CI special agents are the only federal law enforcement agents with investigative jurisdiction over violations of the Internal Revenue Code, obtaining a more than a 90 percent federal conviction rate. The agency has 18 field offices located across the U.S. and 12 attach\xc3\xa9 posts abroad.\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\nThis message was distributed automatically from a mailing list. Please do not reply to this message. Update or cancel your subscription or modify your password or email address on your Subscriber Preferences Page [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USIRS/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ]. Questions or problems with GovDelivery? Visit subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/ ].\r\n\r\nThis service is provided by CI [ https://www.irs.gov/compliance/criminal-investigation ].\r\n\r\n*Please Do Not Reply To This Message.*\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\nUpdate your subscriptions, modify your password or email address, or stop subscriptions at any time on your Subscriber Preferences Page [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USIRS/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ]. You will need your email address to log in. If you have questions or problems with the subscription service, visit subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/ ].\r\n\r\nThis service is provided to you at no charge by the Internal Revenue Service (IRS) [ https://www.irs.gov/ ].\r\n\r\n \r\nbody .abe-column-block {min-height: 5px;} ________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\nThis email was sent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com by: Internal Revenue Service (IRS) \xc2\xb7 Internal Revenue Service \xc2\xb7 1111 Constitution Ave. N.W. \xc2\xb7 Washington, D.C. 20535 GovDelivery logo [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/ ] \r\nbody .abe-column-block { min-height: 5px; } table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:10px; margin-right:10px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;}\r\n'
