[2026-04-27 10:37:06] Raw text/plain payload: b'View as a webpage\xc2\xa0 /\xc2\xa0 Share [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USDAOC/bulletins/405377f ]\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nHeader-Hybrid \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nOffice of Communications\xc2\xa0 |\xc2\xa0 press@usda.gov\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nICYMI: Secretary Rollins Pens Op-ed in Fox News \xe2\x80\x9cTrump Brings Whole Milk Back\xc2\xa0to Schools, Undoing Obama\xe2\x80\x99s War on Real Food\xe2\x80\x9d\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\n*(Washington, D.C., January\xc2\xa020, 2026)**\xe2\x80\xaf*\xe2\x80\x93 U.S. Secretary of Agriculture Brooke L. Rollins published an opinion piece in Fox News highlighting\xc2\xa0how President Trump is delivering on his promise to put the welfare of American farmers and children first\xc2\xa0by signing the Whole Milk for\xc2\xa0Healthy\xc2\xa0Kids Act.\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n\xe2\x80\x9cThe childhood health crisis currently facing our nation is nothing less than an existential threat.\xc2\xa0Over 75% of kids in America struggle with\xe2\x80\xafobesity, poor physical fitness [ https://www.foxnews.com/category/health/nutrition-and-fitness/obesity?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ],\xc2\xa0or related health challenges. These rising rates of chronic disease are influenced by several factors, but diet plays\xc2\xa0a central role,\xe2\x80\x9d\xc2\xa0*said Secretary Rollins. *\xe2\x80\x9cThe absence of whole milk from schools has long been overlooked by countless public officials, but President Trump noticed and has done something about it. This administration understands that the national health crisis cannot be overcome without reorienting federal nutrition policy around science and real-world outcomes.\xe2\x80\x9d\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nRead the full piece [ https://www.foxnews.com/opinion/sec-brooke-rollins-trump-brings-whole-milk-back-schools-undoing-obamas-war-real-food?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] below.\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nIn 2012, the\xe2\x80\xafObama administration [ https://www.foxnews.com/category/person/barack-obama?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\xe2\x80\xafdecided that America\xe2\x80\x99s kids\xc2\xa0didn\xe2\x80\x99t\xc2\xa0need\xe2\x80\xafwhole milk [ https://www.foxnews.com/category/health/nutrition-and-fitness/nutrition?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]. As a result, our children\xc2\xa0missed out on\xc2\xa0essential nutrition and our farmers lost critical income. Obama-era economic stagnation and anti-agriculture policies, including those promoting the Green New Scam multiplied hardships on the farm and many hardworking Americans began to lose hope.\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nNearly one\xc2\xa0year ago, President Donald Trump\xe2\x80\x99s inauguration restored that hope, and today he renews it. In signing the\xe2\x80\xafWhole Milk for Heathy Kids Act [ https://www.foxnews.com/politics/trump-tear-up-obama-era-school-lunch-rules-blocking-whole-2-milk?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ], President Trump delivers on his promise to put the welfare of American farmers and American children first.\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nWhile President Barack Obama took away market share from America\xe2\x80\x99s dairy farmers to fight the war on healthy fats, President Trump is expanding markets both at home and abroad, pushing for better real food options for our kids.\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nThe Whole Milk for Healthy Kids Act, sponsored by Sens. Roger Marshall, R-Kan., and Peter Welch, D-Vt., and championed by Rep. Glenn Thompson, R-Pa., and Sen. John Boozman, R-Ark., restores whole milk to schools across the nation, delivering real food for the next generation and standing up for the farmers who feed this country.\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nThis issue is near and dear to my heart. Last year at my confirmation hearing, Sen. Marshall asked me if whole milk belongs in school lunches. I enthusiastically agreed. I also shared that growing up, my mom made sure that our refrigerator was always well stocked with whole milk. She instinctively knew that whole milk was a building block to a healthy future for me and my younger sisters.\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nSo much has changed since the founding of our nation 250 years ago, but the benefits of drinking whole milk have\xc2\xa0remained\xc2\xa0the same. If anything, the nutrients that whole milk naturally provides are more in demand than ever before.\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nThe childhood health crisis currently facing our nation is nothing less than an existential threat.\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nOver 75% of kids in America struggle with\xe2\x80\xafobesity, poor physical fitness [ https://www.foxnews.com/category/health/nutrition-and-fitness/obesity?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\xe2\x80\xafor related health challenges. These rising rates of chronic disease are influenced by several factors, but diet plays\xc2\xa0a central role.\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nWe have a responsibility to help fix this crisis, especially since it was partly driven by misguided federal nutrition policies that replaced real food with ideology.\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nThe absence of whole milk from schools has long been overlooked by countless public officials, but President Trump noticed and has done something about it. This administration understands that the national health crisis cannot be overcome without reorienting federal nutrition policy around science and real-world outcomes.\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nLet\xe2\x80\x99s\xc2\xa0be clear\xe2\x80\x94whole milk\xc2\xa0isn\xe2\x80\x99t\xc2\xa0just another drink on a school lunch tray.\xc2\xa0It\xe2\x80\x99s\xc2\xa0a nutrient-dense, affordable source of protein, calcium, vitamin D, and healthy fats that growing bodies and minds need to thrive.\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nBringing whole milk back to schools also builds on this month\'s release of the\xe2\x80\xafDietary Guidelines for Americans [ https://www.foxnews.com/politics/trump-admins-new-nutrition-guidelines-target-ultra-processed-foods-ease-up-red-meat-saturated-fats?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ], 2025\xe2\x80\x932030, which recognize full-fat milk,\xc2\xa0protein\xc2\xa0and healthy fats as essential building blocks of a balanced diet.\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nFor the first time in years, federal guidance and school meal programs will complement one another, sending a consistent message to families about what healthy eating really looks like.\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nThe Whole Milk for Healthy Kids Act restores flexibility to schools, allowing them to offer whole, reduced-fat, low-fat, or fat-free milk. This is a win for local communities and parents, who can now make choices that best serve their kids.\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nAnd equally important,\xc2\xa0it\xe2\x80\x99s\xc2\xa0also a win for American farmers\xe2\x80\x94the backbone of rural America.\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nSchool meal programs create consistent demand for their products, strengthen local\xc2\xa0economies\xc2\xa0and reconnect children to the food that truly fuels them. And after Thursday\'s announcement, the demand for whole milk will take off like a rocket.\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nSo, to America\xe2\x80\x99s dairy farmers: get ready. Gone are the days of declining milk consumption driven by failed Obama-era policy. Your hard work is back where it belongs, front and center in feeding our nation\xe2\x80\x99s children.\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nThis\xc2\xa0isn\xe2\x80\x99t\xc2\xa0about partisan politics.\xc2\xa0It\xe2\x80\x99s\xc2\xa0about\xe2\x80\xafpractical, commonsense government policy [ https://www.foxnews.com/category/domestic-policy?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ], and\xc2\xa0it\xe2\x80\x99s\xc2\xa0exactly the kind of real-world reform President Trump was elected to carry out.\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n"Brooke L. Rollins is the U.S. Secretary of Agriculture."\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n###\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n  \r\n \r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0 \r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*\r\nU.S. Department of Agriculture*\r\n\r\nwww.usda.gov [ https://www.usda.gov/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 Contact us [ https://ask.usda.gov/s/contactsupport?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n\r\ntwitter [ https://www.twitter.com/usda/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]facebook [ https://www.facebook.com/usda/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]instagram [ https://www.instagram.com/usdagov/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]flickr [ https://flickr.com/usdagov?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]youtube [ https://www.youtube.com/usda/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n\r\nBookmark and Share [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USDAOC/bulletins/0?reqfrom=share ]\r\n\r\nManage Subscriptions [ http://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USDAOC/subscribers/new?preferences=true ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 Unsubscribe All [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USDAOC/subscriber/one_click_unsubscribe?verification=5.b0b9ffc01626a62fade26e4ffc0836cd&destination=jasonnorman66994%40gmail.com ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 Help [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/ ]\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \xc2\xa0 \r\n \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n This email was sent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com using govDelivery on behalf of: USDA Office of Communications \xc2\xb7 1400 Independence Ave., S.W. \xc2\xb7 Washington, DC 20250  GovDelivery logo  [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\nbody .abe-column-block { min-height: 5px; } table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:10px; margin-right:10px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;} table.govd_hr {min-width: 100%;}\r\n'
