[2026-04-27 10:37:07] Raw text/plain payload: b"Census Bureau Upcoming and Recently Released Products  \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nUnited States Census Bureau [ https://www.census.gov/en.html?utm_campaign=20260120mspios1ccpupnl&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nPopulation Estimates Methodology Webinar [ https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2026/webinar-methodology-updates.html?utm_campaign=20260120mspios1ccpupnl&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n\r\nThe U.S. Census Bureau is scheduled to hold a webinar [ https://gcc02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?data=05%7C02%7CDonna.E.Tillery%40census.gov%7C3319d2aed84a41500d2e08de54642452%7C3aa716f1e55941cea53047d18313c603%7C0%7C0%7C639040986271958824%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&reserved=0&sdata=uteoGlFEkoOHJfcW%2F59Bq%2B0Fxav6Zgglqk5U5CIpSxI%3D&url=https%3A%2F%2Flinks-1.govdelivery.com%2FCL0%2Fhttps%3A%252F%252Fwww.census.gov%252Fdata%252Facademy%252Fwebinars%252F2026%252Fmethodology-updates-vintage-2025-estimates.html%253Futm_campaign%3D20260115pios2%2526utm_medium%3Demail%2526utm_source%3Dgovdelivery%2F1%2F0100019bc2eb6b62-a9196d0d-b303-4453-ba4f-9fc93ac16be7-000000%2FNkOfOLOFLsGr2Acuq2QmG3mYh-0CkxTIdjCUE1VgRrI%3D440%3Futm_campaign%3D20260120mspios1ccpupnl%26utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_source%3Dgovdelivery&utm_campaign=20260120mspios1ccpupnl&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\xc2\xa0Tuesday, Jan. 20, at 1:30 p.m. ET, on methodology updates for the Vintage 2025 population estimates.\r\n\r\n*Learn More* [ https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2026/webinar-methodology-updates.html?utm_campaign=20260120mspios1ccpupnl&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nCensus Bureau: American Community Survey 2020-2024 5-year estimates pre-release webinar [ https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2026/acs-5-year-estimates-webinar-embargo.html?utm_campaign=20260120mspios1ccpupnl&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n\r\nOn Jan. 22, the U.S. Census Bureau is scheduled to hold a prerelease webinar [ https://www.census.gov/data/academy/webinars/2026/2020-2024-acs-5-year-prerelease.html?utm_campaign=20260120mspios1ccpupnl&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] about the 2020-2024 American Community Survey [ https://www.census.gov/programs-surveys/acs/about.html?utm_campaign=20260120mspios1ccpupnl&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] (ACS) 5-year estimates on Thursday, Jan. 22, at 1 p.m. ET. The webinar will explain how to access ACS data and give tips on comparing geographies and statistics over time.\r\n\r\n*Read More* [ https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2026/acs-5-year-estimates-webinar-embargo.html?utm_campaign=20260120mspios1ccpupnl&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nState-to-State Migration Flows Table Package\r\n\r\nOn Jan. 21, the U.S. Census Bureau will release the latest version of the State-to-State Migration Flows table package. Tables come from the 2024 American Community Survey 1-year estimates. The State-to-State Migration Flows [ https://www.census.gov/data/tables/time-series/demo/geographic-mobility/state-to-state-migration.html?utm_campaign=20260120mspios1ccpupnl&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\xc2\xa0table will provide estimates of the number of people moving between origin and destination geographies.\xc2\xa0The\xc2\xa0State of Residence by Place of Birth [ https://www.census.gov/data/tables/time-series/demo/geographic-mobility/state-of-residence-place-of-birth-acs.html?utm_campaign=20260120mspios1ccpupnl&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] table will provide estimates of the number of people living in their current state of residence by place of birth.\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n2024 Planning Database\r\n\r\nOn Jan, 22, the U.S. Census Bureau is scheduled to release the 2024 Planning Database (PDB), which includes the Low Response Score (LRS) and other new 2020 Census operational data.\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n*?? In Case You Missed It*\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nBusiness Formation Statistics Monthly Data Release\r\n\r\nOn Jan. 14, the U.S. Census Bureau released new Business Formation Statistics [ https://www.census.gov/econ/bfs/index.html?utm_campaign=20260120mspios1ccpupnl&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] (BFS) for December 2025. The BFS provide timely and high frequency information on new business applications and formations in the United States and Puerto Rico.\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*Learn More* [ https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2026/business-formation-statistics-jan14.html?utm_campaign=20260120mspios1ccpupnl&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nBTOS [ https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2026/btos-jan-15.html?utm_campaign=20260120mspios1ccpupnl&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n\r\nOn Jan. 15, the U.S. Census Bureau released The Business Trends and Outlook Survey (BTOS) [ https://www.census.gov/hfp/btos/data?utm_campaign=20260120mspios1ccpupnl&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]. BTOS measures business conditions on an ongoing basis. BTOS experimental data products are representative of all employer businesses other than farms in the U.S. economy. The data allow greater insight into the state of the economy by providing continuous, timely information for key economic measures.\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*Learn More* [ https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2026/btos-jan-15.html?utm_campaign=20260120mspios1ccpupnl&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nPublic Information Office\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nUpcoming Events and News Releases:\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*_Tuesday, Jan. 20_*\r\n\r\n*********************\xe2\x80\xa2 ********************Webinar:* Methodology Updates for the Vintage 2025 Population Estimates 1:30-2:30 pm ET\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*_Wednesday, Jan. 21_*\r\n\r\n*********************\xe2\x80\xa2 ********************Media Advisory: *2020-2024 American Community Survey 5-year Estimates Webinar and Embargo (resend from Jan. 15)\r\n\r\n*********************\xe2\x80\xa2 ********************Tip Sheet: *State-to-State Migration Flows Table Package\r\n\r\n*********************\xe2\x80\xa2 ********************Economic Indicator:* (10 a.m.) Construction Spending (Construction Put in Place) [ http://www.census.gov/construction/c30/c30index.html?utm_campaign=20260120mspios1ccpupnl&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \xe2\x80\x93 September/October 2025\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*_Thursday, Jan. 22_*\r\n\r\n*********************\xe2\x80\xa2 ********************Webinar:* 2020-2024 American Community Survey 5-year Estimates at 1 p.m.\r\n\r\n*********************\xe2\x80\xa2 ********************Media Advisory:* 2020-2024 American Community Survey 5-year Estimates Embargo (English/Spanish)\r\n\r\n*********************\xe2\x80\xa2 ********************Tip Sheet: *2024 Planning Database __\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*Newsroom* [ https://www.census.gov/newsroom.html?utm_campaign=20260120mspios1ccpupnl&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nNews media: 301-763-3030 or 877-861-2010 or\xc2\xa0pio@census.gov\r\n\r\nNon-media: 1-800-923-8282 or\xc2\xa0ask.census.gov [ https://ask.census.gov/?utm_campaign=20260120mspios1ccpupnl&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n\r\nSubscribe now [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USCENSUS/subscriber/new? ]\xc2\xa0to receive Census Bureau releases and information via e-mail or SMS.\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nAbout the Census Bureau\r\n\r\nWe serve as the nation\xe2\x80\x99s leading provider of quality data about its people and economy.\xc2\xa0The Census Bureau is the federal government's largest statistical agency. As the world\xe2\x80\x99s premier statistical agency, we are dedicated to making our nation a better place. Policy-makers, businesses, and the public use our data to make informed decisions.\r\n\r\n*Resources for Media*\r\n\r\nFor media interviews, please contact the\xc2\xa0Public Information Office [ https://lnks.gd/l/eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..p-5wpj2DTx0_qgyLiv6JuMTDOF_vZlHcwFpt971jIDs/s/866068797/br/124287751808-l?utm_campaign=20260120mspios1ccpupnl&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\xc2\xa0Toll Free at 877-861-2010, 301-763-3030, or\xc2\xa0pio@census.gov.\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n  \r\n \r\n\r\n*Stay connected with us!*\r\n\r\nJoin the conversation on social media.\r\n\r\n facebook [ https://www.facebook.com/uscensusbureau/?utm_campaign=20260120mspios1ccpupnl&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]instagram [ https://www.instagram.com/uscensusbureau/?utm_campaign=20260120mspios1ccpupnl&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]linkedin [ https://www.linkedin.com/company/us-census-bureau/?utm_campaign=20260120mspios1ccpupnl&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]twitter [ https://twitter.com/uscensusbureau/?utm_campaign=20260120mspios1ccpupnl&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] [ https://www.linkedin.com/company/us-census-bureau/?utm_campaign=20260120mspios1ccpupnl&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]youtube [ https://www.youtube.com/user/uscensusbureau/?utm_campaign=20260120mspios1ccpupnl&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]  \r\n\r\nSUBSCRIBER SERVICES:\r\n\r\nSubscriber Settings [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USCENSUS/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 Remove me from All Subscriptions  [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USCENSUS/subscriber/one_click_unsubscribe?verification=5.76359f46a06559a62e8e0404a80cc7e5&destination=jasonnorman66994%40gmail.com ]\xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0Help [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/ ]\r\n\r\n \r\n&lt;!-- /* template top padding on mobile */ @media only screen and (max-width: 480px) { table#flexible-abe-main-table { padding:0 !important; } } --&gt; ________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\nThis is an official email from the U.S. Census Bureau. If you have any questions or comments, please contact us (http://www.census.gov/about/contact-us.html [ http://www.census.gov/about/contact-us.html?utm_campaign=20260120mspios1ccpupnl&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]).  \xc2\xa0 \r\nbody .abe-column-block {min-height: 5px;} table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:7px; margin-right:7px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;}\r\n"
