[2026-04-27 10:37:09] Raw text/plain payload: b'Join us on January 28 for our FREE webinar  \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nJanuary WISE: Exploring a New Career with Ticket to Work [ https://choosework.ssa.gov/wise/ ] \r\n  \r\nFree Webinar\r\nExploring a New Career with Ticket to Work\r\n\r\nJanuary 28, 2026\r\n\r\n3 \xe2\x80\x93 4:30 p.m. ET\r\n\r\nThinking about changing your career but not sure where to start? You\xe2\x80\x99re not alone \xe2\x80\x94 and you don\xe2\x80\x99t have to figure it out on your own.\r\n\r\nJoin us on *January 28* for a practical, encouraging webinar where we\xe2\x80\x99ll share tips for exploring new career paths, identifying your strengths, and taking manageable first steps toward a new direction. Whether you\xe2\x80\x99re looking for more flexibility, a fresh start, or a role that better fits your goals, this session will give you tools you can use right away.\r\n\r\nWe\xe2\x80\x99ll also highlight how the Ticket to Work Program can support your journey, offering career counseling, training opportunities, job search assistance, and ongoing workplace support.\r\n\r\nYou\xe2\x80\x99ll learn what to expect when getting started, how Work Incentives can help you explore employment safely, and how to connect with an Employment Network that aligns with your needs. If you\xe2\x80\x99re ready to open the door to new possibilities, this webinar is the perfect place to begin.\r\n\r\nLet\xe2\x80\x99s explore what\xe2\x80\x99s possible \xe2\x80\x94 together!\r\n\r\nRegister Now [ https://choosework.ssa.gov/wise/ ]\r\n\r\nOnline: choosework.ssa.gov/wise [ https://choosework.ssa.gov/wise/ ]\r\n\r\nBy Phone: *1-866-968-7842* or *1-866-833-2967* (TTY)\r\n\r\n"You will receive a registration confirmation message with instructions on how to log in to the webinar. Please be sure to check your spam folder."\r\n\r\n*WISE in American Sign Language (ASL)*\r\n\r\nOur ASL Guide [ https://choosework.ssa.gov/library/wise-asl-guide?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] can help individuals who are deaf or hard of hearing access our monthly WISE webinars using Video Relay Service (VRS).\r\n\r\nAdditional accessibility information is available on the registration page.\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*Questions about Ticket to Work?*\r\n\r\nThe Ticket Program supports career development for people ages 18 through 64 who receive Social Security Disability benefits (SSDI/SSI) and want to work. Monthly WISE webinars provide information about Social Security programs, Work Incentives, and other resources that may help you or someone you know on the path to financial independence through work.\r\n\r\nEmail us: TicketToWork@ssa.gov\r\n\r\nCall us: 1-866-968-7842 or 1-866-833-2967 (TTY)\r\n\r\nVisit our website: choosework.ssa.gov [ https://choosework.ssa.gov/ ]\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n"Use our Share button to send this information to your family and friends!"\r\n\r\n""Bookmark and Share [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USSSATTW/bulletins/40404bd?reqfrom=share ]""\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n  \r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n  \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n [ https://yourtickettowork.com/web/ttw/en-home ]  \r\n\r\n*Social Security\'s Ticket to Work Program*\r\n\r\n"Call the Ticket to Work Help Line"\r\n\r\n"1-866-968-7842\xc2\xa0\r\n1-866-833-2967 (TTY)\r\n"\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nJoin our text message list now and learn about getting FREE help and support to go back to work or work for the first time. Text TICKET to 1-571-489-5292.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nSocial Security\xe2\x80\x99s Ticket Program supports career development for people ages 18 through 64 who receive Social Security disability benefits (SSDI or SSI) and want to work.\r\n\r\n \r\n STAY CONNECTED: \r\nVisit Us on Facebook [ http://www.facebook.com/choosework ] Visit us on X [ http://twitter.com/chooseworkssa ] Blog [ https://choosework.ssa.gov/blog/index.html ] Visit Us on YouTube [ http://www.youtube.com/user/choosework?feature=watch ] Sign up for email updates [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USSSATTW/subscriber/topics ] \xc2\xa0 \r\n \r\n\r\nSUBSCRIBER PREFERENCES:\r\nManage Preferences [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USSSA/subscriber/new ]\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0Un [ http://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USSSA/subscribers/new ]subscribe [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USSSATTW/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ]\xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0 Help [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/s/ ]\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n This email was sent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com by the Ticket to Work, and was produced and disseminated at U.S. taxpayer expense. GovDelivery logo [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/ ] \r\n \r\nbody .abe-column-block { min-height: 5px; } table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:10px; margin-right:10px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;}\r\n'
