[2026-04-27 10:37:12] Raw text/plain payload: b'The approvals listed below may not be comprehensive. For the most current information, view the full listing of all approvals at Drugs@FDA [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=reportsSearch.process&rptName=1&reportSelectMonth=11&reportSelectYear=2025&nav ].\r\n\r\n*What\'s New Related to Drugs*\r\n\r\n*Updated Monday through Friday*\r\n\r\n\r\n  * Current and Resolved Drug Shortages and Discontinuations Reported to FDA [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/drugshortages/#tab4 ] \r\n  * Drug Firm Annual Registration Status [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/drls/default.cfm?utm_medium=&utm_source= ] \r\n  * Drug Firm Annual Registration Status Download File [ https://www.fda.gov/drugs/drug-approvals-and-databases/drug-establishments-current-registration-site?utm_medium=&utm_source= ] \r\n  * National Drug Code Directory [ https://www.fda.gov/drugs/drug-approvals-and-databases/national-drug-code-directory?utm_medium=&utm_source= ] \r\n  * NDC Unfinished Drugs Excluded Database File [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/cder/NDC_unfinished_excluded.zip?utm_medium=&utm_source= ] \r\n  * NDC Database Excluded Packages and Products [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/cder/ndc_excluded.zip?utm_medium=&utm_source= ] \r\n  * Wholesale Distributor and Third-Party Logistics Providers Reporting [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/wdd3plreporting/ ] \r\n  * Drug Establishments Current Registration Site [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/drls/ ] \r\n  * Drugs@FDA Data Files [ https://www.fda.gov/drugs/drug-approvals-and-databases/drugsfda-data-files ]\xc2\xa0 \r\n\r\n*Updated Biweekly*\r\n\r\n  * Competitive Generic Therapy Approvals [ https://www.fda.gov/drugs/generic-drugs/competitive-generic-therapy-approvals ] \r\n\r\n*January 20, 2026*\r\n\r\nDraft Guidance:\xc2\xa0M4Q(R2) The Common Technical Document for the Registration of Pharmaceuticals for Human Use: Quality [ https://www.fda.gov/regulatory-information/search-fda-guidance-documents/m4qr2-common-technical-document-registration-pharmaceuticals-human-use-quality ]\r\n\r\n*January 13, 2026*\r\n\r\n\r\n  * FDA Requests Removal of Suicidal Behavior and Ideation Warning from Glucagon-Like Peptide-1 Receptor Agonist (GLP-1 RA) Medications [ https://www.fda.gov/drugs/drug-safety-and-availability/fda-requests-removal-suicidal-behavior-and-ideation-warning-glucagon-peptide-1-receptor-agonist-glp ] \r\n\r\nThis report displays final approvals and tentative approvals of original and supplemental applications for the two days beginning on the earliest date listed below. Some approvals may be added to the Drugs@FDA database after this time span. For comprehensive approval reports, please use the monthly "All Approvals [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=reportsSearch.process&nav=&reportSelectMonth=9&reportSelectYear=2020&rptName=1&utm_medium=&utm_source=#navigation ]" report on Drugs@FDA.\r\n\r\nJanuary 16, 2026\r\n\r\nDrug Name and\r\nApplication Number Active Ingredient Dosage Form/ Route Submission Company Submission Classification Submission Status Implanon\r\nNDA #021529 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=021529 ] Etonogestrel Implant; Implantation SUPPL-27 Organon Efficacy Approved Nexplanon\r\nNDA #021529 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=021529 ] Etonogestrel Implant; Implantation SUPPL-27 Organon Efficacy Approved Losartan Potassium\r\nANDA #077459 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=077459 ] Losartan Potassium Tablet; Oral SUPPL-15 Hikma Labeling Approved Briumvi\r\nBLA #761238 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=761238 ] Ublituximab-Xiiy Injectable; Intravenous SUPPL-26 Tg Therapeutics, Inc Labeling Approved Briumvi\r\nBLA #761238 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=761238 ] Ublituximab-Xiiy Injectable; Intravenous SUPPL-26 Tg Therapeutics, Inc Labeling Approved \r\n\r\nJanuary 15, 2026\r\n\r\nDrug Name and\r\nApplication Number Active Ingredient Dosage Form/ Route Submission Company Submission Classification Submission Status Naproxen Sodium\r\nNDA #021920 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=021920 ] Naproxen Sodium Capsule; Oral SUPPL-41 Bionpharma Labeling Approved Methylphenidate Hydrochloride\r\nANDA #091159 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=091159 ] Methylphenidate Hydrochloride Tablet; Oral SUPPL-3 Mountain Labeling Approved Methylphenidate Hydrochloride\r\nANDA #091159 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=091159 ] Methylphenidate Hydrochloride Tablet; Oral SUPPL-16 Mountain Labeling Approved Methylphenidate Hydrochloride\r\nANDA #091159 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=091159 ] Methylphenidate Hydrochloride Tablet; Oral SUPPL-3 Mountain Labeling Approved Methylphenidate Hydrochloride\r\nANDA #091159 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=091159 ] Methylphenidate Hydrochloride Tablet; Oral SUPPL-10 Mountain Labeling Approved Methylphenidate Hydrochloride\r\nANDA #091159 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=091159 ] Methylphenidate Hydrochloride Tablet; Oral SUPPL-12 Mountain Labeling Approved Methylphenidate Hydrochloride\r\nANDA #091159 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=091159 ] Methylphenidate Hydrochloride Tablet; Oral SUPPL-14 Mountain Labeling Approved Methylphenidate Hydrochloride\r\nANDA #091159 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?even