pts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=200180 ] Hydrochlorothiazide; Losartan Potassium Tablet; Oral SUPPL-4 Watson Labs Labeling Approved Losartan Potassium and Hydrochlorothiazide\r\nANDA #200180 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=200180 ] Hydrochlorothiazide; Losartan Potassium Tablet; Oral SUPPL-4 Watson Labs Labeling Approved Oseltamivir Phosphate\r\nANDA #212784 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=212784 ] Oseltamivir Phosphate For Suspension; Oral SUPPL-17 Ajanta Pharma Ltd Labeling Approved Oseltamivir Phosphate\r\nANDA #212784 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=212784 ] Oseltamivir Phosphate For Suspension; Oral SUPPL-17 Ajanta Pharma Ltd Labeling Approved Oseltamivir Phosphate\r\nANDA #212784 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=212784 ] Oseltamivir Phosphate For Suspension; Oral SUPPL-17 Ajanta Pharma Ltd Labeling Approved Fluoxetine Hydrochloride\r\nANDA #213265 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=213265 ] Fluoxetine Hydrochloride Tablet; Oral SUPPL-5 Aurobindo Pharma Ltd Manufacturing (CMC) Approved Fluoxetine Hydrochloride\r\nANDA #213265 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=213265 ] Fluoxetine Hydrochloride Tablet; Oral SUPPL-5 Aurobindo Pharma Ltd Manufacturing (CMC) Approved Fluoxetine Hydrochloride\r\nANDA #213286 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=213286 ] Fluoxetine Hydrochloride Tablet; Oral SUPPL-6 Aurobindo Pharma Ltd Manufacturing (CMC) Approved Rezurock\r\nNDA #214783 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=214783 ] Belumosudil Mesylate Tablet; Oral SUPPL-12 Kadmon Pharms Llc Labeling Approved Alvaiz\r\nNDA #216774 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=216774 ] Eltrombopag Choline Tablet; Oral SUPPL-6 Teva Pharms Inc Labeling Approved Oxaliplatin\r\nANDA #219765 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=219765 ] Oxaliplatin Injectable; Intravenous ORIG-1 Shandong \xc2\xa0 Approved Otulfi\r\nBLA #761379 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=761379 ] Ustekinumab-Aauz Injectable; Injection SUPPL-9 Fresenius Kabi Usa \xc2\xa0 Approved Otulfi\r\nBLA #761379 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=761379 ] Ustekinumab-Aauz Injectable; Injection SUPPL-9 Fresenius Kabi Usa \xc2\xa0 Approved \r\n\r\nfeed [ https://www.fda.gov/about-fda/contact-fda/subscribe-podcasts-and-news-feeds?utm_medium=&utm_source= ]twitter [ https://www.twitter.com/US_FDA?utm_medium=&utm_source= ]facebook [ https://www.facebook.com/FDA?utm_medium=&utm_source= ]youtube [ https://www.youtube.com/user/USFoodandDrugAdmin?utm_medium=&utm_source= ]flickr [ https://www.flickr.com/photos/fdaphotos/albums/?utm_medium=&utm_source= ]  \r\n\r\n*Manage Subscriptions* [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 *Unsubscribe All* [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/subscriber/one_click_unsubscribe?verification=5.ee0243ee8741fe358146537aecf40e1e&destination=jasonnorman66994%40gmail.com ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 *Help* [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/ ]\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\nbody .abe-column-block {min-height: 5px;} td {line-height:1;} \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n This email was sent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com using GovDelivery Communications Cloud on behalf of: U.S. Food and Drug Administration \xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0\r\n10903 New Hampshire Ave\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0Silver Spring, MD 