[2026-04-27 10:37:22] Raw text/plain payload: b"Team email banner Advanced Manufacturing [ https://www.trade.gov/advanced-manufacturing-industry ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nCritical Mineral and Mining Projects in Peru: Opportunities for U.S. Businesses\r\n\r\n*Wednesday, January 21 | 12:00pm EST*\r\n\r\n*Free Webinar*\r\n\r\n*Register Here* [ https://events.gcc.teams.microsoft.com/event/3ad836aa-c77f-40de-a00f-0cc6c9b3e4fe@a1d183f2-6c7b-4d9a-b994-5f2f31b3f780 ] \r\n \r\n\r\nAre you a mining equipment manufacturer, service supplier, or project finance professional interested to learn more about mining opportunities in Peru? Hear from the U.S. Commercial Service and U.S. Embassy officials in Lima about exciting mining projects in Peru and a market overview.\r\n\r\nThis webinar will provide U.S. companies with a comprehensive overview of Peru\xe2\x80\x99s mining market and broader investment landscape. The session will begin with a brief macroeconomic and political overview and will highlight why the country remains an attractive destination for U.S. mining firms, equipment manufacturers, and service providers.\r\n\r\npic \r\n\r\n*Register Here* [ https://events.gcc.teams.microsoft.com/event/3ad836aa-c77f-40de-a00f-0cc6c9b3e4fe@a1d183f2-6c7b-4d9a-b994-5f2f31b3f780 ] \r\n \r\n\r\n*Mining in Peru Overview*\r\n\r\n\r\n  * Mining is vital to Peru's economy, contributing 15% of GDP (2017-2021) \r\n  * World's 2nd largest producer of Copper\xc2\xa0 \r\n  * Major producer of key minerals such as gold, silver,\xc2\xa0zinc,\xc2\xa0and lithium \r\n\r\n*Export and Investment Opportunities*\r\n\r\n\r\n  * The discussion will focus on Peru\xe2\x80\x99s key investment projects planned for 2026\xe2\x80\x932027. These projects represent nearly US$8.2 billion in new mining investment concentrated primarily in Arequipa, Puno, Apur\xc3\xadmac, Pasco, and Cusco regions. \r\n  * These projects present a great opportunity for U.S. exports in mining equipment and services and in this webinar the U.S. Commercial Service will discuss how we can help facilitate these export deals. \r\n\r\n*Additional*\r\n\r\n\r\n  * This webinar will provide companies with information on the upcoming Mining Convention in Peru (PERUMIN), the U.S. Commercial Service's new Coal and Mining Connect program, and similar webinar content for opportunities in Vietnam.\xc2\xa0 \r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*Contact*: Chris.Petersen@trade.gov & Lilliam.Baez@trade.gov\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n  \r\n \r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n* International Trade Administration*\xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0United States Commercial Service, International Trade Administration [ https://www.trade.gov/us-commercial-service ]*\r\n [ https://www.trade.gov/us-commercial-service ]*  \r\n\r\nThe U.S. Commercial Service is the trade promotion arm of the\r\n*U.S. Department of Commerce's International Trade Administration.*\r\nU.S. Commercial Service trade professionals in over 100 U.S. cities and in more than 75 markets \r\nhelp U.S. companies get started in exporting or increase sales to global markets.\r\n\r\n*STAY CONNECTED*\r\n\r\nVisit us on X [ https://twitter.com/exportgov ]\xc2\xa0 Connect with us on LinkedIn [ https://www.linkedin.com/company/uscommercialservice/ ]\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nBookmark and Share [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USITATRADE/bulletins/404388c?reqfrom=share ]\r\n\r\nIf you are ready to begin exporting or expand to additional global markets, \r\nplease contact your nearest U.S. Commercial Service office [ https://www.trade.gov/commercial-services-offices-us ]\r\nor check out our online EXPORT SOLUTIONS [ https://www.trade.gov/export-solutions ].\r\n\r\n*SUBSCRIBER SERVICES*\r\nVisit our User Profile Page [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USITATRADE/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] to update your subscriptions or unsubscribe.\r\nIf you need assistance, please visit\xc2\xa0subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/hc/en-us ].\r\n\r\n \r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\nThis email was sent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com using GovDelivery Communications Cloud on behalf of the International Trade Administration\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7 1401 Constitution Avenue NW \xc2\xb7 Washington, DC 20230 GovDelivery logo [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/ ] \r\nbody .abe-column-block { min-height: 5px; } table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:10px; margin-right:10px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;} table.govd_hr {min-width: 100%;}\r\n"
