[2026-04-27 10:37:47] Raw text/plain payload: b'Connecting the global media, entertainment and technology ecosystem  \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nMedia &amp; Entertainment Banner \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nUpcoming Webinar\r\n\r\nNAB Show: Your Gateway to Global Buyers and Exhibitors\r\n\r\n*"Connecting the global media, entertainment,\xc2\xa0"*\r\n\r\n*"and technology ecosystem"*\r\n\r\n*Tuesday, January 27, 2026 | 11:00 AM EST | VIRTUAL | FREE*\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\nNab SHOW 2026 Upcoming Webinar\r\n\r\n*Join the U.S. Commercial Service and NAB Show [ https://gcc02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Flinks-1.govdelivery.com%2FCL0%2Fhttps%3A%252F%252Fwww.nabshow.com%252F%2F1%2F0100019bc24ce243-24cdb74c-211b-4914-98c9-86a7b8d8a8c8-000000%2FRL4divMHBbM1kRHsRj1cTh0z59bVev6LKoBhybFLkfw%3D440&data=05%7C02%7Cisabel.davila%40trade.gov%7C3d4ed469033e4909a7c008de544bd388%7Ca1d183f26c7b4d9ab9945f2f31b3f780%7C0%7C0%7C639040881806598352%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&sdata=py91TSANORRqCXCuafjWpTyt2r%2BjyLiCvR6EMX%2B2xqo%3D&reserved=0 ] for a webinar that will help you unlock new international opportunities!*\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nNAB Show is the premier marketplace where creators, technologists, and innovators from more than 160 countries converge to discover solutions, forge partnerships, and shape the future of the content economy. This webinar will walk you through how the NAB Show can put your brand in front of high\xe2\x80\x91value buyers, distributors, and technology partners from every corner of the world.\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*AGENDA*\r\n\r\n\r\n  * U.S. Commercial Service Introductions \r\n  * NAB Show Overview \r\n  * What\'s New in 2026 \r\n  * Questions \r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*WEBINAR HIGHLIGHTS*\r\n\r\n\r\n  * An overview of the U.S. Commercial Service and how we can support your global expansion. \r\n  * You\xe2\x80\x99ll gain insights into attendee demographics, emerging global trends, and strategies to maximize your visibility and ROI. \r\n  * Whether you\xe2\x80\x99re looking to enter new markets, launch products on an international stage, or connect with decision\xe2\x80\x91makers across broadcast, streaming, production, AI, cloud, and beyond, this session will equip you with the knowledge to make the most of the opportunity. \r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*WHO SHOULD ATTEND?*\r\n\r\nCompanies with commercial products or platforms in video, broadcast, streaming, production technology or media software that want to learn how NAB Show can help them showcase their solutions, reach global buyers and partners, generate qualified leads and grow their business.\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nOrganizations actively producing content, distributing content or managing media workflows that are looking to discover new technology, evaluate partners and source solutions to improve efficiency, quality, reach and monetization across the content lifecycle.\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n*LEARN MORE AND REGISTER HERE* [ https://events.trade.gov/en/TradeGov/NABShowYourGatewaytoGlobalBuyersandExhibitors-9884/ ] \r\n \r\n\r\n*Thank you to our Co-Organizers*\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nNEW NAB LOGO\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n*QUESTIONS? * \r\n \r\n\r\n*For more information please contact:\xc2\xa0*\r\n\r\n*Isabel.Davila@trade.gov - U.S. Commercial Service*\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n  \r\n \r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n* International Trade Administration*\xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0United States Commercial Service, International Trade Administration [ https://www.trade.gov/us-commercial-service ]*\r\n [ https://www.trade.gov/us-commercial-service ]*  \r\n\r\nThe U.S. Commercial Service is the trade promotion arm of the\r\n*U.S. Department of Commerce\'s International Trade Administration.*\r\nU.S. Commercial Service trade professionals in over 100 U.S. cities and in more than 75 markets \r\nhelp U.S. companies get started in exporting or increase sales to global markets.\r\n\r\n*STAY CONNECTED*\r\n\r\nVisit us on X [ https://twitter.com/exportgov ]\xc2\xa0 Connect with us on LinkedIn [ https://www.linkedin.com/company/uscommercialservice/ ]\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nBookmark and Share [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USITATRADE/bulletins/4049189?reqfrom=share ]\r\n\r\nIf you are ready to begin exporting or expand to additional global markets, \r\nplease contact your nearest U.S. Commercial Service office [ https://www.trade.gov/commercial-services-offices-us ]\r\nor check out our online EXPORT SOLUTIONS [ https://www.trade.gov/export-solutions ].\r\n\r\n*SUBSCRIBER SERVICES*\r\nVisit our User Profile Page [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USITATRADE/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] to update your subscriptions or unsubscribe.\r\nIf you need assistance, please visit\xc2\xa0subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/hc/en-us ].\r\n\r\n \r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\nThis email was sent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com using GovDelivery Communications Cloud on behalf of the International Trade Administration\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7 1401 Constitution Avenue NW \xc2\xb7 Washington, DC 20230 GovDelivery logo [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/ ] \r\nbody .abe-column-block { min-height: 5px; } table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:10px; margin-right:10px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;} table.govd_hr {min-width: 100%;}\r\n'
