[2026-04-27 10:38:01] Raw text/plain payload: b"Hello, everyone!\r\n\r\nFor those who are on Threads, I just created my own account to expand my platform.\r\n[not a writing post] my contents are now available on Threads!\r\n\r\nletters from rosie (https://medium.com/@lynwrites_?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769001256116-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------11558861_da14_4ce0_be2b_cc18722158b5--------8db497530be4)\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nJanuary 21, 2026\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\n1 min read\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nView on Medium (https://medium.com/p/461d2a7a1b27?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769001256116-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------11558861_da14_4ce0_be2b_cc18722158b5--------8db497530be4)\r\n\r\nHello, everyone!\r\n\r\nFor those who are on Threads, I just created my own account to expand my platform. If you'd like to check it out and be mutuals, here's my account:\r\n\r\nWe can be mutuals! Feel free to drop your usernames so I can follow you back \xf0\x9f\xa4\x8d\r\n\r\nJust in case you didn't know, I'm also on Instagram:\r\nhttps://www.instagram.com/lettersfromrosie_/\r\n\r\nIf you've already sent a request, you can leave a comment so I won't miss it. Stay tuned for upcoming posts. Thank you so much, and wishing you all the best always \xf0\x9f\xab\xb6\r\n\r\nWith love,\r\nRosie\r\n\r\nContinue reading (https://medium.com/p/461d2a7a1b27?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769001256116-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------11558861_da14_4ce0_be2b_cc18722158b5--------8db497530be4)\r\nContinue reading this story on Medium.\r\n\r\nSent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com by letters from rosie on Medium\r\nUnsubscribe (https://medium.com/me/email-settings/50207bf5a022/07dbe42ad08d?type=noSetting&newsletterV3Id=8db497530be4&source=email-50207bf5a022-1769001256116-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------11558861_da14_4ce0_be2b_cc18722158b5--------8db497530be4)\r\n from this writer's email notifications\r\nManage your email settings (https://medium.com/me/settings/notifications?hash=07dbe42ad08d&userId=50207bf5a022&settingsRouteHash=%23manageSubscriptions&source=email-50207bf5a022-1769001256116-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------11558861_da14_4ce0_be2b_cc18722158b5--------8db497530be4)\r\n\r\n3500 South DuPont Highway, Suite IQ-101, Dover,\xc2\xa0DE\xc2\xa019901\r\nCareers (https://medium.com/jobs-at-medium/work-at-medium-959d1a85284e?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769001256116-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------11558861_da14_4ce0_be2b_cc18722158b5--------8db497530be4)\r\n\xc2\xb7Help Center (https://help.medium.com/hc/en-us?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769001256116-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------11558861_da14_4ce0_be2b_cc18722158b5--------8db497530be4)\r\n\xc2\xb7Privacy Policy (https://policy.medium.com/medium-privacy-policy-f03bf92035c9?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769001256116-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------11558861_da14_4ce0_be2b_cc18722158b5--------8db497530be4)\r\n\xc2\xb7Terms of service (https://policy.medium.com/medium-terms-of-service-9db0094a1e0f?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769001256116-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------11558861_da14_4ce0_be2b_cc18722158b5--------8db497530be4)"
