[2026-04-27 10:38:13] Raw text/plain payload: b'Exciting News!  \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nNIST  \r\n \r\n\r\nView As Web Page [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USNIST/bulletins/4055168 ]\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\nHeader  \r\n \r\n\r\nNational Cybersecurity Center of Excellence\r\n \r\n \r\nNCCoE Portfolio and Webinar \r\nNIST NCCoE Announces Project Portfolio\r\n\r\nThe NIST National Cybersecurity Center of Excellence (NCCoE) is excited to announce the release of our inaugural Project Portfolio [ https://www.nccoe.nist.gov/sites/default/files/2026-01/nccoe-project-portfolio.pdf ], providing an overview of the NCCoE\xe2\x80\x99s research priorities and active projects. In addition, we invite you to join us for a webinar [ https://www.nccoe.nist.gov/get-involved/attend-events/nccoe-project-portfolio-webinar ] on February 19, 2026.\r\n\r\n*Background*\r\n\r\nThe NCCoE serves as a U.S. cybersecurity innovation hub for the technologies, standards, and architectures for today\xe2\x80\x99s cybersecurity landscape. We collaborate with top cybersecurity experts and industry leaders to demonstrate practical ways to address the nation\xe2\x80\x99s most pressing cybersecurity challenges.\r\n\r\nThe Project Portfolio document provides an overview of the NCCoE and its work, including details on:\r\n\r\n\r\n  * Our four strategic pillars to guide our research projects \r\n  * Each active research project, with links to find more information \r\n  * Opportunities to provide input and get involved in the NCCoE\xe2\x80\x99s work \r\n\r\n*February Virtual Event*\r\n\r\nThose interested in hearing more about the NCCoE\xe2\x80\x99s Project Portfolio are invited to register [ https://www.nccoe.nist.gov/get-involved/attend-events/nccoe-project-portfolio-webinar ] for and attend our webinar on February 19, 2026, from 1:00 to 2:00 p.m. EST. The webinar will provide an overview of the NCCoE and our work, including more detail on our research portfolio, and a spotlight on a selection of our projects. Participants will be encouraged to provide feedback throughout the session to guide our future projects.\r\n\r\nAttendance is limited to 500 participants and is first-come, first-serve. There is no fee to attend. A recording will be made available after the webinar.\r\n\r\nReview the Portfolio [ https://www.nccoe.nist.gov/sites/default/files/2026-01/nccoe-project-portfolio.pdf ]\r\n \r\nRegister for the Webinar [ https://www.nccoe.nist.gov/get-involved/attend-events/nccoe-project-portfolio-webinar ]\r\n \r\n\r\n*NIST Cybersecurity and Privacy Program*\r\nQuestions and comments can be directed to: nccoe@nist.gov\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nConnect with us\r\n facebook [ https://www.facebook.com/NIST ]twitter [ https://twitter.com/NIST ]youtube [ https://www.youtube.com/NIST ]linkedin [ https://www.linkedin.com/company/nist ]flickr [ https://www.instagram.com/nist/ ]  \r\n\r\nReceived this email from a friend? Subscribe here [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USNIST/subscriber/new?topic_id=USNIST_1 ].\r\n\r\n ITL NIST [ https://www.nist.gov/itl ] \r\n\r\nSubscriber services:\r\n\r\nManage Preferences [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USNIST/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 Unsubscribe [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USNIST/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 Help [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/ ]\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\nIf you have questions or problems with the subscription service, please contact subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/ ].\r\nTechnical questions? Contact inquiries@nist.gov. (301) 975-NIST (6478).\r\n\r\nThis service is provided to you at no charge by National Institute of Standards and Technology (NIST).\xc2\xa0100 Bureau Drive, Stop 1070\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7 Gaithersburg, MD 20899\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0301-975-6478\r\n\r\n GovDelivery logo [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/ ] \r\nbody .abe-column-block { min-height: 5px; } table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:10px; margin-right:10px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;} table.govd_hr {min-width: 100%;}\r\n'
