 \xe2\x80\x94 Elevate Women in Tech\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>Hi there,</p><p><br class="ProseMirror-trailingBreak"></p><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: "Open Sans"; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: pre-line; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;"> </span></p><p>We\xe2\x80\x99re excited to announce that WiTVoices - our Speaker Arm is teaming up with ISACA South Florida this year to bring women\xe2\x80\x99s voices to the Audit, Controls, Cyber security and Risk management stage. If you\xe2\x80\x99re an experienced woman in tech who wants to connect, learn, influence others, mentor younger creators, and help redefine who gets to speak at conferences, this is for you.</p><p><br class="ProseMirror-trailingBreak"></p><p>What you\xe2\x80\x99ll gain</p><ul><li><p><span style="color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: "Gentium Basic", serif; font-size: 18.6667px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: none; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;">Leading industry speakers for an informative and educational event.</span>.</p></li><li><p>Clear pathways to speaking opportunities at ISACA South Florida events.</p></li><li><p>A supportive, collaborative community of women leaders in tech.</p></li></ul><p>Join us at the upcoming ISACA South Florida event and use code WIT10 for a special discount (applies to registration fees). Reserve your seat now: http://clicks.meetup.com/ls/click?upn=u001.NY3oBFzZ5LJDG7YcnfSAKsDIWI3PyJms8xYJodvBo5HdKCd1udUPSh-2FV0XXj6R5NIWOBDWIde8oYcMqVvTuJeLIY11dJMcK4JHMy6kwyr4ffedHjBroz6Gg2FxafiU8P5dFx_Hvirw9jLOYnqUg7ucIAtvDa4JCWhfjePQT8cfdKWfeKaKK6WyzUu0MT5hcL83ezarLAJeFzEeRP-2BR0XWfLa6c0ZkzfahQk62JU2n714v4KB89CB57uF-2FMMiFQQp6ZDNrgCmERdH6xP5UIwDcEfXa91hAAMWdXq7vuoMqtx8MxMlq9IVFlamMcIRG0Cyv9KASR6QmD-2BBA6xjN5HO8ZFbTknm1r018l2ym7yCZp5g0o7X8cU9ih66-2F2vFICGoBoRwb2wFOQw-2FLKElweyuwEIg6KXEQuOUm0bVbmq3uACkUGFTKqe8HsQqfOnurSAKRZ8hljyODe1FboPc4lVkKxTmj-2BYa-2FVRC4j6T9fhj-2BH91hwXnAFZ8TDECfv7ETAI2IZDTOFpipGsiwYbHW8k9u9-2BCCTTbxCfCP-2BDMowqtswJrJJ8FO5h0AEccTZolP8MrDXPGHp1J-2FM21XmXeWSUhPN88yC-2Fp34R-2BaUwVqG3uiSHfs1uAM4vX6SQ3lp7UMYiPT8487beH0PRPpDbVJrFdYbXABxPxMpVxww1Qc0wHn77TD45g8LOEJ-2BWkDixi2moa-2BpCBvWJSzqnQPpyB73fplNhVZQRJUixQla5Xuye8VsYdstSHaZUeVjRSWwlZ4U8aSkVlAcIj4rtx6bateCN0K3TEfVNkNW1ZWnXJ6C-2By8wbWioW1oSek3nFsvvoZr-2B62we8GSxSwoo3u9CvVEv3f-2Bgp2IUMeav520lVhNc23NWc6Ytik-3D</p><p><br class="ProseMirror-trailingBreak"></p><p>Your voice matters. Let\xe2\x80\x99s elevate women in tech together\xe2\x80\x94on and off the stage.</p><p><br class="ProseMirror-trailingBreak"></p><p>Warmly,</p><p>WiTVoices Team</p><p>P.S. If you\xe2\x80\x99d prefer not to receive emails like this, unsubscribe here: [unsubscribe link]</p><p><br class="ProseMirror-trailingBreak"></p><p><br class="ProseMirror-trailingBreak"></p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n       iPhone App Store \r\n( http://clicks.meetup.com/ls/click?upn=u001.NY3oBFzZ5LJDG7YcnfSAKjLc2cl1o9WhgumBbYjz9KA2bdbkkDa9jzeWsn8k5pk52hm5EmtB3yIWoqDtcaPcHvKSQ1HmK9EZ-2Bf5i-2FGzQQh5r87HgUrPonIFAmomnRNFx53c1EAJPRUWbLzCaO-2FKgnZtG5To1m4i9PDrmasBZvMU-3DbvYL_Hvirw9jLOYnqUg7ucIAtvDa4JCWhfjePQT8cfdKWfeKaKK6WyzUu0MT5hcL83ezarLAJeFzEeRP-2BR0XWfLa6c0ZkzfahQk62JU2n714v4KB89CB57uF-2FMMiFQQp6ZDNrgCmERdH6xP5UIwDcEfXa91hAAMWdXq7vuoMqtx8MxMlq9IVFlamMcIRG0Cyv9KASR6QmD-2BBA6xjN5HO8