[2026-04-27 10:38:23] Raw text/plain payload: b'If your email program has trouble displaying this email, view as a webpage [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/bulletins/405707a ].\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nUS Food and Drug Administration\r\nFDA Announces PreCheck Implementation Roadmap [ https://www.fda.gov/drugs/drug-safety-and-availability/fda-announces-precheck-implementation-roadmap?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n\r\nBookmark and Share [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/bulletins/405707a?reqfrom=share ]\r\n\r\n*[1/21/2026]*\xc2\xa0The U.S. Food and Drug Administration announced\xe2\x80\xafthat it will begin accepting applications\xe2\x80\xafon February 1,\xe2\x80\xaf2026\xe2\x80\xaffor\xe2\x80\xafthe\xe2\x80\xafPreCheck\xe2\x80\xafPilot Program. This program will\xe2\x80\xafstrengthen the domestic pharmaceutical supply chain by increasing regulatory predictability,\xe2\x80\xaffacilitating the construction of manufacturing sites in the\xe2\x80\xafU.S., and\xe2\x80\xafstreamlining\xe2\x80\xafaspects\xe2\x80\xafof\xe2\x80\xafpharmaceutical manufacturing facility\xe2\x80\xafassessments\xe2\x80\xafin advance of a specific\xe2\x80\xafproduct application. \xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nThe PreCheck\xe2\x80\xafPilot\xe2\x80\xafProgram will select\xe2\x80\xafan initial cohort of\xe2\x80\xafnew pharmaceutical manufacturing facilities\xe2\x80\xafand begin conducting\xe2\x80\xafPreCheck activities in 2026. These facilities will be selected based on overall alignment with national priorities\xe2\x80\xafsuch as\xe2\x80\xafproducts to be manufactured, phase of facility development, timeline to producing pharmaceutical products\xe2\x80\xaffor the\xe2\x80\xafU.S.\xe2\x80\xafmarket, and innovation in facility\xe2\x80\xafdevelopment. Additional details will be released\xe2\x80\xafon the application website on February 1, 2026.\xe2\x80\xaf\r\n\r\nPreCheck Pilot Program Implementation Roadmap\r\n\r\nThe\xe2\x80\xafFDA is incorporating stakeholder feedback\xe2\x80\xafinto the program design based on comments made during\xe2\x80\xafthe\xe2\x80\xafSeptember 30, 2025 "Onshoring Manufacturing of Drugs and Biological Products"\xe2\x80\xafpublic meeting and\xe2\x80\xafpublic comments received through the Federal Register\xe2\x80\xafpublication. Overall sentiment\xe2\x80\xafregarding\xe2\x80\xafthe PreCheck program was positive, with industry requesting early engagement during facility\xe2\x80\xafdevelopment\xe2\x80\xafphases. FDA will create a more predictable regulatory pathway, accelerate domestic pharmaceutical manufacturing, and protect patient safety through the implementation of the PreCheck Program.\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n  \r\n \r\n\r\nfeed [ https://www.fda.gov/about-fda/contact-fda/subscribe-podcasts-and-news-feeds?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]twitter [ https://www.twitter.com/US_FDA?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]facebook [ https://www.facebook.com/FDA?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]Instagram [ https://www.instagram.com/FDA?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]youtube [ https://www.youtube.com/user/USFoodandDrugAdmin?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]flickr [ https://www.flickr.com/photos/fdaphotos/albums/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]  \r\n\r\n*Manage Subscriptions* [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 *Unsubscribe All* [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/subscriber/one_click_unsubscribe?verification=5.ee0243ee8741fe358146537aecf40e1e&destination=jasonnorman66994%40gmail.com ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 *Help* [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/ ]\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\nbody .abe-column-block {min-height: 5px;} td {line-height:1;} \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n This email was sent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com using GovDelivery Communications Cloud on behalf of: U.S. Food and Drug Administration \xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0\r\n10903 New Hampshire Ave\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0Silver Spring, MD \xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0 20993-0002\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa01-888-INFO-FDA GovDelivery logo [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\nbody .abe-column-block { min-height: 5px; } table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:10px; margin-right:10px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;}\r\n'
