[2026-04-27 10:38:43] Raw text/plain payload: b"A few days ago, while experimenting with native ES modules in the browser, I found out one of those features that feels too powerful\xe2\x80\xa6\r\nThe Import Map Trick Browsers Don't Want You to Use\r\n\r\nAmit Kumar (https://medium.com/@amit08255?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769056353795-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------118a86a0_a1a9_4a3e_b846_1711e1f50aec--------1e8d2271b316)\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nJanuary 22, 2026\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\n4 min read\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nView on Medium (https://medium.com/p/72ce3303de46?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769056353795-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------118a86a0_a1a9_4a3e_b846_1711e1f50aec--------1e8d2271b316)\r\n\r\nThe Import Map Trick Browsers Don't Want You to Use\r\n\r\nA few days ago, while experimenting with native ES modules in the browser, I found out one of those features that feels too powerful.\r\n\r\nClick here to read for free\r\n\r\nI'm talking about import maps.\r\n\r\nThey may look like a small convenience feature. But once you understand what they unlock and what they don't allow you will start to love it like I do.\r\n\r\nLet's start with the fun part.\r\n\r\nA Short Refresh Before The Magic Part Begins\r\n\r\nOne of the biggest annoyances with native ES modules is long, ugly URLs in your imports.\r\n\r\nWithout import maps, you end up writing things like:\r\n\r\nimport { h } from\xe2\x80\xa6\r\n\r\nContinue reading (https://medium.com/p/72ce3303de46?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769056353795-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------118a86a0_a1a9_4a3e_b846_1711e1f50aec--------1e8d2271b316)\r\nThis is a member-only story and can only be read on Medium.\r\n\r\nSent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com by Amit Kumar on Medium\r\nUnsubscribe (https://medium.com/me/email-settings/50207bf5a022/f499f51bc748?type=noSetting&newsletterV3Id=1e8d2271b316&source=email-50207bf5a022-1769056353795-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------118a86a0_a1a9_4a3e_b846_1711e1f50aec--------1e8d2271b316)\r\n from this writer's email notifications\r\nManage your email settings (https://medium.com/me/settings/notifications?hash=f499f51bc748&userId=50207bf5a022&settingsRouteHash=%23manageSubscriptions&source=email-50207bf5a022-1769056353795-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------118a86a0_a1a9_4a3e_b846_1711e1f50aec--------1e8d2271b316)\r\n\r\n3500 South DuPont Highway, Suite IQ-101, Dover,\xc2\xa0DE\xc2\xa019901\r\nCareers (https://medium.com/jobs-at-medium/work-at-medium-959d1a85284e?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769056353795-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------118a86a0_a1a9_4a3e_b846_1711e1f50aec--------1e8d2271b316)\r\n\xc2\xb7Help Center (https://help.medium.com/hc/en-us?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769056353795-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------118a86a0_a1a9_4a3e_b846_1711e1f50aec--------1e8d2271b316)\r\n\xc2\xb7Privacy Policy (https://policy.medium.com/medium-privacy-policy-f03bf92035c9?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769056353795-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------118a86a0_a1a9_4a3e_b846_1711e1f50aec--------1e8d2271b316)\r\n\xc2\xb7Terms of service (https://policy.medium.com/medium-terms-of-service-9db0094a1e0f?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769056353795-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------118a86a0_a1a9_4a3e_b846_1711e1f50aec--------1e8d2271b316)"
