[2026-04-27 10:38:45] Raw text/plain payload: b"Everything you do when building a startup will teach you a lesson, but some things will teach the wrong lesson.\r\nThe Only Thing in Startups More Dangerous Than Failure\r\n\r\nEverything you do when building a startup will teach you a lesson, but some things will teach the wrong lesson.\r\n\r\nAaron Dinin, PhD (https://medium.com/@aarondinin?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769079886073-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-7adf33e44ae3------------------------52c75d7b_a6f0_4e22_9356_2d0cf8d3405e--------7ae6917575f4)\r\n\xc2\xa0in\xc2\xa0Entrepreneurship Handbook (https://medium.com/entrepreneur-s-handbook?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769079886073-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-7adf33e44ae3------------------------52c75d7b_a6f0_4e22_9356_2d0cf8d3405e--------7ae6917575f4)\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nJanuary 22, 2026\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\n5 min read\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nView on Medium (https://medium.com/entrepreneur-s-handbook/43b8f4807212?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769079886073-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-7adf33e44ae3------------------------52c75d7b_a6f0_4e22_9356_2d0cf8d3405e--------7ae6917575f4)\r\n\r\nPhoto by Kamil Pietrzak (http://redirect.medium.systems/r-xBayrXsA01?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769079886073-newsletter.subscribeToProfile--43b8f4807212-----------------------52c75d7b_a6f0_4e22_9356_2d0cf8d3405e--------7ae6917575f4)\r\n on Unsplash (http://redirect.medium.systems/r-Gu6Z_HViFN?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769079886073-newsletter.subscribeToProfile--43b8f4807212-----------------------52c75d7b_a6f0_4e22_9356_2d0cf8d3405e--------7ae6917575f4)\r\n\r\nA few months ago, I met up with an entrepreneur I hadn't seen in nearly fifteen years.\r\n\r\nWe cut our teeth in the startup world around the same time, back when neither of us really knew what we were doing. We were both first-time founders, both convinced we were building something important, both stumbling through the early chaos with more confidence than competence. The difference was that his company worked. As-in\xe2\x80\xa6 really worked. It sold for something in the eighty-million-dollar range, which, especially at that time and on the East Coast, was a genuinely great outcome.\xc2\xa0\xe2\x80\xa6\r\n\r\nContinue reading (https://medium.com/entrepreneur-s-handbook/43b8f4807212?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769079886073-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-7adf33e44ae3------------------------52c75d7b_a6f0_4e22_9356_2d0cf8d3405e--------7ae6917575f4)\r\nThis is a member-only story and can only be read on Medium.\r\n\r\nSent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com by Aaron Dinin, PhD on Medium\r\nUnsubscribe (https://medium.com/me/email-settings/50207bf5a022/aaf0615f0f51?type=noSetting&newsletterV3Id=7ae6917575f4&collectionId=7adf33e44ae3&source=email-50207bf5a022-1769079886073-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-7adf33e44ae3------------------------52c75d7b_a6f0_4e22_9356_2d0cf8d3405e--------7ae6917575f4)\r\n from this writer's email notifications\r\nManage your email settings (https://medium.com/me/settings/notifications?hash=aaf0615f0f51&userId=50207bf5a022&settingsRouteHash=%23manageSubscriptions&source=email-50207bf5a022-1769079886073-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-7adf33e44ae3------------------------52c75d7b_a6f0_4e22_9356_2d0cf8d3405e--------7ae6917575f4)\r\n\r\n3500 South DuPont Highway, Suite IQ-101, Dover,\xc2\xa0DE\xc2\xa019901\r\nCareers (https://medium.com/jobs-at-medium/work-at-medium-959d1a85284e?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769079886073-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-7adf33e44ae3------------------------52c75d7b_a6f0_4e22_9356_2d0cf8d3405e--------7ae6917575f4)\r\n\xc2\xb7Help Center (https://help.medium.com/hc/en-us?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769079886073-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-7adf33e44ae3------------------------52c75d7b_a6f0_4e22_9356_2d0cf8d3405e--------7ae6917575f4)\r\n\xc2\xb7Privacy Policy (https://policy.medium.com/medium-privacy-policy-f03bf92035c9?source=ema