[2026-04-27 10:38:52] Raw text/plain payload: b"For a long time, I thought being sensitive was something I had to outgrow.\r\nit's okay to cry when there is too much on your mind, the clouds rain too when things get heavy.\r\n\r\nletters from rosie (https://medium.com/@lynwrites_?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769089804177-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------896bc6a8_cf8b_472f_87a5_79b9141c8ea7--------8db497530be4)\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nJanuary 22, 2026\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\n4 min read\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nView on Medium (https://medium.com/p/da46579663ae?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769089804177-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------896bc6a8_cf8b_472f_87a5_79b9141c8ea7--------8db497530be4)\r\n\r\nImage from Pinterest\r\n\r\nFor a long time, I thought being sensitive was something I had to outgrow.\r\n\r\nI told myself I felt too much, cared too deeply, noticed things I shouldn't. So I learned how to hide it. I learned how to stay quiet, how to carry the heaviness without letting it spill. But slowly, I began to understand that this softness isn't a flaw: it's a part of me that keeps me honest, that allows me to experience life without filters.\r\n\r\nI've always found comfort in looking at the sky. Clouds never stay the same. They move, shift, and change without apologizing\xe2\x80\xa6\r\n\r\nContinue reading (https://medium.com/p/da46579663ae?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769089804177-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------896bc6a8_cf8b_472f_87a5_79b9141c8ea7--------8db497530be4)\r\nContinue reading this story on Medium.\r\n\r\nSent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com by letters from rosie on Medium\r\nUnsubscribe (https://medium.com/me/email-settings/50207bf5a022/19052680a9bf?type=noSetting&newsletterV3Id=8db497530be4&source=email-50207bf5a022-1769089804177-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------896bc6a8_cf8b_472f_87a5_79b9141c8ea7--------8db497530be4)\r\n from this writer's email notifications\r\nManage your email settings (https://medium.com/me/settings/notifications?hash=19052680a9bf&userId=50207bf5a022&settingsRouteHash=%23manageSubscriptions&source=email-50207bf5a022-1769089804177-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------896bc6a8_cf8b_472f_87a5_79b9141c8ea7--------8db497530be4)\r\n\r\n3500 South DuPont Highway, Suite IQ-101, Dover,\xc2\xa0DE\xc2\xa019901\r\nCareers (https://medium.com/jobs-at-medium/work-at-medium-959d1a85284e?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769089804177-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------896bc6a8_cf8b_472f_87a5_79b9141c8ea7--------8db497530be4)\r\n\xc2\xb7Help Center (https://help.medium.com/hc/en-us?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769089804177-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------896bc6a8_cf8b_472f_87a5_79b9141c8ea7--------8db497530be4)\r\n\xc2\xb7Privacy Policy (https://policy.medium.com/medium-privacy-policy-f03bf92035c9?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769089804177-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------896bc6a8_cf8b_472f_87a5_79b9141c8ea7--------8db497530be4)\r\n\xc2\xb7Terms of service (https://policy.medium.com/medium-terms-of-service-9db0094a1e0f?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769089804177-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------896bc6a8_cf8b_472f_87a5_79b9141c8ea7--------8db497530be4)"
