[2026-04-27 10:38:58] Raw text/plain payload: b'View as a webpage\xc2\xa0 /\xc2\xa0 Share [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USDAOC/bulletins/4059bad ]\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nHeader-Hybrid \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nOffice of Communications\xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0press@usda.gov\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nUSDA Daily Radio Newsline\r\n\r\nNews Update for January 22 (as of 11:00 AM EST)\r\n\r\nPotential Ag Impacts from Significant Winter System\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nActuality: Post Winter Storm Weather and Storm Recovery\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nConsiderations for Cattle in Cold - Water and Feed\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nActuality: Feed Consideration for Cattle in Extreme Cold\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nThe Daily Radio Newsline Full Lineup will be available starting at 5:30 PM Eastern Time\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*Have a Listen* [ https://www.usda.gov/about-usda/news/radio?f%5B0%5D=radio_news_type%3A7806&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n  \r\n \r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0 \r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*\r\nU.S. Department of Agriculture*\r\n\r\nwww.usda.gov [ https://www.usda.gov/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 Contact us [ https://ask.usda.gov/s/contactsupport?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n\r\ntwitter [ https://www.twitter.com/usda/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]facebook [ https://www.facebook.com/usda/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]instagram [ https://www.instagram.com/usdagov/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]flickr [ https://flickr.com/usdagov?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]youtube [ https://www.youtube.com/usda/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n\r\nBookmark and Share [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USDAOC/bulletins/0?reqfrom=share ]\r\n\r\nManage Subscriptions [ http://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USDAOC/subscribers/new?preferences=true ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 Unsubscribe All [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USDAOC/subscriber/one_click_u