[2026-04-27 10:39:05] Raw text/plain payload: b'NIST  \r\n \r\n\r\nView As Web Page [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USNIST/bulletins/4057ab4 ]\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\nHeader  \r\n \r\n\r\nNIST Cybersecurity and Privacy Program\r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nCall for Comments on NIST SP 800-82, Guide to Operational Technology (OT) Security\r\n\r\nNIST has initiated the process of revising Special Publication (SP) 800-82, "Guide to Operational Technology (OT) Security [ https://gcc02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcsrc.nist.gov%2Fpubs%2Fsp%2F800%2F82%2Fr4%2Fiprd&data=05%7C02%7Coana.ritfeld%40nist.gov%7Cd81fddfda88644b895fe08de5921a2e5%7C2ab5d82fd8fa4797a93e054655c61dec%7C0%7C0%7C639046198153096622%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&sdata=ujcHZEv3ZkGtv2idxwAPZBSfM6RFnEvovkXd%2FzMQLY0%3D&reserved=0 ]", to incorporate lessons learned, align with relevant NIST guidance (e.g.,\xc2\xa0Cybersecurity Framework (CSF) 2.0 [ https://gcc02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnvlpubs.nist.gov%2Fnistpubs%2FCSWP%2FNIST.CSWP.29.pdf&data=05%7C02%7Coana.ritfeld%40nist.gov%7Cd81fddfda88644b895fe08de5921a2e5%7C2ab5d82fd8fa4797a93e054655c61dec%7C0%7C0%7C639046198153113585%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&sdata=%2B9dVPxBya60rIRB0ud%2BTv%2F2kGjyU%2FbCG1V72t0v5qcM%3D&reserved=0 ], NIST IR 8286 Rev. 1 [ https://gcc02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcsrc.nist.gov%2Fpubs%2Fir%2F8286%2Fr1%2Ffinal&data=05%7C02%7Coana.ritfeld%40nist.gov%7Cd81fddfda88644b895fe08de5921a2e5%7C2ab5d82fd8fa4797a93e054655c61dec%7C0%7C0%7C639046198153130482%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&sdata=JAq6qsBdrmyE%2BnWse8qUTSkLH%2B58gIMBeezCKaHkWGE%3D&reserved=0 ],\xc2\xa0NIST SP 800-53 Rev. 5.2.0 [ https://gcc02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcsrc.nist.gov%2Fprojects%2Fcprt%2Fcatalog%23%2Fcprt%2Fframework%2Fversion%2FSP_800_53_5_2_0%2Fhome&data=05%7C02%7Coana.ritfeld%40nist.gov%7Cd81fddfda88644b895fe08de5921a2e5%7C2ab5d82fd8fa4797a93e054655c61dec%7C0%7C0%7C639046198153146793%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&sdata=5PR9%2FRPpMdFniX5Tu8TvA3JE4NCEDBtPzqJaNs1p47s%3D&reserved=0 ]) and OT cybersecurity standards and practices, and address changes in the OT threat landscape.\r\n\r\nNIST invites the public to suggest improvements on the document\xe2\x80\x99s effectiveness, relevance, and general use to better help the OT community understand and manage their cybersecurity risk.\r\n\r\nThe public comment period is open through February 23, 2026. Submit comments to sp800-82rev4@nist.gov with the subject \xe2\x80\x9cComments on SP 800-82.\xe2\x80\x9d\r\n\r\nRead More [ https://csrc.nist.gov/pubs/sp/800/82/r4/iprd ]\r\n \r\n\r\n*NIST Cybersecurity and Privacy Program*\r\nQuestions and comments can be directed to: sp800-82rev4@nist.gov\r\nCSRC Website questions:\xc2\xa0csrc-inquiry@nist.gov\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nConnect with us\r\n facebook [ https://www.facebook.com/NIST ]twitter [ https://twitter.com/NIST ]youtube [ https://www.youtube.com/NIST ]linkedin [ https://www.linkedin.com/company/nist ]flickr [ https://www.instagram.com/nist/ ]  \r\n\r\nReceived this email from a friend? Subscribe here [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USNIST/subscriber/new?topic_id=USNIST_1 ].\r\n\r\n ITL NIST [ https://www.nist.gov/itl ] \r\n\r\nSubscriber services:\r\n\r\nManage Preferences [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USNIST/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 Unsubscribe [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USNIST/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 Help [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/ ]\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\nIf you have questions or problems with the subscription service, please contact subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/ ].\r\nTechnical questions? Contact inquiries@nist.gov. (301) 975-NIST (6478).\r\n\r\nThis service is provided to you at no charge by National Institute of Standards and Technology (NIST).\xc2\xa0100 Bureau Drive, Stop 1070\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7 Gaithersburg, MD 20899\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0301-975-6478\r\n\r\n GovDelivery logo [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/ ] \r\nbody .abe-column-block { min-height: 5px; } table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:10px; margin-right:10px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;} table.govd_hr {min-width: 100%;}\r\n'
