[2026-04-27 10:39:08] Raw text/plain payload: b"SelectUSA News and Updates \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nSelectUSA \r\nApply to Attend the 2026 SelectUSA Investment Summit!\r\n\r\n\xe2\x80\x8b\xe2\x80\x8b\xe2\x80\x8b\xe2\x80\x8b\xe2\x80\x8b\xe2\x80\x8b\xe2\x80\x8bRegistration is now OPEN! Join us for the 2026 SelectUSA Investment Summit happening May 3-6, 2026 in National Harbor, Maryland!\r\n\r\nThe SelectUSA Investment Summit is the\xe2\x80\xafpremier event in the United States for FDI promotion, *learn more and register to attend now [ https://www.selectusasummit.us/ ]*.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\nSelectUSA Stats\r\nYear 1 Investment in America: SelectUSA Announces $139 Billion in FDI Deals\r\n\r\nSince its inception, SelectUSA has facilitated more than $390 Billion in foreign direct investment, supporting more than 265,000 jobs across the United States.\r\n\r\nThe SelectUSA Investment Summit alone has directly generated over $250 BILLION in new U.S. investment projects, supporting more than 125,000 American jobs.\r\n\r\nWe\xe2\x80\x99re proud to have played a key role in helping the United States maintain its position as the world\xe2\x80\x99s leading FDI destination for more than a decade. Thousands of international companies, economic developers, and service providers have leveraged SelectUSA programs to jumpstart business plans in the world\xe2\x80\x99s largest economy.\r\n\r\n*Learn More!* [ https://www.trade.gov/press-release/year-1-investment-america-selectusa-announces-139-billion-fdi-deals ] \r\n \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nWebinar: BEA\xe2\x80\x99s Got Your Number \xe2\x80\x94 An Overview of Foreign Direct Investment Data\r\n\r\n*Date*: Tuesday, January 27\r\n\r\n*Time*: 11-11:30 AM ET\r\n\r\nThe Bureau of Economic Analysis (BEA) will provide an overview of the latest Foreign Direct Investment (FDI) data. This data provides information on the scale of foreign-owned business activities in the United States and the impacts these activities have on the U.S. economy, such as FDI employment by state. Join this webinar to learn about statistics from the 2025 releases that can help stakeholders have a better understanding of the current FDI landscape and make more informed decisions about investing in the United States.\r\n\r\n*Register Now!* [ https://events.gcc.teams.microsoft.com/event/06daffdf-39a1-4a1c-ab51-3bda7cf391ae@a1d183f2-6c7b-4d9a-b994-5f2f31b3f780 ] \r\n \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nSelectUSA Tech Webinar | Unlocking the U.S. Fundraising Landscape for Global Tech Startups\r\n\r\n*Date*: Thursday, January 29\r\n\r\n*Time*: 10-11 AM ET\r\n\r\nExpanding into the U.S. can unlock major opportunities for global tech startups \xe2\x80\x94 but fundraising can work differently depending on where you land.\r\n\r\nJoin venture capital leaders for a live webinar on the U.S. investment landscape, built for international companies preparing to scale. We\xe2\x80\x99ll discuss how to pick the right U.S. tech ecosystem for your business model, how regional investor mindsets shape fundraising, and how emerging AI tools can support smarter market-entry decisions.\r\n\r\n*Register Here!* [ https://events.gcc.teams.microsoft.com/event/62ca3aff-53f6-441b-854f-5638a8afb6a9@a1d183f2-6c7b-4d9a-b994-5f2f31b3f780 ] \r\n \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nApply to Host a Collateral!\r\n\r\nSelectUSA and the U.S. Department of Commerce will highlight investment promotion events surrounding the Investment Summit on the Collateral Events Calendar. Any event held during the Investment Summit in Washington, D.C. and hosted by another group with the support of SelectUSA is considered a SelectUSA Investment Summit Collateral Event. The Collateral Events Calendar can help drive investors to your on-site collateral events, such as receptions, roundtables, and networking sessions.\r\n\r\n*The deadline to submit an Investment Summit Collateral Event application is 5 PM ET on Monday, March 2, 2026*\r\n\r\n*Apply Now!* [ https://www.selectusasummit.us/Applications/Collateral-Event-Application ] \r\n \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nSelectUSA Investment Summit Spinoff Events\r\n\r\nSelectUSA Investment Summit Spinoff Events connect your company to some of the most promising business opportunities in the United States. SelectUSA Spinoffs are events that take place before or after the SelectUSA Investment Summit in different locations across the United States. Explore the full list of 2026 SelectUSA Spinoff Events on our*\xc2\xa0website [ https://www.selectusasummit.us/Programming/Spinoff-Events ]*.\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nIdaho Spinoff \r\nInvest in Idaho: From Potato Chips to Microchips\r\n\r\n*Date*: May 7-9, 2026\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*Registration Deadline*: April 17, 2026\r\n\r\nConnect with leaders from across Idaho through exclusive receptions, targeted networking, and company visits, alongside conversations on incentives and workforce. The Idaho Department of Commerce invites international businesses to forge connections with the right partners and witness the Gem State\xe2\x80\x99s industrial strengths up close.\r\n\r\nLearn more and register *here [ https://www.selectusasummit.us/Programming/Spinoff-Events ].*\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nDC Spinoff \r\nWashington, DC: Your Global Gateway to Innovation\r\n\r\n*Date*: May 7, 2026\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*Registration Deadline*: May 1, 2026\r\n\r\nDiscover the capital\xe2\x80\x99s potential for your enterprise: Hear remarks from local officials, tour the Global Soft Landing Program, and explore talent pipelines from top universities. WDCEP invites international companies of all kinds to a comprehensive session featuring essential resources, expert guidance, and valuable networking opportunities.\r\n\r\nLearn more and register *here [ https://wdcep.com/selectusa-2026-spin-off-rsvp/ ].*\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nCall for speakers \r\nJoin Us as a Speaker at a SelectUSA Event\r\n\r\nSelectUSA continues to accept speaker and topic suggestions to inspire and educate global business leaders and economic developers. Share actionable insights at the highest-profile FDI event in the U.S. from May 3-6, 2026, or contribute to SelectUSA\xe2\x80\x99s year-round webinars and sessions. If you are a U.S. Startup Ecosystem member and have expertise relevant to international tech startups, take a look at our (SelectUSA Tech Programming) and submit a Call for Speakers application [ https://www.selectusasummit.us/Applications/Call-for-Speakers ].\r\n\r\nApplications that were submitted before September 12, 2025 will receive priority consideration for the 2026 Investment Summit and applications submitted after that date will be considered for SelectUSA year-round programming and to fill gaps in the 2026 Investment Summit programming.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nSelectUSA Hosted Events\r\n\r\nWe have many more exciting events for companies, EDOs, service providers, and more in 2026. Be sure to check out our full *calendar of events* [ https://gcc02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Flnks.gd%2Fl%2FeyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJidWxsZXRpbl9saW5rX2lkIjoxMDYsInVyaSI6ImJwMjpjbGljayIsImJ1bGxldGluX2lkIjoiMjAyMjA4MTcuNjIzNzIzMTEiLCJ1cmwiOiJodHRwczovL3d3dy50cmFkZS5nb3Yvc2VsZWN0dXNhLXVwY29taW5nLWV2ZW50cyJ9.ORWNVLtGcDpDY35tIP1uksMJ6vSBJO1y2C1WzwOSWiQ%2Fs%2F693235793%2Fbr%2F142680075531-l&data=05%7C02%7CLauren.westcott%40trade.gov%7C407dbde5372d460ee0b508dc11fa8cf1%7Ca1d183f26c7b4d9ab9945f2f31b3f780%7C1%7C0%7C638405015004667506%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C3000%7C%7C%7C&sdata=EVbPPPK%2B4g3k9R6EGHD2TKbgTUmLo9MByMSdpEkgTvo%3D&reserved=0 ] on our website.\r\n\r\n*Calendar of Events* [ https://www.trade.gov/selectusa-upcoming-events ] \r\n \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nThis Week Online\r\nCluster Mapping\r\n\r\n*LinkedIn [ https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7416875441753481216 ]: *Eager to find the ideal home for your business in America? SelectUSA\xe2\x80\x99s Cluster Mapping now includes county-level data to uncover where industries thrive in the world\xe2\x80\x99s largest economy.\r\n\r\nWe're proud to offer our own free, interactive map of industry clusters in the United States to help guide real-world investment decisions. Our Cluster Mapping dashboard compiles more than a million data points to help global companies identify the states and counties where the industries that fuel their businesses are concentrated.\r\n\r\nTip: Use the Cluster Mapping tool to plan your journey through the Exhibition Hall at the 2026 SelectUSA Investment Summit!\r\n\r\nExplore the dashboard: https://www.trade.gov/data-visualization/cluster-mapping\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nSelect Tech\r\n\r\n*Instagram [ https://www.instagram.com/p/DTf0_F8Ede5/?utm_source=ig_web_copy_link&igsh=MzRlODBiNWFlZA== ]*: Short Pitch, Big Exposure: Global tech startups, apply for an exciting platform to gain visibility at the 2026 #SelectUSASummit!\r\n\r\nShow off your innovation to an audience that could include venture capitalists, investors, ecosystem leaders, and industry experts. Present on an international stage with a six-minute pitch, get feedback from judges, and open doors to new partnerships.\r\n\r\n\xe2\x80\x9cWe made valuable connections with investors, partners, and fellow innovators. The event was well-organized, energizing, and gave us clear insights into expanding into the U.S. market.\xe2\x80\x9d \xe2\x80\x94 SelectUSA Tech pitching participant\r\n\r\nPut your business on the map! https://www.selectusasummit.us/Programming/SelectUSA-Tech\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n  \r\n \r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\nBookmark and Share [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USITATRADE/bulletins/4053ada?reqfrom=share ]\r\n\r\nLogo [ http://selectusa.gov ] Questions?\r\nContact Us [ https://www.selectusa.gov/contact-us ]  \r\n\r\nSTAY CONNECTED: Visit us on X [ http://twitter.com/tradegov ] \xc2\xa0 @SelectUSA [ https://twitter.com/SelectUSA ]  Connect with us on LinkedIn [ https://www.linkedin.com/company/international-trade-administration ] \xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0SelectUSA on LinkedIn [ https://www.linkedin.com/company/selectusa ]  \r\n\r\nSUBSCRIBER SERVICES:\r\nManage Preferences [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USITATRADE/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ]\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0Help <support@govdelivery.com>\r\n\r\nThis message was sent to you from *SelectUSA *within the U.S. Department of Commerce's *International Trade Administration*.\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nTo unsubscribe or update your subscriptions, please visit the\xc2\xa0User Profile Page [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USITATRADE/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ].\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nFind out how the United States is *supporting foreign direct investors* on the federal, state, and local level at SelectUSA.gov [ http://selectusa.gov ].\r\n\r\nP.S. If you have any questions or problems, please visit subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com ] for assistance.\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\nThis email was sent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com using GovDelivery Communications Cloud on behalf of the International Trade Administration\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7 1401 Constitution Avenue NW \xc2\xb7 Washington, DC 20230 GovDelivery logo [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/ ] \r\nbody .abe-column-block { min-height: 5px; } table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:10px; margin-right:10px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;} table.govd_hr {min-width: 100%;}\r\n"
