[2026-04-27 10:39:15] Raw text/plain payload: b'View as a webpage\xc2\xa0 /\xc2\xa0 Share [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USDAOC/bulletins/4059b4e ]\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nHeader-Hybrid \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nOffice of Communications\xc2\xa0 |\xc2\xa0 press@usda.gov\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nUSDA Launches New Online Portal for Reporting Foreign-Owned Agricultural Land\xc2\xa0Transactions\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\n*(Washington, D.C., January 22, 2026)* \xe2\x80\x93 The U.S. Department of Agriculture (USDA) is launching a new online portal [ https://afida.landmark.usda.gov/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] to streamline reporting of transactions involving U.S. agricultural land by foreign persons, which can include businesses and governments, under the Agricultural Foreign Investment Disclosure Act of 1978 (AFIDA). The new online portal is part of a broader effort to strengthen enforcement and protect American farmland as USDA continues its implementation of the National Farm Security Action Plan [ https://www.usda.gov/sites/default/files/documents/farm-security-nat-sec.pdf?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] (PDF, 1.2 MB).\r\n\r\n\xe2\x80\x9cPresident Trump is putting America First, and this includes increasing transparency and scrutiny of one of our most valuable national assets, American farmland. We are working to improve reporting of foreign owned land in the United States. This move to streamline the reporting portal will increase compliance and assist our efforts to effectively enforce accurate reporting of interests held by foreign adversaries in U.S. farmland,\xe2\x80\x9d *said Secretary Brooke Rollins*.\xe2\x80\xaf\xe2\x80\x9cThe online portal will allow us to obtain verifiable information about foreign interests in American agricultural land and protect the security of our farmers.\xe2\x80\x9d\r\n\r\nThe new online portal is available at afida.landmark.usda.gov [ https://afida.landmark.usda.gov/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]. Users can access the portal with Login.gov, a sign in service that provides secure online access to participate in certain government programs and reporting requirements.\r\n\r\nThe new digital portal will gather the same information found on the current form FSA-153 and those subject to filing may still file using the current FSA-153 hard copy form if desired. However, filers should not duplicate filings by using both submission options.\r\n\r\n*About the National Farm Security Action Plan*\r\n\r\nOne of the key tenets of USDA\xe2\x80\x99s National Farm Security Action Plan [ https://www.usda.gov/sites/default/files/documents/farm-security-nat-sec.pdf?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] (PDF, 1.2 MB) is strengthening processes around disclosure of foreign persons who have an interest in U.S. farmland. This historic plan, announced in July 2025, calls for aggressive implementation of reforms to the AFIDA process including improved verification and monitoring of collected AFIDA data. In addition to the new portal, USDA published an Advanced Notice of Proposed Rulemaking [ https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2025-12-29/pdf/2025-23830.pdf?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] for AFIDA in December 2025.\r\n\r\n*About AFIDA*\r\n\r\nThe new portal is part of USDA\xe2\x80\x99s efforts to streamline its process for electronic submission and retention of AFIDA disclosures, as initially required by the Consolidated Appropriations Act, 2023. Today USDA also shared its annual AFIDA report [ https://www.fsa.usda.gov/documents/foreign-holdings-us-agricultural-land?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] for 2024 with Congress, which is available online. The report lists foreign holdings of U.S. agricultural land as 46 million acres, as of December 31, 2024 and includes a section on land held and acquired by China, Russia, Iran, and North Korea in recent years.\r\n\r\nAFIDA became law in 1978, and its regulations were created to establish a nationwide system for the collection of information pertaining to foreign ownership of U.S. agricultural land. The regulations require foreign investors who acquire, transfer or hold an interest in U.S. agricultural land to report such holdings and transactions to the Secretary of Agriculture.\r\n\r\nThe data obtained from AFIDA disclosures are used in the preparation of an annual report to Congress, which is published online [ https://www.fsa.usda.gov/resources/economic-policy-analysis/afida?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ].\r\n\r\nThe AFIDA regulations define the term \xe2\x80\x9cforeign person\xe2\x80\x9d and specifies the information that must be included in the report. AFIDA focuses on foreign persons who hold direct or indirect interest in the agricultural land, provided those foreign persons with an indirect interest have \xe2\x80\x9csignificant interest or substantial control\xe2\x80\x9d in the direct interest holder.\r\n\r\n###\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n  \r\n \r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0 \r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*\r\nU.S. Department of Agriculture*\r\n\r\nwww.usda.gov [ https://www.usda.gov/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 Contact us [ https://ask.usda.gov/s/contactsupport?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n\r\ntwitter [ https://www.twitter.com/usda/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]facebook [ https://www.facebook.com/usda/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]instagram [ https://www.instagram.com/usdagov/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]flickr [ https://flickr.com/usdagov?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]youtube [ https://www.youtube.com/usda/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n\r\nBookmark and Share [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USDAOC/bulletins/0?reqfrom=share ]\r\n\r\nManage Subscriptions [ http://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USDAOC/subscribers/new?preferences=true ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 Unsubscribe All [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USDAOC/subscriber/one_click_unsubscribe?verification=5.b0b9ffc01626a62fade26e4ffc0836cd&destination=jasonnorman66994%40gmail.com ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 Help [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/ ]\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \xc2\xa0 \r\n \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n This email was sent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com using govDelivery on behalf of: USDA Office of Communications \xc2\xb7 1400 Independence Ave., S.W. \xc2\xb7 Washington, DC 20250  GovDelivery logo  [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\nbody .abe-column-block { min-height: 5px; } table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:10px; margin-right:10px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;} table.govd_hr {min-width: 100%;}\r\n'
