[2026-04-27 10:39:20] Raw text/plain payload: b'Firm has identified packaging failures related to MediHoney Wound and Burn Products That Could Lead To a Breach in Sterile Barrier  \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nIf your email program has trouble displaying this email, view as a webpage [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/bulletins/4054746 ].\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nMedWatch Banner \r\n\r\nBookmark and Share [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/bulletins/4054746?reqfrom=share ]\r\n\r\nEarly Alert: Wound, Burn Dressing Issue from Integra LifeSciences\r\n\r\nThe FDA is aware that Integra LifeSciences has identified packaging failures related to all MediHoney Wound and Burn products and certain lots of CVS Wound Gel that could lead to a breach in the sterile barrier. Using products with a breached sterile barrier could lead to patient infection. The inability to use the device due to packaging failures may delay care. \r\n\r\nAs of December 19, 2025, Integra LifeSciences has reported 11 serious injuries related to MediHoney Wound and Burn products, three serious injuries related to CVS Wound Gel products, and no deaths associated with this issue.\r\n\r\n*Read More* [ https://www.fda.gov/medical-devices/medical-device-recalls-and-early-alerts/early-alert-wound-and-burn-dressing-issue-integra-lifesciences?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n\r\n*"CDRH is issuing this Early Alert [ https://www.fda.gov/medical-devices/medical-device-recalls-and-early-alerts/what-early-alert?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] to notify the public of a potentially high-risk device issue. "*"The FDA will keep the public informed and update this web page as significant new information becomes available."\r\n\r\n*Questions?*\r\n\r\nCustomers in the U.S. with adverse reactions, quality problems, or questions about this recall should contact Integra at 1-800-654-2873 or custsvcnj@integralife.com.\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n*Follow us on X at @FDAMedWatch [ https://twitter.com/FDAMedWatch?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]*\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n  \r\n \r\n\r\nfeed [ https://www.fda.gov/about-fda/contact-fda/subscribe-podcasts-and-news-feeds?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]twitter [ https://www.twitter.com/US_FDA?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]facebook [ https://www.facebook.com/FDA?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]Instagram [ https://www.instagram.com/FDA?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]youtube [ https://www.youtube.com/user/USFoodandDrugAdmin?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]flickr [ https://www.flickr.com/photos/fdaphotos/albums/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]  \r\n\r\n*Manage Subscriptions* [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 *Unsubscribe All* [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/subscriber/one_click_unsubscribe?verification=5.ee0243ee8741fe358146537aecf40e1e&destination=jasonnorman66994%40gmail.com ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 *Help* [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/ ]\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\nbody .abe-column-block {min-height: 5px;} td {line-height:1;} \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n This email was sent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com using GovDelivery Communications Cloud on behalf of: U.S. Food and Drug Administration \xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0\r\n10903 New Hampshire Ave\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0Silver Spring, MD \xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0 20993-0002\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa01-888-INFO-FDA GovDelivery logo [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\nbody .abe-column-block { min-height: 5px; } table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:10px; margin-right:10px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;}\r\n'
