[2026-04-27 10:39:26] Raw text/plain payload: b'US Food and Drug Administration \r\nOutbreak Investigations & Safety Advisories\r\n\r\n*FDA Human Foods Program*\r\n\r\nThe following is an update from FDA of concern to our subscribers.\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nCORE Outbreak Investigation Table\r\n\r\nThe CORE Outbreak Investigation Table is a list of outbreak and adverse event investigations primarily being managed by FDA\xe2\x80\x99s CORE Response Teams [ https://www.fda.gov/food/outbreaks-foodborne-illness/about-core-network?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]. The investigations are in a variety of stages, meaning that some outbreaks have limited information, and others may be near completion. The table will be updated weekly.\r\n\r\n*This week\'s updates are: *\r\n\r\n\r\n  * For the outbreak of "Salmonella" Typhimurium (ref #1358) linked to dietary supplements, FDA has issued an advisory. Consumers should not eat, sell, or serve certain Live it Up-brand Super Greens dietary supplement powder. More information about the products is included on the advisory [ https://www.fda.gov/food/outbreaks-foodborne-illness/outbreak-investigation-salmonella-dietary-supplement-january-2026?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ].\xc2\xa0 FDA has initiated traceback and an inspection. \r\n  * For the outbreak of "Salmonella "Saintpaul (ref #1353) the outbreak is over. \r\n  * For the outbreak of "Salmonella "Africana (ref #1351) the outbreak is over. \r\n  * For the outbreak of "Salmonella" Richmond (ref #1345) linked to moringa leaf powder, FDA\xe2\x80\x99s outbreak investigation is complete. This outbreak is over. \r\n  * For the outbreak of "Listeria monocytogenes "(ref #1309) the outbreak is over. \r\n\r\nCORE Outbreak Investigation Table [ https://www.fda.gov/food/outbreaks-foodborne-illness/investigations-foodborne-illness-outbreaks?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n\r\n \r\n_________