[2026-04-27 10:39:46] Raw text/plain payload: b'Top stories for Jason\r\n\r\n-----\r\n\r\nQuestion: I cheated on my husband, he wants a divorce. I want more than anything for us to work on our marriage through marriage counseling. We have been together for 17 years. What should I do?\r\n\r\n\r\nAnswer from Kim Kelley\r\n\r\n\r\nDo whatever your husband wants. If he wants a divorce, sign the papers and go away. What did you think was going to happen. I\xe2\x80\x99ve been married 35 years and we\xe2\x80\x99ve had our pr \r\nRead More: https://www.quora.com/qemail/tc?al_imp=eyJ0eXBlIjogMzMsICJoYXNoIjogIjEzMTk0ODc2MTY0MTA0NjY0Mjh8MXwxfDE0Nzc3NDM2OTUwODgyMzYifQ%3D%3D&al_pri=8&aoid=MVzFTKsxQ6F&aoty=1&aty=4&cp=1&et=2&id=ed8e05e5a20b4389a6828d0b3ecf4884&uid=FMv7T9N2AvY\r\n-----\r\nQuestion: How much marijuana will shorten a typical user\'s life?\r\n\r\n\r\nAnswer from Brad Nation\r\n\r\n\r\nThis is common. People like to conflate marijuana and alcohol and therefore ask questions that they think pertain to both. Alcohol is a mild poison. The byproducts produce \r\nRead More: https://www.quora.com/qemail/tc?al_imp=eyJ0eXBlIjogMzMsICJoYXNoIjogIjEzMTk0ODc2MTY0MTA0NjY0Mjh8MnwxfDE0Nzc3NDM4Njg5ODA3MDIifQ%3D%3D&al_pri=8&aoid=oFJylkPXnyS&aoty=1&aty=4&cp=2&et=2&id=ed8e05e5a20b4389a6828d0b3ecf4884&uid=FMv7T9N2AvY\r\n-----\r\n\r\n\r\nI\'m in love with this app but it\'s really hurting \xf0\x9f\x92\x94 my first account got banned and my second account this is my third account I was only trying to be friendly in the comments section but it seems to ...\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nRead More: https://www.quora.com/qemail/tc?al_imp=eyJ0eXBlIjogMzMsICJoYXNoIjogIjEzMTk0ODc2MTY0MTA0NjY0Mjh8M3wxMHwyNDEwMDU4OTMifQ%3D%3D&al_pri=8&aoid=zgTn0xV2dgq&aoty=4&aty=4&cp=3&et=2&id=ed8e05e5a20b4389a6828d0b3ecf4884&uid=FMv7T9N2AvY\r\n\r\n-----\r\nQuestion: At 39, I have been terminated by Wipro. What to do now?\r\n\r\n\r\nAnswer from SearchingLifesPurpose\r\n\r\n\r\nI am in same boat as you.\r\n\r\nI worked for 15 years