[2026-04-27 10:40:03] Raw text/plain payload: b'The approvals listed below may not be comprehensive. For the most current information, view the full listing of all approvals at Drugs@FDA [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=reportsSearch.process&rptName=1&reportSelectMonth=11&reportSelectYear=2025&nav ].\r\n\r\n*What\'s New Related to Drugs*\r\n\r\n*Updated Monday through Friday*\r\n\r\n\r\n  * Current and Resolved Drug Shortages and Discontinuations Reported to FDA [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/drugshortages/#tab4 ] \r\n  * Drug Firm Annual Registration Status [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/drls/default.cfm?utm_medium=&utm_source= ] \r\n  * Drug Firm Annual Registration Status Download File [ https://www.fda.gov/drugs/drug-approvals-and-databases/drug-establishments-current-registration-site?utm_medium=&utm_source= ] \r\n  * National Drug Code Directory [ https://www.fda.gov/drugs/drug-approvals-and-databases/national-drug-code-directory?utm_medium=&utm_source= ] \r\n  * NDC Unfinished Drugs Excluded Database File [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/cder/NDC_unfinished_excluded.zip?utm_medium=&utm_source= ] \r\n  * NDC Database Excluded Packages and Products [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/cder/ndc_excluded.zip?utm_medium=&utm_source= ] \r\n  * Wholesale Distributor and Third-Party Logistics Providers Reporting [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/wdd3plreporting/ ] \r\n  * Drug Establishments Current Registration Site [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/drls/ ] \r\n  * Drugs@FDA Data Files [ https://www.fda.gov/drugs/drug-approvals-and-databases/drugsfda-data-files ]\xc2\xa0 \r\n\r\n*Updated Biweekly*\r\n\r\n  * Competitive Generic Therapy Approvals [ https://www.fda.gov/drugs/generic-drugs/competitive-generic-therapy-approvals ] \r\n\r\n*January 21, 2026*\r\n\r\n\r\n  * Drug Trials Snapshots KYGEVVI [ https://www.fda.gov/drugs/drug-approvals-and-databases/drug-trials-snapshots-kygevvi ] \r\n  * FDA Announces PreCheck Implementation Roadmap [ https://www.fda.gov/drugs/drug-safety-and-availability/fda-announces-precheck-implementation-roadmap ] \r\n\r\n*January 20, 2026*\r\n\r\n\r\n  * Draft Guidance:\xc2\xa0M4Q(R2) The Common Technical Document for the Registration of Pharmaceuticals for Human Use: Quality [ https://www.fda.gov/regulatory-information/search-fda-guidance-documents/m4qr2-common-technical-document-registration-pharmaceuticals-human-use-quality ] \r\n\r\nThis report displays final approvals and tentative approvals of original and supplemental applications for the two days beginning on the earliest date listed below. Some approvals may be added to the Drugs@FDA database after this time span. For comprehensive approval reports, please use the monthly "All Approvals [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=reportsSearch.process&nav=&reportSelectMonth=9&reportSelectYear=2020&rptName=1&utm_medium=&utm_source=#navigation ]" report on Drugs@FDA.\r\n\r\nJanuary 22, 2026\r\n\r\nDrug Name and\r\nApplication Number Active Ingredient Dosage Form/ Route Submission Company Submission Classification Submission Status Estradiol\r\nANDA #040275 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=040275 ] Estradiol Tablet; Oral SUPPL-14 Epic Pharma Llc Labeling Approved Estradiol\r\nANDA #040275 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=040275 ] Estradiol Tablet; Oral SUPPL-14 Epic Pharma Llc Labeling Approved Estradiol\r\nANDA #040275 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=040275 ] Estradiol Tablet; Oral SUPPL-14 Epic Pharma Llc Labeling Approved Acyclovir\r\nANDA #075677 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=075677 ] Acyclovir Capsule; Oral SUPPL-12 Apotex Labeling Approved Acyclovir\r\nANDA #075677 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=075677 ] Acyclovir Capsule; Oral SUPPL-12 Apotex Labeling Approved Ketorolac Tromethamine\r\nANDA #076109 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=076109 ] Ketorolac Tromethamine Solution/Drops; Ophthalmic SUPPL-19 Apotex Labeling Approved Ketorolac Tromethamine\r\nANDA #076109 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=076109 ] Ketorolac Tromethamine Solution/Drops; Ophthalmic SUPPL-19 Apotex Labeling Approved Zilbrysq\r\nNDA #216834 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=216834 ] Zilucoplan Sodium Solution; Subcutaneous SUPPL-13 Ucb Inc Labeling Approved Zilbrysq\r\nNDA #216834 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=216834 ] Zilucoplan Sodium Solution; Subcutaneous SUPPL-13 Ucb Inc Labeling Approved \r\n\r\nJanuary 21, 2026\r\n\r\nDrug Name and\r\nApplication Number Active Ingredient Dosage Form/ Route Submission Company Submission Classification Submission Status Fenofibrate\r\nANDA #210379 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=210379 ] Fenofibrate Tablet; Oral ORIG-1 Macleods Pharms Ltd \xc2\xa0 Approved Evrysdi\r\nNDA #213535 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=213535 ] Risdiplam For Solution; Oral SUPPL-15 Genentech Inc Labeling Approved Evrysdi\r\nNDA #213535 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=213535 ] Risdiplam For Solution; Oral SUPPL-16 Genentech Inc Labeling Approved Verquvo\r\nNDA #214377 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=214377 ] Vericiguat Tablet; Oral SUPPL-5 Msd Efficacy Approved Valbenazine Tosylate\r\nANDA #215984 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=215984 ] Valbenazine Tosylate Capsule; Oral ORIG-1 Teva Pharms Inc \xc2\xa0 Tentative Approval Bisoprolol Fumarate and Hydrochlorothiazide\r\nANDA #217922 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=217922 ] Bisoprolol Fumarate; Hydrochlorothiazide Tablet; Oral ORIG-1 Aurobindo Pharma Ltd \xc2\xa0 Approved Evrysdi\r\nNDA #219285 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=219285 ] Risdiplam Tablet; Oral SUPPL-1 Genentech Inc Labeling Approved Micafungin Sodium\r\nANDA #219712 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=219712 ] Micafungin Sodium Injectable; Intravenous ORIG-1 Hisun Pharm Hangzhou \xc2\xa0 Approved Buprenorphine Hydrochloride and Naloxone Hydrochloride\r\nANDA #219850 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=219850 ] Buprenorphine Hydrochloride; Naloxone Hydrochloride Film; Buccal, Sublingual ORIG-1 Ascent Pharms Inc \xc2\xa0 Approved Lacosamide\r\nANDA #220268 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=220268 ] Lacosamide Solution; Intravenous ORIG-1 Anthea Pharma \xc2\xa0 Approved Avtozma\r\nBLA #761498 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=761498 ] Tocilizumab-Anoh Injectable; Iv (Infusion) ORIG-1 Celltrion Inc Type 5 - New Formulation or New Manufacturer Approved Avtozma\r\nBLA #761498 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=761498 ] Tocilizumab-Anoh Injectable; Subcutaneous ORIG-1 Celltrion Inc Type 5 - New Formulation or New Manufacturer Approved \r\n\r\nfeed [ https://www.fda.gov/about-fda/contact-fda/subscribe-podcasts-and-news-feeds?utm_medium=&utm_source= ]twitter [ https://www.twitter.com/US_FDA?utm_medium=&utm_source= ]facebook [ https://www.facebook.com/FDA?utm_medium=&utm_source= ]youtube [ https://www.youtube.com/user/USFoodandDrugAdmin?utm_medium=&utm_source= ]flickr [ https://www.flickr.com/photos/fdaphotos/albums/?utm_medium=&utm_source= ]  \r\n\r\n*Manage Subscriptions* [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 *Unsubscribe All* [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/subscriber/one_click_unsubscribe?verification=5.ee0243ee8741fe358146537aecf40e1e&destination=jasonnorman66994%40gmail.com ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 *Help* [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/ ]\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\nbody .abe-column-block {min-height: 5px;} td {line-height:1;} \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n This email was sent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com using GovDelivery Communications Cloud on behalf of: U.S. Food and Drug Administration \xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0\r\n10903 New Hampshire Ave\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0Silver Spring, MD \xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0 20993-0002\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa01-888-INFO-FDA GovDelivery logo [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/ ] \r\n \r\nbody .abe-column-block { min-height: 5px; } table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:10px; margin-right:10px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;}\r\n'
