[2026-04-27 10:40:09] Raw text/plain payload: b"Dear Filers, Brokers, and Importers,\r\n\r\nThe U.S. Food and Drug Administration's Office of Import Operations have implemented the FDA ImportShield Program (FISP) to address increasing import volumes driven by e-commerce growth, trade volume increases, and supply chain complexities.\r\n\r\n*Program Overview*\r\n\r\nThe FDA ImportShield Program consolidates five separate regional inspection teams into one centralized, nationwide system that operates more efficiently and consistently across all U.S. ports of entry. This approach ensures standardized enforcement of FDA regulations while leveraging advanced technologies to better protect Americans from unsafe imported products.\r\n\r\n*What has changed *\r\n\r\nThe FDA ImportShield Program has transitioned from port-by-port reviews to a national-based system that will:\r\n\r\n\r\n  * Conduct entry admissibility reviews nationally instead of at individual ports \r\n  * Utilize staff across multiple time zones for expanded coverage \r\n  * Explore automation opportunities to streamline processes \r\n  * Optimize resource allocation to focus on higher-risk products \r\n\r\n*What is NOT Changing*\r\n\r\n\r\n  * Review processes and standards remain unchanged \r\n  * Review criteria and evaluation methods continue as before \r\n  * Public health protection remains our top priority \r\n  * This is an internal operational enhancement\xe2\x80\x94there are no changes to trade entry submission processes \r\n\r\n*Process Flow*\r\n\r\nOnce FDA receives entry data, it is initially reviewed by the FDA ImportShield Program. If additional review or examination is required, the entry data will be forwarded to the local FDA Import Office for further evaluation.\r\n\r\nTrade should continue to use ITACS (https://itacs.fda.gov) as the primary means to check shipment status, upload entry documents, and provide locations for examination.\r\n\r\n*CRITICAL: New Communication Protocols Effective August 4, 2025*\r\n\r\nThe FDA ImportShield Program provides specific contact protocols with designated email addresses and phone numbers for different types of requests. When contacting the FDA ImportShield inquiry team, users must follow specific email formatting guidelines including entry numbers, commodity types, and port codes in the subject line. To avoid duplication of efforts and unnecessary follow-up, industry users should use only one method of communication and wait for a response from the Entry Review Team before reaching out through additional inquiry methods.\r\n\r\nFor detailed procedures regarding urgent shipments and additional contact protocols, please refer to the FDA ImportShield Trade Communications Guide which can be found by visiting our Imports Entry Review page Entry Review | FDA [ https://www.fda.gov/industry/fda-import-process/entry-review?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] to access the FDA ImportShield Trade Communications Guide. [ https://www.fda.gov/media/187855/download?attachment=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n\r\nThank you for your cooperation as we implement this enhanced system to better protect public health.\r\n\r\nFDA ImportShield Team\r\nOffice of Import Operations\r\nFDAImportShield@fda.hhs.gov\r\n\r\nfeed [ https://www.fda.gov/about-fda/contact-fda/subscribe-podcasts-and-news-feeds?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]twitter [ https://www.twitter.com/US_FDA?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]facebook [ https://www.facebook.com/FDA?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]Instagram [ https://www.instagram.com/FDA?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]youtube [ https://www.youtube.com/user/USFoodandDrugAdmin?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]flickr [ https://www.flickr.com/photos/fdaphotos/albums/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]  \r\n\r\n*Manage Subscriptions* [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 *Unsubscribe All* [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/subscriber/one_click_unsubscribe?verification=5.ee0243ee8741fe358146537aecf40e1e&destination=jasonnorman66994%40gmail.com ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 *Help* [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/ ]\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\nbody .abe-column-block {min-height: 5px;} td {line-height:1;} \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n This email was sent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com using GovDelivery Communications Cloud on behalf of: U.S. Food and Drug Administration \xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0\r\n10903 New Hampshire Ave\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0Silver Spring, MD \xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0 20993-0002\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa01-888-INFO-FDA GovDelivery logo [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\nbody .abe-column-block { min-height: 5px; } table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:10px; margin-right:10px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;}\r\n"
