[2026-04-27 10:40:13] Raw text/plain payload: b'We want your feedback!  \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nNIST  \r\n \r\n\r\nView As Web Page [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USNIST/bulletins/4059fb9 ]\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\nHeader  \r\n \r\n\r\nNational Cybersecurity Center of Excellence\r\n \r\n \r\nComments Due January 30! NIST Cyber AI Profile\r\nSubmit Your Feedback Before Time Runs Out! NIST Cyber AI Profile\r\n\r\nLast month, the NIST NCCoE released the preliminary draft NIST IR 8596, Cybersecurity Framework Profile for Artificial Intelligence (Cyber AI Profile) [ https://www.nccoe.nist.gov/projects/cyber-ai-profile#project-promo ]. This profile is open for comments until *January 30, 2026*. Submit your feedback before time runs out!\r\n\r\n*Draft for Public Comment*\r\n\r\nAI has become a driving force behind today\xe2\x80\x99s technological development, transforming industries and redefining how society operates. Advancements in AI technology introduce both cybersecurity opportunities and challenges to organizations.\r\n\r\nNIST\xe2\x80\x99s preliminary draft Cyber AI Profile is intended to help organizations strategically adopt AI while addressing and prioritizing cybersecurity risks stemming from its advancements.\r\n\r\nThe Cyber AI Profile addresses the following Focus Areas:\r\n\r\n\r\n  * Securing AI System Components (Secure) \r\n  * Conducting AI-Enabled Cyber Defense (Defend) \r\n  * Thwarting AI-Enabled Cyber Attacks (Thwart) \r\n\r\nThank you to those of you who participated in last week\xe2\x80\x99s Cyber AI Workshop #2 [ https://www.nccoe.nist.gov/get-involved/attend-events/cyber-ai-workshop-2 ] and who have sent us comments already! The insights shared so far have been invaluable. We look forward to receiving additional comments on this publication.\r\n\r\nTo download the draft and submit comments, visit the NCCoE project page [ https://www.nccoe.nist.gov/projects/cyber-ai-profile ].\r\n\r\nComment Now! [ https://www.nccoe.nist.gov/projects/cyber-ai-profile#project-promo ]\r\n\r\nNIST Cybersecurity and Privacy Program\r\nQuestions/Comments about this notice: cyberaiprofile@nist.gov\r\nNCCoE Website questions: nccoe@nist.gov\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nConnect with us\r\n facebook [ https://www.facebook.com/NIST ]twitter [ https://twitter.com/NIST ]youtube [ https://www.youtube.com/NIST ]linkedin [ https://www.linkedin.com/company/nist ]flickr [ https://www.instagram.com/nist/ ]  \r\n\r\nReceived this email from a friend? Subscribe here [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USNIST/subscriber/new?topic_id=USNIST_1 ].\r\n\r\n ITL NIST [ https://www.nist.gov/itl ] \r\n\r\nSubscriber services:\r\n\r\nManage Preferences [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USNIST/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 Unsubscribe [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USNIST/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 Help [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/ ]\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\nIf you have questions or problems with the subscription service, please contact subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/ ].\r\nTechnical questions? Contact inquiries@nist.gov. (301) 975-NIST (6478).\r\n\r\nThis service is provided to you at no charge by National Institute of Standards and Technology (NIST).\xc2\xa0100 Bureau Drive, Stop 1070\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7 Gaithersburg, MD 20899\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0301-975-6478\r\n\r\n GovDelivery logo [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/ ] \r\nbody .abe-column-block { min-height: 5px; } table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:10px; margin-right:10px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;} table.govd_hr {min-width: 100%;}\r\n'
