[2026-04-27 10:40:24] Raw text/plain payload: b'If your email program has trouble displaying this email, view as a webpage [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/bulletins/405c7a4 ].\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nUS Food and Drug Administration\r\n\r\nDear Cosmetics Industry Stakeholder,\r\n\r\nThe U.S. Food and Drug Administration (FDA) is writing to inform you of an important opportunity to provide input on a new draft guidance document that may affect your operations due to the Modernization of Cosmetics Regulation Act of 2022 (MoCRA).\r\n\r\nNew Draft Guidance Available for Comment\r\n\r\nFDA has released a draft guidance entitled "FDA Records Access Authority for Cosmetics: Guidance for Industry," which clarifies the agency\'s authorities to access records related to cosmetic products added by MoCRA. This guidance addresses frequently asked questions about record access provisions and provides FDA\'s current thinking on their implementation.\r\n\r\nKey Areas Covered in the Draft Guidance\r\n\r\nThe guidance provides clarity on three critical areas established by MoCRA:\r\n\r\n*Adverse Event Records Access (Section 605)*\xc2\xa0- FDA\'s authority to access adverse event records during inspections, including communications, assessments, and reports related to adverse events.\r\n\r\n*Records Access for Serious Health Threats (Section 610)*\xc2\xa0- FDA\'s authority to access various records when there is reasonable belief that a cosmetic product is likely to be adulterated such that the use or exposure to such product presents a threat of serious adverse health consequences or death (SAHCOD) to humans, including manufacturing records, distribution records, analytical results, and safety substantiation records.\r\n\r\n*Enhanced Inspection Authority (Section 704(a)(1))*\xc2\xa0- FDA\xe2\x80\x99s extended inspectional authority over records from facilities that manufacture or process cosmetic products.\r\n\r\nWhat This Means for Your Business\r\n\r\nThis guidance will help you understand:\r\n\r\n\r\n  * Which entities are subject to record access requirements \r\n  * When FDA may exercise these authorities \r\n  * Record retention requirements (6 years for adverse event records, or 3 years for qualifying small businesses) \r\n  * How FDA will protect confidential information \r\n  * Potential consequences of refusing record access to FDA \r\n\r\nYour Input is Important\r\n\r\nFDA values stakeholder input and encourages you to review and comment on this draft guidance. Your feedback will help ensure the final guidance is practical, clear, and supports both public health protection and industry compliance.\r\n\r\n*Comment Deadline:*\xc2\xa0Comments must be submitted within 60 days of publication in the Federal Register.\r\n\r\nHow to Submit Comments\r\n\r\n*Electronic Submissions:*\xc2\xa0Visit https://www.regulations.gov and search for the docket number listed in the Federal Register notice.\r\n\r\n*Written Submissions:*\xc2\xa0Mail to Dockets Management Staff (HFA-305), Food and Drug Administration, 5630 Fishers Lane, Rm. 1061, Rockville, MD 20852.\r\n\r\nAccess the Draft Guidance\r\n\r\nThe draft guidance is available at:\r\n\r\n\r\n  * https://www.fda.gov/regulatory-information/search-fda-guidance-documents [ https://www.fda.gov/regulatory-information/search-fda-guidance-documents?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n  * https://www.regulations.gov [ https://www.regulations.gov/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n  * Modernization of Cosmetics Regulation Act of 2022 (MoCRA) | FDA [ https://www.fda.gov/cosmetics/cosmetics-laws-regulations/modernization-cosmetics-regulation-act-2022-mocra?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nAdditional Resources\r\n\r\nFor comprehensive information about requirements added by MoCRA, visit our cosmetics regulation webpage [ https://www.fda.gov/cosmetics?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ], which includes resources on facility registration, product listing, and adverse event reporting.\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nQuestions?\r\n\r\nIf you have questions about this draft guidance, please contact:\r\n\r\n\r\n  * *Draft Guidance Questions:*\xc2\xa0OIIPolicyStaffs@fda.hhs.gov \r\n  * *General Registration/Listing Questions:*\xc2\xa0eRLC@fda.hhs.gov \r\n  * *Cosmetics Direct Technical Support:*\xc2\xa0cosmeticsdirect@fda.hhs.gov \r\n  * *For Questions on Cosmetics contact **Food and Cosmetic Information Center (FCIC): *https://www.fda.gov/food/resources-you-food/get-assistance-fda-human-foods-program-hfp [ https://www.fda.gov/food/resources-you-food/get-assistance-fda-human-foods-program-hfp?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n\r\nBookmark and Share [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/bulletins/405c7a4?reqfrom=share ]\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n  \r\n \r\n\r\nfeed [ https://www.fda.gov/about-fda/contact-fda/subscribe-podcasts-and-news-feeds?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]twitter [ https://www.twitter.com/US_FDA?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]facebook [ https://www.facebook.com/FDA?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]Instagram [ https://www.instagram.com/FDA?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]youtube [ https://www.youtube.com/user/USFoodandDrugAdmin?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]flickr [ https://www.flickr.com/photos/fdaphotos/albums/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]  \r\n\r\n*Manage Subscriptions* [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 *Unsubscribe All* [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/subscriber/one_click_unsubscribe?verification=5.ee0243ee8741fe358146537aecf40e1e&destination=jasonnorman66994%40gmail.com ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 *Help* [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/ ]\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\nbody .abe-column-block {min-height: 5px;} td {line-height:1;} \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n This email was sent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com using GovDelivery Communications Cloud on behalf of: U.S. Food and Drug Administration \xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0\r\n10903 New Hampshire Ave\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0Silver Spring, MD \xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0 20993-0002\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa01-888-INFO-FDA GovDelivery logo [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\nbody .abe-column-block { min-height: 5px; } table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:10px; margin-right:10px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;}\r\n'
