eyword  \r\nhttps://blog.google/?utm_source=kw-newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=01232026\r\nhttps://blog.google/?utm_source=kw-newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=01232026\r\n\r\nhttps://blog.google/products-and-platforms/products/search/personal-intelligence-ai-mode-search/?utm_source=kw-newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=01232026&utm_content=image\r\nHelp in Search that's uniquely yours\r\n\r\nWe're making the search experience even more helpful by bringing Personal  \r\nIntelligence to AI Mode. Now, thanks\r\nto Gemini 3, Google AI Pro and Ultra subscribers can choose to connect  \r\nGmail and Google Photos to enable more\r\nintuitive, tailored responses. By integrating your personal context, Search  \r\ncan now anticipate your needs,\r\nlike aligning travel itineraries with flight confirmations or suggesting  \r\nproducts that match your unique\r\nstyle. With this upgrade, privacy remains the priority: connecting your  \r\napps is strictly opt-in, ensuring you\r\nare always in full control of your data and connections.\r\n\r\nGet tailored results\r\nhttps://blog.google/products-and-platforms/products/search/personal-intelligence-ai-mode-search/?utm_source=kw-newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=01232026&utm_content=cta\r\n\r\nThe latest education news\r\n\r\nLEARNING & EDUCATION\r\n\r\nBett 2026: Celebrating the art of teaching and the science of learning\r\n\r\nRead more\r\nhttps://blog.google/products-and-platforms/products/education/collection-bett-2026/?utm_source=kw-newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=01232026&utm_content=cta\r\n\r\nLEARNING & EDUCATION\r\n\r\nPremium Google AI for more educators and students\r\n\r\nRead more\r\nhttps://blog.google/products-and-platforms/products/education/bett26-premium-ai/?utm_source=kw-newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=01232026&utm_content=cta\r\n\r\nLEARNING & EDUCATION\r\n\r\nPrep for the SAT with practice tests in Gemini\r\n\r\nRead more\r\nhttps://blog.google/products-and-platforms/products/education/practice-sat-gemini/?utm_source=kw-newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=01232026&utm_content=cta\r\n\r\nLEARNING & EDUCATION\r\n\r\nNew ChromeOS tools to support classroom collaboration\r\n\r\nRead more\r\nhttps://blog.google/products-and-platforms/products/education/chromeos-chromebooks-bett-2026/?utm_source=kw-newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=01232026&utm_content=cta\r\n\r\nLEARNING & EDUCATION\r\n\r\nTransform teaching and learning with updates to Gemini and Google Classroom\r\n\r\nRead more\r\nhttps://blog.google/products-and-platforms/products/education/bett-2026-gemini-classroom-updates/?utm_source=kw-newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=01232026&utm_content=cta\r\n\r\nLEARNING & EDUCATION\r\n\r\nNew security and AI detection features for Google Workspace for Education\r\n\r\nRead more\r\nhttps://blog.google/products-and-platforms/products/education/security-ai-features/?utm_source=kw-newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=01232026&utm_content=cta\r\n\r\nBeyond the news\r\n\r\nTake the headache out of vacation planning with AI Mode in Search. The  \r\nCanvas tool in AI Mode can create a\r\ncustom itinerary based on your travel ideas and needs. Here are a few tips  \r\nand prompts to help you get\r\nstarted, from brainstorming destinations to customizing your itinerary with  \r\nhotels, restaurants and must-see\r\nattractions.\r\n\r\nPlan a trip\r\nhttps://blog.google/products-and-platforms/products/search/tips-prompts-ai-mode-canvas-travel-planning/?utm_source=kw-newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=01232026&utm_content=cta\r\nhttps://blog.google/?utm_source=kw-newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=01232026\r\nThis email was sent to <jasonnorman66994@gmail.com> because you've signed  \r\nup to receive news and updates from Google.\r\n\r\n(c) <2026> Google LLC. All Rights Reserved. Google and the Google logo are  \r\ntrademarks of\r\nGoogle LLC. 1600 Amphitheatre Parkway, Mountain View, CA 94043.\r\n\r\nMore news from