[2026-04-27 10:40:40] Raw text/plain payload: b"Helping you reach more markets!  \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nGlobal Teams banner.healthcare [ https://www.trade.gov/healthcare-technologies-industry ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nUpcoming Healthcare Events To\xc2\xa0Help You Go Global\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nMarkets of the Month\r\nHealth Technologies Resource Guide [ https://www.trade.gov/healthcare-technologies-resource-guide ]\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*Croatia*\xe2\x80\x99s healthcare sector is increasingly focused on improving operational efficiency, with particular attention on reducing the administrative burden placed on medical staff. Within this context, the Croatian Chamber of Nurses (HKMS), the professional regulatory body representing nurses nationwide, has signaled its intention to accelerate the digitalization of the nursing administration. The objective is to streamline administrative workflows, reduce paperwork, and allow nursing staff to dedicate more time to patient care. Learn More [ https://www.trade.gov/market-intelligence/croatia-healthcare-digitalization-nursing-administration ]\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*Israel*\xe2\x80\x99s Sheba Medical Center and Bar-Ilan University announced the creation of a joint biomedical research institute with an initial investment of ILS (approx. $105MM). The institute, modeled after the U.S. National Institutes of Health (NIH), will house 20 laboratories and focus on translational medicine, turning basic scientific discoveries into clinical treatments. Research areas include cancer, organ and tissue printing, medical robotics, genetic engineering, and artificial intelligence (AI) for medical data analysis. Learn More [ https://www.trade.gov/market-intelligence/israel-establishes-joint-biomedical-research-institute ]\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*South Korea*n medical device market is expected to return to moderate growth in 2026, once hospital operations fully normalize and public health investment resumes. Growth will likely be driven by replacement demand for delayed purchases and government initiatives supporting digital health and AI-assisted technologies. These factors make the market attractive for U.S. exporters. Learn More [ https://www.trade.gov/market-intelligence/south-korea-medical-devices ]\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*Malaysia*\xe2\x80\x99s planned shift to a Diagnosis-Related Group (DRG) payment system represents a structural reform of its healthcare financing model, creating near- and medium-term commercial opportunities for U.S. firms with proven capabilities Health Information Technology solutions such as electronic medical records, clinical billing platforms, DRG grouper software, analytics tools, and data integration systems, and play a key role in supporting Malaysia\xe2\x80\x99s move toward value-based care. Learn More [ https://www.trade.gov/market-intelligence/malaysia-health-information-technology ]\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nThe Government of *Pakistan* has announced the establishment of the Jinnah Medical Complex and Research Center (JMC&RC) in Islamabad, positioning the new greenfield healthcare facility as a world-class medical institution and national Center of Excellence while creating significant near-term export opportunities for U.S. medical technology, digital health, and clinical systems suppliers. Learn More [ https://www.trade.gov/market-intelligence/pakistan-healthcare-jinnah-complex ]\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nVirtual Events\r\n\r\n*AmCham Saudi Arabia's webinar on Business Opportunities for U.S. Biotech Companies Interested in Exporting to Saudi Arabia [ https://www.trade.gov/saudi-arabia ]*\r\n\r\n*January 27, 2026 at 9:00AM ET*\r\n\r\nFor more information on AmCham's webinar.\xc2\xa0 Please contact, Khalid Khan <Khalid.Khan@trade.gov> from the U.S. Commercial Service in Saudi Arabia.\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n  CS Saudi Arabia [ https://www.trade.gov/saudi-arabia ] \r\n\r\n*Tools for U.S. Companies Exhibiting at Foreign Trade Shows [ https://gcc02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Flinks-1.govdelivery.com%2FCL0%2Fhttps%3A%252F%252Fevents.trade.gov%252Fen%252FTradeGov%252FTemporaryImportsToolsforInternationalExhibitors%252F%2F2%2F0100019be30de380-78bad7fc-fd26-48bd-bb2c-186fa83bade5-000000%2FbYKeh_4nMcJB6tq_4MI1XhDtbzJr6hxHZyb_38Nq7ic%3D441&data=05%7C02%7CFernando.Bentz%40trade.gov%7C6fa0ab7144be43cf3fde08de59ee0012%7Ca1d183f26c7b4d9ab9945f2f31b3f780%7C0%7C0%7C639047076512064483%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&sdata=CBPn2McL4WRsfNT6hTLpgyXnwH2SzGbUqjP0OQrrxoE%3D&reserved=0 ]*\r\n\r\n*January 28, 2026 at 11:00AM ET*\r\n\r\nWe invite both new and experienced U.S. exhibitors to join this webinar and learn how the ATA Carnet\xe2\x80\x94an internationally recognized customs document\xe2\x80\x94can help you move trade show equipment across borders smoothly and in full compliance. Register Today [ https://gcc02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Flinks-1.govdelivery.com%2FCL0%2Fhttps%3A%252F%252Fevents.trade.gov%252Fen%252FTradeGov%252FTemporaryImportsToolsforInternationalExhibitors%252F%2F3%2F0100019be30de380-78bad7fc-fd26-48bd-bb2c-186fa83bade5-000000%2F2JdT5ZAbD_FUKePn0afcdBS552eVGe8RQb8bur9MNtU%3D441&data=05%7C02%7CFernando.Bentz%40trade.gov%7C6fa0ab7144be43cf3fde08de59ee0012%7Ca1d183f26c7b4d9ab9945f2f31b3f780%7C0%7C0%7C639047076512081298%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&sdata=gU1HBRn6%2FihgbWTlI4Vergf8DBNKPWqOjF9r9lDtoVs%3D&reserved=0 ]\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n  Tools for U.S. exporters exhibiting in a foreign trade show [ https://gcc02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Flinks-1.govdelivery.com%2FCL0%2Fhttps%3A%252F%252Fevents.trade.gov%252Fen%252FTradeGov%252FTemporaryImportsToolsforInternationalExhibitors%252F%2F2%2F0100019be30de380-78bad7fc-fd26-48bd-bb2c-186fa83bade5-000000%2FbYKeh_4nMcJB6tq_4MI1XhDtbzJr6hxHZyb_38Nq7ic%3D441&data=05%7C02%7CFernando.Bentz%40trade.gov%7C6fa0ab7144be43cf3fde08de59ee0012%7Ca1d183f26c7b4d9ab9945f2f31b3f780%7C0%7C0%7C639047076512064483%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&sdata=CBPn2McL4WRsfNT6hTLpgyXnwH2SzGbUqjP0OQrrxoE%3D&reserved=0 ] \r\n\r\n*Exporting Industrial Machinery to Brazil [ https://gcc02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Flinks-1.govdelivery.com%2FCL0%2Fhttps%3A%252F%252Fevents.trade.gov%252Fen%252FTradeGov%252FExportingAdvancedManufacturingProductstoBrazil-988%252F%2F2%2F0100019be30de380-78bad7fc-fd26-48bd-bb2c-186fa83bade5-000000%2F8T0BVKgnmrQcbx0jN-xqYZTtc2Kc6AVir0YT64CFkI4%3D441&data=05%7C02%7CFernando.Bentz%40trade.gov%7C6fa0ab7144be43cf3fde08de59ee0012%7Ca1d183f26c7b4d9ab9945f2f31b3f780%7C0%7C0%7C639047076512197461%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&sdata=MGAfJGmuSb2SZeOAnHskWMCVQXK35yNC4ef89KMS604%3D&reserved=0 ]*\r\n\r\n*February 11, 2026 at 12:00PM ET*\r\n\r\nGet a clear introduction to Brazil\xe2\x80\x99s customs procedures and tariff structure. Strengthen your competitive position by mastering one of the most complex aspects of exporting to this dynamic market. This webinar is tailored for U.S. exporters of equipment and machinery.\xc2\xa0Register Today [ https://gcc02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Flinks-1.govdelivery.com%2FCL0%2Fhttps%3A%252F%252Fevents.trade.gov%252Fen%252FTradeGov%252FExportingAdvancedManufacturingProductstoBrazil-988%252F%2F3%2F0100019be30de380-78bad7fc-fd26-48bd-bb2c-186fa83bade5-000000%2FsuKnYWCsjvr61ZtnPk7FLYatzJ2uff8BMcDKm5o6Wok%3D441&data=05%7C02%7CFernando.Bentz%40trade.gov%7C6fa0ab7144be43cf3fde08de59ee0012%7Ca1d183f26c7b4d9ab9945f2f31b3f780%7C0%7C0%7C639047076512214031%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&sdata=N%2F4ukjy36GbNjHBqp6SUTWpSkvIRCV%2B8t237DQjLjlQ%3D&reserved=0 ]\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n  Exporting Manufactured Products to Brazil [ https://gcc02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Flinks-1.govdelivery.com%2FCL0%2Fhttps%3A%252F%252Fevents.trade.gov%252Fen%252FTradeGov%252FExportingAdvancedManufacturingProductstoBrazil-988%252F%2F2%2F0100019be30de380-78bad7fc-fd26-48bd-bb2c-186fa83bade5-000000%2F8T0BVKgnmrQcbx0jN-xqYZTtc2Kc6AVir0YT64CFkI4%3D441&data=05%7C02%7CFernando.Bentz%40trade.gov%7C6fa0ab7144be43cf3fde08de59ee0012%7Ca1d183f26c7b4d9ab9945f2f31b3f780%7C0%7C0%7C639047076512197461%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&sdata=MGAfJGmuSb2SZeOAnHskWMCVQXK35yNC4ef89KMS604%3D&reserved=0 ] \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nIn-person Events\r\nU.S. Commercial Service at WHX Dubai 2026\r\n\r\nSeveral key events will take place on the sidelines of WHX Dubai 2026 (formerly Arab Health), including a reception and panel discussion hosted by the U.S.\xe2\x80\x93UAE Business Council, a kickoff breakfast organized by AmCham Dubai, and speaker sessions coordinated by CS Dubai. For more information on these events and USA Pavilion, please contact Monica Toporkiewicz <Monica.Toporkiewicz@trade.gov> and Vandana Nair <Vandana.Nair@trade.gov>.\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nKuwait Healthcare Trade Event\r\n\r\nFollowing the WHX Dubai 2026 (formerly Arab Health), CS Kuwait will host a one day event in *Kuwait City* (*February 12, 0226*), which will include presentations from the Ministry of Health on how to do business in Kuwait and customized business-to-business meetings with local healthcare distributors of medical equipment, supplies, and pharmaceutical products. There is a participation fee of $1,000 USD per company (one participant) and $300 USD for each additional participant. For more information, please contact Darrel Ching <darrel.ching@trade.gov>\xc2\xa0and Rasha Al-Muhtaseb <rasha.al-muhtaseb@trade.gov> from the U.S. Commercial Service in Kuwait. Register Today [ https://events.trade.gov/en/TradeGov/KuwaitHealthcareTradeEvent-9884-1763388279/login.php?redirect=%2Fen%2FTradeGov%2FKuwaitHealthcareTradeEvent-9884-1763388279%2Fform.php%3F ]\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nBanner for NPEW 2026 [ https://www.expowest.com/en/home.html ]\r\n\r\nNatural Products Expo West [ https://www.expowest.com/en/home.html ] (NPEW) is the world's leading trade show for the organic and healthy products industry. Its 2026 edition is scheduled to take place from *March 3\xe2\x80\x936, 2026,* at the Anaheim Convention Center in California. NPEW plans to have an event focuses on innovation, such as how AI-driven operations are reshaping the CPG industry. For more information on the U.S. Commercial Service's free export counseling and support at the show, please contact Richard Swanson <Richard.Swanson@trade.gov> and\xc2\xa0Daniel Bruner <daniel.bruner@trade.gov>.\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nBanner for Pittcon 2026 [ https://pittcon.org/ ]\r\n\r\nPittcon [ https://pittcon.org/about-us/ ]\xe2\x80\x94formally known as the Pittsburgh Conference on Analytical Chemistry\xe2\x80\x94is a leading global conference and exposition focused on laboratory science, instrumentation, and emerging research technologies. Pittcon 2026 will be held *March 7\xe2\x80\x9311, 2026*, at the Henry B. Gonz\xc3\xa1lez Convention Center in *San Antonio, Texas*.\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nThe U.S. Commercial Service has partnered with Pittcon 2026 [ https://pittcon.org/about-us/ ] through the International Trade Administration\xe2\x80\x99s TEMS program [ https://www.trade.gov/tepp ] to expand the event\xe2\x80\x99s international reach. As part of this collaboration, the U.S. Commercial Service is promoting the conference to U.S. companies interested in exhibiting, as well as to foreign buyers seeking to connect with American suppliers. This effort supports the broader goal of increasing U.S. exports of laboratory and analytical technologies.\r\n\r\nFor additional details or to arrange government-to-business meetings during the event, please contact Oscar Magana <Oscar.Magana@trade.gov>.\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nMulti-Omics Technology Trade Gateway Event\r\n\r\nThe U.S. Commercial Service will host a Multi-Omics Technology Trade Event in *Stockholm, Sweden* on *June 11, 2026*, ahead of ESHG 2026 in Gothenburg. Sweden\xe2\x80\x99s national initiative to integrate genomic sequencing into clinical care\xe2\x80\x94and to incorporate multi-omics data into healthcare records\xe2\x80\x94creates a strong export opportunity for U.S. companies offering advanced technologies in these fields.\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nThe planned program for the U.S. Commercial Service event features a briefing at the U.S. Embassy, expert panel and roundtable discussions, guided visits to leading research facilities, and a networking reception designed to connect U.S. innovators with Swedish stakeholders. For more information, please contact Michelle Ouellette <Michelle.Ouellette@trade.gov> and Johan Bjorkman <Johan.Bjorkman@trade.gov>.\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nTrade Leads\r\n\r\nPlease note that only U.S. Companies with products and services that have at least 51% U.S. content are eligible for the U.S. Commercial Service's assistance with these trade leads.\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nAfDB\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nThe African Development Bank (AfDB) published the following procurement notices [ https://gcc02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Flinks-1.govdelivery.com%2FCL0%2Fhttps%3A%252F%252Fwww.afdb.org%252Fen%252Fprojects-and-operations%252Fprocurement%2F1%2F0100019867463588-1bd228de-9876-47f4-b2f0-cf13d1bc3859-000000%2FOMXNU7dolW28iXDcV_2zN6ok4uvU8WSLHpr_l2iFrNA%3D416&data=05%7C02%7CFernando.Bentz%40trade.gov%7C4bf2f2b3e7dc4c12e38f08ddd138f5d0%7Ca1d183f26c7b4d9ab9945f2f31b3f780%7C0%7C0%7C638896764764041068%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&sdata=SU3vOItAOjvV0%2FcUTTnd9nkkzQeh99uVu9YgdAjmoYg%3D&reserved=0 ].\xc2\xa0U.S. suppliers submitting a proposal may contact Susan Hettleman <%20susan.hettleman@trade.gov>\xc2\xa0to inquire on potential advocacy support from the U.S. government [ https://gcc02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Flinks-1.govdelivery.com%2FCL0%2Fhttps%3A%252F%252Fwww.trade.gov%252Fadvocacy%2F1%2F0100019867463588-1bd228de-9876-47f4-b2f0-cf13d1bc3859-000000%2FPiopExKDBlT82bJ8A1LdEVrrDSXScoTEVlxL4_oYpKA%3D416&data=05%7C02%7CFernando.Bentz%40trade.gov%7C4bf2f2b3e7dc4c12e38f08ddd138f5d0%7Ca1d183f26c7b4d9ab9945f2f31b3f780%7C0%7C0%7C638896764764058581%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&sdata=muXjHPXxrqTK1Yok6GyhP4sxDI%2FUoon1HMBaqKjPCZY%3D&reserved=0 ].\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nEBRD\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nThe European Bank for Reconstruction and Development (EBRD) published the following tenders [ https://gcc02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Flinks-1.govdelivery.com%2FCL0%2Fhttps%3A%252F%252Fecepp.ebrd.com%252Fdelta%252FnoticeSearchResults.html%2F1%2F0100019867463588-1bd228de-9876-47f4-b2f0-cf13d1bc3859-000000%2F1PuCpvtsm_R9BPTTks_jOxV9n9TG53ruDo97diwhjiU%3D416&data=05%7C02%7CFernando.Bentz%40trade.gov%7C4bf2f2b3e7dc4c12e38f08ddd138f5d0%7Ca1d183f26c7b4d9ab9945f2f31b3f780%7C0%7C0%7C638896764764075779%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&sdata=9wlZGjRcs7E%2FN2gnpD%2BmpIK1c9viMFGs8%2B3jk2RcqeM%3D&reserved=0 ]. U.S. suppliers submitting a proposal may contact Chrystal Denys <Chrystal.Denys@trade.gov> to inquire on advocacy support from the U.S. government [ https://gcc02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Flinks-1.govdelivery.com%2FCL0%2Fhttps%3A%252F%252Fwww.trade.gov%252Fadvocacy%2F2%2F0100019867463588-1bd228de-9876-47f4-b2f0-cf13d1bc3859-000000%2FWK_1Un4JHS3XiJ3zuGUxcoU34u8bICBTlOHo3ZCChos%3D416&data=05%7C02%7CFernando.Bentz%40trade.gov%7C4bf2f2b3e7dc4c12e38f08ddd138f5d0%7Ca1d183f26c7b4d9ab9945f2f31b3f780%7C0%7C0%7C638896764764094377%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&sdata=b%2FKC7YnPuzkgECSlQ8h7iGEzB%2Baprgknc0n6DB9%2Bf0A%3D&reserved=0 ].\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nIDB\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nThe Interamerican Development Bank (IDB) published the following procurement opportunities [ https://gcc02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Flinks-1.govdelivery.com%2FCL0%2Fhttps%3A%252F%252Fprojectprocurement.iadb.org%252Fen%252Fprocurement-notices%2F1%2F0100019867463588-1bd228de-9876-47f4-b2f0-cf13d1bc3859-000000%2FlBVS-TGy8XZbfUtmktG35eKnmpDI8kH-XXcC_DI3vC4%3D416&data=05%7C02%7CFernando.Bentz%40trade.gov%7C4bf2f2b3e7dc4c12e38f08ddd138f5d0%7Ca1d183f26c7b4d9ab9945f2f31b3f780%7C0%7C0%7C638896764764112896%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&sdata=9m0WZ0I7ZbV8HA2wsxAoxccDpjnUAYHbKt4RrOXgaqA%3D&reserved=0 ]. U.S. suppliers submitting a proposal may contact Belen Gallegos <Belen.Gallegos@trade.gov> to inquire on advocacy support from the U.S. government [ https://gcc02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Flinks-1.govdelivery.com%2FCL0%2Fhttps%3A%252F%252Fwww.trade.gov%252Fadvocacy%2F3%2F0100019867463588-1bd228de-9876-47f4-b2f0-cf13d1bc3859-000000%2FbEYldc6mxRXbXEOQZIreW6W5RYFlOaC-mltogcrOfHE%3D416&data=05%7C02%7CFernando.Bentz%40trade.gov%7C4bf2f2b3e7dc4c12e38f08ddd138f5d0%7Ca1d183f26c7b4d9ab9945f2f31b3f780%7C0%7C0%7C638896764764132283%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&sdata=OUKt3Y996VS9FTlfLGPp223apaJF7UwIB%2BniLpHksOI%3D&reserved=0 ].\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nU.S. Commercial Service in Jordan\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nKey public sector projects with public tenders include King Hussein Cancer Center\xe2\x80\x99s pediatric center, Madaba Public Hospital, Ma\xe2\x80\x99an Military Hospital, Al Bashir Hospital expansion, and Princess Muna Al-Hussein Maternity Hospital. U.S. companies interested in healthcare public tenders in Jordan, should contact their local U.S. Commercial Service Office [ https://www.trade.gov/commercial-service-offices-us ] and copy Erick Kish <erick.kish@trade.gov>.\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nWorld\r\n\r\nBank\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nThe World Bank published the following procurement opportunities [ https://projects.worldbank.org/en/projects-operations/procurement?srce=both ]. U.S. suppliers submitting a proposal may contact Danica Starks <Danica.Starks@trade.gov>\xc2\xa0to inquire on advocacy support from the U.S. government [ https://www.trade.gov/advocacy ].\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nHealthcare Export Resources\r\n\r\nExplore the following resources that are always available to you:\r\n\r\nCountry Research [ https://www.trade.gov/ccg-landing-page ]\r\n\r\nIndustry Research [ https://www.trade.gov/industries ]\r\n\r\nAttend a Trade Event [ https://www.trade.gov/trade-events-search#/ ]\r\n\r\nHow-to-Export Resources [ https://www.trade.gov/learn-how-export ]\r\n\r\nLearn About our Export Services [ https://www.trade.gov/let-our-experts-help-0 ]\r\n\r\nHealth Technologies Resource Guide [ https://www.trade.gov/healthcare-technologies-resource-guide ]\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nWhat we do [ https://youtu.be/pRRsmcWtpt4 ]  \r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nWatch this short video to learn how we can help you export!\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n  \r\n \r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0International Trade Administration\xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0United States Commercial Service, International Trade Administration  \r\n\r\nThe U.S. Commercial Service is the trade promotion arm of the\r\n*U.S. Department of Commerce's International Trade Administration.*\r\nU.S. Commercial Service trade professionals in over 100 U.S. cities and in more than 75 markets \r\nhelp U.S. companies get started in exporting or increase sales to global markets.\r\n\r\n*STAY CONNECTED*\r\n\r\nVisit us on Twitter [ https://twitter.com/exportgov ]\xc2\xa0 Connect with us on LinkedIn [ https://www.linkedin.com/company/uscommercialservice/ ]\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nBookmark and Share [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USITATRADE/bulletins/404a64a?reqfrom=share ]\r\n\r\nIf you are ready to begin exporting or expand to additional global markets, \r\nplease contact your nearest U.S. Commercial Service office [ https://www.trade.gov/commercial-services-offices-us ] or access exporting resources [ https://www.trade.gov/learn-how-export ].\r\n\r\n*SUBSCRIBER SERVICES*\r\nVisit our User Profile Page [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USITATRADE/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] to update your subscriptions or unsubscribe.\r\nIf you need assistance, please visit\xc2\xa0subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/hc/en-us ].\r\n\r\n \r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\nThis email was sent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com using GovDelivery Communications Cloud on behalf of the International Trade Administration\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7 1401 Constitution Avenue NW \xc2\xb7 Washington, DC 20230 GovDelivery logo [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/ ] \r\nbody .abe-column-block { min-height: 5px; } table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:10px; margin-right:10px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;} table.govd_hr {min-width: 100%;}\r\n"
