[2026-04-27 10:40:41] Raw text/plain payload: b'rad \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nSPOTLIGHT\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nWHAT\'S NEW IN THIS ISSUE?\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nRegistration for our NYC Wicked-on Broadway [ https://radnorpa.myrec.com/info/activities/program_details.aspx?ProgramID=30296&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]*\xc2\xa0*Bus Trip is NOW OPEN!\r\n*Saturday, April 11, 2026*\r\n*Bus Departs for NYC*:\xc2\xa07:30am from Radnor Memorial Park: 60 Matsonford Rd, Wayne\r\n*Show Begins*:\xc2\xa02:00pm at the Gershwin Theatre (222 W 51st St)\r\n*Bus Departs* for Radnor:\xc2\xa06:30pm\r\n\r\nRegister today: www.radnorrecreation.com [ https://radnorpa.myrec.com/info/activities/program_details.aspx?ProgramID=30296&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n\r\n  NYC Wicked Trip [ https://radnorpa.myrec.com/info/activities/program_details.aspx?ProgramID=30296&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n*Radnor Township 2026 Wizarding Camp* [ https://radnorpa.myrec.com/info/activities/program_details.aspx?ProgramID=30299&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\nRegistration Now Open for *children in grades 1st- 8th\xc2\xa0\r\n*Monday- Friday, 9:00- 3:00 PM\r\nWeek One: August 3- 7\r\nWeek Two: August 10-14\r\nWeek Three: August 17- 21\r\n\r\nCampers may register for one of the three sessions offered.\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*New this Year! Field trip to Cork & Candles in KOP! All campers will receive a custom candle to take home!*\r\n\r\n  Wizarding Camp Flyer [ https://radnorpa.myrec.com/info/activities/program_details.aspx?ProgramID=30299&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n*Treats on the Trail with Hiking Hound Adventures [ https://radnorpa.myrec.com/info/activities/program_details.aspx?ProgramID=30275&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n*Guided adventures designed to spark curiosity and love of nature!\r\n\r\nRegister Today for tomorrow\'s hike, *Saturday, January 24th*, and catch our next one on *Saturday, February 28th*.\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nMultiple hikes scheduled throughout the year. Register at: https://hikinghoundadventures.com [ https://hikinghoundadventures.com/kids-and-family-hikes/treats-on-the-trail/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n\r\n  Treats on the Trail flyer [ https://radnorpa.myrec.com/info/activities/program_details.aspx?ProgramID=30275&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n*Summer Fishing Camp with Hiking Hound* [ https://radnorpa.myrec.com/info/activities/program_details.aspx?ProgramID=30300&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\nHiking Hound Adventures is excited to offer a week-long, full day camp for *kids ages 8-14.*\r\n\r\n*Registration opens February 1st, 2026*\r\nMonday- Friday, 9:00- 3:00 PM\r\nAugust 17th- August 21st\r\n\r\nCampers will develop confidence and fishing skills while enjoying time at the *Willows Park in Villanova*.\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n  Fishing Camp with HH [ https://radnorpa.myrec.com/info/activities/program_details.aspx?ProgramID=30300&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n\xe2\x9a\xa0\xef\xb8\x8f *Weather Update* \xe2\x9a\xa0\xef\xb8\x8f\r\nDue to the weather forecast expected to impact our region Sunday into Monday, and out of an abundance of caution, the Township Building will be *closed to the public on Monday, January 26*.\r\nPlease stay safe, check for updates, and for any Parks and Recreation related questions, email: recreation@radnor.org\r\n\r\n  Radnor Township \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nCOMMUNITY EVENTS\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\n*Sponsorship Opportunities*\r\n\r\nThe Parks & Recreation Department strives to provide a range of activities that appeal to all ages and segments within our great community.\xc2\xa0\r\nSponsorships are available to local, regional, and national businesses and organizations.\r\n\r\n*2026 Sponsorships are now available!*\r\n\r\nEnhance your recognition, public image, and good will in Radnor Township.\r\n\xc2\xa0Provide great quality of life opportunities for members of the community.\r\n\xc2\xa0Increase awareness of your products and services and overall marketing strategy.\r\n\xc2\xa0Make connections and interact with people while you reach various markets.\r\n\xc2\xa0Promote your business or organization to numerous people.\r\n\xc2\xa0Assist the Parks & Recreation Department in meeting its mission.\r\n\r\n*2026 Sponsorship Brochure coming soon!* [ https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/PARADNOR/2025/01/31/file_attachments/3149621/Sponsorships%20Opportunities%20Brochure%20Events%202025.pdf ] \r\n \r\n\r\n*2026 Community Events* [ https://www.radnor.com/government/departments/parks-recreation/draft-community-events?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n\r\n2026 Radnor Sweetheart Dance \r\n\r\nWe have an exciting night planned for our registered families! Our 15th Annual Radnor Sweetheart Dance will include music, dancing, refreshments, caricatures, and fun crafts. Ending the night with a special rose ceremony!\r\n\r\n*Event is sold out*. "For questions, call 610-688-5600 or email recreation@radnor.org"\r\n\r\nThank You Villanova University! [ https://www1.villanova.edu/university.html?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n\r\nThank you for your generous support of our Radnor Sweetheart Dance 2026!\r\n\r\nVillanova University [ https://www1.villanova.edu/university.html?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n\r\n*Learn More* [ https://www1.villanova.edu/university.html?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n\r\n_________________________________________________________________