nYou\xe2\x80\x99ve seen government officials pivot, relief and forgiveness\r\nprograms come and go, payment plans and rules shift. Last week,\r\nthere was yet another change of plans: The Department of\r\nEducation issued a last-minute reprieve for borrowers with loans\r\nin default, delaying collection efforts.\r\n\r\nWhat happened?\r\nOn Jan. 16, the Department of Education \r\n( https://ablink.newsletter.sofi.com/ls/click?upn=u001.k-2FImUMyJvquSjfrastfytITkr5z6fTIQOLr-2BR7cV2Zu1DOkj5d608Sx7SlONRC3StCqNJyNX7z9MWu0RMj-2F09z3lq-2By21xtzp-2BCN10nXhADDuRJXo-2BTfq1oxphDbvrt15OuLUTgpgzTsrsaawsliQCi0PZH-2B7x6LjyqYYSEhTFg1IwUuA4aP25UzhF-2FAJgLOhr8AYIjLl3kvDD7FR7gceCklMz14jnQIG5pzTEck7-2BH7dib-2F0or-2F1PhNirf6Ff3E8xxn-2FxxGDxT7T3RH-2BE41DXj8pqfpMdljWCQp0jebCTs-3D3c02_Hvirw9jLOYnqUg7ucIAtvDa4JCWhfjePQT8cfdKWfeKaKK6WyzUu0MT5hcL83ezarLAJeFzEeRP-2BR0XWfLa6c0AclSaEgGoSjypn37DPora5RjNsxhwb3aP0QQ9S8aDHcBqqh8NxS4AWJ07dVkaddV5zg2mDN-2BsxcbOyMULTKqSCFh-2FM-2FtWSejn5-2FaT94cDAgGfaFxLFTo92ANRauKdMUcRBDz14FB7Yt9RuTzg1nVejlVoWbXK8aw3G4D16Ie-2FRB4QMaE-2FCy22qjG-2BcmjWWvzaTDv36RUOTp75Btpax0Y9Mahm7LOluJZrNqQap07LtKdjKsIt1eCtWelx8r-2FB8d4GPLK7l7apgg5dy-2BQElGn67PT2Z9wAGwNez4zJsBa3LudWaTDqoDh2qFr-2FMRKLCLc2Ib8In6NBZlHiZn7yK4QDniTf6phc9BAtCipUT-2B3qPz2b558ZLyPdJjIN5yma-2BFvZN1AJO-2F-2FDuqMNQqHNJo4g4B-2F4vXVja6gGdH3YKic5sufLjaiViqYGN9nlVXs73Vz-2BuPqEwuObLvEi3nE68aRzxxaNIb3WyAF9KRPYEEEN4QI1Dpma-2F-2FKvPifv0ajO8FJ1OeQc3v18M4JS2vU-2BfBEXO0BTwi-2FRQwWeagNvgcVxlP1IslazWQFOBWDm9InxV-2FQ7n86ubP87CBIZDlgdHo9e4G1m7W9yfeULTsYOZ156IaHthCIo8PKkritjKe8uKXZlxoEI56iUysmdoxjLNqwADQ83uBdzitUhRciUaLyQD )\r\n announced it would delay \xe2\x80\x9cinvoluntary collections\xe2\x80\x9d on defaulted\r\nloans while it makes payment plan changes authorized under the\r\nOne Big Beautiful Bill Act \r\n( https://ablink.newsletter.sofi.com/ls/click?upn=u001.k-2FImUMyJvquSjfrastfytIPj6h1-2BVfWjnUDDp-2FeYQFJyOZ7ex2mIHgSiWdnbQtP-2BVGEq7JkZTGrTKovxOwMBAu3RhyxtOnKJXoh-2BgSmfQRyD4wj4DR4fwe2FOYrGjdqp-2FCx7zsxneYtxuAJH2Go-2FmKBQk68