[2026-04-27 10:41:11] Raw text/plain payload: b'Your Mac Will No Longer Be The Same After These Apps\r\n6 Mac Apps That Made Me Say, \'Wait, My Mac Can Do That?!\'\r\n\r\nYour Mac Will No Longer Be The Same After These Apps\r\n\r\nThe Useful Tech (https://medium.com/@theusefultech?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769362061228-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-953b148ade73------------------------1451159a_1c8d_4667_90de_9f9f47f9d2cb--------eeb618317985)\r\n\xc2\xa0in\xc2\xa0The Useful Tech (https://medium.com/the-useful-tech?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769362061228-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-953b148ade73------------------------1451159a_1c8d_4667_90de_9f9f47f9d2cb--------eeb618317985)\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nJanuary 25, 2026\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\n10 min read\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nView on Medium (https://medium.com/the-useful-tech/c54d19fa9379?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769362061228-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-953b148ade73------------------------1451159a_1c8d_4667_90de_9f9f47f9d2cb--------eeb618317985)\r\n\r\nSource: Generated by GPT 5.2\r\n\r\nYour Mac is already capable of a lot. But every now and then, you stumble across an app that makes you pause and think, "Wait, my Mac can do that?"\r\n\r\nI\'m not talking about better calendars or prettier note-taking apps. I\'m talking about apps that genuinely add new functionality to your Mac, the kind of things Apple never thought to include, things that feel almost like hardware upgrades delivered through software.\r\n\r\nI\'ve been using Macs for years, and I still get that spark of excitement when I find something that fundamentally changes what my laptop can do.\r\n\r\nThese six apps\xe2\x80\xa6\r\n\r\nContinue reading (https://medium.com/the-useful-tech/c54d19fa9379?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769362061228-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-953b148ade73------------------------1451159a_1c8d_4667_90de_9f9f47f9d2cb--------eeb618317985)\r\nThis is a member-only story and can only be read on Medium.\r\n\r\nSent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com by The Useful Tech on Medium\r\nUnsubscribe (https://medium.com/me/email-settings/50207bf5a022/49a1cde46556?type=noSetting&newsletterV3Id=eeb618317985&collectionId=953b148ade73&source=email-50207bf5a022-1769362061228-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-953b148ade73------------------------1451159a_1c8d_4667_90de_9f9f47f9d2cb--------eeb618317985)\r\n from this writer\'s email notifications\r\nManage your email settings (https://medium.com/me/settings/notifications?hash=49a1cde46556&userId=50207bf5a022&settingsRouteHash=%23manageSubscriptions&source=email-50207bf5a022-1769362061228-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-953b148ade73------------------------1451159a_1c8d_4667_90de_9f9f47f9d2cb--------eeb618317985)\r\n\r\n3500 South DuPont Highway, Suite IQ-101, Dover,\xc2\xa0DE\xc2\xa019901\r\nCareers (https://medium.com/jobs-at-medium/work-at-medium-959d1a85284e?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769362061228-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-953b148ade73------------------------1451159a_1c8d_4667_90de_9f9f47f9d2cb--------eeb618317985)\r\n\xc2\xb7Help Center (https://help.medium.com/hc/en-us?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769362061228-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-953b148ade73------------------------1451159a_1c8d_4667_90de_9f9f47f9d2cb--------eeb618317985)\r\n\xc2\xb7Privacy Policy (https://policy.medium.com/medium-privacy-policy-f03bf92035c9?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769362061228-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-953b148ade73------------------------1451159a_1c8d_4667_90de_9f9f47f9d2cb--------eeb618317985)\r\n\xc2\xb7Terms of service (https://policy.medium.com/medium-terms-of-service-9db0094a1e0f?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769362061228-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-953b148ade73------------------------1451159a_1c8d_4667_90de_9f9f47f9d2cb--------eeb618317985)'
