[2026-04-27 10:41:27] Raw text/plain payload: b'Submit your comments by February 2, 2026!  \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nNIST  \r\n\r\nView as a Web Page [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USNIST/bulletins/4059f8f ]\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nNICE | advancing cybersecurity education and workforce\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nnews and updates \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\n*January 26, 2026*\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nPROPOSED NICE FRAMEWORK UPDATES FOR PUBLIC COMMENT\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nFriendly reminder that public comment is open on three proposed Work Roles and updates to two Competency Areas in the NICE Workforce Framework for Cybersecurity [ https://www.nist.gov/itl/applied-cybersecurity/nice/resources ] (NICE Framework).\r\n\r\nThe proposals include:\r\n\r\n\r\n  * Cybersecurity Supply Chain Risk Management Work Role (new OG-WRL-017) \r\n  * Risk Management Work Role (new OG-WRL-018) \r\n  * Learning Program Management Work Role (new OG-WRL-019) \r\n  * Cryptography Competency Area (NF-COM-006) \r\n  * DevSecOps Competency Area (NF-COM-008) \r\n\r\n*Submit feedback by Monday, February 2, 2026!\xc2\xa0*\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nWE WANT TO HEAR FROM YOU!\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nComments received by the February 2, 2026 deadline will be acknowledged by email. Final updates will be incorporated in the next release of the NICE Framework Components [ https://www.nist.gov/itl/applied-cybersecurity/nice/nice-framework-resource-center/nice-framework-current-versions ]. Take the following steps to share your feedback:\r\n\r\n\r\n  * Visit the NICE Framework Resource Center Public Comments [ https://www.nist.gov/itl/applied-cybersecurity/nice/nice-framework-resource-center/current-version/nice-framework-public ] page to access and review the proposed update spreadsheets \r\n  * Submit comments to NICEFramework@nist.gov by 11:59 pm ET on Monday, February 2, 2026 \r\n  * Join the NICE Framework Users Group [ https://www.nist.gov/itl/applied-cybersecurity/nice/community/community-coordinating-council/nice-framework-users ] to participate in community discussions! \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n  \r\n \r\n\r\nConnect with us\r\n facebook [ https://www.facebook.com/NIST ]X [ https://twitter.com/NIST ]youtube [ https://www.youtube.com/NIST ]linkedin [ https://www.linkedin.com/company/nist ]flickr [ https://www.instagram.com/nist/ ]  \r\n\r\nReceived this email from a friend? Subscribe here [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USNIST/subscriber/new?topic_id=USNIST_1 ].\r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy [ https://www.nist.gov/privacy-policy#privpolicy ]\r\n\r\n NICE Logo \r\n\r\nSubscriber services:\r\n\r\nManage Preferences [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USNIST/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 Unsubscribe [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USNIST/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 Help [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/ ]\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n&lt;!-- body table .abe-column-block { min-height: 20px; } @media only screen and (max-device-width: 480px) { .tablecell { width:100% !important; display: block !important; max-width:100% !important; min-width: 100% !important; } } --&gt; ________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\nIf you have questions or problems with the subscription service, please contact subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/ ].\r\nTechnical questions? Contact inquiries@nist.gov. (301) 975-NIST (6478).\r\n\r\nThis service is provided to you at no charge by National Institute of Standards and Technology (NIST).\xc2\xa0100 Bureau Drive, Stop 1070\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7 Gaithersburg, MD 20899\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0301-975-6478\r\n\r\n GovDelivery logo [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/ ] \r\nbody .abe-column-block { min-height: 5px; } table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:10px; margin-right:10px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;} table.govd_hr {min-width: 100%;}\r\n'
