[2026-04-27 10:41:37] Raw text/plain payload: b"Don't miss Wednesday's Live webinar/demo of how Kyverno release 1.17 expands policy as code for Kubernetes with powerful new CEL capabilities.\r\n\r\nCNCF logo (https://email.linuxfoundation.org/e3t/Ctc/RI+113/cZw--04/VVCD6f2P14WBW6PfVXM74QzYyW5VG-2S5JN7K_N8kT_BW3prCCW7lCdLW6lZ3lJN5Lcwn-_LrSJVqrKXR97klqVW4K45Dp45cFKzW6SdBTZ4Cv1BXW4WqRqj4wMrFKW34xSK74hjWyrW9392Bh8SrdC-W43tYPc9gf1r3W3DHJPH3pF0GFVGx6Yy1gBP9_W5qbsVF4Gk5g6W8hDXJM1LQ553W6Sr04425GbVQW1vzZd36gDfdcW4LQryQ2spR8SW86y2pj2SBM-hN56Z3rD4czhvV8BYc52QYpvhW7LFmkv72q6MjW4Q55Ys77ZQqzVpqyYK74LgFwW8Gry_s7b1yYyW8qqvKH5qL0DhW821Pws1HbLx8dVsTld04 )\r\n\r\nOnline Programs:\r\n\r\nWeek of January 26\r\n\r\nONE LIVE WEBINAR THIS WEEK\r\n\r\nSome weeks are heavy with content, and others are light. This week is the latter, so we hope you take advantage of going Live with CNCF maintainers!\r\n\r\nWednesday, January 28\r\n\r\nKyverno 1.17 Release \xe2\x80\x94 Advancing with CEL and Supply Chain Security\r\n\r\nKyverno 1.17 expands policy as code for Kubernetes with powerful new CEL capabilities. In this Cloud Native Live session, Kyverno maintainers demo key 1.17 features, including the transition from JMESPath to CEL, new cryptographic, time-based, and parsing functions, namespaced policies, and dynamic mutation targets\xe2\x80\x94plus a preview of upcoming reporting and supply chain security enhancements.\r\n\r\nRSVP HERE (https://email.linuxfoundation.org/e3t/Ctc/RI+113/cZw--04/VVCD6f2P14WBW6PfVXM74QzYyW5VG-2S5JN7K_N8kT_Cb3prCCW7Y8-PT6lZ3mPW5tbxCZ6yTRGsW3KD3CK255DFJW2m9NYs8M8kJZW6YTDn-7kWKqhW6SWz9b8gxsqwW4DbJg-1rpRSwW23qblp8XwwvWW2fWyKG1BwQN2W8MgGWZ99kWxgW15q4LT6R8qlQW7sCcLl3sNBVbW2WWM437Fz6htW5Z2HV38VhjgQW6yMKh74NVf5lW7cqB7q52tTh6W7C02qj1FB9g8N8gpKLhy0Z57W373j3W3n3PJKW3lVdTR28wpcZVz3XhB4LsBp6N1Pp6Lvq035RW6ZHNN247Qm2KW77sJ-B5R9LRPW81YrPR7XBj3zW6ptcj54gBtcXW2355H1547_HFf5JQ5TC04 )\r\n\r\nNext Tuesday, February 3\r\n\r\nThe CNCF Annual Cloud Native Survey \xe2\x80\x94 Infrastructure of AI's Future\r\n\r\nJoin to learn how The CNCF Annual Cloud Native Survey report helps you explore how Kubernetes emerged as the unifying platform for cloud native and AI in production, what sets cloud native leaders apart as infrastructure maturity accelerates, and why people, culture, and organizational alignment now matter more than tooling alone.\r\n\r\nRSVP HERE (https://email.linuxfoundation.org/e3t/Ctc/RI+113/cZw--04/VVCD6f2P14WBW6PfVXM74QzYyW5VG-2S5JN7K_N8kT_Cb3prCCW7Y8-PT6lZ3mNN8sSzJYtgSl9W7G3bXM5cfwFjW5Qr1Yh4Gs3MzW7jZvlr3ps9b6W47xJNb2FkfTjW6Fspxc6XTM6wW4W3H1x8KZcjYW8yNfFf8ZQHBfW4j5KdW66JyF0W7ZKy6P5ZCPrpN6Lpff4d809mW5Z30Gj8gHnfmW4Ddd6s13FLjQN3Q9pkrkljZHW8902cd2HrCzZW7kT1-q12WKwhW1T6Hfg7Vwv1DVCmlWT7fFb5YW38n-qT6bVZnQVrT0Rr3vG1y7W1FtLKQ12ssJrW6YBK_F3w6ntSW4DfzT62tQPSBW8k1tQ35GcNtcN6rZtzLVtMJNW2SRsHv3hxP9qf1PcLYW04 )\r\n\r\nYOUTUBE PLAYLIST UPDATES\r\n\r\nLooking for more great content? Be sure to visit our YouTube page (https://email.linuxfoundation.org/e3t/Ctc/RI+113/cZw--04/VVCD6f2P14WBW6PfVXM74QzYyW5VG-2S5JN7K_N8kT_CP3prCCW95jsWP6lZ3l-W4kjGtl20Q5_zW38JfzJ7908kgW73SP6L1YVlWnW8lrTJZ1Gfwp-W5Gg7jK6TrXVDW3j4YGq89jmMQW2_lvBw8mp8XMW8Rg5PJ4GsMHjW6T281n1NMLj2W8y5XLl6R9PvjW8RJV7d7QxWf8W98BHWF5999MBW5PdwsC3rYCzbT6b1R86RR4JW7ghxSS1ycxZDW6rgX8m7H8svYW7ySgmJ2b9DJqW6W9y4w7MYf0LVBP96f5YYkvHW5NGr831R8nhxVf-csc32k-mBW4tb9Vw5vVwpNW2b91Z56Q5VB9Vr6yZN8YXxMZW6dpCZJ1Dr1mWW7Y48qf8rLXbQW1Gjq944pHclZN417_vSr67qjW59g8yJ37NpBLW8z3Tg67kKJptf2m6Yg404 ) every Friday for new content under our Online Programs playlist!\r\n\r\nVIEW FULL SCHEDULE\r\n(https://email.linuxfoundation.org/e3t/Ctc/RI+113/cZw--04/VVCD6f2P14WBW6PfVXM74QzYyW5VG-2S5JN7K_N8kT_Cv3prCCW8wLKSR6lZ3pmW6GKbZN1SYCrXVN3tJc151CZYW5tvXJT8QdhpNW2StH_j5dBmrtW3kS04G73rV56V9gnls4Nk2jjW3zhLvd8Qzxy4W4L8LHK1lMZlFW2Mp2zf4MmBP7W4GF_Zk88PpwnW6Rw13P40fWVqW79yfy88-hw53W5Y0vQ236jY4XW2tKGjx31gXqpW1s_56r4qN2d6MdS0P91qszNW45FZDg6cdfkVW8WRBGX56RKxkN1WYkCxYZ-dMN1-XcyCBRKmZW2WVcPH79p5ckW75H5Mp7Z9M0rV7chG_4Xh3FhN7QjpTzcBqkwW3J8B2J33RdGsW1BFlyS1