[2026-04-27 10:41:40] Raw text/plain payload: b'F&amp;W Waterfowl Banner 3 [ https://dep.nj.gov/njfw/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nAdditional Waterfowl Hunting Day for Youth/Veterans/Active Duty Personnel!\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nThis Saturday, January 31, 2026, a "joint" Youth and Veterans/Active Military Hunting Day will be held statewide. This day gives youth hunters, veterans and active duty military personnel the opportunity to share a unique hunting experience. These days are outside regular legal waterfowl seasons (but all other regulations apply).\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n\r\n  * Special Youth and Veterans/Active Military Waterfowl Hunting Days FAQs [ https://dep.nj.gov/njfw/hunting/special-youth-and-veterans-active-military-waterfowl-hunting-days-faqs/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n  * Waterfowl and Migratory Birds in New Jersey [ https://dep.nj.gov/njfw/hunting/waterfowl-and-migratory-birds-in-new-jersey/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n  * 2026 Waterfowl Regulations [ https://dep.nj.gov/wp-content/uploads/njfw/digest-hunting-and-trapping-2025-2026-segment-61-65.pdf?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\xc2\xa0(pdf) \r\n  * NJ Hunting & Trapping Explorer [ https://njdep.maps.arcgis.com/apps/webappviewer/index.html?id=9b56ba3f8e4b4cbeb08361a1a56c26cb&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\xc2\xa0(Waterfowl Hunting Zones) \r\n  * Youth Hunts [ https://dep.nj.gov/njfw/hunting/take-a-kid-hunting-program/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n  * Disabled Veteran License Information [ https://dep.nj.gov/njfw/licenses-and-permits/disabled-veteran-license-information/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\nNew Jersey D E P Fish and Wildlife [ https://dep.nj.gov/njfw/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] New Jersey Department of Environmental Protection [ https://dep.nj.gov/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n\r\nQuestions?\xc2\xa0Contact Us [ http://www.nj.gov/dep/fgw/contact.htm?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n\r\n \r\n\xc2\xa0 Facebook [ https://www.facebook.com/NJFishandWildlife?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] twitter [ https://twitter.com/newjerseydep?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] Follow us on Instagram [ https://www.instagram.com/newjerseyfishandwildlife/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] Sign up for email updates [ http://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/NJDEP/subscriber/new ] \xc2\xa0 \r\n \r\n\r\nSUBSCRIBER SERVICES:\r\n\r\nManage Preferences [ http://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/NJDEP/subscribers/new?preferences=true ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 Unsubscribe [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/NJDEP/subscribers/new?preferences=true ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 Help [ https://insights.govdelivery.com/Communications/Subscriber_Help_Center ]\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n This email was sent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com using GovDelivery Communications Cloud on behalf of: New Jersey Department of Environmental Protection \xc2\xb7 401 E. State St. \xc2\xb7 Trenton, NJ 08625 GovDelivery logo [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\nbody .abe-column-block { min-height: 5px; } table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:10px; margin-right:10px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;} table.govd_hr {min-width: 100%;}\r\n'
