[2026-04-27 10:41:44] Raw text/plain payload: b"The U.S. Census Bureau is scheduled to embargo 2020-2024 ACS 5-years estimates, which are set to be publicly released on Jan. 29.  \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nUnited States Census Bureau [ https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2026/embargo-acs-5-year-estimates.html?utm_campaign=20260126pios1&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nCensus Bureau Announces Embargo for 2020-2024 American Community Survey 5-Year Estimates\r\n\r\n2020-2024 Embargo ACS [ https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2026/embargo-acs-5-year-estimates.html?utm_campaign=20260126pios1&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n\r\nThe U.S. Census Bureau is scheduled to release new 2020-2024 American Community Survey [ http://www.census.gov/programs-surveys/acs/about.html?utm_campaign=20260126pios1&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] (ACS) 5-year estimates to embargo subscribers beginning Jan. 27, at 10 a.m. ET, which are set to be publicly released on Jan. 29.\r\n\r\nThe ACS [ http://www.census.gov/programs-surveys/acs/?utm_campaign=20260126pios1&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] provides a wide range of statistics about the nation\xe2\x80\x99s people and housing, such as language spoken at home, education, commuting, employment, mortgage status and rent, income, poverty, and health insurance coverage. It is the only source of local estimates for most of the 40-plus topics [ https://www.census.gov/programs-surveys/acs/guidance/subjects.html?utm_campaign=20260126pios1&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] it covers.\r\n\r\nThe statistics will be available to embargo subscribers beginning Jan. 27 at 10 a.m. ET for a variety of geographic areas, including all states, the District of Columbia, Puerto Rico, congressional and state legislative districts, metropolitan and micropolitan statistical areas, counties, places, and other geographies down to census tracts and block groups.\r\n\r\n*Read More* [ https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2026/embargo-acs-5-year-estimates.html?utm_campaign=20260126pios1&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n\r\n*Embargo subscribers* [ https://www.census.gov/newsroom/releases/archives/embargoed_releases/?utm_campaign=20260126pios1&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]* will have access to these statistics from Tuesday, Jan. 27, at 10 a.m. ET to Jan. 29, at 12:01 a.m. ET. *Wire and distribution services are prohibited from distributing embargoed news stories and data files before the embargo period ends. For more information, refer to the Census Bureau\xe2\x80\x99s\xc2\xa0embargo policy [ https://www.census.gov/newsroom/embargo/embargo-policy.html?utm_campaign=20260126pios1&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]. *All data products on data.census.gov, the API, summary files, and other tools will be made publicly available by 10 a.m. ET on** Jan. 29**. *\r\n\r\nTo register for embargo access, visit www.census.gov/newsroom/releases/archives/embargoed_releases [ http://www.census.gov/newsroom/releases/archives/embargoed_releases?utm_campaign=20260126pios1&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ].\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nHelp us spread the word about Census Bureau data!\r\n\r\nShare this on social media or forward it to a friend.\r\n\r\n*Share This* [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USCENSUS/bulletins/4061c70 ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nYou May Be Interested In\r\n\r\n  * Press Kit: 2020-2024 American Community Survey 5-Year Estimates [ https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-kits/2026/acs-5-year-estimates.html?utm_campaign=20260126pios1&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nAbout the Census Bureau\r\n\r\nWe serve as the nation\xe2\x80\x99s leading provider of quality data about its people and economy.\xc2\xa0The Census Bureau is the federal government's largest statistical agency. As the world\xe2\x80\x99s premier statistical agency, we are dedicated to making our nation a better place. Policy-makers, businesses, and the public use our data to make informed decisions.\r\n\r\nResources for Media\r\n\r\nFor media interviews, please contact the\xc2\xa0Public Information Office [ https://lnks.gd/l/eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..p-5wpj2DTx0_qgyLiv6JuMTDOF_vZlHcwFpt971jIDs/s/866068797/br/124287751808-l?utm_campaign=20260126pios1&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\xc2\xa0Toll Free at 877-861-2010, 301-763-3030, or\xc2\xa0pio@census.gov.\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n  \r\n \r\n\r\n*Stay connected with us!*\r\n\r\nJoin the conversation on social media.\r\n\r\n facebook [ https://www.facebook.com/uscensusbureau/?utm_campaign=20260126pios1&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]instagram [ https://www.instagram.com/uscensusbureau/?utm_campaign=20260126pios1&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]linkedin [ https://www.linkedin.com/company/us-census-bureau/?utm_campaign=20260126pios1&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]twitter [ https://twitter.com/uscensusbureau/?utm_campaign=20260126pios1&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] [ https://www.linkedin.com/company/us-census-bureau/?utm_campaign=20260126pios1&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]youtube [ https://www.youtube.com/user/uscensusbureau/?utm_campaign=20260126pios1&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]  \r\n\r\nSUBSCRIBER SERVICES:\r\n\r\nSubscriber Settings [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USCENSUS/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 Remove me from All Subscriptions  [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USCENSUS/subscriber/one_click_unsubscribe?verification=5.76359f46a06559a62e8e0404a80cc7e5&destination=jasonnorman66994%40gmail.com ]\xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0Help [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/ ]\r\n\r\n \r\n&lt;!-- /* template top padding on mobile */ @media only screen and (max-width: 480px) { table#flexible-abe-main-table { padding:0 !important; } } --&gt; ________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\nThis is an official email from the U.S. Census Bureau. If you have any questions or comments, please contact us (http://www.census.gov/about/contact-us.html [ http://www.census.gov/about/contact-us.html?utm_campaign=20260126pios1&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]).  \xc2\xa0 \r\nbody .abe-column-block {min-height: 5px;} table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:7px; margin-right:7px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;}\r\n"
