[2026-04-27 10:41:48] Raw text/plain payload: b"Top stories for Jason\r\n\r\n-----\r\n\r\nQuestion: Can I get demonetized from YouTube permanently after getting monetized?\r\n\r\n\r\nAnswer from Geoffrey Verity Schofield\r\n\r\n\r\nYouTube requires 1,000 subscribers and 4,000 watch hours within the past year in order for the channel to be monetized.\r\n\r\nThis probably seems like an insurmountable amount  \r\nRead More: https://www.quora.com/qemail/tc?al_imp=eyJ0eXBlIjogMzMsICJoYXNoIjogIjEwNjY5NTQ5MTQ2NzE4NDIxMTV8MXwxfDI3Mzg3MjU1NyJ9&al_pri=8&aoid=qvnNaZStn3W&aoty=1&aty=4&cp=1&et=2&id=b7f7a2df351f44bc80caad94147337d4&uid=FMv7T9N2AvY\r\n-----\r\nQuestion: What are keyword research types?\r\n\r\n\r\nAnswer from Rajat Murthy\r\n\r\n\r\nThe process of keyword research involves brainstorming and the use of keyword research tools, with popular ones including SEMrush [ https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Semrush ] \r\nRead More: https://www.quora.com/qemail/tc?al_imp=eyJ0eXBlIjogMzMsICJoYXNoIjogIjEwNjY5NTQ5MTQ2NzE4NDIxMTV8MnwxfDE0Nzc3NDM4OTYxOTQ3NjgifQ%3D%3D&al_pri=8&aoid=LlZh6FGvMWS&aoty=1&aty=4&cp=2&et=2&id=b7f7a2df351f44bc80caad94147337d4&uid=FMv7T9N2AvY\r\n-----\r\nQuestion: Can I hire a hacker to spy on my spouse?\r\n\r\n\r\nAnswer from Erik Benson\r\n\r\n\r\nI wasn\xe2\x80\x99t ready for confrontation, just understanding. Insights from Nora Ander [ https://www.quora.com/profile/Nor\xc3\xa5Decrypts ] showed me how digital activity often leaves a \r\nRead More: https://www.quora.com/qemail/tc?al_imp=eyJ0eXBlIjogMzMsICJoYXNoIjogIjEwNjY5NTQ5MTQ2NzE4NDIxMTV8M3wxfDE0Nzc3NDM4OTcwMDU1MzYifQ%3D%3D&al_pri=8&aoid=oY0CPPrrpf6&aoty=1&aty=4&cp=3&et=2&id=b7f7a2df351f44bc80caad94147337d4&uid=FMv7T9N2AvY\r\n-----\r\nNEVER GIVE UP\r\n\r\nGod has a purpose why\r\nYou're still breathing and alive\r\nYou escape that incident and circumstances\r\nYou're where you're presently\r\nYou're born into that family or married to that person\r\nYou're at a parti...\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nRead More: https://www