[2026-04-27 10:41:56] Raw text/plain payload: b'Explore Art, Creativity, and Real-World Data During CCW 2026!  \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nUnited States Census Bureau [ https://www.census.gov/en.html?utm_campaign=20251216sis&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nStatistics in Schools [ https://www.census.gov/schools?utm_campaign=20251216sis&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nKick Off the New Year With Data-Driven Creativity!\r\nccw2026banner [ https://www.census.gov/programs-surveys/sis/resources/create-with-data.html?utm_campaign=20251216sis&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n\r\nToday\xe2\x80\x99s the first day of Crayola Creativity Week 2026! Join us in celebrating children\xe2\x80\x99s creativity and making data come to life all week long (Jan. 26-Feb.1) with the engaging, grade-appropriate activities and resources designed to boost students\xe2\x80\x99 artistic and digital literacy skills on our Create with Data [ https://www.census.gov/programs-surveys/sis/resources/create-with-data.html?utm_campaign=20251216sis&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] webpage.\r\n\r\nFrom celebrating statehood anniversaries and national observances like Earth Day to exploring the history of popular last names, embarking on a data-driven, cross-country scavenger hunt, and creating bar graphs, these creative resources are sure to spark your students\xe2\x80\x99 curiosity and creativity.\r\n\r\nShare these data-driven art projects and other creative resources below to encourage students to use their imagination, showcase what they\xe2\x80\x99ve learned, and enhance their civic and statistical literacy skills!\r\n\r\n*Explore Here* [ https://www.census.gov/programs-surveys/sis/resources/create-with-data.html?utm_campaign=20251216sis&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\nCWD [ https://www.census.gov/programs-surveys/sis/resources/create-with-data.html?utm_campaign=20251216sis&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n\r\n*Bring Art to Life With Kid-Friendly Data*\r\n\r\n\r\n  * Data-Driven Art Ideas Handout [ https://www.census.gov/programs-surveys/sis/resources/create-with-data/bring-art-to-life.html?utm_campaign=20251216sis&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n\r\n*Learn About Your State*\r\n\r\n\r\n  * Changes in My State (Classroom Activity) [ https://www.census.gov/programs-surveys/sis/activities/math/state-changes.html?utm_campaign=20251216sis&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n  * Scavenger Hunt: Where Is Gina the Geographer? (Classroom Activity) [ https://www.census.gov/programs-surveys/sis/activities/geography/scavenger-hunt.html?utm_campaign=20251216sis&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n  * State Facts for Students (Data Tool) [ https://www.census.gov/programs-surveys/sis/resources/data-tools/state-facts.html?utm_campaign=20251216sis&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n\r\n*Discover Creative Writing Exercises*\r\n\r\n\r\n  * Narratives and Names (Classroom Activity) [ https://www.census.gov/programs-surveys/sis/activities/english/narratives-and-names.html?utm_campaign=20251216sis&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n  * Writing for Change (Classroom Activity) [ https://www.census.gov/programs-surveys/sis/activities/english/writing-for-change.html?utm_campaign=20251216sis&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n  * Numbers That Tell a Story (Classroom Activity) [ https://www.census.gov/programs-surveys/sis/activities/english/numbers-that-tell-a-story.html?utm_campaign=20251216sis&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n\r\n*Construct Data-Driven Art-Projects*\r\n\r\n\r\n  * My State Data Wheel (Art Project) [ https://www.census.gov/programs-surveys/sis/resources/create-with-data/my-state-data-wheel.html?utm_campaign=20251216sis&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n  * Earth Day Ornament (Art Project) [ https://www.census.gov/programs-surveys/sis/resources/create-with-data/earth-day-ornament.html?utm_campaign=20251216sis&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n\r\n*Coloring Pages and Activity Books*\r\n\r\n\r\n  * Statistics in Schools Coloring Pages [ https://www.census.gov/programs-surveys/sis/resources/games/coloring.html?utm_campaign=20251216sis&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n  * Librarian Appreciation Card [ https://www.census.gov/programs-surveys/sis/resources/games/librarian-week.html?utm_campaign=20251216sis&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n  * Teacher Appreciation Card Coloring Page [ https://www.census.gov/programs-surveys/sis/resources/games/teacherappreciationweek_coloringcard.html?utm_campaign=20251216sis&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n  * Everybody Counts Coloring Book [ https://www2.census.gov/programs-surveys/sis/resources/sis-coloring-english.pdf?utm_campaign=20251216sis&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n  * Everyone Counts Story and Activity Book (English) [ https://www.census.gov/programs-surveys/sis/2020census/2020-resources/pre-k/story-and-activity-book.html?utm_campaign=20251216sis&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n  * Everyone Counts Story and Activity Book (Spanish) [ https://www.census.gov/programs-surveys/sis/2020census/2020-resources/pre-k/libro-de-cuentos-actividades.html?utm_campaign=20251216sis&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n\r\n*Music*\r\n\r\n\r\n  * Counting Way Song [ https://www.census.gov/programs-surveys/sis/resources/games/counting-way.html?utm_campaign=20251216sis&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n  * Everyone Counts Song [ https://www.census.gov/programs-surveys/sis/2020census/2020-resources/pre-k/everyone-counts-song.html?utm_campaign=20251216sis&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n\r\n*Register Here* [ https://www.crayola.com/learning/creativity-week?utm_campaign=20251216sis&utm_content=&utm_id=ccw2026&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nPlan Ahead\r\n\r\nCheck out our resources for National Black History Month [ https://www.census.gov/programs-surveys/sis/resources/fun-facts/black-history.html?utm_campaign=20251216sis&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ], Digital Learning Day [ https://www.census.gov/programs-surveys/sis/activities/geography/scavenger-hunt.html?utm_campaign=20251216sis&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] (Feb.12), Valentine\xe2\x80\x99s Day [ https://www.census.gov/programs-surveys/sis/resources/fun-facts/valentines.html?utm_campaign=20251216sis&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] (Feb.14), Presidents Day [ https://www.census.gov/programs-surveys/sis/resources/warm-up-activities/presidents-day.html?utm_campaign=20251216sis&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] (Feb.16), and Public Schools Week [ https://www.census.gov/programs-surveys/sis/resources/videos/top-10.html?utm_campaign=20251216sis&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] (Feb. 23-27). Use our February Monthly Highlights [ https://www.census.gov/programs-surveys/sis/resources/monthly-highlights/february.html?utm_campaign=20251216sis&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] webpage to plan your month!\r\n\r\n*Learn More* [ https://www.census.gov/programs-surveys/sis/resources/monthly-highlights/february.html?utm_campaign=20251216sis&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nAbout Statistics in Schools\r\n\r\nBring your lessons to life and boost the civic and statistical literacy of your students with resources from the U.S. Census Bureau\xe2\x80\x99s Statistics in Schools (SIS) program. Whether you teach math, geography, history, sociology or English, explore more than 200 free and engaging materials for K-12 students that use census data.\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n  \r\n \r\n\r\n*Stay connected with us!*\r\n\r\nJoin the conversation on social media.\r\n\r\n facebook [ https://www.facebook.com/uscensusbureau/?utm_campaign=20251216sis&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]instagram [ https://www.instagram.com/uscensusbureau/?utm_campaign=20251216sis&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]linkedin [ https://www.linkedin.com/company/us-census-bureau/?utm_campaign=20251216sis&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]twitter [ https://twitter.com/uscensusbureau/?utm_campaign=20251216sis&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] [ https://www.linkedin.com/company/us-census-bureau/?utm_campaign=20251216sis&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]youtube [ https://www.youtube.com/user/uscensusbureau/?utm_campaign=20251216sis&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]  \r\n\r\nSUBSCRIBER SERVICES:\r\n\r\nSubscriber Settings [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USCENSUS/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 Remove me from All Subscriptions  [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USCENSUS/subscriber/one_click_unsubscribe?verification=5.76359f46a06559a62e8e0404a80cc7e5&destination=jasonnorman66994%40gmail.com ]\xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0Help [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/ ]\r\n\r\n \r\n&lt;!-- /* template top padding on mobile */ @media only screen and (max-width: 480px) { table#flexible-abe-main-table { padding:0 !important; } } --&gt; ________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\nThis is an official email from the U.S. Census Bureau. If you have any questions or comments, please co