[2026-04-27 10:41:58] Raw text/plain payload: b"By Joseph Razo\r\nALGORAND: The Underdog No One Is Betting On.\r\n\r\nJoseph Razo (https://medium.com/@j.razo7869?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769447756617-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------94d17f74_bb68_4889_adbd_8b4da041db65--------2d9d33acc198)\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nJanuary 26, 2026\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\n9 min read\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nView on Medium (https://medium.com/p/12c1a712038c?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769447756617-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------94d17f74_bb68_4889_adbd_8b4da041db65--------2d9d33acc198)\r\n\r\nBy Joseph Razo\r\n\r\nJanuary 26, 2026\r\n\r\n\xc2\xb7\xc2\xb7\xc2\xb7\r\nDisclaimer: This article is for informational and educational purposes only and does not constitute financial advice. Cryptocurrency and blockchain investments involve risk. DYOR (Do Your Own Research) and consult a qualified professional before making any financial decisions.\r\n\r\n\xc2\xb7\xc2\xb7\xc2\xb7\r\nMost revolutions don't announce themselves.\r\n\r\nThey don't arrive with fireworks or viral hashtags. They emerge slowly, through standards, patents, pilot programs, and decisions made far from retail traders and Crypto Twitter timelines. By the time the public notices, the architecture is already in place.\r\n\r\nThat's exactly what's happening right now in blockchain.\r\n\r\nWhile market attention remains fixated\xe2\x80\xa6\r\n\r\nContinue reading (https://medium.com/p/12c1a712038c?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769447756617-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------94d17f74_bb68_4889_adbd_8b4da041db65--------2d9d33acc198)\r\nThis is a member-only story and can only be read on Medium.\r\n\r\nSent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com by Joseph Razo on Medium\r\nUnsubscribe (https://medium.com/me/email-settings/50207bf5a022/4c989b5a60fa?type=noSetting&newsletterV3Id=2d9d33acc198&source=email-50207bf5a022-1769447756617-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------94d17f74_bb68_4889_adbd_8b4da041db65--------2d9d33acc198)\r\n from this writer's email notifications\r\nManage your email settings (https://medium.com/me/settings/notifications?hash=4c989b5a60fa&userId=50207bf5a022&settingsRouteHash=%23manageSubscriptions&source=email-50207bf5a022-1769447756617-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------94d17f74_bb68_4889_adbd_8b4da041db65--------2d9d33acc198)\r\n\r\n3500 South DuPont Highway, Suite IQ-101, Dover,\xc2\xa0DE\xc2\xa019901\r\nCareers (https://medium.com/jobs-at-medium/work-at-medium-959d1a85284e?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769447756617-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------94d17f74_bb68_4889_adbd_8b4da041db65--------2d9d33acc198)\r\n\xc2\xb7Help Center (https://help.medium.com/hc/en-us?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769447756617-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------94d17f74_bb68_4889_adbd_8b4da041db65--------2d9d33acc198)\r\n\xc2\xb7Privacy Policy (https://policy.medium.com/medium-privacy-policy-f03bf92035c9?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769447756617-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------94d17f74_bb68_4889_adbd_8b4da041db65--------2d9d33acc198)\r\n\xc2\xb7Terms of service (https://policy.medium.com/medium-terms-of-service-9db0094a1e0f?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769447756617-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------94d17f74_bb68_4889_adbd_8b4da041db65--------2d9d33acc198)"
