[2026-04-27 10:42:00] Raw text/plain payload: b'Compounding Quality Center of Excellence  \r\n   \r\n*Registration is open for **February **training courses* \r\n\r\nThere\xe2\x80\x99s still time to register for two instructor-led courses in February at the National Center for Therapeutics Manufacturing in College Station, Texas, offered in partnership with the Parenteral Drug Association (PDA):\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n\r\n  * Quality Management Systems (QMS) [ https://www.train.org/main/course/1123845/live-event?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ],\xc2\xa0Feb. 10-11: Learn how to\xc2\xa0establish\xc2\xa0an effective quality management system and build a culture of quality at your facility, including the critical role senior leadership plays in the process.\xc2\xa0 \r\n\r\n  * Data\xc2\xa0Integrity [ https://www.train.org/main/course/1123848/live-event?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ], Feb.\xc2\xa012-13:\xc2\xa0Learn from a\xc2\xa0former FDA\xc2\xa0drug\xc2\xa0investigator\xc2\xa0who\xc2\xa0uncovered data integrity\xc2\xa0issues at manufacturing facilities\xc2\xa0around\xc2\xa0the globe.\xc2\xa0Build\xc2\xa0the documentation and quality system\xc2\xa0expertise\xc2\xa0your outsourcing facility needs to\xc2\xa0operate\xc2\xa0confidently through reliable data and information management. Gain practical tools to design and implement processes that collect and\xc2\xa0use\xc2\xa0data while ensuring\xc2\xa0the data\xc2\xa0are\xc2\xa0complete,\xc2\xa0consistent\xc2\xa0and\xc2\xa0accurate.\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0 \r\n\r\nThese\xc2\xa0courses\xc2\xa0will\xc2\xa0help participants\xc2\xa0learn how to\xc2\xa0apply best practices\xc2\xa0that\xc2\xa0protect patient safety and\xc2\xa0comply\xc2\xa0with\xc2\xa0FDA standards. Participants also will learn about the types of issues FDA investigators\xc2\xa0look for during an inspection.\xc2\xa0The cost of each course is $249.\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nVisit\xc2\xa0our\xc2\xa0instructor-led [ https://www.fda.gov/drugs/compounding-quality-center-excellence/compounding-quality-center-excellence-instructor-led-trainings?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\xc2\xa0and\xc2\xa0self-guided online [ https://www.fda.gov/drugs/compounding-quality-center-excellence/compounding-quality-center-excellence-self-guided-online-trainings?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\xc2\xa0training\xc2\xa0webpages\xc2\xa0for more\xc2\xa0courses.\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n  \r\n\r\nFDA\xe2\x80\x99s Compounding Quality Center of Excellence [ https://www.fda.gov/drugs/human-drug-compounding/compounding-quality-center-excellence?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] aims to improve the quality of compounded drugs, especially those made at outsourcing facilities. We encourage outsourcing facilities and others to get involved with the Center of Excellence by taking our training courses, in-person and online, attending our annual conference and other activities.\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n  \r\n\r\n"This is an automated message delivery system, replying to this message will not reach the FDA. Contact us at CompoundingQualityCoE@fda.hhs.gov <compoundingqualitycoe@fda.hhs.gov> or (866) 405-5367 or (301) 796-6707."\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nStay Connected with U.S. Food and Drug Administration: Facebook [ https://www.facebook.com/FDA?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0Twitter [ https://twitter.com/US_FDA?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\xc2\xa0 Youtube [ https://www.youtube.com/user/USFoodandDrugAdmin?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0RSS [ https://www.fda.gov/about-fda/contact-fda/subscribe-podcasts-and-news-feeds?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] SUBSCRIBER SERVICES:\r\nManage Subscriptions [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 Unsubscribe All [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/subscriber/one_click_unsubscribe?verification=5.ee0243ee8741fe358146537aecf40e1e&destination=jasonnorman66994%40gmail.com ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 Help [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/ ]  \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n This email was sent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com using GovDelivery Communications Cloud on behalf of: U.S. Food and Drug Administration \xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0\r\n10903 New Hampshire Ave\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0Silver Spring, MD \xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0 20993-0002\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa01-888-INFO-FDA GovDelivery logo [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\nbody .abe-column-block { min-height: 5px; } table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:10px; margin-right:10px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;}\r\n'
