[2026-04-27 10:42:10] Raw text/plain payload: b'Putting you in control  ssa.gov\r\n\r\nThe following program policy instructions were updated on 01/23/2026.\r\n\r\n*_Program Operations Manual System_* \r\n*_DI 27001 TN 8_* [ https://secure.ssa.gov/apps10/reference.nsf/lnx/01222026081038PM?opendocument=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]*\xc2\xa0- Introduction*\r\nSummary: The Office of Disability Policy revised this section to provide updated guidance on the introduction to the reconsideration level.\r\n\r\n*_DI 27001 TN 9_* [ https://secure.ssa.gov/apps10/reference.nsf/lnx/01222026081122PM?opendocument=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]*\xc2\xa0- Introduction*\r\nSummary: The Office of Disability Policy revised this POMS section to provide updated guidance on development at the reconsideration level to align with recently revised POMS sections about evidence development and sufficiency of evidence. \r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n [ # ] \r\n\r\n [ # ]\r\n\r\n [ # ]\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nStay Connected with Social Security:\r\n\r\n \xc2\xa0 Like us on Facebook [ https://www.facebook.com/socialsecurity?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] Find us on X [ https://twitter.com/socialsecurity?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] Watch us on Youtube [ https://www.youtube.com/socialsecurityonline?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] Instagram [ https://www.instagram.com/socialsecurity/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] Social Security Matters Blog [ http://blog.ssa.gov?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] Govdelivery [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USSSA/subscriber/new ] \xc2\xa0 \r\n\r\nJoin the millions and discover your benefits!\r\nOpen a my Social Security [ http://www.socialsecurity.gov/myaccount/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] account.\r\n\r\nSUBSCRIBER SERVICES:\r\nManage Subscriptions [ https://public