[2026-04-27 10:42:15] Raw text/plain payload: b"Here's a quick note on what's coming up as we wind down the month of January.  \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nUnited States Census Bureau [ https://www.census.gov/about/event-calendar.html?utm_campaign=20260126cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\n?? This Week: Census Bureau Data Releases!\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nUpcoming Data Releases Jan2026 [ https://www.census.gov/about/event-calendar.html?utm_campaign=20260126cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n\r\nStay tuned for these upcoming Census Bureau data releases!\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n??\xc2\xa0January 27: Vintage 2025 Population Estimates [ https://www.census.gov/programs-surveys/popest/about/schedule.html?utm_campaign=20260126cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n?? January 27: 2024 Small Area Income and Poverty Estimates [ https://www.census.gov/programs-surveys/saipe.html?utm_campaign=20260126cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\xc2\xa0\r\n??\xc2\xa0January 29: 2020-2024 American Community Survey 5-Year Estimates [ https://www.census.gov/programs-surveys/acs/news/data-releases/2024/release-schedule.html?utm_campaign=20260126cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n??\xc2\xa0January 29: 2024 Community Resilience Estimates [ https://www.census.gov/programs-surveys/community-resilience-estimates.html?utm_campaign=20260126cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n\r\nCheck out our event calendar for more.\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*Learn More* [ https://www.census.gov/about/event-calendar.html?utm_campaign=20260126cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n??\xef\xb8\x8f Crayola Creativity Week\r\n\r\nStatistics in Schools: Crayola Creativity Week [ https://www.census.gov/programs-surveys/sis/resources/create-with-data.html?utm_campaign=20260126cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n\r\nOur Statistics in Schools program is excited to be a part of Crayola Creativity Week, which is officially underway and runs through February 1.\r\n\r\nCheck out our featured activities as we highlight how you can create with Census Bureau data.\r\n\r\n*Create with Data * [ https://www.census.gov/programs-surveys/sis/resources/create-with-data.html?utm_campaign=20260126cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n?? 2026 LED Partnership Workshop: Call for Presentations\r\n\r\nThe Census Bureau invites you to submit a proposal to present virtually at the 2026 Local Employment Dynamics (LED) Partnership Hybrid Workshop May 12-13. The deadline to submit a proposal is February 18.\r\n\r\nThe LED Partnership is a collaboration between state data agencies and the Census Bureau to leverage existing data in the development of new sources of economic and demographic information. The theme of this year\xe2\x80\x99s workshop is \xe2\x80\x9cNumbers to Narratives: Data for Better Decisions.\xe2\x80\x9d\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nClick the button below for detailed proposal guidance and questions about the workshop.\r\n\r\n*Learn More* [ https://lehd.ces.census.gov/workshops_webinars/workshop/2026.html?utm_campaign=20260126cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n?? Economic Indicators\r\n\r\n*January 26:* Advance Report on Durable Goods \xe2\x80\x94 Manufacturers' Shipments, Inventories, and Orders [ https://www.census.gov/manufacturing/m3/index.html?utm_campaign=20260126cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\nNovember 2025 (originally scheduled for December 24, 2025)\r\n\r\n*January 29:* Full Report \xe2\x80\x94 Manufacturers' Shipments, Inventories and Orders [ https://www.census.gov/manufacturing/m3/index.html?utm_campaign=20260126cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\nNovember 2025 (originally scheduled for January 7, 2025)\r\n\r\n*January 29:* U.S. International Trade in Goods and Services [ https://www.census.gov/foreign-trade/index.html?utm_campaign=20260126cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\nNovember 2025 (originally scheduled for January 8, 2025)\r\n\r\n*January 29:* Monthly Wholesale Trade: Sales and Inventories [ https://www.census.gov/wholesale/index.html?utm_campaign=20260126cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\nNovember 2025 (originally scheduled for January 8, 2025)\r\n\r\n*Economic Indicators* [ https://www.census.gov/economic-indicators/calendar-listview.html?utm_campaign=20260126cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n?? Upcoming Webinars\r\n\r\n*January 27:* Essential Skills for Finding ACS Data on data.census.gov [ https://www.census.gov/data/academy/webinars/2026/essential-skills-for-finding-acs-data.html?utm_campaign=20260126cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n\r\n*February 18:* Unlocking NAICS 5- and 6-Digit Details in the Quarterly Workforce Indicator Data Set [ https://www.census.gov/data/academy/webinars/2026/unlocking-naics-5-6-digit-details.html?utm_campaign=20260126cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n\r\n*February 25:* Introduction to the American Community Survey Public Use Microdata Sample (PUMS) Files [ https://www.census.gov/data/academy/webinars/2026/intro-to-acs-pums-files.html?utm_campaign=20260126cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n\r\n*Webinars* [ https://www.census.gov/data/academy/webinars/upcoming.html?utm_campaign=20260126cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nStay Connected with the Census Bureau\r\n\r\nFollow us on our social media channels, Facebook [ https://www.facebook.com/uscensusbureau?utm_campaign=20260126cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ], Instagram [ https://www.instagram.com/uscensusbureau/?utm_campaign=20260126cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ], LinkedIn [ https://www.linkedin.com/company/us-census-bureau?utm_campaign=20260126cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ], Twitter/X [ https://x.com/uscensusbureau?utm_campaign=20260126cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ], and\xc2\xa0YouTube [ https://www.youtube.com/user/uscensusbureau?utm_campaign=20260126cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ], so you never miss an update.\r\n\r\nStay Connected With Us on Social Media [ https://www.census.gov/about/contact-us/social_media.html?utm_campaign=20260126cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n\r\n*Follow Us* [ https://www.census.gov/about/contact-us/social_media.html?utm_campaign=20260126cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nIn Case You Missed It\r\n\r\nA family of four unpacking a moving truck outside of a new home. [ https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2026/2024-state-to-state-migration.html?utm_campaign=20260126cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n\r\nWhere are people moving in the United States?\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nFind out with our new state-level statistics on geographic mobility and place of birth based on 2024 American Community Survey 1-year estimates.\r\n\r\n*Explore* [ https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2026/2024-state-to-state-migration.html?utm_campaign=20260126cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nAbout the Census Bureau\r\n\r\nWe serve as the nation\xe2\x80\x99s leading provider of quality data about its people and economy.\xc2\xa0The Census Bureau is the federal government's largest statistical agency. As the world\xe2\x80\x99s premier statistical agency, we are dedicated to making our nation a better place. Policy-makers, businesses, and the public use our data to make informed decisions.\r\n\r\nSubscribe [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USCENSUS/signup/34555 ] | Manage Subscriptions [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USCENSUS/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] | Unsubscribe [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USCENSUS/subscriber/one_click_unsubscribe?verification=5.76359f46a06559a62e8e0404a80cc7e5&destination=jasonnorman66994%40gmail.com ] | Help [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/s/?utm_campaign=20260126cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n\r\n*Share This * [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USCENSUS/bulletins/4062bbf ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n  \r\n \r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\nThis is an official email from the U.S. Census Bureau. If you have any questions or comments, please contact us (http://www.census.gov/about/contact-us.html [ http://www.census.gov/about/contact-us.html?utm_campaign=20260126cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]).  \xc2\xa0 \r\nbody .abe-column-block {min-height: 5px;} table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:7px; margin-right:7px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;}\r\n"
