W23Hi9zj5hrhnNr01QsBDH0zXhw6unjdrM4d-2FDu4DOoWuiQ0kPmudOoPnl514c2KTMk9vEBc8F7fu39r8-2Biyk1zMUyOtd19updE0Hg-2BTvz2slmjEiRQwDNEgwFiO-2BeL6PPjQzMD9ipfRTJ5rG5iWekwaxea1zKvbPMKL5aH79vvU7fh7cDLKjV4puZM0mk9JP3l6lrJc-2BI4CwkbcQ9bcGw5j45DKNEA3-2Bue3UJFXxXfSIIoxB\r\n)By Lora Shinn\r\n\r\nBuried underneath the buzz about the new slate of federal tax\r\nbreaks is a pretty big caveat: The higher your income, the\r\nsmaller the deductions may be. Fortunately, when it comes to\r\ntaxes, income is more of a paper construct. You might be able to\r\ndial it down to where it needs to be \xe2\x80\x94 and give your retirement\r\nsavings a kickstart \xe2\x80\x94 without earning a penny less.Keep&nbsp;reading (\r\nhttps://ablink.newsletter.sofi.com/ls/click?upn=u001.k-2FImUMyJvquSjfrastfytIPj6h1-2BVfWjnUDDp-2FeYQFJgaQjEiLCkaMTJKxwAZUjvkbcz2J-2F-2Bvkkm4RkqNwJQi1D5eTf19CJ6zIw8CFn3NPodZjeKi-2BkTnyjz7SMOu3QlYBl9iUlJTxNECpLXBGjAsVlZDAZjX7KT-2BY1-2Bj9pe15r1mlPrgbGneezz5v49gxIQnq9qCvO5Ly-2BbTlJ3niihGT0VHc94xBehWKbFQ9bcaQuABC69BC5PPFp-2BJm9ROrbymtVl_Hvirw9jLOYnqUg7ucIAtvDa4JCWhfjePQT8cfdKWfeKaKK6WyzUu0MT5hcL83ezarLAJeFzEeRP-2BR0XWfLa6c8WoKOnQfqKxHB1ySPioptH3bP-2F8iRwCyQvlGaNSsvr0VHYOArdD5Vh-2BRJdgru-2BN8T4bWIuN0OU1J0SC52Gn8Y2ZuHnFwRWF1iOFBxagBPmDerzW52SimoV1oNR9rZWq2C6bxltNuEV4Fi3QGAuqAMxIpoV1Ii4QM3QB2-2BYYObiLdxB-2F0mMnOptny1B5peTx6BQKsr4J8VigR2KezNYE1cNkd7EGKT6XmjrYzMps5yp-2Bz-2BQcSoYmoGPYCHdZRDYGDF8UIeYzCrq1wmdCx3ay16DDrQUJoLoJyFs0qGmIyumnBrvslK8Y8Ptvoy1u4YROyG6GXguVqq6o87YFafhZfQv5ANTAdPZSf0HX0Eoxm3OcuOnwQQhPzZqLShZGO4MIW4I3XVJBzVpEEVEAJTsOJkYCx-2F251fqVT4QgPE30WAWSDgZ-2FrJc102W-2F-2BbxW23Hi9zj5hrhnNr01QsBDH0zXhw6unjdrM4d-2FDu4DOoWuiQ0kPmudOoPnl514c2KTMk9vEBc8F7fu39r8-2Biyk1zMUyOvY1lSejUaykSD9j173tqs2aeaMwBTVQmfAlnaoTbwb48N1mj4JDXMYiMefMbZruJu13HdFCO-2Fb7u79JQqT9MqWc8SKLkWQwqzT0JqydVB4wvRV1Jex1hGJg1SM0YBTv4ktJvJtajz3WNgPukaw14jo )BY&nbsp;THE&nbsp;NUMBER\r\n79\r\nThat\xe2\x80\x99s how many days taxpayers\r\nhave to file 2025 returns.\r\n\r\nTax season officially opens today, and the sooner you file, the\r\nsooner you\xe2\x80\x99ll get your refund (if you\xe2\x80\x99re getting one). Just make\r\nsure to wait until you\xe2\x80\x99ve gotten all your forms, including your\r\nW-2 or 1099. Those can reflect bonuses or other adjustments that\r\naren\xe2\x80\x99t included in your last paystub, and processing could be\r\ndelayed if the figures don\xe2\x80\x99t match.\r\n\r\nA few other tips:\r\n\r\n* If you\xe2\x80\x99re not sure whether to do your own taxes, ask\r\nyourselfthese questions \r\n( https://ablink.newsletter.sofi.com/ls/click?upn=u001.k-2FImUMyJvquSjfrastfytIPj6h1-2BVfWjnUDDp-2FeYQFJgaQjEiLCkaMTJKxwAZUjviJLWmX74k68vUEs5NzR6l7sYpAd5fze1nKC0-2FebqNBLrNkxmbb4oPPe5kr64Q5CJLvqXKmzlcujmoonR2xiOc6WtyZDCArE3LRo4d52A9TpSUYXi56HPWKyit7qWcAdEqA58LSNNf1UWRcxJ008dIICHZ1-2FExdmyLvGjplG98fs-3Dmdt5_Hvirw9jLOYnqUg7ucIAtvDa4JCWhfjePQT8cfdKWfeKaKK6WyzUu0MT5hcL83ezarLAJeFzEeRP-2BR0XWfLa6c8WoKOnQfqKxHB1ySPioptH3bP-2F8iRwCyQvlGaNSsvr0VHYOArdD5Vh-2BRJdgru-2BN8T4bWIuN0OU1J0SC52Gn8Y2ZuHnFwRWF1iOFBxagBPmDerzW52SimoV1oNR9rZWq2C6bxltNuEV4Fi3QGAuqAMxIpoV1Ii4QM3QB2-2BYYObiLdxB-2F0mMnOptny1B5peTx6BQKsr4J8VigR2KezNYE1cNkd7EGKT6XmjrYzMps5yp-2Bz-2BQcSoYmoGPYCHdZRDYGDF8UIeYzCrq1wmdCx3ay16DDrQUJoLoJyFs0qGmIyumnBrvslK8Y8Ptvoy1u4YROyG6GXguVqq6o87YFafhZfQv5ANTAdPZSf0HX0Eoxm3OcuOnwQQhPzZqLShZGO4MIW4I3XVJBzVpEEVEAJTsOJkYCx-2F251fqVT4QgPE30WAWSDgZ-2FrJc102W-2F-2BbxW23Hi9zj5hrhnNr01QsBDH0zXhw6unjdrM4d-2FDu4DOoWuiQ0kPmudOoPnl514c2KTMk9vEBc8F7fu39r8-2Biyk1zMUyOtAHG6Sxs8CGG4WxIQoXhOvm8qiym5qgst6cPJG5wPykx-2FgrBIeXsGGY9qt6mSM-2FLfgg1zW9OqYELGI21l9vQA7YnfiDz8jkpkntry2ojWwJomqZe95nWMMVGLdxcJq2pA60iaa1XmvLInuH-2Bomnnk5 )\r\n.\r\n* If your adjusted gross income (AGI) \r\n( https://ablink.newsletter.sofi.com/ls/click?upn=u001.k-2FImUMyJvquSjfrastfytMYmcBcQHVs8OUDAoocJCaox9csz7Zi1kFEAoVlL6k9BpTUub-2FinY-2B2mb4Z655RmoB9HoZ96D0BdgtDGmKNkpEvpEHOlX7f0CR1wFrUud2nkV1E-2Fpa-2B1iNtctPl11Hx3vrxRjD-2FuSiYW80l5BfTLQQTYlh7CDNISZWkkAZVh9JmrwZsg_Hvirw9jLOYnqUg7ucIAtvDa4JCWhfjePQT8cfdKWfeKaKK6WyzUu0MT5hcL83ezarLAJeFz