[2026-04-27 10:42:22] Raw text/plain payload: b"Learn how to navigate and access American Community Survey data through the Census Bureau's primary data platform.  \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nUnited States Census Bureau [ https://www.census.gov/data/academy/webinars/2026/essential-skills-for-finding-acs-data.html?utm_campaign=20260126cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nWebinar: Essential Skills for Finding ACS Data [ https://www.census.gov/data/academy/webinars/2026/essential-skills-for-finding-acs-data.html?utm_campaign=20260126cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n\r\nJoin us Tuesday for an introductory webinar on how to pinpoint the American Community Survey (ACS) data you need on data.census.gov. We'll use real-world examples, show you how to export and download your findings, and more.\r\n\r\nThis webinar is perfect for learning the essentials of data.census.gov, from conducting effective searches for current ACS estimates to locating specific demographic and housing tables.\r\n\r\n*Join Us* [ https://www.census.gov/data/academy/webinars/2026/essential-skills-for-finding-acs-data.html?utm_campaign=20260126cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n\r\n*Date:* Tuesday, January 27\r\n*Time:* 2:00 p.m. ET\r\n\r\n*WebEx Event Number (if needed):\xc2\xa0*2830 112 4925\r\n*WebEx Event Password (if needed):*\xc2\xa0#Census26\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nStay Connected with the Census Bureau\r\n\r\nFollow us on our social media channels, Facebook [ https://www.facebook.com/uscensusbureau?utm_campaign=20260126cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ], Instagram [ https://www.instagram.com/uscensusbureau/?utm_campaign=20260126cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ], LinkedIn [ https://www.linkedin.com/company/us-census-bureau?utm_campaign=20260126cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ], Twitter/X [ https://x.com/uscensusbureau?utm_campaign=20260126cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ], and\xc2\xa0YouTube [ https://www.youtube.com/user/uscensusbureau?utm_campaign=20260126cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ], so you never miss an update.\r\n\r\nStay Connected With Us on Social Media [ https://www.census.gov/about/contact-us/social_media.html?utm_campaign=20260126cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n\r\n*Follow Us* [ https://www.census.gov/about/contact-us/social_media.html?utm_campaign=20260126cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nUpcoming Webinars\r\n\r\n  * *February 18:* Unlocking NAICS 5- and 6-Digit Details in the Quarterly Workforce Indicator Data Set [ https://www.census.gov/data/academy/webinars/2026/unlocking-naics-5-6-digit-details.html?utm_campaign=20260126cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n  * *February 25:* Introduction to the American Community Survey Public Use Microdata Sample (PUMS) Files [ https://www.census.gov/data/academy/webinars/2026/intro-to-acs-pums-files.html?utm_campaign=20260126cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nAbout data.census.gov [ https://data.census.gov/?utm_campaign=20260126cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n\r\nData.census.gov [ https://data.census.gov/?utm_campaign=20260126cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\xc2\xa0is the primary platform to access data and digital content from the U.S. Census Bureau. We continuously update\xc2\xa0data.census.gov [ https://data.census.gov/?utm_campaign=20260126cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] with new data from our most popular survey and programs, as well as system enhancements to improve your experience on the platform.\r\n\r\nWe\xe2\x80\x99re here to help with your data needs:\r\n\r\n\r\n  * Visit our data.census.gov Resources page [ https://www.census.gov/data/what-is-data-census-gov.html?utm_campaign=20260126cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\xc2\xa0for educational materials \r\n  * Learn about\xc2\xa0Microdata Access [ https://www.census.gov/data/what-is-data-census-gov/guidance-for-data-users/how-to-materials-for-using-the-microdata-access.html?utm_campaign=20260126cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\xc2\xa0and the\xc2\xa0Census Data API [ https://www.census.gov/data/what-is-data-census-gov/guidance-for-data-users/how-to-materials-for-using-the-census-api.html?utm_campaign=20260126cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n  * Request a\xc2\xa0data.census.gov [ https://data.census.gov/?utm_campaign=20260126cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\xc2\xa0training:\xc2\xa0\r\nced.cedsci.outreach@census.gov \r\n  * Request a training for your local area:\xc2\xa0census.askdata@census.gov <askdata@census.gov> \r\n  * Ask your questions:\xc2\xa0census.data@census.gov \r\n\r\n*Provide Feedback on\xc2\xa0data.census.gov [ https://data.census.gov/?utm_campaign=20260126cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]*\r\n\r\nYour suggestions help determine future improvements we implement to make\xc2\xa0data.census.gov [ https://data.census.gov/?utm_campaign=20260126cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\xc2\xa0work better for you!\r\n\r\n*Send Feedback* <census.data@census.gov> \r\n \r\n\r\nSubscribe [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USCENSUS/signup/34555 ] | Manage Subscriptions [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USCENSUS/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] | Unsubscribe [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USCENSUS/subscriber/one_click_unsubscribe?verification=5.76359f46a06559a62e8e0404a80cc7e5&destination=jasonnorman66994%40gmail.com ] | Help [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/s/?utm_campaign=20260126cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n\r\n*Share This * [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USCENSUS/bulletins/4062e22 ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n  \r\n \r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\nThis is an official email from the U.S. Census Bureau. If you have any questions or comments, please contact us (http://www.census.gov/about/contact-us.html [ http://www.census.gov/about/contact-us.html?utm_campaign=20260126cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]).  \xc2\xa0 \r\nbody .abe-column-block {min-height: 5px;} table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:7px; margin-right:7px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;}\r\n"
