[2026-04-27 10:56:19] Raw text/plain payload: b"2026 - Tigers and Monkeys, Troops Drawups in a Neverending Story\r\nUkraine Update January 27\r\n\r\n2026\xe2\x80\x8a-\xe2\x80\x8aTigers and Monkeys, Troops Drawups in a Neverending Story\r\n\r\nDylan Combellick (https://medium.com/@dylan_combellick?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769506748110-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------e6d77a8f_a992_49f0_b696_c93c48ede27d--------354e45830cd6)\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nJanuary 27, 2026\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\n13 min read\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nView on Medium (https://medium.com/p/5f8118f163e5?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769506748110-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------e6d77a8f_a992_49f0_b696_c93c48ede27d--------354e45830cd6)\r\n\r\nSo Goes the War\r\n\r\nRussian optempo on the front lines is down slightly in January, but this is probably more due to severe weather there than to any other factors. Casualties are up, so that's good news. However, looking back to November 1, the number of daily attacks along the front is also decreasing in the medium term. You can see a slight downward trend over the past three months on the left, alongside the overall upward trend over the past two years on the right.\xc2\xa0\xe2\x80\xa6\r\n\r\nContinue reading (https://medium.com/p/5f8118f163e5?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769506748110-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------e6d77a8f_a992_49f0_b696_c93c48ede27d--------354e45830cd6)\r\nThis is a member-only story and can only be read on Medium.\r\n\r\nSent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com by Dylan Combellick on Medium\r\nUnsubscribe (https://medium.com/me/email-settings/50207bf5a022/92300c33e253?type=noSetting&newsletterV3Id=354e45830cd6&source=email-50207bf5a022-1769506748110-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------e6d77a8f_a992_49f0_b696_c93c48ede27d--------354e45830cd6)\r\n from this writer's email notifications\r\nManage your email settings (https://medium.com/me/settings/notifications?hash=92300c33e253&userId=50207bf5a022&settingsRouteHash=%23manageSubscriptions&source=email-50207bf5a022-1769506748110-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------e6d77a8f_a992_49f0_b696_c93c48ede27d--------354e45830cd6)\r\n\r\n3500 South DuPont Highway, Suite IQ-101, Dover,\xc2\xa0DE\xc2\xa019901\r\nCareers (https://medium.com/jobs-at-medium/work-at-medium-959d1a85284e?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769506748110-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------e6d77a8f_a992_49f0_b696_c93c48ede27d--------354e45830cd6)\r\n\xc2\xb7Help Center (https://help.medium.com/hc/en-us?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769506748110-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------e6d77a8f_a992_49f0_b696_c93c48ede27d--------354e45830cd6)\r\n\xc2\xb7Privacy Policy (https://policy.medium.com/medium-privacy-policy-f03bf92035c9?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769506748110-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------e6d77a8f_a992_49f0_b696_c93c48ede27d--------354e45830cd6)\r\n\xc2\xb7Terms of service (https://policy.medium.com/medium-terms-of-service-9db0094a1e0f?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769506748110-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------e6d77a8f_a992_49f0_b696_c93c48ede27d--------354e45830cd6)"
