[2026-04-27 10:56:20] Raw text/plain payload: b'Coffee is good, but what\'s the limit?\r\nHow Many Cups of Coffee Can Destroy Your Blood Pressure\r\n\r\nCoffee is good, but what\'s the limit?\r\n\r\nShikha | Author (https://medium.com/@SvaCopy?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769506906926-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-84ac01765c52------------------------4d6f35ec_7ae5_40eb_9134_0f9aa081c4c6--------bd173739d135)\r\n\xc2\xa0in\xc2\xa0Write A Catalyst (https://medium.com/write-a-catalyst?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769506906926-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-84ac01765c52------------------------4d6f35ec_7ae5_40eb_9134_0f9aa081c4c6--------bd173739d135)\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nJanuary 27, 2026\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\n5 min read\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nView on Medium (https://medium.com/write-a-catalyst/7d7c4bb9b661?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769506906926-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-84ac01765c52------------------------4d6f35ec_7ae5_40eb_9134_0f9aa081c4c6--------bd173739d135)\r\n\r\nPhoto by Nathan Dumlao (http://redirect.medium.systems/r-1Lv6G3S5Dr?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769506906926-newsletter.subscribeToProfile--7d7c4bb9b661-----------------------4d6f35ec_7ae5_40eb_9134_0f9aa081c4c6--------bd173739d135)\r\n on Unsplash (http://redirect.medium.systems/r-Gu6Z_HViFN?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769506906926-newsletter.subscribeToProfile--7d7c4bb9b661-----------------------4d6f35ec_7ae5_40eb_9134_0f9aa081c4c6--------bd173739d135)\r\n\r\nFirst cup: 6 AM, before my brain fully wakes up.\r\n\r\nSecond cup: 9 AM, when work actually starts.\r\n\r\nThird cup: 3 PM, because why not.\r\n\r\nFourth cup: 3 PM, because why not.\r\n\r\nFifth cup: Sometimes 5 PM if I have evening plans.\r\n\r\nThis was my daily coffee routine for three years. I thought I was fine. Productive. Alter. Just someone who "really loves coffee."\r\n\r\nThen I went to the doctor for something completely unrelated.\r\n\r\n"Your blood pressure is 145/92. That\'s stage 2 hypertension. Are you stressed?"\r\n\r\nI wasn\'t stressed. I was just caffeinated. Constantly.\r\n\r\nHere\'s what nobody tells you about\xe2\x80\xa6\r\n\r\nContinue reading (https://medium.com/write-a-catalyst/7d7c4bb9b661?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769506906926-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-84ac01765c52------------------------4d6f35ec_7ae5_40eb_9134_0f9aa081c4c6--------bd173739d135)\r\nThis is a member-only story and can only be read on Medium.\r\n\r\nSent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com by Shikha | Author on Medium\r\nUnsubscribe (https://medium.com/me/email-settings/50207bf5a022/68421784f560?type=noSetting&newsletterV3Id=bd173739d135&collectionId=84ac01765c52&source=email-50207bf5a022-1769506906926-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-84ac01765c52------------------------4d6f35ec_7ae5_40eb_9134_0f9aa081c4c6--------bd173739d135)\r\n from this writer\'s email notifications\r\nManage your email settings (https://medium.com/me/settings/notifications?hash=68421784f560&userId=50207bf5a022&settingsRouteHash=%23manageSubscriptions&source=email-50207bf5a022-1769506906926-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-84ac01765c52------------------------4d6f35ec_7ae5_40eb_9134_0f9aa081c4c6--------bd173739d135)\r\n\r\n3500 South DuPont Highway, Suite IQ-101, Dover,\xc2\xa0DE\xc2\xa019901\r\nCareers (https://medium.com/jobs-at-medium/work-at-medium-959d1a85284e?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769506906926-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-84ac01765c52------------------------4d6f35ec_7ae5_40eb_9134_0f9aa081c4c6--------bd173739d135)\r\n\xc2\xb7Help Center (https://help.medium.com/hc/en-us?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769506906926-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-84ac01765c52------------------------4d6f35ec_7ae5_40eb_9134_0f9aa081c4c6--------bd173739d135)\r\n\xc2\xb7Privacy Policy (https://policy.medium.com/medium-privacy-policy-f03bf92035c9?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769506906926-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-84ac01765c52------------------------4d6f35ec_7ae5_40eb_9134_0f9aa081c4c6--------bd173739d135)\r\n\xc2\xb7Terms of service (https://policy.medium.com/medium-terms-of-service-9db0094a1e0f?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769506906926-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-84ac01765c52------------------------4d6f35ec_7ae5_40eb_9134_0f9aa081c4c6--------bd173739d135)'
