[2026-04-27 10:56:25] Raw text/plain payload: b"United States Census Bureau [ https://www.census.gov/en.html?utm_campaign=&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nEconomic Indicator Release Updates\r\n\r\nThe U.S. Census Bureau today announced additional revisions to its release calendar for the 2025/2026 economic indicators that were delayed due to the recent lapse in federal funding.\r\n\r\nThe revised dates are:\r\n\r\n*Advance Monthly Sales for Retail and Food Services\r\n*December 2025 [originally scheduled for 1/15/26] 2/10/26\r\n\r\n*Manufacturing and Trade: Inventories and Sales\r\n*November 2025 [originally scheduled for 1/15/26] 2/10/26\r\n\r\n*New Residential Construction\r\n*November 2025 [originally scheduled for 12/16/25] 2/18/26\r\nDecember 2025 [originally scheduled for 1/21/26] 2/18/26\r\n\r\n*Advance Report on Durable Goods--Manufacturers' Shipments, Inventories, and Orders\r\n*December 2025 [originally scheduled for 1/28/26] 2/18/26\r\n\r\n*U.S. International Trade in Goods and Services (FT900)\r\n*December 2025 [originally scheduled for 2/5/26] 2/19/26\r\n\r\n*Advance Economic Indicators Report (International Trade, Retail, & Wholesale)*\r\nDecember 2025 [originally scheduled for 1/28/26] 2/19/26\r\n\r\n*New Residential Sales*\r\nNovember 2025 [originally scheduled for 12/23/25] 2/20/26\r\nDecember 2025 [originally scheduled for 1/27/26] 2/20/26\r\n\r\n*Full Report - Manufacturers' Shipments, Inventories and Orders*\r\nDecember 2025 [originally scheduled for 2/4/26] 2/23/26\r\n\r\n*Monthly Wholesale Trade: Sales and Inventories\r\n*December 2025 [originally scheduled for 2/9/26] 2/24/26\r\n\r\n*Construction Spending (Construction Put in Place)\r\n*November 2025 [originally scheduled for 1/2/26] 2/27/26\r\nDecember 2025 [originally scheduled for 2/2/26] 2/27/26\r\n\r\nThe U.S. Census Bureau will continue updating its economic indicator release calendar in coordination with other agencies and the Office of Management and Budget to address the impacts of the recent lapse in federal funding. We will provide updates to the release schedule as soon as they become available. For more information, see Census' Recovery Plan for Principal Federal Economic Indicators [ https://www.census.gov/econ/indicators/census-pfei-recovery-2025-lapse-in-funding.pdf?utm_campaign=&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ].\r\n\r\n*Read More* [ https://www.census.gov/economic-indicators/calendar-listview.html?utm_campaign=&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nHelp us spread the word about Census Bureau data!\r\n\r\nShare this on social media or forward it to a friend.\r\n\r\n*Share This* [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USCENSUS/bulletins/4064773 ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nAbout the Census Bureau\r\n\r\nWe serve as the nation\xe2\x80\x99s leading provider of quality data about its people and economy.\xc2\xa0The Census Bureau is the federal government's largest statistical agency. As the world\xe2\x80\x99s premier statistical agency, we are dedicated to making our nation a better place. Policy-makers, businesses, and the public use our data to make informed decisions.\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n  \r\n \r\n\r\n*Stay connected with us!*\r\n\r\nJoin the conversation on social media.\r\n\r\n facebook [ https://www.facebook.com/uscensusbureau/?utm_campaign=&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]instagram [ https://www.instagram.com/uscensusbureau/?utm_campaign=&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]linkedin [ https://www.linkedin.com/company/us-census-bureau/?utm_campaign=&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]twitter [ https://twitter.com/uscensusbureau/?utm_campaign=&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] [ https://www.linkedin.com/company/us-census-bureau/?utm_campaign=&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]youtube [ https://www.youtube.com/user/uscensusbureau/?utm_campaign=&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]  \r\n\r\nSUBSCRIBER SERVICES:\r\n\r\nSubscriber Settings [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USCENSUS/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 Remove me from All Subscriptions  [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USCENSUS/subscriber/one_click_unsubscribe?verification=5.76359f46a06559a62e8e0404a80cc7e5&destination=jasonnorman66994%40gmail.com ]\xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0Help [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/ ]\r\n\r\n \r\n&lt;!-- /* template top padding on mobile */ @media only screen and (max-width: 480px) { table#flexible-abe-main-table { padding:0 !important; } } --&gt; ________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\nThis is an official email from the U.S. Census Bureau. If you have any questions or comments, please contact us (http://www.census.gov/about/contact-us.html [ http://www.census.gov/about/contact-us.html?utm_campaign=&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]).  \xc2\xa0 \r\nbody .abe-column-block {min-height: 5px;} table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:7px; margin-right:7px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;}\r\n"
