[2026-04-27 10:56:36] Raw text/plain payload: b'table {border-collapse: collapse;} &lt;!-- /* Make columns expand to 100% on small screens */ @media only screen and (max-width: 480px) { .abe-column-block { min-width: 100%; } } /* Disables Apple clients adding blue color and underline to links and other text */ a[x-apple-data-detectors] { color: inherit !important; text-decoration: none !important; font-size: inherit !important; font-family: inherit !important; font-weight: inherit !important; line-height: inherit !important; } --&gt; \r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0 \r\n\r\nFTC Logo [ https://www.ftc.gov?utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nFTC to Host Virtual Workshop on January 28 on Age Verification Technologies [ https://www.ftc.gov/news-events/news/press-releases/2026/01/ftc-host-virtual-workshop-january-28-age-verification-technologies?utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\nThe Federal Trade Commission is hosting a virtual workshop to discuss a range of issues related to age verification technologies, which can help companies obtain age information of potential visitors to websites and other online services.\r\n\r\nView Press Release [ https://www.ftc.gov/news-events/news/press-releases/2026/01/ftc-host-virtual-workshop-january-28-age-verification-technologies?utm_source=govdelivery ]  \r\n\r\n*More news from the FTC* [ https://www.ftc.gov/news-events/news/press-releases?utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n ________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\xc2\xa0 \r\nFacebook [ https://www.facebook.com/federaltradecommission?utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\nTwitter [ https://twitter.com/FTC?utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\nLinkedIn [ https://www.linkedin.com/company/163780?utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \xc2\xa0 \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \xc2\xa0 \r\n \r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\nTo\xc2\xa0update or delete your subscription at any time, visit your\xc2\xa0subscriber preferences page [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFTC/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ]. If you have questions or problems with the subscription service, please contact subscriber support [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/s/?utm_source=govdelivery ].\xc2\xa0This is a free service provided by the\xc2\xa0Federal Trade Commission [ https://www.ftc.gov/?utm_source=govdelivery ].\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\nThis email was sent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com using GovDelivery Communications Cloud on behalf of: Federal Trade Commission \xc2\xb7 600 Pennsylvania Ave., NW \xc2\xb7 Washington, DC 20580 \xc2\xb7 1-877-382-4357 \xc2\xa0 \r\nbody .abe-column-block { min-height: 5px; } table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:10px; margin-right:10px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;} table.govd_hr {min-width: 100%;}\r\n'
