[2026-04-27 10:56:50] Raw text/plain payload: b'Webinar\r\n\r\nThe U.S. Commercial Service invites *American energy producers, service companies, equipment manufacturers, technology providers, logistics firms, and supply chain partners* to join a high impact webinar on *commercial opportunities in Canada\xe2\x80\x99s energy sector* and how to engage effectively at the Global Energy Show.\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nThis session will focus on *market access, regulatory considerations, and cross border supply chain opportunities* relevant to U.S. companies operating in or entering the Canadian energy market.\r\nCanada remains the United States\xe2\x80\x99 largest energy trading partner. Recent *developments in infrastructure, permitting, and supply chain integration create new opportunities for U.S. firms* to expand their presence, strengthen North American energy security, and build commercial partnerships with Canadian operators.\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*AGENDA*\r\n\r\n*9:00 am:\xc2\xa0 Welcome*\r\n\r\n*9:02 am:\xc2\xa0 U.S. Foreign Commercial Service Canada\xc2\xa0*\r\n\r\n"\xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0Joshua Leibowitz, Principal Commercial Officer\xc2\xa0"\r\n\r\n*9:12 am:\xc2\xa0 Canada\xe2\x80\x99s Energy Sector\xc2\xa0*\r\n\r\n"*\xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0 *Shannon Joseph, Chair, Energy for a Secure Future\xe2\x80\xaf(ESF)\xc2\xa0"\r\n\r\n*9:27 am:\xc2\xa0 EXIM Bank\xc2\xa0*\r\n\r\n"*\xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0 *Regina Gordin, Deputy Managing Director - Eastern Region\xc2\xa0"\r\n\r\n*9:37 am:\xc2\xa0 DMG Events\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0*\r\n\r\n"*\xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0 *Nick Samain, Senior Vice President, dmg Events\xc2\xa0"\r\n\r\n*9:47 am:\xc2\xa0 USA Pavilion\xc2\xa0*\r\n\r\n"*\xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0 *Eric Halsten, Chief Commercial Officer, IMEX.\xc2\xa0"\r\n\r\n*9:52 am:\xc2\xa0 Q&A\xc2\xa0*\r\n\r\n*10:00 am:\xc2\xa0 Event Concludes*\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\n*Register Now* [ https://events.gcc.teams.microsoft.com/event/f8bd6f6a-2e34-43a9-82c6-f84a3ff6cc89@a1d183f2-6c7b-4d9a-b994-5f2f31b3f780 ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nContact Cathy.Gibbons@trade.gov or Connie.Haider@trade.gov <Federico.Bevini@trade.gov>, U.S. Commercial Service\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n  \r\n \r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0International Trade Administration\xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0United States Commercial Service, International Trade Administration  \r\n\r\nThe U.S. Commercial Service is the trade promotion arm of the\r\n*U.S. Department of Commerce\'s International Trade Administration.*\r\nU.S. Commercial Service trade professionals in over 100 U.S. cities and in more than 75 markets \r\nhelp U.S. companies get started in exporting or increase sales to global markets.\r\n\r\n*STAY CONNECTED*\r\n\r\nVisit us on Twitter [ https://twitter.com/exportgov ]\xc2\xa0 Connect with us on LinkedIn [ https://www.linkedin.com/company/uscommercialservice/ ]\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nBookmark and Share [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USITATRADE/bulletins/4065cc4?reqfrom=share ]\r\n\r\nIf you are ready to begin exporting or expand to additional global markets, \r\nplease contact your nearest U.S. Commercial Service office [ https://www.trade.gov/commercial-services-offices-us ] or access exporting resources [ https://www.trade.gov/learn-how-export ].\r\n\r\n*SUBSCRIBER SERVICES*\r\nVisit our User Profile Page [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USITATRADE/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] to update your subscriptions or unsubscribe.\r\nIf you need assistance, please visit\xc2\xa0subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/hc/en-us ].\r\n\r\n \r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\nThis email was sent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com using GovDelivery Communications Cloud on behalf of the International Trade Administration\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7 1401 Constitution Avenue NW \xc2\xb7 Washington, DC 20230 GovDelivery logo [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/ ] \r\nbody .abe-column-block { min-height: 5px; } table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:10px; margin-right:10px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;} table.govd_hr {min-width: 100%;}\r\n'
