[2026-04-27 10:56:51] Raw text/plain payload: b"The U.S. Census Bureau's TIGERweb applications and services have been updated to reflect the latest geospatial data available.  \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nUnited States Census Bureau [ https://www.census.gov/programs-surveys/geography.html?utm_campaign=20260127cnmps1&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nData Update: TIGERweb Applications and Services\r\n\r\nScreenshot from Census Bureau TIGERweb [ https://tigerweb.geo.census.gov/tigerwebmain/TIGERweb_main.html?utm_campaign=20260127cnmps1&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n\r\nThe U.S. Census Bureau's TIGERweb applications and services have been updated to reflect the geospatial data available as of November 2025.\r\n\r\nTIGERweb is a collection of web-based application and service that enable users to visualize our TIGER (Topologically Integrated Geographic Encoding and Referencing system) data through:\r\n\r\nTIGERweb Applications [ https://tigerweb.geo.census.gov/tigerwebmain/TIGERweb_apps.html?utm_campaign=20260127cnmps1&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\nTIGERweb Web Map Service (WMS) [ https://tigerweb.geo.census.gov/tigerwebmain/TIGERweb_wms.html?utm_campaign=20260127cnmps1&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\nTIGERweb Representational State Transfer (REST) Services [ https://tigerweb.geo.census.gov/tigerwebmain/TIGERweb_restmapservice.html?utm_campaign=20260127cnmps1&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n\r\nThe TIGERweb Applications [ https://tigerweb.geo.census.gov/tigerwebmain/TIGERweb_apps.html?utm_campaign=20260127cnmps1&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] provide a simple way to view our geospatial data \xe2\x80\x93 including legal boundaries such as county and place; statistical boundaries such as census blocks and census tracts; roads; and other geographic features \xe2\x80\x93 without Geographic Information System (GIS) software and without downloading data.\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nThe TIGERweb WMS [ https://tigerweb.geo.census.gov/tigerwebmain/TIGERweb_wms.html?utm_campaign=20260127cnmps1&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] and TIGERweb REST [ https://tigerweb.geo.census.gov/tigerwebmain/TIGERweb_restmapservice.html?utm_campaign=20260127cnmps1&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] Services allow users to integrate our data into their own GIS or custom web-based applications.\r\n\r\n*TIGERweb Applications and Services* [ https://tigerweb.geo.census.gov/tigerwebmain/TIGERweb_main.html?utm_campaign=20260127cnmps1&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nAbout the Geography Program\r\n\r\nGeography Division Logo \r\n\r\nGeography is central to the work of the Census Bureau, providing the framework for survey design, sample selection, data collection, tabulation, and dissemination. Geography provides meaning and context to statistical data.\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nUse of the latest and best geographic methodologies is critical to the Census Bureau\xe2\x80\x99s ability to serve as the leading provider of statistical and geospatial data. Our geographic area concepts, information, and statistical data [ https://www.census.gov/programs-surveys/geography.html?utm_campaign=20260127cnmps1&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] must keep pace with the needs of the researchers and analysts who work to understand the changing distribution and characteristics of our people, places, and economy.\r\n\r\n*Share This* [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USCENSUS/bulletins/4065d2c ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n  \r\n \r\n\r\n*Stay connected with us!*\r\n\r\nJoin the conversation on social media.\r\n\r\n facebook [ https://www.facebook.com/uscensusbureau/?utm_campaign=20260127cnmps1&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]instagram [ https://www.instagram.com/uscensusbureau/?utm_campaign=20260127cnmps1&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]linkedin [ https://www.linkedin.com/company/us-census-bureau/?utm_campaign=20260127cnmps1&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]twitter [ https://twitter.com/uscensusbureau/?utm_campaign=20260127cnmps1&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] [ https://www.linkedin.com/company/us-census-bureau/?utm_campaign=20260127cnmps1&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]youtube [ https://www.youtube.com/user/uscensusbureau/?utm_campaign=20260127cnmps1&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]  \r\n\r\nSUBSCRIBER SERVICES:\r\n\r\nSubscriber Settings [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USCENSUS/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 Remove me from All Subscriptions  [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USCENSUS/subscriber/one_click_unsubscribe?verification=5.76359f46a06559a62e8e0404a80cc7e5&destination=jasonnorman66994%40gmail.com ]\xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0Help [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/ ]\r\n\r\n \r\n&lt;!-- /* template top padding on mobile */ @media only screen and (max-width: 480px) { table#flexible-abe-main-table { padding:0 !important; } } --&gt; ________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\nThis is an official email from the U.S. Census Bureau. If you have any questions or comments, please contact us (http://www.census.gov/about/contact-us.html [ http://www.census.gov/about/contact-us.html?utm_campaign=20260127cnmps1&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]).  \xc2\xa0 \r\nbody .abe-column-block {min-height: 5px;} table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:7px; margin-right:7px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;}\r\n"
