[2026-04-27 10:56:58] Raw text/plain payload: b"2026\xe2\x80\x8a-\xe2\x80\x8aChina's MASSIVE Intelligence Coup in the US/UK\r\nUkraine Update January 28\r\n\r\n2026\xe2\x80\x8a-\xe2\x80\x8aChina's MASSIVE Intelligence Coup in the US/UK\r\n\r\nDylan Combellick (https://medium.com/@dylan_combellick?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769594653235-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------e7985f9e_3751_46ad_b6c6_c562404651c6--------354e45830cd6)\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nJanuary 28, 2026\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\n13 min read\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nView on Medium (https://medium.com/p/a4a2fb02153d?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769594653235-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------e7985f9e_3751_46ad_b6c6_c562404651c6--------354e45830cd6)\r\n\r\nSo Goes the War\r\n\r\nAnother day, another Russian assault group in the Pokrovsk region. Attacking in a half-dozen modified minibuses, the group was spotted early, and a swarm of drones fell upon them. None of the vehicles had any anti-drone 'armor' (is that the right word?) on them, just the tops and doors removed for a quick exit. None of the troops was wearing white, either, so they made easy targets on the snow.\r\n\r\nSimilar results were achieved by the 13th Khartiia Brigade of the UAF near Kupiansk.\r\n\r\n-\xe2\x80\x8a-\xe2\x80\x8a-\r\n\r\nTargeting a busload of invaders is good tactics. Targeting a passenger train is\xe2\x80\xa6\r\n\r\nContinue reading (https://medium.com/p/a4a2fb02153d?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769594653235-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------e7985f9e_3751_46ad_b6c6_c562404651c6--------354e45830cd6)\r\nThis is a member-only story and can only be read on Medium.\r\n\r\nSent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com by Dylan Combellick on Medium\r\nUnsubscribe (https://medium.com/me/email-settings/50207bf5a022/dc05af10baf3?type=noSetting&newsletterV3Id=354e45830cd6&source=email-50207bf5a022-1769594653235-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------e7985f9e_3751_46ad_b6c6_c562404651c6--------354e45830cd6)\r\n from this writer's email notifications\r\nManage your email settings (https://medium.com/me/settings/notifications?hash=dc05af10baf3&userId=50207bf5a022&settingsRouteHash=%23manageSubscriptions&source=email-50207bf5a022-1769594653235-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------e7985f9e_3751_46ad_b6c6_c562404651c6--------354e45830cd6)\r\n\r\n3500 South DuPont Highway, Suite IQ-101, Dover,\xc2\xa0DE\xc2\xa019901\r\nCareers (https://medium.com/jobs-at-medium/work-at-medium-959d1a85284e?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769594653235-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------e7985f9e_3751_46ad_b6c6_c562404651c6--------354e45830cd6)\r\n\xc2\xb7Help Center (https://help.medium.com/hc/en-us?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769594653235-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------e7985f9e_3751_46ad_b6c6_c562404651c6--------354e45830cd6)\r\n\xc2\xb7Privacy Policy (https://policy.medium.com/medium-privacy-policy-f03bf92035c9?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769594653235-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------e7985f9e_3751_46ad_b6c6_c562404651c6--------354e45830cd6)\r\n\xc2\xb7Terms of service (https://policy.medium.com/medium-terms-of-service-9db0094a1e0f?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769594653235-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------e7985f9e_3751_46ad_b6c6_c562404651c6--------354e45830cd6)"
