[2026-04-27 10:57:04] Raw text/plain payload: b'January WISE: Exploring a New Career with Ticket to Work [ https://choosework.ssa.gov/wise/ ] \r\n  \r\nFree Webinar\r\nExploring a New Career with Ticket to Work\r\n\r\nJanuary 28, 2026\r\n\r\n3 \xe2\x80\x93 4:30 p.m. ET\r\n\r\nJust a quick reminder that our career\xe2\x80\x91change webinar is happening *TODAY*. We\xe2\x80\x99ll share practical tips for exploring new opportunities and explain how the Ticket to Work Program can support your journey. We hope you\xe2\x80\x99ll join us and take the next step toward a career that fits your goals.\r\n\r\nRegister Now [ https://choosework.ssa.gov/wise/ ]\r\n\r\nOnline: choosework.ssa.gov/wise [ https://choosework.ssa.gov/wise/ ]\r\n\r\nBy Phone: *1-866-968-7842* or *1-866-833-2967* (TTY)\r\n\r\n"You will receive a registration confirmation message with instructions on how to log in to the webinar. Please be sure to check your spam folder. Questions? ""Contact us" [ https://choosework.ssa.gov/contact/ ]"."\r\n\r\nWe look forward to seeing you there!\r\n\r\n*Accessibility Documents for the January WISE Webinar*\r\n\r\nPresentation PDF: https://choosework.ssa.gov/Assets/cw/docs-materials/2026-01-28-Exploring-a-New-Career-with-Ticket-to-Work.pdf\r\n\r\nPresentation Word Document: https://choosework.ssa.gov/Assets/cw/docs-materials/2026-01-28-Exploring-a-New-Career-with-Ticket-to-Work-Text-Only.docx\r\n\r\n*Questions about Ticket to Work?*\r\n\r\nThe Ticket Program supports career development for people ages 18 through 64 who receive Social Security disability benefits (SSDI/SSI) and want to work. Monthly WISE webinars provide information about Social Security programs, Work Incentives, and other resources that may help you or someone you know succeed on the path to financial independence through work.\r\n\r\nEmail us: TicketToWork@ssa.gov\r\n\r\nCall us: 1-866-968-7842 or 1-866-833-2967 (TTY)\r\n\r\nVisit our website: choosework.ssa.gov [ https://choosework.ssa.gov/ ]\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n"Use our Share button to send this information to your family and friends!"\r\n\r\n""Bookmark and Share [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USSSATTW/bulletins/4053e32?reqfrom=share ]""\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n  \r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n  \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n [ https://yourtickettowork.com/web/ttw/en-home ]  \r\n\r\n*Social Security\'s Ticket to Work Program*\r\n\r\n"Call the Ticket to Work Help Line"\r\n\r\n"1-866-968-7842\xc2\xa0\r\n1-866-833-2967 (TTY)\r\n"\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nJoin our text message list now and learn about getting FREE help and support to go back to work or work for the first time. Text TICKET to 1-571-489-5292.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nSocial Security\xe2\x80\x99s Ticket Program supports career development for people ages 18 through 64 who receive Social Security disability benefits (SSDI or SSI) and want to work.\r\n\r\n \r\n STAY CONNECTED: \r\nVisit Us on Facebook [ http://www.facebook.com/choosework ] Visit us on X [ http://twitter.com/chooseworkssa ] Blog [ https://choosework.ssa.gov/blog/index.html ] Visit Us on YouTube [ http://www.youtube.com/user/choosework?feature=watch ] Sign up for email updates [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USSSATTW/subscriber/topics ] \xc2\xa0 \r\n \r\n\r\nSUBSCRIBER PREFERENCES:\r\nManage Preferences [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USSSA/subscriber/new ]\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0Un [ http://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USSSA/subscribers/new ]subscribe [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USSSATTW/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ]\xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0 Help [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/s/ ]\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n This email was sent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com by the Ticket to Work, and was produced and disseminated at U.S. taxpayer expense. GovDelivery logo [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/ ] \r\n \r\nbody .abe-column-block { min-height: 5px; } table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:10px; margin-right:10px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;}\r\n'
