[2026-04-27 10:57:07] Raw text/plain payload: b"On February 11, 2026, learn about the FDA\xe2\x80\x99s General Wellness: Policy for Low Risk Devices, Final Guidance.  \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nIf your email program has trouble displaying this email, view as a webpage [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/bulletins/40668df ].\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nU.S. Food and Drug Administration, CDRH Webinars\r\n\r\nBookmark and Share [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/bulletins/40668df?reqfrom=share ]\r\n\r\nTown Hall \xe2\x80\x93 General Wellness: Policy for Low Risk Devices, Final Guidance\r\n\r\nThe U.S. Food and Drug Administration (FDA) will host a town hall for industry and other interested parties to discuss updates to the General Wellness: Policy for Low Risk Devices, Final Guidance [ https://www.fda.gov/regulatory-information/search-fda-guidance-documents/general-wellness-policy-low-risk-devices?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ], issued on January 6, 2026. This guidance provides clarity to industry and FDA staff on CDRH's policy for low risk products that promote a healthy lifestyle (general wellness products).\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n\r\n  * *Dates: *February 11, 2026 \r\n  * *Time:* 1:00 \xe2\x80\x93 2:00 p.m. ET \r\n  * Registration is not required. \r\n\r\n*View the Town Hall Details* [ https://www.fda.gov/medical-devices/medical-devices-news-and-events/town-hall-general-wellness-policy-low-risk-devices-final-guidance-02112026?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n\r\nQuestions?\r\n\r\nIf you have questions that you wish to submit for possible discussion during the town hall, please email\xc2\xa0digitalhealth@fda.hhs.gov. *All questions must be received by February 4, 2026 to be considered for the discussion*. Questions will not be taken during the live town hall.\r\n\r\nIf you have questions about this town hall, contact the Division of Industry and Consumer Education [ https://www.fda.gov/medical-devices/device-advice-comprehensive-regulatory-assistance/contact-us-division-industry-and-consumer-education-dice?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ].\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n  \r\n \r\n\r\nFollow us on X at @FDADeviceInfo [ https://x.com/FDADeviceInfo?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n\r\n \r\ntwitter [ https://x.com/FDADeviceInfo?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]facebook [ https://www.facebook.com/FDA?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]youtube [ https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC_giJ3xlEL9jUF1YfJdzzuQ?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]LinkedIn [ https://www.linkedin.com/company/fda?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]  \r\n\r\n*Manage Subscriptions* [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 *Unsubscribe All* [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/subscriber/one_click_unsubscribe?verification=5.ee0243ee8741fe358146537aecf40e1e&destination=jasonnorman66994%40gmail.com ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 *Help* [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/ ]\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\nbody .abe-column-block {min-height: 5px;} td {line-height:1;} \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n This email was sent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com using GovDelivery Communications Cloud on behalf of: U.S. Food and Drug Administration \xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0\r\n10903 New Hampshire Ave\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0Silver Spring, MD \xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0 20993-0002\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa01-888-INFO-FDA GovDelivery logo [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\nbody .abe-column-block { min-height: 5px; } table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:10px; margin-right:10px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;}\r\n"
