[2026-04-27 10:57:09] Raw text/plain payload: b"If your email program has trouble displaying this email, view as a webpage [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/bulletins/4067777 ].\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nFDA Voices Insights from FDA leadership and experts into the agency's work to protect public health. \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nA Special Year, New Seal, and Renewed Commitment to the American People\r\n\r\n2026 is a special year for the U.S. Food and Drug Administration. It marks our 120th year of service to this nation. In honor of this occasion, and to help the public better understand who we are and the many functions we fulfill, we\xe2\x80\x99ve recently unveiled an official agency seal, our first ever. It signifies the many public health strides we\xe2\x80\x99ve made over the decades\xe2\x80\x94including this past year\xe2\x80\x94while also inspiring more powerful outcomes to make Americans safer and healthier, and we hope, affirm your trust in us.\r\n\r\nThe FDA\xe2\x80\x99s new seal may at first seem simple. There\xe2\x80\x99s familiar imagery: a snake-entwined staff symbolizes medicine. A badge signifies enforcement and protection. An eagle, most naturally, represents our nation and all of you whom we serve. \xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nBut if you ask any of our committed staff working across a wide variety of disciplines what the seal means to them, they\xe2\x80\x99ll likely tell you it reflects so much more.\r\n\r\n*Read More* [ https://www.fda.gov/news-events/fda-voices/special-year-new-seal-and-renewed-commitment-american-people?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n  \r\n \r\n\r\nStay Connected with U.S. Food and Drug Administration: Facebook [ https://www.facebook.com/FDA?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0Twitter [ https://twitter.com/US_FDA?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\xc2\xa0 Youtube [ https://www.youtube.com/user/USFoodandDrugAdmin?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0RSS [ https://www.fda.gov/about-fda/contact-fda/subscribe-podcasts-and-news-feeds?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] SUBSCRIBER SERVICES:\r\nManage Subscriptions [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 Unsubscribe All [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/subscriber/one_click_unsubscribe?verification=5.ee0243ee8741fe358146537aecf40e1e&destination=jasonnorman66994%40gmail.com ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 Help [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/ ]  \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n This email was sent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com using GovDelivery Communications Cloud on behalf of: U.S. Food and Drug Administration \xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0\r\n10903 New Hampshire Ave\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0Silver Spring, MD \xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0 20993-0002\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa01-888-INFO-FDA GovDelivery logo [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\nbody .abe-column-block { min-height: 5px; } table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:10px; margin-right:10px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;}\r\n"
