[2026-04-27 10:57:18] Raw text/plain payload: b'View as a webpage <https://app.email.forrester.com/e/es?s=332&e=2252269&elqTrackId=062712D84AB1993D35406E117F93EA75&elq=bba93d4661084488a429c23d35c5192d&elqaid=141858&elqat=1&elqak=8AF54BD51A2B7C9691F4449A9A566164846C0C264F911B17115DE05DA048937D6EB1>                \r\n\r\n"Forrester Logo" <https://www.forrester.com?elqTrackId=a446aca53a534955b672d9378ceb15e3&elq=bba93d4661084488a429c23d35c5192d&elqaid=141858&elqat=1&elqCampaignId=24037&elqak=8AF5D3E44B3133509F98D76CE3910A8106790C264F911B17115DE05DA048937D6EB1>                                                          Newsletter \r\nJAN 28, 2026                    \r\n\r\n"Insights at work"            \r\n\r\nHello, GTM Singularity: Turn Ideas Into Action At B2B Summit North America                     \r\n\r\n"Divider"                    \r\n\r\n"Hello_GTM_Singularity"                                          \r\nBuyer autonomy and the prevalence of AI are collapsing go-to-market fault lines. For B2B teams, this presents an opportunity to reset with a new, resilient, and connected GTM approach.                         \r\n\r\nLearn More <https://www.forrester.com/blogs/hello-gtm-singularity-turn-ideas-into-action-at-b2b-summit-north-america/?utm_source=forrester_newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=summit26na&utm_content=blog_frankland&elqTrackId=5e6e518ba04e4705979ecaefb04c52b4&elq=bba93d4661084488a429c23d35c5192d&elqaid=141858&elqat=1&elqCampaignId=24037&elqak=8AF5AB2246B45FFBEA41A736B6BF153E424F0C264F911B17115DE05DA048937D6EB1>                            \r\n\r\n"Forecast_AI_Automation"                                          \r\nForecast: AI And Automation Will Take 6% Of US Jobs By 2030                         \r\nAI will take over increasing numbers of workflows and tasks \xe2\x80\x94 but workflows and tasks aren\xe2\x80\x99t jobs. Find more insight and next steps in this preview of our new forecast on the impact of AI on jobs in the US.                         \r\n\r\nREAD NOW <https://www.forrester.com/blogs/ai-and-automation-will-take-6-of-us-jobs-by-2030/?utm_source=forrester_newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=ai&utm_content=blog_gownder&elqTrackId=417ee4297684455facde72b2adda9503&elq=bba93d4661084488a429c23d35c5192d&elqaid=141858&elqat=1&elqCampaignId=24037&elqak=8AF53A138139AAB03467C3E910969B0960D50C264F911B17115DE05DA048937D6EB1>                        \r\n\r\n"The State Of Business Buying"                                          \r\nThe State Of Business Buying: Risk-Averse Buyers Demand Proof, Not Promises                         \r\nOur latest Buyers\xe2\x80\x99 Journey Survey of nearly 18,000 global business buyers describes a buying climate\xc2\xa0in which AI is everywhere, scrutiny is the norm, and trust is paramount. Learn about the key findings and how organizations can succeed with today\xe2\x80\x99s wary buyers.                         \r\n\r\nREAD NOW <https://www.forrester.com/blogs/state-of-business-buying-2026?utm_source=forrester_newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=b2bm&utm_content=blog_winters&elqTrackId=2e7a12951a5c457ea8bc56cf443f2660&elq=bba93d4661084488a429c23d35c5192d&elqaid=141858&elqat=1&elqCampaignId=24037&elqak=8AF5042B1D25C3DA3C48E61B0ED263E40ABF0C264F911B17115DE05DA048937D6EB1>                        \r\n\r\n"Rise_of_modern_trade_agreement"                                          \r\nThe Rise Of Modern Trade Agreements: Tariff-Proof Your Supply Chain                        \r\nModern trade agreements are reshaping global trade, helping companies stabilize supply chains amid geopolitical and economic shifts. As these pacts expand beyond tariffs into digital and regulatory rules, they\xe2\x80\x99re becoming key strategic tools for how firms operate and grow.                        \r\n\r\nREAD NOW <https://www.forrester.com/blogs/the-rise-of-modern-trade-agreements-tarif-proof-your-supply-chain/?utm_source=forrester_newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=tech&utm_content=blog_rajamani&elqTrackId=3f9a36873b024d469f55480900b7cfde&elq=bba93d4661084488a429c23d35c5192d&elqaid=141858&elqat=1&elqCampaignId=24037&elqak=8AF53A1EBA09785F22F45D94EC238BDB803A0C264F911B17115DE05DA048937D6EB1>                        \r\n\r\nPODCAST                                 \r\n\r\nPractitioner Stories: Building A \xe2\x80\x9cLiquid\xe2\x80\x9d Company At ABN AMRO                                 \r\n\r\n20 JAN 2026                                 \r\n\r\nJorissa Neutelings, chief digital officer at ABN AMRO, discusses the bank\xe2\x80\x99s vision for becoming a fully adaptable, hyperpersonal, modular, and conversational organization that meets customers where they are.                                 \r\n\r\n"CX"                                                               \r\n\r\n"Play Button Icon" <https://www.forrester.com/cx-cast/434-practitioner-stories-building-a-liquid-company-at-abn-amro/?utm_source=forrester_newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=brand&utm_content=cxcast_436&elqTrackId=0dfe3f3079d047d68fcbfa53814a84b1&elq=bba93d4661084488a429c23d35c5192d&elqaid=141858&elqat=1&elqCampaignId=24037&elqak=8AF59774EF672D43E5FF30A7011F266EACA20C264F911B17115DE05DA048937D6EB1>                                                                                                 Listen Now <https://www.forrester.com/what-it-means/ep428-ai-buying-healthcare-jobs ?utm_source=forrester_newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=brand&utm_content=wim_428 &elqTrackId=d3e2fa4dd20449399741b4f94bb2d2ad&elq=bba93d4661084488a429c23d35c5192d&elqaid=141858&elqat=1&elqCampaignId=24037&elqak=8AF51F6864BD227F3208E23BA158F74166D70C264F911B17115DE05DA048937D6EB1>                                   \r\n\r\n"How_to_stand_out_in_answer_engine"                                          \r\nHow To Stand Out In Answer Engines                        \r\nAI and answer engines are rewriting the rules of search visibility for B2B marketers. Download our guide for answer engine optimization strategies to break through to buyers.                        \r\n\r\nGet The Guide <https://www.forrester.com/b2b-marketing/stand-out-in-ai-search-guide/?utm_source=forrester_newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=b2bm&utm_content=ebook_zero_click&elqTrackId=dd90e7bc982d4c21ad90f0eb82b1f736&elq=bba93d4661084488a429c23d35c5192d&elqaid=141858&elqat=1&elqCampaignId=24037&elqak=8AF52F5F0DBAF22FCCAA3868D3FB198FC5340C264F911B17115DE05DA048937D6EB1>                        \r\n\r\nPODCAST                                \r\n\r\nAI\xe2\x80\x99s Impact On B2B Buying, Healthcare, And US Jobs                                \r\n\r\n22 JAN 2026                                \r\n\r\nHow is AI affecting B2B purchasing decisions? We dig into insights from Forrester\xe2\x80\x99s latest Buyers\xe2\x80\x99 Journey Survey to find answers. We also look at AI\xe2\x80\x99s impact on consumer healthcare and its true contribution to layoffs.                                \r\n\r\n"What it means" <https://www.forrester.com/what-it-means/ep428-ai-buying-healthcare-jobs ?utm_source=forrester_newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=brand&utm_content=wim_428 &elqTrackId=533c63e2d4254d1ab08e15d3a7068f0a&elq=bba93d4661084488a429c23d35c5192d&elqaid=141858&elqat=1&elqCampaignId=24037&elqak=8AF51A876CB80AFD31B0581CBD3603970B2B0C264F911B17115DE05DA048937D6EB1>                                                             \r\n\r\n"Play Button Icon" <https://www.forrester.com/what-it-means/ep428-ai-buying-healthcare-jobs ?utm_source=forrester_newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=brand&utm_content=wim_428&elqTrackId=0eed669fc1a3440394504fbf912f684b&elq=bba93d4661084488a429c23d35c5192d&elqaid=141858&elqat=1&elqCampaignId=24037&elqak=8AF5E63868C2189E0CC4B9E2F90CCB5857180C264F911B17115DE05DA048937D6EB1>                                                                                              Listen Now <https://www.forrester.com/what-it-means/ep428-ai-buying-healthcare-jobs ?utm_source=forrester_newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=brand&utm_content=wim_428&elqTrackId=d62e8ffb6d374689825f5972ebb513da&elq=bba93d4661084488a429c23d35c5192d&elqaid=141858&elqat=1&elqCampaignId=24037&elqak=8AF5878081BBA4CA749B17994BCEEF9A6D240C264F911B17115DE05DA048937D6EB1>                                  \r\n\r\nInsights delivered directly to your inbox.                            \r\n\r\nNot a subscriber yet? Click below to get Insights At Work delivered directly to your inbox.                            \r\n\r\nSIGN UP <https://go.forrester.com/blog-subscription-page?elqTrackId=2aaa4a2cd20e4f6486b7e5bdff27be50&elq=bba93d4661084488a429c23d35c5192d&elqaid=141858&elqat=1&elqCampaignId=24037&elqak=8AF5DF152E6F938FC3AC18A11E09A356DCC70C264F911B17115DE05DA048937D6EB1>                                \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nConnect with us:                                                                                                                                   Blogs <https://go.forrester.com/blogs?elqTrackId=fb787fe7766a4ab39d9e8d8bab52668c&elq=bba93d4661084488a429c23d35c5192d&elqaid=141858&elqat=1&elqCampaignId=24037&elqak=8AF52647748C066E53C112ACDE618F6A7ADC0C264F911B17115DE05DA048937D6EB1>                                                                                                                                   "LinkedIn" <https://app.email.forrester.com/e/er?s=332&lid=55946&elqTrackId=36ee485dc8584e618558b1b6793592a9&elq=bba93d4661084488a429c23d35c5192d&elqaid=141858&elqat=1&elqak=8AF55D0EDFDECD2C8EB193F1F1059FC8433A0C264F911B17115DE05DA048937D6EB1>                                                                                                                                   "X" <https://app.email.forrester.com/e/er?s=332&lid=50941&elqTrackId=ca9ea3ac49fb48749394b674c1ae7745&elq=bba93d4661084488a429c23d35c5192d&elqaid=141858&elqat=1&elqak=8AF580CD297E2C5E589897881A0D23DB83DE0C264F911B17115DE05DA048937D6EB1>                                                             