[2026-04-27 10:57:23] Raw text/plain payload: b'We\xe2\x80\x99re starting this year off with some big news - Collabwriting is officially becoming [Cluing](https://app.cluing.io/). \xf0\x9f\x8e\x8a\r\n\r\n**Why the name change?**\r\n\r\nEvery conversation would start with an explanation of what we\xe2\x80\x99re not and confusion on why the name that involvers \xe2\x80\x9cwriting\xe2\x80\x9d when we\xe2\x80\x99re not infact a writing tool. \r\n\r\nSo we decided to take the plunge and settled on a name that better reflects what we do - helping you collect, share, and make sense of unique insights (or better yet - clues).\r\n\r\n**What is staying the same?**\r\n\r\nYour account, your settings, and the features you love are all still here - no extra work for you is involved \xe2\x9c\xa8\r\n\r\n**What is changing?**\r\n\r\nWhat you\xe2\x80\x99ll notice in the following months:\r\n\r\n* **Cluing m**obile apps** **are launching soon and will give you an even better experience of using Cluing on the go\r\n\r\n* **N**ew AI features are going to both deliver key insights and help you curate information by learning from your past snippets of information\r\n\r\n* More** **educational content** **and user stories on how you can improve your productivity and actively build your own knowledge hub\r\n\r\nIf you want to share something with our team or have a story you\xe2\x80\x99d like to share with the community on how Cluing helps you, just hit reply.\r\n\r\nBest,\r\n\r\nThe Cluing team \xf0\x9f\x92\x9b\r\n\r\n\r\n\xe2\x80\x94\xe2\x80\x94\xe2\x80\x94\r\n\r\nYou are reading a plain text version of this post. For the best experience, copy and paste this link in your browser to view the post online:\r\nhttps://mail.collabwriting.co/p/collabwriting-is-becoming-cluing\r\n'
