[2026-04-27 10:57:30] Raw text/plain payload: b"A new story on America Counts highlights data from the Vintage 2025 National and State Population Estimates.  \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nUnited States Census Bureau [ https://www.census.gov/library/stories/2026/01/pop-estimates-state-change.html?utm_campaign=20260128aco&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nAmerica Counts: Stories Behind the Numbers\r\n\r\nA crowd of people looks toward the Statue of Liberty. [ https://www.census.gov/library/stories/2026/01/pop-estimates-state-change.html?utm_campaign=20260128aco&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n\r\nU.S. Population Growth Slowest Since COVID-19 Pandemic\r\n\r\nAmerica\xe2\x80\x99s growth is slowing \xe2\x80\x94 again.\r\n\r\nAfter a brief post-pandemic uptick \xe2\x80\x93 0.8% in 2023 and a robust 1.0% in 2024 \xe2\x80\x93 U.S. population growth slowed to 0.5% between 2024 and 2025.\r\n\r\nA sizeable reduction in net international migration \xe2\x80\x93 people moving between the United States and other countries \xe2\x80\x93 was the main reason for the slowdown. Natural change, the difference between the number of births and deaths, remained relatively stable.\r\n\r\nBoth the nation and states saw their population growth slow in the last year but for different reasons.\r\n\r\n*Read More* [ https://www.census.gov/library/stories/2026/01/pop-estimates-state-change.html?utm_campaign=20260128aco&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nStay Connected with the Census Bureau\r\n\r\nFollow us on our social media channels, Facebook [ https://www.facebook.com/uscensusbureau?utm_campaign=20260128aco&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ], Instagram [ https://www.instagram.com/uscensusbureau/?utm_campaign=20260128aco&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ], LinkedIn [ https://www.linkedin.com/company/us-census-bureau?utm_campaign=20260128aco&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ], Twitter/X [ https://x.com/uscensusbureau?utm_campaign=20260128aco&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ], and\xc2\xa0YouTube [ https://www.youtube.com/user/uscensusbureau?utm_campaign=20260128aco&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ], so you never miss an update.\r\n\r\nStay Connected With Us on Social Media [ https://www.census.gov/about/contact-us/social_media.html?utm_campaign=20260128aco&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n\r\n*Follow Us* [ https://www.census.gov/about/contact-us/social_media.html?utm_campaign=20260128aco&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\n?? You May Be Interested In\r\n\r\n  * *News Release:* U.S. Population Growth Slows Due to Historic Decline in Net International Migration [ https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2026/population-growth-slows.html?utm_campaign=20260128aco&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n  * *Press Kit:*\xc2\xa0Vintage 2025 National and State\xc2\xa0Population\xc2\xa0Estimates [ https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-kits/2026/national-state-population-estimates.html?utm_campaign=20260128aco&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n  * *Blog:* New Population Estimates Show Historic Decline in Net International Migration [ https://www.census.gov/newsroom/blogs/random-samplings/2026/01/historic-decline-in-net-international-migration.html?utm_campaign=20260128aco&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nAbout America Counts [ https://www.census.gov/library/stories.html?utm_campaign=20260128aco&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n\r\nAmerica Counts features stories on various topics including:\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n\r\n  * Families [ https://www.census.gov/library/stories.html?utm_campaign=20260128aco&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery&visual-list-fb55843e87%3Afilters=Census%3ATopic%2FFamilies ],\xc2\xa0Housing [ https://www.census.gov/library/stories.html?utm_campaign=20260128aco&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery&visual-list-fb55843e87%3Afilters=Census%3ATopic%2FHousing ],\xc2\xa0Employment [ https://www.census.gov/library/stories.html?utm_campaign=20260128aco&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery&visual-list-fb55843e87%3Afilters=Census%3ATopic%2FEmployment ], Business and Economy [ https://www.census.gov/library/stories.html?utm_campaign=20260128aco&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery&visual-list-fb55843e87%3Afilters=Census%3ATopic%2Fbusiness-economy ] \r\n  * Education [ https://www.census.gov/library/stories.html?utm_campaign=20260128aco&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery&visual-list-fb55843e87%3Afilters=Census%3ATopic%2FEducation ], [ https://www.census.gov/library/stories.html?utm_campaign=20260128aco&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery&visual-list-fb55843e87%3Afilters=Census%3ATopic%2FEducation ] Health [ https://www.census.gov/library/stories.html?utm_campaign=20260128aco&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery&visual-list-fb55843e87%3Afilters=Census%3ATopic%2FHealth ], Population [ https://www.census.gov/library/stories.html?utm_campaign=20260128aco&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery&visual-list-fb55843e87%3Afilters=Census%3ATopic%2FThePopulation ], Income and Poverty [ https://www.census.gov/library/stories.html?utm_campaign=20260128aco&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery&visual-list-fb55843e87%3Afilters=Census%3ATopic%2FIncome-Poverty ] \r\n\r\n*For the Media:*\xc2\xa0Contact our\xc2\xa0Public Information Office [ https://www.census.gov/newsroom/about.html?utm_campaign=20260128aco&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\xc2\xa0for inquiries or interviews.\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nDon't miss an America Counts story!\xc2\xa0Use the button below to sign up and update your preferences.\r\n\r\nSubscribe [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USCENSUS/signup/34555 ] | Manage Subscriptions [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USCENSUS/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] | Unsubscribe [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USCENSUS/subscriber/one_click_unsubscribe?verification=5.76359f46a06559a62e8e0404a80cc7e5&destination=jasonnorman66994%40gmail.com ] | Help [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/s/?utm_campaign=20260128aco&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n\r\n*Share This * [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USCENSUS/bulletins/4067ead ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n  \r\n \r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\nThis is an official email from the U.S. Census Bureau. If you have any questions or comments, please contact us (http://www.census.gov/about/contact-us.html [ http://www.census.gov/about/contact-us.html?utm_campaign=20260128aco&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]).  \xc2\xa0 \r\nbody .abe-column-block {min-height: 5px;} table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:7px; margin-right:7px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;}\r\n"
