[2026-04-27 10:57:40] Raw text/plain payload: b'If your email program has trouble displaying this email, view as a webpage [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/bulletins/40689ad ].\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nUS Food and Drug Administration \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nNavitas Organics Voluntarily Recalls Select Lots of 8oz Organic Chia Seeds Because of Possible Health Risk [ https://www.fda.gov/safety/recalls-market-withdrawals-safety-alerts/navitas-organics-voluntarily-recalls-select-lots-8oz-organic-chia-seeds-because-possible-health-risk?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n\r\nNavitas Organics is voluntarily recalling select lots of its 8oz Organic Chia Seeds due to possible\xc2\xa0"Salmonella"\xc2\xa0contamination. This recall is being conducted as a precautionary measure following a recall initiated by the company\xe2\x80\x99s chia seed supplier.\r\n\r\nProduct was distributed nationally through retail stores such as Whole Foods Market and online retailers including Amazon.\r\n\r\nThe recall applies to the following product packaged in sealed stand-up pouches:\r\n\r\n\r\n  * Navitas Organics - Organic Chia Seeds, 8oz, UPC 858847000284 \r\n  * Lot Codes (9-digit codes starting with \xe2\x80\x9cW") are printed on the back of the chia seed bag above the nutritional information. The Lot Codes included in this recall are: \r\n  * W31025283 - Best If Used By: End APR 2027 \r\n  * W31025286 - Best If Used By: End APR 2027 \r\n  * W31025287 - Best If Used By: End APR 2027 \r\n  * W31025311 - Best If Used By: End MAY 2027 \r\n  * W31025314 - Best If Used By: End MAY 2027 \r\n  * W31025315 - Best If Used By: End MAY 2027 \r\n  * W31025316 - Best If Used By: End MAY 2027 \r\n  * W31025317 - Best If Used By: End MAY 2027 \r\n\r\nWe do not have any reports of\xc2\xa0"Salmonella"\xc2\xa0in our product at this time, nor have any illnesses or adverse medical events been reported or identified. No other Navitas Organics products are affected by this recall.\r\n\r\nView Full Recall [ https://www.fda.gov/safety/recalls-market-withdrawals-safety-alerts/navitas-organics-voluntarily-recalls-select-lots-8oz-organic-chia-seeds-because-possible-health-risk?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n  \r\n \r\n\r\nfeed [ https://www.fda.gov/about-fda/contact-fda/subscribe-podcasts-and-news-feeds?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]twitter [ https://www.twitter.com/US_FDA?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]facebook [ https://www.facebook.com/FDA?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]Instagram [ https://www.instagram.com/FDA?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]youtube [ https://www.youtube.com/user/USFoodandDrugAdmin?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]flickr [ https://www.flickr.com/photos/fdaphotos/albums/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]  \r\n\r\n*Manage Subscriptions* [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 *Unsubscribe All* [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/subscriber/one_click_unsubscribe?verification=5.ee0243ee8741fe358146537aecf40e1e&destination=jasonnorman66994%40gmail.com ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 *Help* [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/ ]\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\nbody .abe-column-block {min-height: 5px;} td {line-height:1;} \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n This email was sent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com using GovDelivery Communications Cloud on behalf of: U.S. Food and Drug Administration \xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0\r\n10903 New Hampshire Ave\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0Silver Spring, MD \xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0 20993-0002\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa01-888-INFO-FDA GovDelivery logo [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\nbody .abe-column-block { min-height: 5px; } table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:10px; margin-right:10px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;}\r\n'
