[2026-04-27 10:58:00] Raw text/plain payload: b"2026\xe2\x80\x8a-\xe2\x80\x8aJust Following Orders, Russian Delivery Service\r\nUkraine Update January 29\r\n\r\n2026\xe2\x80\x8a-\xe2\x80\x8aJust Following Orders, Russian Delivery Service\r\n\r\nDylan Combellick (https://medium.com/@dylan_combellick?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769671994098-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------956a6e01_c0c5_41c0_a1a6_d2cf0f888825--------354e45830cd6)\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nJanuary 29, 2026\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\n15 min read\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nView on Medium (https://medium.com/p/633fe7100580?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769671994098-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------956a6e01_c0c5_41c0_a1a6_d2cf0f888825--------354e45830cd6)\r\n\r\nYesterday was the anniversary of the 2003 Treaty between Ukraine and Russia, which demarcated the borders between the two countries. It was signed by Putin. The treaty is on file at the United Nations.\r\n\r\n-\xe2\x80\x8a-\xe2\x80\x8a-\r\n\r\nSo Goes the War\r\n\r\nRussian sources report that Ukraine shot down a Russian Su-34 over the Black Sea yesterday. No survivors. The plane was flying west from near Sevastopol towards Odesa and fell into the sea not far from where the Moskva lies on the sea floor, and not far from Snake Island, which was so famous in the early years of the war.\r\n\r\nIn a related\xe2\x80\xa6\r\n\r\nContinue reading (https://medium.com/p/633fe7100580?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769671994098-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------956a6e01_c0c5_41c0_a1a6_d2cf0f888825--------354e45830cd6)\r\nThis is a member-only story and can only be read on Medium.\r\n\r\nSent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com by Dylan Combellick on Medium\r\nUnsubscribe (https://medium.com/me/email-settings/50207bf5a022/0bfdbf44e9f5?type=noSetting&newsletterV3Id=354e45830cd6&source=email-50207bf5a022-1769671994098-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------956a6e01_c0c5_41c0_a1a6_d2cf0f888825--------354e45830cd6)\r\n from this writer's email notifications\r\nManage your email settings (https://medium.com/me/settings/notifications?hash=0bfdbf44e9f5&userId=50207bf5a022&settingsRouteHash=%23manageSubscriptions&source=email-50207bf5a022-1769671994098-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------956a6e01_c0c5_41c0_a1a6_d2cf0f888825--------354e45830cd6)\r\n\r\n3500 South DuPont Highway, Suite IQ-101, Dover,\xc2\xa0DE\xc2\xa019901\r\nCareers (https://medium.com/jobs-at-medium/work-at-medium-959d1a85284e?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769671994098-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------956a6e01_c0c5_41c0_a1a6_d2cf0f888825--------354e45830cd6)\r\n\xc2\xb7Help Center (https://help.medium.com/hc/en-us?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769671994098-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------956a6e01_c0c5_41c0_a1a6_d2cf0f888825--------354e45830cd6)\r\n\xc2\xb7Privacy Policy (https://policy.medium.com/medium-privacy-policy-f03bf92035c9?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769671994098-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------956a6e01_c0c5_41c0_a1a6_d2cf0f888825--------354e45830cd6)\r\n\xc2\xb7Terms of service (https://policy.medium.com/medium-terms-of-service-9db0094a1e0f?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769671994098-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------956a6e01_c0c5_41c0_a1a6_d2cf0f888825--------354e45830cd6)"
