[2026-04-27 10:58:02] Raw text/plain payload: b'AI is great for getting products built faster than ever, but that speed has a major cost\r\nFounders Are Building Faster With AI\xe2\x80\x8a-\xe2\x80\x8aBut There\'s a Problem\r\n\r\nAI is great for getting products built faster than ever, but that speed has a major cost\r\n\r\nAaron Dinin, PhD (https://medium.com/@aarondinin?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769684554778-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-7adf33e44ae3------------------------93ba89f5_2772_4819_8316_1a9f70b3ca72--------7ae6917575f4)\r\n\xc2\xa0in\xc2\xa0Entrepreneurship Handbook (https://medium.com/entrepreneur-s-handbook?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769684554778-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-7adf33e44ae3------------------------93ba89f5_2772_4819_8316_1a9f70b3ca72--------7ae6917575f4)\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nJanuary 29, 2026\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\n4 min read\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nView on Medium (https://medium.com/entrepreneur-s-handbook/d4c3b0d882fd?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769684554778-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-7adf33e44ae3------------------------93ba89f5_2772_4819_8316_1a9f70b3ca72--------7ae6917575f4)\r\n\r\nPhoto by Dalila Moreira (http://redirect.medium.systems/r-PLUaMbZo4A?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769684554778-newsletter.subscribeToProfile--d4c3b0d882fd-----------------------93ba89f5_2772_4819_8316_1a9f70b3ca72--------7ae6917575f4)\r\n on Unsplash (http://redirect.medium.systems/r-Gu6Z_HViFN?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769684554778-newsletter.subscribeToProfile--d4c3b0d882fd-----------------------93ba89f5_2772_4819_8316_1a9f70b3ca72--------7ae6917575f4)\r\n\r\nLast weekend, I was invited to judge an AI-powered hackathon.\r\n\r\nI\'ll admit, I was curious. I hadn\'t been to a hackathon in years. Definitely not since before large language models, copilots, and "vibe coding" became part of the startup lexicon. Back then, hackathons were mostly exercises in exhaustion. They tended to feature a handful of sleep-deprived engineers hastily duct-taping together barely functional demos, hoping the judges would squint kindly at the ambition.\r\n\r\nIn contrast, an AI-powered hackathon was definitely different. By the end of the weekend, the teams had built things that would\'ve taken weeks (or months) not too long\xe2\x80\xa6\r\n\r\nContinue reading (https://medium.com/entrepreneur-s-handbook/d4c3b0d882fd?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769684554778-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-7adf33e44ae3------------------------93ba89f5_2772_4819_8316_1a9f70b3ca72--------7ae6917575f4)\r\nThis is a member-only story and can only be read on Medium.\r\n\r\nSent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com by Aaron Dinin, PhD on Medium\r\nUnsubscribe (https://medium.com/me/email-settings/50207bf5a022/45219dc7fd7d?type=noSetting&newsletterV3Id=7ae6917575f4&collectionId=7adf33e44ae3&source=email-50207bf5a022-1769684554778-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-7adf33e44ae3------------------------93ba89f5_2772_4819_8316_1a9f70b3ca72--------7ae6917575f4)\r\n from this writer\'s email notifications\r\nManage your email settings (https://medium.com/me/settings/notifications?hash=45219dc7fd7d&userId=50207bf5a022&settingsRouteHash=%23manageSubscriptions&source=email-50207bf5a022-1769684554778-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-7adf33e44ae3------------------------93ba89f5_2772_4819_8316_1a9f70b3ca72--------7ae6917575f4)\r\n\r\n3500 South DuPont Highway, Suite IQ-101, Dover,\xc2\xa0DE\xc2\xa019901\r\nCareers (https://medium.com/jobs-at-medium/work-at-medium-959d1a85284e?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769684554778-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-7adf33e44ae3------------------------93ba89f5_2772_4819_8316_1a9f70b3ca72--------7ae6917575f4)\r\n\xc2\xb7Help Center (https://help.medium.com/hc/en-us?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769684554778-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-7adf33e44ae3------------------------93ba89f5_2772_4819_8316_1a9f70b3ca72--------7ae6917575f4)\r\n\xc2\xb7Privacy Policy (https://policy.medium.com/medium