[2026-04-27 10:58:04] Raw text/plain payload: b'How Prism Unifies Writing, Reasoning, and LaTeX for the Next Era of Science\r\nThe "Cursor" Moment for Science: OpenAI\'s Prism Changed Everything for Researchers\r\n\r\nHow Prism Unifies Writing, Reasoning, and LaTeX for the Next Era of Science\r\n\r\nAdham Khaled (https://medium.com/@adham__khaled__?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769691704295-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-98111c9905da------------------------b310314f_0fe9_4198_b62b_2a6cc6ffb981--------dbf9f8a2e961)\r\n\xc2\xa0in\xc2\xa0Towards AI (https://medium.com/towards-artificial-intelligence?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769691704295-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-98111c9905da------------------------b310314f_0fe9_4198_b62b_2a6cc6ffb981--------dbf9f8a2e961)\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nJanuary 29, 2026\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\n4 min read\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nView on Medium (https://medium.com/towards-artificial-intelligence/b655c7f2aa0b?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769691704295-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-98111c9905da------------------------b310314f_0fe9_4198_b62b_2a6cc6ffb981--------dbf9f8a2e961)\r\n\r\nMade by Author\r\n\r\nIf you are a researcher, your daily workflow probably looks like a browser tab disaster movie.\r\n\r\nYou have Overleaf open for writing, Zotero for citations, ChatGPT for brainstorming, Google Scholar for search, and Python/Matlab for data. You are constantly context-switching, copy-pasting code, and wrestling with LaTeX errors that refuse to die.\r\n\r\nYesterday, OpenAI launched Prism, and it might just be the "Cursor moment" for scientific writing.\r\n\r\nJust as Cursor transformed coding by integrating AI directly into the IDE, Prism integrates GPT-5.2 directly into a LaTeX-native workspace.\xc2\xa0\xe2\x80\xa6\r\n\r\nContinue reading (https://medium.com/towards-artificial-intelligence/b655c7f2aa0b?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769691704295-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-98111c9905da------------------------b310314f_0fe9_4198_b62b_2a6cc6ffb981--------dbf9f8a2e961)\r\nThis is a member-only story and can only be read on Medium.\r\n\r\nSent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com by Adham Khaled on Medium\r\nUnsubscribe (https://medium.com/me/email-settings/50207bf5a022/8ae5875d3c72?type=noSetting&newsletterV3Id=dbf9f8a2e961&collectionId=98111c9905da&source=email-50207bf5a022-1769691704295-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-98111c9905da------------------------b310314f_0fe9_4198_b62b_2a6cc6ffb981--------dbf9f8a2e961)\r\n from this writer\'s email notifications\r\nManage your email settings (https://medium.com/me/settings/notifications?hash=8ae5875d3c72&userId=50207bf5a022&settingsRouteHash=%23manageSubscriptions&source=email-50207bf5a022-1769691704295-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-98111c9905da------------------------b310314f_0fe9_4198_b62b_2a6cc6ffb981--------dbf9f8a2e961)\r\n\r\n3500 South DuPont Highway, Suite IQ-101, Dover,\xc2\xa0DE\xc2\xa019901\r\nCareers (https://medium.com/jobs-at-medium/work-at-medium-959d1a85284e?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769691704295-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-98111c9905da------------------------b310314f_0fe9_4198_b62b_2a6cc6ffb981--------dbf9f8a2e961)\r\n\xc2\xb7Help Center (https://help.medium.com/hc/en-us?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769691704295-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-98111c9905da------------------------b310314f_0fe9_4198_b62b_2a6cc6ffb981--------dbf9f8a2e961)\r\n\xc2\xb7Privacy Policy (https://policy.medium.com/medium-privacy-policy-f03bf92035c9?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769691704295-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-98111c9905da------------------------b310314f_0fe9_4198_b62b_2a6cc6ffb981--------dbf9f8a2e961)\r\n\xc2\xb7Terms of service (https://policy.medium.com/medium-terms-of-service-9db0094a1e0f?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769691704295-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-98111c9905da------------------------b310314f_0fe9_4198_b62b_2a6cc6ffb981--------dbf9f8a2e961)'
