[2026-04-27 10:58:12] Raw text/plain payload: b'The approvals listed below may not be comprehensive. For the most current information, view the full listing of all approvals at Drugs@FDA [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=reportsSearch.process&rptName=1&reportSelectMonth=11&reportSelectYear=2025&nav ].\r\n\r\n*What\'s New Related to Drugs*\r\n\r\n*Updated Monday through Friday*\r\n\r\n\r\n  * Current and Resolved Drug Shortages and Discontinuations Reported to FDA [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/drugshortages/#tab4 ] \r\n  * Drug Firm Annual Registration Status [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/drls/default.cfm?utm_medium=&utm_source= ] \r\n  * Drug Firm Annual Registration Status Download File [ https://www.fda.gov/drugs/drug-approvals-and-databases/drug-establishments-current-registration-site?utm_medium=&utm_source= ] \r\n  * National Drug Code Directory [ https://www.fda.gov/drugs/drug-approvals-and-databases/national-drug-code-directory?utm_medium=&utm_source= ] \r\n  * NDC Unfinished Drugs Excluded Database File [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/cder/NDC_unfinished_excluded.zip?utm_medium=&utm_source= ] \r\n  * NDC Database Excluded Packages and Products [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/cder/ndc_excluded.zip?utm_medium=&utm_source= ] \r\n  * Wholesale Distributor and Third-Party Logistics Providers Reporting [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/wdd3plreporting/ ] \r\n  * Drug Establishments Current Registration Site [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/drls/ ] \r\n  * Drugs@FDA Data Files [ https://www.fda.gov/drugs/drug-approvals-and-databases/drugsfda-data-files ]\xc2\xa0 \r\n\r\n*Updated Biweekly*\r\n\r\n  * Competitive Generic Therapy Approvals [ https://www.fda.gov/drugs/generic-drugs/competitive-generic-therapy-approvals ] \r\n\r\n*January 27, 2026*\r\n\r\n\r\n  * FDA approves daratumumab and hyaluronidase-fihj with bortezomib, lenalidomide, and dexamethasone for newly diagnosed multiple myeloma [ https://www.fda.gov/drugs/resources-information-approved-drugs/fda-approves-daratumumab-and-hyaluronidase-fihj-bortezomib-lenalidomide-and-dexamethasone-newly ] \r\n\r\n*January 21, 2026*\r\n\r\n\r\n  * Drug Trials Snapshots KYGEVVI [ https://www.fda.gov/drugs/drug-approvals-and-databases/drug-trials-snapshots-kygevvi ] \r\n  * FDA Announces PreCheck Implementation Roadmap [ https://www.fda.gov/drugs/drug-safety-and-availability/fda-announces-precheck-implementation-roadmap ] \r\n\r\nThis report displays final approvals and tentative approvals of original and supplemental applications for the two days beginning on the earliest date listed below. Some approvals may be added to the Drugs@FDA database after this time span. For comprehensive approval reports, please use the monthly "All Approvals [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=reportsSearch.process&nav=&reportSelectMonth=9&reportSelectYear=2020&rptName=1&utm_medium=&utm_source=#navigation ]" report on Drugs@FDA.\r\n\r\nJanuary 28, 2026\r\n\r\nDrug Name and\r\nApplication Number Active Ingredient Dosage Form/ Route Submission Company Submission Classification Submission Status Daysee\r\nANDA #091467 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=091467 ] Ethinyl Estradiol; Levonorgestrel Tablet; Oral SUPPL-16 Lupin Ltd Manufacturing (CMC) Approved Daysee\r\nANDA #091467 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=091467 ] Ethinyl Estradiol; Levonorgestrel Tablet; Oral SUPPL-16 Lupin Ltd Manufacturing (CMC) Approved Sertraline Hydrochloride\r\nANDA #219655 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=219655 ] Sertraline Hydrochloride Capsule; Oral ORIG-1 Skg Pharma \xc2\xa0 Approved \r\n\r\nJanuary 27, 2026\r\n\r\nDrug Name and\r\nApplication Number Active Ingredient Dosage Form/ Route Submission Company Submission Classification Submission Status Priftin\r\nNDA #021024 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=021024 ] Rifapentine Tablet; Oral SUPPL-22 Sanofi Aventis Us Labeling Approved Priftin\r\nNDA #021024 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=021024 ] Rifapentine Tablet; Oral SUPPL-22 Sanofi Aventis Us Labeling Approved Noxafil\r\nNDA #022003 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=022003 ] Posaconazole Suspension; Oral SUPPL-34 Schering Efficacy Approved Caprelsa\r\nNDA #022405 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=022405 ] Vandetanib Tablet; Oral SUPPL-26 Genzyme Corp Labeling Approved Caprelsa\r\nNDA #022405 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=022405 ] Vandetanib Tablet; Oral SUPPL-26 Genzyme Corp Labeling Approved Ampicillin and Sulbactam\r\nANDA #065240 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=065240 ] Ampicillin Sodium; Sulbactam Sodium Injectable; Injection SUPPL-29 Sandoz Labeling Approved Topiramate\r\nANDA #076314 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=076314 ] Topiramate Tablet; Oral SUPPL-19 Natco Labeling Approved Noxafil\r\nNDA #205053 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=205053 ] Posaconazole Tablet, Delayed Release; Oral SUPPL-18 Merck Sharp Dohme Efficacy Approved Noxafil\r\nNDA #205596 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=205596 ] Posaconazole Solution; Intravenous SUPPL-21 Merck Sharp Dohme Efficacy Approved Capecitabine\r\nANDA #207652 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=207652 ] Capecitabine Tablet; Oral SUPPL-13 Alkem Labs Ltd Labeling Approved Capecitabine\r\nANDA #20765