[2026-04-27 10:58:13] Raw text/plain payload: b'Drug Safety-related Labeling Changes (SrLC)\r\n\r\n*The SrLC database has been updated with the following approved drug safety labeling changes.*\r\n\r\nDrug Name Active Ingredient Application Number Application Type Supplement Date Database Updated *AFREZZA* [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/safetylabelingchanges/index.cfm?event=searchdetail.page&DrugNameID=1290 ] INSULIN RECOMBINANT HUMAN 022472 BLA 01/23/2026 01/29/2026 *IDOSE TR* [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/safetylabelingchanges/index.cfm?event=searchdetail.page&DrugNameID=3244 ] TRAVOPROST 218010 NDA 01/27/2026 01/29/2026 *JOURNAVX* [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/safetylabelingchanges/index.cfm?event=searchdetail.page&DrugNameID=3243 ] SUZETRIGINE 219209 NDA 01/23/2026 01/29/2026 *VYXEOS* [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/safetylabelingchanges/index.cfm?event=searchdetail.page&DrugNameID=2439 ] CYTARABINE; DAUNORUBICIN 209401 NDA 01/27/2026 01/29/2026 *ZILBRYSQ* [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/safetylabelingchanges/index.cfm?event=searchdetail.page&DrugNameID=2949 ] ZILUCOPLAN SODIUM 216834 NDA 01/22/2026 01/28/2026 \r\n\r\nfeed [ https://www.fda.gov/about-fda/contact-fda/subscribe-podcasts-and-news-feeds?utm_medium=utm_source&utm_source= ]twitter [ https://www.twitter.com/US_FDA?utm_medium=utm_source&utm_source= ]facebook [ https://www.facebook.com/FDA?utm_medium=utm_source&utm_source= ]youtube [ https://www.youtube.com/user/USFoodandDrugAdmin?utm_medium=utm_source&utm_source= ]flickr [ https://www.flickr.com/photos/fdaphotos/albums/?utm_medium=utm_source&utm_source= ]  \r\n\r\n*Manage Subscriptions* [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 *Unsubscribe All* [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/subscriber/one_click_unsubscribe?verification=5.ee0243ee8741fe358146537aecf40e1e&destination=jasonnorman66994%40gmail.com ] \x