[2026-04-27 10:58:27] Raw text/plain payload: b'NIST  \r\n \r\n\r\nView As Web Page [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USNIST/bulletins/40658f2 ]\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\nHeader  \r\n \r\n\r\nNIST Cybersecurity and Privacy Program\r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nBridging the Gap Between Standards on Random Number Generation: NIST releases IR 8446\r\n\r\nCryptographic systems rely on high-quality random number generation, and implementers often need to interpret and apply multiple standards and guidelines. NIST has published the final version of Interagency Report (IR) 8446, "Bridging the Gap Between Standards on Random Number Generation: Comparison of SP 800-90 Series and AIS 20/31 [ https://gcc02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcsrc.nist.gov%2Fpubs%2Fir%2F8446%2Ffinal&data=05%7C02%7Coana.ritfeld%40nist.gov%7Cdeffbe013af54599ae1008de5dd61f04%7C2ab5d82fd8fa4797a93e054655c61dec%7C0%7C0%7C639051371383520568%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&sdata=m%2F3jdtrlIrL0sG3C%2FWss1kB0SJuBTCphF6KlF1SLS7o%3D&reserved=0 ]", which compares Germany\xe2\x80\x99s BSI AIS 20/31 and NIST\xe2\x80\x99s SP 800-90 series to help clarify similarities and differences in terminology, assumptions, and requirements. The report aims to improve communication among stakeholders, promote shared understanding, and reduce or resolve inconsistencies in related standards.\r\n\r\nAdditional information is available on the CSRC Random Bit Generation project page [ https://gcc02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcsrc.nist.gov%2Fprojects%2Frandom-bit-generation&data=05%7C02%7Coana.ritfeld%40nist.gov%7Cdeffbe013af54599ae1008de5dd61f04%7C2ab5d82fd8fa4797a93e054655c61dec%7C0%7C0%7C639051371383543751%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&sdata=eCBdUZAPvpPRL2y4uo%2FmkG7ibjvIVBZE6tW4zIzO0pA%3D&reserved=0 ]\r\n\r\nRead More [ https://csrc.nist.gov/pubs/ir/8446/final ]\r\n \r\n\r\n*NIST Cybersecurity and Privacy Program*\r\nQuestions and comments can be directed to: rbg_comments@nist.gov\r\nCSRC Website questions:\xc2\xa0csrc-inquiry@nist.gov\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nConnect with us\r\n facebook [ https://www.facebook.com/NIST ]twitter [ https://twitter.com/NIST ]youtube [ https://www.youtube.com/NIST ]linkedin [ https://www.linkedin.com/company/nist ]flickr [ https://www.instagram.com/nist/ ]  \r\n\r\nReceived this email from a friend? Subscribe here [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USNIST/subscriber/new?topic_id=USNIST_1 ].\r\n\r\n ITL NIST [ https://www.nist.gov/itl ] \r\n\r\nSubscriber services:\r\n\r\nManage Preferences [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USNIST/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 Unsubscribe [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USNIST/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 Help [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/ ]\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\nIf you have questions or problems with the subscription service, please contact subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/ ].\r\nTechnical questions? Contact inquiries@nist.gov. (301) 975-NIST (6478).\r\n\r\nThis service is provided to you at no charge by National Institute of Standards and Technology (NIST).\xc2\xa0100 Bureau Drive, Stop 1070\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7 Gaithersburg, MD 20899\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0301-975-6478\r\n\r\n GovDelivery logo [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/ ] \r\nbody .abe-column-block { min-height: 5px; } table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:10px; margin-right:10px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;} table.govd_hr {min-width: 100%;}\r\n'
