[2026-04-27 10:59:06] Raw text/plain payload: b'Having trouble viewing this email?\xc2\xa0 [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USDAOIG/bulletins/0 ]View it as a Web page [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USDAOIG/bulletins/4065e37 ].\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nUSDA Office of Inspector General \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nUSDA OIG oversight reports - January 2026\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nHow card skimming fraud wors\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nReview of Food and Nutrition Service Supplemental Nutrition Assistance Program/Electronic Benefits Transfer Hardware [ https://usdaoig.oversight.gov/reports/inspection-evaluation/review-food-and-nutrition-service-supplemental-nutrition-assistance ]\r\n\r\nUSDA OIG\'S objective was to determine whether Food and Nutrition Service has taken actions to secure IT hardware to effectively prevent Supplemental and Nutrition Assistance Program (SNAP) benefit theft through card skimming, card and terminal cloning, and other similar fraudulent methods.\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nStatement by USDA Inspector General John Walk\r\n\r\n\xe2\x80\x9cUpgrading security on SNAP EBT cards will help prevent fraud by skimming and card cloning. Current EBT card technology is low-hanging fruit for criminals. This report highlights the savings that could be achieved by states upgrading and modernizing card security. Thanks to OIG\xe2\x80\x99s auditors for your hard work on this important product.\xe2\x80\x9d - Inspector General John Walk.\r\n\r\n*View the report* [ https://usdaoig.oversight.gov/reports/inspection-evaluation/review-food-and-nutrition-service-supplemental-nutrition-assistance ] \r\n \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nNatural Resources Conservation Service\'s Financial Statements for Fiscal Year 2025 [ https://usdaoig.oversight.gov/reports/audit/natural-resources-conservation-services-financial-statements-fiscal-year-2025 ]\r\n\r\nThe report contains an unmodified opinion on Natural Resources Conservation Service\xe2\x80\x99s financial statements as of September 30, 2025, as well as an assessment of NRCS\' internal controls over financial reporting and compliance with laws and regulations.\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nRural Development\'s Financial Statements for Fiscal Year 2025 [ https://usdaoig.oversight.gov/reports/audit/rural-developments-financial-statements-fiscal-year-2025 ]\r\n\r\nThis report presents the results of our audit of Rural Development\xe2\x80\x99s financial statements for the fiscal year ending September 30, 2025.\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nFederal Crop Insurance Corporation/Risk Management Agency\'s Financial Statements for Fiscal Year 2025 [ https://usdaoig.oversight.gov/reports/audit/federal-crop-insurance-corporationrisk-management-agencys-financial-statements-10 ]\r\n\r\nThe report contains an unmodified opinion on Federal Crop Insurance Corporation/Risk Management Agency\'s (FCIC/RMA) financial statements as of September 30, 2025, as well as an assessment of FCIC/RMA\xe2\x80\x99s internal controls over financial reporting and compliance with laws and regulations.\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n"*View previous USDA OIG oversight reports [ https://usdaoig.oversight.gov/reports/all ]*"\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n  \r\n \r\n\r\nStay Connected with USDA Office of Inspector General: \xc2\xa0Twitter [ https://twitter.com/OIGUSDA ] \xc2\xa0 LinkedIn [ https://www.linkedin.com/company/usdaoig/ ]\xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0Govdelivery [ http://www.granicus.com ] SUBSCRIBER SERVICES:\r\nManage Subscriptions [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USDAOIG/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 Unsubscribe All [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USDAOIG/subscriber/one_click_unsubscribe?verification=5.fde2673c2470fe5a6f755c8624fc39e9&destination=jasonnorman66994%40gmail.com ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 Help [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/ ]  \r\n \r\n \r\nbody .abe-section-table {max-width:601px !important;} body .abe-column-block {min-height: 5px;} \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n This email was sent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com using govDelivery Communications Cloud on behalf of: USDA Office of Inspector General \xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0Room 117-W Jamie Whitten Bldg\xc2\xb71400 Independence Avenue SW \xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0Washington, DC 20250  GovDelivery logo  [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/ ]\r\n'
