[2026-04-27 10:59:22] Raw text/plain payload: b'\r\nMoltbot is now available to quickly deploy on DigitalOcean Droplet servers in the [DigitalOcean Marketplace](https://marketplace.digitalocean.com/apps/moltbot?utm_source=marketo&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=Moltbot+launch). Created by [Peter Steinberger](https://github.com/steipete), this personal AI assistant runs around the clock and connects to messaging platforms you already use, including WhatsApp, Telegram, Slack, and iMessage.\r\n\r\nWith 1-Click Deploy Moltbot, you can have Moltbot running on a DigitalOcean Droplet server in minutes instead of manually configuring infrastructure.\r\n\r\n[Deploy Moltbot Now](https://marketplace.digitalocean.com/apps/moltbot?utm_source=marketo&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=Moltbot+launch)\r\nWhy run Moltbot on DigitalOcean?\r\n\r\n- Container-based isolation: Moltbot runs inside a dedicated Docker container, isolating agent execution from the host system. If an agent crashes or misbehaves, only its container is affected, which protects the underlying Droplet, files, and credentials.\r\n- Authentication by default: Each deployment generates a unique gateway token for authenticated access, ensuring only authorized clients can communicate with the agent. This prevents unauthenticated access and reduces the risk of exposed endpoints.\r\n- Hardened server configuration: The Droplet is provisioned with firewall rules, non-root execution, and locked-down permissions to reduce attack surface from day one. Background internet noise is automatically mitigated using fail2ban, blocking abusive traffic patterns without manual tuning.\r\n- Private access controls: Device pairing is enabled by default, ensuring that only explicitly approved users and clients can interact with the agent, which limits the blast radius of unintended commands.\r\n- Flexible model support: Developers can use DigitalOcean Gradient\xc2\xae AI models directly, connect to open-source models or third-party providers while maintaining full control over runtime behavior, data flow, and configuration. Today, Anthropic is supported with more to follow.\r\n\r\nReady to get started? Deploy Moltbot in minutes\r\n\r\n- Deploy your Droplet - Select the Moltbot 1-Click App image from the [DigitalOcean Marketplace](https://marketplace.digitalocean.com/apps/moltbot?utm_source=marketo&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=Moltbot+launch)\r\n- Under Authentication, select your desired SSH Key or [add an SSH key](https://docs.digitalocean.com/products/droplets/how-to/add-ssh-keys/)\r\n- Open your CLI of choice and run ssh root@your-droplet-ip, using the IP provided for your droplet in the cloud console. Note that droplets may take a few minutes to fully configure so you might need to try this a couple of times.\r\n- Once connected, you\xe2\x80\x99ll be shown the Moltbot welcome message. Take note of the Dashboard URL as this is what you will copy and paste into your browser to access the dashboard. Similarly, you can run /opt/clawdbot-tui.sh to access the Clawdbot TUI in your CLI.\r\n- To finish configuration, you\xe2\x80\x99ll be prompted to choose your AI provider. Within the terminal, choose Anthropic as your AI Provider. If you have access to Gradient AI, you can select that option. models will be available soon. Once you select your provider, provide the respective API/Secret key.\r\n- After you setup your AI provider, Clawdbot will automatically restart with your new configured Moltbot. You can also run systemctl restart Moltbot at any time to restart your session.\r\n\r\nLooking for more instructions, details about installing skills, or our FAQ? [Head to our tutorial to learn more](https://www.digitalocean.com/community/tutorials/how-to-run-moltbot).\r\n\r\n[Deploy your assistant today](https://marketplace.digitalocean.com/apps/moltbot?utm_source=marketo&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=Moltbot+launch)\r\n\r\n\r\nFollow us:\r\n\r\n[Twitter](https://twitter.com/digitalocean)\r\n[Facebook](https://www.facebook.com/DigitalOceanCloudHosting)\r\n[YouTube](https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCaPX53JLxxSbwZz_Ra_cL0g)\r\n[Instagram](https://www.instagram.com/thedigitalocean)\r\n[Linkedin](https://linkedin.com/company/digitalocean)\r\n[Twitch](https://www.twitch.tv/digitaloceantv)\r\n\r\nGive $200, get $25. [Refer a friend](https://cloud.digitalocean.com/account/referrals?utm_medium=email&utm_source=footer&utm_campaign=referral).\r\nTrouble seeing this email? [View it as a web page](https://anchor.digitalocean.com/index.php/email/emailWebview).\r\n\r\nCopyright DigitalOcean. All rights reserved.\r\n105 Edgeview Dr., Suite 425, Broomfield, CO 80021\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThis email was sent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com. You can update your email subscription preferences here: https://anchor.digitalocean.com/Email_Preferences.html?mkt_unsubscribe=1&mkt_tok=MTEzLURUTi0yNjYAAAGfqaaAfQ19bNallPGOUOTjjQXzvl3-foUku_f7USB18L7Rp3W7J5LQ3e8XgkWTVNkO06R-zWV9SWi34iAMZgOrrnLSxWm8Aavb5aOBLZv7yDgB.\r\n'
