[2026-04-27 10:59:31] Raw text/plain payload: b'Aumentan los niveles educativos en \xc3\xa1reas metro y micropolitanas  \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nUnited States Census Bureau [ https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2026/acs-5-year-gains-educational-attainment/acs-5-year-gains-educational-attainment-spanish.html?utm_campaign=20260129pios4&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nLos datos de la Oficina del Censo muestran un gran aumento de los niveles educativos alcanzados en \xc3\xa1reas estad\xc3\xadsticas metropolitanas y micropolitanas\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nSeg\xc3\xban las nuevas estimaciones de 5 a\xc3\xb1os de la Encuesta sobre la Comunidad Estadounidense (ACS, por sus siglas en ingl\xc3\xa9s) [ http://www.census.gov/programs-surveys/acs/?utm_campaign=20260129pios4&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] que public\xc3\xb3 hoy la Oficina del Censo de los EE.\xc2\xa0UU., el porcentaje de adultos mayores de 25 a\xc3\xb1os con t\xc3\xadtulo de licenciatura universitaria o t\xc3\xadtulo m\xc3\xa1s alto aument\xc3\xb3 de manera significativa en \xc3\xa1reas estad\xc3\xadsticas metropolitanas (\xc3\xa1reas metropolitanas). Este porcentaje aument\xc3\xb3 del 34.2\xc2\xa0% en el per\xc3\xadodo del 2015 al 2019 al 37.8\xc2\xa0% en el per\xc3\xadodo del 2020 al 2024.\r\n\r\n\xe2\x80\x9cEn los \xc3\xbaltimos cinco a\xc3\xb1os, hemos notado un aumento significativo del porcentaje de adultos que complet\xc3\xb3 estudios de educaci\xc3\xb3n superior\xe2\x80\x9d, afirm\xc3\xb3 Erik Hern\xc3\xa1ndez, estad\xc3\xadstico de la Oficina del Censo. "Alrededor del 89\xc2\xa0% de las \xc3\xa1reas metropolitanas tuvieron un aumento del porcentaje de poblaci\xc3\xb3n mayor de 25 a\xc3\xb1os con t\xc3\xadtulo de licenciatura universitaria o t\xc3\xadtulo m\xc3\xa1s alto, en comparaci\xc3\xb3n con el per\xc3\xadodo del 2015 al 2019", agreg\xc3\xb3.\r\n\r\nDe las \xc3\xa1reas metropolitanas, Durham-Chapel Hill (Carolina del Norte)\xc2\xa0 present\xc3\xb3 uno de los mayores aumentos de nivel educativo alcanzado de adultos mayores de 25 a\xc3\xb1os con t\xc3\xadtulo de licenciatura universitaria o t\xc3\xadtulo m\xc3\xa1s alto: del 45.3\xc2\xa0% en el per\xc3\xadodo del 2015 al 2019 al 53.4\xc2\xa0% en el per\xc3\xadodo del 2020 al 2024. Springfield (Massachussets) fue la \xc3\xbanica \xc3\xa1rea metropolitana donde hubo un descenso del nivel de educaci\xc3\xb3n alcanzado: del 32.8\xc2\xa0%, en el per\xc3\xadodo del 2015 al 2019, al 29.3\xc2\xa0%, en el per\xc3\xadodo del 2020 al 2024.\r\n\r\n*Aprende M\xc3\xa1s* [ https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2026/acs-5-year-gains-educational-attainment/acs-5-year-gains-educational-attainment-spanish.html?utm_campaign=20260129pios4&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nHelp us spread the word about Census Bureau data!\r\n\r\nShare this on social media or forward it to a friend.\r\n\r\n*Share This* [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USCENSUS/bulletins/406a9db ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\n??You May Be Interested In\r\n\r\n  * Kit de prensa en ingl\xc3\xa9s: 2020-2024 American Community Survey 5-year Estimates [ https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-kits/2026/acs-5-year-estimates.html?utm_campaign=20260129pios4&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nAbout the Census Bureau\r\n\r\nWe serve as the nation\xe2\x80\x99s leading provider of quality data about its people and economy.\xc2\xa0The Census Bureau is the federal government\'s largest statistical agency. As the world\xe2\x80\x99s premier statistical agency, we are dedicated to making our nation a better place. Policy-makers, businesses, and the public use our data to make informed decisions.\r\n\r\nResources for Media\r\n\r\nFor media interviews, please contact the\xc2\xa0Public Information Office [ https://lnks.gd/l/eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..p-5wpj2DTx0_qgyLiv6JuMTDOF_vZlHcwFpt971jIDs/s/866068797/br/124287751808-l?utm_campaign=20260129pios4&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\xc2\xa0Toll Free at 877-861-2010, 301-763-3030, or\xc2\xa0pio@census.gov.\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n  \r\n \r\n\r\n*Stay connected with us!*\r\n\r\nJoin the conversation on social media.\r\n\r\n facebook [ https://www.facebook.com/uscensusbureau/?utm_campaign=20260129pios4&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]instagram [ https://www.instagram.com/uscensusbureau/?utm_campaign=20260129pios4&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]linkedin [ https://www.linkedin.com/company/us-census-bureau/?utm_campaign=20260129pios4&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]twitter [ https://twitter.com/uscensusbureau/?utm_campaign=20260129pios4&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] [ https://www.linkedin.com/company/us-census-bureau/?utm_campaign=20260129pios4&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]youtube [ https://www.youtube.com/user/uscensusbureau/?utm_campaign=20260129pios4&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]  \r\n\r\nSUBSCRIBER SERVICES:\r\n\r\nSubscriber Settings [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USCENSUS/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 Remove me from All Subscriptions  [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USCENSUS/subscriber/one_click_unsubscribe?verification=5.76359f46a06559a62e8e0404a80cc7e5&destination=jasonnorman66994%40gmail.com ]\xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0Help [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/ ]\r\n\r\n \r\n&lt;!-- /* template top padding on mobile */ @media only screen and (max-width: 480px) { table#flexible-abe-main-table { padding:0 !important; } } --&gt; ________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\nThis is an official email from the U.S. Census Bureau. If you have any questions or comments, please contact us (http://www.census.gov/about/contact-us.html [ http://www.census.gov/about/contact-us.html?utm_campaign=20260129pios4&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]).  \xc2\xa0 \r\nbody .abe-column-block {min-height: 5px;} table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:7px; margin-right:7px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;}\r\n'
