[2026-04-27 11:01:18] Raw text/plain payload: b"2026\xe2\x80\x8a-\xe2\x80\x8aHuman Perspective, Canadian Rebels, MAGA Jeopardy\r\nUkraine Update January 30\r\n\r\n2026\xe2\x80\x8a-\xe2\x80\x8aHuman Perspective, Canadian Rebels, MAGA Jeopardy\r\n\r\nDylan Combellick (https://medium.com/@dylan_combellick?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769762506936-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------39382d36_e290_47f3_9cf6_29812ce35a2a--------354e45830cd6)\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nJanuary 30, 2026\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\n12 min read\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nView on Medium (https://medium.com/p/df5c95b830a9?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769762506936-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------39382d36_e290_47f3_9cf6_29812ce35a2a--------354e45830cd6)\r\n\r\nI'm getting a late start this morning. I'm usually up by 0500 and write for as long as I can, but our son is taking the day off today, so we all slept in. I got up first anyway to let my wife and mother-in-law sleep in, and spent the morning with him. The reason I say this is why\xe2\x80\xa6 It's because tomorrow, Saturday, my mother-in-law, who is a 4th-grade teacher in Kyiv, is here with us in Uzhhorod. The schools are closed, thanks to broken pipes, freezing classrooms, and the indifference of the world. Tomorrow, she will be teaching\xe2\x80\xa6\r\n\r\nContinue reading (https://medium.com/p/df5c95b830a9?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769762506936-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------39382d36_e290_47f3_9cf6_29812ce35a2a--------354e45830cd6)\r\nThis is a member-only story and can only be read on Medium.\r\n\r\nSent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com by Dylan Combellick on Medium\r\nUnsubscribe (https://medium.com/me/email-settings/50207bf5a022/17765f7e2003?type=noSetting&newsletterV3Id=354e45830cd6&source=email-50207bf5a022-1769762506936-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------39382d36_e290_47f3_9cf6_29812ce35a2a---