e.com/translate?hl=en&sl=en&tl=ht&u=https%3A%2F%2Fcontent.govdelivery.com%2Faccounts%2FDEDNREC%2Fbulletins%2F406d260&utm_medium=email&utm_name=&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nYou are subscribed to Outdoor Delaware online magazine for Delaware Department of Natural Resources and Environmental Control. This information has recently been updated and is now available.\r\n\r\nA Year on the Job: DNREC Secretary and Deputy Secretary Reflect on Their First 365 Days [ https://dnrec.delaware.gov/outdoor-delaware/a-year-on-the-job-dnrec-secretary-and-deputy-secretary-reflect-on-their-first-365-days/?utm_medium=email&utm_name=&utm_source=govdelivery ] 01/30/2026 10:28 AM EST \r\n\r\nOn Jan. 30, 2025, Secretary Greg Patterson and Deputy Secretary Dayna Cobb stepped into the top leadership roles at the Delaware Department of Natural Resources and Environmental Control. To mark the occasion, Outdoor Delaware sat down with Patterson and Cobb to reflect on what surprised them most, the progress they\xe2\x80\x99re proud of and what they\xe2\x80\x99re focused on next for Delaware\xe2\x80\x99s environment and the people who protect it every day.\r\n\r\nThe post A Year on the Job: DNREC Secretary and Deputy Secretary Reflect on Their First 365 Days [ https://dnrec.delaware.gov/outdoor-delaware/a-year-on-the-job-dnrec-secretary-and-deputy-secretary-reflect-on-their-first-365-days/?utm_medium=email&utm_name=&utm_source=govdelivery ] appeared first on DNREC [ https://dnrec.delaware.gov?utm_medium=email&utm_name=&utm_source=govdelivery ].\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nStay Connected with the Delaware Department of Natural Resources and Environmental Control: Facebook [ https://www.facebook.com/DelawareDNREC?utm_medium=email&utm_name=&utm_source=govdelivery ]\xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0instagram [ https://www.instagram.com/delawarednrec/?utm_medium=email&utm_name=&utm_source=govdelivery ] \xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0X [ https://twitter.com/DelawareDNREC?utm_medium=email&utm_name=&utm_source=govdelivery ] \xc2\xa0 LinkedIn [ https://www.linkedin.com/company/delawarednrec?utm_medium=email&utm_name=&utm_source=govdelivery ] \xc2\xa0 you tube [ https://www.youtube.com/DelawareDNREC?utm_medium=email&utm_name=&utm_source=govdelivery ] \xc2\xa0 Govdelivery [ https://dnrec.delaware.gov/dnrec-e-mail-lists/?utm_medium=email&utm_name=&utm_source=govdelivery ] SUBSCRIBER SERVICES:\r\nManage Subscriptions [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/DEDNREC/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ]\xc2\xa0 |\xc2\xa0 Help [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/ ]  \r\n \r\n \r\nbody .abe-section-table {max-width:601px !important;} body .abe-column-block {min-height: 5px;} #footer-container td {padding:0px;} \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n This email was sent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com using govDelivery Communications Cloud on behalf of: Delaware Department of Natural Resources and Environmental Control \xc2\xb7 89 Kings Highway, Dover, DE 19901 GovDelivery logo  [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/?utm_medium=email&utm_name=&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\nbody .abe-column-block { min-height: 5px; } table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:10px; margin-right:10px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;} table.govd_hr {min-width: 100%;}\r\n'
