[2026-04-27 11:02:06] Raw text/plain payload: b"\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://click.e.aspca.org/? \r\n\r\n Your 2026 Member StatusSUPPORTER RECORD: Jorge\r\n 2026 Membership: PENDING\r\n 12,000 Member Goal: STILL SHORT\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n SUGGESTED ACTION: \r\nhttps://click.e.aspca.org/? \r\nBecome an ASPCA member now >>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n There\xe2\x80\x99s still time to help vulnerable dogs, cats and other animals in need! Last week, we set an ambitious goal of 12,000 new and renewed members because we know how many suffering animals are counting on us nationwide. These animals have so much love to give, but spend every day wondering if hope will ever come, and if the pain will ever stop.\r\n\r\nhttps://click.e.aspca.org/? \r\nWe still need more members to join us. Can you help, Jorge?\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://click.e.aspca.org/? \r\n\r\n\r\nThe clock is ticking down to the January 31 deadline, and we haven't heard from you yet. Can animals count on you this month? \r\nhttps://click.e.aspca.org/? \r\nPlease, rush your 2026 membership gift today!\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://click.e.aspca.org/? \r\nDONATE $25\r\n\r\nhttps://click.e.aspca.org/? \r\nDONATE $35\r\n\r\nhttps://click.e.aspca.org/? \r\nDONATE $50\r\n\r\nhttps://click.e.aspca.org/? \r\nDONATE $150\r\n\r\nhttps://click.e.aspca.org/? \r\nDONATE $500\r\n\r\nhttps://click.e.aspca.org/? \r\nOTHER\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://click.e.aspca.org/? \r\nRescuing and protecting innocent animals is a job we take on every day &mdash; responding to cruelty cases, providing food and medical treatment for those in our care, fighting for tougher anti-cruelty laws and finding loving families for rescued animals. And we desperately need more compassionate people like you by our side to continue this lifesaving work.\r\n\r\nhttps://click.e.aspca.org/? \r\nDon&rsquo;t miss this chance to help rescue and protect those in need this year &mdash; become one of 12,000 new and renewing ASPCA members with your first lifesaving gift today.\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://click.e.aspca.org/? \r\nDONATE $25\r\n\r\nhttps://click.e.aspca.org/? \r\nDONATE $35\r\n\r\nhttps://click.e.aspca.org/? \r\nDONATE $50\r\n\r\nhttps://click.e.aspca.org/? \r\nDONATE $150\r\n\r\nhttps://click.e.aspca.org/? \r\nDONATE $500\r\n\r\nhttps://click.e.aspca.org/? \r\nOTHER\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n Together we can confront the suffering that they endure every day &mdash; in puppy mills, alone on the streets, on factory farms, in neglectful situations and at the hands of abusers. That\xe2\x80\x99s why we are counting on you to make your membership gift before January 31.\r\n\r\nhttps://click.e.aspca.org/? \r\nPlease become a member before time runs out and help us reach a critical goal to support our lifesaving efforts nationwide.\r\n\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\nThe American Society for the Prevention of Cruelty to Animals\xc2\xae (ASPCA\xc2\xae)\r\nimpacts hundreds of thousands of animals each year through our work \r\nrescuing animals, securing adoptions, providing medical and rehabilitation\r\ntreatment, and driving significant legislative change that protects their\r\nlives and welfare. By receiving ASPCA emails and taking action on behalf of\r\nanimals, you are helping make this lifesaving work possible. Take a look at our latest news \r\nhttps://click.e.aspca.org/?%3D%3D \r\n\r\nhere . Please click \r\nhttps://click.e.aspca.org/? \r\nhere  if you wish to unsubscribe from the email list.\r\n \r\n\r\nhttps://click.e.aspca.org/?%3D%3D \r\nPrivacy Policy  | \r\n \r\nhttps://click.e.aspca.org/?%3D%3D \r\nASPCA Website  | \r\n \r\nhttps://click.e.aspca.org/?%3D%3D \r\nView Online \r\n\r\nConnect with us: \r\nhttps://click.e.aspca.org/?%3D%3D \r\nFacebook  | \r\n \r\nhttps://click.e.aspca.org/?%3D%3D \r\nX  | \r\n \r\nhttps://click.e.aspca.org/?%3D%3D \r\nInstagram  | \r\n \r\nhttps://click.e.aspca.org/?%3D%3D \r\nTikTok  | \r\n \r\nhttps://click.e.aspca.org/?%3D%3D \r\nYouTube \r\n\r\n \xc2\xa92026 ASPCA. All Rights Reserved.\r\n \r\n \r\nhttps://click.e.aspca.org/? \r\n\r\n\r\nThis email was sent to: \r\n jasonnorman66994@gmail.com\r\n\r\n\r\n This email was sent by: American Society For The Prevention Of Cruelty To Animals\r\n \r\n\r\n 424 East 92nd Street New York, NY, 10128-6804, US\r\n \r\n  \r\n \r\n\r\n\r\n"
