[2026-04-27 11:02:08] Raw text/plain payload: b'The approvals listed below may not be comprehensive. For the most current information, view the full listing of all approvals at Drugs@FDA [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=reportsSearch.process&rptName=1&reportSelectMonth=11&reportSelectYear=2025&nav ].\r\n\r\n*What\'s New Related to Drugs*\r\n\r\n*Updated Monday through Friday*\r\n\r\n\r\n  * Current and Resolved Drug Shortages and Discontinuations Reported to FDA [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/drugshortages/#tab4 ] \r\n  * Drug Firm Annual Registration Status [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/drls/default.cfm?utm_medium=&utm_source= ] \r\n  * Drug Firm Annual Registration Status Download File [ https://www.fda.gov/drugs/drug-approvals-and-databases/drug-establishments-current-registration-site?utm_medium=&utm_source= ] \r\n  * National Drug Code Directory [ https://www.fda.gov/drugs/drug-approvals-and-databases/national-drug-code-directory?utm_medium=&utm_source= ] \r\n  * NDC Unfinished Drugs Excluded Database File [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/cder/NDC_unfinished_excluded.zip?utm_medium=&utm_source= ] \r\n  * NDC Database Excluded Packages and Products [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/cder/ndc_excluded.zip?utm_medium=&utm_source= ] \r\n  * Wholesale Distributor and Third-Party Logistics Providers Reporting [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/wdd3plreporting/ ] \r\n  * Drug Establishments Current Registration Site [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/drls/ ] \r\n  * Drugs@FDA Data Files [ https://www.fda.gov/drugs/drug-approvals-and-databases/drugsfda-data-files ]\xc2\xa0 \r\n\r\n*Updated Biweekly*\r\n\r\n  * Competitive Generic Therapy Approvals [ https://www.fda.gov/drugs/generic-drugs/competitive-generic-therapy-approvals ] \r\n\r\n*January 27, 2026*\r\n\r\n\r\n  * FDA approves daratumumab and hyaluronidase-fihj with bortezomib, lenalidomide, and dexamethasone for newly diagnosed multiple myeloma [ https://www.fda.gov/drugs/resources-information-approved-drugs/fda-approves-daratumumab-and-hyaluronidase-fihj-bortezomib-lenalidomide-and-dexamethasone-newly ] \r\n\r\n*January 21, 2026*\r\n\r\n\r\n  * Drug Trials Snapshots KYGEVVI [ https://www.fda.gov/drugs/drug-approvals-and-databases/drug-trials-snapshots-kygevvi ] \r\n  * FDA Announces PreCheck Implementation Roadmap [ https://www.fda.gov/drugs/drug-safety-and-availability/fda-announces-precheck-implementation-roadmap ] \r\n\r\nThis report displays final approvals and tentative approvals of original and supplemental applications for the two days beginning on the earliest date listed below. Some approvals may be added to the Drugs@FDA database after this time span. For comprehensive approval reports, please use the monthly "All Approvals [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=reportsSearch.process&nav=&reportSelectMonth=9&reportSelectYear=2020&rptName=1&utm_medium=&utm_source=#navigation ]" report on Drugs@FDA.\r\n\r\nJanuary 29, 2026\r\n\r\nDrug Name and\r\nApplication Number Active Ingredient Dosage Form/ Route Submission Company Submission Classification Submission Status Gabapentin\r\nANDA #075350 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=075350 ] Gabapentin Capsule; Oral SUPPL-80 Actavis Elizabeth Labeling Approved Gabapentin\r\nANDA #075350 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=075350 ] Gabapentin Capsule; Oral SUPPL-80 Actavis Elizabeth Labeling Approved Ximino\r\nNDA #201922 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=201922 ] Minocycline Hydrochloride Capsule, Extended Release; Oral SUPPL-4 Journey Labeling Approved Gabapentin\r\nANDA #207099 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=207099 ] Gabapentin Capsule; Oral SUPPL-20 Rising Labeling Approved Vortioxetine Hydrobromide\r\nANDA #211130 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=211130 ] Vortioxetine Hydrobromide Tablet ORIG-1 Apotex Inc \xc2\xa0 Tentative Approval Dapagliflozin and Metformin Hydrochloride\r\nANDA #219755 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=219755 ] Dapagliflozin, Metformin Hydrochloride Tablet, Extended Release ORIG-1 Inventia Healthcare Limited \xc2\xa0 Tentative Approval \r\n\r\nJanuary 28, 2026\r\n\r\nDrug Name and\r\nApplication Number Active Ingredient Dosage Form/ Route Submission Company Submission Classification Submission Status Vfend\r\nNDA #021266 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=021266 ] Voriconazole Tablet; Oral SUPPL-59 Pf Prism Cv Labeling Approved Vfend\r\nNDA #021267 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=021267 ] Voriconazole Powder; Intravenous SUPPL-69 Pf Prism Cv Labeling Approved Vfend\r\nNDA #021630 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=021630 ] Voriconazole For Suspension; Oral SUPPL-49 Pf Prism Cv Labeling Approved Isosulfan Blue\r\nANDA #090874 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=090874 ] Isosulfan Blue Solution; Subcutaneous SUPPL-8 Mylan Institutional Manufacturing (CMC) Approved Daysee\r\nANDA #091467 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=091467 ] Ethinyl Estradiol; Levonorgestrel Tablet; Oral SUPPL-16 Lupin Ltd Manufacturing (CMC) Approved Daysee\r\nANDA #091467 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=091467 ] Ethinyl Estradiol; Levonorgestrel Tablet; Oral SUPPL-16 Lupin Ltd Manufacturing (CMC) Approved Abilify Maintena Kit\r\nNDA #202971 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=202971 ] Aripiprazole For Suspension, Extended Release; Intramuscular SUPPL-20 Otsuka Pharm Co Ltd Labeling Approved Sertraline Hydrochloride\r\nANDA #219655 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=219655 ] Sertraline Hydrochloride Capsule; Oral ORIG-1 Skg Pharma \xc2\xa0 Approved Yuvezzi\r\nNDA #220142 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=220142 ] Carbachol and Brimondine Tartrate Solution; Topical ORIG-1 Visus Therapeutics Inc. Type 3 - New Dosage Form and Type 4 - New Combination Approved Apalutamide\r\nANDA #220525 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=220525 ] Apalutamide Tablet ORIG-1 Hetero Labs Limited \xc2\xa0 Tentative Approval \r\n\r\nfeed [ https://www.fda.gov/about-fda/contact-fda/subscribe-podcasts-and-news-feeds?utm_medium=&utm_source= ]twitter [ https://www.twitter.com/US_FDA?utm_medium=&utm_source= ]facebook [ https://www.facebook.com/FDA?utm_medium=&utm_source= ]youtube [ https://www.youtube.com/user/USFoodandDrugAdmin?utm_medium=&utm_source= ]flickr [ https://www.flickr.com/photos/fdaphotos/albums/?utm_medium=&utm_source= ]  \r\n\r\n*Manage Subscriptions* [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 *Unsubscribe All* [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/subscriber/one_click_unsubscribe?verification=5.ee0243ee8741fe358146537aecf40e1e&destination=jasonnorman66994%40gmail.com ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 *Help* [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/ ]\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\nbody .abe-column-block {min-height: 5px;} td {line-height:1;} \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n This email was sent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com using GovDelivery Communications Cloud on behalf of: U.S. Food and Drug Administration \xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0\r\n10903 New Hampshire Ave\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0Sil