y responsible for determining whether any product or service is appropriate for you. If you have any questions regarding your financial situation, please consult with your professional advisor.\r\n\r\nIf you refinance Federal student loans into a private loan, you will lose access to Federal loan protections like income-driven repayment and loan forgiveness.Do not reply to this email. The inbox is not monitored. If you require support, please email \r\nmailto:support@credible.com \r\nsupport@credible.com .\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n"
