[2026-04-27 11:02:41] Raw text/plain payload: b"Three new stories on America Counts highlight data from the 2020-2024 American Community Survey 5-year estimates.  \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nUnited States Census Bureau [ https://www.census.gov/library/stories.html?utm_campaign=20260130aco&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nAmerica Counts: Stories Behind the Numbers\r\n\r\n?? New 2020-2024 American Community Survey 5-year estimates are now available.\xc2\xa0Explore highlights in three new stories on America Counts.\r\n\r\nModern townhomes line a suburban street. [ https://www.census.gov/library/stories/2026/01/housing-costs.html?utm_campaign=20260130aco&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n\r\nRental Costs Up, Mortgages Stayed Flat\r\n\r\nHomeowners\xe2\x80\x99 costs remained nearly unchanged from 2020-2024 compared to the previous five-year period while renters paid $100 more a month to a median $1,413, according to the 2020\xe2\x80\x932024 American Community Survey (ACS) 5-year estimates released this week.\r\n\r\nThe newly released data shows how housing costs changed in each of the nation\xe2\x80\x99s 3,144 counties between two five-year periods \xe2\x80\x93 2015-2019 and 2020-2024.\r\n\r\n*Read More* [ https://www.census.gov/library/stories/2026/01/housing-costs.html?utm_campaign=20260130aco&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nA woman counts cash at a service counter. [ https://www.census.gov/library/stories/2026/01/household-income-by-race-and-state.html?utm_campaign=20260130aco&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n\r\nHow Income Varies by Race and Geography\r\n\r\nMedian household income of almost all race and Hispanic origin groups increased in most states over the past 15 years (after adjusting for inflation) but fell among non-Hispanic White households in five states.\r\n\r\nAccording to the latest American Community Survey data, U.S. median household income was $80,734 during the 5-year period from 2020 to 2024 but varied by racial and ethnic group.\r\n\r\n*Read More* [ https://www.census.gov/library/stories/2026/01/household-income-by-race-and-state.html?utm_campaign=20260130aco&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nA couple stands in the front yard of their house. [ https://www.census.gov/library/stories/2026/01/mortgage-free-homes.html?utm_campaign=20260130aco&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n\r\nShare of Owner-Occupied, Mortgage-Free Homes Up in 2024\r\n\r\nThe share of mortgage-free homeowners continued to grow nationwide and in every state in 2024 \xe2\x80\x94 a possible reaction to higher interest rates and home prices that tend to discourage moves to new homes.\r\n\r\nThe percentage of U.S. owner-occupied homes owned free and clear rose from 34.4% in the 2010-2014 period to 39.4% in 2020-2024, according to the Census Bureau\xe2\x80\x99s latest American Community Survey 5-year estimates.\r\n\r\n*Read More* [ https://www.census.gov/library/stories/2026/01/mortgage-free-homes.html?utm_campaign=20260130aco&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nStay Connected with the Census Bureau\r\n\r\nFollow us on our social media channels, Facebook [ https://www.facebook.com/uscensusbureau?utm_campaign=20260130aco&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ], Instagram [ https://www.instagram.com/uscensusbureau/?utm_campaign=20260130aco&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ], LinkedIn [ https://www.linkedin.com/company/us-census-bureau?utm_campaign=20260130aco&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ], Twitter/X [ https://x.com/uscensusbureau?utm_campaign=20260130aco&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ], and\xc2\xa0YouTube [ https://www.youtube.com/user/uscensusbureau?utm_campaign=20260130aco&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ], so you never miss an update.\r\n\r\nStay Connected With Us on Social Media [ https://www.census.gov/about/contact-us/social_media.html?utm_campaign=20260130aco&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n\r\n*Follow Us* [ https://www.census.gov/about/contact-us/social_media.html?utm_campaign=20260130aco&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\n??\xc2\xa0You May Be Interested In\r\n\r\n  * *News Release:* Census Bureau Data Show Large Gains in Educational Attainment in Metropolitan and Micropolitan Statistical Areas [ https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2026/acs-5-year-gains-educational-attainment.html?utm_campaign=20260130aco&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n  * *Press Kit:* 2020-2024 American Community Survey 5-Year Estimates [ https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-kits/2026/acs-5-year-estimates.html?utm_campaign=20260130aco&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nAbout America Counts [ https://www.census.gov/library/stories.html?utm_campaign=20260130aco&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n\r\nAmerica Counts features stories on various topics including:\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n\r\n  * Families [ https://www.census.gov/library/stories.html?utm_campaign=20260130aco&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery&visual-list-fb55843e87%3Afilters=Census%3ATopic%2FFamilies ],\xc2\xa0Housing [ https://www.census.gov/library/stories.html?utm_campaign=20260130aco&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery&visual-list-fb55843e87%3Afilters=Census%3ATopic%2FHousing ],\xc2\xa0Employment [ https://www.census.gov/library/stories.html?utm_campaign=20260130aco&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery&visual-list-fb55843e87%3Afilters=Census%3ATopic%2FEmployment ], Business and Economy [ https://www.census.gov/library/stories.html?utm_campaign=20260130aco&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery&visual-list-fb55843e87%3Afilters=Census%3ATopic%2Fbusiness-economy ] \r\n  * Education [ https://www.census.gov/library/stories.html?utm_campaign=20260130aco&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery&visual-list-fb55843e87%3Afilters=Census%3ATopic%2FEducation ], [ https://www.census.gov/library/stories.html?utm_campaign=20260130aco&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery&visual-list-fb55843e87%3Afilters=Census%3ATopic%2FEducation ] Health [ https://www.census.gov/library/stories.html?utm_campaign=20260130aco&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery&visual-list-fb55843e87%3Afilters=Census%3ATopic%2FHealth ], Population [ https://www.census.gov/library/stories.html?utm_campaign=20260130aco&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery&visual-list-fb55843e87%3Afilters=Census%3ATopic%2FThePopulation ], Income and Poverty [ https://www.census.gov/library/stories.html?utm_campaign=20260130aco&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery&visual-list-fb55843e87%3Afilters=Census%3ATopic%2FIncome-Poverty ] \r\n\r\n*For the Media:*\xc2\xa0Contact our\xc2\xa0Public Information Office [ https://www.census.gov/newsroom/about.html?utm_campaign=20260130aco&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\xc2\xa0for inquiries or interviews.\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nDon't miss an America Counts story!\xc2\xa0Use the button below to sign up and update your preferences.\r\n\r\nSubscribe [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USCENSUS/signup/34555 ] | Manage Subscriptions [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USCENSUS/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] | Unsubscribe [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USCENSUS/subscriber/one_click_unsubscribe?verification=5.76359f46a06559a62e8e0404a80cc7e5&destination=jasonnorman66994%40gmail.com ] | Help [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/s/?utm_campaign=20260130aco&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n\r\n*Share This * [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USCENSUS/bulletins/406dc69 ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n  \r\n \r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\nThis is an official email from the U.S. Census Bureau. If you have any questions or comments, please contact us (http://www.census.gov/about/contact-us.html [ http://www.census.gov/about/contact-us.html?utm_campaign=20260130aco&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]).  \xc2\xa0 \r\nbody .abe-column-block {min-height: 5px;} table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:7px; margin-right:7px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;}\r\n"
