[2026-04-27 11:02:44] Raw text/plain payload: b"Stop paying 70% more than you need to\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n \r\n<https://www.energybillcruncher.com/la/?tg_ref=ebc_it&camp_id=review_and_compare::new_estimate&keyword=YB&sub2=1.27.22&csg_ref=leg>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nCartersville Homes Made The List\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nJason,\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nYou ever get the feeling that City of Cartersville - (GA) may be taking \r\nadvantage of you?\r\n\r\nSeems like the rate at which those bills are climbing is getting out of hand.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThe truth?\r\n\r\nYou shouldn't have to feel anxiety about your utilities.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nHere's the solution:\r\n\r\nHomes in your zipcode 30120 have been re-evaluated for solar estimates, which \r\nmeans yours have likely changed.\r\n\r\nSee If They Changed  \r\n<https://www.energybillcruncher.com/la/?tg_ref=EBCGM&camp_id=1.30.1&keyword=o1&sub2=1main>\r\n\r\nstop overpaying for electricity and ggo with the $0 down option!\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nOn your side,\r\n\r\nTeam EBC\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nYou received this email because you requested solar quotes from \r\nEnergybillcruncher.com.Click here to unsubscribe. \r\n<http://links.ebcsolarmail.com/e/encryptedUnsubscribe?_r=a5b385c9ed104e9baa0616bcbbf74110&_s=34a1e44b8ced4b4b80d08ec27da8a2cb&_t=9SA5puyf83R0jsFIGc7jIlULPK5hd8swENY8-r6QCMvyFL2ou_LDG2gSZ2Upi6NkddBAdcdDMpk6qiy4GRAmsbeuTxy8S_L3oV_PuKxRzwKLclKfHtPgKqRD6QIwesvE>\r\n\r\n\r\n6834 Cantrell Road #2024, Little Rock AK 72207 \r\n"
