[2026-04-27 11:02:51] Raw text/plain payload: b'The updated process is being implemented to align with amendments to 21 CFR 820, now entitled Quality System Regulation  \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nIf your email program has trouble displaying this email, view as a webpage [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/bulletins/406c6e5 ].\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nU.S. Food and Drug Administration, Center for Devices and Radiological Health\r\n\r\nBookmark and Share [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/bulletins/406c6e5?reqfrom=share ]\r\n\r\nFDA implements QMSR: Medical device inspections to be conducted under an updated process\r\n\r\nOn February 2, 2026, the FDA will begin implementing the Quality Management System Regulation (QMSR), which amends the Quality System Regulation (21 CFR Part 820). The FDA will discontinue use of the Quality System Inspection Technique (QSIT) for medical device inspections and will instead conduct inspections using the process described in the updated "Inspection of Medical Device Manufacturers Compliance Program (CP 7382.850) [ https://www.fda.gov/media/80195/download?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]". As of February 2, 2026, the FDA will no longer use "Inspection of Medical Device Manufacturers (CP 7382.845)" or "Medical Device PMA Preapproval and PMA Postmarket Inspections (CP 7383.001)".\r\n\r\nThis action is part of implementing the amendments to 21 CFR Part 820, the Quality Management System Regulation. The action continues the FDA\xe2\x80\x99s efforts to align its regulatory framework with that used by other regulatory authorities to promote consistency in the regulation of devices and provide timelier introduction of safe, effective, high-quality devices for patients.\r\n\r\n*Learn More* [ https://www.fda.gov/medical-devices/postmarket-requirements-devices/quality-management-system-regulation-qmsr?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n\r\nAdditional Resources:\r\n\r\n  * Quality Management System Regulation \xe2\x80\x93 Frequently Asked Questions [ https://www.fda.gov/medical-devices/quality-management-system-regulation-qmsr/quality-management-system-regulation-frequently-asked-questions?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n\r\nQuestions?\r\n\r\nIf you have questions,\xc2\xa0contact the Division of Industry and Consumer Education [ https://www.fda.gov/medical-devices/device-advice-comprehensive-regulatory-assistance/contact-us-division-industry-and-consumer-education-dice?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ].\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n  \r\n \r\n\r\nFollow us on X at @FDADeviceInfo [ https://x.com/FDADeviceInfo?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n\r\n \r\ntwitter [ https://x.com/FDADeviceInfo?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]facebook [ https://www.facebook.com/FDA?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]youtube [ https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC_giJ3xlEL9jUF1YfJdzzuQ?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]LinkedIn [ https://www.linkedin.com/company/fda?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]  \r\n\r\n*Manage Subscriptions* [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 *Unsubscribe All* [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/subscriber/one_click_unsubscribe?verification=5.ee0243ee8741fe358146537aecf40e1e&destination=jasonnorman66994%40gmail.com ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 *Help* [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/ ]\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\nbody .abe-column-block {min-height: 5px;} td {line-height:1;} \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n This email was sent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com using GovDelivery Communications Cloud on behalf of: U.S. Food and Drug Administration \xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0\r\n10903 New Hampshire Ave\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0Silver Spring, MD \xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0 20993-0002\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa01-888-INFO-FDA GovDelivery logo [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\nbody .abe-column-block { min-height: 5px; } table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:10px; margin-right:10px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;}\r\n'
