[2026-04-27 11:03:04] Raw text/plain payload: b'If your email program has trouble displaying this email, view as a webpage [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/bulletins/406e5d6 ].\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nUS Food and Drug Administration \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nNeogen Issues Voluntary Nationwide Recall of Neogen\xc2\xaeVet HYCOAT\xc2\xae Hyaluronate Sodium Sterile Solution [ https://www.fda.gov/safety/recalls-market-withdrawals-safety-alerts/neogen-issues-voluntary-nationwide-recall-neogenrvet-hycoatr-hyaluronate-sodium-sterile-solution?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n\r\nLANSING, Mich. \xe2\x80\x93 (BUSINESS WIRE) \xe2\x80\x93 Neogen Corporation (NASDAQ: NEOG) is voluntarily recalling all lots within expiry of Neogen\xc2\xaeVet HYCOAT\xc2\xae Hyaluronate Sodium Sterile Solution, for use in dogs, cats, and horses, to the veterinarian level. Neogen distributes this product, which is manufactured by a third-party supplier. This recall has been initiated due to microbial contamination in certain lots of 10 mL/50 mg product vials. Neogen received a number of reports of adverse events in horses following intraarticular injections of this product, which is inconsistent with its labeled, intended use. To date, Neogen has not received reports of adverse events when used in a manner consistent with the labeled use.\r\n\r\nWhile the company\xe2\x80\x99s investigation into this issue is ongoing, out of an abundance of caution the 2mL/20mg product vials are also being recalled. The company is proactively working with the FDA on this matter.\r\n\r\n*Risk Statement: This product is labeled as a sterile solution, but due to microbial contamination of certain lots, the recalled lots should no longer be considered sterile.*\xc2\xa0Vials that contain a microbial contaminant potentially result in infection in the animal. The risk is particularly acute when used as an intraarticular injection (which is inconsistent with its labeled, intended use). There also is risk if used according to the label as a topical wound management system in surgical wounds, burns, ulcers, and autograft procedures. To date, Neogen has not received reports of adverse events when used in a manner consistent with the labeled use.\r\n\r\nView Full Recall [ https://www.fda.gov/safety/recalls-market-withdrawals-safety-alerts/neogen-issues-voluntary-nationwide-recall-neogenrvet-hycoatr-hyaluronate-sodium-sterile-solution?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n  \r\n \r\n\r\nfeed [ https://www.fda.gov/about-fda/contact-fda/subscribe-podcasts-and-news-feeds?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]twitter [ https://www.twitter.com/US_FDA?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]facebook [ https://www.facebook.com/FDA?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]Instagram [ https://www.instagram.com/FDA?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]youtube [ https://www.youtube.com/user/USFoodandDrugAdmin?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]flickr [ https://www.flickr.com/photos/fdaphotos/albums/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]  \r\n\r\n*Manage Subscriptions* [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 *Unsubscribe All* [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/subscriber/one_click_unsubscribe?verification=5.ee0243ee8741fe358146537aecf40e1e&destination=jasonnorman66994%40gmail.com ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 *Help* [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/ ]\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\nbody .abe-column-block {min-height: 5px;} td {line-height:1;} \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n This email was sent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com using GovDelivery Communications Cloud on behalf of: U.S. Food and Drug Administration \xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0\r\n10903 New Hampshire Ave\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0Silver Spring, MD \xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0 20993-0002\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa01-888-INFO-FDA GovDelivery logo [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\nbody .abe-column-block { min-height: 5px; } table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:10px; margin-right:10px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;}\r\n'
