[2026-04-27 11:03:07] Raw text/plain payload: b'If your email program has trouble displaying this email, view as a webpage [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/bulletins/406bd36 ].\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nUS Food and Drug Administration \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nKoikoi Trading Inc., Issues Allergy Alert on Undeclared Wheat and Sesame in FU ZHOU FISH BALL (200g / 400g / 5lb) [ https://www.fda.gov/safety/recalls-market-withdrawals-safety-alerts/koikoi-trading-inc-issues-allergy-alert-undeclared-wheat-and-sesame-fu-zhou-fish-ball-200g-400g-5lb?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n\r\nCommerce, CA \xe2\x80\x93 Koikoi Trading Inc. is recalling certain lots of FU ZHOU FISH BALL products in multiple pack sizes (200g, 400g, and 5LB) because the products may contain undeclared allergens: wheat and sesame. People who have an allergy or severe sensitivity to wheat and/or sesame run the risk of a serious or life-threatening allergic reaction if they consume these products.\r\n\r\nThe products were distributed through foodservice and e-commerce channels and may have reached consumers through direct delivery to restaurant customers, distributors, and online fulfillment. Distribution reach may include CA, WA, OR, NY, FL, TX, NJ, IL, MA, GA, AZ, NV, CO.\r\n\r\n*Product Details / How to Identify:*\r\n\r\n\r\n  * *Product Name:*\xc2\xa0FU ZHOU FISH BALL \r\n  * *Brand:*\xc2\xa0YABA \r\n  * *Storage:*\xc2\xa0Keep Frozen \r\n\r\n*Pack Size Details:*\r\n\r\n\r\n  * *200g (consumer pack)* \r\n  * *UPC / Item #81009389866 item#27010* \r\n  * *Lot Code(s): 08/12/2025* \r\n  * *Best By / Expiration Date \xef\xbc\x9a08/11/2027 400g (consumer pack)* \r\n  * *UPC / Item # 81009389131 ITEM# 27550* \r\n  * *Lot Code(s):09/02/2025* \r\n  * *Best By / Expiration Date(s): 09/01/2027 5LB (foodservice pack)* \r\n  * *Pack Size: 4/5LB* \r\n  * *UPC / Item #: UPC: 81009389132 | Item #: 27530* \r\n  * *Lot Code(s): 11/11/2025* \r\n  * *Best By / Expiration Date(s): 11/12/2027* \r\n  * *Shelf Life: 24 months* \r\n\r\n*Health Risk / Illnesses:*\r\nTo date, no illnesses have been reported.\r\n\r\nView Full Recall\xc2\xa0 [ https://www.fda.gov/safety/recalls-market-withdrawals-safety-alerts/koikoi-trading-inc-issues-allergy-alert-undeclared-wheat-and-sesame-fu-zhou-fish-ball-200g-400g-5lb?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n  \r\n \r\n\r\nfeed [ https://www.fda.gov/about-fda/contact-fda/subscribe-podcasts-and-news-feeds?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]twitter [ https://www.twitter.com/US_FDA?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]facebook [ https://www.facebook.com/FDA?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]Instagram [ https://www.instagram.com/FDA?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]youtube [ https://www.youtube.com/user/USFoodandDrugAdmin?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]flickr [ https://www.flickr.com/photos/fdaphotos/albums/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]  \r\n\r\n*Manage Subscriptions* [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 *Unsubscribe All* [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/subscriber/one_click_unsubscribe?verification=5.ee0243ee8741fe358146537aecf40e1e&destination=jasonnorman66994%40gmail.com ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 *Help* [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/ ]\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\nbody .abe-column-block {min-height: 5px;} td {line-height:1;} \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n This email was sent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com using GovDelivery Communications Cloud on behalf of: U.S. Food and Drug Administration \xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0\r\n10903 New Hampshire Ave\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0Silver Spring, MD \xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0 20993-0002\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa01-888-INFO-FDA GovDelivery logo [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\nbody .abe-column-block { min-height: 5px; } table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:10px; margin-right:10px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;}\r\n'
