[2026-04-27 11:05:06] Raw text/plain payload: b"Hi, Javin Paul here. I\xe2\x80\x99ve analyzed job postings and talked to hiring managers at top companies. Here's what you'll need to know in 2026.\r\n\r\nView in browser (https://learn.educative.io/e3t/Ctc/RG+113/cz5H404/MWx128cBBSsW7_9ywn2XB8hcW2z6fd_5JZ910N5t-nks5m_5PW7lCGcx6lZ3kVW1khBFV5ZVf_hVQwNpn77LM-2W52H6Nf7sQ9QYN6cZC59VjvvZW3FMf-S65bDpvW8s2nmd3C-7WGW2jYryr12tgnsW5r1Q638-hHjXW5DxYPS8NtTTZW2nH9GF2vMt92W62zX0J2dMTjSW33T74L8SyBKTW2N-FTt92_jZcW401C_06h-vWsW6GbJcb1XB3SnW2cXYlS7rNjB8W17BBgC49_vHFW49fDx918yt9jW1kR2Ww3q8r3mW81sb8d4HdSqHW8wR2SJ1Yg_P4VpG5Z92xLcfWW1fH1Z44HdVFXW80L8gl708WwBW6VQbkG5H4px2N5BcPRv-1YmcW55r6y14421D-W17kGRZ1FrwxSVyt0sB9bz-1VW5q9hfc7MksHDMG0wrDt2f3hW6yqRBP6X3sp_W8djwck5zkvNYW5_K-Hz2M9Bx7W4-vqHT2KlW1SW23y3DJ3JLqzbW7vmQn34bhHRlN2dlgcFwFJsjW1WMW241lHTzkW3FTYCy6TgjVDf5rPCyF04 )\r\n\r\nEducative (https://learn.educative.io/e3t/Ctc/RG+113/cz5H404/MWx128cBBSsW7_9ywn2XB8hcW2z6fd_5JZ910N5t-nl23prCCW8wLKSR6lZ3llW6Zx1zv8_tkr5W1jj-wK56ShVgW1JFswF2BbHJ0W54WThk7JLLfjW5PQS4W5Bm9trW5zlmBf8KdvwNW7PD5RT7-nvgWW4qdnsd4T1b-kV5M3RG8wXWMJW1GvFgt4rw-y9N87JsPBBJKHsVBvT-Q5SPF60N7-qF78mWCWZW2nQ0fZ6TZlNJV3McSH8vd7R3W61zv1z33mNXLVS809g5tsFnGW4Fklqw165vRhN3_04GhGFCZYW6BK1f11K6YhVW4MYqvb7bJPkVW3LNZqq66YLKfW79j3VW890Lq8V2mVyp41h1wyW4STdj25KV2NdW3PZX8C2XGf9hMSp3lZs24cJW2Mt0Bz8sYT-lf75M6lR04 )\r\n\r\nJasonnorman,\r\n\r\nToday, I am thrilled to welcome back Javin Paul as our guest expert. He's true a pro who has a ton of expertise to share about the current job market. I think you'll get a lot out of his advice today.\r\n\r\n\xe2\x8c\x9b Before we start, Educative is running a Flash Sale today (https://learn.educative.io/e3t/Ctc/RG+113/cz5H404/MWx128cBBSsW7_9ywn2XB8hcW2z6fd_5JZ910N5t-nl23prCCW8wLKSR6lZ3llW6Zx1zv8_tkr5W1jj-wK56ShVgW1JFswF2BbHJ0W54WThk7JLLfjW5PQS4W5Bm9trW5zlmBf8KdvwNW7PD5RT7-nvgWW4qdnsd4T1b-kV5M3RG8wXWMJW1GvFgt4rw-y9N87JsPBBJKHsVBvT-Q5SPF60N7-qF78mWCWZW2nQ0fZ6TZlNJV3McSH8vd7R3W61zv1z33mNXLVS809g5tsFnGW4Fklqw165vRhN3_04GhGFCZYW6BK1f11K6YhVW4MYqvb7bJPkVW3LNZqq66YLKfW79j3VW890Lq8V2mVyp41h1wyW4STdj25KV2NdW3PZX8C2XGf9hMSp3lZs24cJW2Mt0Bz8sYT-lf75M6lR04 ) . It's just about done, but you can still lock in a great discount through the link above if you move quickly.\r\n\r\nOver to Javin!\r\n\r\nHello guys, Javin here. If you don\xe2\x80\x99t know me, I am a Java developer and share my thoughts on javarevisited.blogspot.com (https://learn.educative.io/e3t/Ctc/RG+113/cz5H404/MWx128cBBSsW7_9ywn2XB8hcW2z6fd_5JZ910N5t-nkM3prCCW7Y8-PT6lZ3ncW4MLrj61QM_xwW21zR_f6xbXlFW2Ycg-Y6XmCXfW3ZjL4m4HHfNZW6qmbF68SVmsmW3RTkPc8FqxM6W25FjTC8pbLjTW2jM1HW6GK-MjN9jFJkyzZ0y0W4l2rjd3DR886VVgPhf432jgDN8JLcKk90fHwW3S9L208vhs6pN3NZCLLJXJcBW8RLCN25RsqfsW6jfgWj3yfsJvW3kT7qq7GNklxW7N_9Xt29TKlvW3N2-_D2WQ8WyW6wk4nL7ZrWl2N1wTV0QTBl2JW6bcxjR7ttL2kW2WJtF233Mz3tN4qZWMLG2sYgW3N2vRL31Ww6-W26pBcD8p65_vf8FCqnj04 ) . I have been writing since 2010 and have written multiple articles on Java, Programming and Coding interviews.\r\n\r\nThe tech landscape evolves rapidly. What was cutting-edge last year might be table-stakes today. If you want to stay competitive, advance your career, and command top salaries in 2026, you need to master specific skills that employers desperately want.\r\n\r\nI\xe2\x80\x99ve spent time analyzing job postings, talking to hiring managers at top tech companies, and evaluating what separates mid-level engineers from senior engineers.\r\n\r\nThe result? These 5 skills will define your career trajectory in 2026.\r\n\r\nSo without any further ado, here are the key tech skills you can learn or improve in 2026 to give your career a boost and make yourself more employable in the current market.\r\n\r\n1. System Design & Distributed Systems Architecture\r\n\r\nWhy It Matters: System design is the ultimate skill separator. It\xe2\x80\x99s what determines if you can handle complex problems at scale, and it\xe2\x80\x99s the gatekeeper for senior roles and high salaries.\r\n\r\nCompanies like Google, Meta, Amazon, and Netflix won\xe2\x80\x99t hire senior engineers without strong system design skills. Being able to architect scalable, fault-tolerant systems is non-negotiable.\r\n\r\nWhat You\xe2\x80\x99ll Learn:\r\n\r\n- Designing systems that scale to millions of users\r\n- Trade-offs between consistency and availability\r\n- Database sharding, caching, and load balancing\r\n- Microservices architecture patterns\r\n- Real-world system design case studies (Twitter, Uber, Netflix, etc.)\r\n\r\nRecommended Resource:\r\n\r\n\xf0\x9f\x91\x89 Grokking the Modern System Design Interview (https://learn.educative.io/e3t/Ctc/RG+113/cz5H404/MWx128cBBSsW7_9ywn2XB8hcW2z6fd_5JZ910N5t-njz5m_5PW5BWr2F6lZ3nrW66Gj247LFZ8lN2hRSwcLNwfYW3LG_HV6r_csRW18DBft355QbXW3pXbM44R-fgZN6V8R4Tm0zfqW2vVNH21VTp2wW27SpVF4zp5BXW3rbNGn8kVbYKW9fmZzJ2BftBfW4f4p7t7brp5gW8BQh5b6-JKn7W106NYG733Sq9W7bGd_s4Mws6sN3Z-pXN2_4FLW18gXkB8whgPQW82dDD_5J9Z0fW4Gx8LZ8B1b-PW5L9Sk557M9yqN5cl3znv6TYrW2cjMKj3lVfV8W3DQHpx4FymMkW7V1h5q5-Jy-6W2hWW8d4QyrWPW71h6Ty6SkcFyW3B4j2S6ZvxgcW63zFw980XVvmW4Hr4yf275SGfW7MgyMZ60xpwQW3FKyj97mjSDHW3rC_1v4bZJS7N1qkbrYXdmY8N1Q32vzkgYfRVTfV_g47Y5rlf5jCvVg04 )\r\n\r\nThis is the #1 resource for system design learning. The hands-on nature and visual diagrams make complex concepts stick immediately. The course covers real systems from companies you know and breaks down how they actually work.\r\n\r\nWhy: Visual learning is unmatched for system design. When you\xe2\x80\x99re in an interview, you\xe2\x80\x99ll recall these diagrams perfectly.\r\n\r\n2. Advanced Data Structures & Algorithms\r\n\r\nWhy It Matters: You\xe2\x80\x99ll never stop doing algorithm problems. They appear in every coding interview at top companies. But more importantly, understanding algorithms deeply makes you a better engineer \xe2\x80\x94 you write more efficient code and spot performance bottlenecks immediately.\r\n\r\nWhat You\xe2\x80\x99ll Learn:\r\n\r\n- Advanced data structures (graphs, tries, segment trees, disjoint sets)\r\n- Dynamic programming patterns\r\n- Graph algorithms (BFS, DFS, Dijkstra, Floyd-Warshall)\r\n- Time and space complexity analysis\r\n- Pattern recognition for solving problems efficiently\r\n\r\nRecommended Resource:\r\n\r\n\xf0\x9f\x91\x89 Grokking the Coding Interview Patterns (https://learn.educative.io/e3t/Ctc/RG+113/cz5H404/MWx128cBBSsW7_9ywn2XB8hcW2z6fd_5JZ910N5t-njg5m_5PW50kH_H6lZ3m4VwFSwG8HqrQTV6R3Gk6H966gW1xRDq421Hq1nW4sg3jy5jz1xxW4NjZs-7Mxkw3W6RNsRt1jC9JvN4nfZy2WSxJZW3kNjDT6z9khHN7FLrnB154mLW8jSd956w_44TW3k--Pn4RSTmsVJfn9l7hYZScW8JNGbS46B-NsW1fZ1t996FgcKW7pW6BX6hHKFPV_Vvcl4Z0yR_N4NBswxH-nLhW1ktQpB3byDPxMBpRwtccKWGV_YR557S08X0W5tLjg-2kv3P1W11cBLr3XgFPgW8Nvpnk9gv8ppW89ZxkT47jgwWW39G-MN34Z47lW5XnqxZ2khQjxN1QPtx83NV7ZW7xc_9F2ZHQ9cW3Y-LYs6nJXJrW1J2CfB44m9HMVpbRgv7L3bpwW3vR1wm3-gm4df7PJzY404 )\r\n\r\nThis course teaches patterns, not random problems. Instead of grinding 500 LeetCode problems, you learn 15\xe2\x80\x9320 patterns that solve hundreds of problems.\r\n\r\nWhy: Pattern-based learning is exponentially more efficient than brute-force grinding. You\xe2\x80\x99ll spend less time practicing but retain more knowledge.\r\n\r\n3. Cloud Architecture (AWS/GCP/Azure)\r\n\r\nWhy It Matters: Cloud is no longer optional \xe2\x80\x94 it\xe2\x80\x99s essential. Every company is moving to the cloud. If you can\xe2\x80\x99t design and deploy cloud-native applications, you\xe2\x80\x99re limiting your career severely.\r\n\r\nSenior engineers need to understand cloud-native architecture, serverless computing, containerization, and infrastructure-as-code.\r\n\r\nWhat You\xe2\x80\x99ll Learn:\r\n\r\n- Cloud service models (IaaS, PaaS, SaaS)\r\n- AWS/GCP/Azure core services\r\n- Cloud-native architecture patterns\r\n- Serverless computing (Lambda, Cloud Functions)\r\n- Cost optimization and security best practices\r\n\r\nRecommended Resource:\r\n\r\n\xf0\x9f\x91\x89 Cloud (AWS): Master the AWS Certified Solutions Architect \xe2\x80\x93 Associate SAA-C03 Exam (https://learn.educative.io/e3t/Ctc/RG+113/cz5H404/MWx128cBBSsW7_9ywn2XB8hcW2z6fd_5JZ910N5t-njz5m_5PW5BWr2F6lZ3m3W9khKDS1v5Tm8W7W8Q2Q3TqyptW1L5slq8kkfDSW1KRyPm9kS5xdW5QJXxx617yKsW4_Fx0f2pKjhZW7T3Zpy76g-yBVVvx2z1FWRsYW96vhSZ7W_wpSW6j5WGz3mfs4nW7TrXSL6cvXRvW417MPG8flB0DW4hxmCp2Skq9jN4tFkSDRqsD-W3CQdN988CBDYW680MH_7TB76HW29jS3q2xxS8VW8csS2_8Xj5VZW3Zz6bC6qVVzMW5649fx2Q1dRqW1_2B8y49JxHMN5FNKsDbBsGwW7wJMJQ5GjYfLW1Rl1Yp8dHd2TW19TQrq5JG645W7_TrSw3dZ9tyW1Y4Q-c6mzSXNW7Wzbnw4gxXFMW8Qz0cT8QHTZgW15f0fY3hHzQ7N2Zk1sdSTG5yM2NmsN-dTc6W6rcN5728q8fGW2dMZJY6CwLQ0f7MrM-C04 )\r\n\r\nEducative\xe2\x80\x99s cloud programs are comprehensive and project-based. You\xe2\x80\x99ll build real cloud infrastructure, not just watch videos. The hands-on projects give you resume-worthy work.\r\n\r\nWhy: Cloud is where the money is in 2026. Engineers with strong cloud skills earn 30\xe2\x80\x9340% more.\r\n\r\n4. Kubernetes & Container Orchestration\r\n\r\nWhy It Matters: Kubernetes has become the standard for deploying containerized applications at scale. DevOps, backend engineers, and even frontend engineers increasingly need Kubernetes knowledge.\r\n\r\nUnderstanding K8s separates engineers who can handle complex deployments from those who can\xe2\x80\x99t.\r\n\r\nWhat You\xe2\x80\x99ll Learn:\r\n\r\n- Docker containerization fundamentals\r\n- Kubernetes architecture (pods, deployments, services)\r\n- StatefulSets, DaemonSets, and Jobs\r\n- Networking and storage in Kubernetes\r\n- Helm, ConfigMaps, and Secrets management\r\n- Deploying and scaling real applications\r\n\r\nRecommended Resource:\r\n\r\n\xf0\x9f\x91\x89 A Practical Guide to Kubernetes (https://learn.educative.io/e3t/Ctc/RG+113/cz5H404/MWx128cBBSsW7_9ywn2XB8hcW2z6fd_5JZ910N5t-njg5m_5PW50kH_H6lZ3lpW185xVd99B-HdW2R9ySq8jhB8cW82NX_h5P11kWW2rFM6P930XpfW2DRFqW3lX4rbW2svQvB21z_9-W1BJKJ-59jSVCW3pcrFh2CRqt4W2Wx40c6hxrfSW1FTsZS7gs8V3W2XJnRR4Z6gSkW1jcVCc4lN3StV405DL1HfrQQW32-28b1L-5xmW5x61bg1KTDhkW25v-7L1PmmLHW1R12WW91XLrZW3wY2_93p5YpfW2K7_zd3fNM-nW7xZWkn4HxnybVsGRB07vTFyVW88sRRG4VMXDcW4WNbtZ2SkqKHW1YK-ZV8GZ4SZW9f-DY14hRDmlW79GBxB45bgNjW22tdJ85kmG8QW3xsdTG16DnfwW2sJ3JL6nLtTbW8pFK8f4d8KQsW1ytk0s3s_FwnW2WN_6G85ZH9ff3Dj_H404 )\r\n\r\nLook for comprehensive Kubernetes courses on Udemy that focus on practical deployment, not just theory. When Udemy has sales (which they always do), grab a course for $10\xe2\x80\x9315.\r\n\r\nWhy: K8s knowledge adds significant value to your profile and opens doors to DevOps and platform engineering roles.\r\n\r\n5. API Design & REST/GraphQL Mastery\r\n\r\nWhy It Matters: Every software engineer builds APIs or works with APIs daily. Designing good APIs is an art. Poor API design causes problems for years. Companies need engineers who can design elegant, scalable, maintainable APIs.\r\n\r\nWhat You\xe2\x80\x99ll Learn:\r\n\r\n- REST API design principles and best practices\r\n- HTTP methods and status codes (the right way)\r\n- API versioning and backward compatibility\r\n- GraphQL fundamentals and when to use it\r\n- API security and rate limiting\r\n- Documentation and developer experience\r\n\r\nRecommended Resource:\r\n\r\n\xf0\x9f\x91\x89 Grokking the API Design Interview (https://learn.educative.io/e3t/Ctc/RG+113/cz5H404/MWx128cBBSsW7_9ywn2XB8hcW2z6fd_5JZ910N5t-njz5m_5PW5BWr2F6lZ3pjW50p0FY1hRRh_W8q4pD15nlsGMW2YWzh81vLdlTW5r_WKn2-CMZNN6VNvV67dfSPW7ycK4G4bqQ3lW59HSGZ9dsPTDV4sFPy3wlGrBW3R7lRk39rsPfW6GSXG57Cy_-4VsFJsp6n4yY2W55RdwC6lRjf3N5MwZ5JlKTtJN2XcTRV7CrVXW1Gg5s555Q1rZW1Y21j-6qJn5MW9cf3d61JbbdlW3Tz-ZQ7X4hxvW6s_mXz7trZk3W5Ld82d8BxhK5W8kSlZ-7H7DmbW2Yb9tx78DkkVW2RgBw25PrbygW37xmv74qkFc2N5v6Rdz1S_vhW6FCN4H7ZLXfSW3xVt4y7SZrCfW4Q8kwC7MGwYyVjxc867tjVGpW3CFFTr8zbcTZW6GCRCc5825l3W4RxgRv8B3ydpW5SsNjt86kdKPVr0BQj6rzPGzf75Xsmq04 )\r\n\r\nIn this course, you will design APIs for well-known systems such as YouTube, Stripe, and Zoom, understanding how these APIs integrate into the larger product ecosystem.\r\n\r\nWhy: Great API design is a superpower. Companies pay premium salaries for engineers who understand this deeply.\r\n\r\nFinal Thoughts\r\n\r\nThe engineers earning $200K+ in 2026 aren\xe2\x80\x99t just good coders \xe2\x80\x94 they\xe2\x80\x99re T-shaped professionals. They have depth in core skills (like system design, cloud, or database optimization) and breadth across multiple domains.\r\n\r\nThese 10 skills represent the breadth modern engineers need. Choose 2\xe2\x80\x933 to develop deep expertise in, and spend 2026 becoming expert-level.\r\n\r\nBy the way, you don't need to join these courses individually, you can just get an Educative Unlimited Subscription (https://learn.educative.io/e3t/Ctc/RG+113/cz5H404/MWx128cBBSsW7_9ywn2XB8hcW2z6fd_5JZ910N5t-nll3prCCW95jsWP6lZ3nkVtmDNZ3nQ302W39J3Rt53cS9bW5J9hnh5zLhFpVjRLz87kQHG4W79Wj7B1PssTVW1tMV6V70PqtDW8Gw4sm86LqXwDt5_nrBJQCW91q1_c5Kw1qlW66mGBy7P2nWbW8NFT6f6NXkLtW8nwY7x6yMCKDW7SGLKK4KYwV8N4pLsDG7T8DtW8SLjPQ3_N5TFW9cRN684bV3sbW5zj_wB6T9GB2W3wx0np7_pYHlW1BLQm13Gy1JSW1zjdp886fy3CW3TsD9T1YXbYVVn5kGw306ZJ2W263WmK5gVlGNW5KhcvL390bkRW10qZ6z3-ldn9W5nznYZ2HjhxRW4CxvG61gtWysW7t2RdB7FLl9VW6H9sY24rP87PW3mbrM38vpZ09f148VbM04 ) and you are all set. This single subscription gives access to 1400+ AI powered, high-quality, interactive courses for coding interviews and learning in-demand tech skills.\r\n\r\nYour career in 2027 will thank you for the investment you make in 2026.\r\n\r\nStart learning today. Your future self will be grateful.\r\n\r\nJavin Paul\r\n\r\nJava programmer\r\n\r\nP.S. I\xe2\x80\x99m also the creator of the Javarevisited newsletter (https://learn.educative.io/e3t/Ctc/RG+113/cz5H404/MWx128cBBSsW7_9ywn2XB8hcW2z6fd_5JZ910N5t-nkM3prCCW7Y8-PT6lZ3kZW8hh-Rg4xt7mYW80-k8T8bVKMLW6WPbMQ3YzRLRW6Prr0G59CHtkW8BQP0Z5P63szMJr0WFF4KHrW99Lrch8zT3XJN1-j16-4QJ3mW7wFNk04w5W7tW3ws0ls6TpD2HW896fPx5w_3ccW6PFRrs2_CpJ5W7_cL874pdLDqW2wYyqP1BnZq_W2S73176rhTDrW66RC521znqxhW82MQZ65vPX45W3w3Hhw60vY3dW1Ldf5Q8jCp3kVdBRp33jLn9wW79vTPJ9jHGTcW13kX1y8DXdBgVqzkSX1-xh_FW5Y9VcP3T8Y3_W6Fb0gl7j_9c0W5QxdlN8-npgXf6qgkzs04 ) , where I share interview t