[2026-04-27 11:05:26] Raw text/plain payload: b'Stop counting steps and start counting years\r\nHow Much Walking Is Good For Your Age\xe2\x80\x8a-\xe2\x80\x8aThe Surprising Truth\r\n\r\nStop counting steps and start counting years\r\n\r\nShikha | Author (https://medium.com/@SvaCopy?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769862614675-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-84ac01765c52------------------------4f6d4703_7c96_482e_951f_42c6b3ebff0d--------bd173739d135)\r\n\xc2\xa0in\xc2\xa0Write A Catalyst (https://medium.com/write-a-catalyst?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769862614675-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-84ac01765c52------------------------4f6d4703_7c96_482e_951f_42c6b3ebff0d--------bd173739d135)\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nJanuary 31, 2026\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\n5 min read\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nView on Medium (https://medium.com/write-a-catalyst/8cbb96402f3e?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769862614675-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-84ac01765c52------------------------4f6d4703_7c96_482e_951f_42c6b3ebff0d--------bd173739d135)\r\n\r\nPhoto by Jasmin Chew (http://redirect.medium.systems/r-qIXTjNjz2v?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769862614675-newsletter.subscribeToProfile--8cbb96402f3e-----------------------4f6d4703_7c96_482e_951f_42c6b3ebff0d--------bd173739d135)\r\n on Unsplash (http://redirect.medium.systems/r-Gu6Z_HViFN?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769862614675-newsletter.subscribeToProfile--8cbb96402f3e-----------------------4f6d4703_7c96_482e_951f_42c6b3ebff0d--------bd173739d135)\r\n\r\nA 74-year-old woman walked past me on the trail. Steady. Confident. She smiled and kept moving.\r\n\r\nTen minutes later, a man who couldn\'t be older than 40 stumbled to a bench, completely gassed after what looked like a short jog.\r\n\r\nOne person was training to survive. The other was training to perform.\r\n\r\nOnly one of them will probably make it to 74.\r\n\r\nThat got me spiraling into research papers at midnight, texting doctor friends.\r\n\r\nWhat I found changed everything I thought I knew about movement, age, and what actually keeps humans functioning.\r\n\r\nThe Question Nobody\'s Asking\r\n\r\nWe obsess over "how many steps?" when we\xe2\x80\xa6\r\n\r\nContinue reading (https://medium.com/write-a-catalyst/8cbb96402f3e?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769862614675-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-84ac01765c52------------------------4f6d4703_7c96_482e_951f_42c6b3ebff0d--------bd173739d135)\r\nThis is a member-only story and can only be read on Medium.\r\n\r\nSent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com by Shikha | Author on Medium\r\nUnsubscribe (https://medium.com/me/email-settings/50207bf5a022/3d34de41dbac?type=noSetting&newsletterV3Id=bd173739d135&collectionId=84ac01765c52&source=email-50207bf5a022-1769862614675-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-84ac01765c52------------------------4f6d4703_7c96_482e_951f_42c6b3ebff0d--------bd173739d135)\r\n from this writer\'s email notifications\r\nManage your email settings (https://medium.com/me/settings/notifications?hash=3d34de41dbac&userId=50207bf5a022&settingsRouteHash=%23manageSubscriptions&source=email-50207bf5a022-1769862614675-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-84ac01765c52------------------------4f6d4703_7c96_482e_951f_42c6b3ebff0d--------bd173739d135)\r\n\r\n3500 South DuPont Highway, Suite IQ-101, Dover,\xc2\xa0DE\xc2\xa019901\r\nCareers (https://medium.com/jobs-at-medium/work-at-medium-959d1a85284e?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769862614675-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-84ac01765c52------------------------4f6d4703_7c96_482e_951f_42c6b3ebff0d--------bd173739d135)\r\n\xc2\xb7Help Center (https://help.medium.com/hc/en-us?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769862614675-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-84ac01765c52------------------------4f6d4703_7c96_482e_951f_42c6b3ebff0d--------bd173739d135)\r\n\xc2\xb7Privacy Policy (https://policy.medium.com/medium-privacy-policy-f03bf92035c9?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769862614675-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-84ac01765c52---------------