[2026-04-27 11:06:06] Raw text/plain payload: b'And I say this with love, but also mild judgment\r\nYou\'re Severely Underutilizing Your iPhone\'s Lock Screen\r\n\r\nAnd I say this with love, but also mild judgment\r\n\r\nThe Useful Tech (https://medium.com/@theusefultech?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769879194341-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-953b148ade73------------------------bdddf8fe_2c4d_435f_812e_86c20ffc4079--------eeb618317985)\r\n\xc2\xa0in\xc2\xa0The Useful Tech (https://medium.com/the-useful-tech?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769879194341-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-953b148ade73------------------------bdddf8fe_2c4d_435f_812e_86c20ffc4079--------eeb618317985)\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nJanuary 31, 2026\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\n9 min read\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nView on Medium (https://medium.com/the-useful-tech/17bb11411cd7?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769879194341-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-953b148ade73------------------------bdddf8fe_2c4d_435f_812e_86c20ffc4079--------eeb618317985)\r\n\r\nSource: Author Screenshot\r\n\r\nLast week, a friend watched me unlock my phone and immediately asked why my lock screen looked "completely different" from what he saw the day before. Different wallpaper. Different widgets. Different shortcuts in the corners.\r\n\r\n"Did you get a new phone?"\r\n\r\nNo. I just know how to use the one I have.\r\n\r\nMost people set up their iPhone lock screen once, pick a nice photo of their dog or their vacation, and never touch it again. Meanwhile, they\'re sitting on what\'s essentially a customizable command center that can change based on time, location, and what they\'re doing.\r\n\r\nI\'m going to\xe2\x80\xa6\r\n\r\nContinue reading (https://medium.com/the-useful-tech/17bb11411cd7?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769879194341-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-953b148ade73------------------------bdddf8fe_2c4d_435f_812e_86c20ffc4079--------eeb618317985)\r\nThis is a member-only story and can only be read on Medium.\r\n\r\nSent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com by The Useful Tech on Medium\r\nUnsubscribe (https://medium.com/me/email-settings/50207bf5a022/36cafcf9fe17?type=noSetting&newsletterV3Id=eeb618317985&collectionId=953b148ade73&source=email-50207bf5a022-1769879194341-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-953b148ade73------------------------bdddf8fe_2c4d_435f_812e_86c20ffc4079--------eeb618317985)\r\n from this writer\'s email notifications\r\nManage your email settings (https://medium.com/me/settings/notifications?hash=36cafcf9fe17&userId=50207bf5a022&settingsRouteHash=%23manageSubscriptions&source=email-50207bf5a022-1769879194341-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-953b148ade73------------------------bdddf8fe_2c4d_435f_812e_86c20ffc4079--------eeb618317985)\r\n\r\n3500 South DuPont Highway, Suite IQ-101, Dover,\xc2\xa0DE\xc2\xa019901\r\nCareers (https://medium.com/jobs-at-medium/work-at-medium-959d1a85284e?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769879194341-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-953b148ade73------------------------bdddf8fe_2c4d_435f_812e_86c20ffc4079--------eeb618317985)\r\n\xc2\xb7Help Center (https://help.medium.com/hc/en-us?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769879194341-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-953b148ade73------------------------bdddf8fe_2c4d_435f_812e_86c20ffc4079--------eeb618317985)\r\n\xc2\xb7Privacy Policy (https://policy.medium.com/medium-privacy-policy-f03bf92035c9?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769879194341-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-953b148ade73------------------------bdddf8fe_2c4d_435f_812e_86c20ffc4079--------eeb618317985)\r\n\xc2\xb7Terms of service (https://policy.medium.com/medium-terms-of-service-9db0094a1e0f?source=email-50207bf5a022-1769879194341-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-953b148ade73------------------------bdddf8fe_2c4d_435f_812e_86c20ffc4079--------eeb618317985)'
