[2026-04-27 11:08:20] Raw text/plain payload: b'If your email program has trouble displaying this email, view as a webpage [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/bulletins/40739a0 ].\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nUS Food and Drug Administration\r\nFDA implements QMSR: Medical device inspections to be conducted under an updated process\r\n\r\nOn February 2, 2026, the FDA will begin implementing the Quality Management System Regulation (QMSR), which amends the Quality System Regulation (21 CFR Part 820). The FDA will discontinue use of the Quality System Inspection Technique (QSIT) for medical device inspections and will instead conduct inspections using the process described in the updated "Inspection of Medical Device Manufacturers Compliance Program (CP 7382.850) [ https://links-2.govdelivery.com/CL0/https:%2F%2Fwww.fda.gov%2Fmedia%2F80195%2Fdownload%3Futm_medium=email%26utm_source=govdelivery/1/0101019c10424ed0-a31dd83e-ebfd-4a2d-ac55-8d61ee92406e-000000/qE6S1sHhi_PUhKVg6Vrm_0L3iBJwtR4GmQQypYg3qVk=442 ]". As of February 2, 2026, the FDA will no longer use "Inspection of Medical Device Manufacturers (CP 7382.845)" or "Medical Device PMA Preapproval and PMA Postmarket Inspections (CP 7383.001)".\r\n\r\nThis action is part of implementing the amendments to 21 CFR Part 820, the Quality Management System Regulation. The action continues the FDA\xe2\x80\x99s efforts to align its regulatory framework with that used by other regulatory authorities to promote consistency in the regulation of devices and provide timelier introduction of safe, effective, high-quality devices for patients.\r\n\r\n*Learn More* [ https://www.fda.gov/medical-devices/postmarket-requirements-devices/quality-management-system-regulation-qmsr?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n\r\nAdditional Resources:\r\n\r\n  * Quality Management System Regulation \xe2\x80\x93 Frequently Asked Questions [ https://links-2.govdelivery.com/CL0/https:%2F%2Fwww.fda.gov%2Fmedical-devices%2Fquality-management-system-regulation-qmsr%2Fquality-management-system-regulation-frequently-asked-questions%3Futm_medium=email%26utm_source=govdelivery/1/0101019c10424ed0-a31dd83e-ebfd-4a2d-ac55-8d61ee92406e-000000/o3CAqcxng_yjJ2LSLaEVuvUHRQhsn0lP2LcT6J-3TYM=442 ] \r\n\r\nQuestions?\r\n\r\nIf you have questions,\xc2\xa0contact the Division of Industry and Consumer Education [ https://links-2.govdelivery.com/CL0/https:%2F%2Fwww.fda.gov%2Fmedical-devices%2Fdevice-advice-comprehensive-regulatory-assistance%2Fcontact-us-division-industry-and-consumer-education-dice%3Futm_medium=email%26utm_source=govdelivery/1/0101019c10424ed0-a31dd83e-ebfd-4a2d-ac55-8d61ee92406e-000000/IUf0jAmpvl4KWni2Q6xYMqpCZLZS6yaD8_Fh0qqC6cI=442 ].\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\nAn unofficial translation of this announcement is provided below.\r\n\r\n\xe7\xbf\xbb\xe8\xaf\x91\xe5\x8f\x82\xe8\x80\x83\xef\xbc\x9a\r\n\r\n*FDA**\xe5\xae\x9e\xe6\x96\xbd** QMSR**\xef\xbc\x9a\xe5\x8c\xbb\xe7\x96\x97\xe5\x99\xa8\xe6\xa2\xb0\xe6\xa3\x80\xe6\x9f\xa5\xe5\xb0\x86\xe6\x8c\x89\xe7\x85\xa7\xe6\x9b\xb4\xe6\x96\xb0\xe5\x90\x8e\xe7\x9a\x84\xe6\xb5\x81\xe7\xa8\x8b\xe5\xbc\x80\xe5\xb1\x95* \r\n\r\n2026\xe5\xb9\xb42\xe6\x9c\x882\xe6\x97\xa5\xef\xbc\x8c\xe7\xbe\x8e\xe5\x9b\xbd\xe9\xa3\x9f\xe5\x93\x81\xe8\x8d\xaf\xe5\x93\x81\xe7\xae\xa1\xe7\x90\x86\xe5\xb1\x80\xef\xbc\x88FDA\xef\xbc\x89\xe5\xbc\x80\xe5\xa7\x8b\xe5\xae\x9e\xe6\x96\xbd\xe8\xb4\xa8\xe9\x87\x8f\xe7\xae\xa1\xe7\x90\x86\xe4\xbd\x93\xe7\xb3\xbb\xe6\xb3\x95\xe8\xa7\x84\xef\xbc\x88QMSR\xef\xbc\x89\xef\xbc\x8c\xe8\xaf\xa5\xe6\xb3\x95\xe8\xa7\x84\xe5\xaf\xb9\xe8\xb4\xa8\xe9\x87\x8f\xe4\xbd\x93\xe7\xb3\xbb\xe6\xb3\x95\xe8\xa7\x84\xef\xbc\x8821 CFR \xe7\xac\xac 820 \xe9\x83\xa8\xe5\x88\x86\xef\xbc\x89\xe8\xbf\x9b\xe8\xa1\x8c\xe4\xba\x86\xe4\xbf\xae\xe8\xae\xa2\xe3\x80\x82\xe8\x87\xaa\xe8\xaf\xa5\xe6\x97\xa5\xe6\x9c\x9f\xe8\xb5\xb7\xef\xbc\x8cFDA\xe5\xb0\x86\xe5\x81\x9c\xe6\xad\xa2\xe5