[2026-04-27 11:08:24] Raw text/plain payload: b"If your email program has trouble displaying this email, view as a webpage [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/bulletins/406ccd2 ].\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nUS Food and Drug Administration\r\nFDA Releases New Interactive Tool for Total Diet Study (TDS) Results and New Data\r\n\r\n*View on the FDA Website [ https://links-2.govdelivery.com/CL0/https:%2F%2Fwww.fda.gov%2Ffood%2Fhfp-constituent-updates%2Ffda-releases-new-interactive-tool-total-diet-study-tds-results-and-new-data%3Futm_medium=email%26utm_source=govdelivery/1/0101019c0045dd8d-0ef102fe-0ba9-4bf2-8895-154772185848-000000/d2UtbMoLgiBIpzLRGrV8muP5DagWUycFU3w4rgA0gdU=441 ]*\r\n\r\nJanuary 27, 2026\r\n\r\nThe FDA today announced the release of the Total Diet Study Interface (TDSi), a new consumer-friendly interactive web-based tool that provides streamlined access to findings from FDA's Total Diet Study [ https://links-2.govdelivery.com/CL0/https:%2F%2Fwww.fda.gov%2Ffood%2Freference-databases-and-monitoring-programs-food%2Ffda-total-diet-study-tds%3Futm_medium=email%26utm_source=govdelivery/1/0101019c0045dd8d-0ef102fe-0ba9-4bf2-8895-154772185848-000000/-_CceF1heY12b-m0YcRXkr3RW-KRuxfNkFdi3Jsj2WE=441 ]. Concurrent with this launch, the FDA is releasing the most recent cycle of TDS data, including results from fiscal years 2021 and 2022. TDSi includes TDS datasets from fiscal year 2018\xe2\x80\x932022.\r\n\r\nThe TDSi release underscores the FDA's commitment to transparency and continuous improvement in its food chemical safety programs and aligns with\xc2\xa0Make America Healthy Again [ https://links-2.govdelivery.com/CL0/https:%2F%2Fwww.hhs.gov%2Fradical-transparency%2Findex.html%3Futm_medium=email%26utm_source=govdelivery/1/0101019c0045dd8d-0ef102fe-0ba9-4bf2-8895-154772185848-000000/WjHkmzhy-LIC3Zw-lPiDbUgbSZQpju2mNdUtkvxmQSs=441 ]\xc2\xa0goals. By transitioning from traditional publication methods to this dynamic, user-interactive platform, the FDA is providing stakeholders with significantly enhanced access to critical food safety and nutrition data, positioning itself as the global leader in providing comprehensive, publicly accessible data on foods in a typical U.S. consumer\xe2\x80\x99s diet.\r\n\r\nFDA's TDS is a continuous monitoring program that systematically collects, prepares and analyzes chemical contaminants and nutrients in foods representing the average U.S. consumer's diet. This new enhancement to the TDS surveillance program provides critical data to assess cumulative exposure to various contaminants and supports the FDA's food safety and nutrition oversight responsibilities.\r\n\r\nThe TDSi represents a significant advancement in data accessibility and transparency, offering:\r\n\r\n\r\n  * *Comprehensive data visualization*\xc2\xa0\xe2\x80\x93 Interactive graphics and charts that enable users to easily explore TDS findings efficiently and intuitively. \r\n  * *Enhanced transparency*\xc2\xa0\xe2\x80\x93 User-driven access to detailed analytical results with full dataset download capabilities for researchers and stakeholders. \r\n  * *Historical scope*\xc2\xa0\xe2\x80\x93 Complete datasets for nutrients and contaminants (including elements, radionuclides, and pesticides) in foods collected since 2018. \r\n  * *Ongoing updates*\xc2\xa0\xe2\x80\x93 Regular incorporation of new TDS data as it becomes available. \r\n\r\nFor comprehensive information on TDS design and implementation, foods and dietary exposure estimation, and analytical methods, visit the\xc2\xa0FDA TDS webpage [ https://links-2.govdelivery.com/CL0/https:%2F%2Fwww.fda.gov%2Ffood%2Freference-databases-and-monitoring-programs-food%2Ffda-total-diet-study-tds%3Futm_medium=email%26utm_source=govdelivery/2/0101019c0045dd8d-0ef102fe-0ba9-4bf2-8895-154772185848-000000/NLg91FJQ2ALzA-GveVbvp18D7zkt9a-NX7KQucltmb0=441 ].\r\n\r\nFor broader information on FDA's food chemical safety initiatives, visit\xc2\xa0FDA Food Chemical Safety [ https://links-2.govdelivery.com/CL0/https:%2F%2Fwww.fda.gov%2Ffood%2Ffood-ingredients-packaging%2Ffood-chemical-safety%3Futm_medium=email%26utm_source=govdelivery/1/0101019c0045dd8d-0ef102fe-0ba9-4bf2-8895-154772185848-000000/jBzTvvUxftDZJ9662M5ZQCjBBNnVXC8Zd-ePg-NuRRY=441 ].\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\nAn unofficial translation of this announcement is provided below.\r\n\r\n\xe7\xbf\xbb\xe8\xaf\x91\xe5\x8f\x82\xe8\x80\x83\xef\xbc\x9a\r\n\r\nFDA\xe5\x8f\x91\xe5\xb8\x83\xe6\x80\xbb\xe8\x86\xb3\xe9\xa3\x9f\xe7\xa0\x94\xe7\xa9\xb6 (TDS) \xe7\xbb\x93\xe6\x9e\x9c\xe6\x96\xb0\xe4\xba\xa4\xe4\xba\x92\xe5\xbc\x8f\xe5\xb7\xa5\xe5\x85\xb7\xe5\x8f\x8a\xe6\x9c\x80\xe6\x96\xb0\xe6\x95\xb0\xe6\x8d\xae\r\n\r\n*\xe5\x9c\xa8FDA\xe7\xbd\x91\xe7\xab\x99\xe4\xb8\x8a\xe6\x9f\xa5\xe7\x9c\x8b [ https://links-2.govdelivery.com/CL0/https:%2F%2Flinks-2.govdelivery.com%2FCL0%2Fhttps:%252F%252Fwww.fda.gov%252Ffood%252Fhfp-constituent-updates%252Ffda-releases-new-interactive-tool-total-diet-study-tds-results-and-new-data%253Futm_medium=email%2526utm_source=govdelivery%2F1%2F0101019c0045dd8d-0ef102fe-0ba9-4bf2-8895-154772185848-000000%2Fd2UtbMoLgiBIpzLRGrV8muP5DagWUycFU3w4rgA0gdU=441/2/0101019c0e6a027a-e3857984-adc2-4679-9341-b67ae525a7d1-000000/6XivoVVIy8DY56vU_HLYLpWRxx2BSPHVz4SDYpE6fao=442 ]*\r\n\r\n2026\xe5\xb9\xb41\xe6\x9c\x8827\xe6\x97\xa5\r\n\r\n\xe7\xbe\x8e\xe5\x9b\xbd\xe9\xa3\x9f\xe5\x93\x81\xe8\x8d\xaf\xe5\x93\x81\xe7\xae\xa1\xe7\x90\x86\xe5\xb1\x80 (FDA) \xe4\xbb\x8a\xe5\xa4\xa9\xe5\xae\xa3\xe5\xb8\x83\xe6\x8e\xa8\xe5\x87\xba\xe6\x80\xbb\xe8\x86\xb3\xe9\xa3\x9f\xe7\xa0\x94\xe7\xa9\xb6\xe7\x95\x8c\xe9\x9d\xa2 (TDSi)\xef\xbc\x8c\xe8\xbf\x99\xe6\x98\xaf\xe4\xb8\x80\xe6\xac\xbe\xe5\x85\xa8\xe6\x96\xb0\xe7\x9a\x84\xe3\x80\x81\xe6\x96\xb9\xe4\xbe\xbf\xe6\xb6\x88\xe8\xb4\xb9\xe8\x80\x85\xe4\xbd\xbf\xe7\x94\xa8\xe7\x9a\x84\xe4\xba\xa4\xe4\xba\x92\xe5\xbc\x8f\xe7\xbd\x91\xe7\xbb\x9c\xe5\xb7\xa5\xe5\x85\xb7\xef\xbc\x8c\xe5\x