[2026-04-27 11:08:47] Raw text/plain payload: b"2026 - Red Scare and Self Demobilization\r\nUkraine Update February 2\r\n\r\n2026\xe2\x80\x8a-\xe2\x80\x8aRed Scare and Self Demobilization\r\n\r\nDylan Combellick (https://medium.com/@dylan_combellick?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770025715970-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------f668f623_55d7_48b5_b7a3_0b1ca2531a9f--------354e45830cd6)\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nFebruary 2, 2026\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\n11 min read\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nView on Medium (https://medium.com/p/f569f89dfa63?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770025715970-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------f668f623_55d7_48b5_b7a3_0b1ca2531a9f--------354e45830cd6)\r\n\r\nOkay, I apologize to all the BlackBerry users out there. There were many valid reasons for using them. I stand corrected. They had an actual keyboard, which is cool, I guess. They were, according to some, more secure than other devices. Obama used one that was heavily modified by the NSA to enhance its security.\r\n\r\n-\xe2\x80\x8a-\xe2\x80\x8a-\r\n\r\nSo Goes the War\r\n\r\nTwo Russians tried to walk across the Dnipro River near Kherson, but the ice wasn't quite thick enough. They fell through, one losing his weapon, the other his life.\xc2\xa0\xe2\x80\xa6\r\n\r\nContinue reading (https://medium.com/p/f569f89dfa63?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770025715970-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------f668f623_55d7_48b5_b7a3_0b1ca2531a9f--------354e45830cd6)\r\nThis is a member-only story and can only be read on Medium.\r\n\r\nSent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com by Dylan Combellick on Medium\r\nUnsubscribe (https://medium.com/me/email-settings/50207bf5a022/6eee651ecc77?type=noSetting&newsletterV3Id=354e45830cd6&source=email-50207bf5a022-1770025715970-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------f668f623_55d7_48b5_b7a3_0b1ca2531a9f--------354e45830cd6)\r\n from this writer's ema