[2026-04-27 11:08:57] Raw text/plain payload: b'The approvals listed below may not be comprehensive. For the most current information, view the full listing of all approvals at Drugs@FDA [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=reportsSearch.process&rptName=1&reportSelectMonth=11&reportSelectYear=2025&nav ].\r\n\r\n*What\'s New Related to Drugs*\r\n\r\n*Updated Monday through Friday*\r\n\r\n\r\n  * Current and Resolved Drug Shortages and Discontinuations Reported to FDA [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/drugshortages/#tab4 ] \r\n  * Drug Firm Annual Registration Status [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/drls/default.cfm?utm_medium=&utm_source= ] \r\n  * Drug Firm Annual Registration Status Download File [ https://www.fda.gov/drugs/drug-approvals-and-databases/drug-establishments-current-registration-site?utm_medium=&utm_source= ] \r\n  * National Drug Code Directory [ https://www.fda.gov/drugs/drug-approvals-and-databases/national-drug-code-directory?utm_medium=&utm_source= ] \r\n  * NDC Unfinished Drugs Excluded Database File [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/cder/NDC_unfinished_excluded.zip?utm_medium=&utm_source= ] \r\n  * NDC Database Excluded Packages and Products [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/cder/ndc_excluded.zip?utm_medium=&utm_source= ] \r\n  * Wholesale Distributor and Third-Party Logistics Providers Reporting [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/wdd3plreporting/ ] \r\n  * Drug Establishments Current Registration Site [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/drls/ ] \r\n  * Drugs@FDA Data Files [ https://www.fda.gov/drugs/drug-approvals-and-databases/drugsfda-data-files ]\xc2\xa0 \r\n\r\n*Updated Biweekly*\r\n\r\n  * Competitive Generic Therapy Approvals [ https://www.fda.gov/drugs/generic-drugs/competitive-generic-therapy-approvals ] \r\n\r\n*January 27, 2026*\r\n\r\n\r\n  * FDA approves daratumumab and hyaluronidase-fihj with bortezomib, lenalidomide, and dexamethasone for newly diagnosed multiple myeloma [ https://www.fda.gov/drugs/resources-information-approved-drugs/fda-approves-daratumumab-and-hyaluronidase-fihj-bortezomib-lenalidomide-and-dexamethasone-newly ] \r\n\r\n*January 21, 2026*\r\n\r\n\r\n  * Drug Trials Snapshots KYGEVVI [ https://www.fda.gov/drugs/drug-approvals-and-databases/drug-trials-snapshots-kygevvi ] \r\n  * FDA Announces PreCheck Implementation Roadmap [ https://www.fda.gov/drugs/drug-safety-and-availability/fda-announces-precheck-implementation-roadmap ] \r\n\r\nThis report displays final approvals and tentative approvals of original and supplemental applications for the two days beginning on the earliest date listed below. Some approvals may be added to the Drugs@FDA database after this time span. For comprehensive approval reports, please use the monthly "All Approvals [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=reportsSearch.process&nav=&reportSelectMonth=9&reportSelectYear=2020&rptName=1&utm_medium=&utm_source=#navigation ]" report on Drugs@FDA.\r\n\r\nJanuary 30, 2026\r\n\r\nDrug Name and\r\nApplication Number Active Ingredient Dosage Form/ Route Submission Company Submission Classification Submission Status Cetirizine Hydrochloride Allergy\r\nNDA #022429 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=022429 ] Cetirizine Hydrochloride Capsule; Oral SUPPL-26 Bionpharma Labeling Approved Cetirizine Hydrochloride Hives Relief\r\nNDA #022429 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=022429 ] Cetirizine Hydrochloride Capsule; Oral SUPPL-26 Bionpharma Labeling Approved Enbrel\r\nBLA #103795 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=103795 ] Etanercept Syringe SUPPL-5605 Immunex Labeling Approved Enbrel\r\nBLA #103795 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=103795 ] Etanercept Syringe SUPPL-5605 Immunex Labeling Approved Enbrel\r\nBLA #103795 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=103795 ] Etanercept Vial; Subcutaneous SUPPL-5605 Immunex Labeling Approved Enbrel\r\nBLA #103795 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=103795 ] Etanercept Vial; Subcutaneous SUPPL-5605 Immunex Labeling Approved Lybalvi\r\nNDA #213378 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=213378 ] Olanzapine; Samidorphan L-Malate Tablet; Oral SUPPL-11 Alkermes Inc Labeling Approved Livdelzi\r\nNDA #217899 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=217899 ] Seladelpar Lysine Capsule; Oral SUPPL-2 Gilead Sciences Inc Labeling Approved Livdelzi\r\nNDA #217899 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=217899 ] Seladelpar Lysine Capsule; Oral SUPPL-2 Gilead Sciences Inc Labeling Approved \r\n\r\nJanuary 29, 2026\r\n\r\nDrug Name and\r\nApplication Number Active Ingredient Dosage Form/ Route Submission Company Submission Classification Submission Status Gabapentin\r\nANDA #075350 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=075350 ] Gabapentin Capsule; Oral SUPPL-80 Actavis Elizabeth Labeling Approved Gabapentin\r\nANDA #075350 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=075350 ] Gabapentin Capsule; Oral SUPPL-80 Actavis Elizabeth Labeling Approved Ximino\r\nNDA #201922 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=201922 ] Minocycline Hydrochloride Capsule, Extended Release; Oral SUPPL-4 Journey Labeling Approved Gabapentin\r\nANDA #207099 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=207099 ] Gabapentin Capsule; Oral SUPPL-20 Rising Labeling Approved Lorbrena\r\nNDA #210868 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=210868 ] Lorlatinib Tablet; Oral SUPPL-8 Pfizer Labeling Approved Vortioxetine Hydrobromide\r\nANDA #211130 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=211130 ] Vortioxetine Hydrobromide Tablet ORIG-1 Apotex Inc \xc2\xa0 Tentative Approval Wegovy\r\nNDA #215256 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=215256 ] Semaglutide Solution; Subcutaneous SUPPL-30 Novo Labeling Approved Wegovy\r\nNDA #215256 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=215256 ] Semaglutide Solution; Subcutaneous SUPPL-30 Novo Labeling Approved Wegovy\r\nNDA #218316 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=218316 ] Semaglutide Tablet; Oral SUPPL-2 Novo Labeling Approved Wegovy\r\nNDA #218316 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=218316 ] Semaglutide Tablet; Oral SUPPL-2 Novo Labeling Approved Dapagliflozin and Metformin Hydrochloride\r\nANDA #219755 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=219755 ] Dapagliflozin, Metformin Hydrochloride Tablet, Extended Release ORIG-1 Inventia Healthcare Limited \xc2\xa0 Tentative Approval Sertraline Hydrochloride\r\nANDA #220275 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=220275 ] Sertraline Hydrochloride Capsule; Oral ORIG-1 Zydus Lifesciences \xc2\xa0 Approved Lacosamide\r\nANDA #220386 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=220386 ] Lacosamide Solution; Oral ORIG-1 Indoco \xc2\xa0 Approved \r\n\r\nfeed [ https://www.fda.gov/about-fda/contact-fda/subscribe-podcasts-and-news-feeds?utm_medium=&utm_source= ]twitter [ https://www.twitter.com/US_FDA?utm_medium=&utm_source= ]facebook [ https://www.facebook.com/FDA?utm_medium=&utm_sou