[2026-04-27 11:09:05] Raw text/plain payload: b'See how a two-question survey helped drive loyalty and repurchase\xc2\xa0// view online <[[http://pages.qualtrics.com/v/NTQyLUZNRi00MTIAAAGfvdf3L99TPzl1Fgg3vlG7r_IjUm0H3RNvY7P6SnYmpwlBnp-wLdX2qlQbN8v-5J0tZJVz4GA=]]>\r\nWhat does the ultimate customer experience look like behind the wheel of a BMW?\r\n \r\nIt started with a bold move: simplifying their CX program to just two questions: a single NPS score <http://pages.qualtrics.com/dc/qEtCYPdDrgh7DbDU2Hwx5rL6NntdigmWeW2LvIHn_O44kcoou3FpD2WZVrymZ5dYvCKwZEdq9UjuxXWUIz0A1hpolqShIAa5iT1dOEhdbfaq492ogf7qzDLvEWBMyuMTpxOyUER9S5FTv6wF4BmmBUA4Za4Oq24OfeW30sB7WgVrtjHAUEHOcMnh7yB255Cn-7J8FFVGvU7Sx4nXCHgwdvuVn1vUOVogS4QppSNJ7_U=/NTQyLUZNRi00MTIAAAGfvdf3L2S4ZAdTwbPEpYzedCwCJJxsDzLBPkAzqP1pYDFoWkqhUFcWUfJ2FSh9SnYMzrgAOH8=>\xc2\xa0and one open-ended response.\r\n\r\nBut simplicity on the surface requires power behind the scenes. With Qualtrics CX tools, BMW harnesses advanced text analytics, seamless integrations, and personalized dashboards to ensure every piece of feedback reaches the right person, and most importantly, drives action.\r\n\r\nThe results speak for themselves:\r\nWatch <http://pages.qualtrics.com/dc/q7YJrwQofMmIa59046xld957NqZDAlrSGp6OMIQ4XugpCuFeaFxIt4bf-PZOMJX5kXHBeFzdo3lWzGZt4DWTARja1TOHqGVuf9Wa2MCbCdb-dWsU-ntnK1vxFfnrEqLpJ__0F-r24BM6dgcjB2OiKstavrQiNIgxyJCCkCR_OzQ=/NTQyLUZNRi00MTIAAAGfvdf3L2S4ZAdTwbPEpYzedCwCJJxsDzLBPkAzqP1pYDFoWkqhUFcWUfJ2FSh9SnYMzrgAOH8=> how BMW reengineered their CX to fuel brand loyalty.\r\n333 River Park Drive, Provo, Utah 84604\r\n385 203 4999\r\nTerms of Service <http://pages.qualtrics.com/NTQyLUZNRi00MTIAAAGfvdf3LxswKm4KxnEpAtEbKi2DBikcm114-mW6zEYI-cA1lNETQ6K2Mx3HS55SWvPm6YLuJlM=> \r\nPrivacy <http://pages.qualtrics.com/NTQyLUZNRi00MTIAAAGfvdf3L0nP-rtFjCo2Bu4NNHSxI-cx4ttY_exymoLpKq79nsobrY8YY2DfQscJPW0cH7PmE5c=>\r\nSecurity Statement <http://pages.qualtrics.com/NTQyLUZNRi00MTIAAAGfvdf3L2hFxKewYKQjDUDU4rLfzAKusbuFEhh2CzRGDPzwofrhsr9g82q13HXSzOW878HNOVA=> \r\nUnsubscribe <[[https://success.qualtrics.com/UnsubscribePage.html?mkt_unsubscribe=1&mkt_tok=NTQyLUZNRi00MTIAAAGfvdf3L6G0vCL6NXgONq13e7kJsaNGp1lJyU-P-dUmH3xpDPohS0HXB0goroNBIdlnS72GPdNTI07Gp2fgU9H5Z5KyfVbdlZYXd8XxSeLVnZTXRmsA5nDh]]> \r\n\xc2\xa9 2026 Qualtrics\r\n'
