[2026-04-27 11:09:23] Raw text/plain payload: b"Register to join fellow researchers, innovators, and technology scouts at the 2026 event  \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nHaving trouble viewing this email? View it as a Web page [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USDOESNLEC/bulletins/4051d21 ].\r\n\r\nScandia National Laboratories [ https://www.sandia.gov/ ]  \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nEnergy Storage Battery Racks \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nRegister Today for the\r\n\r\n2026 Energy Storage Symposium\r\n\r\n*Energy Storage from Molecules to Megawatts*\r\nTechConnect World Innovation Conference and Expo \r\nRaleigh, North Carolina\r\nMarch 10-12, 2026\r\n\r\nRegister to join fellow researchers, innovators and technology scouts as they convene in Raleigh, North Carolina, March 10-12 for the 2026\xc2\xa0*Energy Storage Symposium [ https://www.techconnectworld.com/World2026/sym/Energy_Storage.html ]* of TechConnect! \r\n\r\nThe symposium will cover energy storage topics, such as:\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n\r\n  * Grid-Scale Battery Innovation (Sodium, Zinc, Flow, Lithium, etc.)\xc2\xa0 \r\n\r\n  * Non-Battery Storage (Thermal, Mechanical, Chemical Storage)\xc2\xa0 \r\n\r\n  * Storage Integration (Power Electronics, Systems Design)\xc2\xa0 \r\n\r\n  * Safety and Reliability in Energy Storage\xc2\xa0 \r\n\r\n  * Wholesale and Retail Market Enablers\xc2\xa0 \r\n\r\n  * Manufacturing and Supply Chain Efficiencies\xc2\xa0 \r\n\r\n  * Energy Storage Financing\xc2\xa0 \r\n\r\n  * Realizing Storage Utility through Demonstrations\xc2\xa0 \r\n\r\n*Poster abstracts are still accepted until Friday, Feb. 6.* Don\xe2\x80\x99t miss this opportunity to present your applied energy storage research and innovations!\r\n\r\n*Register* [ https://www.techconnectworld.com/World2026/sym/Energy_Storage.html ] \r\n \r\n\r\nAbout the Event\r\n\r\nFor over 25 years, the TechConnect World Innovation Conference and Expo has connected\xc2\xa0applied research and\xc2\xa0early-stage\xc2\xa0innovations from universities, labs, and startups with industry end users and scouts.\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nCo-chaired by\xc2\xa0energy storage\xc2\xa0experts from\xc2\xa0Sandia National Laboratories, Pacific Northwest National Laboratory, and the Department of Energy, the\xc2\xa0*Energy Storage Symposium*\xc2\xa0is one of\xc2\xa030 world-class technical symposia\xc2\xa0planned for the 2026 Conference and Expo.\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*Learn more* [ https://www.techconnectworld.com/World2026/ ] \r\n \r\n\r\nLet's Stay in Touch\r\n\r\nWe're transitioning to a new email communications tool. To continue receiving our updates and invitations, please *sign up on our new list. [ https://hbeupdate.custhelp.com/ci/documents/detail/2/formOptIn_EnergyStorage ]*\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n  \r\n \r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\nSandia National Laboratories is a multimission laboratory managed and operated by National Technology and Engineering Solutions of Sandia, LLC, a wholly owned subsidiary of Honeywell International, Inc., for the U.S. Department of Energy\xe2\x80\x99s National Nuclear Security Administration under contract DE-NA-0003525.\xc2\xa0\r\n\xc2\xa9 2026 National Technology & Engineering Solutions of Sandia, LLC\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nSUBSCRIBER SERVICES:\r\nManage Preferences [ http://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USDOESNLEC/subscribers/new?preferences=true ]\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0Unsubscribe [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USDOESNLEC/subscriber/one_click_unsubscribe?verification=5.1385db987570cec7c53f0feb5a7d4a5b&destination=jasonnorman66994%40gmail.com ]\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0Help [ subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com ]\r\n\r\nQuestions?\r\nContact Us [ https://www.sandia.gov/contact_us/index.html ]\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\nThis email was sent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com using GovDelivery Communications Cloud on behalf of: Sandia National Laboratories \xc2\xb7 1515 Eubank SE \xc2\xb7 Albuquerque, NM 87123 GovDelivery logo [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/ ] \r\nbody .abe-column-block { min-height: 5px; } table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:10px; margin-right:10px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;} table.govd_hr {min-width: 100%;} p, li, h1, h2, h3 { overflow-wrap: normal; word-wrap: normal; word-break: keep-all; -moz-hyphens: none; -ms-hyphens: none; -webkit-hyphens: none; hyphens: none; mso-hyphenate: none; }\r\n"
