[2026-04-27 11:09:25] Raw text/plain payload: b"By Joseph Razo\r\nWhat's Really Holding XRP & XLM Back?\r\n\r\nJoseph Razo (https://medium.com/@j.razo7869?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770048081321-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------a81f25b5_d4a7_43a3_98da_b53e6d2811d1--------2d9d33acc198)\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nFebruary 2, 2026\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\n5 min read\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nView on Medium (https://medium.com/p/41306ae337c3?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770048081321-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------a81f25b5_d4a7_43a3_98da_b53e6d2811d1--------2d9d33acc198)\r\n\r\nBy Joseph Razo\r\n\r\nFeb 2, 2026\r\n\r\n\xc2\xb7\xc2\xb7\xc2\xb7\r\n\r\n\xc2\xb7\xc2\xb7\xc2\xb7\r\nDisclaimer: This article is for informational and educational purposes only and does not constitute financial advice. Cryptocurrency and blockchain investments involve risk. DYOR (Do Your Own Research) and consult a qualified professional before making any financial decisions.\r\n\r\n\xc2\xb7\xc2\xb7\xc2\xb7\r\nBy late January 2026, the contradiction was hard to ignore. On the one side, Ripple's CEO was standing at Davos predicting new all-time highs for crypto markets. On the other side, XRP was trading nearly 50% below its July 2025 cycle peak, drifting sideways while Bitcoin and Ethereum soaked up headlines, capital, and confidence.\r\n\r\nTo some observers\xe2\x80\xa6\r\n\r\nContinue reading (https://medium.com/p/41306ae337c3?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770048081321-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------a81f25b5_d4a7_43a3_98da_b53e6d2811d1--------2d9d33acc198)\r\nThis is a member-only story and can only be read on Medium.\r\n\r\nSent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com by Joseph Razo on Medium\r\nUnsubscribe (https://medium.com/me/email-settings/50207bf5a022/3891e1b0bbb5?type=noSetting&amp;newsletterV3Id=2d9d33acc198&source=email-50207bf5a022-1770048081321-newsletter.subscri