[2026-04-27 11:09:32] Raw text/plain payload: b'Everyone is buying Mac Minis for this, but 90% of setups are dangerously insecure. Here is the definitive guide to installing, hardening\xe2\x80\xa6\r\nClawdbot (Moltbot): How to Actually Run Your Own AI Employee (Without Getting Hacked)\r\n\r\nEveryone is buying Mac Minis for this, but 90% of setups are dangerously insecure. Here is the definitive guide to installing, hardening, and using the agent that\'s killing the monthly subscription.\r\n\r\nAdham Khaled (https://medium.com/@adham__khaled__?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770050919778-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-9c6d01af5370------------------------8b238e7c_fd6b_42bd_bcbc_9050ab843908--------dbf9f8a2e961)\r\n\xc2\xa0in\xc2\xa0AI Mind (https://medium.com/ai-mind-labs?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770050919778-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-9c6d01af5370------------------------8b238e7c_fd6b_42bd_bcbc_9050ab843908--------dbf9f8a2e961)\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nFebruary 2, 2026\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\n4 min read\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nView on Medium (https://medium.com/ai-mind-labs/e6954f82798d?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770050919778-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-9c6d01af5370------------------------8b238e7c_fd6b_42bd_bcbc_9050ab843908--------dbf9f8a2e961)\r\n\r\nGenerated by Nano Banana pro\r\n\r\nThe "AI Employee" era has officially arrived, and it\'s not coming from OpenAI or Google. It\'s coming from a GitHub repo that just rebranded from Clawdbot to Moltbot (thanks to a trademark tap on the shoulder from Anthropic).\r\n\r\nIf you\'ve seen the viral tweets about people buying up Mac Minis to run this 24/7, you know the hype. But after auditing the codebase and running it on both a home server and a cloud VPS, I can tell you two things:\r\n\r\nIt is incredibly powerful. It fundamentally changes how you interact with LLMs by giving them persistent memory and agency.\r\n\r\n\xe2\x80\xa6\r\n\r\nContinue reading (https://medium.com/ai-mind-labs/e6954f82798d?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770050919778-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-9c6d01af5370------------------------8b238e7c_fd6b_42bd_bcbc_9050ab843908--------dbf9f8a2e961)\r\nThis is a member-only story and can only be read on Medium.\r\n\r\nSent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com by Adham Khaled on Medium\r\nUnsubscribe (https://medium.com/me/email-settings/50207bf5a022/78d0af544f5c?type=noSetting&newsletterV3Id=dbf9f8a2e961&collectionId=9c6d01af5370&source=email-50207bf5a022-1770050919778-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-9c6d01af5370------------------------8b238e7c_fd6b_42bd_bcbc_9050ab843908--------dbf9f8a2e961)\r\n from this writer\'s email notifications\r\nManage your email settings (https://medium.com/me/settings/notifications?hash=78d0af544f5c&userId=50207bf5a022&settingsRouteHash=%23manageSubscriptions&source=email-50207bf5a022-1770050919778-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-9c6d01af5370------------------------8b238e7c_fd6b_42bd_bcbc_9050ab843908--------dbf9f8a2e961)\r\n\r\n3500 South DuPont Highway, Suite IQ-101, Dover,\xc2\xa0DE\xc2\xa019901\r\nCareers (https://medium.com/jobs-at-medium/work-at-medium-959d1a85284e?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770050919778-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-9c6d01af5370------------------------8b238e7c_fd6b_42bd_bcbc_9050ab843908--------dbf9f8a2e961)\r\n\xc2\xb7Help Center (https://help.medium.com/hc/en-us?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770050919778-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-9c6d01af5370------------------------8b238e7c_fd6b_42bd_bcbc_9050ab843908--------dbf9f8a2e961)\r\n\xc2\xb7Privacy Policy (https://policy.medium.com/medium-privacy-policy-f03bf92035c9?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770050919778-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-9c6d01af5370------------------------8b238e7c_fd6b_42bd_bcbc_9050ab843908--------dbf9f8a2e961)\r\n\xc2\xb7Terms of service (https://policy.medium.com/medium-terms-of-service-9db0094a1e0f?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770050919778-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-9c6d01af5370-----------