[2026-04-27 11:09:48] Raw text/plain payload: b'Documents available online  \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nMessage from CTP  \r\n \r\n\r\nMaterials Posted for ZYN MRTP Applications; Closing Date for Public Comments Set for March 4, 2026\r\n\r\nOn February 2, 2026, FDA posted new materials related to the modified risk tobacco product (MRTP) applications submitted by Swedish Match USA, Inc. for 20 ZYN nicotine pouch products. The documents are available on the Swedish Match USA, Inc. MRTP application webpage [ http://www.fda.gov/tobacco-products/advertising-and-promotion/swedish-match-usa-inc-modified-risk-tobacco-product-mrtp-applications-zyn-products?utm_campaign=ctp-mrtp&utm_content=landingpage&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery&utm_term=stratcomms ]. This is the final set of application materials.\r\n\r\nAccordingly, FDA is establishing the closing date for the public comment period on these MRTP applications. Public comments must be submitted to Docket Number FDA-2025-N-0835-0001 [ https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2025/06/18/2025-10821/modified-risk-tobacco-product-application-applications-for-zyn-products-submitted-by-swedish-match?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] by 11:59 p.m. ET on March 4, 2026, to make sure they are considered by FDA.\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nRead the Application Materials [ http://www.fda.gov/tobacco-products/advertising-and-promotion/swedish-match-usa-inc-modified-risk-tobacco-product-mrtp-applications-zyn-products?utm_campaign=ctp-mrtp&utm_content=landingpage&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery&utm_term=stratcomms ]\r\n \r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nFacebook [ https://www.facebook.com/FDA?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \xc2\xa0Twitter [ https://twitter.com/fdatobacco?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] Youtube [ https://www.youtube.com/user/USFoodandDrugAdmin?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] RSS [ https://www.fda.gov/about-fda/contact-fda/subscribe-podcasts-and-news-feeds?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]  \r\n \r\nFDA \r\n \r\n\r\nPhone 1-888-INFO-FDA \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\n*Manage Subscriptions* [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 *Unsubscribe All* [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/subscriber/one_click_unsubscribe?verification=5.ee0243ee8741fe358146537aecf40e1e&destination=jasonnorman66994%40gmail.com ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 *Help* [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/ ]\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n&lt;!-- @media only screen and (max-device-width: 480px) { .tablecell { width:100% !important; display: block !important; max-width:100% !important; min-width: 100% !important; } } --&gt; \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n This email was sent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com using GovDelivery Communications Cloud on behalf of: U.S. Food and Drug Administration \xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0\r\n10903 New Hampshire Ave\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0Silver Spring, MD \xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0 20993-0002\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa01-888-INFO-FDA GovDelivery logo [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\nbody .abe-column-block { min-height: 5px; } table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:10px; margin-right:10px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;}\r\n'
