b9Terms and conditions apply. Only applicable for mortgage\r\nrefinance applications received from 1/12/26 to 2/3/26. To be\r\neligible you must not have submitted a mortgage refinance\r\napplication within the preceding 90 days. Offer is subject to\r\nlender approval. Not eligible for Jumbo loan products. Cannot be\r\ncombined with any other origination fee discount offers. SoFi\r\nreserves the right to change or terminate this offer at any time\r\nwith or without notice.\r\n   SoFi Bank, N.A. values your\r\nprivacy and the security of your personal information so please\r\ndo not include sensitive personal information, such as your\r\nSocial Security number, in any email or letter that you send\r\nto us.\r\n\r\nSoFi Bank, N.A. 2750 East Cottonwood Parkway #300, Cottonwood\r\nHeights, Utah 84121        Unsubscribe (\r\nhttps://ablink.r.sofi.com/ls/click?upn=u001.k-2FImUMyJvquSjfrastfytCaHf0CItlw9JVHjkSY1MAhwldbDIRGcvAOLK3WuemVn35mGi13Q4GtGLscWZPrfpPpxkonaDHit2nXUD1dvVeIlZ1a8kvVZcfqS4rZTNpIwFQ752FNohBGIG9-2BtCJ0eCS5-2FN0vZXyhESfgP-2FbxsWxU-3D05VR_Hvirw9jLOYnqUg7ucIAtvDa4JCWhfjePQT8cfdKWfeKaKK6WyzUu0MT5hcL83ezarLAJeFzEeRP-2BR0XWfLa6c8MwNw74euZZaMvOSRu4-2FW0SpKKObV5OMXNLcvZW9lKSgxX2CNkmvMObJwZWAnpj1actvcg51Iq-2BbfOZwz4-2FQglERjEvKq7fVMTAJaRYckO6kaPiOTDr11KEpkdUI2530H4wZ0Kxyf7y6zDxj0oto4ZjVJOJTVB1tf4rc8Nd-2BT-2FHXfHTwD12S-2B8Jy0rOSLX45bhc7BhND-2FZL5qsPQzSbGZ9BZL73HvY0FMJvBZrNqv-2FBTy-2B9zQbUqrIdMgo6LrA8FXXEYrGFF1sk0Ujtk3TXoNXlUbolbwzrzjV2mZToyClbRAN4xAVc-2F-2FMocdjKtzVsxiW3bSg-2BynO5Bap8RAmYUYHEGtmZDwlK1fjTlPJBhgNI5Wya1JVgJYvCgL62vf1HqDWsHPoNfwjatSIxvPR53m1v67lX-2BxeyKscQgMHNMUGyMP-2FAvdhl3jgupK87tV5TWJ1DCDaoOXMSc-2BkqpQAJuZh1NjmATgafkuYMcrDMDecfz0xKqP3he4bg-2B2F2Y7HIKlzc-2BrYeGLSmzmEEJhAKJchy-2BP8raBRkNPnMdrDost28dsTxeb69yg9eZxiZZp02KfnjZNMzt3t6h7qnmvubS7y94Za9E4qqCnuMmMU22iGUNAXxCCkPMuCKfMPjxAiOGk1zCBm6yMl7db38N4K4UAubZwXeoGdH2uvNWoe8Wci6 )   Privacy Policy \r\n( https://ablink.r.sofi.com/ls/click?upn=u001.k-2FImUMyJvquSjfrastfytBx3kruUwwfS2L4xZXxxO0D0bwX3sozgH6Fg2qU