[2026-04-27 11:09:56] Raw text/plain payload: b"Here's a quick note on what's coming up as we begin the month of February.  \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nUnited States Census Bureau [ https://lehd.ces.census.gov/workshops_webinars/workshop/2026.html?utm_campaign=20260202cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\n?? This Week: Call for Presentations for the 2026 LED Workshop\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nCensus Bureau: 2026 LED Partnership Workshop [ https://lehd.ces.census.gov/workshops_webinars/workshop/2026.html?utm_campaign=20260202cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n\r\nThe U.S. Census Bureau invites you to submit a proposal to present virtually at the 2026 Local Employment Dynamics (LED) Partnership Workshop May 12-13. The deadline to submit a proposal is February 18.\r\n\r\nThe hybrid workshop will provide insights into LED data products as well as professional development and networking opportunities. The LED Partnership is a collaboration between state data agencies and the Census Bureau to leverage existing data in the development of new sources of economic and demographic information. The theme of this year\xe2\x80\x99s workshop is \xe2\x80\x9cNumbers to Narratives: Data for Better Decisions.\xe2\x80\x9d\r\n\r\nClick the button below for detailed proposal guidance and questions about the workshop.\r\n\r\n*Learn More* [ https://lehd.ces.census.gov/workshops_webinars/workshop/2026.html?utm_campaign=20260202cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n?? February Statehood Anniversaries\r\n\r\n  * *Massachusetts *will celebrate its 238th anniversary on February 6. \r\n  * *Arizona *will celebrate its 114th anniversary on February 14. \r\n  * *Oregon *will celebrate its 167th anniversary on February 14. \r\n\r\nExplore Census Bureau data on each state with our data.census.gov\xc2\xa0state profiles [ https://data.census.gov/profile?g=010XX00US&utm_campaign=20260202cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\xc2\xa0and sign up for\xc2\xa0email updates on your state [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USCENSUS/signup/11707 ]!\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n?? Fact Sheet: Energy and Rental Assistance\r\n\r\nSIPP Fact Sheet: Energy and Rental Assistance [ https://www.census.gov/library/fact-sheets/2026/demo/p70fs-213.html?utm_campaign=20260202cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n\r\nOne in 13 households in the United States received either energy or rental assistance in 2023. Census Bureau data show households that received this assistance tended to be smaller than the average household.\r\n\r\nLearn more about those who receive energy and rental assistance in our fact sheet.\r\n\r\n*Learn More* [ https://www.census.gov/library/fact-sheets/2026/demo/p70fs-213.html?utm_campaign=20260202cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n?? Economic Indicators\r\n\r\n  * *February 3:\xc2\xa0*Housing Vacancies and Homeownership [ https://www.census.gov/housing/hvs/?utm_campaign=20260202cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n\r\n*Economic Indicators* [ https://www.census.gov/economic-indicators/calendar-listview.html?utm_campaign=20260202cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n?? Upcoming Webinars\r\n\r\n*February 18:* Unlocking NAICS 5- and 6-Digit Details in the Quarterly Workforce Indicator Data Set [ https://www.census.gov/data/academy/webinars/2026/unlocking-naics-5-6-digit-details.html?utm_campaign=20260202cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n\r\n*February 25:* Introduction to the American Community Survey Public Use Microdata Sample (PUMS) Files [ https://www.census.gov/data/academy/webinars/2026/intro-to-acs-pums-files.html?utm_campaign=20260202cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n\r\n*Webinars* [ https://www.census.gov/data/academy/webinars/upcoming.html?utm_campaign=20260202cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nStay Connected with the Census Bureau\r\n\r\nFollow us on our social media channels, Facebook [ https://www.facebook.com/uscensusbureau?utm_campaign=20260202cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ], Instagram [ https://www.instagram.com/uscensusbureau/?utm_campaign=20260202cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ], LinkedIn [ https://www.linkedin.com/company/us-census-bureau?utm_campaign=20260202cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ], Twitter/X [ https://x.com/uscensusbureau?utm_campaign=20260202cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ], and\xc2\xa0YouTube [ https://www.youtube.com/user/uscensusbureau?utm_campaign=20260202cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ], so you never miss an update.\r\n\r\nStay Connected With Us on Social Media [ https://www.census.gov/about/contact-us/social_media.html?utm_campaign=20260202cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n\r\n*Follow Us* [ https://www.census.gov/about/contact-us/social_media.html?utm_campaign=20260202cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\n?? In Case You Missed It\r\n\r\nAmerica Counts: ACS Stories GIF [ https://www.census.gov/library/stories.html?utm_campaign=20260202cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n\r\nLast week, we released lots of new Census Bureau data. Here's a quick look.\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n\r\n  * Press Kit: 2020-2024 American Community Survey 5-Year Estimates [ https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-kits/2026/acs-5-year-estimates.html?utm_campaign=20260202cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n  * Press Kit: Vintage 2025 National and State Population Estimates [ https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-kits/2026/national-state-population-estimates.html?utm_campaign=20260202cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n  * Data Release: 2024 Small Area Income and Poverty Estimates [ https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2026/2024-saipe.html?utm_campaign=20260202cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n  * Data Release: 2024 Community Resilience Estimates [ https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2026/2024-cre-natural-hazard-risk-tables.html?utm_campaign=20260202cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nAbout the Census Bureau\r\n\r\nWe serve as the nation\xe2\x80\x99s leading provider of quality data about its people and economy.\xc2\xa0The Census Bureau is the federal government's largest statistical agency. As the world\xe2\x80\x99s premier statistical agency, we are dedicated to making our nation a better place. Policy-makers, businesses, and the public use our data to make informed decisions.\r\n\r\nSubscribe [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USCENSUS/signup/34555 ] | Manage Subscriptions [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USCENSUS/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] | Unsubscribe [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USCENSUS/subscriber/one_click_unsubscribe?verification=5.76359f46a06559a62e8e0404a80cc7e5&destination=jasonnorman66994%40gmail.com ] | Help [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/s/?utm_campaign=20260202cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n\r\n*Share This * [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USCENSUS/bulletins/40759b3 ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n  \r\n \r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\nThis is an official email from the U.S. Census Bureau. If you have any questions or comments, please contact us (http://www.census.gov/about/contact-us.html [ http://www.census.gov/about/contact-us.html?utm_campaign=20260202cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]).  \xc2\xa0 \r\nbody .abe-column-block {min-height: 5px;} table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:7px; margin-right:7px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;}\r\n"
