ll Tax Products [ https://www.irs.gov/forms-instructions-and-publications?find=&items_per_page=25&order=posted_date&sort=desc ]\r\n\r\nDraft Tax Products [ https://www.irs.gov/draft-tax-forms?find=&items_per_page=25&order=posted_date&sort=desc ]\r\n\r\nHelp with forms and instructions [ https://www.irs.gov/forms-pubs/more-information ]\r\n\r\nPost-release changes to tax forms, instructions,\r\nand publications [ https://www.irs.gov/forms-pubs/changes-to-current-forms-publications ]\r\n\r\nComments on Tax Forms,\r\nand Publications [ https://www.irs.gov/forms-pubs/comment-on-tax-forms-and-publications ]\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\nIRS Resources\r\n\r\nTaxpayer Bill of Rights [ https://www.irs.gov/taxpayer-bill-of-rights ]\r\n\r\nContact My Local Office [ https://www.irs.gov/help/contact-your-local-irs-office ]\r\n\r\nFile your tax return [ https://www.irs.gov/filing/individuals/how-to-file ]\r\n\r\nNewsroom [ https://www.irs.gov/newsroom ]\r\n\r\nLet us help you [ https://www.irs.gov/help/let-us-help-you ]\r\n\r\nTaxpayer Advocate Service [ https://www.taxpayeradvocate.irs.gov/ ]\r\n\r\nWhere to File [ https://www.irs.gov/filing/where-to-file-paper-tax-returns-with-or-without-a-payment ]\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nThe Following Early Release(s) have been posted\r\n\r\nEarly Releases are draft versions of tax forms, instructions, and publications. Do not file draft forms and do not rely on information in draft instructions or publications.\r\n\r\nProduct Title Rev. Date Posted Instruction 1040-C [ https://www.irs.gov/pub/irs-dft/i1040c--dft.pdf ] Instructions for Form 1040-C, U.S. Departing Alien Income Tax Return Jan 2026 02/02/2026 \r\n \r\nBack to Top [ #Fifteenth ] \r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\nThank you for subscribing to Recent Development for Tax Products, an IRS e-mail service.\r\n