[2026-04-27 11:10:28] Raw text/plain payload: b'2026\xe2\x80\x8a-\xe2\x80\x8aTruce Broken, Captured or Not?\r\nUkraine Update February 3\r\n\r\n2026\xe2\x80\x8a-\xe2\x80\x8aTruce Broken, Captured or Not?\r\n\r\nDylan Combellick (https://medium.com/@dylan_combellick?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770112377189-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------9fdb2ca2_2879_4125_bf02_d3fafc69e99f--------354e45830cd6)\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nFebruary 3, 2026\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\n11 min read\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nView on Medium (https://medium.com/p/709a4eef194e?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770112377189-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------9fdb2ca2_2879_4125_bf02_d3fafc69e99f--------354e45830cd6)\r\n\r\nTrump claimed on December 30th that Putin had agreed to stop targeting Kyiv and other large cities in Ukraine for a week. Peskov, Putin\'s press secretary, said the request (http://redirect.medium.systems/r-4DZiVjtJfy?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770112377189-newsletter.subscribeToProfile--709a4eef194e-----------------------9fdb2ca2_2879_4125_bf02_d3fafc69e99f--------354e45830cd6)\r\n was "until February 1." This implies that the request would have applied to the period from December 24 to February 1, although no concrete dates were ever announced by either side. If we go from the date of Trump\'s announcement, it would be December 30-February 6.\r\n\r\n"I did call up President Putin and he\'s agreed\xe2\x80\x8a-\xe2\x80\x8athey have the same cold wave that we do, maybe different because it\'s pretty far\xe2\x80\xa6\r\n\r\nContinue reading (https://medium.com/p/709a4eef194e?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770112377189-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------9fdb2ca2_2879_4125_bf02_d3fafc69e99f--------354e45830cd6)\r\nThis is a member-only story and can only be read on Medium.\r\n\r\nSent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com by Dylan Combellick on Medium\r\nUnsubscribe (https:/