[2026-04-27 11:10:39] Raw text/plain payload: b"December 7-8, 2026 | New Orleans, LA  \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nNIST  \r\n\r\nView as a Web Page [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USNIST/bulletins/405cadb ]\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nNICE | advancing cybersecurity education and workforce\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\n2026 NICE K12 Save the Date Web BIG Graphic\r\nMark Your Calendars!\r\n\r\nThe NICE K12 Cybersecurity Education Conference will take place in New Orleans, Louisiana, on December 7-8, 2026!\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nThe Annual NICE K12 Cybersecurity Education Conference [ https://www.k12cybersecurityconference.org/ ], supported by NICE and hosted by iKeepSafe, brings together K12 educators and those interested in cybersecurity education for today\xe2\x80\x99s K12 youth in support of growing the cybersecurity workforce of the future.\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nThis annual two-day conference helps attendees learn about increasing cybersecurity career awareness, infusing cybersecurity across the education portfolio, integrating innovative cybersecurity educational approaches, designing cybersecurity academic and career pathways, and promoting cyber awareness.\r\n\r\nIncluded in this year's conference:\r\n\r\n\r\n  * World-class keynotes \r\n  * Free and ready-to-use resources \r\n  * Endless networking opportunities \r\n  * Pre-conference workshops and tours \r\n  * National Cyber Signing Day, evening social, exhibitor showcase, and more \r\n  * Adjacent to the Association for Career and Technical Education (ACTE) CareerTech VISION Conference [ https://www.careertechvision.com/ ] \r\n\r\nJoin hundreds of K12 educators and supporters as we come together to learn, network, create community, promote, and increase K12 cybersecurity education programs nationwide. Don't miss out!\r\n\r\n*LEARN MORE* [ https://www.k12cybersecurityconference.org/ ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nThis event is supported by NICE, a program of the National Institute of Standards and Technology in the U.S. Department of Commerce, under financial assistance award #70NANB20H144.\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n  \r\n \r\n\r\nConnect with us\r\n facebook [ https://www.facebook.com/NIST ]X [ https://twitter.com/NIST ]youtube [ https://www.youtube.com/NIST ]linkedin [ https://www.linkedin.com/company/nist ]flickr [ https://www.instagram.com/nist/ ]  \r\n\r\nReceived this email from a friend? Subscribe here [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USNIST/subscriber/new?topic_id=USNIST_1 ].\r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy [ https://www.nist.gov/privacy-policy#privpolicy ]\r\n\r\n NICE Logo \r\n\r\nSubscriber services:\r\n\r\nManage Preferences [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USNIST/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 Unsubscribe [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USNIST/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 Help [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/ ]\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n&lt;!-- body table .abe-column-block { min-height: 20px; } @media only screen and (max-device-width: 480px) { .tablecell { width:100% !important; display: block !important; max-width:100% !important; min-width: 100% !important; } } --&gt; ________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\nIf you have questions or problems with the subscription service, please contact subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/ ].\r\nTechnical questions? Contact inquiries@nist.gov. (301) 975-NIST (6478).\r\n\r\nThis service is provided to you at no charge by National Institute of Standards and Technology (NIST).\xc2\xa0100 Bureau Drive, Stop 1070\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7 Gaithersburg, MD 20899\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0301-975-6478\r\n\r\n GovDelivery logo [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/ ] \r\nbody .abe-column-block { min-height: 5px; } table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:10px; margin-right:10px;} table.gd_combo_table d