[2026-04-27 11:10:43] Raw text/plain payload: b'Abiomed has issued an Urgent Medical Device Correction for all Impella RP and RP Flex with SmartAssist  \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nIf your email program has trouble displaying this email, view as a webpage [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/bulletins/4075f96 ].\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nU.S. Food and Drug Administration, Center for Devices and Radiological Health\r\n\r\nBookmark and Share [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/bulletins/4075f96?reqfrom=share ]\r\n\r\nEarly Alert: Heart Pump Issue from Abiomed\r\n\r\nThe U.S. Food and Drug Administration (FDA) is aware that Abiomed has issued an Urgent Medical Device Correction to notify affected customers of updated use instructions for all Impella RP with SmartAssist and Impella RP Flex with SmartAssist devices.\xc2\xa0 Abiomed has identified that the differential pressure (dP) sensor in Impella RP devices may malfunction, causing sensor values to drift over time. If sensor drift occurs, the Automated Impella Controller (AIC) may display inaccurate information, including pump flow readings, Pulmonary Artery (PA) Placement Signal, Pulmonary Artery Pulsatility Index (PAPi), and Central Venous (CV) Placement Signal.\r\n\r\nAs of January 15, Abiomed has reported 22 injuries and no deaths associated with this issue.\r\n\r\n*Read More* [ https://www.fda.gov/medical-devices/medical-device-recalls-and-early-alerts/early-alert-heart-pump-issue-abiomed?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n\r\n*"CDRH is issuing this Early Alert [ https://www.fda.gov/medical-devices/medical-device-recalls-and-early-alerts/what-early-alert?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] "**"to notify the public of a potentially high-risk device issue. "*"The FDA will keep the public informed and update this web page as significant new information becomes available. "\r\n\r\nQuestions?\r\n\r\nCustomers in the U.S. with adverse reactions, quality problems, or questions about this recall should contact Abiomed, Inc. at onemed-field-actions@its.jnj.com.\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n  \r\n \r\n\r\nFollow us on X at @FDADeviceInfo [ https://x.com/FDADeviceInfo?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n\r\n \r\ntwitter [ https://x.com/FDADeviceInfo?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]facebook [ https://www.facebook.com/FDA?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]youtube [ https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC_giJ3xlEL9jUF1YfJdzzuQ?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]LinkedIn [ https://www.linkedin.com/company/fda?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]  \r\n\r\n*Manage Subscriptions* [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 *Unsubscribe All* [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/subscriber/one_click_unsubscribe?verification=5.ee0243ee8741fe358146537aecf40e1e&destination=jasonnorman66994%40gmail.com ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 *Help* [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/ ]\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\nbody .abe-column-block {min-height: 5px;} td {line-height:1;} \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n This email was sent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com using GovDelivery Communications Cloud on behalf of: U.S. Food and Drug Administration \xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0\r\n10903 New Hampshire Ave\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0Silver Spring, MD \xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0 20993-0002\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa01-888-INFO-FDA GovDelivery logo [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\nbody .abe-column-block { min-height: 5px; } table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:10px; margin-right:10px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;}\r\n'
