[2026-04-27 11:10:44] Raw text/plain payload: b'View as a webpage\xc2\xa0 /\xc2\xa0 Share [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USDAOC/bulletins/4077e69 ]\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nHeader-Hybrid \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nOffice of Communications\xc2\xa0 |\xc2\xa0 press@usda.gov\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nTrump Administration\xc2\xa0Expands\xc2\xa0Export\xc2\xa0Financing Opportunities to Support American Farmers\r\n\r\n"New repayment options support Trump Administration\xe2\x80\x99s goal to support American farmers, boost exports"\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\n*(Jakarta, Indonesia, February 3, 2026)* \xe2\x80\x94 As part of the Trump Administration\xe2\x80\x99s efforts to expand American agricultural exports, Luke J. Lindberg, Under Secretary for Trade and Foreign Agricultural Affairs at the U.S. Department of Agriculture, announced that USDA is expanding financing options under the Export Credit Guarantee Program, known as GSM-102.\r\n\r\nUnder the new policy, USDA\xe2\x80\x99s Foreign Agricultural Service will offer an 18-month repayment option that allows buyers pay the full loan amount at the end of the term instead of in installments. This new option will initially be available in Africa, the Middle East, and Asia \xe2\x80\x93 all regions with strong potential for American export growth \xe2\x80\x93 is expected to make U.S. financing more competitive and increase the use of GSM-102.\r\n\r\n\xe2\x80\x9cThis new policy brings GSM-102 in line with current industry practices and gives American exporters new opportunities for financing in Africa, the Middle East, and Asia,\xe2\x80\x9d *said Under Secretary Lindberg*. \xe2\x80\x9cIt\xe2\x80\x99s another way the Trump Administration is working to support American farmers and producers and bring America\xe2\x80\x99s bounty to the world.\xe2\x80\x9d\r\n\r\nGSM-102 provides credit guarantees to U.S. banks and, in some cases, to U.S. exporters to help finance foreign purchases of American food and agricultural products by approved foreign banks. While GSM-102 already allows repayment terms of up to 18 months, this is the first time that borrowers will be able to repay the full amount in a single payment at the end of the 18-month term.\r\n\r\nUSDA expects this change to increase use of the program in Africa, the Middle East, and Asia, and to help expand American agricultural exports without increasing the program\xe2\x80\x99s current financial risk.\r\n\r\nUnder Secretary Lindberg made the announcement during an agribusiness trade mission to Indonesia as part of the Trump Administration\xe2\x80\x99s broader efforts to open to open new markets and reduce trade barriers.\r\n\r\nThese updates to GSM-102, along with expanded market access from a stronger trade partnership, will help give Indonesian consumers better access to high-quality American food and agricultural products.\r\n\r\nThe new repayment terms take effect on February 3, 2026. More information about GSM-102 is at www.fas.usda.gov [ https://www.fas.usda.gov/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ].\r\n\r\n###\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n  \r\n \r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0 \r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*\r\nU.S. Department of Agriculture*\r\n\r\nwww.usda.gov [ https://www.usda.gov/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 Contact us [ https://ask.usda.gov/s/contactsupport?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n\r\ntwitter [ https://www.twitter.com/usda/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]facebook [ https://www.facebook.com/usda/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]instagram [ https://www.instagram.com/usdagov/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]flickr [ https://flickr.com/usdagov?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]youtube [ https://www.youtube.com/usda/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n\r\nBookmark and Share [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USDAOC/bulletins/0?reqfrom=share ]\r\n\r\nManage Subscriptions [ http://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USDAOC/subscribers/new?preferences=true ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 Unsubscribe All [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USDAOC/subscriber/one_click_unsubscribe?verification=5.b0b9ffc01626a62fade26e4ffc0836cd&destination=jasonnorman66994%40gmail.com ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 Help [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/ ]\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \xc2\xa0 \r\n \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n This email was sent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com using govDelivery on behalf of: USDA Office of Communications \xc2\xb7 1400 Independence Ave., S.W. \xc2\xb7 Washington, DC 20250  GovDelivery logo  [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\nbody .abe-column-block { min-height: 5px; } table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:10px; margin-right:10px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;} table.govd_hr {min-width: 100%;}\r\n'
