[2026-04-27 11:10:49] Raw text/plain payload: b'Warning Letters Issued to Firms after Agency Inspections  \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nIf your email program has trouble displaying this email, view as a webpage [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/bulletins/4077717 ].\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nU.S. Food and Drug Administration, Center for Devices and Radiological Health, Safety Communication\r\n\r\nBookmark and Share [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/bulletins/4077717?reqfrom=share ]\r\n\r\nUPDATE: Risk of False Positive Lead Test Results with Certain Capillary Blood Collection Tubes Used with Magellan Diagnostics LeadCare Testing Systems \xe2\x80\x93 FDA Safety Communication \r\n\r\nThe U.S. Food and Drug Administration (FDA) is updating the April 2025 safety communication\xc2\xa0\xe2\x80\x9cRisk of False Positive\xc2\xa0Lead Test\xc2\xa0Results with Certain Capillary Blood Collection Tubes Used with Magellan Diagnostics\xc2\xa0LeadCare\xc2\xa0Testing Systems [ https://www.fda.gov/medical-devices/safety-communications/risk-false-positive-results-certain-capillary-blood-collection-tubes-used-magellan-diagnostics?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\xe2\x80\x9d. This update provides information about Warning Letters the FDA issued to two firms responsible for the manufacture and distribution of devices referenced in the communication.\r\n\r\n*Read More* [ https://www.fda.gov/medical-devices/safety-communications/risk-false-positive-results-certain-capillary-blood-collection-tubes-used-magellan-diagnostics?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n\r\nQuestions?\r\n\r\nIf you have questions,\xe2\x80\xafcontact the\xc2\xa0Division of Industry and Consumer Education [ https://links-2.govdelivery.com/CL0/https:%2F%2Fwww.fda.gov%2Fmedical-devices%2Fdevice-advice-comprehensive-regulatory-assistance%2Fcontact-us-division-industry-and-consumer-education-dice%3Futm_medium=email%26utm_source=govdelivery/1/010101966ef0e79d-b02f7880-2bf6-4a3b-bdf4-ea49a40eff69-000000/kCuT8nTlUbCR4rJQWqIx82Gcxi-pgDYYKAP1MWDbKqo=402 ].\xe2\x80\xaf\xe2\x80\xaf\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n  \r\n \r\n\r\nFollow us on X at @FDADeviceInfo [ https://x.com/FDADeviceInfo?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n\r\n \r\ntwitter [ https://x.com/FDADeviceInfo?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]facebook [ https://www.facebook.com/FDA?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]youtube [ https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC_giJ3xlEL9jUF1YfJdzzuQ?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]LinkedIn [ https://www.linkedin.com/company/fda?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]  \r\n\r\n*Manage Subscriptions* [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 *Unsubscribe All* [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/subscriber/one_click_unsubscribe?verification=5.ee0243ee8741fe358146537aecf40e1e&destination=jasonnorman66994%40gmail.com ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 *Help* [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/ ]\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\nbody .abe-column-block {min-height: 5px;} td {line-height:1;} \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n This email was sent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com using GovDelivery Communications Cloud on behalf of: U.S. Food and Drug Administration \xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0\r\n10903 New Hampshire Ave\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0Silver Spring, MD \xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0 20993-0002\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa01-888-INFO-FDA GovDelivery logo [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\nbody .abe-column-block { min-height: 5px; } table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:10px; margin-right:10px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;}\r\n'
