[2026-04-27 11:10:55] Raw text/plain payload: b"The Census Bureau is here to help. Don't miss important updates. \r\n\r\nUnited States Census Bureau [ https://www.census.gov/about/contact-us.html?utm_campaign=20260203_FGU_Welcome&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nWe're Here to Help!\r\n\r\nMeasuring America's People, Places, and Economy We believe in the power of quality data to impact public life.  Learn More [ https://www.census.gov/about/contact-us.html?utm_campaign=20260203_FGU_Welcome&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n\r\n*\r\n?? Remember* *to add us *to your address book as a trusted contact so our messages are delivered to your inbox.\r\n\r\n*\xe2\x9a\x99\xef\xb8\x8f Customize your subscriber settings* at any time. Bookmark the subscriber settings link [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USCENSUS/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] or access your settings at the bottom of every email.\r\n\r\n*?? Visit* the Census Bureau\xc2\xa0Newsroom [ https://www.census.gov/newsroom.html?utm_campaign=20260203_FGU_Welcome&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] and follow us on social media [ https://www.census.gov/about/contact-us/social_media.html?utm_campaign=20260203_FGU_Welcome&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]  [ https://twitter.com/censusdirector?utm_campaign=20260203_FGU_Welcome&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] to stay up to date.\r\n\r\n*Need help with a survey?* We have several ongoing surveys of households and businesses. We can help you verify a mailing, identify a field representative, and get help with a specific survey. Use the button below to get started.\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nGet Survey Help  [ https://www.census.gov/programs-surveys/surveyhelp.html?utm_campaign=20260203_FGU_Welcome&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\n*Still have questions? *Contact us at 1-800-923-8282 (TTY 1-800-877-8339) or visit ask.census.gov [ https://ask.census.gov/?utm_campaign=20260203_FGU_Welcome&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ].\xc2\xa0 \r\n \r\n \xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0 \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\n*Stay connected with us!*\r\n\r\nJoin the conversation on social media.\r\n\r\n facebook [ https://www.facebook.com/uscensusbureau/?utm_campaign=20260203_FGU_Welcome&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]instagram [ https://www.instagram.com/uscensusbureau/?utm_campaign=20260203_FGU_Welcome&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]linkedin [ https://www.linkedin.com/company/us-census-bureau/?utm_campaign=20260203_FGU_Welcome&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]twitter [ https://twitter.com/uscensusbureau/?utm_campaign=20260203_FGU_Welcome&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] [ https://www.linkedin.com/company/us-census-bureau/?utm_campaign=20260203_FGU_Welcome&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]youtube [ https://www.youtube.com/user/uscensusbureau/?utm_campaign=20260203_FGU_Welcome&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]  \r\n\r\nSUBSCRIBER SERVICES:\r\n\r\nSubscriber Settings [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USCENSUS/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 Remove me from All Subscriptions  [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USCENSUS/subscriber/one_click_unsubscribe?verification=5.76359f46a06559a62e8e0404a80cc7e5&destination=jasonnorman66994%40gmail.com ]\xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0Help [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/ ]\r\n\r\n \r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;!-- /* template top padding on mobile */ @media only screen and (max-width: 480px) { table#flexible-abe-main-table { padding:0 !important; } } --&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt; ________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\nThis is an official email from the U.S. Census Bureau. If you have any questions or comments, please contact us (http://www.census.gov/about/contact-us.html [ http://www.census.gov/about/contact-us.html?utm_campaign=20260203_FGU_Welcome&utm_content=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]).  \xc2\xa0 \r\nbody .abe-column-block {min-height: 5px;} table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:7px; margin-right:7px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;}\r\n"
