[2026-04-27 11:10:57] Raw text/plain payload: b"3 Real Stories that will change how you think about life\r\nThe One Question A Billionaire Asked Every Morning\xe2\x80\x8a-\xe2\x80\x8aThat Changed Everything\r\n\r\n3 Real Stories that will change how you think about life\r\n\r\nShikha | Author (https://medium.com/@SvaCopy?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770138218730-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-84ac01765c52------------------------af839eca_227b_484d_b7b4_26b62f12034d--------bd173739d135)\r\n\xc2\xa0in\xc2\xa0Write A Catalyst (https://medium.com/write-a-catalyst?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770138218730-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-84ac01765c52------------------------af839eca_227b_484d_b7b4_26b62f12034d--------bd173739d135)\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nFebruary 3, 2026\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\n6 min read\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nView on Medium (https://medium.com/write-a-catalyst/2b8b62e580a3?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770138218730-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-84ac01765c52------------------------af839eca_227b_484d_b7b4_26b62f12034d--------bd173739d135)\r\n\r\nPhoto by Alif Ngoylung (http://redirect.medium.systems/r-LlftFhRV6z?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770138218730-newsletter.subscribeToProfile--2b8b62e580a3-----------------------af839eca_227b_484d_b7b4_26b62f12034d--------bd173739d135)\r\n on Unsplash (http://redirect.medium.systems/r-Gu6Z_HViFN?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770138218730-newsletter.subscribeToProfile--2b8b62e580a3-----------------------af839eca_227b_484d_b7b4_26b62f12034d--------bd173739d135)\r\n\r\nMost commencement speeches are garbage.\r\n\r\nPlatitudes wrapped in fancy words, delivered by people who've forgotten what it's like to be broke, confused, and terrified about the future.\r\n\r\nThis one's different.\r\n\r\nSteve Jobs stood in front of Stanford graduates in 2005 and told them three stories that cut through every piece of career advice you've ever heard.\r\n\r\nNo fluff. No corporate speak. Just raw truth from someone who'd been to the top, crashed to the bottom, and clawed his way back up.\r\n\r\nThe Adoption Nobody Wanted\r\n\r\nBefore Jobs was born, his biological mother had his entire life planned out.\r\n\r\nShe was young, unmarried, and still\xe2\x80\xa6\r\n\r\nContinue reading (https://medium.com/write-a-catalyst/2b8b62e580a3?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770138218730-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-84ac01765c52------------------------af839eca_227b_484d_b7b4_26b62f12034d--------bd173739d135)\r\nThis is a member-only story and can only be read on Medium.\r\n\r\nSent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com by Shikha | Author on Medium\r\nUnsubscribe (https://medium.com/me/email-settings/50207bf5a022/c97c67efdfc1?type=noSetting&newsletterV3Id=bd173739d135&collectionId=84ac01765c52&source=email-50207bf5a022-1770138218730-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-84ac01765c52------------------------af839eca_227b_484d_b7b4_26b62f12034d--------bd173739d135)\r\n from this writer's email notifications\r\nManage your email settings (https://medium.com/me/settings/notifications?hash=c97c67efdfc1&userId=50207bf5a022&settingsRouteHash=%23manageSubscriptions&source=email-50207bf5a022-1770138218730-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-84ac01765c52------------------------af839eca_227b_484d_b7b4_26b62f12034d--------bd173739d135)\r\n\r\n3500 South DuPont Highway, Suite IQ-101, Dover,\xc2\xa0DE\xc2\xa019901\r\nCareers (https://medium.com/jobs-at-medium/work-at-medium-959d1a85284e?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770138218730-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-84ac01765c52------------------------af839eca_227b_484d_b7b4_26b62f12034d--------bd173739d135)\r\n\xc2\xb7Help Center (https://help.medium.com/hc/en-us?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770138218730-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-84ac01765c52------------------------af839eca_227b_484d_b7b4_26b62f12034d--------bd173739d135)\r\n\xc2\xb7Privacy Policy (https://policy.medium.com/medium-privacy-policy-f03bf92035c9?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770138218730-