[2026-04-27 11:11:00] Raw text/plain payload: b"From someone who literally writes about Apple products for a living\r\n7 Things Android Users Mock iPhones For That Apple Still Has Not Fixed\r\n\r\nFrom someone who literally writes about Apple products for a living\r\n\r\nThe Useful Tech (https://medium.com/@theusefultech?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770138422320-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-953b148ade73------------------------3ebb2332_f8f0_4da6_bede_4f05f40ddf94--------eeb618317985)\r\n\xc2\xa0in\xc2\xa0The Useful Tech (https://medium.com/the-useful-tech?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770138422320-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-953b148ade73------------------------3ebb2332_f8f0_4da6_bede_4f05f40ddf94--------eeb618317985)\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nFebruary 3, 2026\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\n8 min read\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nView on Medium (https://medium.com/the-useful-tech/3ce0bc6310ff?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770138422320-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-953b148ade73------------------------3ebb2332_f8f0_4da6_bede_4f05f40ddf94--------eeb618317985)\r\n\r\nSource: Image Generated by GPT 5.2\r\n\r\nI run an Apple blog. I've written hundreds of articles defending the iPhone. I've convinced family members to switch. I've rolled my eyes at Android users who bring up the same tired arguments at every family gathering.\r\n\r\nAnd yet.\r\n\r\nThere are moments when my Android-using friend sends me a screenshot of his split-screen setup while I'm fumbling between apps, and I have to physically stop myself from throwing my iPhone into the nearest body of water.\r\n\r\nAfter years of writing about Apple, I've earned the right to air some grievances. These are the criticisms I can no longer defend with\xe2\x80\xa6\r\n\r\nContinue reading (https://medium.com/the-useful-tech/3ce0bc6310ff?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770138422320-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-953b148ade73------------------------3ebb2332_f8f0_4da6_bede_4f05f40ddf94--------eeb618317985)\r\nThis is a member-only story and can only be read on Medium.\r\n\r\nSent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com by The Useful Tech on Medium\r\nUnsubscribe (https://medium.com/me/email-settings/50207bf5a022/57d82d9c0a9f?type=noSetting&newsletterV3Id=eeb618317985&collectionId=953b148ade73&source=email-50207bf5a022-1770138422320-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-953b148ade73------------------------3ebb2332_f8f0_4da6_bede_4f05f40ddf94--------eeb618317985)\r\n from this writer's email notifications\r\nManage your email settings (https://medium.com/me/settings/notifications?hash=57d82d9c0a9f&userId=50207bf5a022&settingsRouteHash=%23manageSubscriptions&source=email-50207bf5a022-1770138422320-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-953b148ade73------------------------3ebb2332_f8f0_4da6_bede_4f05f40ddf94--------eeb618317985)\r\n\r\n3500 South DuPont Highway, Suite IQ-101, Dover,\xc2\xa0DE\xc2\xa019901\r\nCareers (https://medium.com/jobs-at-medium/work-at-medium-959d1a85284e?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770138422320-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-953b148ade73------------------------3ebb2332_f8f0_4da6_bede_4f05f40ddf94--------eeb618317985)\r\n\xc2\xb7Help Center (https://help.medium.com/hc/en-us?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770138422320-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-953b148ade73------------------------3ebb2332_f8f0_4da6_bede_4f05f40ddf94--------eeb618317985)\r\n\xc2\xb7Privacy Policy (https://policy.medium.com/medium-privacy-policy-f03bf92035c9?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770138422320-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-953b148ade73------------------------3ebb2332_f8f0_4da6_bede_4f05f40ddf94--------eeb618317985)\r\n\xc2\xb7Terms of service (https://policy.medium.com/medium-terms-of-service-9db0094a1e0f?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770138422320-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-953b148ade73------------------------3ebb2332_f8f0_4da6_bede_4f05f40ddf94--------eeb618317985)"
