[2026-04-27 11:11:03] Raw text/plain payload: b'FDA Safety Communication  \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nIf your email program has trouble displaying this email, view as a webpage [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/bulletins/4054759 ].\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nMedWatch Banner \r\n\r\nBookmark and Share [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/bulletins/4054759?reqfrom=share ]\r\n\r\nUPDATE: Risk of False Positive Lead Test Results with Certain Capillary Blood Collection Tubes Used with Magellan Diagnostics LeadCare Testing Systems \xe2\x80\x93 FDA Safety Communication\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nThe FDA is updating the April 2025 safety communication \xe2\x80\x9cRisk of False Positive\xc2\xa0Lead Test\xc2\xa0Results with Certain Capillary Blood Collection Tubes Used with Magellan Diagnostics\xc2\xa0LeadCare\xc2\xa0Testing Systems [ https://links-2.govdelivery.com/CL0/https:%2F%2Fwww.fda.gov%2Fmedical-devices%2Fsafety-communications%2Frisk-false-positive-results-certain-capillary-blood-collection-tubes-used-magellan-diagnostics%3Futm_medium=email%26utm_source=govdelivery/1/0101019c246427fc-48a8bc7f-7a72-4a36-bb2c-204f0ce8a44a-000000/DQPZb5w1SsXTBGDuVUINYlkQCwEgiZj1e87FrVSIMRM=442 ]\xe2\x80\x9d. This update provides information about Warning Letters the FDA issued to two firms responsible for the manufacture and distribution of devices referenced in the communication.\r\n\r\n*Read More* [ https://www.fda.gov/medical-devices/safety-communications/risk-false-positive-lead-test-results-certain-capillary-blood-collection-tubes-used-magellan?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n\r\n*Questions?*\r\n\r\nIf you have questions,\xe2\x80\xafcontact the Division of Industry and Consumer Education [ https://links-2.govdelivery.com/CL0/https:%2F%2Flinks-2.govdelivery.com%2FCL0%2Fhttps:%252F%252Fwww.fda.gov%252Fmedical-devices%252Fdevice-advice-comprehensive-regulatory-assistance%252Fcontact-us-division-industry-and-consumer-education-dice%253Futm_medium=email%2526utm_source=govdelivery%2F1%2F010101966ef0e79d-b02f7880-2bf6-4a3b-bdf4-ea49a40eff69-000000%2FkCuT8nTlUbCR4rJQWqIx82Gcxi-pgDYYKAP1MWDbKqo=402/1/0101019c246427fc-48a8bc7f-7a72-4a36-bb2c-204f0ce8a44a-000000/7Is2fElnKfSAcxHcIKz6ASepkT_6SBP4BF1zqH-hQCg=442 ].\xe2\x80\xaf\xe2\x80\xaf\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n*Follow us on X at @FDAMedWatch [ https://twitter.com/FDAMedWatch?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]*\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n  \r\n \r\n\r\nfeed [ https://www.fda.gov/about-fda/contact-fda/subscribe-podcasts-and-news-feeds?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]twitter [ https://www.twitter.com/US_FDA?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]facebook [ https://www.facebook.com/FDA?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]Instagram [ https://www.instagram.com/FDA?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]youtube [ https://www.youtube.com/user/USFoodandDrugAdmin?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]flickr [ https://www.flickr.com/photos/fdaphotos/albums/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]  \r\n\r\n*Manage Subscriptions* [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 *Unsubscribe All* [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/subscriber/one_click_unsubscribe?verification=5.ee0243ee8741fe358146537aecf40e1e&destination=jasonnorman66994%40gmail.com ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 *Help* [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/ ]\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\nbody .abe-column-block {min-height: 5px;} td {line-height:1;} \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n This email was sent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com using GovDelivery Communications Cloud on behalf of: U.S. Food and Drug Administration \xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0\r\n10903 New Hampshire Ave\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0Silver Spring, MD \xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0 20993-0002\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa01-888-INFO-FDA GovDelivery logo 