[2026-04-27 11:11:04] Raw text/plain payload: b"Why didn't complex ecosystems vanish after Earth's first mass extinction?\r\nFOSSILS ET AL.\r\n\r\nHow Early Animal Life Survived an Unstable Climate\r\n\r\nWhy didn't complex ecosystems vanish after Earth's first mass extinction?\r\n\r\nSilvia Pineda-Munoz, PhD - Climate Ages (https://medium.com/@silvia-pineda-munoz-phd?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770140081466-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-618665d86dc7------------------------112b0d47_030b_4d6a_ac69_807141b5d22c--------67abc7b0bfbc)\r\n\xc2\xa0in\xc2\xa0Fossils et al. (https://medium.com/fossils-et-al?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770140081466-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-618665d86dc7------------------------112b0d47_030b_4d6a_ac69_807141b5d22c--------67abc7b0bfbc)\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nFebruary 3, 2026\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\n5 min read\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nView on Medium (https://medium.com/fossils-et-al/290855dba2a4?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770140081466-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-618665d86dc7------------------------112b0d47_030b_4d6a_ac69_807141b5d22c--------67abc7b0bfbc)\r\n\r\nLife on the platform margin of the Miaolingian sea, North China. Based on data from the Linyi Lagerst\xc3\xa4tte. Drawing by Dinghua Yang\xe2\x80\x8a-\xe2\x80\x8aBy Zhixin Sun, Fangchen Zhao, Han Zeng, Cui Luo, Heyo Van Iten, Maoyan Zhu\xe2\x80\x8a-\xe2\x80\x8ahttps://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwac069/6563905, CC BY 4.0, https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?curid=117302553\r\n\r\nFor a long time, the Cambrian explosion (http://redirect.medium.systems/r-MTIF6afG0p?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770140081466-newsletter.subscribeToProfile--290855dba2a4-----------------------112b0d47_030b_4d6a_ac69_807141b5d22c--------67abc7b0bfbc)\r\n (approximately 538.8 (http://redirect.medium.systems/r-zLDIOGSwIE?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770140081466-newsletter.subscribeToProfile--290855dba2a4-----------------------112b0d47_030b_4d6a_ac69_807141b5d22c--------67abc7b0bfbc)\r\n million years ago) has been told as a story of appearance. Animals show up in the fossil record with recognizable body plans. Limbs, eyes, mouths, and guts appear quickly in geological terms. When people hear this story for the first time, it often sounds like a biological mystery that solved itself. Life got complex, and then it kept going.\r\n\r\nBut that smooth storyline hides a problem that we paleontologists have been aware of for decades.\r\n\r\nThe early Cambrian (http://redirect.medium.systems/r-D7L3dV-xk_?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770140081466-newsletter.subscribeToProfile--290855dba2a4-----------------------112b0d47_030b_4d6a_ac69_807141b5d22c--------67abc7b0bfbc)\r\n world was not stable. It was dynamic, chemically active, and environmentally uneven. The\xe2\x80\xa6\r\n\r\nContinue reading (https://medium.com/fossils-et-al/290855dba2a4?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770140081466-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-618665d86dc7------------------------112b0d47_030b_4d6a_ac69_807141b5d22c--------67abc7b0bfbc)\r\nThis is a member-only story and can only be read on Medium.\r\n\r\nSent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com by Silvia Pineda-Munoz, PhD - Climate Ages on Medium\r\nUnsubscribe (https://medium.com/me/email-settings/50207bf5a022/5fc7ace63502?type=noSetting&newsletterV3Id=67abc7b0bfbc&collectionId=618665d86dc7&source=email-50207bf5a022-1770140081466-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-618665d86dc7------------------------112b0d47_030b_4d6a_ac69_807141b5d22c--------67abc7b0bfbc)\r\n from this writer's email notifications\r\nManage your email settings (https://medium.com/me/settings/notifications?hash=5fc7ace63502&userId=50207bf5a022&settingsRouteHash=%23manageSubscriptions&source=email-50207bf5a022-1770140081466-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-618665d86dc7------------------------112b0d47_030b_4d6a_ac69_807141b5d22c--------67abc7b0bfbc)\r\n\r\n3500 South DuPont Highway, Suite IQ-101, Dover,\xc2\xa0DE\xc2\xa019901\r\nCareers (https://medium.com/jobs-at-medium/work-at-medium-959d1a85284e?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770140081466-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-618665d86dc7------------------------112b0d47_030b_4d6a_ac69_807141b5d22c--------67abc7b0bfbc)\r\n\xc2\xb7Help Center (https://help.medium.com/hc/en-us?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770140081466-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-618665d86dc7------------------------112b0d47_030b_4d6a_ac69_807141b5d22c--------67abc7b0bfbc)\r\n\xc2\xb7Privacy Policy (https://policy.medium.com/medium-privacy-policy-f03bf92035c9?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770140081466-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-618665d86dc7------------------------112b0d47_030b_4d6a_ac69_807141b5d22c--------67abc7b0bfbc)\r\n\xc2\xb7Terms of service (https://policy.medium.com/medium-terms-of-service-9db0094a1e0f?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770140081466-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-618665d86dc7------------------------112b0d47_030b_4d6a_ac69_807141b5d22c--------67abc7b0bfbc)"
