[2026-04-27 11:11:06] Raw text/plain payload: b"Submit a proposal to present virtually at the 2026 LED Partnership Hybrid Workshop May 12-13.  \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nUnited States Census Bureau [ https://lehd.ces.census.gov/workshops_webinars/workshop/2026.html?utm_campaign=20260203cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nCensus Bureau: 2026 LED Partnership Workshop [ https://lehd.ces.census.gov/workshops_webinars/workshop/2026.html?utm_campaign=20260203cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n\r\n?? Call for Presentations!\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nThe Census Bureau invites you to submit a proposal to present virtually at the 2026 Local Employment Dynamics (LED) Partnership Workshop May 12-13. The deadline to submit a proposal is February 18.\r\n\r\nThe hybrid workshop will provide insights into LED data products as well as professional development and networking opportunities. The theme of this year\xe2\x80\x99s workshop is \xe2\x80\x9cNumbers to Narratives: Data for Better Decisions.\xe2\x80\x9d\r\n\r\nPresentations should focus on useful applications of data products made possible through the LED Partnership. Topics can include a wide variety of disciplines, including workforce development, transportation planning, economic analysis, emergency management and more. We are particularly interested in examples from our state partners.\r\n\r\nThe LED Partnership is a collaboration between state data agencies and the Census Bureau to leverage existing data in the development of new sources of economic and demographic information. Click the button below for detailed proposal guidance.\r\n\r\n*Learn More* [ https://lehd.ces.census.gov/workshops_webinars/workshop/2026.html?utm_campaign=20260203cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nStay Connected with the Census Bureau\r\n\r\nFollow us on our social media channels, Facebook [ https://www.facebook.com/uscensusbureau?utm_campaign=20260203cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ], Instagram [ https://www.instagram.com/uscensusbureau/?utm_campaign=20260203cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ], LinkedIn [ https://www.linkedin.com/company/us-census-bureau?utm_campaign=20260203cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ], Twitter/X [ https://x.com/uscensusbureau?utm_campaign=20260203cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ], and\xc2\xa0YouTube [ https://www.youtube.com/user/uscensusbureau?utm_campaign=20260203cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ], so you never miss an update.\r\n\r\nStay Connected With Us on Social Media \r\n\r\n*Follow Us* [ https://www.census.gov/about/contact-us/social_media.html?utm_campaign=20260203cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nAbout the Census Bureau\r\n\r\nWe serve as the nation\xe2\x80\x99s leading provider of quality data about its people and economy.\xc2\xa0The Census Bureau is the federal government's largest statistical agency. As the world\xe2\x80\x99s premier statistical agency, we are dedicated to making our nation a better place. Policy-makers, businesses, and the public use our data to make informed decisions.\r\n\r\nSubscribe [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USCENSUS/signup/34555 ] | Manage Subscriptions [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USCENSUS/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] | Unsubscribe [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USCENSUS/subscriber/one_click_unsubscribe?verification=5.76359f46a06559a62e8e0404a80cc7e5&destination=jasonnorman66994%40gmail.com ] | Help [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/s/?utm_campaign=20260203cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n\r\n*Share This* [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USCENSUS/bulletins/4078482 ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n  \r\n \r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\nThis is an official email from the U.S. Census Bureau. If you have any questions or comments, please contact us (http://www.census.gov/about/contact-us.html [ http://www.census.gov/about/contact-us.html?utm_campaign=20260203cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]).  \xc2\xa0 \r\nbody .abe-column-block {min-height: 5px;} table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:7px; margin-right:7px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;}\r\n"
