[2026-04-27 11:11:07] Raw text/plain payload: b"FDA's Cosmetics News \r\n \r\nFDA Grand Rounds: Postmarket Regulation of Cosmetic Products: The Who, What, When, Why and How\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\nFDA Grand Rounds logo\r\n\r\nA collage image of cups with barcodes, a scientist looking in microscope, virus, and bottle of medication.\r\n\r\n*Title:* FDA Grand Rounds: Postmarket Regulation of Cosmetic Products: The Who, What, When, Why and How\r\n\r\n*Date:* Thursday, February 5, 2026\r\n\r\n*Time:* 12:00 pm - 1:00 pm ET\r\n\r\nVia webcast\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*About the Presentation:*\r\n\r\nThis lecture will provide a comprehensive overview of the FDA's regulatory authorities over cosmetic products. Participants will also learn about the various tools available for industry to register their facilities and list their cosmetic products as required by MoCRA, and how industry and consumers can report adverse events from use of cosmetic products to the FDA.\r\n\r\n*CME credit will be offered. For more event information: https://www.fda.gov/science-research/about-science-research-fda/fda-grand-rounds [ https://www.fda.gov/science-research/about-science-research-fda/fda-grand-rounds?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]*\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n*https://www.fda.gov/cosmetics [ https://www.fda.gov/cosmetics?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]*\r\n\r\nUS Food and Drug Administration  \r\n \r\n\r\nfeed [ https://www.fda.gov/about-fda/contact-fda/subscribe-podcasts-and-news-feeds?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]twitter [ https://www.twitter.com/US_FDA?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]facebook [ https://www.facebook.com/FDA?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]Instagram [ https://www.instagram.com/FDA?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]youtube [ https://www.youtube.com/user/USFoodandDrugAdmin?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]flickr [ https://www.flickr.com/photos/fdaphotos/albums/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]  \r\n\r\n*Manage Subscriptions* [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 *Unsubscribe All* [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/subscriber/one_click_unsubscribe?verification=5.ee0243ee8741fe358146537aecf40e1e&destination=jasonnorman66994%40gmail.com ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 *Help* [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/ ]\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\nbody .abe-column-block {min-height: 5px;} td {line-height:1;} \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n This email was sent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com using GovDelivery Communications Cloud on behalf of: U.S. Food and Drug Administration \xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0\r\n10903 New Hampshire Ave\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0Silver Spring, MD \xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0 20993-0002\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa01-888-INFO-FDA GovDelivery logo [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\nbody .abe-column-block { min-height: 5px; } table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:10px; margin-right:10px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;}\r\n"
