[2026-04-27 11:11:38] Raw text/plain payload: b'If your email program has trouble displaying this email, view as a webpage [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/bulletins/407a60e ].\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nUS Food and Drug Administration\r\nCDRH Learn Module \xe2\x80\x93 Technology-Enabled Meaningful Patient Outcomes (TEMPO) for Digital Health Devices Pilot\r\n\r\nBookmark and Share [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/bulletins/407a60e?reqfrom=share ]\r\n\r\nThe U.S. Food and Drug Administration\xe2\x80\x99s Center for Devices and Radiological Health\xe2\x80\x99s new module, "Technology-Enabled Meaningful Patient Outcomes (TEMPO) for Digital Health Devices Pilot, "is now available online". "This module discusses the goals and features of the pilot, explains the selection process for participation, and describes information to include in statements of interest.\r\n\r\nThe presentation, printable slides, and transcript are available now on CDRH Learn [ https://links-2.govdelivery.com/CL0/https:%2F%2Fwww.fda.gov%2Ftraining-and-continuing-education%2Fcdrh-learn%3Futm_medium=email%26utm_source=govdelivery/1/0101019c246d8735-5f6c0e9a-ae77-411b-8fbb-d8dde23a20b2-000000/9uFbosilnFvbAwLzgxyA2tJu-olD_6WjQoYpd0saaU0=442 ] under \xe2\x80\x9cSpecialty Technical Topics,\xe2\x80\x9d sub-section \xe2\x80\x9cDigital Health.\xe2\x80\x9d\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*Read More* [ https://www.fda.gov/training-and-continuing-education/cdrh-learn?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n\r\nQuestions?\r\n\r\nIf you have questions, contact FDA-TEMPOPilot@fda.hhs.gov. \xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nAn unofficial translation of this announcement is provided below.\r\n\r\n\xe7\xbf\xbb\xe8\xaf\x91\xe5\x8f\x82\xe8\x80\x83:\r\n\r\nCDRH\xe5\xad\xa6\xe4\xb9\xa0\xe6\xa8\xa1\xe5\x9d\x97 \xe2\x80\x94\xe2\x80\x94 \xe6\x95\xb0\xe5\xad\x97\xe5\x81\xa5\xe5\xba\xb7\xe5\x8c\xbb\xe7\x