[2026-04-27 11:11:46] Raw text/plain payload: b'"Receive this email as a forward? Subscribe to CDER SBIA industry updates. [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/subscriber/new?topic_id=USFDA_352 ]"\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nBanner\r\nFDA | CDER | Small Business and Industry Assistance\r\n\r\nINDUSTRY NEWS\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\n.\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nBookmark and Share [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/bulletins/407775d?reqfrom=share ]\r\n\r\n*FDA Grand Rounds: Postmarket Regulation of Cosmetic Products: The Who, What, When, Why and How*\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\nA collage image of cups with barcodes, a scientist looking in microscope, virus, and bottle of medication. [ https://www.fda.gov/science-research/about-science-research-fda/fda-grand-rounds?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n\r\n*Title:* FDA Grand Rounds: Postmarket Regulation of Cosmetic Products: The Who, What, When, Why and How\r\n\r\n*Date:* Thursday, February 5, 2026\r\n\r\nTime: 12:00 pm - 1:00 pm ET\r\n\r\nVia webcast\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*About the Presentation:*\r\n\r\nThis lecture will provide a comprehensive overview of the FDA\'s regulatory authorities over cosmetic products. Participants will also learn about the various tools available for industry to register their facilities and list their cosmetic products as required by MoCRA, and how industry and consumers can report adverse events from use of cosmetic products to the FDA.\r\n\r\n*CME credit will be offered. For more event information:*\r\n\r\n*https://www.fda.gov/grandrounds [ https://links-2.govdelivery.com/CL0/https:%2F%2Fwww.fda.gov%2Fgrandrounds%3Futm_medium=email%26utm_source=govdelivery/2/0101019c108c23d5-fb3a6350-5907-4720-b2c1-f1075732ce3a-000000/5XUaxDno59kuXLDXzGNy3ZhCoC23aiz7tK6a-GIArU0=442 ]*\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nThe Small Business and Industry Assistance (SBIA) program in the Center for Drug Evaluation and Research provides guidance, education [ https://lnks.gd/l/eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJidWxsZXRpbl9saW5rX2lkIjoxMTYsInVyaSI6ImJwMjpjbGljayIsInVybCI6Imh0dHBzOi8vd3d3LmZkYS5nb3YvY2RlcnNiaWFsZWFybj91dG1fbWVkaXVtPWVtYWlsJnV0bV9zb3VyY2U9Z292ZGVsaXZlcnkiLCJidWxsZXRpbl9pZCI6IjIwMjQwNDA0LjkyODcwNjExIn0.bvTTMrV69vNEv9jQ5ie7cvbfajxuiLzwmIntCGYThWs/s/2605691806/br/240159884453-l?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] and updates for regulated industry.\r\n\r\n\r\n  * Register for Upcoming Training [ https://lnks.gd/l/eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJidWxsZXRpbl9saW5rX2lkIjoxMTcsInVyaSI6ImJwMjpjbGljayIsInVybCI6Imh0dHBzOi8vd3d3LmZkYS5nb3YvY2RlcnNiaWE_dXRtX21lZGl1bT1lbWFpbCZ1dG1fc291cmNlPWdvdmRlbGl2ZXJ5IiwiYnVsbGV0aW5faWQiOiIyMDI0MDQwNC45Mjg3MDYxMSJ9.m3W4Q5TmF7U4ze9XjN70rDHKjEiEdJV6Fk6U2bPc2p4/s/2605691806/br/240159884453-l?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n  * View the SBIA 2024 YouTube Playlist [ https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLey4Qe-Uxcxaf1HvpvnKO8-n8u9QW412g&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n  * View the SBIA 2025 YouTube Playlist [ https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLey4Qe-Uxcxa5NzgN2UeQcHqklugEvBje&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n  * Subscribe to CDER SBIA Email Updates [ https://lnks.gd/l/eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJidWxsZXRpbl9saW5rX2lkIjoxMTksInVyaSI6ImJwMjpjbGljayIsInVybCI6Imh0dHBzOi8vcHVibGljLmdvdmRlbGl2ZXJ5LmNvbS9hY2NvdW50cy9VU0ZEQS9zdWJzY3JpYmVyL25ldz90b3BpY19pZD1VU0ZEQV8zNTIiLCJidWxsZXRpbl9pZCI6IjIwMjQwNDA0LjkyODcwNjExIn0.rkzrgB5T3o3MggEWrk43morjHQ6oyfX2_lm3997kshs/s/2605691806/br/240159884453-l?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n  * Connect on LinkedIn [ https://lnks.gd/l/eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJidWxsZXRpbl9saW5rX2lkIjoxMjAsInVyaSI6ImJwMjpjbGljayIsInVybCI6Imh0dHBzOi8vd3d3LmxpbmtlZGluLmNvbS9zaG93Y2FzZS9jZGVyLXNtYWxsLWJ1c2luZXNzLWFuZC1pbmR1c3RyeS1hc3Npc3RhbmNlP3V0bV9tZWRpdW09ZW1haWwmdXRtX3NvdXJjZT1nb3ZkZWxpdmVyeSIsImJ1bGxldGluX2lkIjoi