[2026-04-27 11:11:54] Raw text/plain payload: b'If your email program has trouble displaying this email, view as a webpage [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/bulletins/4066f42 ].\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nUS Food and Drug Administration\r\n\r\nBookmark and Share [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/bulletins/4066f42?reqfrom=share ]\r\n\r\nFood Safety Culture Webinar - February 18, 2026\r\n\r\nGreetings,\r\n\r\nPlease join us for the third webinar in our FDA and Alliance to Stop Foodborne Illness co-hosted Food Safety Culture Webinar Series.\r\n\r\n*Webinar #3: Live Your Values Day by Day*\r\n\r\n*Wednesday, February 18, 2026; noon ET*\r\n\r\nRegister here [ https://consumerbrandsassociation.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_KG1PsyA0SoGbb_3l1QP_Dw?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery#/registration ]!\r\n\r\nThe webinar will discuss how to avoid complacency through proactive, ongoing reinforcement of organizational values. Webinar participants will include Sean Leighton, Global Vice President of Food Safety, Quality and Regulatory at Cargill and Sarah Nayani, Director of Compliance with Arctic Storm Management, as well as speakers from FDA and the Alliance to Stop Foodborne Illness.\r\n\r\nThis is the third in our ongoing series of interactive, hour-long webinars throughout the year designed to deepen your knowledge and strengthen your commitment to food safety. Each session will feature industry experts who will share valuable insights, real-world tools and actionable strategies to enhance food safety culture across your organization.\r\n\r\nClick this link [ https://stopfoodborneillness.org/alliance/webinar-series/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] to view the complete list of webinars and reserve your spot for the rest of the series.\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nAbout Us\r\n\r\nThe Public Engagement Staff [ https://www.fda.gov/about-fda/office-external-affairs/stakeholder-engagement-staff?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] resides within the Office of Operations and falls under the Office of External Affairs. We aim to build stronger relationships with health professional organizations, patients and patient advocacy organizations, consumer groups, trade associations, think tanks and academia, and other interested parties, in order to better inform our policy making process, identify policy hurdles or misconceptions, and create strategic collaborations. For more information, please contact us at PublicEngagement@fda.hhs.gov.\xc2\xa0For patient specific inquiries, please contact us at\xc2\xa0Patients Ask FDA [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/email/dsp_ESMR.cfm?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ].\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n  \r\n \r\n\r\nfeed [ https://www.fda.gov/about-fda/contact-fda/subscribe-podcasts-and-news-feeds?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]twitter [ https://www.twitter.com/US_FDA?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]facebook [ https://www.facebook.com/FDA?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]Instagram [ https://www.instagram.com/FDA?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]youtube [ https://www.youtube.com/user/USFoodandDrugAdmin?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]flickr [ https://www.flickr.com/photos/fdaphotos/albums/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]  \r\n\r\n*Manage Subscriptions* [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 *Unsubscribe All* [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/subscriber/one_click_unsubscribe?verification=5.ee0243ee8741fe358146537aecf40e1e&destination=jasonnorman66994%40gmail.com ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 *Help* [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/ ]\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\nbody .abe-column-block {min-height: 5px;} td {line-height:1;} \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n This email was sent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com using GovDelivery Communications Cloud on behalf of: U.S. Food and Drug Administration \xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0\r\n10903 New Hampshire Ave\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0Silver Spring, MD \xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0 20993-0002\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa01-888-INFO-FDA GovDelivery logo [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\nbody .abe-column-block { min-height: 5px; } table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:10px; margin-right:10px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;}\r\n'
