en-drug-ingredients ] \r\n  * Drug Trials Snapshots: REDEMPLO [ https://www.fda.gov/drugs/drug-approvals-and-databases/drug-trials-snapshots-redemplo ] \r\n\r\n*January 27, 2026*\r\n\r\n\r\n  * FDA approves daratumumab and hyaluronidase-fihj with bortezomib, lenalidomide, and dexamethasone for newly diagnosed multiple myeloma [ https://www.fda.gov/drugs/resources-information-approved-drugs/fda-approves-daratumumab-and-hyaluronidase-fihj-bortezomib-lenalidomide-and-dexamethasone-newly ] \r\n\r\nThis report displays final approvals and tentative approvals of original and supplemental applications for the two days beginning on the earliest date listed below. Some approvals may be added to the Drugs@FDA database after this time span. For comprehensive approval reports, please use the monthly "All Approvals [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=reportsSearch.process&nav=&reportSelectMonth=9&reportSelectYear=2020&rptName=1&utm_medium=&utm_source=#navigation ]" report on Drugs@FDA.\r\n\r\nFebruary 3, 2026\r\n\r\nDrug Name and\r\nApplication Number Active Ingredient Dosage Form/ Route Submission Company Submission Classification Submission Status Actonel\r\nNDA #020835 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=020835 ] Risedronate Sodium Tablet; Oral SUPPL-54 Apil Labeling Approved Stivarga\r\nNDA #203085 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=203085 ] Regorafenib Tablet; Oral SUPPL-18 Bayer Hlthcare Labeling Approved Pregabalin\r\nANDA #213226 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=213226 ] Pregabalin Tablet, Extended Release; Oral SUPPL-5 Msn Labeling Approved Pregabalin\r\nANDA #213226 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=213226 ] Pregabalin Tablet, Extended Release; Oral SUPPL-5 Msn Labeling Approved Doxorubicin Hydrochloride\r\nANDA #219881 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=219881 ] Doxorubicin Hydrochloride Injectable, Liposomal; Injection ORIG-1 Qilu Pharm Hainan \xc2\xa0 Approved \r\n\r\nFebruary 2, 2026\r\n\r\nDrug Name and\r\nApplication Number Active Ingredient Dosage Form/ Route Submission Company Submission Classification Submission Status Primaquine\r\nNDA #008316 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=008316 ] Primaquine Phosphate Tablet; Oral SUPPL-26 Sanofi Aventis Us Labeling Approved Concerta\r\nNDA #021121 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=021121 ] Methylphenidate Hydrochloride Tablet, Extended Release; Oral SUPPL-34 Janssen Pharms Labeling Approved Concerta\r\nNDA #021121 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=021121 ] Methylphenidate Hydrochloride Tablet, Extended Release; Oral SUPPL-40 Janssen Pharms Labeling Approved Concerta\r\nNDA #021121 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=021121 ] Methylphenidate Hydrochloride Tablet, Extended Release; Oral SUPPL-45 Janssen Pharms Labeling Approved Pur-Wash\r\nNDA #022305 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=022305 ] Purified Water Solution; Ophthalmic SUPPL-8 Niagara Pharms Labeling Approved Dapagliflozin\r\nANDA #211582 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=211582 ] Dapagliflozin Tablet; Oral ORIG-1 Zydus Pharms \xc2\xa0 Tentative Approval Lenalidomide\r\nANDA #213165 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=213165 ] Lenalidomide Capsule; Oral ORIG-1 Cipla \xc2\xa0 Approved Pregabalin\r\nANDA #213313 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=213313 ] Pregabalin Tablet, Extended Release; Oral SUPPL-2 Apotex Labeling Approved Pregabalin\r\nANDA #214322 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=214322 ] Pregabalin Capsule; Oral SUPPL-6 Changzhou Pharm Labeling Approved Norliqva\r\nNDA #214439 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=214439 ] Amlodipine Besylate Solution; Oral SUPPL-1 Cmp Dev Llc Labeling Approved Estradiol\r\nANDA #215096 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=215096 ] Estradiol Gel, Metered; Transdermal ORIG-1 Long Grove Pharms \xc2\xa0 Approved Methylene Blue\r\nANDA #215636 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=215636 ] Methylene Blue Solution; Intravenous SUPPL-4 Zydus Lifesciences Manufacturing (CMC) Approved Fidaxomicin\r\nANDA #219559 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=219559 ] Fidaxomicin Tablet; Oral ORIG-1 Apotex \xc2\xa0 Approved Mirtazapine\r\nANDA #219919 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=219919 ] Mirtazapine Tablet; Oral ORIG-1 Novitium Pharma \xc2\xa0 Approved Tyruko\r\nBLA #761322 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=761322 ] Natalizumab-Sztn Injectable; Injection SUPPL-7 Sandoz Inc REMS Approved \r\n\r\nfeed [ https://www.fda.gov/about-fda/contact-fda/subscribe-podcasts-and-news-feeds?utm_medium=&utm_source= ]twitter [ https://www.twitter.com/US_FDA?utm_medium=&utm_source= ]facebook [ https://www.facebook.com/FDA?utm_medium=&utm_source= ]youtube [ https://www.youtube.com/user/USFoodandDrugAdmin?utm_medium=&utm_source= ]flickr [ https://www.flickr.com/photos/fdaphotos/albums/?utm_medium=&utm_source= ]  \r\n\r\n*Manage Subscriptions* [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 *Unsubscribe All* [ ht