[2026-04-27 11:12:10] Raw text/plain payload: b'SelectUSA News and Updates \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nApply to Attend the 2026 SelectUSA Investment Summit!\r\nSelectUSA Investment Summit\r\n\r\n\xe2\x80\x8b\xe2\x80\x8b\xe2\x80\x8b\xe2\x80\x8b\xe2\x80\x8b\xe2\x80\x8b\xe2\x80\x8bRegistration is OPEN! Join us for the 2026 SelectUSA Investment Summit happening May 3-6, 2026 in National Harbor, Maryland!\r\n\r\nThe SelectUSA Investment Summit is the\xe2\x80\xafpremier event in the United States for FDI promotion, *learn more and register to attend now [ https://www.selectusasummit.us/ ]*.\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nKelly Coldiron Bio \r\nWelcoming Acting Executive Director Kelly Coldiron\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nKelly Coldiron serves as Acting Executive Director of SelectUSA, as well as Deputy Chief of Staff and Director of Industry Engagement for the Under Secretary for International Trade at the U.S. Department of Commerce. In these capacities, she provides counsel to advance strategic initiatives and priorities that enhance U.S. economic competitiveness, drive investment, and global commercial opportunities. Through industry engagement efforts, Kelly directs corporate outreach to ensure private-sector insights inform policy, and acts as an ombudsman for U.S. companies facing trade and investment barriers or foreign regulatory hurdles.\r\n\r\nPrior to ITA, Kelly held senior roles across the public and private sectors, including as President of KAI Strategies, LLC, where she supported clients seeking to sharpen their technological edge, expand international sales, build public\xe2\x80\x91private partnerships, and grow advanced manufacturing and R&D investments in emerging U.S. industries. During President Trump\xe2\x80\x99s first term, she served in multiple senior positions at the U.S. Department of Commerce and the White House, helping drive global investment attraction, operations, and strategic communications.\r\n\r\nA Michigan native, she also worked in Michigan and Ohio on state-level economic development, coalition building, and regional growth initiatives. She is a graduate of Michigan State University with a B.A. in Political Science and International Studies.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\nSelectUSA Webinar\r\nWebinar Opportunity: U.S. Artificial Intelligence Infrastructure and Data Centers\r\n\r\n*Date:* Thursday, February 19 at 10 AM ET\r\n*Register here [ https://events.trade.gov/en/TradeGov/USArtificialIntelligenceInfrastructureandDataCente/login.php?redirect=%2Fen%2FTradeGov%2FUSArtificialIntelligenceInfrastructureandDataCente%2Fform.php%3F ]*\r\n\r\nInvestment in artificial intelligence is booming. Learn how your company can be part of America\xe2\x80\x99s plan to scale the infrastructure supporting AI deployment.\r\n\r\nHear from panelists at Microsoft, Cisco, and the Data Center Coalition as they break down where opportunities are emerging, the challenges facing domestic buildout, and how companies can position themselves in a rapidly evolving market.\r\n\r\n"Please note: This is a fee-based webinar."\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nApply to Host a Collateral!\r\n\r\nSelectUSA and the U.S. Department of Commerce will highlight investment promotion events surrounding the Investment Summit on the Collateral Events Calendar. Any event held during the Investment Summit in Washington, D.C. and hosted by another group with the support of SelectUSA is considered a SelectUSA Investment Summit Collateral Event. The Collateral Events Calendar can help drive investors to your on-site collateral events, such as receptions, roundtables, and networking sessions.\r\n\r\n*The deadline to submit an Investment Summit Collateral Event application is 5 PM ET on Monday, March 2, 2026*\r\n\r\n*Apply Now!* [ https://www.selectusasummit.us/Applications/Collateral-Event-Application ] \r\n \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nSelectUSA Investment Summit Spinoff Events\r\n\r\nSelectUSA Investment Summit Spinoff Events connect your company to some of the most promising business opportunities in the United States. SelectUSA Spinoffs are events that take place before or after the SelectUSA Investment Summit in different locations across the United States. Explore the full list of 2026 SelectUSA Spinoff Events on our*\xc2\xa0website [ https://www.selectusasummit.us/Programming/Spinoff-Events ]*.\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nCollege Park Spinoff \r\nThe Maryland Lighthouse Exchange: Illuminating Investment Opportunities Across Maryland\'s Leading Industries\r\n\r\n*Date*: April 30-May 1, 2026\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*Registration Deadline*: April 3, 2026\r\n\r\nThe Maryland Lighthouse Exchange is a two-day deal driven experience that will take place in the capital region of Maryland designed for foreign investors seeking high-impact opportunities in the U.S.\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nLearn more and register *here [ https://business.maryland.gov/maryland-selectusa-2026-spinoff-tour/ ].*\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nReno Spinoff \r\nSelectNV: The Future of Doing Business in Nevada\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*Date*: April 29-30, 2026\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*Registration Deadline*: April 13, 2026\r\n\r\nThe Governor\xe2\x80\x99s Office of Economic Development (GOED) will host SelectNV: The Future of Doing Business in Nevada, in Reno as an official SelectUSA Spinoff Event highlighting Nevada\xe2\x80\x99s unique position as the state in the U.S. with a fully integrated, closed lithium loop\xe2\x80\x94from raw material extraction to advanced battery manufacturing and recycling.\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nLearn more and register *here [ https://goed.nv.gov/ ].*\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nCall for speakers \r\nJoin Us as a Speaker at a SelectUSA Event\r\n\r\nSelectUSA continues to accept speaker and topic suggestions to inspire and educate global business leaders and economic developers. Share actionable insights at the highest-profile FDI event in the U.S. from May 3-6, 2026, or contribute to SelectUSA\xe2\x80\x99s year-round webinars and sessions. If you are a U.S. Startup Ecosystem member and have expertise relevant to international tech startups, take a look at our (SelectUSA Tech Programming) and submit a Call for Speakers application [ https://www.selectusasummit.us/Applications/Call-for-Speakers ].\r\n\r\nApplications that were submitted before September 12, 2025 will receive priority consideration for the 2026 Investment Summit and applications submitted after that date will be considered for SelectUSA year-round programming and to fill gaps in the 2026 Investment Summit programming.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nSelectUSA Hosted Events\r\n\r\nWe have many more exciting events for companies, EDOs, service providers, and more in 2026. Be sure to check out our full *calendar of events* [ https://gcc02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Flnks.gd%2Fl%2FeyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJidWxsZXRpbl9saW5rX2lkIjoxMDYsInVyaSI6ImJwMjpjbGljayIsImJ1bGxldGluX2lkIjoiMjAyMjA4MTcuNjIzNzIzMTEiLCJ1cmwiOiJodHRwczovL3d3dy50cmFkZS5nb3Yvc2VsZWN0dXNhLXVwY29taW5nLWV2ZW50cyJ9.ORWNVLtGcDpDY35tIP1uksMJ6vSBJO1y2C1WzwOSWiQ%2Fs%2F693235793%2Fbr%2F142680075531-l&data=05%7C02%7CLauren.westcott%40trade.gov%7C407dbde5372d460ee0b508dc11fa8cf1%7Ca1d183f26c7b4d9ab9945f2f31b3f780%7C1%7C0%7C638405015004667506%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C3000%7C%7C%7C&sdata=EVbPPPK%2B4g3k9R6EGHD2TKbgTUmLo9MByMSdpEkgTvo%3D&reserved=0 ] on our website.\r\n\r\n*Calendar of Events* [ https://www.trade.gov/selectusa-upcoming-events ] \r\n \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nThis Week Online\r\nSelectUSA Roadshow\r\n\r\n*LinkedIn [ https://www.linkedin.com/posts/selectusa_ol%C3%A1-and-hola-from-brazil-and-colombia-activity-7424479236658294784-xrzi?utm_source=share&utm_medium=member_desktop&rcm=ACoAABigc9EBCJeBtqG47n_DAbjEqYTtNoV8LAg ]:* Ol\xc3\xa1 and hola from Brazil and Colombia! The SelectUSA South America Roadshow is officially in the books!\r\n\r\nFrom Curitiba and S\xc3\xa3o Paulo to Medell\xc3\xadn, we spent the week connecting Brazilian and Colombian companies with the insights, networks, and on-the-ground expertise to explore investment opportunities in the United States.\r\n\r\nAlong the way, participants met with service providers and economic developers from eight U.S. states, helping companies map opportunities and shape their next steps in the world\xe2\x80\x99s largest economy.\r\n\r\nThanks to our partners, speakers, and everyone who joined us across all three stops.\r\n\r\nAcademy Speakers\r\n\r\n*Instagram [ https://www.instagram.com/p/DT-4OywEdYI/?utm_source=ig_web_copy_link&igsh=MzRlODBiNWFlZA== ]: *We\xe2\x80\x99re excited to share the FIRST group of speakers joining us at the 2026 SelectUSA Investment Summit!\r\n\r\nOur agenda is now updated with many confirmed experts leading Investment Academy sessions, designed to help international companies navigate expansion into the United States.\r\n\r\nNot sure where to start? If you\xe2\x80\x99re exploring how to enter or grow in the U.S. market, these panels offer targeted insight on site selection, business culture, tax considerations, foreign direct investment data, the U.S. legal landscape, and more.\r\n\r\nStay tuned for more speaker confirmations soon!\r\n\r\nExplore the agenda: https://www.selectusasummit.us/Programming/2026-Investment-Summit-Agenda\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n  \r\n \r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\nBookmark and Share [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USITATRADE/bulletins/4075008?reqfrom=share ]\r\n\r\nLogo [ http://selectusa.gov ] Questions?\r\nContact Us [ https://www.selectusa.gov/contact-us ]  \r\n\r\nSTAY CONNECTED: Visit us on X [ http://twitter.com/tradegov ] \xc2\xa0 @SelectUSA [ https://twitter.com/SelectUSA ]  Connect with us on LinkedIn [ https://www.linkedin.com/company/international-trade-administration ] \xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0SelectUSA on LinkedIn [ https://www.linkedin.com/company/selectusa ]  \r\n\r\nSUBSCRIBER SERVICES:\r\nManage Preferences [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USITATRADE/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ]\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0Help <support@govdelivery.com>\r\n\r\nThis message was sent to you from *SelectUSA *within the U.S. Department of Commerce\'s *International Trade Administration*.\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nTo unsubscribe or update your subscriptions, please visit the\xc2\xa0User Profile Page [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USITATRADE/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ].\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nFind out how the United States is *supporting foreign direct investors* on the federal, state, and local level at SelectUSA.gov [ http://selectusa.gov ].\r\n\r\nP.S. If you have any questions or problems, please visit subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com ] for assistance.\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\nThis email was sent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com using GovDelivery Communications Cloud on behalf of the International Trade Administration\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7 1401 Constitution Avenue NW \xc2\xb7 Washington, DC 20230 GovDelivery logo [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/ ] \r\nbody .abe-column-block { min-height: 5px; } table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:10px; margin-right:10px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;} table.govd_hr {min-width: 100%;}\r\n'
