[2026-04-27 11:12:12] Raw text/plain payload: b"Recapping last week's population estimates and American Community Survey data releases.  \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nUnited States Census Bureau [ https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-kits.html?utm_campaign=20260204cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\n?? Updates You May Have Missed\r\n\r\nWe released a lot of new Census Bureau data last week! Explore *Vintage 2025 National and State Population\xc2\xa0**Estimates* and *2020-2024 American Community Survey 5-year estimates*.\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nU.S. Population Growth Slows Due to Historic Decline in Net International Migration\r\n\r\nU.S. Population Growth Slows Due to Historic Decline in Net International Migration [ https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2026/population-growth-slows.html?utm_campaign=20260204cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n\r\nPopulation growth in the United States has slowed significantly with an increase of only *1.8 million*, or *0.5%*, between July 1, 2024, and July 1, 2025, according to new Vintage 2025 population estimates.\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*Learn More* [ https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2026/population-growth-slows.html?utm_campaign=20260204cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n\r\n?? Related Content\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n  * *Press Kit:*\xc2\xa0Vintage 2025 National and State Population Estimates [ https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-kits/2026/national-state-population-estimates.html?utm_campaign=20260204cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n  * *Blog:*\xc2\xa0New Population Estimates Show Historic Decline in Net International Migration [ https://www.census.gov/newsroom/blogs/random-samplings/2026/01/historic-decline-in-net-international-migration.html?utm_campaign=20260204cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nAmerica Counts: U.S. Population Growth Slowest Since COVID-19 Pandemic [ https://www.census.gov/library/stories/2026/01/pop-estimates-state-change.html?utm_campaign=20260204cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n\r\nA sizeable reduction in net international migration \xe2\x80\x93 people moving between the United States and other countries \xe2\x80\x93 was the main reason for the slowdown.\r\n\r\nNatural change, the difference between the number of births and deaths, remained relatively stable.\xc2\xa0Both the nation and states saw their population growth slow in the last year but for different reasons.\r\n\r\n*Read More* [ https://www.census.gov/library/stories/2026/01/pop-estimates-state-change.html?utm_campaign=20260204cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nCensus Bureau: 2020-2024 ACS 5-Year Estimates [ https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2026/acs-5-year-gains-educational-attainment.html?utm_campaign=20260204cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n\r\nMetro and Micro Areas Have Large Gains in Educational Attainment\r\n\r\nThe percentage of adults age 25 and over with a bachelor\xe2\x80\x99s degree or higher increased significantly in metropolitan statistical areas, up from *34.2%* during the 2015-2019 period to *37.8%* during the 2020-2024 period, according to new American Community Survey 5-year estimates.\r\n\r\n*Learn More* [ https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2026/acs-5-year-gains-educational-attainment.html?utm_campaign=20260204cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n\r\n?? Related Content\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n  * *Press Kit:*\xc2\xa02020-2024 American Community Survey 5-Year Estimates [ https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-kits/2026/acs-5-year-estimates.html?utm_campaign=20260204cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nAmerica Counts: Rental Costs Up, Mortgages Stayed Flat [ https://www.census.gov/library/stories/2026/01/housing-costs.html?utm_campaign=20260204cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n\r\nHomeowners\xe2\x80\x99 costs remained nearly unchanged from 2020-2024 compared to the previous five-year period while renters paid $100 more a month to a median $1,413, according to 2020-2024 American Community Survey 5-year estimates.\r\n\r\n*Read More* [ https://www.census.gov/library/stories/2026/01/housing-costs.html?utm_campaign=20260204cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n\r\n?? More from America Counts\r\n\r\n  * How Income Varies by Race and Geography [ https://www.census.gov/library/stories/2026/01/household-income-by-race-and-state.html?utm_campaign=20260204cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n  * Share of Owner-Occupied, Mortgage-Free Homes Up in 2024 [ https://www.census.gov/library/stories/2026/01/mortgage-free-homes.html?utm_campaign=20260204cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\n*?? *Help us spread the word about Census Bureau data!\r\n\r\nShare this on social media or forward it to a friend.\r\n\r\n*Share This* [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USCENSUS/bulletins/407c1c4 ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nAbout the Census Bureau\r\n\r\nWe serve as the nation\xe2\x80\x99s leading provider of quality data about its people and economy.\xc2\xa0The Census Bureau is the federal government's largest statistical agency. As the world\xe2\x80\x99s premier statistical agency, we are dedicated to making our nation a better place. Policy-makers, businesses, and the public use our data to make informed decisions.\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n  \r\n \r\n\r\n*Stay connected with us!*\r\n\r\nJoin the conversation on social media.\r\n\r\n facebook [ https://www.facebook.com/uscensusbureau/?utm_campaign=20260204cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]instagram [ https://www.instagram.com/uscensusbureau/?utm_campaign=20260204cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]linkedin [ https://www.linkedin.com/company/us-census-bureau/?utm_campaign=20260204cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]twitter [ https://twitter.com/uscensusbureau/?utm_campaign=20260204cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] [ https://www.linkedin.com/company/us-census-bureau/?utm_campaign=20260204cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]youtube [ https://www.youtube.com/user/uscensusbureau/?utm_campaign=20260204cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]  \r\n\r\nSUBSCRIBER SERVICES:\r\n\r\nSubscriber Settings [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USCENSUS/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 Remove me from All Subscriptions  [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USCENSUS/subscriber/one_click_unsubscribe?verification=5.76359f46a06559a62e8e0404a80cc7e5&destination=jasonnorman66994%40gmail.com ]\xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0Help [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/ ]\r\n\r\n \r\n&lt;!-- /* template top padding on mobile */ @media only screen and (max-width: 480px) { table#flexible-abe-main-table { padding:0 !important; } } --&gt; ________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\nThis is an official email from the U.S. Census Bureau. If you have any questions or comments, please contact us (http://www.census.gov/about/contact-us.html [ http://www.census.gov/about/contact-us.html?utm_campaign=20260204cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]).  \xc2\xa0 \r\nbody .abe-column-block {min-height: 5px;} table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:7px; margin-right:7px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;}\r\n"
