[2026-04-27 11:12:19] Raw text/plain payload: b'/**View Email Container Start**/ .view_email_container { font-family: Calibri, Arial; } .view_email_container .bottom { text-align: left; margin: 0px auto; } .view_email_container .block > label { display: inline-block; width: 70px; text-align: left; margin-right: 10px; } .view_email_block { padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ccc; border-radius: 4px; margin-bottom: 10px; } .title_block { text-align: center; margin-bottom:10px !important; } .email_bottom_info_block .title_block { font-size: 70%;} .email_bottom_info_block { background-color: #f0f0f0; text-align: center; margin: 0px auto; } /*Content Review Style*/ .content_area { padding: 23px 22px 0px 22px;font-family: Calibri, Arial;} .content_area table td { font-family: Calibri, Arial; } .content_area:empty { padding: 0; } .content_area img { border: 0px; } .content_area a { color: #337ffe; } .clearfix:after { content: "."; display: block; height: 0; clear: both; visibility: hidden; font-size: 0px; } .detail-thumbnail { display: inline-block; vertical-align: top; } .detail-thumbnail img { display: block; max-width: 200px; margin: 0 15px 0 0; } .detail-title, .detail-subtitle, .detail-intro { margin: 0; } .detail-title { color: #337ffe; } .detail-intro { font-size: 100%; font-weight: normal; margin-bottom: 10px; font-style: italic; } .detail-list { margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; display: inline-block; vertical-align: top; } .detail-list-label { display: inline-block; width: 120px; font-weight: bold; vertical-align: top; } .detail-list-value { display: inline-block; vertical-align: top; } .detail-content { padding: 10px 0; clear: both; } .detail-more { font-style: italic; font-size: 90%; float: right; } .detail-url {padding:0px 22px 10px 22px;} .detail-url a {color:#337ffe} \r\nFriday, February 13: 8th Annual Bishop Richard Allen Wreath Laying Ceremony\r\n\r\nA Celebration of Life & Legacy\r\nPost Date: 02/04/2026 1:53 PM \r\n\r\nOn Friday, February 13,\xc2\xa0join Radnor Township, members of the AME Community, and Friends as we celebrate the life and legacy of Bishop Richard Allen, and commemorate Bishop Richard Allen Park (227 Brook Street, Bryn Mawr). We are excited to announce this year we will be transitioning event partnership and leadership to St. John AME Church Rosemont with leadership by Reverend Kasha Sudler. We have been honored to celebrate the creation of and leadership of the event for the last seven years with Bethel African Methodist Episcopal Church of Ardmore, led by Reverend Carolyn C. Cavaness, who is now the first woman and 53rd Pastor of Mother Bethel AME Church Philadelphia.\r\n\r\nDescendants of Bishop Richard Allen will be in attendance at the event this year. We welcome distinguished spiritual leaders and theologians and members of the Radnor Township and Main Line community to lead and be a part of this cherished annual tradition now in its 8th year. For more information, please visit the event website by clicking here [ https://gcc02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?data=05%7C02%7Cmgallagher%40radnor.org%7C596ba718748c4018636308de640972f8%7Cb321154193fc4b5cb1808f75e9cfe8b5%7C0%7C0%7C639058188919724181%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&reserved=0&sdata=KgJYCqYPwNcHTx%2B9P9L7AZbpwCm%2Bwu2Pa%2BYqWfcuu1Y%3D&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.radnor.com%2Fgovernment%2Fdepartments%2Fparks-recreation%2Fcommunity-events%2Fbishop-richard-allen-wreath-laying-ceremony%3Futm_medium%3Demail%26utm_source%3Dgovdelivery&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ].\r\n\r\nRAllen wreath 2026\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nClick here for more information [ https://www.radnor.com/Home/Components/News/News/4000/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] ________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\nUpdate your subscriptions, modify your password or email address, or stop subscriptions at any time on your Subscriber Preferences Page [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/PARADNOR/subscriber/new?preferences=true ]. You will need to use your email address to log in. If you have questions or problems with the subscription service, please visit subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/ ]. \r\n\r\nThis service is provided to you at no charge by Township of Radnor, PA [ https://www.radnor.com/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]. \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n This email was sent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com using govDelivery Communications Cloud on behalf of: Township of Radnor, PA \xc2\xb7 301 Iven Avenue \xc2\xb7 Wayne, PA 19087-5297 GovDelivery logo [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\nbody .abe-column-block {min-height: 5px;}\r\n'
