[2026-04-27 11:12:23] Raw text/plain payload: b'US Food and Drug Administration \r\nOutbreak Investigations & Safety Advisories\r\n\r\n*FDA Human Foods Program*\r\n\r\nThe following is an update from FDA of concern to our subscribers.\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nCORE Outbreak Investigation Table\r\n\r\nThe CORE Outbreak Investigation Table is a list of outbreak and adverse event investigations primarily being managed by FDA\xe2\x80\x99s CORE Response Teams [ https://www.fda.gov/food/outbreaks-foodborne-illness/about-core-network?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]. The investigations are in a variety of stages, meaning that some outbreaks have limited information, and others may be near completion. The table will be updated weekly.\r\n\r\n*This week\'s updates are: *\r\n\r\n\r\n  * For the outbreak of\xc2\xa0"Salmonella\xc2\xa0"Typhimurium (ref #1358), the vehicle linked to illnesses was updated to moringa leaf powder. FDA updated the\xc2\xa0advisory [ https://www.fda.gov/food/outbreaks-foodborne-illness/outbreak-investigation-salmonella-moringa-leaf-powder-january-2026?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\xc2\xa0on January 29, 2026, to include an additional recall for a lot of Why Not Natural Pure Organic Moringa Green Superfood capsules and the addition of\xc2\xa0"Salmonella\xc2\xa0"Newport cases based on CDC\xe2\x80\x99s investigation. FDA has initiated sampling.\xc2\xa0 \r\n  * For the outbreak of\xc2\xa0"Listeria monocytogenes"\xc2\xa0(ref #1309) linked to a not identified product, FDA\xe2\x80\x99s outbreak investigation is complete. \r\n  * For the outbreak of\xc2\xa0"Salmonella\xc2\xa0"Lomalinda (ref #1339) linked to spring mix, the\xc2\xa0Executive Incident Summary Abstract [ https://www.fda.gov/media/190906/download?attachment=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\xc2\xa0can now be accessed by clicking the reference number. This outbreak investigation was moved to the Closed 2025 Table. \r\n  * For the outbreak of\xc2\xa0"Listeria monocytogenes"\xc2\xa0(ref #1334) linked to a not identified product, the\xc2\xa0Executive Incident Summary Abstract [ https://www.fda.gov/media/190907/download?attachment=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\xc2\xa0can now be accessed by clicking the reference number. This outbreak investigation was moved to the Closed 2025 Table. \r\n  * For the outbreak of\xc2\xa0"Salmonella\xc2\xa0"Enteritidis (ref #1329) linked to a not identified product, the\xc2\xa0Executive Incident Summary Abstract [ https://www.fda.gov/media/190908/download?attachment=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\xc2\xa0can now be accessed by clicking the reference number. This outbreak investigation was moved to the Closed 2025 Table. \r\n  * For the outbreak of\xc2\xa0"Cyclospora cayetanensis"\xc2\xa0(ref #1325) linked to parsley, the\xc2\xa0Executive Incident Summary Abstract [ https://www.fda.gov/media/190909/download?attachment=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\xc2\xa0can now be accessed by clicking the reference number. This outbreak investigation was moved to the Closed 2025 Table. \r\n  * For the outbreak of\xc2\xa0"Cyclospora cayetanensis"\xc2\xa0(ref #1313) linked to a not identified product, the\xc2\xa0Executive Incident Summary Abstract\xc2\xa0 [ https://www.fda.gov/media/190910/download?attachment=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]can now be accessed by clicking the reference number. This outbreak investigation was moved to the Closed 2025 Table. \r\n\r\nCORE Outbreak Investigation Table [ https://www.fda.gov/food/outbreaks-foodborne-illness/investigations-foodborne-illness-outbreaks?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n\r\n \r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nRecalls, Outbreaks & Emergencies [ https://www.fda.gov/food/recalls-outbreaks-emergencies?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nfeed [ https://www.fda.gov/about-fda/contact-fda/subscribe-podcasts-and-news-feeds?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]twitter [ https://www.twitter.com/US_FDA?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]facebook [ https://www.facebook.com/FDA?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]Instagram [ https://www.instagram.com/FDA?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]youtube [ https://www.youtube.com/user/USFoodandDrugAdmin?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]flickr [ https://www.flickr.com/photos/fdaphotos/albums/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]  \r\n\r\n*Manage Subscriptions* [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 *Unsubscribe All* [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/subscriber/one_click_unsubscribe?verification=5.ee0243ee8741fe358146537aecf40e1e&destination=jasonnorman66994%40gmail.com ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 *Help* [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/ ]\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\nbody .abe-column-block {min-height: 5px;} td {line-height:1;} \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n This email was sent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com using GovDelivery Communications Cloud on behalf of: U.S. Food and Drug Administration \xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0\r\n10903 New Hampshire Ave\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0Silver Spring, MD \xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0 20993-0002\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa01-888-INFO-FDA GovDelivery logo [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\nbody .abe-column-block { min-height: 5px; } table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:10px; margin-right:10px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;}\r\n'
