[2026-04-27 11:12:27] Raw text/plain payload: b'If your email program has trouble displaying this email, view as a webpage [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/bulletins/407ca30 ].\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nUS Food and Drug Administration  \r\n \r\n*Glucose Monitor Sensor Recall: Abott Diabetes Care Removes Certain FreeStyle Libre 3 and FreeStyle Libre 3 Plus Sensors*\r\n\r\n*"**CVM is sharing these announcements because these products may be used in veterinary settings.**"*\r\n\r\n"*This\xc2\xa0*""*recall*" [ https://www.fda.gov/medical-devices/medical-device-recalls-and-early-alerts/what-medical-device-recall?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]"*\xc2\xa0involves removing certain devices from where they are used or sold.*\xc2\xa0The FDA has identified this recall as the most serious type. This device may cause serious injury or death if you continue to use it. The affected products have not changed, but the \xe2\x80\x9cFull list of affected lots\xe2\x80\x9d has been modified for clarity. The recommendations for what to do with the devices below have not changed. The reason for recall has been clarified and updated with current information.\xc2\xa0"\r\n\r\n*Affected Product*\r\n\r\nThe FDA is aware that Abbott Diabetes Care has issued a letter to distributors, health care providers, and affected customers recommending certain glucose monitor sensors be removed from where they are used or sold:\r\n\r\n\r\n  * FreeStyle Libre 3 Sensor \r\n  * Model Numbers: 72081-01, 72080-01 \r\n  * Unique Device Identifiers (UDI-DI):\xc2\xa0_00357599818005_ [ https://accessgudid.nlm.nih.gov/devices/00357599818005?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ],\xc2\xa0_00357599819002_ [ https://accessgudid.nlm.nih.gov/devices/00357599819002?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n\r\n  * FreeStyle Libre 3 Plus Sensor \r\n  * Model Numbers: 78768-01, 78769-01 \r\n  * Unique Device Identifiers (UDI-DI):\xc2\xa0_00357599844011_ [ https://accessgudid.nlm.nih.gov/devices/00357599844011?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ],\xc2\xa0_00357599843014_ [ https://accessgudid.nlm.nih.gov/devices/00357599843014?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n\r\n*Full list of affected lots* [ https://www.fda.gov/media/189900/download?attachment=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]*:*\xc2\xa0See separate tabs within file for products offered within the U.S. and those offered outside of the U.S. [ https://www.fda.gov/animal-veterinary/products/approved-animal-drug-products-green-book?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n\r\nRead More Button [ https://www.fda.gov/medical-devices/medical-device-recalls-and-early-alerts/glucose-monitor-sensor-recall-abott-diabetes-care-removes-certain-freestyle-libre-3-and-freestyle?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n\r\n"*\r\nYou are subscribed to updates from FDA\'s Center for Veterinary Medicine.*"\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nfeed [ https://www.fda.gov/about-fda/contact-fda/subscribe-podcasts-and-news-feeds?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]twitter [ https://www.twitter.com/US_FDA?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]facebook [ https://www.facebook.com/FDA?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]Instagram [ https://www.instagram.com/FDA?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]youtube [ https://www.youtube.com/user/USFoodandDrugAdmin?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]flickr [ https://www.flickr.com/photos/fdaphotos/albums/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]  \r\n\r\n*Manage Subscriptions* [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 *Unsubscribe All* [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/subscriber/one_click_unsubscribe?verification=5.ee0243ee8741fe358146537aecf40e1e&destination=jasonnorman66994%40gmail.com ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 *Help* [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/ ]\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\nbody .abe-column-block {min-height: 5px;} td {line-height:1;} \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n This email was sent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com using GovDelivery Communications Cloud on behalf of: U.S. Food and Drug Administration \xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0\r\n10903 New Hampshire Ave\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0Silver Spring, MD \xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0 20993-0002\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa01-888-INFO-FDA GovDelivery logo [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\nbody .abe-column-block { min-height: 5px; } table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:10px; margin-right:10px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;}\r\n'
