[2026-04-27 11:12:31] Raw text/plain payload: b'Putting you in control  ssa.gov\r\n\r\nThe following program policy instructions were updated on 01/30/2026.\r\n\r\n*_Emergency Messages_*\r\n\r\n*_EM-25069 REV_* [ https://secure.ssa.gov/apps10/reference.nsf/lnx/01302026094625AM?opendocument=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]*\xc2\xa0- Technology Assisted Adjudication (TAA) for Standard Medicare-Only Internet Claims (iClaims)\r\n*Summary:*\xc2\xa0*The purpose of this emergency message (EM) is to notify Field Offices (FO) and Workload Support Units (WSU) that Technology Assisted Adjudication (TAA) was released for standard Medicare-only internet claims (iClaims), on December 13, 2025.\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n [ # ] \r\n\r\n [ # ]\r\n\r\n [ # ]\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nStay Connected with Social Security:\r\n\r\n \xc2\xa0 Like us on Facebook [ https://www.facebook.com/socialsecurity?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] Find us on X [ https://twitter.com/socialsecurity?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] Watch us on Youtube [ https://www.youtube.com/socialsecurityonline?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] Instagram [ https://www.instagram.com/socialsecurity/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] Social Security Matters Blog [ http://blog.ssa.gov?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] Govdelivery [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USSSA/subscriber/new ] \xc2\xa0 \r\n\r\nJoin the millions and discover your benefits!\r\nOpen a my Social Security [ http://www.socialsecurity.gov/myaccount/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] account.\r\n\r\nSUBSCRIBER SERVICES:\r\nManage Subscriptions [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USSSA/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ]\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0Unsubscribe All [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USSSA/subscriber/one_click_unsubscribe?verification=5.26af423df56cba