[2026-04-27 11:13:04] Raw text/plain payload: b'The approvals listed below may not be comprehensive. For the most current information, view the full listing of all approvals at Drugs@FDA [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=reportsSearch.process&rptName=1&reportSelectMonth=11&reportSelectYear=2025&nav ].\r\n\r\n*What\'s New Related to Drugs*\r\n\r\n*Updated Monday through Friday*\r\n\r\n\r\n  * Current and Resolved Drug Shortages and Discontinuations Reported to FDA [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/drugshortages/#tab4 ] \r\n  * Drug Firm Annual Registration Status [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/drls/default.cfm?utm_medium=&utm_source= ] \r\n  * Drug Firm Annual Registration Status Download File [ https://www.fda.gov/drugs/drug-approvals-and-databases/drug-establishments-current-registration-site?utm_medium=&utm_source= ] \r\n  * National Drug Code Directory [ https://www.fda.gov/drugs/drug-approvals-and-databases/national-drug-code-directory?utm_medium=&utm_source= ] \r\n  * NDC Unfinished Drugs Excluded Database File [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/cder/NDC_unfinished_excluded.zip?utm_medium=&utm_source= ] \r\n  * NDC Database Excluded Packages and Products [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/cder/ndc_excluded.zip?utm_medium=&utm_source= ] \r\n  * Wholesale Distributor and Third-Party Logistics Providers Reporting [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/wdd3plreporting/ ] \r\n  * Drug Establishments Current Registration Site [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/drls/ ] \r\n  * Drugs@FDA Data Files [ https://www.fda.gov/drugs/drug-approvals-and-databases/drugsfda-data-files ]\xc2\xa0 \r\n\r\n*Updated Biweekly*\r\n\r\n  * Competitive Generic Therapy Approvals [ https://www.fda.gov/drugs/generic-drugs/competitive-generic-therapy-approvals ] \r\n\r\n*February 2, 2026*\r\n\r\n\r\n  * Umary contains hidden drug ingredients [ https://www.fda.gov/drugs/medication-health-fraud-notifications/umary-contains-hidden-drug-ingredients ] \r\n  * Drug Trials Snapshots: REDEMPLO [ https://www.fda.gov/drugs/drug-approvals-and-databases/drug-trials-snapshots-redemplo ] \r\n\r\n*January 27, 2026*\r\n\r\n\r\n  * FDA approves daratumumab and hyaluronidase-fihj with bortezomib, lenalidomide, and dexamethasone for newly diagnosed multiple myeloma [ https://www.fda.gov/drugs/resources-information-approved-drugs/fda-approves-daratumumab-and-hyaluronidase-fihj-bortezomib-lenalidomide-and-dexamethasone-newly ] \r\n\r\nThis report displays final approvals and tentative approvals of original and supplemental applications for the two days beginning on the earliest date listed below. Some approvals may be added to the Drugs@FDA database after this time span. For comprehensive approval reports, please use the monthly "All Approvals [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=reportsSearch.process&nav=&reportSelectMonth=9&reportSelectYear=2020&rptName=1&utm_medium=&utm_source=#navigation ]" report on Drugs@FDA.\r\n\r\nFebruary 4, 2026\r\n\r\nDrug Name and\r\nApplication Number Active Ingredient Dosage Form/ Route Submission Company Submission Classification Submission Status Atropine Sulfate\r\nNDA #214652 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=214652 ] Atropine Sulfate Solution; Intravenous SUPPL-5 Accord Hlthcare Labeling Approved Carboplatin\r\nANDA #219999 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=219999 ] Carboplatin Injectable; Intravenous ORIG-1 Qilu Pharm Hainan \xc2\xa0 Approved \r\n\r\nFebruary 3, 2026\r\n\r\nDrug Name and\r\nApplication Number Active Ingredient Dosage Form/ Route Submission Company Submission Classification Submission Status Exidine\r\nNDA #019125 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=019125 ] Chlorhexidine Gluconate Solution; Topical SUPPL-48 Xttrium Manufacturing (CMC) Approved Exidine\r\nNDA #019422 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=019422 ] Chlorhexidine Gluconate Solution; Topical SUPPL-55 Xttrium Labeling Approved Fosamax\r\nNDA #020560 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=020560 ] Alendronate Sodium Tablet; Oral SUPPL-73 Organon Labeling Approved Fosamax\r\nNDA #020560 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=020560 ] Alendronate Sodium Tablet; Oral SUPPL-73 Organon Labeling Approved Actonel\r\nNDA #020835 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=020835 ] Risedronate Sodium Tablet; Oral SUPPL-54 Apil Labeling Approved Fosamax Plus D\r\nNDA #021762 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=021762 ] Alendronate Sodium; Cholecalciferol Tablet; Oral SUPPL-27 Organon Llc Labeling Approved Fosamax Plus D\r\nNDA #021762 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=021762 ] Alendronate Sodium; Cholecalciferol Tablet; Oral SUPPL-27 Organon Llc Labeling Approved Reclast\r\nNDA #021817 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=021817 ] Zoledronic Acid Injectable; Intravenous SUPPL-32 Sandoz Labeling Approved Atelvia\r\nNDA #022560 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=022560 ] Risedronate Sodium Tablet, Delayed Release; Oral SUPPL-13 Apil Labeling Approved Ibandronate Sodium\r\nANDA #078996 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=078996 ] Ibandronate Sodium Tablet; Oral SUPPL-6 Sun Pharm Industries Labeling Approved Ibandronate Sodium\r\nANDA #078996 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=078996 ] Ibandronate Sodium Tablet; Oral SUPPL-6 Sun Pharm Industries Labeling Approv