onate Sodium\r\nANDA #205332 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=205332 ] Ibandronate Sodium Injectable; Intravenous SUPPL-7 Eugia Pharma Labeling Approved Ibandronate Sodium\r\nANDA #206058 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=206058 ] Ibandronate Sodium Injectable; Intravenous SUPPL-7 Accord Hlthcare Labeling Approved Ibandronate Sodium\r\nANDA #206887 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=206887 ] Ibandronate Sodium Tablet; Oral SUPPL-27 Macleods Pharms Ltd Labeling Approved Pregabalin\r\nANDA #213226 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=213226 ] Pregabalin Tablet, Extended Release; Oral SUPPL-5 Msn Labeling Approved Pregabalin\r\nANDA #213226 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=213226 ] Pregabalin Tablet, Extended Release; Oral SUPPL-5 Msn Labeling Approved Alendronate Sodium\r\nANDA #214512 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=214512 ] Alendronate Sodium Solution; Oral SUPPL-8 Novitium Pharma Labeling Approved Selenious Acid\r\nANDA #219472 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=219472 ] Selenious Acid Solution; Intravenous ORIG-1 Kindos \xc2\xa0 Approved Doxorubicin Hydrochloride\r\nANDA #219881 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=219881 ] Doxorubicin Hydrochloride Injectable, Liposomal; Injection ORIG-1 Qilu Pharm Hainan \xc2\xa0 Approved Vykoura\r\nNDA #220406 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=220406 ] Eucovorin Calcium Vial; Subcutaneous ORIG-1 Avyxa Holdings Type 5 - New Formulation or New Manufacturer Approved \r\n\r\nfeed [ https://www.fda.gov/about-fda/contact-fda/subscribe-podcasts-and-news-feeds?utm_medium=&utm_source= ]twitter [ https://www.twitter.com/US_FDA?utm_medium=&utm_source= ]facebook [ https://www.facebook.com/FDA?utm_medium=&utm_source= ]youtube [ https://www.youtube.com/user/USFoodandDrugAdmin?utm_medium=&utm_source= ]flickr [ https://www.flickr.com/photos/fdaphotos/albums/?utm_medium=&utm_source= ]  \r\n\r\n*Manage Subscriptions* [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 *Unsubscribe All* [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/subscriber/one_click_unsubscribe?verification=5.ee0243ee8741fe358146537aecf40e1e&destination=jasonnorman66994%40gmail.com ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 *Help* [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/ ]\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\nbody .abe-column-block {min-height: 5px;} td {line-height:1;} \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n This email was sent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com using GovDelivery Communications Cloud on behalf of: U.S. Food and Drug Administration \xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0\r\n10903 New Hampshire Ave\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0Silver Spring, MD \xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0 20993-0002\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa01-888-INFO-FDA GovDelivery logo [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/ ] \r\n \r\nbody .abe-column-block { min-height: 5px; } table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:10px; margin-right:10px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;}\r\n'
