hion Nova reserves the right to modify or cancel this promotion at any time without notice. Offers not valid at Fashion Nova retail locations. Apply discount code at checkout. Taxes, shipping and handling fees are excluded from any discount. Cannot be combined with other discount codes and offers. In order for NovaBEAUTY items to be returned items must be unused, sealed, and in original packaging.\r\n\r\nBy signing up via text, you agree to receive recurring automated marketing text messages from Fashion Nova at the cell number used when signing up. Consent is not a condition of any purchase. Msg & data rates may apply. View [Terms](https://www.fashionnova.com/pages/terms-of-service) & [Privacy Policy.](https://www.fashionnova.com/pages/privacy-policy)\r\n\r\nPlease do not reply to this e-mail, as we are not able to respond to messages sent to this address. Instead, [Contact Support Here](https://www.fashionnova.com/pages/help-center).\r\n\r\nWant to change the types of emails you're receiving or unsubscribe? [Preference Center](https://manage.kmail-lists.com/subscriptions/update?a=XkHHQx&c=01KFEAMKZ56JGBTAVAK2SKQX9H&k=0ea90890f9a80c11cc259ee973027951&m=01KGNH4VR2SA2BG8M18T9Q2W1J&r=01KGQ53RAHGJCVBHRTENN7Z48Z) or [Unsubscribe Here](https://manage.kmail-lists.com/subscriptions/unsubscribe?a=XkHHQx&c=01KFEAMKZ56JGBTAVAK2SKQX9H&k=0ea90890f9a80c11cc259ee973027951&m=01KGNH4VR2SA2BG8M18T9Q2W1J&r=01KGQ53RAHGJCVBHRTENN7Z48Z)\r\n\r\nFashion Nova | 2801 E 46th St, Vernon CA 90058"
