[2026-04-27 11:13:10] Raw text/plain payload: b'Check out key interface improvements to our primary data search platform designed to make navigation more intuitive.  \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nUnited States Census Bureau [ https://www.census.gov/library/video/2026/adrm/navigating-the-refreshed-home-page-on-data-census-gov.html?utm_campaign=20260205cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nNavigating the Refreshed Home Page on data.census.gov [ https://www.census.gov/library/video/2026/adrm/navigating-the-refreshed-home-page-on-data-census-gov.html?utm_campaign=20260205cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n\r\nCheck out the latest updates to data.census.gov, the U.S. Census Bureau\xe2\x80\x99s primary data search platform!\r\n\r\nNew interface improvements are designed to make navigation more intuitive and help you connect to Census Bureau data and resources more quickly and efficiently.\r\n\r\nWatch our video tutorial for a walkthrough of the redesigned search bar, streamlined navigation, and other user-friendly feature updates.\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*Watch* [ https://www.census.gov/library/video/2026/adrm/navigating-the-refreshed-home-page-on-data-census-gov.html?utm_campaign=20260205cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n\r\n\xe2\x96\xb6\xef\xb8\x8f You May Be Interested In\r\n\r\n  * Data.census.gov Video Tutorials [ https://www.census.gov/data/what-is-data-census-gov/guidance-for-data-users/video-tutorials.html?utm_campaign=20260205cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n  * Data.census.gov Resources [ https://www.census.gov/data/what-is-data-census-gov.html?utm_campaign=20260205cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nStay Connected with the Census Bureau\r\n\r\nFollow us on our social media channels, Facebook [ https://www.facebook.com/uscensusbureau?utm_campaign=20260205cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ], Instagram [ https://www.instagram.com/uscensusbureau/?utm_campaign=20260205cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ], LinkedIn [ https://www.linkedin.com/company/us-census-bureau?utm_campaign=20260205cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ], Twitter/X [ https://x.com/uscensusbureau?utm_campaign=20260205cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ], and\xc2\xa0YouTube [ https://www.youtube.com/user/uscensusbureau?utm_campaign=20260205cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ], so you never miss an update.\r\n\r\nStay Connected With Us on Social Media [ https://www.census.gov/about/contact-us/social_media.html?utm_campaign=20260205cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n\r\n*Follow Us* [ https://www.census.gov/about/contact-us/social_media.html?utm_campaign=20260205cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nAbout data.census.gov [ https://data.census.gov/?utm_campaign=20260205cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n\r\nData.census.gov [ https://data.census.gov/?utm_campaign=20260205cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\xc2\xa0is the primary platform to access data and digital content from the U.S. Census Bureau. We continuously update\xc2\xa0data.census.gov [ https://data.census.gov/?utm_campaign=20260205cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] with new data from our most popular surveys and programs, as well as system enhancements to improve your experience on the platform.\r\n\r\nWe\xe2\x80\x99re here to help with your data needs:\r\n\r\n\r\n  * Visit our data.census.gov Resources page [ https://www.census.gov/data/what-is-data-census-gov.html?utm_campaign=20260205cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\xc2\xa0for educational materials \r\n  * Learn about\xc2\xa0Microdata Access [ https://www.census.gov/data/what-is-data-census-gov/guidance-for-data-users/how-to-materials-for-using-the-microdata-access.html?utm_campaign=20260205cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\xc2\xa0and the\xc2\xa0Census Data API [ https://www.census.gov/data/what-is-data-census-gov/guidance-for-data-users/how-to-materials-for-using-the-census-api.html?utm_campaign=20260205cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n  * Request a\xc2\xa0data.census.gov [ https://data.census.gov/?utm_campaign=20260205cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\xc2\xa0training:\xc2\xa0\r\nced.cedsci.outreach@census.gov \r\n  * Request a training for your local area:\xc2\xa0census.askdata@census.gov <askdata@census.gov> \r\n  * Ask your questions:\xc2\xa0census.data@census.gov \r\n\r\n*Provide Feedback on\xc2\xa0data.census.gov [ https://data.census.gov/?utm_campaign=20260205cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]*\r\n\r\nYour suggestions help determine future improvements we implement to make\xc2\xa0data.census.gov [ https://data.census.gov/?utm_campaign=20260205cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\xc2\xa0work better for you!\r\n\r\n*Send Feedback* <census.data@census.gov> \r\n \r\n\r\nSubscribe [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USCENSUS/signup/34555 ] | Manage Subscriptions [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USCENSUS/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] | Unsubscribe [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USCENSUS/subscriber/one_click_unsubscribe?verification=5.76359f46a06559a62e8e0404a80cc7e5&destination=jasonnorman66994%40gmail.com ] | Help [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/s/?utm_campaign=20260205cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n\r\n*Share This * [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USCENSUS/bulletins/407f85a ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n  \r\n \r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\nThis is an official email from the U.S. Census Bureau. If you have any questions or comments, please contact us (http://www.census.gov/about/contact-us.html [ http://www.census.gov/about/contact-us.html?utm_campaign=20260205cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]).  \xc2\xa0 \r\nbody .abe-column-block {min-height: 5px;} table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:7px; margin-right:7px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;}\r\n'
