[2026-04-27 11:13:19] Raw text/plain payload: b"View this email as a web page [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/NJDEP/bulletins/408022a ]\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nConstruction Update: New Jersey's Newest State Park A Nine-Mile Greenway in Essex and Hudson Counties\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nConstruction is underway on community gathering spaces at the nearly one-mile Newark segment of New Jersey\xe2\x80\x99s newest state park, a nine-mile greenway stretching through Essex and Hudson counties.\r\n\r\nThe New Jersey Economic Development Authority is overseeing construction in collaboration with the Department of Environmental Protection.\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\nConstruction Update: New Jersey's Newest State Park A Nine-Mile Greenway in Essex and Hudson Counties\xc2\xa0\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\nFoundations have been excavated, rebar is being set, and concrete has begun to be poured\r\n\r\nFoundations have been excavated, rebar is being set, and concrete has begun to be poured for features at the Newark Central Activity Center and the Branch Brook Park Overlook.\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\nAt the Newark Central Activity Center, work\xc2\xa0has been\xc2\xa0focused on\xc2\xa0constructing\xc2\xa0the performance stage\xc2\xa0located\xc2\xa0off Verona Avenue.\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nAt the Newark Central Activity Center, work\xc2\xa0has been\xc2\xa0focused on\xc2\xa0constructing\xc2\xa0the performance stage\xc2\xa0located\xc2\xa0off Verona Avenue.\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\nFuture Vision: Newark Central Activity Center Performance Stage\r\n\r\nFuture Vision: Newark Central Activity Center Performance Stage\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\nAt the Branch Brook Park Overlook, crews are laying the foundation for an observation platform.\r\n\r\nAt the Branch Brook Park Overlook, crews are laying the foundation for an observation platform overlooking Branch Brook Park and the Second River.\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\nFuture Vision: Branch Brook Park Overlook\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nFuture Vision: Branch Brook Park Overlook\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\nLearn more about the under-construction Newark segment and the future vision for the nine-mile\xc2\xa0park\xc2\xa0at:\xc2\xa0dep.nj.gov/greenway\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nLearn more about the under-construction Newark segment and the future vision for the full nine-mile park at: dep.nj.gov/greenway [ https://dep.nj.gov/greenway/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n  \r\n \r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\nNew Jersey State Parks [ https://dep.nj.gov/parksandforests/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nQuestions?\xc2\xa0Contact Us [ https://dep.nj.gov/parksandforests/about/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n\r\n \xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0 \r\nSign up for email updates [ https://www.facebook.com/NewJerseyStateParks?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]  [ https://twitter.com/newjerseydep?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] Follow us on Instagram [ https://www.instagram.com/newjerseystateparks/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] Sign up for email updates [ http://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/NJDEP/subscriber/new ] \r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nSUBSCRIBER SERVICES:\r\n\r\nManage Preferences [ http://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/NJDEP/subscribers/new?preferences=true ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 Unsubscribe [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/NJDEP/subscribers/new?preferences=true ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 Help [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/ ]\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n This email was sent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com using GovDelivery Communications Cloud on behalf of: New Jersey Department of Environmental Protection \xc2\xb7 401 E. State St. \xc2\xb7 Trenton, NJ 08625 GovDelivery logo [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\nbody .abe-column-block { min-height: 5px; } table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:10px; margin-right:10px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;} table.govd_hr {min-width: 100%;}\r\n"
