[2026-04-27 11:13:36] Raw text/plain payload: b'2026\xe2\x80\x8a-\xe2\x80\x8aAll Roads Increasingly Lead to Moscow\r\nUkraine Update February 6\r\n\r\n2026\xe2\x80\x8a-\xe2\x80\x8aAll Roads Increasingly Lead to Moscow\r\n\r\nDylan Combellick (https://medium.com/@dylan_combellick?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770377239900-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------21e8dc8e_6423_46a3_8536_9dfb82117773--------354e45830cd6)\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nFebruary 6, 2026\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\n11 min read\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nView on Medium (https://medium.com/p/75a8d64c2a4b?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770377239900-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------21e8dc8e_6423_46a3_8536_9dfb82117773--------354e45830cd6)\r\n\r\nSo Goes the War\r\n\r\nDonald Trump says Putin kept his promise not to strike Ukraine\'s energy: "The pause was Sunday to Sunday\xe2\x80\xa6We will take anything." However, during that period, Russia attacked Ukraine\'s power grid multiple times\xe2\x80\x8a-\xe2\x80\x8aon January 25, 26, 27, 28, and on February 3. So either Trump is a fucking idiot, or he is lying. Or both. Yes, it\'s both.\r\n\r\nIf he were blue instead of orange, all of MAGA would be calling for his impeachment on grounds of senility, dishonesty, or just plain unsuitability for office, but the cult endures. This statement alone, IMHO, is justification for impeachment.\xc2\xa0\xe2\x80\xa6\r\n\r\nContinue reading (https://medium.com/p/75a8d64c2a4b?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770377239900-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------21e8dc8e_6423_46a3_8536_9dfb82117773--------354e45830cd6)\r\nThis is a member-only story and can only be read on Medium.\r\n\r\nSent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com by Dylan Combellick on Medium\r\nUnsubscribe (https://medium.com/me/email-settings/50207bf5a022/5f8e6ff3cadd?type=noSetting&newsletterV3Id=354e45830cd6&source=email-50207bf5a022-1770377239900-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------21e8dc8e_6423_46a3_8536_9dfb82117773--------354e45830cd6)\r\n from this writer\'s email notifications\r\nManage your email settings (https://medium.com/me/settings/notifications?hash=5f8e6ff3cadd&userId=50207bf5a022&settingsRouteHash=%23manageSubscriptions&source=email-50207bf5a022-1770377239900-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------21e8dc8e_6423_46a3_8536_9dfb82117773--------354e45830cd6)\r\n\r\n3500 South DuPont Highway, Suite IQ-101, Dover,\xc2\xa0DE\xc2\xa019901\r\nCareers (https://medium.com/jobs-at-medium/work-at-medium-959d1a85284e?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770377239900-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------21e8dc8e_6423_46a3_8536_9dfb82117773--------354e45830cd6)\r\n\xc2\xb7Help Center (https://help.medium.com/hc/en-us?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770377239900-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------21e8dc8e_6423_46a3_8536_9dfb82117773--------354e45830cd6)\r\n\xc2\xb7Privacy Policy (https://policy.medium.com/medium-privacy-policy-f03bf92035c9?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770377239900-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------21e8dc8e_6423_46a3_8536_9dfb82117773--------354e45830cd6)\r\n\xc2\xb7Terms of service (https://policy.medium.com/medium-terms-of-service-9db0094a1e0f?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770377239900-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------21e8dc8e_6423_46a3_8536_9dfb82117773--------354e45830cd6)'
