[2026-04-27 11:13:38] Raw text/plain payload: b"Energy Banner [ https://www.trade.gov/energy-industry ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nSmart Energy Week\r\n\r\n*March 17 - 19, 2026 | Tokyo, Japan*\r\n\r\n*Smart Energy Week* is an exhibition where the latest technologies, information, and people gather to accelerate business in the energy industry.\xc2\xa0 Smart Energy Week gathers a full range of energy technologies such as hydrogen and fuel cells, rechargeable batteries, smart grids, biomass, zero-emission thermal power generation, etc.\r\n\r\nThis exhibition attracts a *significant number of visitors not only from Japan, but also from various Asian regions, including China and South Korea, making it an excellent opportunity for exhibitors seeking to expand their business in the Asian market.*\r\n\r\nThe exhibition provides an excellent platform for establishing strategic partnerships, exploring collaborative projects, and driving innovation through in-depth discussions and cutting-edge technologies.\r\n\r\nThe expected visitor profile includes: *Electric Power & Gas Companies, **Oil & Chemical Manufacturers, Power Generation & Transmission/Distribution Companies, Aggregators, General Contractors & Engineering Firms, **Heavy Industry & Heavy Electric Machinery Manufacturers, Automotive & Transportation Equipment Manufacturers*\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nSmart Energy Week \r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nCompanies interested in attending or exhibiting at Smart Energy Week can contact Delaney Messina <delaney.messina@rxglobal.com> at RX Global for more information.\r\n\r\n*Learn More* [ https://www.wsew.jp/hub/en-gb.html ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n  \r\n \r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n* International Trade Administration*\xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0United States Commercial Service, International Trade Administration [ https://www.trade.gov/us-commercial-service ]*\r\n [ https://www.trade.gov/us-commercial-service ]*  \r\n\r\nThe U.S. Commercial Service is the trade promotion arm of the\r\n*U.S. Department of Commerce's International Trade Administration.*\r\nU.S. Commercial Service trade professionals in over 100 U.S. cities and in more than 75 markets \r\nhelp U.S. companies get started in exporting or increase sales to global markets.\r\n\r\n*STAY CONNECTED*\r\n\r\nVisit us on X [ https://twitter.com/exportgov ]\xc2\xa0 Connect with us on LinkedIn [ https://www.linkedin.com/company/uscommercialservice/ ]\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nBookmark and Share [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USITATRADE/bulletins/407f021?reqfrom=share ]\r\n\r\nIf you are ready to begin exporting or expand to additional global markets, \r\nplease contact your nearest U.S. Commercial Service office [ https://www.trade.gov/commercial-services-offices-us ]\r\nor check out our online EXPORT SOLUTIONS [ https://www.trade.gov/export-solutions ].\r\n\r\n*SUBSCRIBER SERVICES*\r\nVisit our User Profile Page [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USITATRADE/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] to update your subscriptions or unsubscribe.\r\nIf you need assistance, please visit\xc2\xa0subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/hc/en-us ].\r\n\r\n \r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\nThis email was sent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com using GovDelivery Communications Cloud on behalf of the International Trade Administration\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7 1401 Constitution Avenue NW \xc2\xb7 Washington, DC 20230 GovDelivery logo [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/ ] \r\nbody .abe-column-block { min-height: 5px; } table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:10px; margin-right:10px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;} table.govd_hr {min-width: 100%;}\r\n"
