[2026-04-27 11:13:51] Raw text/plain payload: b'rad \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nSPOTLIGHT\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\n2026 Radnor Sweetheart Dance \r\n\r\nWe are excited to hold our 15th Annual Radnor Sweetheart Valentine\'s Dance, taking place at The Inn at Villanova University tonight from 6:30-8:30 PM. We would like to extend a special THANK YOU to our sponsors including Villanova University [ https://www.villanova.edu/university.html?gad_campaignid=23526735786&gad_source=1&gclid=CjwKCAiAv5bMBhAIEiwAqP9GuBGNsEdOrA2nm4WziqUyxpI5wSdSGKf1Wy4EQv2VVl_FO0NnK4wwUhoC-aUQAvD_BwE&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] and Harmelin Media. [ https://harmelin.com/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nWHAT\'S NEW IN THIS ISSUE?\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\nRichard Bishop Allen [ https://www.radnor.com/government/departments/parks-recreation/community-events/bishop-richard-allen-wreath-laying-ceremony?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n8th Annual Bishop Richard Allen Wreath Laying Ceremony\r\n\r\nA Celebration of Life & Legacy\r\n\r\nPlease join Radnor Township, members of the AME community, and friends for the 8th Annual Bishop Richard Allen Wreath Laying Ceremony on *Friday, February 13, 2026, at 12:15 PM*, held at *Bishop Richard Allen Park*, located at 227 Brook Street, Bryn Mawr.\r\n\r\nThis annual gathering honors the extraordinary life and legacy of Bishop Richard Allen on the occasion of his 266th birthday, commemorating his historic walk to Radnor Township in 1784 and his enduring impact on faith, freedom, and community.\r\n\r\nWe are excited to announce that event partnership and leadership will transition this year to St. John AME Church, Rosemont, under the leadership of Reverend Kasha Sudler. We extend our deepest gratitude to Bethel African Methodist Episcopal Church of Ardmore and Reverend Carolyn C. Cavaness for seven years of dedicated leadership and stewardship of this event. Reverend Cavaness now serves as the first woman and 53rd Pastor of Mother Bethel AME Church in Philadelphia, a historic and inspiring milestone.\r\n\r\nAdding to the significance of this year\xe2\x80\x99s ceremony, descendants of Bishop Richard Allen will be in attendance, making this a truly meaningful celebration of history, heritage, and legacy.\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nRadnor Girls\' Lacrosse is offering a great opportunity for Radnor girls to learn the game of Lacrosse with friends and neighbors!\r\n\r\nThis township program will provide great skill development and competition for both new and experienced players to learn, grow and have fun.\r\n\r\n*Registration deadline is February 11*.\r\n\r\n  Radnor Lacrosse [ https://radnorgirls.com/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n\r\n*Register Today* [ https://radnorgirls.com/program-info/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\nRDC Staff [ https://www.radnor.com/government/departments/parks-recreation/employment-volunteer-opportunities?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n\r\n*Learn More* [ https://www.radnor.com/government/departments/parks-recreation/employment-volunteer-opportunities?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nCOMMUNITY EVENTS\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\n*Sponsorship Opportunities*\r\n\r\nThe Parks & Recreation Department strives to provide a range of activities that appeal to all ages and segments within our great community.\xc2\xa0\r\nSponsorships are available to local, regional, and national businesses and organizations.\r\n\r\n*2026 Sponsorships are now available!*\r\n\r\nEnhance your recognition, public image, and good will in Radnor Township.\r\n\xc2\xa0Provide great quality of life opportunities for members of the community.\r\n\xc2\xa0Increase awareness of your products and services and overall marketing strategy.\r\n\xc2\xa0Make connections and interact with people while you reach various markets.\r\n\xc2\xa0Promote your business or organization to numerous people.\r\n\xc2\xa0Assist the Parks & Recreation Department in meeting its mission.\r\n\r\n*2026 Sponsorship Brochure coming soon!* [ https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/PARADNOR/2025/01/31/file_attachments/3149621/Sponsorships%20Opportunities%20Brochure%20Events%202025.pdf ] \r\n \r\n\r\n*2026 Community Events* [ https://www.radnor.com/government/departments/parks-recreation/draft-community-events?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n\r\nThank You The Inn At Villanova University! [ https://theinnatvillanova.com/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n\r\nThank you for 6 years of supporting our Radnor Sweetheart Dance!\r\n\r\nVillanova Inn [ https://theinnatvillanova.com/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n\r\n*Learn More* [ https://theinnatvillanova.com/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\n*Calling Local Community Organizations, Institutions, and Groups*\r\n\r\nWe would like to ask for your consideration in participating at our many community events this year. Our community events offer an opportunity to interact with members of the community by providing information about your organization and services, providing fun giveaways, conducting interactive games, and even having fundraisers that will help your organization.\r\n\r\nThere is no fee to attend any of the great events taking place.\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nPlease email Tammy Cohen at tcohen@radnor.org with your interest.\r\n\r\n*Learn More* [ https://radnorpa.myrec.com/info/activities/program_details.aspx?ProgramID=30269&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n*Save the Dates! [ https://www.radnor.com/government/departments/parks-recreation/draft-community-events?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]*\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*Bishop Richard Allen Wreath Laying Ceremony: Friday, February 13 [ https://www.radnor.com/government/departments/parks-recreation/community-events/bishop-richard-allen-wreath-laying-ceremony?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]*\r\n\r\n*NYC Bus Trip, WICKED on Broadaway: Saturday, April 11 [ https://radnorpa.myrec.com/info/activities/program_details.aspx?ProgramID=30296&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]*\r\n\r\n*Arbor Day Celebration: Friday, April 24 [ https://www.radnor.com/government/departments/parks-recreation/community-events/arbor-day-celebration?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]*\r\n\r\n*Wheels of Wayne Car Show: Sunday, April 26 [ https://www.radnor.com/government/departments/parks-recreation/community-events/wheels-of-wayne-car-motorcycle-show?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]*\r\n\r\n*Great American Backyard Campout: Saturday, May 30 [ https://www.radnor.com/government/departments/parks-recreation/community-events/great-american-backyard-campout-2?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]*\r\n\r\n*Garrett Hill, Rosemont July 4th Parade: Saturday, July 4 [ https://www.radnor.com/government/departments/parks-recreation/community-events/garrett-hill-rosemont-july-4th-parade?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]*\r\n\r\n*Children\'s Summer Concert at Clem Macrone Park: Tuesday, July 21 [ https://www.radnor.com/government/departments/parks-recreation/community-events/concerts-in-the-park-clem-macrone-park?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]*\r\n\r\n  Community Events \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nSPRING/ SUMMER CAMPS\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\n*Radnor Day Camp 2026 [ https://