[2026-04-27 11:13:52] Raw text/plain payload: b'View as a webpage\xc2\xa0 /\xc2\xa0 Share [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USDAOC/bulletins/408204d ]\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nHeader-Hybrid \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nOffice of Communications\xc2\xa0 |\xc2\xa0 press@usda.gov\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nMEDIA ADVISORY: Secretary Rollins in South Texas MONDAY\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\n*(Washington, D.C.,\xc2\xa0February\xc2\xa06, 2026)\xc2\xa0*\xe2\x80\x93 U.S. Secretary of Agriculture Brooke L. Rollins will travel to South Texas, MONDAY, February 9th. In South Texas, Secretary Rollins and Texas Governor Greg Abbott will attend a 1944 Water Treaty and the grand opening of the sterile fly dispersal facility.\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*_Secretary Rollins\xc2\xa0to\xc2\xa0Host Roundtable on\xc2\xa0the\xc2\xa01944\xc2\xa0Water Treaty_*\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*WHAT:* Secretary Rollins and Governor Abbott will hold a roundtable focused on the\xc2\xa0new commitment between the United States and Mexico [ https://www.usda.gov/about-usda/news/press-releases/2026/02/03/statement-secretary-state-marco-rubio-and-secretary-agriculture-brooke-rollins?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\xc2\xa0that strengthens implementation of the 1944 Water Treaty, providing greater certainty for farmers, ranchers, and producers in South Texas who rely on consistent water deliveries from the Rio Grande.\xc2\xa0Immediately following the roundtable, Secretary Rollins and Governor Abbott will hold a media availability.\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*WHEN:* Monday, February 9th,\xc2\xa012:00\xc2\xa0pm\xc2\xa0CT\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*WHERE:* Lone Star Citrus Growers\xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa09625 N.\xc2\xa0Moorefield Rd. Mission, TX 78574\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*_Secretary Rollins to\xc2\xa0Attend\xc2\xa0Grand Opening at Moore Air Base Facility_*\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*WHAT:\xc2\xa0*Secretary Rollins and Governor Abbott will\xc2\xa0attend the grand opening of the USDA Animal\xc2\xa0Plant Health Inspection Service\xc2\xa0(APHIS)\xc2\xa0sterile fly dispersal facility. A key piece of\xc2\xa0USDA\xe2\x80\x99s efforts to protect the American livestock industry [ https://www.usda.gov/about-usda/news/press-releases/2025/08/15/usda-announces-sweeping-plans-protect-united-states-new-world-screwworm?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\xc2\xa0from the New World Screwworm. At the grand opening, Secretary\xc2\xa0Rollins and Governor Abbott will host a press conference.\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*WHEN:\xc2\xa0*Monday, February 9th,\xc2\xa01:15\xc2\xa0pm\xc2\xa0CT\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*WHERE:\xc2\xa0*Moore Air Base Facility | 22675 N. Moorefield Rd. Edinburg, TX 78539\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n**Media interested in covering the event must RSVP to\xc2\xa0*press@usda.gov*\xc2\xa0by\xc2\xa0SUNDAY,\xc2\xa0February\xc2\xa08th, at\xc2\xa04:00pm ET*\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n###\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n  \r\n \r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0 \r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*\r\nU.S. Department of Agriculture*\r\n\r\nwww.usda.gov [ https://www.usda.gov/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 Contact us [ https://ask.usda.gov/s/contactsupport?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n\r\ntwitter [ https://www.twitter.com/usda/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]facebook [ https://www.facebook.com/usda/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]instagram [ https://www.instagram.com/usdagov/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]flickr [ https://flickr.com/usdagov?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]youtube [ https://www.youtube.com/usda/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n\r\nBookmark and Share [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USDAOC/bulletins/0?reqfrom=share ]\r\n\r\nManage Subscriptions [ http://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USDAOC/subscribers/new?preferences=true ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 Unsubscribe All [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USDAOC/subscriber/one_click_unsubscribe?verification=5.b0b9ffc01626a62fade26e4ffc0836cd&destination=jasonnorman66994%40gmail.com ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 Help [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/ ]\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \xc2\xa0 \r\n \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n This email was sent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com using govDelivery on behalf of: USDA Office of Communications \xc2\xb7 1400 Independence Ave., S.W. \xc2\xb7 Washington, DC 20250  GovDelivery logo  [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\nbody .abe-column-block { min-height: 5px; } table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:10px; margin-right:10px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;} table.govd_hr {min-width: 100%;}\r\n'
