[2026-04-27 11:13:57] Raw text/plain payload: b"Not designed for productivity, but can absolutely be used for it\r\n10 Productivity Features Apple Accidentally Buried in the Weirdest Places\r\n\r\nNot designed for productivity, but can absolutely be used for it\r\n\r\nThe Useful Tech (https://medium.com/@theusefultech?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770405997133-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-953b148ade73------------------------26d53253_dbcb_4890_baf5_811fa7205532--------eeb618317985)\r\n\xc2\xa0in\xc2\xa0The Useful Tech (https://medium.com/the-useful-tech?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770405997133-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-953b148ade73------------------------26d53253_dbcb_4890_baf5_811fa7205532--------eeb618317985)\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nFebruary 6, 2026\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\n11 min read\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nView on Medium (https://medium.com/the-useful-tech/57c61afa32f0?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770405997133-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-953b148ade73------------------------26d53253_dbcb_4890_baf5_811fa7205532--------eeb618317985)\r\n\r\nSource: Image Generated by GPT 5.2\r\n\r\nI have been writing about Apple products for nearly a decade, and I still discover features that make me wonder how I ever lived without them.\r\n\r\nThe frustrating part is that most of these features were not designed to make me more productive. Apple built them for accessibility, or for some obscure use case, or just buried them so deep in the settings that no normal person would ever find them. And yet, once you stumble upon them, they become essential to how you work.\r\n\r\nThis post is a collection of 10 features I now use constantly that I found\xe2\x80\xa6\r\n\r\nContinue reading (https://medium.com/the-useful-tech/57c61afa32f0?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770405997133-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-953b148ade73------------------------26d53253_dbcb_4890_baf5_811fa7205532--------eeb618317985)\r\nThis is a member-only story and can only be read on Medium.\r\n\r\nSent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com by The Useful Tech on Medium\r\nUnsubscribe (https://medium.com/me/email-settings/50207bf5a022/01947dd3c4ad?type=noSetting&newsletterV3Id=eeb618317985&collectionId=953b148ade73&source=email-50207bf5a022-1770405997133-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-953b148ade73------------------------26d53253_dbcb_4890_baf5_811fa7205532--------eeb618317985)\r\n from this writer's email notifications\r\nManage your email settings (https://medium.com/me/settings/notifications?hash=01947dd3c4ad&userId=50207bf5a022&settingsRouteHash=%23manageSubscriptions&source=email-50207bf5a022-1770405997133-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-953b148ade73------------------------26d53253_dbcb_4890_baf5_811fa7205532--------eeb618317985)\r\n\r\n3500 South DuPont Highway, Suite IQ-101, Dover,\xc2\xa0DE\xc2\xa019901\r\nCareers (https://medium.com/jobs-at-medium/work-at-medium-959d1a85284e?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770405997133-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-953b148ade73------------------------26d53253_dbcb_4890_baf5_811fa7205532--------eeb618317985)\r\n\xc2\xb7Help Center (https://help.medium.com/hc/en-us?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770405997133-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-953b148ade73------------------------26d53253_dbcb_4890_baf5_811fa7205532--------eeb618317985)\r\n\xc2\xb7Privacy Policy (https://policy.medium.com/medium-privacy-policy-f03bf92035c9?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770405997133-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-953b148ade73------------------------26d53253_dbcb_4890_baf5_811fa7205532--------eeb618317985)\r\n\xc2\xb7Terms of service (https://policy.medium.com/medium-terms-of-service-9db0094a1e0f?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770405997133-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-953b148ade73------------------------26d53253_dbcb_4890_baf5_811fa7205532--------eeb618317985)"
