[2026-04-27 11:14:19] Raw text/plain payload: b"By Joseph Razo\r\nThe Great CryptoUnwind: Understanding the Forces Behind the Current Crypto Market Collapse.\r\n\r\nJoseph Razo (https://medium.com/@j.razo7869?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770430974287-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------0857d783_bdd8_4f82_bfc4_860735be4900--------2d9d33acc198)\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nFebruary 7, 2026\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\n6 min read\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nView on Medium (https://medium.com/p/37b754618419?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770430974287-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------0857d783_bdd8_4f82_bfc4_860735be4900--------2d9d33acc198)\r\n\r\nBy Joseph Razo\r\n\r\n\xc2\xb7\xc2\xb7\xc2\xb7\r\n\r\n\xc2\xb7\xc2\xb7\xc2\xb7\r\nOver the past several weeks, the cryptocurrency market has experienced a sharp and unsettling decline. Headlines have focused on Bitcoin falling below $70,000, Ethereum losing a significant portion of its value, and altcoins sliding to multi-year lows. According to Coinpedia, in an article by Nidhi Kolhapur, more than $900 billion has been erased from the digital asset market in just over three weeks.\r\n\r\nAt first glance, this looks like yet another crypto-specific crash. But that interpretation misses the larger picture. What is unfolding is not a judgment on blockchain technology or decentralized finance.\xc2\xa0\xe2\x80\xa6\r\n\r\nContinue reading (https://medium.com/p/37b754618419?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770430974287-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------0857d783_bdd8_4f82_bfc4_860735be4900--------2d9d33acc198)\r\nThis is a member-only story and can only be read on Medium.\r\n\r\nSent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com by Joseph Razo on Medium\r\nUnsubscribe (https://medium.com/me/email-settings/50207bf5a022/927b30e4ece1?type=noSetting&newsletterV3Id=2d9d33acc198&source=email-50207bf5a022-1770430974287-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-