[2026-04-27 11:14:42] Raw text/plain payload: b"David Chase built a joke that takes three seasons to land.\r\nThe Most Brilliant Joke in Television History\r\n\r\nDavid Chase built a joke that takes three seasons to land.\r\n\r\nJonatha Czajkiewicz (https://medium.com/@jonathacz99?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770522018559-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------309943a0_8edd_4460_a666_4034351ebf98--------31025c3990ac)\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nFebruary 8, 2026\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\n5 min read\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nView on Medium (https://medium.com/p/3ba28f01638f?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770522018559-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------309943a0_8edd_4460_a666_4034351ebf98--------31025c3990ac)\r\n\r\nIn The Sopranos, the word gabagool enters early and enters casually. A real Italian-American pronunciation of capicola, filtered through Italian dialects and a hundred years of North Jersey speech drift. It sounds right because it is right. These guys aren't textbook Italians. They're suburban Jersey guys ordering cold cuts the way their grandfathers taught them to.\r\n\r\nNothing funny yet.\r\n\r\nBut David Chase is patient.\r\n\r\nBy mid-series, gabagool has shifted. The characters say it the way they say honor, constantly, reflexively, without examining what they are really saying. It's not food anymore.\xc2\xa0\xe2\x80\xa6\r\n\r\nContinue reading (https://medium.com/p/3ba28f01638f?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770522018559-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------309943a0_8edd_4460_a666_4034351ebf98--------31025c3990ac)\r\nThis is a member-only story and can only be read on Medium.\r\n\r\nSent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com by Jonatha Czajkiewicz on Medium\r\nUnsubscribe (https://medium.com/me/email-settings/50207bf5a022/56e71bfb9da2?type=noSetting&newsletterV3Id=31025c3990ac&source=email-50207bf5a022-1770522018559-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------309943a0_8edd_4460_a666_4034351ebf98--------31025c3990ac)\r\n from this writer's email notifications\r\nManage your email settings (https://medium.com/me/settings/notifications?hash=56e71bfb9da2&userId=50207bf5a022&settingsRouteHash=%23manageSubscriptions&source=email-50207bf5a022-1770522018559-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------309943a0_8edd_4460_a666_4034351ebf98--------31025c3990ac)\r\n\r\n3500 South DuPont Highway, Suite IQ-101, Dover,\xc2\xa0DE\xc2\xa019901\r\nCareers (https://medium.com/jobs-at-medium/work-at-medium-959d1a85284e?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770522018559-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------309943a0_8edd_4460_a666_4034351ebf98--------31025c3990ac)\r\n\xc2\xb7Help Center (https://help.medium.com/hc/en-us?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770522018559-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------309943a0_8edd_4460_a666_4034351ebf98--------31025c3990ac)\r\n\xc2\xb7Privacy Policy (https://policy.medium.com/medium-privacy-policy-f03bf92035c9?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770522018559-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------309943a0_8edd_4460_a666_4034351ebf98--------31025c3990ac)\r\n\xc2\xb7Terms of service (https://policy.medium.com/medium-terms-of-service-9db0094a1e0f?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770522018559-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------309943a0_8edd_4460_a666_4034351ebf98--------31025c3990ac)"
