[2026-04-27 11:15:58] Raw text/plain payload: b"Census Bureau Upcoming and Recently Released Products  \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nUnited States Census Bureau [ https://www.census.gov/en.html?utm_campaign=20260209mspios1ccpupnl&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nBFS \r\n\r\nBusiness Formation Statistics Monthly Data Release\r\n\r\nOn Feb. 11, the U.S. Census Bureau will release new Business Formation Statistics [ https://gcc02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?data=05%7C02%7CDonna.E.Tillery%40census.gov%7Cae80405cf0464c7b572608de547640ab%7C3aa716f1e55941cea53047d18313c603%7C0%7C0%7C639041064051400189%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&reserved=0&sdata=0U5ffOkhmmtN3YzJSCokqKPvUxSaR1ZTbDfcqwTnQA8%3D&url=https%3A%2F%2Flinks-1.govdelivery.com%2FCL0%2Fhttps%3A%252F%252Fwww.census.gov%252Fecon%252Fbfs%252Findex.html%253Futm_campaign%3D20260120mspios1ccpupnl%2526utm_medium%3Demail%2526utm_source%3Dgovdelivery%2F1%2F0100019bc35fd53a-efcbb2f4-69dd-45f3-8872-1f7013b80b69-000000%2FhoHduVY4D46AnFmIcZagcz9H7nnVsgIESRyDii2wonU%3D440%3Futm_campaign%3D20260209mspios1ccpupnl%26utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_source%3Dgovdelivery&utm_campaign=20260209mspios1ccpupnl&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] (BFS) for January 2026. The BFS provide timely and high frequency information on new business applications and formations in the United States and Puerto Rico.\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nPSEO \r\n\r\nNew Post-Secondary Employment Outcomes Data\r\n\r\nOn Feb. 12, the U.S. Census Bureau is scheduled to announce new education partners for its Post-Secondary Employment Outcomes (PSEO) [ https://gcc02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?data=05%7C02%7CAngela.C.Baker%40census.gov%7Cee19a2d057184df69e8d08de64034d07%7C3aa716f1e55941cea53047d18313c603%7C0%7C0%7C639058162504672105%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&reserved=0&sdata=FYoFaAXrsMKZ8RqEbgFMJ3M%2FiK6z7IFbF52DHUm9ugA%3D&url=https%3A%2F%2Flehd.ces.census.gov%2Fdata%2Fpseo_experimental.html%3Futm_campaign%3D20260209mspios1ccpupnl%26utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_source%3Dgovdelivery&utm_campaign=20260209mspios1ccpupnl&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\xe2\x80\xafexperimental data product.\xc2\xa0The\xc2\xa0PSEO\xc2\xa0provides\xc2\xa0earnings and employment outcomes for\xc2\xa0college and university graduates\xc2\xa0by degree level, degree major, post-secondary institution, and state of institution,\xc2\xa0and\xc2\xa0is\xc2\xa0used by parents, students, institutions, and workforce agencies to learn about\xc2\xa0the\xc2\xa0labor force\xc2\xa0outcomes of graduates.\xe2\x80\xaf(Scheduled for release Feb. 12.)\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nBusiness Trends and Outlook Survey\r\n\r\nOn Feb. 12, the U.S. Census Bureau will release the Business Trends and Outlook Survey (BTOS) measures business conditions on an ongoing basis. BTOS experimental data products are representative of all employer businesses other than farms in the U.S. economy. The data allow greater insight into the state of the economy by providing continuous, timely information for key economic measures. Data are released biweekly and are available by sector, state, employment size and the 25 most populous metropolitan statistical areas. New questions on artificial intelligence were added Nov. 17 and will be released in 2026.\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n*?? In Case You Missed It*\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nCRE [ https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2026/2024-cre-natural-hazard-risk-tables.html?utm_campaign=20260209mspios1ccpupnl&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n\r\n2024 Community Resilience Estimates\r\n\r\nOn Jan. 29, the U.S. Census Bureau released new community resilience estimates by social vulnerability to natural disasters. This product helps local governments and community stakeholders plan mitigation and recovery strategies in the event of a disaster. Estimates will be released for the nation, states, counties, core-based statistical areas and tracts.\r\n\r\n*Learn More* [ https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2026/2024-cre-natural-hazard-risk-tables.html?utm_campaign=20260209mspios1ccpupnl&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nPublic Information Office\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nUpcoming Events and News Releases:\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*_Tuesday, Feb. 10_*\r\n\r\n************************\xe2\x80\xa2 ***********************Economic Indicator:* (8:30 a.m.) Advance Monthly Sales for Retail and Food Services [ http://www.census.gov/retail/index.html?utm_campaign=20260209mspios1ccpupnl&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \xe2\x80\x93 December 2025\r\n\r\n************************\xe2\x80\xa2 ***********************Economic Indicator:* (10 a.m.) Manufacturing and Trade: Inventories and Sales [ http://www.census.gov/mtis/?utm_campaign=20260209mspios1ccpupnl&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \xe2\x80\x93 November 2025__\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*_Wednesday, Feb. 11_*\r\n\r\n************************\xe2\x80\xa2 ***********************Tip Sheet: *Business Formation Statistics__\r\n\r\n************************\xe2\x80\xa2 ***********************Data Release: *(10 a.m.) Business Formation Statistics [ https://census.gov/econ/bfs/index.html?utm_campaign=20260209mspios1ccpupnl&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \xe2\x80\x93 January 2026__\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*_Thursday, Feb. 12_*\r\n\r\n************************\xe2\x80\xa2 ***********************Tip Sheet: *New Post-Secondary Employment Outcomes Data\r\n\r\n************************\xe2\x80\xa2 ***********************Tip Sheet: *Business Trends and Outlook Survey Data Release\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*Newsroom* [ https://www.census.gov/newsroom.html?utm_campaign=20260209mspios1ccpupnl&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nNews media: 301-763-3030 or 877-861-2010 or\xc2\xa0pio@census.gov\r\n\r\nNon-media: 1-800-923-8282 or\xc2\xa0ask.census.gov [ https://ask.census.gov/?utm_campaign=20260209mspios1ccpupnl&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n\r\nSubscribe now [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USCENSUS/subscriber/new? ]\xc2\xa0to receive Census Bureau releases and information via e-mail or SMS.\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nAbout the Census Bureau\r\n\r\nWe serve as the nation\xe2\x80\x99s leading provider of quality data about its people and economy.\xc2\xa0The Census Bureau is the federal government's largest statistical agency. As the world\xe2\x80\x99s premier statistical agency, we are dedicated to making our nation a better place. Policy-makers, businesses, and the public use our data to make informed decisions.\r\n\r\n*Resources for Media*\r\n\r\nFor media interviews, please contact the\xc2\xa0Public Information Office [ https://lnks.gd/l/eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..p-5wpj2DTx0_qgyLiv6JuMTDOF_vZlHcwFpt971jIDs/s/866068797/br/124287751808-l?utm_campaign=20260209mspios1ccpupnl&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\xc2\xa0Toll Free at 877-861-2010, 301-763-3030, or\xc2\xa0pio@census.gov.\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n  \r\n \r\n\r\n*Stay connected with us!*\r\n\r\nJoin the conversation on social media.\r\n\r\n facebook [ https://www.facebook.com/uscensusbureau/?utm_campaign=20260209mspios1ccpupnl&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]instagram [ https://www.instagram.com/uscensusbureau/?utm_campaign=20260209mspios1ccpupnl&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]linkedin [ https://www.linkedin.com/company/us-census-bureau/?utm_campaign=20260209mspios1ccpupnl&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]twitter [ https://twitter.com/uscensusbureau/?utm_campaign=20260209mspios1ccpupnl&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] [ https://www.linkedin.com/company/us-census-bureau/?utm_campaign=20260209mspios1ccpupnl&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]youtube [ https://www.youtube.com/user/uscensusbureau/?utm_campaign=20260209mspios1ccpupnl&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]  \r\n\r\nSUBSCRIBER SERVICES:\r\n\r\nSubscriber Settings [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USCENSUS/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 Remove me from All Subscriptions  [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USCENSUS/subscriber/one_click_unsubscribe?verification=5.76359f46a06559a62e8e0404a80cc7e5&destination=jasonnorman66994%40gmail.com ]\xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0Help [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/ ]\r\n\r\n \r\n&lt;!-- /* template top padding on mobile */ @media only screen and (max-width: 480px) { table#flexible-abe-main-table { padding:0 !important; } } --&gt; ________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\nThis is an official email from the U.S. Census Bureau. If you have any questions or comments, please contact us (http://www.census.gov/about/contact-us.html [ http://www.census.gov/about/contact-us.html?utm_campaign=20260209mspios1ccpupnl&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]).  \xc2\xa0 \r\nbody .abe-column-block {min-height: 5px;} table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:7px; margin-right:7px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;}\r\n"
