[2026-04-27 11:16:01] Raw text/plain payload: b'The approvals listed below may not be comprehensive. For the most current information, view the full listing of all approvals at Drugs@FDA [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=reportsSearch.process&rptName=1&reportSelectMonth=11&reportSelectYear=2025&nav ].\r\n\r\n*What\'s New Related to Drugs*\r\n\r\n*Updated Monday through Friday*\r\n\r\n\r\n  * Current and Resolved Drug Shortages and Discontinuations Reported to FDA [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/drugshortages/#tab4 ] \r\n  * Drug Firm Annual Registration Status [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/drls/default.cfm?utm_medium=&utm_source= ] \r\n  * Drug Firm Annual Registration Status Download File [ https://www.fda.gov/drugs/drug-approvals-and-databases/drug-establishments-current-registration-site?utm_medium=&utm_source= ] \r\n  * National Drug Code Directory [ https://www.fda.gov/drugs/drug-approvals-and-databases/national-drug-code-directory?utm_medium=&utm_source= ] \r\n  * NDC Unfinished Drugs Excluded Database File [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/cder/NDC_unfinished_excluded.zip?utm_medium=&utm_source= ] \r\n  * NDC Database Excluded Packages and Products [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/cder/ndc_excluded.zip?utm_medium=&utm_source= ] \r\n  * Wholesale Distributor and Third-Party Logistics Providers Reporting [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/wdd3plreporting/ ] \r\n  * Drug Establishments Current Registration Site [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/drls/ ] \r\n  * Drugs@FDA Data Files [ https://www.fda.gov/drugs/drug-approvals-and-databases/drugsfda-data-files ]\xc2\xa0 \r\n\r\n*Updated Biweekly*\r\n\r\n  * Competitive Generic Therapy Approvals [ https://www.fda.gov/drugs/generic-drugs/competitive-generic-therapy-approvals ] \r\n\r\n*February 5, 2026*\r\n\r\n\r\n  * Safety labeling update for capecitabine and fluorouracil (5-FU) on risks associated with dihydropyrimidine dehydrogenase (DPD) deficiency [ https://www.fda.gov/drugs/resources-information-approved-drugs/safety-labeling-update-capecitabine-and-fluorouracil-5-fu-risks-associated-dihydropyrimidine ] \r\n  * Draft Guidance:\xc2\xa0E22 General Considerations for Patient Preference Studies [ https://www.fda.gov/regulatory-information/search-fda-guidance-documents/e22-general-considerations-patient-preference-studies ] \r\n\r\n*February 4, 2026*\r\n\r\n\r\n  * Drug Trials Snapshots: LEROCHOL [ https://www.fda.gov/drugs/drug-approvals-and-databases/drug-trials-snapshots-lerochol ] \r\n  * Drug Trials Snapshots: WAYRILZ [ https://www.fda.gov/drugs/drug-approvals-and-databases/drug-trials-snapshots-wayrilz ] \r\n\r\nThis report displays final approvals and tentative approvals of original and supplemental applications for the two days beginning on the earliest date listed below. Some approvals may be added to the Drugs@FDA database after this time span. For comprehensive approval reports, please use the monthly "All Approvals [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=reportsSearch.process&nav=&reportSelectMonth=9&reportSelectYear=2020&rptName=1&utm_medium=&utm_source=#navigation ]" report on Drugs@FDA.\r\n\r\nFebruary 6, 2026\r\n\r\nDrug Name and\r\nApplication Number Active Ingredient Dosage Form/ Route Submission Company Submission Classification Submission Status Idamycin Pfs\r\nNDA #050734 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=050734 ] Idarubicin Hydrochloride Solution; Intravenous SUPPL-32 Pfizer Labeling Approved Idarubicin Hydrochloride\r\nNDA #050734 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=050734 ] Idarubicin Hydrochloride Solution; Intravenous SUPPL-32 Pfizer Labeling Approved Anagrelide Hydrochloride\r\nANDA #076530 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=076530 ] Anagrelide Hydrochloride Capsule; Oral SUPPL-9 Barr Labs Labeling Approved \r\n\r\nFebruary 5, 2026\r\n\r\nDrug Name and\r\nApplication Number Active Ingredient Dosage Form/ Route Submission Company Submission Classification Submission Status Fluorouracil\r\nANDA #040743 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=040743 ] Fluorouracil Injectable; Injection SUPPL-19 Accord Hlthcare Labeling Approved Fluorouracil\r\nANDA #040798 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=040798 ] Fluorouracil Injectable; Injection SUPPL-21 Accord Hlthcare Labeling Approved Aztreonam\r\nANDA #207069 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=207069 ] Aztreonam Injectable; Injection ORIG-1 Hikma \xc2\xa0 Approved Bumetanide\r\nANDA #215362 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=215362 ] Bumetanide Tablet; Oral ORIG-1 Msn \xc2\xa0 Approved Carbidopa, Levodopa and Entacapone\r\nANDA #218535 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=218535 ] Carbidopa; Entacapone; Levodopa Tablet; Oral ORIG-1 Alembic \xc2\xa0 Approved Myqorzo\r\nNDA #219083 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=219083 ] Aficamten Tablet; Oral SUPPL-1 Cytokinetics REMS Approved Hydrocortisone Sodium Succinate\r\nANDA #219856 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=219856 ] Hydrocortisone Sodium Succinate Injectable; Injection ORIG-1 Apotex \xc2\xa0 Approved Zoledronic Acid\r\nANDA #219984 [ https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/daf/index.cfm?event=overview.process&ApplNo=219984 ] Zoledronic Acid Injectable; Intravenous ORIG-1 Gland \xc2\xa0 Approved \r\n\r\nfeed [ https://www.fda.gov/about-fda/contact-fda/subscribe-podcasts-and-news-feeds?utm_medium=&utm_source= ]twitter [ https://www.twitter.com/US_FDA?utm_medium=&utm_source= ]facebook [ https://www.facebook.com/FDA?utm_medium=&utm_source= ]youtube [ https://www.youtube.com/user/USFoodandDrugAdmin?utm_medium=&utm_source= ]flickr [ https://www.flickr.com/photos/fdaphotos/albums/?utm_medium=&utm_source= ]  \r\n\r\n*Manage Subscriptions* [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 *Unsubscribe All* [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/subscriber/one_click_unsubscribe?verification=5.ee0243ee8741fe358146537aecf40e1e&destination=jasonnorman66994%40gmail.com ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 *Help* [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/ ]\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\nbody .abe-column-block {min-height: 5px;} td {line-height:1;} \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n This email was sent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com using GovDelivery Communications Cloud on behalf of: U.S. Food and Drug Administration \xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0\r\n10903 New Hampshire Ave\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0Silver Spring, MD \xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0 20993-0002\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa01-888-INFO-FDA GovDelivery logo [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/ ] \r\n \r\nbody .abe-column-block { min-height: 5px; } table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:10px; margin-right:10px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;}\r\n'
