[2026-04-27 11:16:03] Raw text/plain payload: b'Learn to action insights and show the true value of your CX programs\xc2\xa0// view online <[[http://pages.qualtrics.com/v/NTQyLUZNRi00MTIAAAGf4eUaQhnXJoEEpYK6lupshpybL7DboPA18yMZnD_wTPmrzKHKMSZSWPGJ7hmBjbz9fg4MhSs=]]>\r\n\xe2\x80\x9cWe need you to show a quantified and defensible impact by year\xe2\x80\x99s end\xe2\x80\x94or we\xe2\x80\x99ll have to cut your budget.\xe2\x80\x9d It\xe2\x80\x99s a tough message, but it\xe2\x80\x99s one many CX teams are facing. Despite being flooded with data, most still can\xe2\x80\x99t answer critical questions like: What\xe2\x80\x99s breaking the journey? What do customers need? Where should we invest? What\xe2\x80\x99s the next best action?\r\n\r\nThe pressure is real, but so is the opportunity. Digital Experience Analytics (DXA) <http://pages.qualtrics.com/dc/qEtCYPdDrgh7DbDU2Hwx5lCcSlM9_F_2xtDxT1EDwgiwmxMw1s3X36AJluIYTAE1Ty8TlS7HXWXMfzi_B8oUHV8oSo5Vmm-oSDnIaHFt99L_s6KVGzTZuRgCXiGP42K1LGuJ3yIrZxKewVgjh0L7L-svP1ghD6xFWRaf9Wrp0SMbyAJ9CVCAEFyUwGEhIRsMHmRqdQLumq1zAzxwp9Omo6cJXe4dUCxoM2q720TN2qk=/NTQyLUZNRi00MTIAAAGf4eUaQ_zYRF1AGk8xWG_Vd1M-ZlHKTO0XSYvooMjnDWTdhvLramSO10CnshNSWbZWvn5lx1E=> helps you uncover and close experience gaps before they become costly problems. With DXA, you can:\r\nWant to see how leading teams do it?\r\n\r\nWatch From Insight to Impact, a free X4 session <http://pages.qualtrics.com/dc/qEtCYPdDrgh7DbDU2Hwx5hDQSWYCLhHKpP8anHPbHO6wgPY9IammT8z5wKSugljmK2zD33fH7IAogj358fAlhRrkuI-z66NRP5lzuuFLJoDV-OsesrAyRKQRz7cndx-Y578T8lo0vZSfRBTvImbhp-mssC4o0kleyVuKMZqscaQG7jRmxIZM9czvU7k8P9nWqhy7q-ulhyBSJwcE_jXpFA==/NTQyLUZNRi00MTIAAAGf4eUaQ_zYRF1AGk8xWG_Vd1M-ZlHKTO0XSYvooMjnDWTdhvLramSO10CnshNSWbZWvn5lx1E=>\xc2\xa0where Topher Mitchell and Dr. Elizabeth Erkenbrack share a practical playbook for turning insights into measurable action.\r\n333 River Park Drive, Provo, Utah 84604\r\n385 203 4999\r\nTerms of Service <http://pages.qualtrics.com/NTQyLUZNRi00MTIAAAGf4eUaQtu9duRlVEu1kYBZoyQTiCqvTQGRM4mtfclQ5tuqRqcI20fQG95xxszycZvZyHWEiks=> \r\nPrivacy <http://pages.qualtrics.com/NTQyLUZNRi00MTIAAAGf4eUaQgAb5-19wGDjv7vjQUwcU1KoPVL926Sb2_po-5zEVM83K0RowW2vUMuxuP2ElCqO2-U=>\r\nSecurity Statement <http://pages.qualtrics.com/NTQyLUZNRi00MTIAAAGf4eUaQn_7se97F9puUrCjLUa1L8reWZZlt6Iu9CI6sECzkALPNO8039taqeTq0T94QplGMts=> \r\nUnsubscribe <[[https://success.qualtrics.com/UnsubscribePage.html?mkt_unsubscribe=1&mkt_tok=NTQyLUZNRi00MTIAAAGf4eUaQyATImf6msN6xMAp5SzVG7tPkrGNvPLAbzrjsSQemGRDpeFYPrba86axJqVBMd1w7nvb6INVN_HufrjlHCGoThXhGHD-2Xn7x1MFGiAURgJHXNsM]]> \r\n\xc2\xa9 2026 Qualtrics\r\n'
