[2026-04-27 11:16:07] Raw text/plain payload: b'View as a webpage\xc2\xa0 /\xc2\xa0 Share [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USSSA/bulletins/408f36c ]\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nMonday, February 9, 2026\r\n\r\nFor Immediate Release\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nBarton Mackey, Press Officer\r\n\r\nPress.Office@ssa.gov\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\nSocial Security Administration News Release \r\n \r\nSocial Security Surpasses 100 Million "my" Social Security Accounts\r\n\r\n"SSA is delivering better, faster service to more Americans through its digital-first transformation"\r\n\r\n*Baltimore, MD \xe2\x80\x93 *The Social Security Administration (SSA) is announcing that over 100 million Americans have created personal "my "Social Security accounts. This marks a major milestone in the agency\xe2\x80\x99s digital-first transformation to increase accessibility, expand service, and improve the overall customer experience for the public.\r\n\r\n\xe2\x80\x9cMore than 100 million Americans have chosen to set up "my "Social Security accounts because they want immediate access to service, 24 hours a day, and tools to manage their benefits with ease,\xe2\x80\x9d *said Commissioner Frank J. Bisignano*. \xe2\x80\x9cThis milestone underscores what we are working toward at SSA: providing convenient and best-in-class customer service that meets people where they are, whether it is online with "my" Social Security, on the phone, or in person at local field offices.\xe2\x80\x9d\r\n\r\nAs SSA\xe2\x80\x99s secure online portal, "my "Social Security enables individuals with 24/7 access to the agency\xe2\x80\x99s personalized tools and services, whether they currently receive benefits or not. With an account, users can receive tailored notifications, request a replacement card, manage benefits or estimate future benefits, request replacement documents, check the status of pending applications, and conduct other services anytime, anywhere, without needing to visit an office or wait on the phone. With this free and secure account, beneficiaries can also access their most recent "Social Security Statement, "which includes benefit estimates and a summary of earnings in an easy-to-read document. Tax season is a great time for people to use "my "Social Security to review their detailed earnings record.\r\n\r\nTo learn more and create a personal "my "Social Security account, visit: https://www.ssa.gov/myaccount/ [ https://www.ssa.gov/myaccount/?utm_content=pt200m&utm_id=02092026&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ].\r\n\r\nAs a digital-first agency with an increased focus on technology and process engineering, SSA continues to serve more people at faster speeds than ever before by making it easier to resolve customers\xe2\x80\x99 service needs online, on the phone, and in person. Under Commissioner Bisignano\xe2\x80\x99s leadership, Americans now have 24/7 access to their personal "my "Social Security accounts, when previously the website was down 29 hours a week.\r\n\r\n###\r\n\r\n"For more Social Security news, follow the agency on X @SocialSecurity [ https://x.com/socialsecurity?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]."\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nSocial Security National Press Office\xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0 Baltimore, MD\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0 \r\n\r\nSocial Security Administration [ https://www.ssa.gov/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n\r\n*Go Digital!* Join the millions and discover your benefits.\r\n\r\n*Open a personal my Social Security account* [ http://www.socialsecurity.gov/myaccount/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n\r\nx [ https://twitter.com/socialsecurity?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]facebook [ https://www.facebook.com/socialsecurity?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]youtube [ https://www.youtube.com/socialsecurityonline?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]instagram [ https://www.instagram.com/socialsecurity/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]  \r\n\r\nManage Subscriptions [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USSSA/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 Unsubscribe\xc2\xa0All [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USSSA/subscriber/one_click_unsubscribe?verification=5.26af423df56cba5a19f63c28ecad2176&destination=jasonnorman66994%40gmail.com ] \xc2\xa0|\xc2\xa0 Help [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/ ]\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \xc2\xa0 \r\n \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n This email was sent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com by the Social Security Administration, and was produced and disseminated at U.S. taxpayer expense. GovDelivery logo [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\nbody .abe-column-block {min-height: 5px;}\r\n'
