e.com/translate?hl=en&sl=en&tl=ht&u=https%3A%2F%2Fcontent.govdelivery.com%2Faccounts%2FDEDNREC%2Fbulletins%2F408f5c2&utm_medium=email&utm_name=&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nYou are subscribed to Outdoor Delaware online magazine for Delaware Department of Natural Resources and Environmental Control. This information has recently been updated, and is now available.\r\n\r\nHow Electric Vehicles are Going Mainstream (Again) [ https://dnrec.delaware.gov/outdoor-delaware/how-electric-vehicles-are-going-mainstream-again/?utm_medium=email&utm_name=&utm_source=govdelivery ] 02/09/2026 10:19 AM EST \r\n\r\nElectric vehicles are the future \xe2\x80\x94 but they\xe2\x80\x99re not some far-off dream like flying cars. Rather, they represent the present as well as the possibilities to come. And they have a history that\xe2\x80\x99s far deeper than you were likely aware. Learn more in this piece from Outdoor Delaware.\r\n\r\nThe post How Electric Vehicles are Going Mainstream (Again) [ https://dnrec.delaware.gov/outdoor-delaware/how-electric-vehicles-are-going-mainstream-again/?utm_medium=email&utm_name=&utm_source=govdelivery ] appeared first on DNREC [ https://dnrec.delaware.gov?utm_medium=email&utm_name=&utm_source=govdelivery ].\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nStay Connected with the Delaware Department of Natural Resources and Environmental Control: Facebook [ https://www.facebook.com/DelawareDNREC?utm_medium=email&utm_name=&utm_source=govdelivery ]\xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0instagram [ https://www.instagram.com/delawarednrec/?utm_medium=email&utm_name=&utm_source=govdelivery ] \xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0X [ https://twitter.com/DelawareDNREC?utm_medium=email&utm_name=&utm_source=govdelivery ] \xc2\xa0 LinkedIn [ https://www.linkedin.com/company/delawarednrec?utm_medium=email&utm_name=&utm_source=govdelivery ] \xc2\xa0 you tube [ https://www.youtube.com/DelawareDNREC?utm_medium=email&utm_name=&utm_source=govdelivery ] \xc2\xa0 Govdelivery [ https://dnrec.delaware.gov/dnrec-e-mail-lists/?