[2026-04-27 11:16:31] Raw text/plain payload: b'These apps solve daily frustrations you\'ve accepted as normal\r\n6 macOS Apps You Will ACTUALLY Use Every Single Day\r\n\r\nThese apps solve daily frustrations you\'ve accepted as normal\r\n\r\nThe Useful Tech (https://medium.com/@theusefultech?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770654387991-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-953b148ade73------------------------dcd8b7c7_a838_4fe1_98c2_13073bf03598--------eeb618317985)\r\n\xc2\xa0in\xc2\xa0The Useful Tech (https://medium.com/the-useful-tech?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770654387991-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-953b148ade73------------------------dcd8b7c7_a838_4fe1_98c2_13073bf03598--------eeb618317985)\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nFebruary 9, 2026\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\n8 min read\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nView on Medium (https://medium.com/the-useful-tech/9a0a2ac55bc5?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770654387991-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-953b148ade73------------------------dcd8b7c7_a838_4fe1_98c2_13073bf03598--------eeb618317985)\r\n\r\nSource: Image Generated by GPT 5.2\r\n\r\nI have been writing about apps for five years, and the dirty secret of every "best Mac apps" list on the internet is that they all recommend the same 15 apps. Rectangle, Raycast, CleanShot X, Magnet, Alfred, Bartender. You have read those lists. I have written some of those lists. And at this point, recommending Raycast as a hidden gem is like recommending Google as a search engine.\r\n\r\nThe apps that actually changed how I use my Mac on a daily basis came from places no listicle writer bothers to look. Buried 40 comments deep in an r/macapps thread from\xe2\x80\xa6\r\n\r\nContinue reading (https://medium.com/the-useful-tech/9a0a2ac55bc5?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770654387991-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-953b148ade73------------------------dcd8b7c7_a838_4fe1_98c2_13073bf03598--------eeb618317985)\r\nThis is a member-only story and can only be read on Medium.\r\n\r\nSent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com by The Useful Tech on Medium\r\nUnsubscribe (https://medium.com/me/email-settings/50207bf5a022/df34cdd2aa1a?type=noSetting&newsletterV3Id=eeb618317985&collectionId=953b148ade73&source=email-50207bf5a022-1770654387991-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-953b148ade73------------------------dcd8b7c7_a838_4fe1_98c2_13073bf03598--------eeb618317985)\r\n from this writer\'s email notifications\r\nManage your email settings (https://medium.com/me/settings/notifications?hash=df34cdd2aa1a&userId=50207bf5a022&settingsRouteHash=%23manageSubscriptions&source=email-50207bf5a022-1770654387991-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-953b148ade73------------------------dcd8b7c7_a838_4fe1_98c2_13073bf03598--------eeb618317985)\r\n\r\n3500 South DuPont Highway, Suite IQ-101, Dover,\xc2\xa0DE\xc2\xa019901\r\nCareers (https://medium.com/jobs-at-medium/work-at-medium-959d1a85284e?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770654387991-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-953b148ade73------------------------dcd8b7c7_a838_4fe1_98c2_13073bf03598--------eeb618317985)\r\n\xc2\xb7Help Center (https://help.medium.com/hc/en-us?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770654387991-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-953b148ade73------------------------dcd8b7c7_a838_4fe1_98c2_13073bf03598--------eeb618317985)\r\n\xc2\xb7Privacy Policy (https://policy.medium.com/medium-privacy-policy-f03bf92035c9?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770654387991-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-953b148ade73------------------------dcd8b7c7_a838_4fe1_98c2_13073bf03598--------eeb618317985)\r\n\xc2\xb7Terms of service (https://policy.medium.com/medium-terms-of-service-9db0094a1e0f?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770654387991-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-953b148ade73------------------------dcd8b7c7_a838_4fe1_98c2_13073bf03598--------eeb618317985)'
