[2026-04-27 11:16:37] Raw text/plain payload: b"Transportation & Smart Mobility Alerts - February 2026  \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nTransportation and smart mobility banner [ https://www.trade.gov/automotive-smart-mobility-industry ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nGoing Global: News You Can Use\r\n\r\nThe Transportation & Smart Mobility Global Team of the U.S. Commercial Service invites U.S. companies to use the following international business information, events and resources to propel U.S. exports.\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nMarkets Spotlight\r\nTransportation Market Intelligence [ https://www.trade.gov/automotive-smart-mobility-industry ]\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n\r\n  * Most collaborative robots (cobots) in *Mexico* are deployed in the automotive sector, which accounts for roughly 70% of their use. Integrating cobots into manufacturing processes can significantly improve operational efficiency while also enhancing worker safety, particularly in environments that involve complex or hazardous tasks. Learn More [ https://www.trade.gov/market-intelligence/mexico-advanced-manufacturing-cobots ] \r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n\r\n  * The government of *C\xc3\xb4te d\xe2\x80\x99Ivoire* is upgrading and expanding its national pipeline network. The Abidjan\xe2\x80\x93Bouak\xc3\xa9 pipeline is being converted to carry butane, with an investment of 65\xe2\x80\xafmillion USD, while a new multiproduct pipeline linking Abidjan to Ferkess\xc3\xa9dougou is planned at a cost of 733\xe2\x80\xafmillion USD. Both projects have completed their initial studies and are expected to be operational by 2040.Learn More [ https://www.trade.gov/market-intelligence/cote-divoire-petroleum-infrastructure-and-logistics-projects ] \r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n\r\n  * *Brazil*\xe2\x80\x99s EV charging network has grown to nearly 17,000 public and semi\xe2\x80\x91public chargers as of mid\xe2\x80\x912025, yet infrastructure expansion continues to lag behind the pace of vehicle adoption. The EV charging market is projected to rise from 36.7\xe2\x80\xafmillion USD in 2024 to 119.3\xe2\x80\xafmillion USD by 2030 (22% CAGR), with broader EV infrastructure investments expected to reach 189\xe2\x80\xafmillion USD by 2033. Learn More [ https://www.trade.gov/market-intelligence/brazil-electric-vehicle-grid ] \r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n\r\n  * *Kenya*n President William Ruto has announced the creation of a National Infrastructure Fund aimed at mobilizing 1.5\xe2\x80\xaftrillion Kenyan shillings (approximately 11\xe2\x80\xafbillion USD) to finance the construction of 10,000\xe2\x80\xafkilometers of new tarmac roads across the country. The initiative is a central pillar of Kenya\xe2\x80\x99s infrastructure modernization agenda, designed to strengthen the national road network. Learn More [ https://www.trade.gov/market-intelligence/kenya-infrastructure-fund-and-road-expansion ] \r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n\r\n  * *Malaysia*\xe2\x80\x99s electric vehicle (EV) market is expanding rapidly, supported by strong government incentives, growing consumer awareness, and steady improvements in charging infrastructure. This momentum is creating new opportunities for U.S. companies specializing in EV charging solutions, battery technologies, smart\xe2\x80\x91grid systems, energy storage, and EV\xe2\x80\x91related software and services. Learn More [ https://www.trade.gov/market-intelligence/malaysia-electric-vehicles ] \r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n\r\n  * *Portugal*\xe2\x80\x99s push into lithium\xe2\x80\x91battery manufacturing\xe2\x80\x94including a \xe2\x82\xac2\xe2\x80\xafbillion facility planned for Sines\xe2\x80\x94is opening new opportunities across the European supply chain. European automakers still depend heavily on advanced U.S. components and technologies to meet performance and safety standards. Learn More [ https://www.trade.gov/country-commercial-guides/portugal-automotive-and-automotive-parts ] \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nVirtual Events\r\n\r\n*Exporting Industrial Machinery to Brazil [ https://events.trade.gov/en/TradeGov/ExportingAdvancedManufacturingProductstoBrazil-988/ ]*\r\n\r\n*February 11, 2026 at 12:00PM ET*\r\n\r\nGet a clear introduction to Brazil\xe2\x80\x99s customs procedures and tariff structure. Strengthen your competitive position by mastering one of the most complex aspects of exporting to this dynamic market. This webinar is tailored for U.S. exporters of equipment and machinery.\xc2\xa0Register Today [ https://events.trade.gov/en/TradeGov/ExportingAdvancedManufacturingProductstoBrazil-988/ ]\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n  Shipping [ https://events.trade.gov/en/TradeGov/ExportingAdvancedManufacturingProductstoBrazil-988/ ] \r\n\r\n*Explore Opportunities in Colombia\xe2\x80\x99s Regiotram del Norte Light Rail Project <Karen.Ospina@trade.gov>*\r\n\r\n*February 18, 2026 at 9:30AM ET*\r\n\r\nColombian government representatives and project leaders from Empresa Ferrea Regional (EFR) are looking to connect with leading engineering and construction firms, as well as rolling-stock and rail systems manufacturers experienced in large-scale rail projects, to participate as concessionaire bidders. To register in this hybrid event, please contact Commercial Specialist Karen Ospina <Karen.Ospina@trade.gov>.\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n  Rail Project <Karen.Ospina@trade.gov> \r\n\r\n*Exporting with Confidence: Trade Agreements & Compliance Essentials [ https://events.gcc.teams.microsoft.com/event/73d5b51d-137f-4067-94ae-a7ac146fe059@a1d183f2-6c7b-4d9a-b994-5f2f31b3f780 ]*\r\n\r\n*February 18, 2026 at 11:00AM CT*\r\n\r\nLearn about the WTO and free trade agreements, and key export compliance considerations from the U.S. Commercial Service (USCS), the Office of Industry and Analysis (I&A), the Office of Trade Agreements Negotiation and Compliance (TANC), and the Bureau of Industry Security (BIS).\xc2\xa0 Register Today [ https://events.gcc.teams.microsoft.com/event/73d5b51d-137f-4067-94ae-a7ac146fe059@a1d183f2-6c7b-4d9a-b994-5f2f31b3f780 ]\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n  Compliance [ https://events.gcc.teams.microsoft.com/event/73d5b51d-137f-4067-94ae-a7ac146fe059@a1d183f2-6c7b-4d9a-b994-5f2f31b3f780 ] \r\n\r\n*U.S. Artificial Intelligence Infrastructure and Data Centers [ https://events.trade.gov/en/TradeGov/USArtificialIntelligenceInfrastructureandDataCente/index.php?_gl=1%2A115xq6p%2A_ga%2AMTM0MDUxNjcyNy4xNzU4ODEyMTI4%2A_ga_L884J52XQ5%2AczE3NzAzOTM0MjMkbzE3MiRnMSR0MTc3MDM5NTkyMyRqMTUkbDAkaDA.%2A_ga_6D3N6M4S6H%2AczE3NzAzOTM0MjMkbzE0JGcxJHQxNzcwMzk1OTIzJGoxNSRsMCRoMA.. ]*\r\n\r\n*February 19, 2026 at 10:00AM ET*\r\n\r\nThis panel will examine emerging opportunities to invest in U.S. AI infrastructure and offer investors a clear view of the key constraints, policy dynamics, and growth prospects shaping domestic buildout and production. Register Today [ https://events.trade.gov/en/TradeGov/USArtificialIntelligenceInfrastructureandDataCente/index.php?_gl=1%2A115xq6p%2A_ga%2AMTM0MDUxNjcyNy4xNzU4ODEyMTI4%2A_ga_L884J52XQ5%2AczE3NzAzOTM0MjMkbzE3MiRnMSR0MTc3MDM5NTkyMyRqMTUkbDAkaDA.%2A_ga_6D3N6M4S6H%2AczE3NzAzOTM0MjMkbzE0JGcxJHQxNzcwMzk1OTIzJGoxNSRsMCRoMA.. ]\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n  Data Center [ https://events.trade.gov/en/TradeGov/USArtificialIntelligenceInfrastructureandDataCente/index.php?_gl=1%2A115xq6p%2A_ga%2AMTM0MDUxNjcyNy4xNzU4ODEyMTI4%2A_ga_L884J52XQ5%2AczE3NzAzOTM0MjMkbzE3MiRnMSR0MTc3MDM5NTkyMyRqMTUkbDAkaDA.%2A_ga_6D3N6M4S6H%2AczE3NzAzOTM0MjMkbzE0JGcxJHQxNzcwMzk1OTIzJGoxNSRsMCRoMA.. ] \r\n\r\n*Business Opportunities in C\xc3\xb4te d\xe2\x80\x99Ivoire [ https://events.gcc.teams.microsoft.com/event/aaf78503-a802-4dc9-b53b-81267dfe34fd@a1d183f2-6c7b-4d9a-b994-5f2f31b3f780 ]*\r\n\r\n*February 25, 2026 at 9:00AM ET*\r\n\r\nLearn about specific energy and infrastructure projects under the Millennium Challenge Corporation (MCC), and hear directly from government experts about\xc2\xa0 procurement processes and timelines. Register Today [ https://events.gcc.teams.microsoft.com/event/aaf78503-a802-4dc9-b53b-81267dfe34fd@a1d183f2-6c7b-4d9a-b994-5f2f31b3f780 ]\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n  Infrastructure [ https://events.gcc.teams.microsoft.com/event/aaf78503-a802-4dc9-b53b-81267dfe34fd@a1d183f2-6c7b-4d9a-b994-5f2f31b3f780 ] \r\n\r\n*Tools for U.S. Exhibitors at International Shows [ https://events.trade.gov/en/TradeGov/TemporaryImportsToolsforInternationalExhibitors/ ]*\r\n\r\n*February 25, 2026 at 11:00AM ET*\r\n\r\nU.S. exhibitors often face challenges transporting samples and equipment to international trade shows, largely because they\xe2\x80\x99re unaware of simple temporary\xe2\x80\x91export tools that can prevent delays and extra costs. This webinar will show U.S. exhibitors how to move their materials efficiently and in full compliance. Register Today [ https://events.trade.gov/en/TradeGov/TemporaryImportsToolsforInternationalExhibitors/ ]\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n  Tools for International Shows [ https://events.trade.gov/en/TradeGov/TemporaryImportsToolsforInternationalExhibitors/ ] \r\n\r\n*Unlock Bermuda: Market Opportunities for U.S. Companies [ https://events.trade.gov/en/TradeGov/BermudaWebinar/index.php?_gl=1%2A50y51e%2A_ga%2AMTM0MDUxNjcyNy4xNzU4ODEyMTI4%2A_ga_L884J52XQ5%2AczE3NzAzOTM0MjMkbzE3MiRnMSR0MTc3MDM5NTkyMyRqMTUkbDAkaDA.%2A_ga_6D3N6M4S6H%2AczE3NzAzOTM0MjMkbzE0JGcxJHQxNzcwMzk1OTIzJGoxNSRsMCRoMA.. ]*\r\n\r\n*March 3, 2026 at 1:00PM ET*\r\n\r\nBermuda is a globally respected financial and international business hub seeking to expand connections with U.S. suppliers across multiple sectors. Hear directly from local partners on how U.S. companies can successfully enter and expand in the market. Register Today [ https://events.trade.gov/en/TradeGov/BermudaWebinar/index.php?_gl=1%2A50y51e%2A_ga%2AMTM0MDUxNjcyNy4xNzU4ODEyMTI4%2A_ga_L884J52XQ5%2AczE3NzAzOTM0MjMkbzE3MiRnMSR0MTc3MDM5NTkyMyRqMTUkbDAkaDA.%2A_ga_6D3N6M4S6H%2AczE3NzAzOTM0MjMkbzE0JGcxJHQxNzcwMzk1OTIzJGoxNSRsMCRoMA.. ]\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n  CS Bermuda [ https://events.trade.gov/en/TradeGov/BermudaWebinar/index.php?_gl=1%2A50y51e%2A_ga%2AMTM0MDUxNjcyNy4xNzU4ODEyMTI4%2A_ga_L884J52XQ5%2AczE3NzAzOTM0MjMkbzE3MiRnMSR0MTc3MDM5NTkyMyRqMTUkbDAkaDA.%2A_ga_6D3N6M4S6H%2AczE3NzAzOTM0MjMkbzE0JGcxJHQxNzcwMzk1OTIzJGoxNSRsMCRoMA.. ] \r\n\r\n*Discover Opportunities in Suriname's Oil & Gas [ https://events.trade.gov/en/TradeGov/Suriname-OilandGas/index.php?_gl=1%2A50y51e%2A_ga%2AMTM0MDUxNjcyNy4xNzU4ODEyMTI4%2A_ga_L884J52XQ5%2AczE3NzAzOTM0MjMkbzE3MiRnMSR0MTc3MDM5NTkyMyRqMTUkbDAkaDA.%2A_ga_6D3N6M4S6H%2AczE3NzAzOTM0MjMkbzE0JGcxJHQxNzcwMzk1OTIzJGoxNSRsMCRoMA.. ]*\r\n\r\n*March 5, 2026 at 1:00PM ET*\r\n\r\nLearn where U.S. companies fit into Suriname\xe2\x80\x99s primary oil and gas value chain. Identify opportunities in supporting sectors such as infrastructure and transportation. Register Today [ https://events.trade.gov/en/TradeGov/Suriname-OilandGas/index.php?_gl=1%2A50y51e%2A_ga%2AMTM0MDUxNjcyNy4xNzU4ODEyMTI4%2A_ga_L884J52XQ5%2AczE3NzAzOTM0MjMkbzE3MiRnMSR0MTc3MDM5NTkyMyRqMTUkbDAkaDA.%2A_ga_6D3N6M4S6H%2AczE3NzAzOTM0MjMkbzE0JGcxJHQxNzcwMzk1OTIzJGoxNSRsMCRoMA.. ]\r\n\r\n  CS Suriname [ https://events.trade.gov/en/TradeGov/Suriname-OilandGas/index.php?_gl=1%2A50y51e%2A_ga%2AMTM0MDUxNjcyNy4xNzU4ODEyMTI4%2A_ga_L884J52XQ5%2AczE3NzAzOTM0MjMkbzE3MiRnMSR0MTc3MDM5NTkyMyRqMTUkbDAkaDA.%2A_ga_6D3N6M4S6H%2AczE3NzAzOTM0MjMkbzE0JGcxJHQxNzcwMzk1OTIzJGoxNSRsMCRoMA.. ] \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nIn Person Events\r\nWWETT 2026 [ https://www.wwettshow.com/en/home.html ]\r\n\r\nThe WWETT 2026 Show\xe2\x80\x94short for Water & Wastewater Equipment, Treatment & Transport\xe2\x80\x94 will be held at the Indiana Convention Center in Indianapolis from February 16\xe2\x80\x9319, 2026. The show will bring together over 13,500 attendees and 500+ leading suppliers from more than 55 countries. It serves a wide range of sectors including heavy equipment and excavation trucks. For more information, please contact Frances Selema <Frances.Selema@trade.gov>.\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nTrade Leads\r\n\r\nPlease note that only U.S. Companies with products and services that have at least 51% U.S. content are eligible for the U.S. Commercial Service's assistance with these trade leads.\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nDetails\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nAfDB\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nThe African Development Bank (AfDB) published the following procurement notices [ https://www.afdb.org/en/projects-and-operations/procurement ].\xc2\xa0U.S. suppliers submitting a proposal may contact Susan Hettleman <%20susan.hettleman@trade.gov>\xc2\xa0to inquire on potential advocacy support from the U.S. government [ https://www.trade.gov/advocacy ].\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nEBRD\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nThe European Bank for Reconstruction and Development (EBRD) published the following tenders [ https://ecepp.ebrd.com/delta/noticeSearchResults.html ].\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0U.S. suppliers submitting a proposal may contact Chrystal Denys <Chrystal.Denys@trade.gov> to inquire on advocacy support from the U.S. government [ https://www.trade.gov/advocacy ].\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nIDB\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nThe Interamerican Development Bank (IDB) published the following procurement opportunities [ https://projectprocurement.iadb.org/en/procurement-notices ].\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0U.S. suppliers submitting a proposal may contact Belen Gallegos <Belen.Gallegos@trade.gov> to inquire on advocacy support from the U.S. government [ https://www.trade.gov/advocacy ].\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nU.S. Commercial Service in Mexico\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nANPACT, the Mexican association of OEMs for American brands like Paccar, International, and Freightliner, is seeking AI technology to improve its supply chain tracking system. They would like to trace all the components and materials received from foreign suppliers to calculate the regional value content of their final products, pursuant to new USMCA regulations. For more information, please contact your local Trade Specialist [ https://gcc02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Flinks-1.govdelivery.com%2FCL0%2Fhttps%3A%252F%252Fwww.trade.gov%252Fcommercial-service-offices-us%2F1%2F0100019915c993e1-0e9c5d15-2f91-44b0-a60c-1bf874782f76-000000%2FBUX17VkY3YnL6OQBNiuJtTTUx1iK_SkCrIk7iRtVUZU%3D421&data=05%7C02%7CFernando.Bentz%40trade.gov%7C844b9ff7f30b4554dbb608de28feabed%7Ca1d183f26c7b4d9ab9945f2f31b3f780%7C0%7C0%7C638993271717749683%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&sdata=RGybPTeoCPtmgjkpTNUIicvycd%2B52fVaIroLKKStxeY%3D&reserved=0 ] and Monica Martinez <Monica.Martinez@trade.gov>, Commercial Specialist at the U.S Commercial Service in Mexico.\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nWorld Bank\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nThe World Bank published the following procurement opportunities [ https://projects.worldbank.org/en/projects-operations/procurement?srce=both ].\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0U.S. suppliers submitting a proposal may contact Danica Starks <Danica.Starks@trade.gov>\xc2\xa0to inquire on advocacy support from the U.S. government [ https://www.trade.gov/advocacy ].\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nResources for Exporting Vehicles\r\n\r\n  * Motor Vehicle Trade Codes [ https://www.trade.gov/automotive-motor-vehicle-tariff-codes ] \r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n\r\n  * Automotive Parts Trade Codes [ https://www.trade.gov/automotive-parts-tariff-codes ] \r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n\r\n  * Incoterms for International Distribution Agreements [ https://www.trade.gov/know-your-incoterms ] \r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nIntellectual Property &\xc2\xa0Cybersecurity\xc2\xa0Resources\r\n\r\n  * U.S. Patent & Trademark Office's Free Services [ https://www.uspto.gov/learning-and-resources/access-our-free-services?MURL=freeservices ] \r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n\r\n  * MEP's Cybersecurity Resources [ https://www.nist.gov/mep/cybersecurity-resources-manufacturers ] \r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n\r\n  * U.S. Customs' Cybersecurity Resources [ https://www.cbp.gov/trade/cybersecurity-resiliency ] \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nGlobal Team Leader's Message\r\n\r\nWe hope you have found the information in this newsletter to be useful in expanding your exports. Please contact us <Shannon.Christenbury@trade.gov> if you need more details or if you have questions.\r\n\r\n\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nWe encourage you to explore the following resources that are always available to you:\r\n\r\nCountry Research [ https://www.trade.gov/ccg-landing-page ]\r\n\r\nIndustry Research [ https://www.trade.gov/industries ]\r\n\r\nAttend a Trade Event [ https://www.trade.gov/trade-events-search#/ ]\r\n\r\nHow-to-Export Resources [ https://www.trade.gov/learn-how-export ]\r\n\r\nLearn About our Export Services [ https://www.trade.gov/let-our-experts-help-0 ]\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n  \r\n \r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n* International Trade Administration*\xc2\xa0 \xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0United States Commercial Service, International Trade Administration [ https://www.trade.gov/us-commercial-service ]*\r\n [ https://www.trade.gov/us-commercial-service ]*  \r\n\r\nThe U.S. Commercial Service is the trade promotion arm of the\r\n*U.S. Department of Commerce's International Trade Administration.*\r\nU.S. Commercial Service trade professionals in over 100 U.S. cities and in more than 75 markets \r\nhelp U.S. companies get started in exporting or increase sales to global markets.\r\n\r\n*STAY CONNECTED*\r\n\r\nVisit us on X [ https://twitter.com/exportgov ]\xc2\xa0 Connect with us on LinkedIn [ https://www.linkedin.com/company/uscommercialservice/ ]\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nBookmark and Share [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USITATRADE/bulletins/4081d98?reqfrom=share ]\r\n\r\nIf you are ready to begin exporting or expand to additional global markets, \r\nplease contact your nearest U.S. Commercial Service office [ https://www.trade.gov/commercial-services-offices-us ]\r\nor check out our online EXPORT SOLUTIONS [ https://www.trade.gov/export-solutions ].\r\n\r\n*SUBSCRIBER SERVICES*\r\nVisit our User Profile Page [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USITATRADE/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] to update your subscriptions or unsubscribe.\r\nIf you need assistance, please visit\xc2\xa0subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com [ https://subscriberhelp.govdelivery.com/hc/en-us ].\r\n\r\n \r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\nThis email was sent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com using GovDelivery Communications Cloud on behalf of the International Trade Administration\xc2\xa0\xc2\xb7 1401 Constitution Avenue NW \xc2\xb7 Washington, DC 20230 GovDelivery logo [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/ ] \r\nbody .abe-column-block { min-height: 5px; } table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:10px; margin-right:10px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;} table.govd_hr {min-width: 100%;}\r\n"
