[2026-04-27 11:16:54] Raw text/plain payload: b"Here's a quick note on what's coming up as we continue the month of February.  \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nUnited States Census Bureau [ https://www.census.gov/programs-surveys/sis/resources/fun-facts/valentines.html?utm_campaign=20260209cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\n?? This Week: Valentine's Day! \xe2\x9d\xa4\xef\xb8\x8f\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nCensus Bureau: Valentines Day Fun Facts [ https://www.census.gov/programs-surveys/sis/resources/fun-facts/valentines.html?utm_campaign=20260209cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n\r\nThis Saturday, February 14, is Valentine's Day. In the United States in 2023, there were about:\r\n\r\n?? 20,000 jewelry stores\r\n?? 12,000 flower shops\r\n?? 3,000 candy and nut stores\r\n\r\nExplore more Valentine's Day fun facts courtesy of our Statistics in Schools program.\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*Sweet Stats* [ https://www.census.gov/programs-surveys/sis/resources/fun-facts/valentines.html?utm_campaign=20260209cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n?? Coming Soon\r\n\r\nOn Thursday, February 12, the Census Bureau is scheduled to announce new education partners for our *Post-Secondary Employment Outcomes* (PSEO) experimental data product. The PSEO provides earnings and employment outcomes for college and university graduates by degree level, degree major, post-secondary institution, and state of institution.\xe2\x80\xaf\r\n\r\nThese statistics are generated by matching university transcript data with a national database of jobs. PSEO data are available for post-secondary institutions whose transcript data have been made available to the Census Bureau through a data-sharing agreement.\r\n\r\n*Learn More * [ https://lehd.ces.census.gov/data/pseo_experimental.html?utm_campaign=20260209cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n?? 2026 LED Workshop: Call for Presentations\r\n\r\nThe Census Bureau invites you to submit a proposal to present virtually at the 2026 Local Employment Dynamics (LED) Partnership Workshop May 12-13. The deadline to submit a proposal is February 18.\r\n\r\nThe hybrid workshop will provide insights into LED data products as well as professional development and networking opportunities. The LED Partnership is a collaboration between state data agencies and the Census Bureau to leverage existing data in the development of new sources of economic and demographic information. The theme of\xc2\xa0this\xc2\xa0year\xe2\x80\x99s workshop is \xe2\x80\x9cNumbers to Narratives: Data for Better Decisions.\xe2\x80\x9d\r\n\r\nClick the button below for detailed proposal guidance and questions about the workshop.\r\n\r\n*Learn More* [ https://lehd.ces.census.gov/workshops_webinars/workshop/2026.html?utm_campaign=20260209cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n?? Statehood Anniversaries\r\n\r\n  * *Arizona\xc2\xa0*will celebrate its 114th anniversary on February 14. \r\n  * *Oregon\xc2\xa0*will celebrate its 167th anniversary on February 14. \r\n\r\nExplore Census Bureau data on each state with our data.census.gov\xc2\xa0state profiles [ https://data.census.gov/profile?g=010XX00US&utm_campaign=20260209cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\xc2\xa0and sign up for\xc2\xa0email updates on your state [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USCENSUS/signup/11707 ]!\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n?? Economic Indicators\r\n\r\n*February 10:* Advance Monthly Sales for Retail and Food Services [ https://www.census.gov/retail/index.html?utm_campaign=20260209cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\nDecember 2025 (originally scheduled for January 15, 2026)\r\n\r\n*February 10:* Manufacturing and Trade: Inventories and Sales [ https://www.census.gov/mtis/index.html?utm_campaign=20260209cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\nNovember 2025 (originally scheduled for January 15, 2026)\r\n\r\n*February 11:* Business Formation Statistics [ https://www.census.gov/econ/bfs/index.html?utm_campaign=20260209cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n\r\n*Economic Indicators* [ https://www.census.gov/economic-indicators/calendar-listview.html?utm_campaign=20260209cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n?? Upcoming Webinars\r\n\r\n  * *February 18:* Unlocking NAICS 5- and 6-Digit Details in the Quarterly Workforce Indicator Data Set [ https://www.census.gov/data/academy/webinars/2026/unlocking-naics-5-6-digit-details.html?utm_campaign=20260209cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n  * *February 19:* Getting Started with the Census API [ https://www.census.gov/data/academy/webinars/2026/getting-started-with-census-api.html?utm_campaign=20260209cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n  * *February 25:* Introduction to the American Community Survey Public Use Microdata Sample (PUMS) Files [ https://www.census.gov/data/academy/webinars/2026/intro-to-acs-pums-files.html?utm_campaign=20260209cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n\r\n*Webinars* [ https://www.census.gov/data/academy/webinars/upcoming.html?utm_campaign=20260209cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nStay Connected with the Census Bureau\r\n\r\nFollow us on our social media channels, Facebook [ https://www.facebook.com/uscensusbureau?utm_campaign=20260209cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ], Instagram [ https://www.instagram.com/uscensusbureau/?utm_campaign=20260209cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ], LinkedIn [ https://www.linkedin.com/company/us-census-bureau?utm_campaign=20260209cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ], Twitter/X [ https://x.com/uscensusbureau?utm_campaign=20260209cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ], and\xc2\xa0YouTube [ https://www.youtube.com/user/uscensusbureau?utm_campaign=20260209cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ], so you never miss an update.\r\n\r\nStay Connected With Us on Social Media [ https://www.census.gov/about/contact-us/social_media.html?utm_campaign=20260209cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n\r\n*Follow Us* [ https://www.census.gov/about/contact-us/social_media.html?utm_campaign=20260209cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\n?? In Case You Missed It\r\n\r\nCensus Bureau: Snack Food and Beverages [ https://www.census.gov/library/visualizations/2026/econ/snacks-and-beverages.html?utm_campaign=20260209cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n\r\nWhat was your go-to snack or beverage for The Big Game? ????\r\n\r\nGet stats on your favorite gametime fuel with Census Bureau data.\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n*Snack Stats* [ https://www.census.gov/library/visualizations/2026/econ/snacks-and-beverages.html?utm_campaign=20260209cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nAbout the Census Bureau\r\n\r\nWe serve as the nation\xe2\x80\x99s leading provider of quality data about its people and economy.\xc2\xa0The Census Bureau is the federal government's largest statistical agency. As the world\xe2\x80\x99s premier statistical agency, we are dedicated to making our nation a better place. Policy-makers, businesses, and the public use our data to make informed decisions.\r\n\r\nSubscribe [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USCENSUS/signup/34555 ] | Manage Subscriptions [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USCENSUS/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] | Unsubscribe [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USCENSUS/subscriber/one_click_unsubscribe?verification=5.76359f46a06559a62e8e0404a80cc7e5&destination=jasonnorman66994%40gmail.com ] | Help [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/s/?utm_campaign=20260209cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n\r\n*Share This * [ https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USCENSUS/bulletins/40905b0 ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n  \r\n \r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\nThis is an official email from the U.S. Census Bureau. If you have any questions or comments, please contact us (http://www.census.gov/about/contact-us.html [ http://www.census.gov/about/contact-us.html?utm_campaign=20260209cnmp&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]).  \xc2\xa0 \r\nbody .abe-column-block {min-height: 5px;} table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:7px; margin-right:7px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;}\r\n"
