[2026-04-27 11:17:00] Raw text/plain payload: b"\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nYOUR 2026 DONATION STATUS\r\n Supporter Record: Jorge\r\n  2026 Membership: Pending\r\n 50K Match Offer: ACTIVE NOW\r\n SUGGESTED ACTION: \r\nhttps://click.e.aspca.org/?%3D \r\nMake a matched gift now! >>\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://click.e.aspca.org/?%3D \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n \r\nhttps://click.e.aspca.org/?%3D \r\n\r\n\r\nJorge, we're halfway there, but still 6,000 donors short of our goal for new and renewed 2026 supporters!\r\nhttps://click.e.aspca.org/?%3D \r\nThankfully, a group of generous donors have stepped up with a matching gift fund of $50,000 total in hopes that it will encourage more animal lovers like you to help us cross the finish line this month. That means that your gift today will go toward matching this fund!\r\n\r\n\r\nWe know how much you care about animals, and continued, compassionate support helps to ensure that we can fight back against cruelty and reach those who are suffering and in need. Your gift right now will make twice the difference, so why wait?\r\nhttps://click.e.aspca.org/?%3D \r\nCan animals count on your support this year?\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://click.e.aspca.org/?%3D \r\n\r\n\r\nYour lifesaving gift can do so much good for animals rescued from cruelty this year:\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://click.e.aspca.org/?%3D \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://click.e.aspca.org/?%3D \r\n$25 doubles to $50 and can provide over 25 meals for hungry animals.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://click.e.aspca.org/?%3D \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://click.e.aspca.org/?%3D \r\n$35 doubles to $70 and can help provide almost 4 weeks of veterinary supplies for an animal in our care.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://click.e.aspca.org/?%3D \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://click.e.aspca.org/?%3D \r\n$50 doubles to $100 and can help cover an animal\xe2\x80\x99s foster supplies for two months.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://click.e.aspca.org/?%3D \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://click.e.aspca.org/?%3D \r\n$150 doubles to $300 and can help provide enrichment toys for 20 rescued animals.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://click.e.aspca.org/?%3D \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nHaving compassionate donors like you by our side in 2026 is critical as we work to reach animals who are experiencing unspeakable cruelty and are waiting for someone to rescue them. \r\nhttps://click.e.aspca.org/?%3D \r\nEvery matched membership gift today will help us reach our goal of 12,000 members this month, so we can do the most to help vulnerable animals all throughout the year.\r\n\r\n\r\nYour matched gift today will make 2026 a better, brighter year for those who are suffering, and will help us give countless animals the second chances and loving homes they deserve. \r\nhttps://click.e.aspca.org/?%3D \r\nAnd when you donate today, you can also claim your exclusive 2026 member card.\r\n\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://click.e.aspca.org/?%3D \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nhttps://click.e.aspca.org/?%3D \r\nPlease join a community of fellow animal lovers with your matched gift while there\xe2\x80\x99s still time.\r\n\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\nThe American Society for the Prevention of Cruelty to Animals\xc2\xae (ASPCA\xc2\xae)\r\nimpacts hundreds of thousands of animals each year through our work \r\nrescuing animals, securing adoptions, providing medical and rehabilitation\r\ntreatment, and driving significant legislative change that protects their\r\nlives and welfare. By receiving ASPCA emails and taking action on behalf of\r\nanimals, you are helping make this lifesaving work possible. Take a look at our latest news \r\nhttps://click.e.aspca.org/? \r\n\r\nhere . Please click \r\nhttps://click.e.aspca.org/?%3D \r\nhere  if you wish to unsubscribe from the email list.\r\n \r\n\r\nhttps://click.e.aspca.org/? \r\nPrivacy Policy  | \r\n \r\nhttps://click.e.aspca.org/? \r\nASPCA Website  | \r\n \r\nhttps://click.e.aspca.org/? \r\nView Online \r\n\r\nConnect with us: \r\nhttps://click.e.aspca.org/? \r\nFacebook  | \r\n \r\nhttps://click.e.aspca.org/? \r\nX  | \r\n \r\nhttps://click.e.aspca.org/? \r\nInstagram  | \r\n \r\nhttps://click.e.aspca.org/? \r\nTikTok  | \r\n \r\nhttps://click.e.aspca.org/? \r\nYouTube \r\n\r\n \xc2\xa92026 ASPCA. All Rights Reserved.\r\n \r\n \r\nhttps://click.e.aspca.org/?%3D \r\n\r\n\r\nThis email was sent to: \r\n jasonnorman66994@gmail.com\r\n\r\n\r\n This email was sent by: American Society For The Prevention Of Cruelty To Animals\r\n \r\n\r\n 424 East 92nd Street New York, NY, 10128-6804, US\r\n \r\n  \r\n \r\n\r\n\r\n"
