[2026-04-27 11:17:04] Raw text/plain payload: b"Learn about the latest system updates, data releases, and educational opportunities on our data platform.  \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nUnited States Census Bureau [ https://data.census.gov/?utm_campaign=20260209cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nData.census.gov Newsletter \xe2\x80\x93 February 2026\r\n\r\nFebruary data.census.gov Newsletter [ https://data.census.gov/?utm_campaign=20260209cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n\r\nWhat's New?\r\n\r\nDiscover the redesigned data.census.gov landing page, featuring more intuitive navigation and easier access to helpful content.\r\n\r\n\r\n  * Our refreshed landing page has been updated based on years of feedback from data users. For a walkthrough of these improvements, check out our new video tutorial [ https://www.census.gov/library/video/2026/adrm/navigating-the-refreshed-home-page-on-data-census-gov.html?utm_campaign=20260209cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]. Updates include: \r\n  * New \xe2\x80\x98Search by Address\xe2\x80\x99 button, providing an intuitive way to open the address search functionality. \r\n  * Re-titled \xe2\x80\x98Explore Filters\xe2\x80\x99 button. Previously called \xe2\x80\x98Advanced Search,\xe2\x80\x99 this new label provides a more accurate description. \r\n  * Reorganization of navigation links: The tabs for \xe2\x80\x98Profiles,\xe2\x80\x99 \xe2\x80\x98Tables,\xe2\x80\x99 \xe2\x80\x98Maps,\xe2\x80\x99 and \xe2\x80\x98Charts\xe2\x80\x99 have moved from the top right corner of the landing page to the top left side of the page. We also added a new \xe2\x80\x98Microdata\xe2\x80\x99 button that takes you directly to the Microdata Access Tool (MDAT). \r\n  * New links to resources designed to help with your data search: \r\n  * *Getting Started:* Link to our most popular resource to learn how to begin a search on data.census.gov. \r\n  * *Releases*: Links to our latest data releases, upcoming data releases, and site updates. \r\n  * *Help*: Links to the data.census.gov Resources page, video tutorials, frequently asked questions (FAQs), and our email address, census.data@census.gov \r\n\r\n\r\n  * New navigation to census.gov and the data.census.gov landing page: \r\n  * Click the Census Bureau logo in the upper left to navigate to the main census.gov webpage. This update provides consistency and alignment with the user experience on census.gov. \r\n  * Click the new data.census.gov button to clear your search and return to the data.census.gov landing page. \r\n\r\n  * Key links and headers persist beyond the landing page as you navigate through the site. \r\n  * New images and links for video tutorials toward the bottom of the landing page. \r\n\r\n*Learn More* [ https://www.census.gov/data/what-is-data-census-gov/developmental-update.html?utm_campaign=20260209cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\ndata.census.gov Usability Testing\r\n\r\nSince the inception of data.census.gov, we have requested your feedback to guide us in building and improving the site. One of the ways we have done this is through quarterly usability testing. We have a series of tasks that participants use as a guide to walk through the site to help determine what works and what still needs to be addressed.\r\n\r\nWe know that our users come from a variety of backgrounds, and we want to learn as much as we can on how you interact with our site, so we rely on both novice and expert users to complete this testing.\r\n\r\nIf you, or someone you know, would be interested in participating in our usability testing, please complete this eligibility survey [ https://answer.census.gov/jfe/form/SV_cJd3MByY8RFFaQu?utm_campaign=20260209cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ].\r\n\r\nThank you for your interest in participating!\r\n\r\n*Learn More* [ https://www.census.gov/data/what-is-data-census-gov/data-census-gov-usability-testing.html?utm_campaign=20260209cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nStay Connected With Us!\r\n\r\nFollow us on our social media channels so you never miss an update.\r\n\r\nStay Connected With Us on Social Media [ https://www.census.gov/about/contact-us/social_media.html?utm_campaign=20260209cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n\r\n*Follow Us* [ https://www.census.gov/about/contact-us/social_media.html?utm_campaign=20260209cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nFeatured Videos\r\n\r\nNavigating the Refreshed Home Page on data.census.gov [ https://www.census.gov/library/video/2026/adrm/navigating-the-refreshed-home-page-on-data-census-gov.html?utm_campaign=20260209cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n\r\n*Navigating the Refreshed Home Page on data.census.gov [ https://www.census.gov/library/video/2026/adrm/navigating-the-refreshed-home-page-on-data-census-gov.html?utm_campaign=20260209cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]*\r\n\r\nDiscover the latest updates to data.census.gov, the Census Bureau\xe2\x80\x99s primary data search platform.\r\n\r\nGetting Started with Your Search on data.census.gov [ https://www.census.gov/library/video/2026/adrm/getting-started-with-your-search-on-data-census-gov.html?utm_campaign=20260209cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n\r\n*Getting Started with Your Search on data.census.gov [ https://www.census.gov/library/video/2026/adrm/getting-started-with-your-search-on-data-census-gov.html?utm_campaign=20260209cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]*\r\n\r\nThis video is the perfect starting point for newcomers to data.census.gov.\r\n\r\nExploring the Microdata Access Tool (MDAT) on data.census.gov [ https://www.census.gov/library/video/2026/adrm/exploring-mdat-on-data-census-gov.html?utm_campaign=20260209cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n\r\n*Exploring the Microdata Access Tool (MDAT) on data.census.gov [ https://www.census.gov/library/video/2026/adrm/exploring-mdat-on-data-census-gov.html?utm_campaign=20260209cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]*\r\n\r\nLearn how to navigate the newly refreshed Microdata Access Tool.\r\n\r\n*More Videos* [ https://www.census.gov/data/what-is-data-census-gov/guidance-for-data-users/video-tutorials.html?utm_campaign=20260209cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nUpcoming Webinar\r\n\r\n*?? *Getting Started with the Census API [ https://www.census.gov/data/academy/webinars/2026/getting-started-with-census-api.html?utm_campaign=20260209cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n\r\nJoin us February 19 to learn about the Census Bureau's Application Programming Interface, or API, and how to use it in practice.\r\n\r\n*Join Us* [ https://www.census.gov/data/academy/webinars/2026/getting-started-with-census-api.html?utm_campaign=20260209cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nFebruary Workshops\r\n\r\nJoin us for a free virtual workshop to sharpen your data skills!\r\n\r\nFinding Economic Data on data.census.gov and the API [ https://www.census.gov/data/what-is-data-census-gov/workshops/finding-econ-data.html?utm_campaign=20260209cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n\r\nBasics of Using the Census Application Programming Interface (API) [ https://www.census.gov/data/what-is-data-census-gov/workshops/basics-of-using-the-census-api.html?utm_campaign=20260209cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n\r\nData.census.gov Geography Essentials for Beginners [ https://www.census.gov/data/what-is-data-census-gov/workshops/data-census-gov-geography-essentials-for-beginners.html?utm_campaign=20260209cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] [ https://www.census.gov/data/what-is-data-census-gov/workshops/basics.html?utm_campaign=20260209cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n\r\nMaking the Most of Mapping in data.census.gov [ https://www.census.gov/data/what-is-data-census-gov/workshops/mapping.html?utm_campaign=20260209cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n\r\nFinding American Community Survey Data [ https://www.census.gov/data/what-is-data-census-gov/workshops/finding-acs-data.html?utm_campaign=20260209cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n\r\n*Register* [ https://www.census.gov/data/what-is-data-census-gov/workshops.html?utm_campaign=20260209cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nLatest Releases\r\n\r\nIncremental Developmental Code Release [ https://www.census.gov/data/what-is-data-census-gov/developmental-update.html?utm_campaign=20260209cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n\r\n2024 American Community Survey 5-Year Comparison Profile [ https://data.census.gov/all?d=ACS+5-Year+Estimates+Comparison+Profiles&utm_campaign=20260209cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery&y=2024 ]\r\n\r\n*More Releases* [ https://www.census.gov/data/what-is-data-census-gov/latest-releases.html?utm_campaign=20260209cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n \r\n\r\nWant to know what's coming up?\r\n\r\nFind out what datasets are coming to data.census.gov, the Census API, and the Microdata Access in our list of upcoming releases [ https://www.census.gov/data/what-is-data-census-gov/upcoming-releases.html?utm_campaign=20260209cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ].\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n??\xef\xb8\x8f Get in Touch\r\n\r\nHave questions or comments? Send us an email <census.data@census.gov>.\xc2\xa0\r\n\r\nLoving our newsletter? Share it!\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nAbout data.census.gov [ https://data.census.gov/?utm_campaign=20260209cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n\r\nData.census.gov [ https://data.census.gov/?utm_campaign=20260209cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\xc2\xa0is the primary platform to access data and digital content from the U.S. Census Bureau. We continuously update\xc2\xa0data.census.gov [ https://data.census.gov/?utm_campaign=20260209cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] with new data from our most popular survey and programs, as well as system enhancements to improve your experience on the platform.\r\n\r\nWe\xe2\x80\x99re here to help with your data needs:\r\n\r\n\r\n  * Visit our data.census.gov Resources page [ https://www.census.gov/data/what-is-data-census-gov.html?utm_campaign=20260209cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\xc2\xa0for educational materials \r\n  * Learn about\xc2\xa0Microdata Access [ https://www.census.gov/data/what-is-data-census-gov/guidance-for-data-users/how-to-materials-for-using-the-microdata-access.html?utm_campaign=20260209cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\xc2\xa0and the\xc2\xa0Census Data API [ https://www.census.gov/data/what-is-data-census-gov/guidance-for-data-users/how-to-materials-for-using-the-census-api.html?utm_campaign=20260209cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ] \r\n  * Request a\xc2\xa0data.census.gov [ https://data.census.gov/?utm_campaign=20260209cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\xc2\xa0training:\xc2\xa0\r\nced.cedsci.outreach@census.gov \r\n  * Request a training for your local area:\xc2\xa0census.askdata@census.gov <askdata@census.gov> \r\n  * Ask your questions:\xc2\xa0census.data@census.gov \r\n\r\n*Provide Feedback on\xc2\xa0data.census.gov [ https://data.census.gov/?utm_campaign=20260209cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]*\r\n\r\nYour suggestions help determine future improvements we implement to make\xc2\xa0data.census.gov [ https://data.census.gov/?utm_campaign=20260209cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\xc2\xa0work better for you!\r\n\r\n*Send Feedback* <census.data@census.gov> \r\n \r\n\r\nSubscribe [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USCENSUS/signup/34555 ] | Manage Subscriptions [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USCENSUS/subscriber/edit?preferences=true#tab1 ] | Unsubscribe [ https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USCENSUS/subscriber/one_click_unsubscribe?verification=5.76359f46a06559a62e8e0404a80cc7e5&destination=jasonnorman66994%40gmail.com ] | Help [ https://subscriberhelp.granicus.com/s/?utm_campaign=20260209cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n  \r\n \r\n________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\nThis is an official email from the U.S. Census Bureau. If you have any questions or comments, please contact us (http://www.census.gov/about/contact-us.html [ http://www.census.gov/about/contact-us.html?utm_campaign=20260209cedsci&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery ]).  \xc2\xa0 \r\nbody .abe-column-block {min-height: 5px;} table.gd_combo_table img {margin-left:7px; margin-right:7px;} table.gd_combo_table div.govd_image_display img, table.gd_combo_table td.gd_combo_image_cell img {margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;}\r\n"
