[2026-04-27 11:17:27] Raw text/plain payload: b'2026\xe2\x80\x8a-\xe2\x80\x8aWords of Wisdom from Lavrov, Belgorod Treason\r\nUkraine Update February 9\r\n\r\n2026\xe2\x80\x8a-\xe2\x80\x8aWords of Wisdom from Lavrov, Belgorod Treason\r\n\r\nDylan Combellick (https://medium.com/@dylan_combellick?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770708512475-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------a9c34236_6474_496d_a7f1_6b73b70e4748--------354e45830cd6)\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nFebruary 10, 2026\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\n14 min read\r\n\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\xe2\x88\x99\xc2\xa0\xc2\xa0\r\nView on Medium (https://medium.com/p/90cafab2db5e?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770708512475-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------a9c34236_6474_496d_a7f1_6b73b70e4748--------354e45830cd6)\r\n\r\nBroken clock, right? Lavrov said that, despite declarations of moving towards "full-scale, broad cooperation" with the US, Washington continues its anti-Russian policy, citing new sanctions and Western attacks on the \'shadow fleet.\' A rare moment of clarity from Lavrov (http://redirect.medium.systems/r-KWz0pZFBy0?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770708512475-newsletter.subscribeToProfile--90cafab2db5e-----------------------a9c34236_6474_496d_a7f1_6b73b70e4748--------354e45830cd6)\r\n, perhaps? I earlier addressed the absurdity of the Trump administration getting into bed with Russia, given that Russia has a long history of broken deals and failure to live up to promises. The opposite is also true\xe2\x80\x8a-\xe2\x80\x8ait would be perhaps equally foolish for Russia to get involved with the Trump administration, which has a long history of broken deals\xe2\x80\xa6\r\n\r\nContinue reading (https://medium.com/p/90cafab2db5e?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770708512475-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------a9c34236_6474_496d_a7f1_6b73b70e4748--------354e45830cd6)\r\nThis is a member-only story and can only be read on Medium.\r\n\r\nSent to jasonnorman66994@gmail.com by Dylan Combellick on Medium\r\nUnsubscribe (https://medium.com/me/email-settings/50207bf5a022/83aa0e72e21e?type=noSetting&newsletterV3Id=354e45830cd6&source=email-50207bf5a022-1770708512475-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------a9c34236_6474_496d_a7f1_6b73b70e4748--------354e45830cd6)\r\n from this writer\'s email notifications\r\nManage your email settings (https://medium.com/me/settings/notifications?hash=83aa0e72e21e&userId=50207bf5a022&settingsRouteHash=%23manageSubscriptions&source=email-50207bf5a022-1770708512475-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------a9c34236_6474_496d_a7f1_6b73b70e4748--------354e45830cd6)\r\n\r\n3500 South DuPont Highway, Suite IQ-101, Dover,\xc2\xa0DE\xc2\xa019901\r\nCareers (https://medium.com/jobs-at-medium/work-at-medium-959d1a85284e?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770708512475-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------a9c34236_6474_496d_a7f1_6b73b70e4748--------354e45830cd6)\r\n\xc2\xb7Help Center (https://help.medium.com/hc/en-us?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770708512475-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------a9c34236_6474_496d_a7f1_6b73b70e4748--------354e45830cd6)\r\n\xc2\xb7Privacy Policy (https://policy.medium.com/medium-privacy-policy-f03bf92035c9?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770708512475-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------a9c34236_6474_496d_a7f1_6b73b70e4748--------354e45830cd6)\r\n\xc2\xb7Terms of service (https://policy.medium.com/medium-terms-of-service-9db0094a1e0f?source=email-50207bf5a022-1770708512475-newsletter.subscribeToProfile-------------------------a9c34236_6474_496d_a7f1_6b73b70e4748--------354e45830cd6)'
